msgstr "Fusilero"

#. ~ Description of achievement "Rifleman"
#: data/json/achievements.json
msgid ""
"This is my rifle.  There are many like it, but this one is mine.  My rifle "
"is my best friend.  It is my life.  I must master it as I must master my "
"life."
msgstr ""
"Este es mi rifle. Hay otros muchos, pero este es el mio. Mi rifle es mi "
"mejor amigo y es mi vida. Tengo que dominarlo igual que me domino a mi "
"mismo."

