#. ~ Description of bionic "Alarm System"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A motion-detecting alarm system will notice almost all movement within a "
"fifteen-foot radius, and will silently alert you.  This is very useful "
"during sleep, or if you suspect a cloaked pursuer."
msgstr ""
"Un sistema de alarma con detección de movimiento que percibirá casi todos "
"los movimientos en un radio de cuatro metros, y te alertará silenciosamente."
" Esto es muy útil durante el sueño, o si sospechas de un atacante oculto."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Squeaky Ankles"
msgstr "Tobillos Chillones"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Squeaky Ankles"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"In a cruel twist of fate, a poorly executed CBM surgery has given you a pair"
" of useless bionics which make squeaking noises when you walk."
msgstr ""
"Por un cruel giro del destino, una pobre cirugía para instalar un MBC te ha "
"dejado con un par de biónicos inservibles que producen chirridos cuando "
"caminas."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Arms Alloy Plating"
msgstr "Placa de Aleación para Brazos"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Arms Alloy Plating"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"An advanced protective meshwork has been woven into the flesh on your arms "
"and hands, protecting them from physical trauma."
msgstr ""
"Una malla de protección mejorada que ha sido entrelazada con la carne de tus"
" brazos y manos, protegiéndolos de los traumas físicos."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Protective Lenses"
msgstr "Lentes Protectores"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Protective Lenses"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your eye sockets have been surgically sealed with highly protective mirrored"
" lenses and your tear ducts have been re-routed to your mouth.  When you "
"cry, you must spit out or swallow your tears."
msgstr ""
"Las cuencas de tus ojos han sido selladas quirúrgicamente con unas lentes "
"protectoras espejadas, y tus conductos lagrimales han sido desviados hacia "
"tu boca. Cuando lloras, tienes que escupir o tragarte tus lágrimas."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Head Alloy Plating"
msgstr "Placa de Aleación para Cabeza"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Head Alloy Plating"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"An advanced protective meshwork has been woven into the flesh on your head "
"and jaw region, protecting your skull from physical trauma."
msgstr ""
"Una malla de protección mejorada que ha sido entrelazada con la carne en tu "
"cabeza y mandíbula, protegiendo tu cráneo de los traumas físicos."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Legs Alloy Plating"
msgstr "Placa de Aleación para Piernas"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Legs Alloy Plating"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"An advanced protective meshwork has been woven into the flesh on your legs "
"and feet, protecting them from physical trauma."
msgstr ""
"Una malla de protección mejorada que ha sido entrelazada con la carne de tus"
" piernas y pies, protegiéndolos de los traumas físicos."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Torso Alloy Plating"
msgstr "Placa de Aleación para Torso"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Torso Alloy Plating"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"An advanced protective meshwork has been woven into the flesh on your torso,"
" protecting it from physical trauma."
msgstr ""
"Una malla de protección mejorada que ha sido entrelazada con la carne de tu "
"torso, protegiéndolo de los traumas físicos."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Battery System"
msgstr "Sistema de Recarga a Baterías"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Battery System"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"You have a battery draining attachment, and thus can make use of the energy "
"contained in normal, everyday batteries.  Use bionic menu to drain charge "
"from a battery.  Can be toggled on and off at will."
msgstr ""
"Tienes un accesorio para transpasarte energía de baterías, y por ello, "
"puedes aprovechar la energía contenida en las baterías normales y "
"corrientes. Utiliza el menú biónico para traspasarte la carga de una "
"batería. Se puede activar y desactivar a voluntad."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Monomolecular Blade"
msgstr "Cuchilla Monomolecular"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Monomolecular Blade"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A deadly foot-long blade made of advanced material now resides inside your "
"forearm, capable of being extended through the back of your wrist at the "
"cost of a small amount of power.  Though exceptionally sharp, it will "
"prevent you from holding anything else while extended."
msgstr ""
"Una mortal cuchilla de 30 cm hecha de un material superior alojada ahora "
"dentro de tu antebrazo. Puedes extenderla desde detrás de tu muñeca con un "
"gasto mínimo de energía. Aunque excepcionalmente afilada, no te permite "
"agarrar nada con la mano cuando está extendida."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Shotgun Arm"
msgstr "Brazo escopeta"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Shotgun Arm"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Concealed in your left arm is a single shot 12 gauge shotgun.  Activate the "
"bionic to fire and reload the shotgun."
msgstr ""
"Oculto en tu brazo izquierdo hay una escopeta de un solo tiro de calibre 12."
" Activa el biónico para disparar y recargar la escopeta."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Optical Dampers"
msgstr "Atenuadores Ópticos"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Optical Dampers"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"The lenses surgically installed over your eyes can be tinted to block out "
"incoming light."
msgstr ""
"Las lentes instaladas quirúrgicamente sobre tus ojos pueden ser polarizadas "
"para bloquear luz entrante."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Blood Analysis"
msgstr "Analizador de Sangre"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Blood Analysis"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Small sensors have been surgically implanted in your heart, allowing you to "
"analyze your blood.  This will detect many illnesses, drugs, and other "
"conditions."
msgstr ""
"Pequeños sensores han sido implantados quirúrgicamente en tu corazón, "
"permitiéndote analizar tu sangre. Esto detectará muchas enfermedades, drogas"
" y otras condiciones."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Blood Filter"
msgstr "Filtrador de Sangre"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Blood Filter"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A filtration system near your heart allows you to actively filter out "
"chemical impurities, primarily drugs.  It will have limited impact on "
"viruses.  Note that it is not a targeted filter; ALL drugs in your system "
"will be affected."
msgstr ""
"Un sistema de filtración cerca de tu corazón te permite filtrar activamente "
"las impurezas químicas, principalmente las drogas. Tendrá un impacto "
"limitado sobre virus. Ten en cuenta que no es un filtro específico; TODOS "
"los medicamentos de tu sistema también se verán afectados."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Cable Charger System"
msgstr "Sistema Recargador Por Cable"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Cable Charger System"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"You have a complex port surgically mounted above your hip.  While active, it"
" will recharge bionic power when connected to a power source via jumper "
"cable."
msgstr ""
"Tienes un complejo puerto montado quirúrgicamente por encima de tu cadera. "
"Mientras esté activo, recargarás la energía biónica al estar conectado a una"
" fuente de energía a través de un cable."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Subdermal Carbon Filament"
msgstr "Filamento de Carbono Subdérmico"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Subdermal Carbon Filament"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Lying just beneath your skin is a thin armor made of carbon nanotubes.  This"
" has little impact on blunt trauma but will protect you against deep cuts."
msgstr ""
"Justo debajo de la piel hay una fina armadura hecha de nanotubos de carbono."
" Esta armadura tiene poco impacto en los traumatismos contundentes, pero te "
"protegerá contra los cortes profundos."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/bionics.json data/json/items/gun/bio.json
msgid "Chain Lightning"
msgid_plural "Chain Lightnings"
msgstr[0] "Lanzador de Rayo Encadenado"
msgstr[1] "Lanzadores de Rayo Encadenado"
msgstr[2] "Lanzadores de Rayo Encadenado"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Chain Lightning"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your body is equipped with a chain lightning generator, allowing you to emit"
" a blast of lightning at a target, leaving a trail of lightning in its wake,"
" jumping to additional targets within 4 tiles of the previous target."
msgstr ""
"Tu cuerpo está equipado con un generador de rayos en cadena, lo que te "
"permite disparar un rayo hacia un objetivo, dejando una estela que salta "
"hacia otros objetivos en un área de 4 espacios sobre el objetivo principal."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Bionic Claws"
msgstr "Garras Biónicas"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Bionic Claws"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Vicious claws have been surgically installed inside your fingers, allowing "
"you to extend and retract them at the cost of a small amount of power.  "
"These do considerable cutting damage, but prevent you from holding anything "
"else while extended."
msgstr ""
"Garras feroces han sido instaladas quirúrgicamente dentro de tus dedos, lo "
"que te permite extraerlas y retraerlas con un gasto mínimo de energía. Hacen"
" un daño cortante considerable, pero no te permiten agarrar nada cuando "
"estan extendidas."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Internal Climate Control"
msgstr "Control Interno de Temperatura"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Internal Climate Control"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Throughout your body lies a network of thermal piping, which eases the "
"effects of high and low ambient temperatures when activated."
msgstr ""
"A lo largo de tu cuerpo hay una red de tuberías térmicas que, al activarse, "
"alivian los efectos de las altas y bajas temperaturas ambientales."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Cloaking System"
msgstr "Sistema de Camuflaje"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Cloaking System"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"This high-power system uses a set of cameras and LEDs to make you blend into"
" your background, rendering you fully invisible to normal vision.  However, "
"you may be detected by infrared, sonar, etc."
msgstr ""
"Este sistema de gran potencia utiliza una serie de cámaras y LEDs para "
"camuflarte con el ambiente, haciéndote invisible a simple vista. Sin "
"embargo, podrás ser detectado mediante infrarrojos, sonar, etc."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Close Quarters Battle"
msgstr "Pelea en Espacios Cerrados"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Close Quarters Battle"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Bionic processors and databanks, loaded with martial arts combat programs, "
"are surgically integrated into your nervous system.  While active, the CQB "
"module will improve your hand-to-hand combat skills, but prevents you from "
"improving them through combat experience."
msgstr ""
"Procesadores biónicos y bases de datos cargadas con programas de combate de "
"artes marciales se han integrado quirúrgicamente en tu sistema nervioso. "
"Mientras están activos, el módulo de Pelea de Corto Alcance mejorará tu "
"habilidad en el combate cuerpo a cuerpo, pero evitará que puedas mejorar a "
"través de la experiencia de combate."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Bionic-Induced Deformity"
msgstr "Deformidad Inducida por Biónico"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Bionic-Induced Deformity"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A combination of poor surgical installation and unpleasant scarring has lead"
" to the malfunctioning bionic catastrophe you call your face.  People who "
"mind that you look like a dime-store Frankenstein will react poorly to your "
"appearance."
msgstr ""
"Una combinación de mala instalación quirúrgica y desagradables cicatrices ha"
" dado lugar a la catástrofe biónica que funciona mal y que tú llamas tu "
"cara. La gente a la que le importa tu aspecto Frankenstein barato "
"reaccionará mal ante tu apariencia."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Wired Reflexes"
msgstr "Reflejos Cableados"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Wired Reflexes"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your reaction time has been greatly enhanced with bionic nerve stimulators, "
"giving you a +2 bonus to dexterity."
msgstr ""
"Tu tiempo de reacción se ha incrementado enormemente con estimuladores "
"nerviosos biónicos, lo que te da una bonificación de +2 a la destreza."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Expanded Digestive System"
msgstr "Sistema Digestivo Expandido"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Expanded Digestive System"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"You have been outfitted with three synthetic stomachs and industrial-grade "
"intestines.  Not only can you extract much more nutrition from food, but you"
" are highly resistant to foodborne illness, and can sometimes eat rotten "
"food."
msgstr ""
"Has sido equipado con tres estómagos sintéticos y con intestinos "
"industriales. No solo puedes extraer muchos más nutrientes de la comida, "
"sino que también eres muy resistente a las enfermedades transmitidas por "
"alimentos, y  puedes algunas veces comer comida podrida."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Acidic Discharge"
msgstr "Descargador Ácido"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Acidic Discharge"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A malfunctioning bionic which occasionally discharges acid into your "
"muscles, causing sharp pain and minor damage."
msgstr ""
"Un biónico que funciona mal y que ocasionalmente descarga ácido en tus "
"músculos, causando un dolor agudo y daños menores."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Electrical Discharge"
msgstr "Descargador Eléctrico"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Electrical Discharge"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A malfunctioning bionic which occasionally discharges electricity through "
"your body, causing pain and brief paralysis but no damage."
msgstr ""
"Un biónico que funciona mal y que ocasionalmente descarga electricidad a "
"través de tu cuerpo, provocando dolor y una breve parálisis, pero sin causar"
" daños."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Electrical Drain"
msgstr "Drenaje Eléctrico"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Electrical Drain"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A malfunctioning bionic.  It doesn't perform any useful function, but will "
"occasionally draw power from your batteries."
msgstr ""
"Un biónico que funciona mal. No tiene ninguna función útil, pero "
"ocasionalmente va a descargar energía de tus baterías."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Sound Dampeners"
msgstr "Amortiguadores Acústicos"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Sound Dampeners"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "When this bionic is active, you can block hearing completely."
msgstr ""
"Cuando este biónico está activo, puede bloquear la audición por completo."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Enhanced Hearing"
msgstr "Audición Mejorada"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Enhanced Hearing"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"When this bionic is active, your hearing will be drastically improved, "
"allowing you to hear ten times better than the average person.  "
"Additionally, high-intensity sounds will be automatically dampened before "
"they can damage your hearing."
msgstr ""
"Cuando este biónico esté activo, tu audición mejorará drásticamente, "
"permitiéndole oír diez veces mejor que la persona media. Además, los sonidos"
" de alta intensidad se amortiguarán automáticamente antes de que puedan "
"dañar tu audici"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Directional EMP"
msgstr "PEM Direccional"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Directional EMP"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Surgically mounted in your left arm and the palm of your left hand are small"
" parabolic EMP field generators.  You may use power to fire a wide but "
"short-ranged blast that will disable electronics and robots."
msgstr ""
"Montados quirúrgicamente en tu brazo izquierdo. En la palma de tu mano "
"izquierda hay pequeños generadores de campo PEM parabólicos. Puedes usar "
"energía para disparar una ráfaga amplia pero de corto alcance que "
"desactivará aparatos electrónicos y robots."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/bionics.json data/json/items/gun/bio.json
msgid "EMP Projector"
msgid_plural "EMP Projectors"
msgstr[0] "Proyector PEM"
msgstr[1] "Proyectores PEM"
msgstr[2] "Proyectores PEM"

#. ~ Description of bionic "EMP Projector"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A ranged EMP generator system is implanted in your right arm and the palm of"
" your right hand.  The system fires precise, single-target pulses that "
"require time to aim.  Extremely effective against electronic targets but "
"mostly useless otherwise."
msgstr ""
"Un sistema generador de PEM a distancia se implanta en tu brazo derecho y en"
" la palma de tu mano derecha. El sistema dispara pulsos precisos que "
"requieren un tiempo para el apuntado. Extremadamente eficaz contra objetivos"
" electrónicos, pero casi inútil para lo demás."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Ethanol Burner"
msgstr "Quemador de Etanol"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Ethanol Burner"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "You burn alcohol as fuel in an extremely efficient reaction."
msgstr ""
"Quemas alcohol como combustible en una reacción extremadamente eficiente."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Oil Generator"
msgstr "Generador a aceite"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Oil Generator"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Slowly generates bionic power out of kerosene or motor oil."
msgstr "Genera lentamente energía biónica con querosén o con aceite de motor."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Aero-Evaporator"
msgstr "Aero-Evaporador"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Aero-Evaporator"
#. ~ Description of "Aero-Evaporator CBM"
#: data/json/bionics.json data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"This unit draws moisture from the surrounding air, which slowly trickles "
"directly into your blood stream.  It may fail in very dry environments."
msgstr ""
"Esta unidad extrae la humedad del aire que la rodea y lentamente la pasa "
"directamente al torrente sanguíneo. Puede fallar en ambientes muy secos."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Diamond Cornea"
msgstr "Córnea de Diamante"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Diamond Cornea"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Your vision is greatly enhanced, giving you a +2 bonus to perception."
msgstr ""
"Tu visión ha sido mejorada enormemente, lo que te da una bonificación de +2 "
"a la percepción."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Telescopic Eyes"
msgstr "Ojos Telescópicos"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Telescopic Eyes"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Much of the material in your inner eye has been surgically removed and "
"replaced with an array of high-powered, auto-focusing lenses.  They function"
" as integrated binoculars, letting you see much farther than before, and any"
" vision problems you might have had are now gone."
msgstr ""
"Gran parte del material de tu ojo interno ha sido retirado quirúrgicamente y"
" reemplazado con un conjunto de lentes de alta potencia y autoenfoque. "
"Funcionan como prismáticos integrados, permitiéndote ver mucho más lejos que"
" antes, y cualquier problema de visión que pudiera tener ha desaparecido."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Facial Distortion"
msgstr "Distorsión Facial"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Facial Distortion"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Through controlled application of electrochemical impulses, you are capable "
"of altering your facial structure so as to subtly affect the reactions of "
"others.  This grants a bonus to all social interactions."
msgstr ""
"Mediante una aplicación controlada de impulsos electroquímicos, eres capaz "
"de alterar tu estructura facial para afectar sutilmente las reacciones de "
"los otros. Esto te concede una bonificación en toda interacción social."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Dielectric Capacitance System"
msgstr "Sistema de Capacitancia Dieléctrica"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Dielectric Capacitance System"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Throughout your body lies a network of miniature piezoelectric capacitors "
"which can be charged with bionic power to temporarily protect you from "
"external electrical discharge."
msgstr ""
"A través de tu cuerpo hay una red de condensadores piezoeléctricos en "
"miniatura que pueden cargarse con energía biónica para protegerte "
"temporalmente de las descargas eléctricas externas."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Fingerhack"
msgstr "Dedo Hack"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Fingerhack"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"One of your fingers has an electrohack surgically embedded in it; an all-"
"purpose hacking unit used to override control panels and the like (but not "
"computers).  Skill in computers is important, and a failed use may damage "
"your circuits."
msgstr ""
"Uno de tus dedos tiene un electrohackeador incorporado quirúrgicamente, que "
"es una unidad de hackeo útil para anular paneles de control y cosas por el "
"estilo (pero no ordenadores). Tu habilidad en informática es relevante, y si"
" un fallo al usarlo puede dañar tus circuitos."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Flashbang Generator"
msgstr "Generador de Destellos"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Flashbang Generator"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Light emitting diodes surgically integrated into your skin can release a "
"flash comparable to a flashbang grenade, blinding nearby enemies.  Speakers "
"integrated into your body mimic the loud sound, deafening those nearby."
msgstr ""
"Los diodos emisores de luz integrados quirúrgicamente en tu piel pueden "
"liberar un destello comparable a una granada de luz, cegando a los enemigos "
"cercanos. Los altavoces integrados en tu cuerpo imitan el sonido fuerte, "
"ensordeciendo a los que están cerca."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Cranial Flashlight"
msgstr "Linterna Craneal"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Cranial Flashlight"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Surgically mounted between your eyes is a small but powerful LED flashlight."
msgstr ""
"Montada quirúrgicamente entre tus ojos hay una pequeña pero potente linterna"
" LED."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "LED Tattoo"
msgstr "Tatuaje LED"

#. ~ Description of bionic "LED Tattoo"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A small LED display just beneath your dermal layer can be illuminated on "
"command to show patterns of your choice at dim or bright luminosity.  It "
"doesn't provide enough light to comfortably read or craft, but it can "
"suffice if you have nothing else."
msgstr ""
"Una pequeña pantalla LED situada justo debajo de tu capa dérmica puede ser "
"iluminada a voluntad para mostrar patrones de tu elección con una "
"luminosidad tenue o brillante. No proporciona suficiente luz para leer "
"cómodamente o fabricar, pero puede ser suficiente si no tienes nada más."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Glowy Thing"
msgstr "Cosa Brillante"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Glowy Thing"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"You don't think that capacitor is *meant* to glow, but it does, and usually "
"at bad times.  A malfunctioning bionic randomly turns on and off, causing "
"you to glow and making you visible in the dark without improving how much "
"you can see in the slightest."
msgstr ""
"No crees que ese condensador esté *destinado* a brillar, pero lo hace, y "
"normalmente en malos momentos. Un biónico que funciona mal se enciende y se "
"apaga aleatoriamente, haciendo que brille y haciéndote visible en la "
"oscuridad sin mejorar lo más mínimo tu visión."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Integrated Dosimeter"
msgstr "Dosímetro Integrado"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Integrated Dosimeter"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Small radiation sensors have been surgically implanted throughout your body,"
" allowing you to analyze your level of absorbed radiation.  They will also "
"alert you whenever exposed to environmental radiation."
msgstr ""
"Pequeños sensores de radiación han sido implantados quirúrgicamente en todo "
"tu cuerpo, permitiéndote analizar tu nivel de radiación absorbida. También "
"te alertará cada vez que te expongas a radiación ambiental."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Respirator"
msgstr "Respirador"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Respirator"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A complex respiration augmentation system.  Improves respiration ability in "
"air and allows breathing water.  Will automatically turn on when drowning.  "
"Turn on to recharge stamina faster, at moderate power cost.  Asthmatics may "
"also use it to stop asthma attacks."
msgstr ""
"Un complejo sistema de aumento de la respiración. Mejora la capacidad de "
"respiración en el aire y permite respirar agua. Se encenderá automáticamente"
" cuando te estas ahogando. Enciéndelo para recargar tu vigor más rápido a "
"costa de un consumo de energía moderado. Los asmáticos también pueden "
"utilizarlo para detener ataques de asma."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Terranian Sonar"
msgstr "Sonar Terrestre"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Terranian Sonar"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your feet are equipped with precision sonar equipment, allowing you to "
"detect the movements of creatures below the ground, buried traps, and "
"unstable terrain."
msgstr ""
"Tus pies están equipados con un sonar de precisión, lo que te permite "
"detectar movimientos de criaturas bajo tierra, trampas enterradas y terreno "
"inestable."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#. ~ Spell name
#: data/json/bionics.json data/mods/Aftershock/spells/monster_spells.json
msgid "Heat Drain"
msgstr "Drenaje de Calor"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Heat Drain"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"While fighting unarmed against a warm-blooded opponent, there is a chance "
"that a successful hit will drain body heat, inflicting a small amount of "
"extra damage, and increasing your power reserves slightly."
msgstr ""
"Mientras luchas sin armas contra un oponente de sangre caliente, existe la "
"posibilidad de que un golpe con exito drene el calor del cuerpo, infligiendo"
" una pequeña cantidad de daño extra, y aumentando ligeramente tus reservas "
"de energía."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Thermal Dissipation"
msgstr "Disipación Térmica"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Thermal Dissipation"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Powerful heatsinks and supermaterials are surgically woven into your flesh."
"  While powered, this system will prevent heat damage up to 2000 degrees "
"Fahrenheit.  Note that this does not affect your internal temperature."
msgstr ""
"Poderosos disipadores térmicos y supermateriales son tejidos quirurjicamente"
" en tu carne. Cuando esta encendido, este sistema evitará daños por calor "
"hasta los 1090 grados Celsius. Ten en cuenta que esto no afecta tu "
"temperatura interna."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Hydraulic Muscles"
msgstr "Musculatura Hidráulica"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Hydraulic Muscles"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"While activated, your muscles will be greatly enhanced, increasing your "
"strength by 20."
msgstr ""
"Mientras esté activado, tus músculos se fortalecerán enormemente, aumentando"
" tu fuerza en 20."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/bionics.json data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Infrared Vision"
msgstr "Visión Infrarroja"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Infrared Vision"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your range of vision extends into the infrared, allowing you to see warm-"
"blooded creatures in the dark or through smoke."
msgstr ""
"Tu rango de visión se extiende hasta el infrarrojo, permitiéndote ver "
"criaturas de sangre caliente en la oscuridad o a través de humo."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Cerebral Booster"
msgstr "Estimulador Cerebral"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Cerebral Booster"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your brain has been enhanced with bionic coprocessors, giving you a +2 bonus"
" to intelligence."
msgstr ""
"Tu cerebro ha sido mejorado con coprocesadores biónicos, dandote una "
"bonificación de +2 a la inteligencia."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Itchy Metal Thing"
msgstr "Cosas Metálicas Irritantes"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Itchy Metal Thing"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A bionic of some sort, so badly installed that you cannot even tell what it "
"was originally supposed to be.  Sometimes it itches horribly."
msgstr ""
"Una especie de biónico, tan mal instalado que ni siquiera se puede saber qué"
" debía ser originalmente. A veces pica horriblemente."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Finger-Mounted Laser"
msgstr "Dedo Láser"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Finger-Mounted Laser"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"One of your fingers has a small high-powered laser surgically embedded in "
"it.  This long range weapon is not incredibly damaging, but is very "
"accurate, and has the potential to start fires."
msgstr ""
"Uno de tus dedos lleva incrustado quirúrgicamente un pequeño láser de alta "
"potencia. Esta arma de largo alcance no es increíblemente dañina, pero es "
"muy precisa y tiene el potencial de provocar incendios."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Leaky Bionic"
msgstr "Biónico Agujereado"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Leaky Bionic"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"This botched piece of bionic hardware slowly leaks electrolytic compounds, "
"piezoelectric nanomaterials, and other high-tech contaminants into your "
"bloodstream.  Needless to say, this is not good for your health."
msgstr ""
"Esta chapuza de pieza biónica chorrea lentamente hacia tu sangre compuestos "
"electrolíticos, nanomateriales piezoeléctricos, y otros contaminantes de "
"alta tecnología. No es necesario decir que esto no es bueno para tu salud."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Leukocyte Breeder System"
msgstr "Sistema Cultivador de Leucocitos"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Leukocyte Breeder System"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"You are equipped with bionic stimulators which augment your haematopoiesis "
"system, allowing you to accelerate white blood cell production using bionic "
"power.  It is supposed to run continuously and may cause unpleasant side "
"effects when turned off."
msgstr ""
"Estás equipado con estimuladores biónicos que aumentan tu sistema de "
"hematopoyesis, lo que te permite acelerar la producción de glóbulos blancos,"
" utilizando energía biónica. Supuestamente funciona de forma continua y "
"puede causar efectos secundarios desagradables cuando se apaga."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Finger Lighter"
msgstr "Dedo Mechero"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Finger Lighter"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"The index finger of your left hand has a fire starter that can extend from "
"the tip."
msgstr ""
"El dedo índice de tu mano izquierda tiene un encendedor que puede extenderse"
" desde la punta."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Fingerpick"
msgstr "Dedo Ganzúa"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Fingerpick"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"One of your fingers has an electronic lockpick surgically embedded in it.  "
"This automatic system will quickly unlock all but the most advanced key "
"locks without any skill required on the part of the user."
msgstr ""
"Uno de tus dedos tiene una ganzúa electrónica incrustada quirúrgicamente. "
"Este sistema automático desbloquea rápidamente todas las cerraduras, excepto"
" las más avanzadas, sin que se requiera ninguna habilidad por parte del "
"usuario."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Electromagnetic Unit"
msgstr "Unidad Electromagnética"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Electromagnetic Unit"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Surgically embedded in your left arm is a powerful electromagnet, allowing "
"you to use your own strength to pull all nearby magnetic objects towards "
"you.  Unlucky bystanders might be injured or killed by flying objects."
msgstr ""
"Quirúrgicamente incrustado en tu brazo izquierdo hay un potente electroimán,"
" que te permite utilizar tu propia fuerza para atraer hacia ti todos los "
"objetos magnéticos cercanos. Los transeúntes desafortunados pueden resultar "
"heridos o morir a causa de los objetos voladores."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Nictating Membrane"
msgstr "Membrana Nictante"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Nictating Membrane"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your eyes have a thin membrane that closes over your eyes while underwater, "
"negating any vision penalties."
msgstr ""
"Tus ojos tienen una fina membrana que se cierra sobre tus ojos mientras "
"estás bajo el agua, anulando cualquier penalización a la visión."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Enhanced Memory Banks"
msgstr "Bancos Mejorados de Memoria"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Enhanced Memory Banks"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your memory has been enhanced with small quantum storage drives.  While "
"active, you learn - both through reading and practice - more quickly.  "
"Additionally, you forget skills you've learned slower."
msgstr ""
"Tu memoria fue mejorada con pequeñas unidades de almacenamiento cuántico. "
"Mientras están activas, aprendes -tanto a través de la lectura como de la "
"práctica- más rápidamente. Además, tardas mas en olvidar las habilidades que"
" ya aprendiste."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Metabolic Interchange"
msgstr "Intercambio Metabólico"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Metabolic Interchange"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your digestive system and power supply are interconnected; bionic energy is "
"replenished by burning calories.  Can be toggled on and off at will."
msgstr ""
"Tu sistema digestivo y tu suministro de energía están interconectados; la "
"energía biónica se repone quemando calorías. Puede ser activada y "
"desactivada a voluntad."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Weather Reader"
msgstr "Lector de Clima"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Weather Reader"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A multitude of scientific instruments and sensors collect environmental "
"data.  The data is compiled and presented as a simple readout of the current"
" weather.  It also passively tells you the local air temperature."
msgstr ""
"Una multitud de instrumentos y sensores científicos recogen datos "
"medioambientales. Los datos son compilados y presentados como una simple "
"lectura del clima actual. También te dice pasivamente la temperatura del "
"aire local."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Repair Nanobots"
msgstr "Nanobots Reparadores"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Repair Nanobots"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Inside your body is a fleet of tiny dormant robots.  While activated they "
"will flit about your body, repairing damage at 1 HP per minute and stopping "
"bleeding at the cost of extra power and stored calories.  No power is "
"consumed if there is nothing to heal."
msgstr ""
"Dentro de tu cuerpo hay una flota de pequeños robots latentes. Mientras "
"están activados, revolotearán por tu cuerpo, reparando los daños a 1 PG por "
"minuto y deteniendo la hemorragia a costa de energía extra y calorías "
"almacenadas. No se consumirá energía si no hay nada que curar."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Artificial Night Generator"
msgstr "Generador Artificial de Noche"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Artificial Night Generator"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"When active, this bionic eliminates all light within a 2 tile radius through"
" destructive interference."
msgstr ""
"Cuando está activo, este biónico elimina toda la luz en un radio de 2 "
"posiciones a través de interferencias destructivas."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Implanted Night Vision"
msgstr "Visión Nocturna Implantada"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Implanted Night Vision"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"When active, this bionic will amplify existing light, allowing you to see in"
" the dark."
msgstr ""
"Cuando está activo, este biónico amplificará la luz existente, permitiéndote"
" ver en la oscuridad."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Noisemaker"
msgstr "Ruidos con la Nariz"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Noisemaker"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A malfunctioning bionic.  It will occasionally emit a loud burst of noise."
msgstr ""
"Un biónico que funciona mal. Ocasionalmente, hará que emitas un fuerte "
"ráfaga de ruido."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Bionic Nostril"
msgstr "Fosas Nasales Biónicas"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Bionic Nostril"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"You're really not sure how the CBM ended up in your nose, but no matter how "
"it got there this badly misplaced bionic makes it difficult to breathe.  "
"Increases mouth encumbrance by ten."
msgstr ""
"No estás seguro de cómo el MBC terminó en tu nariz, pero no importa cómo "
"llegó ahí, este biónico mal ubicado dificulta la respiración. Incrementa la "
"incomodidad en boca en diez."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Offensive Defense System"
msgstr "Sistema de Defensa Ofensiva"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Offensive Defense System"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A thin forcefield surrounds your body, continually draining power.  This "
"field does not deflect attacks, but rather delivers a strong shock, damaging"
" unarmed attackers and those with a conductive weapon."
msgstr ""
"Un delgado campo de fuerza rodea tu cuerpo, drenando continuamente energía. "
"Este campo no desvía los ataques, sino que da una fuerte descarga, dañando a"
" los atacantes desarmados y a los que tienen un arma conductora."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Sensory Dulling"
msgstr "Adormecimiento Sensorial"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Sensory Dulling"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your nervous system is wired to allow you to inhibit the signals of pain, "
"allowing you to dull your senses at will.  However, the use of this system "
"may cause delayed reaction time and drowsiness."
msgstr ""
"Tu sistema nervioso está conectado para permitirte inhibir las señales de "
"dolor, lo que te permite adormecer tus sentidos a voluntad. Sin embargo, el "
"uso de este sistema puede provocar un retraso en el tiempo de reacción y "
"somnolencia."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Bionic Visual Impairment"
msgstr "Discapacidad Visual Biónica"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Bionic Visual Impairment"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Due to a badly misplaced dielectric stylette, you are now suffering from "
"mild optic neuropathy.  Increases eye encumbrance by ten."
msgstr ""
"Debido a una mala ubicación del estilete dieléctrico, ahora estás sufriendo "
"de una leve neuropatía óptica. Aumenta la incomodidad de tus ojos en diez."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Power Armor Interface"
msgstr "Interfaz de Armadura de Energía"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Power Armor Interface"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Interfaces your power system with the internal charging port on suits of "
"power armor, allowing them to draw from your bionic power banks."
msgstr ""
"Interconecta tu sistema de energía con el puerto de carga interno de los "
"trajes de armadura de energía, permitiéndoles extraer energía biónica de tus"
" bancos."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Power Armor Interface Mk. II"
msgstr "Interfaz de Armadura de Energía Mk. II"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Power Armor Interface Mk. II"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Interfaces your power system with the internal charging port on suits of "
"power armor, allowing them to draw from your bionic power banks.  Twice as "
"efficient as the Mk. I model."
msgstr ""
"Interconecta tu sistema de energía con el puerto de carga interno de los "
"trajes de la armadura de energía, permitiéndoles extraer energía biónica de "
"tus bancos. Dos veces más eficiente que el modelo Mk. I."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Power Storage"
msgstr "Almacenamiento de Energía"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Power Storage"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A Compact Bionics Module that increases your power capacity by 100 kJ.  "
"Having at least one of these is a prerequisite to using powered bionics.  "
"You will also need a power supply, found in various CBMs."
msgstr ""
"Un Módulo Biónico Compacto que aumenta tu almacenamiento de energía en 100 "
"kJ. Tener al menos uno de estos es un prerrequisito para usar biónica "
"energética. También necesitarás una fuente de alimentación, que se encuentra"
" en varios MBCs."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Power Storage Mk. II"
msgstr "Almacenamiento de Energía Mk. II"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Power Storage Mk. II"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "A Compact Bionics Module that increases your power capacity by 250 kJ."
msgstr ""
"Un Módulo Biónico Compacto que aumenta tu almacenamiento de energía en 250 "
"kJ."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Power Overload"
msgstr "Sobrecarga de Energía"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Power Overload"
#: data/json/bionics.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Damaged power circuits cause short-circuiting inside your muscles when your "
"batteries are above 75% capacity, causing greatly reduced strength.  This "
"has no effect if you have no internal batteries."
msgstr ""
"Los circuitos de energía dañados provocan un cortocircuito dentro de tus "
"músculos cuando las baterías están por encima del 75% de su capacidad, "
"causando una gran reducción de fuerza. Esto no tiene ningún efecto si no "
"tienes baterías internas."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Probability Travel"
msgstr "Viaje Cuántico"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Probability Travel"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Increases your body's wavelength, allowing you to quantum tunnel through "
"walls, reappearing on the other side.  Power drain in standby is minimal, "
"but each tile tunneled through costs 250 bionic power."
msgstr ""
"Incrementa la longitud de onda de tu cuerpo, lo que te permite hacer un "
"túnel cuántico a través de muros, reapareciendo del otro lado. El gasto de "
"energía mientras está encendido es mínimo, pero cada espacio atravesado "
"gasta 250 unidades de energía biónica."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Air Filtration System"
msgstr "Sistema de Filtrado de Aire"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Air Filtration System"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Surgically implanted in your trachea is an advanced filtration system.  If "
"toxins or airborne diseases find their way into your windpipe, the filter "
"will attempt to remove them."
msgstr ""
"Implantado quirúrgicamente en tu tráquea hay un sistema de filtración "
"avanzado. Si las toxinas o las enfermedades transmitidas por el aire llegan "
"a la tráquea, el filtro intentará eliminarlas."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Radiation Scrubber System"
msgstr "Sistema Depurador de Radiación"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Radiation Scrubber System"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A system of advanced piezomechanical blood filters have been surgically "
"implanted throughout your body, allowing you to purge yourself of absorbed "
"radiation at the cost of some bionic power."
msgstr ""
"Un sistema de avanzados filtros piezomecánicos para sangre han sido "
"implantados quirúrgicamente en tu cuerpo, lo que te permite purgarte de toda"
" radiación absorbida con un coste de energía biónica."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Fingertip Razors"
msgstr "Uña Cuchillas"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Fingertip Razors"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"You possess razor-sharp claws underneath your fingernails that do a small "
"amount of unarmed slashing damage whenever your fingertips are uncovered."
msgstr ""
"Tienes garras muy afiladas debajo de las uñas de tus dedos que hacen un "
"pequeño daño de corte sin armas siempre que las puntas de tus dedos estén "
"descubiertas."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Recycler Unit"
msgstr "Unidad Recicladora"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Recycler Unit"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your digestive system has been outfitted with a series of filters and "
"processors, allowing you to reclaim waste liquid and, to a lesser degree, "
"nutrients.  The net effect is a greatly reduced need to eat and drink."
msgstr ""
"Tu sistema digestivo ha sido equipado con una serie de filtros y "
"procesadores, lo que te permite recuperar líquido desperdiciado y, en menor "
"medida, nutrientes. El efecto neto es una necesidad muy reducida de comer y "
"beber."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Remote Controller"
msgstr "Controlador Remoto"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Remote Controller"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A small module connected to your brain allows you to interface with nearby "
"devices with wireless capabilities."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño módulo conectado a tu cerebro te permite interactuar con "
"dispositivos cercanos con capacidades inalámbricas."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Sonic Resonator"
msgstr "Resonador Sónico"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Sonic Resonator"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your entire body may resonate at very high power, creating a short-range "
"shockwave.  While it will not do much damage to creatures, solid objects "
"such as walls and doors will be damaged."
msgstr ""
"Todo tu cuerpo puede resonar a una potencia muy alta, creando una onda de "
"choque de corto alcance. Aunque no causará mucho daño a las criaturas, los "
"objetos sólidos como las muros y las puertas serán dañados."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Olfactory Mask"
msgstr "Máscara Olfativa"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Olfactory Mask"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"While this system is powered, your body will produce very little odor, "
"making it nearly impossible for creatures to track you by scent."
msgstr ""
"Mientras este sistema esté encendido, tu cuerpo producirá muy poco olor lo "
"que hace casi imposible que las criaturas puedan rastrearte con su olfato."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Bionic Short Circuit"
msgstr "Cortocircuito Biónico"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Bionic Short Circuit"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A poorly-wired bionic which fails to serve its intended purpose, this "
"malfunctioning device periodically short-circuits, causing systemic muscle "
"tremors."
msgstr ""
"Un biónico conectado muy torpemente que falla para cumplir su propósito. "
"Este dispositivo falla periódicamente y provoca cortocircuitos, causándote "
"temblores musculares."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Synaptic Regeneration System"
msgstr "Sistema de Regeneración Sináptica"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Synaptic Regeneration System"
#. ~ Description of "Synaptic Regeneration System CBM"
#: data/json/bionics.json data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"An electromagnetic stimulator has been surgically implanted on the back of "
"your head and along your spine, continually draining power.  As long as it's"
" active, you will not suffer from sleep deprivation, although you may still "
"feel sleepy; and if you're sleep deprived already, it will gradually reduce "
"the symptoms of lacking sleep."
msgstr ""
"Un estimulador electromagnético ha sido implantado quirúrgicamente en la "
"parte trasera de tu cabeza y a lo largo de tu columna vertebral, drenando "
"continuamente energía. Mientras esté activo, no sufrirás privación de sueño,"
" aunque puede que sigas sintiéndote somnoliento; y si ya estás privado de "
"sueño, reducirás gradualmente los síntomas de la falta de sueño."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Electroshock Unit"
msgstr "Unidad de Electroshock"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Electroshock Unit"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"While fighting unarmed, or with a weapon that conducts electricity, there is"
" a chance that a successful hit will shock your opponent, inflicting extra "
"damage and disabling them temporarily at the cost of some energy."
msgstr ""
"Cuando luchas desarmado, o con un arma que conduce la electricidad, existe "
"la posibilidad de que un golpe con éxito provoque una descarga a tu "
"oponente, infligiéndole un daño extra e incapacitándolo temporalmente a "
"costa de algo de energía."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Shockwave Generator"
msgstr "Generador de Onda Sísmica"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Shockwave Generator"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"You generate a powerful shockwave, knocking back all nearby creatures.  "
"Targets are stunned briefly, take damage and additional stun upon impact "
"with impassable terrain, and knockback any creatures they collide with."
msgstr ""
"Generas una potente onda sísmica que hace retroceder a todas las criaturas "
"cercanas. Los objetivos quedan aturdidos brevemente, reciben daño y "
"aturdimiento adicional al impactar con un terreno infranqueable, y derriba a"
" las criaturas con la que chocan."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Endocrine Enervator"
msgstr "Enervador Endócrino"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Endocrine Enervator"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Through a combination of psychochemical manipulation and old fashioned "
"electrical nerve stimulation, this malfunctioning bionic alters your brain "
"chemistry in such a way as to cause fatigue.  You will find yourself tiring "
"a bit faster than before."
msgstr ""
"Mediante una combinación de manipulación psicoquímica y estimulación "
"nerviosa eléctrica a la antigua, este biónico que funciona mal altera la "
"química de tu cerebro de tal manera que provoca fatiga. Te vas a cansar más "
"rápido que antes."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Motor Control Overstimulator"
msgstr "Sobreestimuladores del Control Motor"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Motor Control Overstimulator"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"One piezoelectric solenoid surgically installed backwards, two crossed "
"wires, and four burned-out capacitors later you started falling on your face"
" and writhing around at the least convenient times.  This incorrectly-"
"configured bionic periodically stuns you for a short duration."
msgstr ""
"Un solenoide piezoeléctrico instalado quirúrgicamente al revés, dos cables "
"cruzados y cuatro condensadores quemados más tarde, has empezado a caerte de"
" cara y a retorcerte en los momentos menos convenientes. Esta biónica mal "
"configurada te aturde periódicamente durante un corto periodo de tiempo."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Synaptic Accelerator"
msgstr "Acelerador de Sinapsis"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Synaptic Accelerator"
#: data/json/bionics.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Your nervous system has been enhanced with bionic stimulators, giving you a "
"10% boost to your speed."
msgstr ""
"Tu sistema nervioso ha sido mejorado con estimuladores biónicos, dándote un "
"10% de impulso a tu velocidad."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Wire-Induced Stiffness"
msgstr "Rigidez Inducida por Cables"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Wire-Induced Stiffness"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Improperly installed wires cause a physical stiffness in most of your body, "
"causing increased encumbrance."
msgstr ""
"Cables instalados de manera inapropiada te causan rigidez física en casi "
"todo tu cuerpo incrementando tu incomodidad."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Muscle Augmentation"
msgstr "Aumento Muscular"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Muscle Augmentation"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your muscular system has been surgically enhanced with myomer fibers, giving"
" you a +2 bonus to strength."
msgstr ""
"Tu sistema muscular ha sido mejorado quirúrgicamente con fibras de miómero, "
"lo que te da una bonificación de +2 a la fuerza."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Autonomous Surgical Scalpels"
msgstr "Escalpelos Quirúrgicos Autónomos"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Autonomous Surgical Scalpels"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A system of surgical grade scalpels is implanted in your forearms, extending"
" from just above your wrists.  They allow you to make automated precise cuts"
" and can also be used as a high-quality butchering tool."
msgstr ""
"Un sistema de bisturíes de grado quirúrgico es implantado en tus antebrazos,"
" extendiéndose desde justo por encima de tus muñecas. Te permite realizar "
"cortes precisos de forma automatizada y también pueden utilizarse como "
"herramienta de descuartizado de alta calidad."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Anti-Glare Compensators"
msgstr "Compensadores AntiReflejo"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Anti-Glare Compensators"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your eyes have quick-reacting transition lenses surgically installed over "
"them.  They negate glare penalties, partially protect you from bright "
"flashes, and protect your eyes when welding."
msgstr ""
"Tus ojos tienen lentes de transición de reacción rápida instaladas "
"quirúrgicamente sobre ellos. Anulan las penalizaciones por deslumbramientos,"
" te protegen parcialmente de los destellos brillantes y protege tus ojos al "
"soldar."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Targeting System"
msgstr "Sistema de Selección de Objetivos"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Targeting System"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your eyes are surgically equipped with range finders, and their movement is "
"synced with that of your arms, to a degree.  Shots you fire will be much "
"more accurate, particularly at long range."
msgstr ""
"Tus ojos están equipados quirúrgicamente con telémetros, y su movimiento "
"está sincronizado con el de tus brazos, en cierto grado. Los disparos que "
"realices serán mucho más precisos, particularmente a grandes distancias."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Teleportation Unit"
msgstr "Unidad de Teletransporte"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Teleportation Unit"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"This highly experimental unit folds space over short distances, instantly "
"transporting your body up to 25 feet at the cost of much power.  Note that "
"prolonged or frequent use may have dangerous side effects."
msgstr ""
"Esta unidad altamente experimental pliega el espacio en distancias cortas, "
"transportando instantáneamente tu cuerpo hasta 7.5 metros a costa de mucha "
"energía. Ten en cuenta que su uso prolongado o frecuente puede tener efectos"
" secundarios peligrosos."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Self-Locking Thumbs"
msgstr "Pulgares AutoBloqueantes"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Self-Locking Thumbs"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Self-locking thumbs hold tight (even when you really don't want them to) and"
" don't let go (even when you'd rather they did).  Increases hand encumbrance"
" by ten, while failing to improve your ability to hold objects whatsoever."
msgstr ""
"Los pulgares de cierre automático se mantienen firmes (incluso cuando "
"realmente no quieres que lo hagan) y no se sueltan (incluso cuando prefieres"
" que lo hagan). Aumenta la incomodidad de la mano en diez, mientras que no "
"mejora tu capacidad para sujetar objetos en absoluto."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Time Dilation"
msgstr "Dilación del Tiempo"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Time Dilation"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"At the cost of all stored bionic power, you may increase your body speed and"
" reactions dramatically, essentially freezing time.  You are still delicate,"
" however, and violent or rapid movements may damage you due to friction."
msgstr ""
"A costa de toda la energía biónica almacenada, puedes aumentar la velocidad "
"y las reacciones de tu cuerpo de forma drástica, esencialmente congelando el"
" tiempo. Sin embargo, aún eres delicado, y los movimientos violentos o "
"rápidos pueden dañarte debido a la fricción."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Integrated Multitool"
msgstr "Multiherramienta Integrada"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Integrated Multitool"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Surgically implanted in your hands and forearms is a set of compact tools "
"and a welder that runs off your internal power banks."
msgstr ""
"Implantado quirúrgicamente en tus manos y antebrazos hay un conjunto de "
"herramientas compactas y un soldador que funciona con tus bancos de energía "
"internos."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Extended Multitool"
msgstr "Multiherramienta Extendida"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Extended Multitool"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Extend or withdraw your integrated multitool to access its functions.  This "
"takes up your hands."
msgstr ""
"Extienda o retira tu multiherramienta integrada para acceder a sus "
"funciones. Esto ocupará tus manos."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Joint Torsion Ratchet"
msgstr "Articulaciones Cinéticas"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Joint Torsion Ratchet"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your joints have been surgically equipped with torsion ratchets that slowly "
"generate power when you move.  Whilst this is toggled, moving will require "
"more effort, though more power will be generated."
msgstr ""
"Tus articulaciones han sido equipadas quirúrgicamente con trinquetes de "
"torsión que generan energía lentamente cuando se mueven. Cuando se activan, "
"el movimiento requerirá más esfuerzo, pero se generará más energía."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Joint Servo"
msgstr "Articulación Servo"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Joint Servo"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your leg joints have been equipped with servomotors that provide power-"
"assisted movement.  Movement takes less effort when this bionic is online.  "
"However, when it's offline it will hamper your movement, as you struggle "
"against its moving parts."
msgstr ""
"Las articulaciones de tus piernas han sido equipadas con servomotores que "
"proporcionan un movimiento asistido por energía. El movimiento requiere "
"menos esfuerzo cuando este biónico está activado. Sin embargo, cuando este "
"desactivado dificultará tu movimiento, ya que lucharás contra tus partes "
"móviles."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Visual Disruptor"
msgstr "Disruptor Visual"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Visual Disruptor"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A malfunctioning bionic which causes occasional visual distortion and "
"pixelation."
msgstr ""
"Un biónico que está fallando y ocasionalmente te causa distorsión visual y "
"pixelación."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Uncanny Dodge"
msgstr "Esquiva Asombrosa"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Uncanny Dodge"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your nervous system has been augmented with bionic processors, allowing you "
"to dodge attacks beyond normal human capability."
msgstr ""
"Tu sistema nervioso fue aumentado con procesadores biónicos, lo que te "
"permite esquivar ataques más allá de la capacidad humana normal."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Unified Power System"
msgstr "UPS"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Unified Power System"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"You have a Unified Power System wired into your power banks.  Objects that "
"run on a UPS can now draw directly from your bionic power supply."
msgstr ""
"Tienes un Sistema de Energía Unificado conectado a tus bancos de energía. "
"Los objetos que funcionan con un UPS ahora pueden funcionar directamente "
"usando tu fuente de alimentación biónica."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Voice Remodulator"
msgstr "Remodulador de Voz"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Voice Remodulator"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"You will likely spend the rest of your days serving as a walking testament "
"to why you don't opt for the Autodoc's 'Cyborg Identity Package'.  A "
"remodulator unit jammed down your throat has given you a creepy robot voice."
msgstr ""
"Es probable que pases el resto de tus días sirviendo de testimonio andante "
"de por qué no optas por el \"Paquete de Identidad Cyborg\" de Autodoc. Una "
"unidad de remodelación metida en tu garganta te ha dado una espeluznante voz"
" de robot."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Internal Chronometer"
msgstr "Cronómetro Interno"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Internal Chronometer"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"You have been equipped with an internal atomic clock, ensuring that you will"
" always know the current time.  Additionally, it includes a silent alarm "
"clock function."
msgstr ""
"Has sido equipado con un reloj atómico interno, asegurando que siempre "
"sabrás la hora actual. Además, incluye una función de despertador "
"silencioso."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Water Extraction Unit"
msgstr "Unidad de Extracción de Agua"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Water Extraction Unit"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Nanotubes surgically embedded in the palm of your hand will pump any "
"available fluid out of a dead body, cleanse it of impurities and convert it "
"into drinkable water.  You must, however, have a container to store the "
"water in."
msgstr ""
"Nanotubos instalados en las palmas de tus manos bombearán cualquier líquido "
"disponible desde un cadáver, limpiando sus impurezas  para convertirlo en "
"agua potable. Sin embargo, necesitás tener un contenedor donde almacenar el "
"agua."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Gasoline Fuel Cell"
msgstr "Celda de Combustible a Gasolina"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Gasoline Fuel Cell"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A small gasoline fuel cell fixed to your scapula.  Despite its limited "
"energy output compared to other fuel cells, this device still produces a "
"significant amount of heat dissipated through a heat exhaust protruding from"
" your back.  A diffuse network of bio-plastic bladders has been meshed with "
"your circulatory system and serves as a fuel tank."
msgstr ""
"Una pequeña pila de combustible de gasolina fijada a tu escápula. A pesar de"
" tu limitada producción de energía en comparación con otras células de "
"combustible, este dispositivo todavía produce una cantidad significativa de "
"calor disipado a través de un tubo de escape de calor que sobresale de tu "
"espalda. Una red difusa de vejigas de bioplástico se ha engranado con tu "
"sistema circulatorio y sirve como depósito de combustible."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Intravenous Needletip"
msgstr "Aguja Intravenosa"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Intravenous Needletip"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"The flesh of the inside of your middle finger has been replaced with a tube "
"leading into your arteries, with a retractable needle extending out of the "
"tip of the finger when clenched.  This lets you pump intravenous drugs like "
"morphine directly into your bloodstream without needing to carry a syringe."
msgstr ""
"La carne del interior de tu dedo corazón ha sido reemplazado por un tubo que"
" lleva a tus arterias, con una aguja retráctil que sale de la punta del dedo"
" cuando se aprieta. Esto te permite bombear drogas intravenosas como la "
"morfina directamente a su torrente sanguíneo sin necesidad de llevar una "
"jeringa."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Titanium Skeletal Bracing"
msgstr "Soporte Esquelético de Titanio"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Titanium Skeletal Bracing"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Titanium bracing has been installed onto your elbows, knees, and spine, "
"making them far better at handling strain.  Your carrying capacity is "
"increased by 20 kilograms, or about 44 pounds."
msgstr ""
"Unos refuerzos de titanio han sido instalado en tus codos, rodillas y "
"columna, volviéndolos mucho mejores soportando el pes. Tu capacidad de carga"
" se incrementa en 20 kilos, unas 44 libras."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Taste Modifier"
msgstr "Modificador del Gusto"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Taste Modifier"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A set of highly sensitive sensors is installed in your mouth, and a small "
"yet sophisticated analyzer is installed in the cavity of your skull.  The "
"active bionic will nullify the taste of all comestibles with negative "
"enjoyment value at the cost of draining bionic power."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de sensores altamente sensibles se instala en tu boca, y un "
"pequeño pero sofisticado analizador se instala en la cavidad de tu cráneo. "
"El biónico activo anulará el sabor de todos los comestibles con valor de "
"disfrute negativo a costa de gastar energía biónica."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Soporific Induction"
msgstr "Inductor Soporífero"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Soporific Induction"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"An electrode has been implanted into your brain's ventrolateral preoptic "
"nucleus.  It turns on whenever you're trying to fall asleep, creating an "
"artificial but effective sensation of fatigue."
msgstr ""
"Un electrodo ha sido implantado en el nucleo preóptico ventrolateral de tu "
"cerebro Se enciende cada vez que intentas dormir, creando una sensación de "
"fatiga artificial pero efectiva."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Electromagnetic Leak"
msgstr "Fuga Electromagnética"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Electromagnetic Leak"
#. ~ Description of "Electromagnetic Leak CBM"
#: data/json/bionics.json data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A broken implant that sends electromagnetic impulses that reduce other "
"implants capacity to store charge."
msgstr ""
"Un implante roto que envía impulsos electromagnéticos que reducen la "
"capacidad de otros implantes para almacenar energía."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Taste Fouler"
msgstr "Gusto Repugnante"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Taste Fouler"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A malfunctioning processor haphazardly interfaced with your taste receptors "
"has given everything you consume a horrid bitter taste.  Food and drink will"
" severely harm your morale."
msgstr ""
"Un procesador funcionando mal y que se interconecta con tus receptores "
"gustativos ha dado a todo lo que consumes un horrible sabor amargo. La "
"comida y la bebida dañarán gravemente tu moral."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Radioactive Leak"
msgstr "Fuga Radioactiva"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Radioactive Leak"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "This damaged CBM occasionally leaks radiation."
msgstr "Este MBC dañado ocasionalmente pierde radiación."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Recoil Compensators"
msgstr "Compensadores de Retroceso"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Recoil Compensators"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Reactive shock absorbers installed in your wrists and elbows which greatly "
"reduce felt recoil."
msgstr ""
"Unos amortiguadores instalados en tus muñecas y codos reducen mucho el "
"retroceso."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Sleep Mode Shutdown"
msgstr "Apagado Modo Sueño"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Sleep Mode Shutdown"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"For better or worse, this CBM suppresses stimuli while asleep, preventing "
"you from waking up until the end of your natural sleep cycle."
msgstr ""
"Para bien o para mal, este MBC suprime los estímulos mientras duermes lo que"
" evita que te despiertes hasta terminar con tu ciclo natural de sueño."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Trickle Charger"
msgstr "Cargador por Goteo"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Trickle Charger"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"You have been equipped with a CBM that slowly recharges your power reserves "
"at all times.  Provides extremely low power but has no cost and will last "
"several years."
msgstr ""
"Fuiste equipado con un MBC que recarga lentamente tu reserva de energía en "
"todo momento. Brinda muy poca energía pero no tiene ningún costo y dura "
"varios años."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid "Throwing Assist"
msgstr "Asistente de Lanzamiento"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Throwing Assist"
#: data/json/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Taken from a world that embraced cybernetics in their sports, this CBM links"
" the eyes to a series of nerve stimulators along the arms and hands.  The "
"result is a significant increase to throwing accuracy, and it turns out it "
"works great with fragmentation grenades."
msgstr ""
"Tomado de un mundo que adoptó la cibernética en sus deportes, este MBC "
"vincula los ojos a una serie de estimuladores nerviosos a lo largo de los "
"brazos y las manos. El resultado es un aumento significativo de la precisión"
" de los lanzamientos, y resulta que funciona muy bien con las granadas de "
"fragmentación."

