#, c-format
msgid "You use your flippin' face to smash the %s.  EXTREME."
msgstr "Usas tu jeta para aplastar  %s . EXTREMO."

#. ~ Name of body part
#. ~ Heading of body part "mouth"
#: data/json/body_parts.json
msgid "mouth"
