#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your mandibles are unusable.  What, you don't have mandibles?  Then it must "
"be a bug if you have it."
msgstr ""
"Tus mandíbulas son inservibles. ¿Qué, no tienes mandíbulas? Entonces debes "
"ser gusano si no tienes."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "maimed_leg"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Maimed Legs"
msgstr "Patas mutiladas"

