"agitados."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Mycus Respite, Mycus Wrath"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Our fibers are stretched near breaking.  Local power diverted to regenerate."
msgstr ""
"Nuestras fibras se estiran a punto de romperse. La energía de la zona es "
"desviada a la regeneración."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Mycus Respite, Mycus Wrath"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Mycal wrath fills our fibers, and we grow turgid."
msgstr "La ira de Mycus llena nuestras fibras y nos ponemos turgentes."

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Mycus Respite, Mycus Wrath"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "We require repose; our fibers are nearly spent…"
msgstr "Necesitamos descansar; nuestras fibras están casi gastadas..."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "meth"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "High on Meth"
msgstr "Drogado con Metanfetaminas"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "meth"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Meth comedown"
msgstr "Bajón de Metanfetaminas"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "cig"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Nicotine"
msgstr "Nicotina"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Nicotine"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You had a puff or two."
msgstr "Tuviste una o dos caladas."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Nicotine"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You smoked too much."
msgstr "Fumaste demasiado."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "high"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "High"
msgstr "Drogado"

#. ~ Description of effect type "High"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You are high as a kite."
msgstr "Estás drogado como una cometa."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "High"
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "weed_high"
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Dead Drunk, Drunk, Tipsy, Trashed, Wasted"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You feel lightheaded."
msgstr "Estás un poco mareado."

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "weed_high"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"That critter's jumping around like a jitterbug!  It needs to mellow out."
msgstr ""
"¡Ese bicho está saltando como si estuviera bailando jitterbug! Necesita "
"calmarse."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "contacts"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Contact Lenses"
msgstr "Lentillas"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Contact Lenses"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You are wearing contact lenses."
msgstr "Estás usando lentillas."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Contact Lenses"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You can see more clearly."
msgstr "Ahora puedes ver mejor."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Contact Lenses"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your vision starts to blur."
msgstr "Tu visión se empieza a hacer borrosa."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "drunk"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Dead Drunk"
msgstr "Muerte de borracho"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "drunk"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Drunk"
msgstr "Borracho"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "drunk"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Tipsy"
msgstr "Achispado"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "drunk"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Trashed"
msgstr "Borracho"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "drunk"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Wasted"
msgstr "Borrachisimo"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Dead Drunk, Drunk, Tipsy, Trashed, Wasted"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You drank alcohol.  Party on!"
msgstr "Bebiste alcohol. ¡Que empiece la fiesta!"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Dead Drunk, Drunk, Tipsy, Trashed, Wasted"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You drank lots of alcohol.  Are those white mice?"
msgstr "Bebiste mucho alcohol. ¿Esos son ratones blancos?"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Dead Drunk, Drunk, Tipsy, Trashed, Wasted"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You drank some alcohol.  You feel warm inside."
msgstr "Bebiste un poco de alcohol. Te sientes caliente por dentro."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Dead Drunk, Drunk, Tipsy, Trashed, Wasted"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You drank unholy amounts of alcohol.  It's the end of the world, what do you"
" care?"
msgstr ""
"Bebiste cantidades impías de alcohol. Es el fin del mundo, ¿qué te importa?"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Dead Drunk, Drunk, Tipsy, Trashed, Wasted"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You embalmed yourself alive with so much alcohol, that even zombies will "
"leave your dead body alone."
msgstr ""
"Te embalsamaste vivo con tanto alcohol, que hasta los zombis dejarán tu "
"cadáver en paz."

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Dead Drunk, Drunk, Tipsy, Trashed, Wasted"
#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Depressants"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You feel woozy."
msgstr "Te sientes mareado."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "amigara"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You can't look away from the faultline…"
msgstr "No puedes dejar de mirar la enorme grieta en el suelo..."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "fearparalyze"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Feared"
msgstr "Miedoso"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Feared"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You have been paralyzed by the fear."
msgstr "Estás paralizado del miedo."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "asthma"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Asthma"
msgstr "Asma"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "asthma"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Heavy Asthma"
msgstr "Asma Grave"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Asthma, Heavy Asthma"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You suffer from a respiratory disorder that makes breathing difficult.\n"
"An asthma attack can occur from time to time, so have your inhaler nearby."
msgstr ""
"Sufre un trastorno respiratorio que dificulta la respiración.\n"
"Un ataque de asma puede ocurrir de vez en cuando, así que tenga su inhalador cerca."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Asthma, Heavy Asthma"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You can't breathe… asthma attack!"
msgstr "No puedes respirar... ¡Ataque de asma!"

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Asthma, Heavy Asthma"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're winded."
msgstr "Te falta el aire."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "crushed"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "The ceiling collapses on you!"
msgstr "¡El techo se te cae encima!"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "took_anticonvulsant_visible"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Took Anticonvulsant Drugs"
msgstr "Tomaste Anticonvulsivo"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Took Anticonvulsant Drugs"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You took anticonvulsant drugs some time ago and you might still be under its influence.\n"
"Prescription note says its effect duration may vary, so your estimate may be inaccurate."
msgstr ""
"Tomaste drogas anticonvulsivas hace algún tiempo y puede que aún estés bajo su influencia.\n"
"La nota de prescripción dice que la duración de su efecto puede variar, por lo que su estimación puede ser inexacta."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "relax_gas"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Relaxation Gas"
msgstr "Gas Relajante"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Relaxation Gas"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You are thoroughly relaxed and don't feel like moving.  Fighting?  Too much "
"effort."
msgstr ""
"Estás completamente relajado y no tienes ganas de moverte. ¿Pelear? "
"Demasiado esfuerzo."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Relaxation Gas"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You inhale sweetish gas."
msgstr "Inhalas un gas dulce."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Relaxation Gas"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "The slackness leaves your muscles."
msgstr "Ya recuperaste el vigor de tus músculos."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "tapeworm"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "bloodworms"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "brainworms"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "paincysts"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Unidentified Illness"
msgstr "Enfermedad no Identificada"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Unidentified Illness"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You aren't sure what's wrong with you but you don't feel well."
msgstr "No estás seguro/a de lo que te pasa, pero no te sientes bien."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "tetanus"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Muscle Cramps"
msgstr "Calambres Musculares"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Muscle Cramps"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your muscles are binding up, you should probably find a sedative."
msgstr ""
"Tus músculos se están agarrotando, probablemente deberías buscar un sedante."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Muscle Cramps"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your muscles start convulsing!"
msgstr "¡Tus músculos empiezan a convulsionar!"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "rat_bite_fever"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Puckered Scratches"
msgstr "Rasguños Arrugados"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Puckered Scratches"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your skin starts burning around some of your scratches.  Some aspirin might "
"relieve the effects."
msgstr ""
"La piel empieza a arder alrededor de tus rasguños. Una aspirina podría "
"aliviar los efectos."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Puckered Scratches"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "The fever breaks."
msgstr "La fiebre desaparece."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "datura"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Experiencing Datura"
msgstr "Experimentando Datura"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Experiencing Datura"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Buy the ticket, take the ride.  The datura has you now."
msgstr "Comprá el pasaje, hacé el viaje. La datura ahora te posee."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "grabbed"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Grabbed"
msgstr "Agarrado"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Grabbed"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You have been grabbed by an attack.\n"
"You are being held in place, and dodging and blocking are very difficult."
msgstr ""
"Has sido agarrado por un ataque.\n"
"Estás siendo retenido en tu lugar, y esquivar y bloquear es muy difícil."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "grabbing"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Grabbing"
msgstr "Agarrando"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Grabbing"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Grabbing another creature and holding them in place."
msgstr "Agarrando otras criaturas y manteniéndolas en su lugar."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "lack_sleep"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Lacking Sleep"
msgstr "Falta de Sueño"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Lacking Sleep"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You haven't slept in a while, and it shows."
msgstr "Hace mucho que no duermes, y se te nota."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Lacking Sleep"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You are too physically tired to function well."
msgstr "Estás demasiado cansado físicamente para funcionar bien."

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Lacking Sleep"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You don't have energy to fight."
msgstr "No tienes energía para pelear."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "lying_down"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You lie down to go to sleep…"
msgstr "Te acuestas para dormirte..."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "sleep"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You fall asleep."
msgstr "Te has dormido."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "sleep"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You wake up."
msgstr "Te despiertas."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "under_operation"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Under Operation"
msgstr "En Cirugía"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Under Operation"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You are being operated on.  Try to stay still."
msgstr "Te están operando. Intente quedarte quieto."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "playing_instrument"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Playing an Instrument"
msgstr "Tocando Instrumento"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Playing an Instrument"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You're playing an instrument.\n"
"Focusing on playing music distracts you, slowing you down."
msgstr ""
"Estás tocando un instrumento.\n"
"Enfocarte en tocar música te distrae, lo que te hace más lento."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "corroding"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Corroding"
msgstr "Corroyendo"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Corroding"
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Corroding"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're covered in acid!"
msgstr "¡Estás cubierto de ácido!"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "zapped"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Zapped"
msgstr "Electrocutado"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Zapped"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You've been zapped with electricity and are barely able to move!"
msgstr "¡Fuiste electrocutado y apenas si te puedes mover!"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Zapped"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're zapped!"
msgstr "¡Eres electrocutado!"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "anemia"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Acute Iron Deficiency"
msgstr "Deficiencia Grave de Hierro"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "anemia"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Early Iron Deficiency"
msgstr "Deficiencia Leve de Hierro"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "anemia"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Iron Deficiency"
msgstr "Deficiencia de Hierro"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Acute Iron Deficiency, Early Iron Deficiency,
#. Iron Deficiency"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"A lack of iron in your diet has hampered the efficiency and regeneration of "
"your red blood cells."
msgstr ""
"La falta de hierro en su dieta ha dificultado la eficacia y la regeneración "
"de sus glóbulos rojos."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Acute Iron Deficiency, Early Iron Deficiency,
#. Iron Deficiency"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Prolonged lack of iron in your diet has compromised the efficiency and "
"regeneration of your red blood cells."
msgstr ""
"La falta prolongada de hierro en su dieta ha comprometido la eficacia y la "
"regeneración de tus glóbulos rojos."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Acute Iron Deficiency, Early Iron Deficiency,
#. Iron Deficiency"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Severe lack of iron in your diet results in your red blood cells dying "
"faster then they are regenerating."
msgstr ""
"La falta grave de hierro en la dieta hace que tus glóbulos rojos mueran más "
"rápido de lo que se regeneran."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Acute Iron Deficiency, Early Iron
#. Deficiency, Iron Deficiency"
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Acute Anemia, Anemia, Early Anemia"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You begin feeling increasingly tired and listless."
msgstr "Empiezas a sentirte cada vez más cansado y apático."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Acute Iron Deficiency, Early Iron
#. Deficiency, Iron Deficiency"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You are no longer in risk of becoming anemic."
msgstr "Ya no estás en riesgo de volverte anémico."

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Acute Iron Deficiency, Early Iron
#. Deficiency, Iron Deficiency"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your iron deficiency is nearly resolved."
msgstr "Ya casi has superado tu deficiencia de hierro."

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Acute Iron Deficiency, Early Iron
#. Deficiency, Iron Deficiency"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your feel stronger as your iron deficiency starts to improve."
msgstr ""
"Te sientes más fuerte a medida que tu deficiencia de hierro comienza a "
"mejorar."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "redcells_anemia"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Acute Anemia"
msgstr "Anemia Aguda"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "redcells_anemia"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Anemia"
msgstr "Anemia"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "redcells_anemia"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Early Anemia"
msgstr "Anemia Leve"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Acute Anemia, Anemia, Early Anemia"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Loss of red blood cells results in progressively worsening anemia."
msgstr ""
"La pérdida de glóbulos rojos provoca un empeoramiento progresivo de la "
"anemia."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Acute Anemia, Anemia, Early Anemia"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You no longer feel anemic."
msgstr "Ya no te sientes anémico."

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Acute Anemia, Anemia, Early Anemia"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your anemia is nearly resolved."
msgstr "Tu anemia está casi resuelta."

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Acute Anemia, Anemia, Early Anemia"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your feel stronger as your anemia starts to improve."
msgstr "Te sientes con más fuerza a medida que mejorás de tu anemia."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "scurvy"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Bad Scurvy"
msgstr "Escorbuto Grave"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "scurvy"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Early Scurvy"
msgstr "Escorbuto Leve"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "scurvy"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Scurvy"
msgstr "Escorbuto"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Bad Scurvy, Early Scurvy, Scurvy"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"A lack of vitamin C in your diet will result in progressively worse symptoms"
" of scurvy."
msgstr ""
"La falta de vitamina C en tu dieta irá progresivamente empeorando tus "
"síntomas de escorbuto."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Bad Scurvy, Early Scurvy, Scurvy"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You start to develop symptoms of scurvy."
msgstr "Empiezas a padecer síntomas de escorbuto."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Bad Scurvy, Early Scurvy, Scurvy"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your scurvy has resolved."
msgstr "Se te ha curado el escorbuto."

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Bad Scurvy, Early Scurvy, Scurvy"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your vitamin C deficiency is starting to resolve."
msgstr "Has comenzado a superar tu deficiencia de vitamina C."

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Bad Scurvy, Early Scurvy, Scurvy"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your scurvy lessens as your Vitamin C deficiency improves."
msgstr ""
"Empiezas a curarte el escorbuto a medida que superás tu deficiencia de "
"vitamina C."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "hypervitaminosis"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Hypervitaminosis"
msgstr "Hipervitaminosis"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Hypervitaminosis"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "An excess of vitamins has badly affected your metabolism."
msgstr "Un exceso de vitaminas ha afectado gravemente tu metabolismo."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Hypervitaminosis"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your metabolism becomes unstable."
msgstr "Tu metabolismo se ha vuelto inestable."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Hypervitaminosis"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your metabolism becomes more stable."
msgstr "Tu metabolismo se vuelve más estable."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "toxin_buildup"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Concerning symptoms"
msgstr "Con respecto a los síntomas"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "toxin_buildup"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Unnerving symptoms"
msgstr "Síntomas desconcertantes"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Concerning symptoms, Unnerving symptoms"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your muscles keep twitching strangely."
msgstr "Tus músculos se siguen moviendo de forma extraña."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Concerning symptoms, Unnerving symptoms"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your nervous system is malfunctioning, almost like it's being torn apart "
"from the inside."
msgstr ""
"Tu sistema nervioso está funcionando mal, casi como si estuviera siendo "
"desgarrado desde el interior."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "bad_food_ennui"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Demoralizing Food"
msgstr "Comida Desmoralizante"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "bad_food_ennui"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Depressing Food"
msgstr "Comida Deprimente"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "bad_food_ennui"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Gross Food"
msgstr "Comida Desagradable"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Demoralizing Food, Depressing Food, Gross
#. Food"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Eating nothing but disgusting rations is starting to get you down."
msgstr "Comer nada más que raciones repugnantes está empezando a deprimirte."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Demoralizing Food, Depressing Food, Gross
#. Food"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Sure, you survived, but what kind of survival is this, eating these "
"disgusting rations day in and day out?"
msgstr ""
"Claro, sobreviviste, pero ¿qué clase de supervivencia es esta, comer estas "
"asquerosas raciones día tras día?"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Demoralizing Food, Depressing Food, Gross
#. Food"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "The food you eat is disgusting."
msgstr "La comida que comes es repugnante."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "genetics_damaged"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Bankrupt Phenotype"
msgstr "Fenotipo Quemado"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "genetics_damaged"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Depleted Phenotype"
msgstr "Fenotipo Agotado"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "genetics_damaged"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Spent Phenotype"
msgstr "Fenotipo Gastado"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Bankrupt Phenotype, Depleted Phenotype, Spent
#. Phenotype"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Mutation has left you with a persistent mild discomfort.  It seems harmless "
"for now, but you can't predict if it'll get worse."
msgstr ""
"La mutación te ha dejado con una leve incomodidad persistente. Parece ser "
"inofensiva ahora pero no puedes predecir si se pondrá peor."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Bankrupt Phenotype, Depleted Phenotype, Spent
#. Phenotype"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"There's an enervating sense of dysmorphia throughout your whole body.  It "
"waxes and wanes, but never quite goes away.  Mutating this much can't be "
"good for you…"
msgstr ""
"Hay una sensación debilitante de dismorfia por todo tu cuerpo. Crece y "
"decrece pero nunca se va. Mutar tanto no puede ser saludable…"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Bankrupt Phenotype, Depleted Phenotype, Spent
#. Phenotype"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You're haunted by phantom pains across your entire body now.  Everything "
"aches from an exhaustion that never seems to fade.  Any further mutation "
"right now is very unlikely to have a happy ending."
msgstr ""
"Ahora, te perturba un dolor fantasma por tu cuerpo entero. Te duele todo por"
" el agotamiento que nunca parece desaparecer. Cualquier próxima mutación no "
"tendrá un final feliz."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "hypovolemia"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Advanced Hypovolemic Shock"
msgstr "Choque Hipovolémico Avanzado"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "hypovolemia"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Mild Hypovolemic Shock"
msgstr "Choque Hipovolémico Leve"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "hypovolemia"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Moderate Hypovolemic Shock"
msgstr "Choque Hipovolémico Moderado"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "hypovolemia"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Severe Hypovolemic Shock"
msgstr "Choque Hipovolémico Severo"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Advanced Hypovolemic Shock, Mild Hypovolemic
#. Shock, Moderate Hypovolemic Shock, Severe Hypovolemic Shock"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You've lost a large amount of blood, and you're not feeling well."
msgstr "Has perdido una gran cantidad de sangre y no te sientes bien."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Advanced Hypovolemic Shock, Mild Hypovolemic
#. Shock, Moderate Hypovolemic Shock, Severe Hypovolemic Shock"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You've lost an awful lot of blood, and your condition is severe.  Seek "
"medical attention."
msgstr "Ha perdido mucha sangre y tu estado es grave. Busca atención médica."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Advanced Hypovolemic Shock, Mild Hypovolemic
#. Shock, Moderate Hypovolemic Shock, Severe Hypovolemic Shock"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You've lost some blood and look somewhat pale."
msgstr "Has perdido algo de sangre y estás algo pálido."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Advanced Hypovolemic Shock, Mild Hypovolemic
#. Shock, Moderate Hypovolemic Shock, Severe Hypovolemic Shock"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You've lost tremendous amount of blood, and you're standing on death's door."
"  Transfusion might save you."
msgstr ""
"Has perdido una gran cantidad de sangre y estás a las puertas de la muerte. "
"Una transfusión podría salvarte."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Advanced Hypovolemic Shock, Mild
#. Hypovolemic Shock, Moderate Hypovolemic Shock, Severe Hypovolemic Shock"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You have lost a lot of blood, and your condition worsens."
msgstr "Has perdido mucha sangre y su estado empeora."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Advanced Hypovolemic Shock, Mild
#. Hypovolemic Shock, Moderate Hypovolemic Shock, Severe Hypovolemic Shock"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You are no longer in shock."
msgstr "Ya no estás en shock."

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Advanced Hypovolemic Shock, Mild
#. Hypovolemic Shock, Moderate Hypovolemic Shock, Severe Hypovolemic Shock"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your blood volume increases, and you feel better; but still, you look pale."
msgstr ""
"Tu volumen de sangre aumenta y te sientes mejor; pero aún así, te ves "
"pálido."

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Advanced Hypovolemic Shock, Mild
#. Hypovolemic Shock, Moderate Hypovolemic Shock, Severe Hypovolemic Shock"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You feel stronger as your blood volume starts to improve."
msgstr ""
"Te sientes más fuerte a medida que tu volumen sanguíneo empieza a mejorar."

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Advanced Hypovolemic Shock, Mild
#. Hypovolemic Shock, Moderate Hypovolemic Shock, Severe Hypovolemic Shock"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You're not dying from lack of blood, but you're not out of the woods yet."
msgstr ""
"No te estás muriendo por falta de sangre, pero aún no estás fuera de "
"peligro."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "haslight"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Lit Up"
msgstr "Con Luz Encendida"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Lit Up"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You are carrying a light and can't hide well."
msgstr "Estás llevando un encendedor y no te puedes ocultar bien."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "mending"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Mostly Recovered"
msgstr "Casi Recuperado"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "mending"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Recovering"
msgstr "Recuperándote"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "mending"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Started Recovery"
msgstr "Empezando a Recuperarte"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Mostly Recovered, Recovering, Started
#. Recovery"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "This damaged limb is slowly regaining its functions."
msgstr "Este miembro dañado está recuperando sus funciones lentamente."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "disabled"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgctxt "physically"
msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "Desactivado"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Disabled"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "This limb is damaged beyond use and may require a splint to recover."
msgstr ""
"Este miembro está tan dañado que no lo puedes usar, y puede necesitar ser "
"entablillado para poder sanar."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Disabled"
#. ~ Snippet in category "broken_limb"
#: data/json/effects.json data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Your limb breaks!"
msgstr "¡Tu extremidad se rompe!"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Disabled"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "The broken limb has mended."
msgstr "El miembro fracturado se recuperó."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "milked"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Milked"
msgstr "Ordeñado"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Milked"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "The creature has been partially or fully milked."
msgstr "Esta criatura ha sido ordeñada completa o parcialmente."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "sheared"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Sheared"
msgstr "Esquilado"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Sheared"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "The creature has been fully sheared."
msgstr "La criatura ha sido completamente esquilada."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "pkill"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Painkillers"
msgstr "Analgésicos"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Painkillers"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You are under the influence of analgesic substances to relieve pain, but "
"they may numb you a bit."
msgstr ""
"Estás bajo los efectos de sustancias analgésicas para aliviar el dolor, pero"
" te pueden adormecer un poco."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "happy"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Elated"
msgstr "Eufórico"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "happy"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Happy"
msgstr "Feliz"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "happy"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Joyful"
msgstr "Alegre"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Elated, Happy, Joyful"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "I'm on top of the world, baby!"
msgstr "¡Estoy en la cima del mundo, nena!"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Elated, Happy, Joyful"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Life is good."
msgstr "La vida es buena."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Elated, Happy, Joyful"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Oh what a day!  What a lovely day!"
msgstr "¡Oh, qué día! ¡Qué día tan hermoso!"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "sad"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Depressed"
msgstr "Deprimido"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "sad"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Sad"
msgstr "Triste"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "sad"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Unhappy"
msgstr "Infeliz"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Depressed, Sad, Unhappy"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "This is not what you planned for your life."
msgstr "Esto no es lo que tenías planeado para tu vida."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Depressed, Sad, Unhappy"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "When will all your suffering end?"
msgstr "¿Cuándo se terminará todo este sufrimiento?"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Depressed, Sad, Unhappy"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You are not content with your life."
msgstr "No estás contento con tu vida."

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Depressed, Sad, Unhappy"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "What's the point of fighting?"
msgstr "¿Qué sentido tiene pelear?"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "irradiated"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_weakening"
#: data/json/effects.json data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Weakness"
msgstr "Debilidad"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "stim"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Stimulants"
msgstr "Estimulantes"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Stimulants"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're very jittery and pumped up, probably from some stimulants."
msgstr ""
"Estás muy nervioso y excitado, probablemente por algunos estimulantes."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "depressants"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Depressants"
msgstr "Calmantes"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Depressants"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You are under the influence of depressants, and in a bit of a daze."
msgstr "Estás bajo los efectos de calmantes, y un poco aturdido."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "stim_overdose"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Stimulant Overdose"
msgstr "Sobredosis de Estimulantes"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Stimulant Overdose"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You can't sit still as you feel your heart pounding out of your chest.  You "
"probably overdosed on those stims."
msgstr ""
"No puedes quedarte quieto mientras sientes que tu corazón se sale del pecho."
" Probablemente tengas una sobredosis de esos estimulantes."

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Stimulant Overdose"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You shake with the excess stimulation."
msgstr "Tiemblas por el exceso de estimulación."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "weak_antibiotic_visible"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Took Weak Antibiotic"
msgstr "Tomaste Antibiótico Suave"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Took Weak Antibiotic"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You consumed mild antibiotic some time ago to fight off infection.\n"
"If you don't recover you may want to take another dose, but beware overdosage."
msgstr ""
"Consumiste un antibiótico suave hace algún tiempo para combatir la infección.\n"
"Si no te recuperas, tal vez quiera tomar otra dosis, pero ten cuidado con una sobredosis."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "antibiotic_visible"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Took Antibiotic"
msgstr "Tomaste Antibiótico"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Took Antibiotic"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You consumed antibiotic some time ago to fight off infection.\n"
"If you don't recover you may want to take another dose, but beware overdosage."
msgstr ""
"Consumiste un antibiótico hace algún tiempo para combatir la infección.\n"
"Si no te recuperas puedes tomar otra dosis, pero ten cuidado con una sobredosis."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "strong_antibiotic_visible"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Took Strong Antibiotic"
msgstr "Tomaste Antibiótico Fuerte"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Took Strong Antibiotic"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You consumed prescription-grade antibiotic some time ago to fight off infection.\n"
"If you don't recover you may want to take another dose, but beware overdosage."
msgstr ""
"Hace tiempo consumistes antibióticos de prescripción para combatir la infección.\n"
"Si no se recupera, tal vez quiera tomar otra dosis, pero ten cuidado con la sobredosis."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "panacea"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Panacea"
msgstr "Panacea"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Panacea"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You feel incredible!  You could take on the world!"
msgstr "¡Te sientes increíble! ¡Podrías conquistar el mundo!"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "tummy_tablet"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Soothed Stomach"
msgstr "Estómago Aliviado"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Soothed Stomach"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You are under the effects of a stomach soother."
msgstr "Estás bajo los efectos de un calmante estomacal."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "antifungal"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Antifungals"
msgstr "Antifungales"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Antifungals"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You are under the effects of an antifungal medicine or chemicals."
msgstr ""
"Está bajo los efectos de un medicamento antifúngico o de productos químicos."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "emp"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Discharge"
msgstr "Descarga"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Discharge"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You've been recently affected by an electromagnetic pulse."
msgstr "Has sido afectado recientemente por un pulso electromagnético."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "supercharged"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Supercharged"
msgstr "Supercarga"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Supercharged"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You've been struck by lightning, and feel… different."
msgstr "Te ha alcanzado un rayo, y te sientes... diferente."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "pd_str_bad"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Muscle Disappearance"
msgstr "Desaparición Muscular"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "pd_str_bad"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Muscle Vanishment"
msgstr "Desvanecimiento Muscular"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Muscle Disappearance, Muscle Vanishment"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You feel as if your muscles are not in your body."
msgstr "Sientes como si tus musculos no estuvieran en tu cuerpo."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Muscle Disappearance, Muscle Vanishment"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You feel as if your muscles are not quite there."
msgstr "Sientes como si tus musculos no estuvieran ahí."

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Muscle Disappearance, Muscle Vanishment"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your lack of strength stops you!"
msgstr "¡Tu falta de fuerza te detiene!"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "pd_dex_bad"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Inexistent Grasp"
msgstr "Agarre Inexistente"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "pd_dex_bad"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Weak Grasp"
msgstr "Agarre Débil"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Inexistent Grasp, Weak Grasp"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You feel as if your hands just pass through matter."
msgstr "Sientes como si tus manos pasaran a través de la materia."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Inexistent Grasp, Weak Grasp"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You seem to have problems touching things."
msgstr "Pareces tener problemas al tocar cosas."

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Inexistent Grasp, Weak Grasp"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your attacks don't seem to touch your enemies!"
msgstr "¡Tus ataques no parecen tocar a tus enemigos!"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "pd_per_bad"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Distorted Vision"
msgstr "Visión Distorsionada"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "pd_per_bad"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Otherworldly Vision"
msgstr "Visión de Otro Mundo"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Distorted Vision, Otherworldly Vision"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You have problems distinguishing shapes and colors."
msgstr "Tienes problemas para distinguir formas y colores."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Distorted Vision, Otherworldly Vision"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You seem to see slightly different realities every time you blink."
msgstr "Pareces ver realidades ligeramente diferentes cada vez que parpadeas."

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Distorted Vision, Otherworldly Vision"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You can't distinguish up from down!"
msgstr "¡No puedes distinguir el arriba del abajo!"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "pd_int_bad"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Foreign Mind"
msgstr "Mente Extranjera"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "pd_int_bad"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Wandering Mind"
msgstr "Mente Errante"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Foreign Mind, Wandering Mind"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Foreign thoughts seem to invade your mind."
msgstr "Pensamientos extraños parecen invadir tu mente."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Foreign Mind, Wandering Mind"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your thoughts seem to wander around on their own."
msgstr "Tus pensamientos parecen vagar por si solos."

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Foreign Mind, Wandering Mind"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You suddenly think you shouldn't do that!"
msgstr "¡De repente sientes que no debes hacer eso!"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "pd_rejection"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Dimensional Rejection"
msgstr "Rechazo Dimensional"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "pd_rejection"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "World Rejection"
msgstr "Rechazo del Mundo"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Dimensional Rejection, World Rejection"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Faint sparks surround your every move, your body aches more with every "
"passing second."
msgstr ""
"Las débiles chispas rodean cada uno de tus movimientos, Tu cuerpo duele más "
"a cada segundo que pasa."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Dimensional Rejection, World Rejection"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Sparks swarm around you, your body hurts and even the air seems to reject "
"your existence."
msgstr ""
"Las chispas revolotean a tu alrededor, tu cuerpo te duele y hasta el aire "
"parece rechazar tu existencia."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "grown_of_fuse"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Grown of Fusion"
msgstr "Crecimiento de la fusión"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Grown of Fusion"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"AI effect to increase stats after fusing with another critter.  1 stack "
"means one absorbed max_hp."
msgstr ""
"Efecto de IA para aumentar los atributos después de fusionarse con otro "
"monstruo. 1 acumulado significa 1 max_pg absorbido."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "migo_atmosphere"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Disorienting Air"
msgstr "Aire Desorientador"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "migo_atmosphere"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Smothering Air"
msgstr "Aire Asfixiante"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "migo_atmosphere"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Stinking Air"
msgstr "Aire Apestoso"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Disorienting Air, Smothering Air, Stinking
#. Air"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "The air in here smells like vinegar and mold."
msgstr "El aire aquí huele a vinagre y moho."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Disorienting Air, Smothering Air, Stinking
#. Air"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"The air in here smells like vinegar and mold.  It is closing in and "
"smothering you, making it impossible to think clearly."
msgstr ""
"El aire aquí huele a vinagre y moho. Se siente cerrado y y te estas "
"sofocando, haciendo imposible pensar con claridad."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Disorienting Air, Smothering Air, Stinking
#. Air"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"The air in here smells like vinegar and mold.  It makes you feel soft-headed"
" and confused."
msgstr ""
"El aire aquí huele a vinagre y a moho. Hace que te sientas débil y "
"confundido."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Disorienting Air, Smothering Air, Stinking
#. Air"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"The air in here smells like vinegar and mold, and hurts your lungs a bit."
msgstr ""
"El aire de aquí huele a vinagre y a moho, y hace un poco de daño a los "
"pulmones."

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Disorienting Air, Smothering Air, Stinking
#. Air"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You feel groggy in this sweltering, foul air."
msgstr "Te sientes mareado en este aire sofocante y asqueroso."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "fetid_goop"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Covered in Fetid Goop"
msgstr "Cubierto por Pegoste Fétido"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Covered in Fetid Goop"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"The feeling of the goop slowly sliding on your skin revulses you and the "
"smell makes you gag."
msgstr ""
"La sensación del pringue deslizándose lentamente sobre tu piel te revuelve y"
" el olor te provoca arcadas."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Covered in Fetid Goop"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're disgusted by the goop."
msgstr "Estás asqueado por el pringue."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "incorporeal"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Incorporeal"
msgstr "Incorporeal"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Incorporeal"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You lack substance, as if you aren't quite fully here."
msgstr "Te falta sustancia, como si no estuvieras aquí del todo."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "weary_1"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Lightly Weary"
msgstr "Un poco cansado"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Lightly Weary"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You've been pretty active for a while; operating at the highest levels of activity will be impaired.\n"
"The following move penalties are applied for the following activity levels:\n"
"Extreme: 1.25x"
msgstr ""
"Has estado muy activo durante un tiempo; operar a los niveles más altos de actividad se mermará.\n"
"Se aplican las siguientes penalizaciones de movimiento para los siguientes niveles de actividad:\n"
"Extremo: 1,25x"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "weary_2"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Moderately Weary"
msgstr "Cansancio moderado"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Moderately Weary"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You've been quite active for a while; operating at higher levels of activity will be impaired.\n"
"The following move penalties are applied for the following activity levels:\n"
"Extreme: 1.67x, Active: 1.33x"
msgstr ""
"Has estado bastante activo durante un tiempo; operar a niveles de actividad más altos te mermará.\n"
"Se aplican las siguientes penalizaciones de movimiento para los siguientes niveles de actividad:\n"
"Extremo: 1,67x, Activo: 1,33x"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "weary_3"
#. ~ Label of UI widget "ln_weariness_desc"
#: data/json/effects.json data/json/ui/sidebar-legacy-labels-narrow.json
msgid "Weary"
msgstr "Cansado"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Weary"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You've been very active for a while, and need to slow down for a bit.\n"
"The following move penalties are applied for the following activity levels:\n"
"Extreme: 2.5x, Active: 2x, Brisk: 1.5x"
msgstr ""
"Has estado muy activo durante un tiempo y necesitas bajar el ritmo por un tiempo.\n"
"Se aplican las siguientes penalizaciones de movimiento para los siguientes niveles de actividad:\n"
"Extremo: 2,5x, Activo: 2x, Rápido: 1,5x"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "weary_4"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Very Weary"
msgstr "Muy cansado"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Very Weary"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You've been extremely active for a while, and need to slow down.\n"
"The following move penalties are applied for the following activity levels:\n"
"Extreme: 5x, Active: 4x, Brisk: 3x, Moderate: 2x"
msgstr ""
"Has estado extremadamente activo durante un tiempo y necesitas bajar el ritmo.\n"
"Se aplican las siguientes penalizaciones de movimiento para los siguientes niveles de actividad:\n"
"Extremo: 5x, Activo: 4x, Enérgico: 3x, Moderado: 2x"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "weary_5"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "weary_6"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "weary_7"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "weary_8"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Extremely Weary"
msgstr "Cansancio extremo"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Extremely Weary"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You've been extremely active for a while, and can't take much more activity.\n"
"The following move penalties are applied for the following activity levels:\n"
"Extreme: 10x, Active: 8x, Brisk: 6x, Moderate: 4x, Light: 2x"
msgstr ""
"Has estado extremadamente activo durante un tiempo y no puedes soportar mucha más actividad.\n"
"Se aplican las siguientes penalizaciones de movimiento para los siguientes niveles de actividad:\n"
"Extremo: 10x, Activo: 8x, Enérgico: 6x, Moderado 4x, Ligero: 2x"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Extremely Weary"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You've been extremely active for a while, and really need to get some rest.\n"
"The following move penalties are applied for the following activity levels:\n"
"Extreme: 10x, Active: 8x, Brisk: 6x, Moderate: 4x, Light: 2x"
msgstr ""
"Has estado muy activo durante un tiempo y necesitas descansar.\n"
"Se aplican las siguientes penalizaciones de movimiento para los siguientes niveles de actividad:\n"
"Extremo: 10x, Activo: 8x, Enérgico: 6x, Moderado 4x, Ligero: 2x"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Extremely Weary"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You've been extremely active for a while; it's time to stop.\n"
"The following move penalties are applied for the following activity levels:\n"
"Extreme: 10x, Active: 8x, Brisk: 6x, Moderate: 4x, Light: 2x"
msgstr ""
"Has sido extremadamente activo durante un tiempo; es hora de parar.\n"
"Se aplican las siguientes penalizaciones de movimiento para los siguientes niveles de actividad:\n"
"Extremo: 10x, Activo: 8x, Enérgico: 6x, Moderado 4x, Ligero: 2x"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Extremely Weary"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You've been extremely active for a while, and can no longer keep pushing.\n"
"The following move penalties are applied for the following activity levels:\n"
"Extreme: 10x, Active: 8x, Brisk: 6x, Moderate: 4x, Light: 2x"
msgstr ""
"Has estado extremadamente activo durante un tiempo y ya no puedes seguir mucho mas.\n"
"Se aplican las siguientes penalizaciones de movimiento para los siguientes niveles de actividad:\n"
"Extremo: 10x, Activo: 8x, Enérgico: 6x, Moderado 4x, Ligero: 2x"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "hunger_full"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "beggar_has_eaten"
#: data/json/effects.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
msgid "Full"
msgstr "Lleno"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Full"
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Full"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You feel quite full, and a bit sluggish."
msgstr "Te sientes bastante lleno, y un poco lento."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "hunger_engorged"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "blood_quenched"
#: data/json/effects.json data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Engorged"
msgstr "Barriga llena"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Engorged"
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Engorged"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your stomach is full to bursting.  This was a mistake."
msgstr "Tu estómago está lleno hasta reventar. Esto fue un error."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "weakened_inertia"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "strengthened_inertia"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Weakened Inertia"
msgstr "Inercia Debilitada"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Weakened Inertia"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your body moves strangely easily, as if it weighted less."
msgstr "Tu cuerpo se mueve con extraña facilidad, como si pesara menos."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Weakened Inertia"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your inertia itself is damaged, but the outcome seems suspiciously "
"beneficial."
msgstr ""
"Tu inercia está mal, pero el resultado parece sospechosamente beneficioso."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Weakened Inertia"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Reality reasserts itself and your inertia returns to normal."
msgstr "La realidad es reafirmada y tu inercia vuelve a la normalidad."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Weakened Inertia"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your body is strangely difficult to move, as if it weighted more."
msgstr "Tu cuerpo está extrañamente difícil de mover, como si pesara más."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Weakened Inertia"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your inertia itself is damaged, but hopefully it's not permanent yet."
msgstr "Tu inercia está dañada, esperemos que no sea permanente aún."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "warped_viewpoint"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Warped Viewpoint"
msgstr "Punto de Vista Retorcido"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Warped Viewpoint"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Space is warped around you such that you can see a wider arc and as if "
"everything was closer."
msgstr ""
"El espacio se deforma a tu alrededor de forma que puedes ver un campo más "
"amplio y como si todo estuviera más cerca."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Warped Viewpoint"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Space around you is damaged but in the process your can see more and more "
"easily than before."
msgstr ""
"El espacio que te rodea está dañado pero en el proceso puedes ver mas campo "
"y más fácilmente que antes."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Warped Viewpoint"
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Narrowed Viewpoint"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Reality reasserts itself and your perspective returns to normal."
msgstr "La realidad se reafirma y tu perspectiva vuelve a la normalidad."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "narrow_viewpoint"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Narrowed Viewpoint"
msgstr "Punto de Vista Reducido"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Narrowed Viewpoint"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Space is warped around you such that you can see less and as if everything "
"was farther away."
msgstr ""
"El espacio se deforma a tu alrededor de tal manera que puedes ver menos y "
"como si todo estuviera más lejos."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Narrowed Viewpoint"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Space around you is damaged narrowing your perspective."
msgstr "El espacio que te rodea está dañado estrechando tu perspectiva."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "weakened_gravity"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Weakened Gravity"
msgstr "Gravedad Debilitada"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Weakened Gravity"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Something is wrong with local spacetime and everything near you seems to "
"weigh less."
msgstr ""
"Algo está distorcionado en el espacio-tiempo y todo lo que está cerca de ti "
"parece pesar menos."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Weakened Gravity"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Space around you is damaged and everything near you seems to weigh less."
msgstr ""
"El espacio que te rodea está distorsionado y todo lo que está cerca de ti "
"parece pesar menos."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Weakened Gravity"
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Strengthened Gravity"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Reality reasserts itself and your gravity returns to normal."
msgstr "La realidad se reafirma y tu gravedad vuelve a la normalidad."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "strengthened_gravity"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Strengthened Gravity"
msgstr "Gravedad Reforzada"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Strengthened Gravity"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Something is wrong with local spacetime and everything near you seems to "
"weigh more."
msgstr ""
"Algo está distorsionado en el espacio-tiempo y todo lo que está cerca de ti "
"parece pesar más."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Strengthened Gravity"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Space around you is damaged and everything near you seems to weigh more."
msgstr ""
"El espacio que te rodea está distorsionado y todo lo que está cerca de ti "
"parece pesar más."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "slowed_time"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Slowed Time"
msgstr "Tiempo Ralentizado"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Slowed Time"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Something is wrong with local spacetime and everything around seems to move "
"faster than you."
msgstr ""
"Algo está mal en el espacio-tiempo local y todo alrededor parece moverse más"
" rápido que tú."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Slowed Time"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Time around you is damaged and everything near you seems to move faster."
msgstr ""
"El tiempo a tu alrededor está dañado y todo lo que está cerca de ti parece "
"moverse más rápido."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Slowed Time"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Reality reasserts itself and your time returns to normal."
msgstr "La realidad se reafirma y el tiempo vuelve a la normalidad."

