msgstr "¡La puerta se cierra de un golpe!"

#. ~ Message of fail action on a gate
#: data/json/gates.json
msgid "The door can't be closed!"
msgstr "¡No se puede cerrar la puerta!"

#. ~ Harvest message
#: data/json/harvest.json
msgid "You gut and fillet the fish."
msgstr "Destripas y fileteas el pescado"

#. ~ Harvest message
#: data/json/harvest.json
msgid "You carefully crack open its exoskeleton to get at the flesh beneath."
msgstr ""
"Rompes cuidadosamente su exoesqueleto para llegar a la carne de adentro."

#. ~ Harvest message
#: data/json/harvest.json
msgid "You crack open its hard shell to get at the flesh beneath."
msgstr "Abres su duro caparazón para llegar a la carne que hay debajo."

#. ~ Harvest message
#: data/json/harvest.json data/json/harvest_dissect.json
msgid ""
"You search for any salvageable hardware in what's left of this failed "
"experiment."
msgstr ""
"Buscas cualquier hardware rescatable en lo que queda de este experimento "
"fallido."

#. ~ Harvest message
#: data/json/harvest.json data/json/harvest_dissect.json
msgid ""
"You search for any salvageable hardware in what's left of this flesh and "
"metal monster.  Much of it is just scrap metal, but some of the electronics "
"look surprisingly intact."
msgstr ""
"Buscas cualquier hardware rescatable en lo que queda de este monstruo de "
"carne y hueso. La mayor parte es chatarra, pero algunos de los componentes "
"electrónicos parecen sorprendentemente intactos."

#. ~ Harvest message
#: data/json/harvest.json
msgid ""
"You messily hack apart the hulking mass of fused, rancid flesh, taking note "
"of anything that stands out."
msgstr ""
"Cortas en piezas sin orden la mole de carne fusionada y rancia, tomando nota"
" de todo lo que llame tu atención."

#. ~ Harvest message
#: data/json/harvest.json
msgid ""
"You messily hack apart the colossal mass of fused, rancid flesh, taking note"
" of anything that stands out."
msgstr ""
"Destruyes la colosal masa de carne fundida y rancia, tomando nota de todo lo"
" que sobresale."

#. ~ Harvest message
#: data/json/harvest.json
msgid "You laboriously dissect the colossal insect.  <acidant_harvest>"
msgstr "Laboriosamente, diseccionas el colosal insecto. <acidant_harvest>"

#. ~ Harvest message
#: data/json/harvest.json
msgid ""
"What appeared to be insect hairs on the chitin of this creature look more "
"like tiny feathers as you pare them back.  Inside is a bundle of bubble-like"
" tissue sacs that appear to be floating, which doesn't fit with what you "
"know about real bees."
msgstr ""
"Lo que parecían ser pelos de insecto en la quitina de esta criatura parecen "
"más bien plumas diminutas cuando se recortan. En su interior hay un conjunto"
" de sacos de tejido en forma de burbuja que parecen flotar, lo que no encaja"
" con lo que se sabe de las abejas reales."

#. ~ Harvest message
#: data/json/harvest.json
msgid ""
"As you hack away at the chitinous amalgamation you can't help but follow the"
" tunnel the (male?) dragonfly's tail bore into the flesh of its mate, ending"
" up at a formless amalgamation of eyes, jaws, eggs, and ganglia deep within."
"  Love truly knows no bounds."
msgstr ""
"Mientras cortas la amalgama quitinosa, no puedes evitar seguir el túnel que "
"la cola de la libélula (¿macho?) perforó en la carne de su compañera, hasta "
"llegar a una amalgama informe de ojos, mandíbulas, huevos y ganglios en lo "
"más profundo. El amor no tiene límites."

#. ~ Harvest message
#: data/json/harvest.json
msgid "You laboriously hack and dig through the remains of the fungal mass."
msgstr ""
"Laboriosamente cortas y cavas a través de los restos de la masa fúngica."

#. ~ Harvest message
#: data/json/harvest_dissect.json data/mods/DinoMod/harvest_dissect.json
msgid ""
"With cuts and pulls equally similar to both extraction and vandalism, you "
"scrape together the most important parts of the creature."
msgstr ""
"Con cortes y tirones igualmente parecidos a los de la extracción y al "
"vandalismo, recoges las partes más importantes de la criatura."

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Heroin Dependence"
msgstr "Adicto a la Heroína"

#. ~ Description of profession "Heroin Dependence" for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The last thing you remember was meeting God behind the local Foodplace.  "
"Then people started eating each other.  This doesn't feel like a fever "
"dream."
msgstr ""
"Lo último que recuerdas fue encontrarte con Dios detrás del Lugarcomida "
"local. Entonces la gente empezó a comerse entre si. Esto no se parece a un "
"sueño febril."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Heroin Dependence"
msgstr "Adicta a Heroína"

#. ~ Description of profession "Heroin Dependence" for female
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The last thing you remember was meeting God behind the local Foodplace.  "
