"local. Entonces la gente empezó a comerse entre si. Esto no se parece a un "
"sueño febril."

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Nicotine Dependence"
msgstr "Adicto a la Nicotina"

#. ~ Description of profession "Nicotine Dependence" for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Your coworkers always muttered when you had to duck outside every hour for a"
" smoke, but it ended up saving your life when things got bad.  You'll need "
"to find a steady supply of nicotine if you want to keep the cravings at bay."
msgstr ""
"Tus compañeros de trabajo siempre murmuraban cuando tenías que escabullirte "
"fuera cada hora para fumar, pero acabó salvándote la vida cuando las cosas "
"se pusieron feas. Tendrás que encontrar un suministro constante de nicotina "
"si quieres mantener a raya las ansias."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Nicotine Dependence"
msgstr "Adicta a la Nicotina"

#. ~ Description of profession "Nicotine Dependence" for female
#: data/json/hobbies.json
