#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Amphetamine Dependence"
msgstr "Adicto a las Anfetaminas"

#. ~ Description of profession "Amphetamine Dependence" for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You're not entirely sure what happened last night, but you woke up on the "
"floor and everything has completely gone to shit.  The only thing running "
"through your head, though, is where you're gonna find your next hit."
msgstr ""
"No estás del todo seguro de lo que pasó anoche, pero te has despertado en el"
" suelo y todo se ha ido completamente a la mierda. Lo único que pasa por tu "
"cabeza, sin embargo, es dónde vas a encontrar tu próximo subidón."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/hobbies.json
