#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Sleeping Pill Dependence"
msgstr "Adicción a Somníferos"

#. ~ Description of profession "Sleeping Pill Dependence" for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You'd been having trouble falling asleep, so you started taking prescription"
" sleep meds.  Now you can hardly seem to fall asleep at all without them, "
"and you'll need plenty of rest to face the days ahead."
msgstr ""
"Has estado teniendo problemas para conciliar el sueño, asi que empezaste a "
"tomar medicamentos para dormir. Ahora apenas puedes conciliar el sueño sin "
"ellos, y necesitarás descansar mucho para afrontar los días que te esperan."

