msgid "Caffeine Dependence"
msgstr "Adicción a la Cafeina"

#. ~ Description of profession "Caffeine Dependence" for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Coffee was your faithful companion every morning, and without it you feel "
"like a zombie.  Thanks to all the actual zombies shambling about, getting "
"your caffeine fix will be much harder now."
msgstr ""
