msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You take camping to a whole new level.  You have spent nights and weekends "
"surviving in the wild with just a knife to aid you.  Maybe this skill for "
"self-sufficiency can keep you safe."
msgstr ""
"Llevas la acampada a un nuevo nivel. Has pasado noches y fines de semana "
"sobreviviendo en la naturaleza con sólo un cuchillo para ayudarte. Quizá "
"esta habilidad para la autosuficiencia pueda mantenerte a salvo."

