msgid "Fencing"
msgstr "Esgrimista"

#. ~ Description of profession "Fencing" for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were in a fencing club, and you weren't too shabby with a saber.  If you"
" can get your hands on a real sword, you'll be a formidable fighter."
msgstr ""
"Estuviste en un club de esgrima, y no eras demasiado malo con el sable. Si "
"puedes hacerte con una espada de verdad, serás un luchador formidable."

