#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Competitive Eating"
msgstr "Comensal de Competencia"

#. ~ Description of profession "Competitive Eating" for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were a professional eater before the Cataclysm and frequently "
"participated in eating contests.  Thanks to your training you can eat huge "
"amounts of food without getting sick, and while eating forty hot dogs in ten"
" minutes might not be too useful in a world of zombies, your fortitude might"
" help you survive off food other survivors would pass over."
msgstr ""
"Eras un commensal profesional antes del Cataclismo y participabas con "
"frecuencia en concursos de comida. Gracias a tu entrenamiento puedes comer "
"enormes cantidades de comida sin enfermar, y aunque comer cuarenta perritos "
"calientes en diez minutos no sea demasiado útil en un mundo de zombis, tu "
"fortaleza podría ayudarte a sobrevivir con comida que otros supervivientes "
"pasarían por alto."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Competitive Eating"
msgstr "Comensal de Competencia"

#. ~ Description of profession "Competitive Eating" for female
#: data/json/hobbies.json
