#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json data/mods/innawood/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Book Hating"
msgstr "Odia Libros"

#. ~ Description of profession "Book Hating" for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json data/mods/innawood/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Reading is for nerds!  You've managed to make hatred of the written word a "
"central part of your identity.  Or, perhaps, you have a barrier that makes "
"books additionally challenging and frustrating for you.  Whatever the "
"reason, boring books are more boring, and you can't have fun by reading "
"books."
msgstr ""
"¡La lectura es para los empollones! Has conseguido que el odio a la palabra "
"escrita sea una parte central de tu identidad. O, tal vez, tienes una "
"barrera que hace que los libros sean adicionalmente un reto y una "
"frustración para ti. Sea cual sea la razón, los libros aburridos son más "
"aburridos, y no puedes divertirte leyendo libros."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/hobbies.json data/mods/innawood/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
