#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Practical Jokes"
msgstr "Bromista Práctica"

#. ~ Description of profession "Practical Jokes" for female
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Pranks and physical jokes are a passion of yours, from the setup right "
"through to playing innocent at the end."
msgstr ""
"Las bromas y los chistes físicos son una de tus pasiones, desde el montaje "
"hasta hacerse el inocente al final."

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Modelling"
msgstr "Modelo"

#. ~ Description of profession "Modelling" for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were deep into the fashion scene, keeping up on the latest trends and "
"even modelling clothes yourself.  Having style and good looks is just as, if"
" not more, important to you than practicality."
msgstr ""
"Estás muy metido en el mundo de la moda, te mantienes al día de las últimas "
"tendencias e incluso eres modelo de ropa. Tener estilo y buena apariencia es"
" tan importante para ti, si no más, que la funcionalidad."

