#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Handloading"
msgstr "Recargador Manual"

#. ~ Description of profession "Handloading" for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You figured you could save money on ammo by learning to make your own.  Now "
"that the factories are shut down, your abilities just went from handy to "
"lifesaving."
msgstr ""
"Pensaste que podías ahorrar dinero en munición aprendiendo a fabricarla tú "
"mismo. Ahora que las fábricas están cerradas, tus habilidades acaban de "
"pasar de ser útiles a salvavidas."

