msgid "Target Shooting"
msgstr "Tirador Al Blanco"

#. ~ Description of profession "Target Shooting" for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You liked going to the local gun range and shooting at some targets or "
"blasting cans off of fence posts.  Maybe if you just imagine targets on "
"those undead, this could help."
msgstr ""
"Te gustaba ir al campo de tiro local y disparar a algunas dianas o hacer "
"saltar latas de los postes de la valla. Tal vez si imaginas objetivos en "
"esos muertos vivientes, esto podría ayudar."

