msgid "Moshing"
msgstr "Bailador Agresivo"

#. ~ Description of profession "Moshing" for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You went to loud concerts and spent your time in the mosh pits.  Now that "
"everything's gone to hell, the whole world is your mosh pit."
msgstr ""
"Ibas a conciertos ruidosos y pasabas tu tiempo en los fosos de baile "
"agresivo. Ahora que el mundo se ha ido al infierno, el mundo entero es tu "
"foso agresivo."

