msgid ""
"Destination for armor.  Does include filthy armor if such zone is not "
"specified."
msgstr ""
"Lugar para armaduras. Incluye armadura sucia si no tiene una zona "
"específica."

#. ~ Name of loot zone
#: data/json/loot_zones.json
msgid "Loot: Filthy Armor"
msgstr "Cosas: Armaduras Sucias"

#. ~ Description of loot zone "Loot: Filthy Armor"
#: data/json/loot_zones.json
msgid "Destination for filthy armor."
msgstr "Lugar para armaduras sucias."

#. ~ Name of loot zone
#: data/json/loot_zones.json
msgid "Loot: Wood"
msgstr "Cosas: Madera"

#. ~ Description of loot zone "Loot: Wood"
#: data/json/loot_zones.json
msgid "Destination for firewood and items that can be used as such."
msgstr "Lugar para leña y objetos que pueden usarse como tal."

#. ~ Name of loot zone
#: data/json/loot_zones.json
msgid "Loot: Custom"
msgstr "Cosas: Personalizado"

#. ~ Description of loot zone "Loot: Custom"
#: data/json/loot_zones.json
msgid "Destination for loot with a custom filter that you can modify."
msgstr "Lugar para cosas dependiendo cómo hayas modificado el filtro."

#. ~ Name of loot zone
#: data/json/loot_zones.json
msgid "Loot: Ignore"
msgstr "Cosas: Ignorar"

#. ~ Description of loot zone "Loot: Ignore"
#: data/json/loot_zones.json
msgid "Items inside of this zone are ignored by \"sort out loot\" zone-action."
msgstr ""
"Los objetos dentro de esta zona son ignorados por la acción \"ordenar "
"cosas\"."

#. ~ Name of loot zone
#: data/json/loot_zones.json
msgid "Loot: Ignore Favorites"
msgstr "Cosas: Ignorar Favoritos"

#. ~ Description of loot zone "Loot: Ignore Favorites"
#: data/json/loot_zones.json
msgid ""
"Favorite items inside of this zone are ignored by \"sort out loot\" zone-"
"action."
msgstr ""
"Los artículos favoritos dentro de esta zona son ignorados por la acción de "
"la zona \"clasificar el botín\"."

#. ~ Name of loot zone
#: data/json/loot_zones.json
msgid "Loot: Item Group"
msgstr "Cosas: Grupo de Objetos"

#. ~ Description of loot zone "Loot: Item Group"
#: data/json/loot_zones.json
msgid "Destination for items from an item group."
msgstr "Lugar de destino de los artículos de un grupo."

#. ~ Name of loot zone
#: data/json/loot_zones.json
msgid "No Auto Pickup"
msgstr "Sin Autorecogida"

#. ~ Description of loot zone "No Auto Pickup"
#: data/json/loot_zones.json
msgid "You won't auto-pickup items inside the zone."
msgstr "No autorecogerás objetos dentro de la zona."

#. ~ Name of loot zone
#: data/json/loot_zones.json
msgid "No NPC Pickup"
msgstr "PNJ No Recogida"

#. ~ Description of loot zone "No NPC Pickup"
#: data/json/loot_zones.json
msgid "Friendly NPCs don't pickup items inside the zone."
msgstr "Los NPC amigos no cogerán objetos dentro de la zona."

#. ~ Name of loot zone
#: data/json/loot_zones.json
msgid "NPC Retreat"
msgstr "PNJ Retirada"

#. ~ Description of loot zone "NPC Retreat"
#: data/json/loot_zones.json
msgid ""
"When fleeing, friendly NPCs will attempt to retreat toward this zone if it "
"is within 60 tiles."
msgstr ""
"Al huir, los PNJ amigos intentarán retirarse hacia esta zona si está dentro "
"de 60 espacios."

#. ~ Name of loot zone
#: data/json/loot_zones.json
msgid "NPC Ignore Sounds"
msgstr "PNJ Ignorar Sonidos"

#. ~ Description of loot zone "NPC Ignore Sounds"
#: data/json/loot_zones.json
msgid "Friendly NPCs won't investigate unseen sounds coming from this zone."
msgstr ""
"Los PNJ amigos no investigarán sonidos no visibles que provengan de esta "
"zona."

#. ~ Name of loot zone
#: data/json/loot_zones.json
msgid "NPC Investigation Area"
msgstr "PNJ Área de Investigación"

#. ~ Description of loot zone "NPC Investigation Area"
#: data/json/loot_zones.json
msgid ""
"Friendly NPCs will investigate unseen sounds only if they come from inside "
"this area."
msgstr ""
"Los PNJ amigos investigarán los sonidos invisibles solo si provienen del "
"interior de esta área."

#. ~ Name of martial art
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "No style"
msgstr "Sin estilo"

#. ~ Description of martial art "No style"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Not a martial art, this is just plain old punching and kicking."
msgstr "No es un arte marcial, es el viejo y conocido pegar piñas y patadas."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "No style"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "You decide to not use any martial arts."
msgstr "Decides no usar ningun arte marcial."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "No style"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s enters a generic combat stance."
msgstr "%s se pone en una postura de combate genérica."

#. ~ Name of martial art
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Force unarmed"
msgstr "Forzar ir desarmado"

#. ~ Description of martial art "Force unarmed"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Not a martial art, setting this style will prevent weapon attacks and force "
"punches (with free hand) or kicks."
msgstr ""
"No es un arte marcial, establecer este estilo evitará ataques de armas y "
"golpes de fuerza (con mano libre) o patadas."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Force unarmed"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "You force yourself to fight unarmed."
msgstr "Te obligas a luchar desarmado."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Force unarmed"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s decides to fight unarmed."
msgstr "%s decide luchar desarmado."

#. ~ Name of martial art
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Aikido"
msgstr "Aikido"

#. ~ Description of martial art "Aikido"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Aikido is a Japanese martial art focused on self-defense, while minimizing "
"injury to the attacker.  It uses defensive throws and disarms but its "
"techniques lack offensive power."
msgstr ""
"El aikido es un arte marcial japonés centrado en la defensa personal, "
"minimizando las lesiones del atacante. Utiliza lanzamientos y desarmes "
"defensivos, pero sus técnicas carecen de poder ofensivo."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Aikido"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "You enter the hanmi stance."
msgstr "Adoptas la postura hanmi."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Aikido"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s changes into a relaxed combat posture."
msgstr "%s cambia a una posición de combate relajado."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Aikido"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Aikido Stance"
msgstr "Postura de Aikido"

#. ~ Description of buff "Aikido" in martial art "Aikido Stance"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"By disregarding offensive in favor of self-defense, you are better at protecting.\n"
"\n"
"Blocked damage reduced by 100% of Dexterity, +2 blocking effectiveness, +1.0 Dodging skill."
msgstr ""
"Al despreciar la ofensiva en favor de la autodefensa, eres mejor en la protección.\n"
"\n"
"El daño bloqueado se reduce en un 100% de la Destreza, +2 Eficacia de Bloqueo.\n"
"+1.0 habilidad de Esquivar."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Aikido"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Intermediate Aikido"
msgstr "Aikido intermedio"

#. ~ Description of buff "Aikido" in martial art "Intermediate Aikido"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"An intermediate Aikido practitioner can protect themselves against multiple opponents.\n"
"\n"
"Blocked damage reduced by 100% of Dexterity, +1 blocking effectiveness, +1 block attempt, +1 dodge attempt."
msgstr ""
"Un practicante de Aikido intermedio puede protegerse contra múltiples oponentes.\n"
"\n"
"El daño por Bloqueo se reduce en un 100% de la Destreza, +1 eficacia de bloqueo.\n"
"+1 intentos de bloqueo, +1 intentos de esquiva."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Aikido"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Advanced Aikido"
msgstr "Aikido avanzado"

#. ~ Description of buff "Aikido" in martial art "Advanced Aikido"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"An advanced Aikido practitioner can protect themselves against even more opponents than normal.\n"
"\n"
"+1 blocking effectiveness, +1 block attempt, +1 dodge attempt."
msgstr ""
"Un practicante avanzado de Aikido puede protegerse contra varios oponentes a la vez, más que lo normal.\n"
"\n"
"+1 efectividad de bloqueo.\n"
"+1 intentos de bloqueo, +1 intentos de esquiva."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Aikido"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Fluid Dodging"
msgstr "Esquiva Fluida"

#. ~ Description of buff "Aikido" in martial art "Fluid Dodging"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"After a smooth dodge, you prepare to counter your foe.\n"
"\n"
"-10% move cost.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""
"Después de esquivar sin esfuerzo, te preparas para contrarrestar a tu enemigo.\n"
"\n"
"-10% de coste de movimiento.\n"
"Dura 1 turno."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Aikido"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Fluid Blocking"
msgstr "Bloqueo Fluido"

#. ~ Description of buff "Aikido" in martial art "Fluid Blocking"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"After a smooth block, you prepare to counter your foe.\n"
"\n"
"-10% move cost.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""
"Después de un bloque sin esfuerzo, te preparas para contrarrestar a tu enemigo.\n"
"\n"
"-10% de coste de movimiento.\n"
"Dura 1 turno."

#. ~ Name of martial art
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Bōjutsu"
msgstr "Bōjutsu"

#. ~ Description of martial art "Bōjutsu"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Bōjutsu, \"The Way of the Staff\", is the Japanese martial art of fighting "
"with a staff.  Bōjutsu focuses on maintaining a good stance to effectively "
"block and counterattack."
msgstr ""
"Bōjutsu, \"El Camino de la Vara\", es el arte marcial japonés de la lucha "
"con varas. El Bōjutsu se focaliza en mantener una buena postura para "
"bloquear y contratacar de manera efectiva."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Bōjutsu"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "You position yourself into an agile stance."
msgstr "Adoptas una postura ágil."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Bōjutsu"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s enters an agile stance."
msgstr "%s adopta una postura ágil."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Bōjutsu"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Bōjutsu Stance"
msgstr "Postura Bōjutsu"

#. ~ Description of buff "Bōjutsu" in martial art "Bōjutsu Stance"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A agile stance that allows your blocks to reduce incoming damage.\n"
"\n"
"Blocked damage reduced by 100% of Dexterity."
msgstr ""
"Una postura ágil que te permite bloquear para reducir el daño recibido.\n"
"\n"
"Daño bloqueado reducido en un 100% de Destreza."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Bōjutsu"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Skilled Striking"
msgstr "Golpeador Habilidoso"

#. ~ Description of buff "Bōjutsu" in martial art "Skilled Striking"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"As you get more skilled you're able to begin targeting striking points that allow more for damage.\n"
"\n"
"Melee skill increases bash damage cap."
msgstr ""
"Cuanto más hábil te vuelves, eres capaz de empezar a golpear los puntos débiles del contrincante para causar más daño.\n"
"\n"
"La habilidad c.a.c. incrementa el máximo posible de daño contundente."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Bōjutsu"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Rolling Staff"
msgstr "Vara Giratoria"

#. ~ Description of buff "Bōjutsu" in martial art "Rolling Staff"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"As you move you begin to rapidly and fluidly roll your staff between your hands.\n"
"\n"
"+10% bash damage.\n"
"Enables \"Rolling Strike\" technique.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""
"Mientras te mueves, comienzas a girar tu vara rápidamente y de manera fluida entre tus manos.\n"
"\n"
"+10% al daño Contundente.\n"
"Habilita la técnica \"Golpe Giratorio\".\n"
"Dura 1 turno."

#. ~ Name of martial art
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Barbaran Montante"
msgstr "Barbaran Montante"

#. ~ Description of martial art "Barbaran Montante"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"The Barbaran Montante originated in 16th century Spain and focuses on "
"overcoming thick armor with heavy weaponry and sweeping blows, transferring "
"kinetic energy through armor and into vulnerable organs and bones."
msgstr ""
"El Barbaran Montante se originó en la España del siglo XVI y se centra en "
"superar las gruesas armaduras con armamento pesado y golpes de barrido, "
"transfiriendo la energía cinética a través de la armadura y hacia los "
"órganos y huesos vulnerables."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Barbaran Montante"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"You heft your weapon, stretch your shoulders, and slide into the Represa."
msgstr ""
"Levantas tu arma, estiras los hombros y te deslizas dentro de la Represa."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Barbaran Montante"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s rolls their shoulders and prepares to duel."
msgstr "%s rueda los hombros y se prepara para el duelo."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Barbaran Montante"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Barbaran Represa"
msgstr "Represa Barbaran"

#. ~ Description of buff "Barbaran Montante" in martial art "Barbaran Represa"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Sliding footwork enhances the crushing continuity of your attacks.\n"
"\n"
"Armor penetration increased by 75% of Strength."
msgstr ""
"El juego de pies deslizante mejora la continuidad aplastante de tus ataques.\n"
"\n"
"Penetración de armadura aumentada en un 75% de la Fuerza."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Barbaran Montante"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Ricasso Step"
msgstr "Paso Ricasso"

#. ~ Description of buff "Barbaran Montante" in martial art "Ricasso Step"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You switch or sturdy your grip mid-step to aid your blocking.\n"
"\n"
"Blocked damage reduced by 40% of Strength.\n"
"Lasts 3 turns.  Stacks 3 times."
msgstr ""
"Cambias o endureces tu agarre a mitad de paso para ayudar a tu bloqueo.\n"
"\n"
"El daño bloqueado se reduce en un 40% de la fuerza.\n"
"Dura 3 turnos. Se acumula hasta 3 veces."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Barbaran Montante"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Vulgar Preparation"
msgstr "Preparación Vulgar"

#. ~ Description of buff "Barbaran Montante" in martial art "Vulgar
#. Preparation"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You prepare for the final crushing strike.\n"
"\n"
"Accuracy increased by 15% of Strength, armor penetration increased by 225% of Strength.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""
"Te preparas para el golpe final.\n"
"\n"
"La precisión aumenta un 15% de la Fuerza, la penetración de la armadura aumenta un 225% de la Fuerza.\n"
"Dura 1 turno."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Barbaran Montante"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Reversing Destreza"
msgstr "Invertir Destreza"

#. ~ Description of buff "Barbaran Montante" in martial art "Reversing
#. Destreza"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Blocking a key strike will turn the battle around.\n"
"\n"
"-5% move cost.\n"
"Lasts 3 turns.  Stacks 2 times."
msgstr ""
"Bloquear un golpe clave cambiará la batalla.\n"
"\n"
"-5% al coste de movimiento\n"
"Dura 3 turnos. Se acumula hasta 2 veces."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Barbaran Montante"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Movimiento Natural"
msgstr "Movimiento Natural"

#. ~ Description of buff "Barbaran Montante" in martial art "Movimiento
#. Natural"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Formal victory is attained, and your mind is cleared to focus on your next moves.\n"
"\n"
"+1 block attempt.\n"
"Lasts 5 turns."
msgstr ""
"Se alcanza la victoria formal, y tu mente se despeja para concentrarse en tus próximos movimientos.\n"
"\n"
"+1 a los intentos de bloqueo.\n"
"Dura 5 turnos."

#. ~ Name of martial art
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Boxing"
msgstr "Boxeo"

#. ~ Description of martial art "Boxing"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Sport of the true gentleman, modern boxing has evolved from the prizefights "
"of the Victorian era.  Strength reduces blocked damage and moving increase "
"Dodging skill."
msgstr ""
"Deporte del verdadero caballero, el boxeo moderno ha evolucionado a partir "
"de los combates profesionales de la época victoriana. La fuerza reduce el "
"daño bloqueado y el movimiento aumenta la habilidad de Esquivar."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Boxing"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "You lower your chin and raise your fists to eye level."
msgstr "Bajas la barbilla y sube los puños a la altura de los ojos."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Boxing"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s prepares to fight with raised fists."
msgstr "%sse prepara para pelear con los puños en alto."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Boxing"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Boxing Stance"
msgstr "Postura de boxeo"

#. ~ Description of buff "Boxing" in martial art "Boxing Stance"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A solid stance allows you block more damage than normal and deliver better punches.\n"
"\n"
"+1 accuracy, blocked damage reduced by 50% of Strength."
msgstr ""
"Una postura sólida te permite bloquear más daño de lo normal y dar mejores puños.\n"
"\n"
"+1 precisión, daño de bloqueado reducido en un 50% de Fuerza."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Boxing"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Footwork"
msgstr "Juego de pies"

#. ~ Description of buff "Boxing" in martial art "Footwork"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"You make yourself harder to hit by bobbing and weaving as you move.\n"
"\n"
"+1.0 Dodging skill.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn.  Stacks 2 times."
msgstr ""
"Te harás más difícil de golpear balanceándote y evadiendo mientras te mueves.\n"
"\n"
"+1.0 de habilidad de Esquivar.\n"
"Dura 1 turno. Se acumula hasta 2 veces."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Boxing"
#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Pankration"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Counter Chance"
msgstr "Contra Ataque"

#. ~ Description of buff "Boxing" in martial art "Counter Chance"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You've seen your chance.  Now strike back!\n"
"\n"
"+25% damage.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""
"Has visto tu oportunidad. ¡Ahora contraataca!\n"
"\n"
"+25% daño.\n"
"Dura un turno."

#. ~ Name of martial art
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Brawling"
msgstr "Peleador"

#. ~ Description of martial art "Brawling"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"You're used to hand-to-creature fighting.  You know how to fight when "
"unarmed or with any weapon to a certain extent.  It's not stylish or "
"sporting, but it gets the job done."
msgstr ""
"Estás acostumbrado a la lucha cuerpo a cuerpo. Sabes cómo luchar cuando "
"estás desarmado o con cualquier arma hasta cierto punto. No es elegante ni "
"deportivo, pero hace el trabajo."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Brawling"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "You grit your teeth and prepare for a good fight."
msgstr "Aprietas los dientes y te preparas para una buena lucha."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Brawling"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s gets ready to brawl."
msgstr " %sse prepara para el combate."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Brawling"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Enhanced Blocking"
msgstr "Bloqueo Mejorado"

#. ~ Description of buff "Brawling" in martial art "Enhanced Blocking"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Combat experience has led to you being able to block multiple attacks at a time.\n"
"\n"
"+1 block attempt."
msgstr ""
"La experiencia en el combate te ha llevado a ser capaz de bloquear varios ataques a la vez.\n"
"\n"
"+1 intento de bloqueo."

#. ~ Name of martial art
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Capoeira"
msgstr "Capoeira"

#. ~ Description of martial art "Capoeira"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"A dance-like style with its roots in Brazilian slavery, Capoeira is focused "
"on fluid movement and sweeping kicks.  Moving briefly enables stronger "
"techniques.  Missing an attack grants bonus damage for a short time."
msgstr ""
"Un estilo de baile con sus raíces en la esclavitud brasileña, la Capoeira se"
" centra en el movimiento fluido y las patadas de barrido. Los movimientos "
"breves permiten técnicas más fuertes. Perder un ataque otorga una "
"bonificación de daño por un corto tiempo."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Capoeira"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "You begin performing the ginga."
msgstr "Comienzas a realizar la ginga."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Capoeira"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s begins to rhythmically rock back and forth."
msgstr " %scomienza a mecerse rítmicamente de un lado a otro."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Capoeira"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Capoeira Stance"
msgstr "Postura de Capoeira"

#. ~ Description of buff "Capoeira" in martial art "Capoeira Stance"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"You never stop moving while performing the ginga.  This makes you very mobile while fighting.\n"
"\n"
"+1.0 Dodging skill, +1 dodge attempt."
msgstr ""
"Nunca dejas de moverte mientras haces el ginga. Esto te hace muy móvil mientras luchas.\n"
"\n"
"+1.0 habilidad de Esquivar, +1 intentos de esquivar."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Capoeira"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Capoeira Momentum"
msgstr "Momentum Capoeira"

#. ~ Description of buff "Capoeira" in martial art "Capoeira Momentum"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"You can feel the rhythm as you move.  Not only are you harder to hit, but your kicks are even more amazing!\n"
"\n"
"+1.0 Dodging skill.\n"
"Enables \"Spin Kick\" and \"Sweep Kick\" techniques.\n"
"Lasts 3 turns."
msgstr ""
"Puedes sentir el ritmo mientras te mueves. No sólo eres más difícil de golpear, sino que tus patadas son aún más sorprendentes.\n"
"\n"
"Habilidad de Esquivar +1.0.\n"
"Habilita las técnicas de \"Patada Giratoria\" y \"Patada Barrido\".\n"
"Dura 3 turnos."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Capoeira"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Capoeira Tempo"
msgstr "Capoeira Tempo"

#. ~ Description of buff "Capoeira" in martial art "Capoeira Tempo"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Hit or miss, its just part of the dance!  And the best part is about to start!\n"
"\n"
"+5% damage.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn.  Stacks 3 times."
msgstr ""
"Golpear o fallar, ¡es solo parte de la danza! ¡Y la mejor parte está por empezar!\n"
"\n"
"+15% de daño.\n"
"Dura 2 turnos. Se acumula hasta 3 veces."

#. ~ Name of martial art
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Crane Kung Fu"
msgstr "Kung Fu de la Grulla"

#. ~ Description of martial art "Crane Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"One of the five Shaolin animal styles.  The Crane uses intricate hand "
"techniques and jumping dodges.  Dexterity determines your damage, rather "
"than Strength; you have a higher chance to dodge and dodging unlocks strong "
"techniques for a limited time."
msgstr ""
"Uno de los cinco estilos animales de Shaolin. La Grulla utiliza intrincadas "
"técnicas de mano y esquivas con salto. La destreza determina su daño, en "
"lugar de la fuerza; tienes una mayor probabilidad de esquivar y hacerlo "
"desbloquea técnicas poderosas durante un tiempo limitado."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Crane Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "You raise your leg slightly and balance like a crane."
msgstr "Levanta la pierna ligeramente y se equilibra como una grúa."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Crane Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s assumes a crane-like stance."
msgstr "%s adopta la postura de la grulla."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Crane Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Crane's Precision"
msgstr "Precisión de Grulla"

#. ~ Description of buff "Crane Kung Fu" in martial art "Crane's Precision"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Your attacks strike at your opponents weakness with speed and precision instead of brute force.\n"
"\n"
"Bash damage increased by 75% of Dexterity but decreased by 75% of Strength."
msgstr ""
"Tus ataques atacan los puntos débiles de tus oponentes con velocidad y precisión en lugar de fuerza bruta.\n"
"\n"
"El daño contundente  aumenta en un 75% de la Destreza pero disminuye en un 75% de la Fuerza."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Crane Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Crane's Stance"
msgstr "Postura de Grulla"

#. ~ Description of buff "Crane Kung Fu" in martial art "Crane's Stance"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Like the beautiful crane, you are very skilled at evading danger.\n"
"\n"
"+2.0 Dodging skill."
msgstr ""
"Al igual que la bella grulla, eres muy hábil para esquivar el peligro.\n"
"\n"
"+2,0 habilidad de Esquivar."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Crane Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Crane's Grace"
msgstr "Gracia de la Grulla"

#. ~ Description of buff "Crane Kung Fu" in martial art "Crane's Grace"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Masters of the Crane style can evade multiple foes with ease.\n"
"\n"
"+2 dodge attempts."
msgstr ""
"Los maestros del estilo Grulla pueden esquivar a varios enemigos con facilidad.\n"
"\n"
"+2 intentos de esquivar"

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Crane Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Crane's Flight"
msgstr "Vuelo de Crane"

#. ~ Description of buff "Crane Kung Fu" in martial art "Crane's Flight"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Much like the crane, you a quick to avoid danger and strike back.\n"
"\n"
"+1 accuracy, +1.0 Dodging skill.\n"
"Enables \"Crane Kick\" and \"Crane Strike\" techniques.\n"
"Lasts 3 turns."
msgstr ""
"Al igual que la grúlla, eres rápido en evitar el peligro y contraatacar.\n"
"\n"
"+1 Precisión, +1.0 habilidad de Esquivar.\n"
"Activa las técnicas \"Patada de Grúlla\" y \"Golpe de Grúlla\".\n"
"Dura 3 turnos."

#. ~ Name of martial art
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Dragon Kung Fu"
msgstr "Kung Fu del Dragón"

#. ~ Description of martial art "Dragon Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"One of the five Shaolin animal styles.  The Dragon uses fluid movements and "
"hard strikes.  Intelligence improves your accuracy and damage instead of "
"Dexterity and Strength.  Dodging and blocking increases your damage.  "
"Pausing increases your defenses.  You can perform a powerful strike against "
"a downed opponent."
msgstr ""
"Uno de los cinco estilos animales Shaolin. El Dragón utiliza movimientos "
"fluidos y golpes fuertes. La Inteligencia mejora tu precisión y el daño en "
"lugar de la Destreza y la Fuerza. Esquivar y bloquear incrementa tu daño. "
"Las pausas incrementan tu defensa. Puede realizar poderosos golpes contra "
"oponentes en el suelo."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Dragon Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "You relax and patiently await conflict like the great dragon."
msgstr "Te relajas y esperas pacientemente el conflicto como el gran dragón."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Dragon Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s assumes a dragon-like stance."
msgstr "%s adopta la postura del dragón."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Dragon Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Dragon's Knowledge"
msgstr "Conocimiento de Dragon"

#. ~ Description of buff "Dragon Kung Fu" in martial art "Dragon's Knowledge"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You plan your attack far in advance relying on your intuition instead of your speed to strike true.\n"
"\n"
"Accuracy increased by 25% of Intelligence but decreased by 25% of Dexterity, bash damage increased by 75% of Intelligence but decreased by 75% of Strength."
msgstr ""
"Planificas tu ataque con mucha antelación confiando en tu intuición en lugar de en tu velocidad para golpear de forma certera.\n"
"\n"
"La precisión aumenta en un 25% de Inteligencia pero disminuye en un 25% de Destreza, el daño de los golpes aumenta en un 75% de Inteligencia pero disminuye en un 75% de Fuerza."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Dragon Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Dragon Wing"
msgstr "Ala de Dragón"

#. ~ Description of buff "Dragon Kung Fu" in martial art "Dragon Wing"
#. ~ Description of buff "Dragon Kung Fu" in martial art "Dragon's Vortex"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Life and combat are a circle.  An attack leads to a counter and to an attack once again.  Seek to complete this loop.\n"
"\n"
"+10% damage.\n"
"Lasts 3 turns."
msgstr ""
"La vida y el combate son un círculo. Un ataque lleva a una contraataque y este a un ataque de nuevo. Buscas completar este bucle.\n"
"\n"
"+10% Daño.\n"
"Dura 3 turnos."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Dragon Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Dragon Power"
msgstr "Poder de Dragón"

#. ~ Description of buff "Dragon Kung Fu" in martial art "Dragon Power"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You take a moment to reflect on battles past and to come.  This insight will protect from future harm.\n"
"\n"
"+2 blocking effectiveness, blocked damage reduced by 100% of Intelligence, +1.0 Dodging skill.\n"
"Lasts 2 turns."
msgstr ""
"Te tomas un momento para reflexionar sobre las batallas pasadas y futuras. Esta visión te protegerá de futuros daños.\n"
"\n"
"+2 Efectividad de bloqueo, el daño bloqueado se reduce en un +100% de Inteligencia, +1.0 habilidad de Esquivar.\n"
"Dura 2 turnos."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Dragon Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Dragon's Vortex"
msgstr "Vórtice de Dragón"

#. ~ Name of martial art
#: data/json/martialarts.json data/mods/Aftershock/martialarts.json
msgid "Eskrima"
msgstr "Eskrima"

#. ~ Description of martial art "Eskrima"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Eskrima, also known as Kali, is a Filipino martial art.  It emphasizes rapid"
" strikes with knife and baton weapons, along with a variety of improvised "
"substitutes."
msgstr ""
"El Eskrima, también conocido como Kali, es un arte marcial filipino. Destaca"
" por sus golpes rápidos con armas de cuchillo y bastón, junto con una "
"variedad de sustitutos improvisados."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Eskrima"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "You enter an open guard stance and prepare to strike."
msgstr "Entras en una posición de guardia abierta y te preparas para golpear."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Eskrima"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s enters an open stance."
msgstr "%s entra en una postura abierta."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Eskrima"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Eskrima Stance"
msgstr "Postura de Eskrima"

#. ~ Description of buff "Eskrima" in martial art "Eskrima Stance"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"You are skilled at getting the most out of your weapons.  The term 'weapon' might be very subjective.\n"
"\n"
"+2 accuracy."
msgstr ""
"Eres hábil para sacar el máximo provecho de tus armas. El término \"arma\" puede ser muy subjetivo,\n"
"\n"
"+2 precisión "

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Eskrima"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Eskrima Combination"
msgstr "Combinación de Eskrima"

#. ~ Description of buff "Eskrima" in martial art "Eskrima Combination"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can follow up a critical hit with a stronger attack if the opportunity presents itself.\n"
"\n"
"+15% damage.\n"
"Enables \"Combination Strike\" technique.\n"
"Lasts 3 turns.  Stacks 3 times."
msgstr ""
"Puedes seguir un golpe crítico con un ataque más fuerte si se presenta la oportunidad.\n"
"\n"
"+15% de daño.\n"
"Activa la técnica \"Golpe Combinado\".\n"
"Dura 3 turnos. Se acumula hasta 3 veces."

#. ~ Name of martial art
#: data/json/martialarts.json data/mods/Aftershock/martialarts.json
msgid "Fencing"
msgstr "Esgrima"

#. ~ Description of martial art "Fencing"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"The noble art of fencing is taught with flexible competition blades, but the"
" techniques are derived from (and applicable to) more functional examples.  "
"Skilled fencers can take advantage of blocks and feints to deliver accurate "
"strikes."
msgstr ""
"El noble arte de la esgrima se enseña con hojas de competición flexibles, "
"pero las técnicas se derivan de (y son aplicables a) ejemplos más "
"funcionales. Los esgrimistas hábiles pueden aprovechar los bloqueos y fintas"
" para dar golpes precisos."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Fencing"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "You move into the en-garde stance."
msgstr "Te posicionas en la postura en-garde."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Fencing"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s moves into a fencing stance."
msgstr "%s se pone en una postura de esgrima."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Fencing"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Fencing Stance"
msgstr "Postura de Esgrima"

#. ~ Description of buff "Fencing" in martial art "Fencing Stance"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Your side stance minimizes the chances you will be harmed in a combat.\n"
"\n"
"Blocked damage reduced by 50% of Dexterity."
msgstr ""
"Tu postura lateral minimiza las posibilidades de que sea dañado en un combate.\n"
"\n"
"El daño bloqueado se reduce en un 50% de Destreza."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Fencing"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Counter Time"
msgstr "Tiempo de Contra"

#. ~ Description of buff "Fencing" in martial art "Counter Time"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"You fake an attack and prepare yourself to unleash a Compound Attack.\n"
"\n"
"+2 blocking effectiveness.\n"
"Enables \"Compound Attack\" technique.\n"
"Lasts 2 turns."
msgstr ""
"Simulas un ataque y te preparas para desatar un Ataque Compuesto.\n"
"\n"
"+2 efectividad de bloqueo.\n"
"Activa la técnica \"Ataque Compuesto\".\n"
"Dura 2 turnos."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Fencing"
#. ~ Martial technique name
#: data/json/martialarts.json data/json/techniques.json
msgid "Parry"
msgstr "Parada"

#. ~ Description of buff "Fencing" in martial art "Parry"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Your next strike will find its mark much easier from your parry.\n"
"\n"
"+1 accuracy.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""
"Tu siguiente golpe encontrará su objetivo mucho más fácilmente desde tu parada.\n"
"\n"
"+1 precisión.\n"
"Dura 1 turno."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Fencing"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Remise"
msgstr "Restaurar"

#. ~ Description of buff "Fencing" in martial art "Remise"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Your feint is the perfect setup for a devastating followup attack!\n"
"\n"
"+1 accuracy.\n"
"Enables \"Compound Attack\" technique.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""
"Tu finta es la preparación perfecta para un ataque consecutivo devastador.\n"
"\n"
"+1 precisión.\n"
"Activas la técnica \"Ataque Compuesto\".\n"
"Dura 1 turno."

#. ~ Name of martial art
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Fior Di Battaglia"
msgstr "Fior Di Battaglia"

#. ~ Description of martial art "Fior Di Battaglia"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Medieval Europe's martial techniques for fighting with polearms.  The "
"\"Flower of Battle\" places great focus on countering one's opponent and "
"knocking them down before landing a killing blow."
msgstr ""
"Las técnicas marciales de la Europa medieval para luchar con armas de asta. "
"La \"Flor de la Batalla\" se centra en contrarrestar al oponente y "
"derribarlo antes de dar un golpe mortal."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Fior Di Battaglia"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "You hold your weapon in a firm grip, ready to block any attack."
msgstr ""
"Sostienes tu arma con un agarre firme, preparado para bloquear cualquier "
"ataque."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Fior Di Battaglia"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s grips their weapon tightly."
msgstr "%s agarra su arma con fuerza."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Fior Di Battaglia"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Stand Your Ground"
msgstr "Mantente firme"

#. ~ Description of buff "Fior Di Battaglia" in martial art "Stand Your
#. Ground"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You are stalwart and will not budge against any threat.\n"
"\n"
"+2 blocking effectiveness, +1 block attempt, -1.0 Dodging skill, blocked damage reduced by 50% of Strength."
msgstr ""
"Eres fuerte y no te rendirás ante ninguna amenaza.\n"
"\n"
"+2 efectividad de bloqueo, +1 intentos de bloqueo, -1.0 a Esquivar, daño bloqueado reducido en 50% de tu Fuerza."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Fior Di Battaglia"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Tactical Retreat"
msgstr "Retirada Táctica"

#. ~ Description of buff "Fior Di Battaglia" in martial art "Tactical Retreat"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You moved and nullified the effects of Stand Your Ground!\n"
"\n"
"-2 blocking effectiveness, -1 block attempt, +1.0 Dodging skill, blocked damage increased by 50% of Strength.\n"
"Prevents \"High Round Strike\" technique.\n"
"Lasts 2 turns."
msgstr ""
"¡Te mueves y anulas los efectos de Mantente Firme!\n"
"\n"
"-2 efectividad de bloqueo, -1 intentos de bloqueo, +1.0 a Esquivar, daño bloqueado reducido en 50% de tu Fuerza.\n"
"Evita las técnicas \"Golpe Alto Rodante y Gancho\".\n"
"Dura 2 turnos."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Fior Di Battaglia"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Defense Break"
msgstr "Ruptura de Defensa"

#. ~ Description of buff "Fior Di Battaglia" in martial art "Defense Break"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Each successful block reveals an opening in your opponent's guard.\n"
"\n"
"+1 accuracy.\n"
"Enables \"Displace and Hook\" technique.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn.  Stacks 3 times."
msgstr ""
"Cada bloqueo exitoso revela una oportunidad en la guardia de tu oponente.\n"
"\n"
"+1 precisión.\n"
"Activa la técnica \"Desviar y Enganchar\".\n"
"Dura 1 turno. Se acumula hasta 3 veces."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Fior Di Battaglia"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Tactical Feinting"
msgstr "Fintas Tácticas"

#. ~ Description of buff "Fior Di Battaglia" in martial art "Tactical
#. Feinting"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"They fell for your feint!\n"
"\n"
"Enables \"Hook and Drag\" technique.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""
"¡Cayeron en tu finta!\n"
"\n"
"Activa la técnica de \"Enganche y Arrastre\".\n"
"Dura 1 turno."

#. ~ Name of martial art
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Judo"
msgstr "Judo"

#. ~ Description of martial art "Judo"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Judo is a martial art that focuses on grabs and throws, both defensive and "
"offensive.  You are resistant to most effects that can knock you down and "
"can counter grab and takedown attacks with strong judo throw."
msgstr ""
"El judo es un arte marcial que se centra en los agarres y los lanzamientos, "
"tanto defensivos como ofensivos. Eres resistente a la mayoría de los efectos"
" que pueden derribarte y puedes contrarrestar los ataques de agarre y "
"derribo con fuertes lanzamientos de judo."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Judo"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "You prepare yourself for a grapple."
msgstr "Te preparas para un forcejeo."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Judo"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s prepares for a grapple."
msgstr "%s se prepara para un forcejeo."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Judo"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Judo Stance"
msgstr "Postura de Judo"

#. ~ Description of buff "Judo" in martial art "Judo Stance"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Your knowledge of grappling allows you to recover from knock down effects "
"instantly.  In addition, you can counter grabs and takedown attacks with a "
"judo throw."
msgstr ""
"Tu conocimiento de la lucha te permite recuperarte de los efectos del derribo al instante.\n"
"Además, puedes contrarrestar los ataques de agarre y derribo con un lanzamiento de judo."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Judo"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Perfect Position"
msgstr "Posición Perfecta"

#. ~ Description of buff "Judo" in martial art "Perfect Position"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You've moved into a perfect position to counter attack!\n"
"\n"
"+30% damage.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""
"¡Te has movido a una posición perfecta para contratacar!\n"
"\n"
"+30% Daño.\n"
"Dura 1 turno."

#. ~ Name of martial art
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Karate"
msgstr "Karate"

#. ~ Description of martial art "Karate"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Karate is a popular martial art, originating from Japan.  It focuses on "
"rapid, precise attacks, blocks, and fluid movement.  A successful hit allows"
" you an extra dodge and an extra block on the following round."
msgstr ""
"El karate es un arte marcial popular, originario de Japón. Se focaliza en "
"los ataques rápidos y precisos, bloqueos y movimientos fluidos. Un golpe "
"exitoso te permite esquivar un golpe más y un bloqueo extra para el "
"siguiente turno."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Karate"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "You adopt a classic karate stance."
msgstr "Adoptas una postura clásica de karate."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Karate"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s adopts a classic karate stance."
msgstr "%s adopta una postura clásica de karate."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Karate"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Karate Kata"
msgstr "Kata de Karate"

#. ~ Description of buff "Karate" in martial art "Karate Kata"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Landing a hit allows you to perfectly position yourself for maximum defense against multiple opponents.\n"
"\n"
"+1 block attempt, +1 dodge attempt, blocked damage reduced by 50% of Strength, -10% move cost.\n"
"Lasts 2 turns."
msgstr ""
"Dar un golpe te permite posicionarte perfectamente para defenderte al máximo de varios oponentes.\n"
"\n"
"+2 intentos de bloqueo, +1 intentos de esquivar, el daño bloqueado se reduce en un 50% de la Fuerza. -10% coste de movimiento\n"
"Dura 2 turnos."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Karate"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Karate Stance"
msgstr "Postura de Karate"

#. ~ Description of buff "Karate" in martial art "Karate Stance"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Your no nonsense stance allows you hit more accurately.\n"
"\n"
"+2 accuracy."
msgstr ""
"Tu postura sin tonterías te permite golpear con más precisión.\n"
"\n"
"+2 precisión "

#. ~ Name of martial art
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Kickboxing"
msgstr "Kickboxing"

#. ~ Description of martial art "Kickboxing"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"A martial art that combines western boxing with elements of Karate, "
"Taekwondo, Muay Thai and Savate, particularly in the use of kicks."
msgstr ""
"Arte marcial que combina el boxeo occidental con elementos de Kárate, "
"Taekwondo, Muay Thai y Savate, especialmente en el uso de las patadas."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Kickboxing"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "You assume a kickboxing stance and focus power into your limbs."
msgstr ""
"Asumes una postura de kickboxing y concentras la fuerza en tus extremidades."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Kickboxing"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s assumes a kickboxing stance."
msgstr "%s asume una postura de kickboxing."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Kickboxing"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Kick stance"
msgstr "Postura de patada"

#. ~ Description of buff "Kickboxing" in martial art "Kick stance"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You have adopted a stance which allows for greater mobility and stability.  Your hands are in a guard position with elbows forward to protect yourself.\n"
"\n"
"Blocked damage reduced by 25% of Strength.\n"
"+1.0 Dodging skill"
msgstr ""
"Adoptaste una postura que te permite una mayor movilidad y estabilidad. Tus manos están en posición de guardia con los codos hacia delante para protegerte.\n"
"\n"
"Daño bloqueado reducido en un 25% de la Fuerza.\n"
"+1.0 Habilidad de esquivar"

#. ~ Name of martial art
#: data/json/martialarts.json data/mods/Aftershock/martialarts.json
msgid "Krav Maga"
msgstr "Krav Maga"

#. ~ Description of martial art "Krav Maga"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Originating in Israel, Krav Maga is based on taking down an enemy quickly "
"and effectively.  It focuses on applicable attacks rather than showy or "
"complex moves.  Popular among police and armed forces everywhere."
msgstr ""
"Originario de Israel, el Krav Maga está basado en derribar al enemigo rápida"
" y eficazmente. Se focaliza en ataques aplicables más que en movimientos "
"complejos o llamativos. Es popular entre la policía y las fuerzas armadas en"
" todo el mundo."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Krav Maga"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "You assume a practical combat stance."
msgstr "Adopta una postura de combate práctico."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Krav Maga"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s assumes a practical combat stance."
msgstr "%s adopta una postura de combate práctico."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Krav Maga"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Krav Maga Stance"
msgstr "Postura de Krav Maga"

#. ~ Description of buff "Krav Maga" in martial art "Krav Maga Stance"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Your training makes it easier to land hits and fight multiple opponents.\n"
"\n"
"+1 accuracy, +1 block attempt."
msgstr ""
"Tu entrenamiento facilita los golpes de tierra y la lucha contra múltiples oponentes.\n"
"\n"
"+1 precisión, +1 intentos de bloqueo"

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Krav Maga"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Strike Vitals"
msgstr "Golpear Vitales"

#. ~ Description of buff "Krav Maga" in martial art "Strike Vitals"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Like a foe, your opponent has left themselves wide.\n"
"\n"
"+5% critical hit chance.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""
"Como un tonto, tu oponente ha quedado expuesto.\n"
"\n"
"+5% a la posibilidad de golpe crítico.\n"
"Dura 1 turno."

#. ~ Name of martial art
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Leopard Kung Fu"
msgstr "Kung Fu del Leopardo"

#. ~ Description of martial art "Leopard Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"One of the five Shaolin animal styles.  The Leopard focuses on rapid, "
"strategically planned strikes.  Dexterity determines your damage, rather "
"than Strength and also increases your critical hit chance."
msgstr ""
"Uno de los cinco estilos animales de Shaolin. El Leopardo se centra en "
"golpes rápidos y estratégicamente planificados. La destreza determina su "
"daño, en lugar de la fuerza, y también aumenta tu probabilidad de golpe "
"crítico."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Leopard Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "You prepare to pounce like a leopard."
msgstr "Te preparas para abalanzarte como un leopardo."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Leopard Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s assumes a leopard-like stance."
msgstr "%s adopta una postura de leopardo."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Leopard Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Leopard's Strategy"
msgstr "La Estrategia del Leopardo"

#. ~ Description of buff "Leopard Kung Fu" in martial art "Leopard's Strategy"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You fight by overwhelming your opponents with speedy strikes that are much harder to defend against.\n"
"\n"
"Bash damage increased by 75% of Dexterity but decreased by 75% of Strength."
msgstr ""
"Luchás abrumando a tus oponentes con golpes rápidos que son mucho más difíciles de defender.\n"
"\n"
"El daño de contundente  aumenta en un 75% de Destreza pero disminuye en un 75% de Fuerza."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Leopard Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Leopard's Ambush"
msgstr "Emboscada de Leopardo"

#. ~ Description of buff "Leopard Kung Fu" in martial art "Leopard's Ambush"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Go for the throat and take out your foes immediately!\n"
"\n"
"Critical hit chance increased by 100% of Dexterity."
msgstr ""
"¡Lánzate a por la garganta y elimina a tu enemigo inmediatamente!\n"
"\n"
"Probabilidad golpe crítico aumenta en un 100% de la Destreza."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Leopard Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Leopard's Agility"
msgstr "Agilidad del Leopardo"

#. ~ Description of buff "Leopard Kung Fu" in martial art "Leopard's Agility"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Just like a cat, you are quick, agile, and hard to pin down.\n"
"\n"
"+1.0 Dodging skill.\n"
"Lasts 2 turns."
msgstr ""
"Al igual que un gato, eres rápido, ágil, y difícil de precisar.\n"
"\n"
"Habilidad de Esquivar +1.0.\n"
"Dura 2 turnos."

#. ~ Name of martial art
#: data/json/martialarts.json data/mods/Aftershock/martialarts.json
msgid "Medieval Swordsmanship"
msgstr "Manejo de Espada Medieval"

#. ~ Description of martial art "Medieval Swordsmanship"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"The art of the longsword and sword & buckler, preceding the later "
"development of fencing.  Designed for combat both unarmored and in armor, it"
" includes grappling as well as defensive and offensive sword techniques.  "
"This treatise compares the Italian and German traditions of medieval combat "
"with detailed step-by-step pictures."
msgstr ""
"El arte de la espada larga y la espada y escudo, precediendo el posterior "
"desarrollo de la esgrima. Diseñado para el combate tanto sin armadura como "
"con armadura, incluye técnicas de agarre y de espada defensiva y ofensiva. "
"Este tratado compara las tradiciones italianas y alemanas de combate "
"medieval con imágenes detalladas paso a paso."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Medieval Swordsmanship"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "You take on a knightly stance."
msgstr "Adoptas una postura de caballero."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Medieval Swordsmanship"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s takes on a knightly stance."
msgstr "%s adoptas una postura de caballero."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Medieval Swordsmanship"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Conserve Momentum"
msgstr "Conservar Impulso"

#. ~ Description of buff "Medieval Swordsmanship" in martial art "Conserve
#. Momentum"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You maintain the momentum from your last strike to move more quickly.\n"
"\n"
"-20% move cost.\n"
"Lasts 2 turns."
msgstr ""
"Mantienes el impulso de tu último golpe para moverte más rápido.\n"
"\n"
"-20% coste de movimiento.\n"
"Dura 2 turnos."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Medieval Swordsmanship"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Swordsman's Stance"
msgstr "Postura del Espadachín"

#. ~ Description of buff "Medieval Swordsmanship" in martial art "Swordsman's
#. Stance"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Through chivalry and vigilance, your defense with a blade has increased.\n"
"\n"
"+1 block attempt, blocked damage reduced by 50% of Strength."
msgstr ""
"Gracias a la caballería y la guardia, tu defensa con la espada aumenta.\n"
"\n"
"+1 intentos de bloqueo, daño bloqueado reducido en 50% de tu Fuerza."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Medieval Swordsmanship"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Half Swording"
msgstr "Media Espada"

#. ~ Description of buff "Medieval Swordsmanship" in martial art "Half
#. Swording"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You grip the blade part way down for greater control.\n"
"\n"
"Blocked damage reduced by 50% of Strength, -1 accuracy.\n"
"Enables \"Grab\" and \"Lethal Strike\" techniques.\n"
"Lasts 2 turns."
msgstr ""
"Agarras la espada más abajo para tener un mejor control.\n"
"\n"
"El daño bloqueado es reducido en un 50% de la Fuerza, -1 en precisión.\n"
"Habilita las técnicas \"Agarre\" y \"Golpe Letal\".\n"
"Dura 2 turnos."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Medieval Swordsmanship"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Mastercut"
msgstr "Corte Maestro"

#. ~ Description of buff "Medieval Swordsmanship" in martial art "Mastercut"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You parry and return the attack with greater vigor!\n"
"\n"
"+10% damage, -10% move cost.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""
"¡Esquivas y devuelves el ataque con gran fuerza!\n"
"\n"
"+10% al daño, -10 al costo de movimiento\n"
"Dura 1 turno."

#. ~ Name of martial art
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Muay Thai"
msgstr "Muay Thai"

#. ~ Description of martial art "Muay Thai"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Also referred to as the \"Art of 8 Limbs,\" Muay Thai is a popular fighting "
"technique from Thailand that uses powerful strikes.  Your Strength decreases"
" blocked damage.  Blocking attacks or getting hit will increase your damage "
"and blocked damage further."
msgstr ""
"También conocido como el \"Arte de las 8 extremidades\", el Muay Thai es una"
" popular técnica de lucha de Tailandia que utiliza poderosos golpes. Tu "
"fuerza disminuye el daño bloqueado. Bloquear los ataques o recibir un golpe "
"incrementará su daño y bloqueará el daño aún más."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Muay Thai"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "You perform a short wai khru in honor of your teachers."
msgstr "Realizas un corto wai khru en honor a tus maestros."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Muay Thai"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s performs a short war-dance."
msgstr "%s realiza una breve danza de guerra."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Muay Thai"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Muay Thai Stance"
msgstr "Postura de  Muay Thai"

#. ~ Description of buff "Muay Thai" in martial art "Muay Thai Stance"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Strength is everything in Muay Thai and you know how to make the most of yours.\n"
"\n"
"Blocked damage reduced by 50% of Strength."
msgstr ""
"La fuerza es todo en el Muay Thai y sabés cómo sacar lo mejor de la tuya.\n"
"\n"
"Daño bloqueado reducido en un 50% de tu Fuerza."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Muay Thai"
#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Shii-Cho"
#: data/json/martialarts.json data/mods/MMA/martialarts.json
msgid "Determination"
msgstr "Determinación"

#. ~ Description of buff "Muay Thai" in martial art "Determination"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Taking a hit will not slow you down.  You will outlast your opponent and win this fight.\n"
"\n"
"Bash damage increased by 25% of Strength, blocked damage reduced by 50% of Strength.\n"
"Lasts 5 turns."
msgstr ""
"Recibir un golpe no te retrasará. Sobrevivirás a tu oponente y ganarás este combate.\n"
"\n"
"El daño contundente aumenta un 25% de la Fuerza, el daño bloqueado disminuye un 50% de la Fuerza.\n"
"Dura 5 turnos."

#. ~ Name of martial art
#: data/json/martialarts.json data/mods/Aftershock/martialarts.json
msgid "Ninjutsu"
msgstr "Ninjutsu"

#. ~ Description of martial art "Ninjutsu"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Ninjutsu is a martial art and set of tactics used by ninja in feudal Japan."
"  It focuses on rapid, precise, silent strikes.  Ninjutsu is almost entirely"
" silent and you have a higher chance to critically hit on your first attack."
"  It also provides small combat bonuses every time you move."
msgstr ""
"El ninjutsu es un arte marcial y un conjunto de tácticas utilizadas por los "
"ninjas en el Japón feudal. Se centra en golpes rápidos, precisos y "
"silenciosos. El ninjutsu es casi totalmente silencioso y tiene una mayor "
"probabilidad de golpear críticamente en su primer ataque. También "
"proporciona pequeñas bonificaciones de combate cada vez que te mueves."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Ninjutsu"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "You perform a kuji-in mantra with your hands.  Rin, Kai, Jin!"
msgstr "Realizas un mantra kuji-in con tus manos. ¡Rin, Kai, Jin!"

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Ninjutsu"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s performs a series of intricate hand signs."
msgstr "%s emite una serie de intrincados signos con las manos."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Ninjutsu"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Ninjutsu Stance"
msgstr "Postura de Ninjutsu"

#. ~ Description of buff "Ninjutsu" in martial art "Ninjutsu Stance"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Your training allows you to make no noise when attacking and less noise when moving around.\n"
"\n"
"Melee and unarmed attacks generate 0 noise, moving generates 1/2 as much noise."
msgstr ""
"Tu entrenamiento te permite no hacer ruido al atacar y menos ruido al moverte.\n"
"\n"
"Los ataques c.a.c y sin armas no generan ruido. Moverse genera la mitad de ruido."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Ninjutsu"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Sneak Attack"
msgstr "Ataque Furtivo"

#. ~ Description of buff "Ninjutsu" in martial art "Sneak Attack"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To a true shinobi, the first strike and the last strike are one in the same.\n"
"\n"
"+25% critical hit chance."
msgstr ""
"Para un verdadero shinobi, el primer golpe y el último golpe son uno mismo.\n"
"\n"
"+25% de probabilidad de golpe crítico."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Ninjutsu"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Momentum Shift"
msgstr "Cambio de Momentum"

#. ~ Description of buff "Ninjutsu" in martial art "Momentum Shift"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Ninjas are training to be extremely agile and mobile.\n"
"\n"
"+1.0 Dodging skill, accuracy increased by 20% of Dexterity.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""
"Los ninjas se entrenan para ser extremadamente ágiles y móviles.\n"
"\n"
"+1,0 de habilidad en Esquivar, precisión aumentada en un 20% de Destreza.\n"
"Dura 1 turno."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Ninjutsu"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Loss of Surprise"
msgstr "Perdida de Sorpresa"

#. ~ Description of buff "Ninjutsu" in martial art "Loss of Surprise"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"You intentions are known!  It will take you a few moments to sneak attack again.\n"
"\n"
"Disables \"Sneak Attack\" buff and \"Assassinate\" and \"Ninjutsu Takedown\" techniques.  Enables \"Swift Strike (crit)\" technique.\n"
"Lasts 3 turns, persists after switching styles."
msgstr ""
"¡Tus intenciones son conocidas! Tardarás unos instantes en volver a atacar sigilosamente.\n"
"\n"
"Desactiva el potenciador \"Ataque furtivo\" y las técnicas \"Asesinar\" y \"Derribo Ninjutsu\". Activa la técnica \"Golpe Rápido (crit)\".\n"
"Dura 3 turnos, y persiste después de cambiar de estilo."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Ninjutsu"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Escape Plan"
msgstr "Plan de Escape"

#. ~ Description of buff "Ninjutsu" in martial art "Escape Plan"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Your target has perished.  It is time to leave and plan your next attack.\n"
"\n"
"+2 dodge attempts, +10 movement speed.\n"
"Lasts 3 turns, persists after switching styles."
msgstr ""
"Tu objetivo ha caído. Es hora de marcharse y planear tu próximo ataque.\n"
"\n"
"+2 intentos de esquivar, +10 velocidad de movimiento.\n"
"Dura 3 turnos y persiste después de cambiar de estilo."

#. ~ Name of martial art
#: data/json/martialarts.json data/mods/Aftershock/martialarts.json
msgid "Niten Ichi-Ryu"
msgstr "Niten Ichi-Ryu"

#. ~ Description of martial art "Niten Ichi-Ryu"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Niten Ichi-Ryu is an ancient school of combat, transmitting a style of "
"classical Japanese swordsmanship conceived by the warrior Miyamoto Musashi."
"  Perception increases damage and reduces blocked damage.  Moving and "
"attacking reduces dodging and damage until you pause.  Pausing for a moment "
"increases Dodging skill."
msgstr ""
"Niten Ichi-Ryu es una antigua escuela de combate, que transmite un estilo de"
" esgrima clásica japonesa concebida por el guerrero Miyamoto Musashi. La "
"percepción aumenta el daño y reduce el daño bloqueado. Moverse y atacar "
"reduce la esquiva y el daño hasta que se hace una pausa. Pausar por un "
"momento aumenta la habilidad de Esquivar."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Niten Ichi-Ryu"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "You clear your mind as you prepare yourself for combat."
msgstr "Despejas tu mente mientras te preparas para el combate."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Niten Ichi-Ryu"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s relaxes and prepares for combat."
msgstr "%s se relaja y se prepara para el combate."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Niten Ichi-Ryu"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Niten Ichi-Ryu Stance"
msgstr "Postura de Niten Ichi-Ryu"

#. ~ Description of buff "Niten Ichi-Ryu" in martial art "Niten Ichi-Ryu
#. Stance"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Cautious watchful eyes,\n"
"measure and display your skill.\n"
"Practice makes perfect.\n"
"\n"
"Armor penetration increased by 50% of Perception, blocked damage reduced by 100% of Perception."
msgstr ""
"Ojos vigilantes y cautelosos\n"
"miden y muestran tu habilidad.\n"
"La práctica hace la perfección.\n"
"\n"
"La penetración de la armadura de aumenta en un 50% de Percepción y el daño bloqueado se reduce en un 100% de Percepción."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Niten Ichi-Ryu"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Waning Moon"
msgstr "Luna menguante"

#. ~ Description of buff "Niten Ichi-Ryu" in martial art "Waning Moon"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Blackened like darkness,\n"
"nightmares approach from all sides.\n"
"Flee at any cost!\n"
"\n"
"-5.0 Dodging skill.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""
"Ennegrecido como la oscuridad,\n"
"Las pesadillas se acercan por todos lados.\n"
"¡Huye a cualquier precio!\n"
"\n"
"Habilidad de Esquivar -5.0.\n"
"Dura 1 turno."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Niten Ichi-Ryu"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Moonlight"
msgstr "Luz de la Luna"

#. ~ Description of buff "Niten Ichi-Ryu" in martial art "Moonlight"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Luck be the light,\n"
"on a dark and cloudy night,\n"
"as the moon shines down.\n"
"\n"
"Enables \"In-One Timing\" technique.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""
"Que la suerte sea la luz,\n"
"en una noche oscura y nublada,\n"
"mientras la luna brilla.\n"
"\n"
"Activa la técnica \"En un Tiempo\".\n"
"Dura 1 turno."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Niten Ichi-Ryu"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Falling Leaf"
msgstr "Hoja que Cae"

#. ~ Description of buff "Niten Ichi-Ryu" in martial art "Falling Leaf"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A sharp sword cuts true.\n"
"Although, all things fade with time.\n"
"Restraint hones your skills.\n"
"\n"
"-1.0 Dodging skill, -5% damage.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn.  Stacks 5 times."
msgstr ""
"Una espada afilada corta la verdad.\n"
"Aunque, todas las cosas desaparecen con el tiempo.\n"
"La restricción pule tus habilidades.\n"
"\n"
"-1.0 habilidad Esquivar, -5% de daño-\n"
"Dura 1 turno. Se acumula hasta 5 veces."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Niten Ichi-Ryu"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Stillness"
msgstr "Quietud"

#. ~ Description of buff "Niten Ichi-Ryu" in martial art "Stillness"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The eye of the storm,\n"
"a fleeting moment of peace,\n"
"gone without a trace.\n"
"\n"
"+2 accuracy, Dodging skill increased by 50% of Perception.\n"
"Lasts 2 turns."
msgstr ""
"El ojo de la tormenta,\n"
"un fugaz momento de paz,\n"
"ido sin huella.\n"
"\n"
"+2 Precisión, habilidad de Esquivar incrementada un 50% de Percepción.\n"
"Dura 2 turnos."

#. ~ Name of martial art
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Pankration"
msgstr "Pancracio"

#. ~ Description of martial art "Pankration"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"An ancient Greek martial art once used by the Spartans.  It combines boxing "
"and wrestling techniques to create a brutal sport, though modern revival of "
"the art is less of no-holds-barred in nature."
msgstr ""
"Un antiguo arte marcial griego que una vez usaron los espartanos. Combina "
"técnicas de boxeo y lucha para crear un deporte brutal, aunque el "
"renacimiento moderno de este arte que no tiene limite en la naturaleza."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Pankration"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "You crouch slightly and prepare to rush forward."
msgstr "Te agachas ligeramente y te preparas para correr hacia adelante."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Pankration"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s crouches slightly, ready to rush forward."
msgstr "%s se agacha ligeramente, preparado para correr hacia adelante."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Pankration"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Close Combat"
msgstr "Combate Cerrado"

#. ~ Description of buff "Pankration" in martial art "Close Combat"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You got your opponent right where you want them!\n"
"\n"
"+20% damage.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""
"¡Tienes a tu oponente justo donde quieres!\n"
"\n"
"+20% daño.\n"
"Dura 1 turno."

#. ~ Description of buff "Pankration" in martial art "Counter Chance"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The enemy has presented an opening in their defense.\n"
"\n"
"+10% damage.\n"
"Enables \"Close Combat\" buff.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""
"El enemigo ha presentado una apertura en su defensa.\n"
"\n"
"+10% daño. \n"
"Activa la mejora de \"Combate Cerrado\".\n"
"Dura 1 turno."

#. ~ Name of martial art
#: data/json/martialarts.json data/mods/Aftershock/martialarts.json
msgid "Silat"
msgstr "Silat"

#. ~ Description of martial art "Silat"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Pencak Silat, of Indonesian origin, is a fighting style that covers the use "
"of short blades and bludgeons.  Fighters stay low and mobile to avoid "
"attacks, then unleash deadly critical hits."
msgstr ""
"El Pencak Silat, originario de Indonesia, es un estilo de combate que usa "
"armas blancas cortas y mazas. Los luchadores se mantienen agachados y "
"moviéndose para evitar los ataques, y luego sueltan golpes mortales."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Silat"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "You give a salute of respect as you prepare to combat."
msgstr "Das un saludo de respeto mientras te preparas para el combate."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Silat"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s gives a combat salute."
msgstr "%s da un saludo de combate."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Silat"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Silat Stance"
msgstr "Postura de Silat"

#. ~ Description of buff "Silat" in martial art "Silat Stance"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"You try to stay loose as possible when fighting to have more chances to dodge.\n"
"\n"
"+1 dodge attempt."
msgstr ""
"Intenta mantenerte lo más suelto posible cuando luchas para tener más oportunidades de esquivar.\n"
"\n"
"+1 Intentos de Esquivar."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Silat"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Silat Ambush"
msgstr "Emboscada Silat"

#. ~ Description of buff "Silat" in martial art "Silat Ambush"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You stay low as you move, making it harder for enemies to defend against you.\n"
"\n"
"+5% critical hit chance.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""
"Te mantienes agachado mientras te mueves, haciendo difícil que tus enemigos se puedan defender de tí.\n"
"\n"
"+5% a la posibilidad de golpe crítico.\n"
"Dura 1 turno."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Silat"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Silat Appraisal"
msgstr "Evaluación de Silat"

#. ~ Description of buff "Silat" in martial art "Silat Appraisal"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Each time you dodge an attack, you learn a bit more about your opponents' fighting style.  This allows you to make more precise attacks against them.\n"
"\n"
"Accuracy increased by 15% of Dexterity.\n"
"Lasts 2 turns.  Stacks 3 times."
msgstr ""
"Cada vez que evades un ataque, aprendes un poco más sobre el estilo de lucha de tus oponentes. Esto te permite hacer ataques más precisos contra ellos.\n"
"\n"
"Precisión aumentada en 15% de Destreza.\n"
"Dura 2 turnos. Se acumula hasta 3 veces."

#. ~ Name of martial art
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Snake Kung Fu"
msgstr "Kung Fu de la Serpiente"

#. ~ Description of martial art "Snake Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"One of the five Shaolin animal styles.  The Snake focuses on sinuous "
"movement and precision strikes.  Perception determines your accuracy and "
"damage, rather than Dexterity and Strength.  Standing still will increases "
"the accuracy and critical hit chance of your next few attacks."
msgstr ""
"Uno de los cinco estilos animales de Shaolin. La Serpiente se centra en los "
"movimientos sinuosos y los golpes de precisión. La percepción determina tu "
"precisión y daño, en lugar de la Destreza y la Fuerza. Quedarse quieto "
"aumenta la precisión y la probabilidad de golpe crítico de tus siguientes "
"ataques."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Snake Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "You adopt a fluid stance, ready to strike like a snake."
msgstr "Adoptas una postura fluida, listo para atacar como una serpiente."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Snake Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s assumes a snake-like stance."
msgstr "%s adopta una postura de serpiente."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Snake Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Snake Bite"
msgstr "Mordedura Serpiente"

#. ~ Description of buff "Snake Kung Fu" in martial art "Snake Bite"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Each snake bite is more painful than the last.\n"
"\n"
"Armor penetration increased by 25% of Perception.\n"
"Lasts 2 turns.  Stacks 4 times."
msgstr ""
"Cada mordedura de serpiente es más dolorosa que la anterior.\n"
"\n"
"Ganas penetración de incrementa al 25% de la Percepción.\n"
"Dura 2 turnos. Se acumula hasta 4 veces"

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Snake Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Snake's Sight"
msgstr "Vista de Serpiente"

#. ~ Description of buff "Snake Kung Fu" in martial art "Snake's Sight"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You are patient and know where to hit your opponent for the best results.\n"
"\n"
"Accuracy increased by 25% of Perception but decreased by 25% of Dexterity, bash damage increased by 75% of Perception but decreased by 75% of Strength."
msgstr ""
"Eres paciente y sabes dónde golpear a tu oponente para tener mejores resultados.\n"
"\n"
"Precisión incrementada en un 25% de tu Percepción pero disminuida en un 25% de tu Destreza, daño contundente se incrementa en un 75% de tu Percepción pero disminuye en un 75% de tu Fuerza."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Snake Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Snake's Coil"
msgstr "Serpiente Enroscada"

#. ~ Description of buff "Snake Kung Fu" in martial art "Snake's Coil"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Every snake waits for the perfect moment to strike.  Aim as your opponents approve and attack their weakness without mercy!\n"
"\n"
"+1 accuracy, +1 blocking effectiveness, +5% critical hit chance.\n"
"Lasts 4 turns.  Stacks 3 times."
msgstr ""
"Cada serpiente espera el momento perfecto para atacar. Apunta cuando tus oponentes lo aprueben y ataca su debilidad sin piedad.\n"
"\n"
"+1 Precisión, +1 Eficacia de Bloqueo, +5% de probabilidad de golpe crítico.\n"
"Dura 4 turnos. Se acumula 3 veces."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Snake Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Snake Fang"
msgstr "Colmillo de Serpiente"

#. ~ Description of buff "Snake Kung Fu" in martial art "Snake Fang"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You hit a weakpoint!  Your next attack will be extra painful.\n"
"\n"
"Armor penetration increased by 100% of Perception.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""
"¡Golpeaste en un punto débil! Tu próximo ataque causará más dolor.\n"
"\n"
"Penetración de armadura igual al 100% de la Percepción.\n"
"Dura 1 turno."

#. ~ Name of martial art
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Sōjutsu"
msgstr "Sōjutsu"

#. ~ Description of martial art "Sōjutsu"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Sōjutsu, \"The Way of the Spear\", is the Japanese martial art of fighting "
"with a spear.  Sōjutsu focuses on keeping opponents at a distance in order "
"to maintain advantage in combat.  Standing still gives you an extra block "
"attempt but moving will briefly increase your damage."
msgstr ""
"Sōjutsu, \"El camino de la lanza\", es el arte marcial japonés de luchar con"
" una lanza. Sōjutsu se enfoca en mantener a los oponentes a distancia para "
"mantener la ventaja en el combate. Quedarse quieto te da un intento de "
"bloqueo extra, pero moverse aumentará brevemente tu daño."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Sōjutsu"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "You prepare to defend against all that approach you."
msgstr "Te preparas para defenderte de todo lo que se te acerque."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Sōjutsu"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s assumes a wide, defensive stance."
msgstr "%s adopta una postura defensiva amplia."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Sōjutsu"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Sōjutsu Stance"
msgstr "Postura Sōjutsu"

#. ~ Description of buff "Sōjutsu" in martial art "Sōjutsu Stance"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Your training grants better defense while using a polearm.\n"
"\n"
"+1 block attempt, +2 blocking effectiveness."
msgstr ""
"Tu entrenamiento te otorga una mejor defensa cuando usas un arma de asta.\n"
"\n"
"+1 intentos de Bloqueo, +2 a Efectividad de Bloqueo."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Sōjutsu"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Superior Positioning"
msgstr "Posicionamiento Superior"

#. ~ Description of buff "Sōjutsu" in martial art "Superior Positioning"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You have given up your defenses for a moment to increase the damage of your attacks.\n"
"\n"
"+10% damage, -1 block attempt.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""
"Ha renunciado a tus defensas por un momento para aumentar el daño de tus ataques.\n"
"\n"
"+10% de daño, -1  intentos de Bloqueo.\n"
"Dura 1 turno."

#. ~ Name of martial art
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Taekwondo"
msgstr "Taekwondo"

#. ~ Description of martial art "Taekwondo"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Taekwondo is the national sport of Korea, and was used by the South Korean "
"army in the 20th century.  Focused on kicks and so it does not benefit from "
"wielded weapons.  It also includes strength training; your blocks absorb "
"extra damage and your attacks do more damage if you are not holding "
"anything."
msgstr ""
"El taekwondo es el deporte nacional de Corea, y fue utilizado por el "
"ejército de Corea del Sur en el siglo XX. Se centra en las patadas, por lo "
"que no se beneficia de las armas blandas. También incluye entrenamiento de "
"fuerza; tus bloqueos absorben el daño extra y tus ataques hacen más daño si "
"no estás sujetando nada."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Taekwondo"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "You adopt a narrow fighting stance."
msgstr "Adopta una postura de lucha rígida."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Taekwondo"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s adopts a narrow fighting stance."
msgstr "%s adopta una postura rígida de combate."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Taekwondo"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Taekwondo Stance"
msgstr "Postura de Taekwondo"

#. ~ Description of buff "Taekwondo" in martial art "Taekwondo Stance"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Using your legs to attack allows your hands to be free for better defense.\n"
"\n"
"Blocked damage reduced by 50% of Strength."
msgstr ""
"Usando tus piernas para atacar permite que tus manos estén libres para una mejor defensa.\n"
"\n"
"El daño Bloqueado disminuye en un 50% de Fuerza."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Taekwondo"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Unhindered"
msgstr "Sin obstáculos"

#. ~ Description of buff "Taekwondo" in martial art "Unhindered"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Your attacks are stronger if you are not holding anything in your hands.\n"
"\n"
"+33% damage when not using a weapon."
msgstr ""
"Tus ataques son más fuertes si no tienes nada en tus manos.\n"
"\n"
"+33 % daño cuando no se usa un arma."

#. ~ Name of martial art
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Tai Chi"
msgstr "Tai Chi"

#. ~ Description of martial art "Tai Chi"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Though Tai Chi is often seen as a form of mental and physical exercise, it "
"is a legitimate martial art, focused on self-defense.  Its ability to absorb"
" the force of an attack makes your Perception decrease damage further on a "
"block.  Pausing for a moment enables powerful palm strike techniques."
msgstr ""
"Aunque el Tai Chi se considera a menudo una forma de ejercicio mental y "
"físico, es un arte marcial legítimo, centrado en la defensa personal. Su "
"habilidad para absorber la fuerza de un ataque hace que su percepción "
"disminuya el daño más allá de un bloque. Hacer una pausa por un momento "
"permite técnicas poderosas de golpe con la palma de la mano."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Tai Chi"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "You settle into a gentle stance and prepare to defend yourself."
msgstr "Te acomodas en una postura suave y te preparas para defenderte."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Tai Chi"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s settles into a gentle stance."
msgstr "%s se acomoda en una postura suave"

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Tai Chi"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Tai Chi Stance"
msgstr "Postura de Tai Chi"

#. ~ Description of buff "Tai Chi" in martial art "Tai Chi Stance"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You are focused of defense and predicting your opponents attacks.\n"
"\n"
"+1 block attempt, blocked damage reduced by 100% Perception."
msgstr ""
"Estás enfocado en la defensa y en predecir los ataques de tus oponentes.\n"
"\n"
"+1 Intentos de Bloqueo, daño bloqueado reducido en 100% de Percepción."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Tai Chi"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Cross Hands"
msgstr "Manos Cruzadas"

#. ~ Description of buff "Tai Chi" in martial art "Cross Hands"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"By taking a moment to prepare yourself, you are able to use your entire body fully for attacking and defending.\n"
"\n"
"+2 blocking effectiveness, blocked damage reduced by 50% of Perception.\n"
"Enables \"Palm Strike\" and \"Double Palm Strike\" techniques.\n"
"Lasts 3 turns."
msgstr ""
"Al tomarte un tiempo para prepararte, eres capaz de usar tu cuerpo entero para atacar y defender.\n"
"\n"
"+2 a Efectividad de Bloqueo, daño bloqueado reducido en un 50% de tu Percepción.\n"
"Habilita las técnicas \"Golpe de Palma\" and \"Doble Golpe de Palma\".\n"
"Dura 3 turnos."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Tai Chi"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Repulse the Monkey"
msgstr "Repeler al mono"

#. ~ Description of buff "Tai Chi" in martial art "Repulse the Monkey"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"By perfectly positioning yourself and your opponent, you have become more accurate and can bypass your opponent's defenses.\n"
"\n"
"Accuracy increased by 20% of Perception, armor penetration increased by 50% of Perception.\n"
"Lasts 2 turns."
msgstr ""
"Al perfeccionar tu posicionamiento y el de tu oponente, te vuelves más preciso y puedes evadir la defensa de tu oponente.\n"
"\n"
"Precisión incrementada en un 20% de tu Percepción, penetración de armadura incrementada en un 50% de tu Percepción.\n"
"Dura 2 turnos."

#. ~ Name of martial art
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Tiger Kung Fu"
msgstr "Kung Fu del Tigre"

#. ~ Description of martial art "Tiger Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"One of the five Shaolin animal styles.  The Tiger focuses on relentless "
"attacks above all else.  Your Strength determines your accuracy, and your "
"attacks do increasing damage as you continue attacking."
msgstr ""
"Uno de los cinco estilos animales Shaolin. El Tigre se focaliza más que nada"
" en ataques implacables. Tu fuerza determina tu precisión, y tus ataques "
"causan mayor daño mientras sigas atacando."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Tiger Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "You clench your hands into ferocious, tiger-like claws."
msgstr "Aprietas las manos para convertirlas en feroces garras de tigre."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Tiger Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s assumes a tiger-like stance."
msgstr "%s adopta una postura de tigre."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Tiger Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Tiger Fury"
msgstr "Furia del Tigre"

#. ~ Description of buff "Tiger Kung Fu" in martial art "Tiger Fury"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You attack with an endless barrage of strikes.  The more you hit, the stronger you become.\n"
"\n"
"+1 accuracy, +5% damage.\n"
"Lasts 3 turns.  Stacks 3 times."
msgstr ""
"Atacas con un aluvión interminable de golpes. Cuanto más golpeas, más fuerte te vuelves.\n"
"\n"
"+1 Precisión, +5% de daño.\n"
"Dura 3 turnos. Se acumula hasta 4 veces."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Tiger Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Tiger's Strength"
msgstr "Fuerza del Tigre"

#. ~ Description of buff "Tiger Kung Fu" in martial art "Tiger's Strength"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You do not need defense.  You do not need a plan.  You need strength.  Strength will break your opponents' defenses and overwhelm them completely.\n"
"\n"
"Accuracy increased by 25% of Strength but decreased by 25% of Dexterity."
msgstr ""
"No necesitas defensa. No necesitas un plan. Necesitas fuerza. La Fuerza romperá las defensas de tus oponentes y los abrumará completamente.\n"
"\n"
"La Precisión aumenta en 25% de Fuerza pero disminuye en 25% de Destreza."

#. ~ Name of martial art
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Wing Chun"
msgstr "Wing Chun"

#. ~ Description of martial art "Wing Chun"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Wing Chun is a Chinese martial art that began by selecting the easiest-to-"
"learn effective techniques from the various Shaolin animal forms.  It has a "
"high stance, with weight entirely on the rear leg.  Wing Chun focuses on "
"sensitivity to the opponent's direction of force, and flowing around it to "
"get back to hitting."
msgstr ""
"El Wing Chun es un arte marcial chino que comenzó seleccionando las técnicas"
" más efectivas y fáciles de aprender de las diversas formas de animales "
"Shaolin. Tiene una postura alta, con el peso enteramente en la pierna "
"trasera. El Wing Chun se centra en la sensibilidad a la dirección de la "
"fuerza del oponente, y fluye a su alrededor para volver a golpear."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Wing Chun"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "You take your stance and prepare to receive the gift of violence."
msgstr ""
"Adoptas tu postura y te preparas para recibir el regalo de la violencia."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Wing Chun"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s patiently assumes a curiously pigeon-toed stance."
msgstr " %s asume pacientemente una curiosa postura de paloma."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Wing Chun"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Chain Punch"
msgstr "Puño de Cadena"

#. ~ Description of buff "Wing Chun" in martial art "Chain Punch"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Your punches are properly timed to give your opponent no rest from your strikes.\n"
"\n"
"-10% move cost.\n"
"Lasts 2 turns.  Stacks 3 times."
msgstr ""
"Tus puños están bien sincronizados para que tu oponente no descanse de tus golpes.\n"
"\n"
"-10% coste de movimiento\n"
"Dura 2 turno. Se acumula hasta 3 veces."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Wing Chun"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Chi-Sao Sensitivity"
msgstr "Sensibilidad Chi-Sao"

#. ~ Description of buff "Wing Chun" in martial art "Chi-Sao Sensitivity"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You have a greater understanding of balance and technique.  This gives you a better chance to avoid your opponent's attacks.\n"
"\n"
"Dodging skill increased by 25% of Perception, blocked damage reduced by 50% of Perception."
msgstr ""
"Tienes una mayor comprensión del balance y la técnica. Esto te proporciona una mejor oportunidad de esquivar los ataques de tu oponente.\n"
"\n"
"Habilidad de Esquivar incrementada en un 25% de tu Percepción. Daño bloqueado reducido en un 50% de tu Percepción."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Wing Chun"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Biu Ji"
msgstr "Biu Ji"

#. ~ Description of buff "Wing Chun" in martial art "Biu Ji"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Through the perfect application of the Thrusting Fingers form, you can strike your opponents' weak points, force them away, and follow!\n"
"\n"
"Accuracy increased by 20% of Perception\n"
"Enables \"Straight Punch (Knockback)\" and \"L-Hook (Knockback)\" techniques.\n"
"Lasts 3 turns."
msgstr ""
"Mediante la aplicación perfecta de la forma de los Dedos Punzantes, puedes golpear los puntos débiles de tus oponentes, forzarlos a alejarse y ¡seguir!\n"
"\n"
"Precisión aumentada en un 20% de Percepción\n"
"Habilita las técnicas \"Puñetazo directo (Noqueado)\" y \"Gancho Izquierdo (Noqueado)\".\n"
"Dura 3 turnos."

#. ~ Name of martial art
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Zui Quan"
msgstr "Zui Quan"

#. ~ Description of martial art "Zui Quan"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"AKA \"drunken boxing,\" Zui Quan imitates the movement of a drunk to confuse"
" the enemy.  You gain a passive Dodging skill bonus based on Intelligence "
"and dodge attempts.  Dodging increases your damage and accuracy based on "
"Intelligence for a short time.  Moving gives you an additional dodging "
"bonus."
msgstr ""
"También conocido como \"boxeo borracho\", Zui Quan imita el movimiento de un"
" borracho para confundir al enemigo. Obtiene una bonificación de esquiva "
"pasiva basada en la inteligencia y los intentos de esquivar. Esquivar "
"aumenta tu daño y precisión en función de la inteligencia durante un breve "
"periodo de tiempo. Moverse te da una bonificación adicional a esquivar."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Zui Quan"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "You begin to sway to and fro with a confident swagger."
msgstr "Comienzas a balancearte de un lado a otro con un contoneo seguro."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Zui Quan"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s stumbles as if pretending to be drunk."
msgstr "%s tropieza como si fingiera estar borracho."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Zui Quan"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Zui Quan Stance"
msgstr "Postura de Zui Quan"

#. ~ Description of buff "Zui Quan" in martial art "Zui Quan Stance"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Others might think you stumble about at random but you know better.  Each movement is calculated to make evading harm with ease.\n"
"\n"
"+2 dodge attempts, Dodging skill increased by 20% of Intelligence."
msgstr ""
"Otros pueden pensar que te tropiezas al azar pero tú sabes lo que haces. Cada movimiento está calculado para evadir el daño fácilmente.\n"
"\n"
"+2 intentos Esquivar, Habilidad Esquivar incrementada en un 20% de Inteligencia."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Zui Quan"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Drunken Stumble"
msgstr "Tropiezo de Borracho"

#. ~ Description of buff "Zui Quan" in martial art "Drunken Stumble"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"With a few quick steps, you can completely change your orientation and dodge attacks easier.\n"
"\n"
"+1.0 Dodging skill.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn.  Stacks 2 times."
msgstr ""
"Con unos pocos pasos rápidos, puedes cambiar completamente tu orientación y esquivar los ataques más fácilmente.\n"
"\n"
"+1.0 Habilidad de Esquivar. \n"
"Dura 1 turno. Se acumula hasta 2 veces."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Zui Quan"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Drunken Dodging"
msgstr "Esquiva de Borracho"

#. ~ Description of buff "Zui Quan" in martial art "Drunken Dodging"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Each time you dodge, your positional advantage increases against your opponents.  This makes your attacks hit harder with each successful dodge.\n"
"\n"
"+20% damage, accuracy increase by 20% of Intelligence.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn.  Stacks 3 times."
msgstr ""
"Cada vez que esquivas, tu ventaja posicional aumenta frente a tus oponentes. Esto hace que tus ataques golpeen más fuerte con cada esquiva con éxito.\n"
"\n"
"+20% de daño, Precisión aumentada en un 20% de Inteligencia.\n"
"Dura 1 turno. Se acumula hasta 3 veces."

#. ~ Name of martial art
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Debug Mastery"
msgstr "Depurar Maestrías"

#. ~ Description of martial art "Debug Mastery"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "A secret martial art used only by developers and cheaters."
msgstr ""
"Es un arte marcial secreto solamente utilizado por los desarrolladores y los"
" tramposos."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Debug Mastery"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "You get ready pwn some zeds!"
msgstr "¡Prepárate para destrozar a algunos zetas!"

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Debug Mastery"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s prepares to cheat at martial arts!"
msgstr " ¡%sse prepara para hacer trampa en las artes marciales!"

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Debug Mastery"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Elemental Resistance"
msgstr "Resistencia Elemental"

#. ~ Description of buff "Debug Mastery" in martial art "Elemental Resistance"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You are a walking tank!\n"
"\n"
"Bash armor increased by 100% of Strength, cut armor increased by 100% of Dexterity, electric armor increased by 100% of Intelligence, and fire armor increased by 100% of Perception."
msgstr ""
"¡Eres un tanque andante!\n"
"\n"
"La armadura contundente aumenta un 100% de Fuerza, la armadura de corte aumenta un 100% de Destreza, la armadura eléctrica aumenta un 100% de Inteligencia y la armadura de fuego aumenta un 100% de Percepción."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Debug Mastery"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Getting Angry"
msgstr "Enfadarse"

#. ~ Description of buff "Debug Mastery" in martial art "Getting Angry"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"When I get my hands on you…\n"
"\n"
"+2 bash damage.\n"
"Lasts 2 turns.  Stacks 5 times."
msgstr ""
"Cuando te ponga las manos encima... \n"
"\n"
"+2 de daño contundente \n"
"Dura 2 turnos. Se acumula hasta 5 veces."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Debug Mastery"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid "Lightning Strike"
msgstr "Golpe Rayo"

#. ~ Description of buff "Debug Mastery" in martial art "Lightning Strike"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Lightning strikes twice.\n"
"\n"
"Electric damage equal to 100% of Perception.\n"
"Lasts 3 turns.  Stacks 2 times."
msgstr ""
"El rayo golpea dos veces.\n"
"\n"
"Daño eléctrico igual al 100% de tu Percepción.\n"
"Dura 3 turnos. Se acumula 2 veces."

#. ~ Description of buff "Debug Mastery" in martial art "On Fire"
#: data/json/martialarts.json
msgid ""
"YOU ARE ON FIRE!\n"
"\n"
"+5 fire damage.\n"
"Lasts 5 turns."
msgstr ""
"¡ESTAS QUE ARDES! \n"
"\n"
"+5 de daño de fuego.\n"
"Dura 5 turnos."

#. ~ Name of martial art
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid "Bionic Combatives"
msgstr "Combativo Biónico"

#. ~ Description of martial art "Bionic Combatives"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid ""
"A modern combat style for the post-modern human.  Nicknamed \"Biojutsu\", "
"Bionic Combatives combines integrated weaponry, armor and augments into an "
"consolidated fighting discipline."
msgstr ""
"Un estilo de combate moderno para el humano posmoderno. Apodado "
"\"Biojutsu\", el Combativo Biónico combina armamento integrado, armadura y "
"aumentos en una disciplina de combate consolidada."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Bionic Combatives"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid "BEGINNING BIONIC COMBATIVES PROGRAM.  INITIATING COMBAT PROTOCOLS."
msgstr ""
"INICIO DEL PROGRAMA DE COMBATIVIDAD BIÓNICA. INICIACIÓN DE LOS PROTOCOLOS DE"
" COMBATE."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Bionic Combatives"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s starts moving with swift robotic precision."
msgstr "%s comienza a moverse con una rápida precisión robótica."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Bionic Combatives"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid "Biojutsu Stance"
msgstr "Postura de Biojutsu"

#. ~ Description of buff "Bionic Combatives" in martial art "Biojutsu Stance"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid ""
"void player::ApplyBiojutsuStatic() {\n"
"    blocks_left += 2;\n"
"    set_hit_bonus( get_hit_bonus() + 1 );\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"+2 block attempts, +1 accuracy."
msgstr ""
"void player::ApplyBiojutsuStatic() {\n"
"blocks_left += 2;\n"
"set_hit_bonus( get_hit_bonus() + 1 );\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"+2 Intentos de Bloqueo, +1 Precisión."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Bionic Combatives"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid "Binary Hardening"
msgstr "Endurecimiento Binario"

#. ~ Description of buff "Bionic Combatives" in martial art "Binary Hardening"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid ""
"player@CDDA:/root$ sudo apt install improved-armor\n"
"player@CDDA:/root$ sudo apt update\n"
"\n"
"+3 bash, cut, and stab armor.\n"
"Lasts 4 turns.  Stacks 3 times."
msgstr ""
"player@CDDA:/root$ sudo apt install improved-armor\n"
"player@CDDA:/root$ sudo apt update\n"
"\n"
"+3 armadura contra Contundentes, Cortantes y Perforantes.\n"
"Dura 4 turnos. Se acumula hasta 3 veces."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Bionic Combatives"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid "Optimization"
msgstr "Optimización"

#. ~ Description of buff "Bionic Combatives" in martial art "Optimization"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
">10 LOCATE TARGET\n"
">20 EXECUTE TARGET\n"
">30 GOTO 10\n"
"\n"
"+1 accuracy, +15% damage.\n"
"Lasts 3 turns.  Stacks 3 times."
msgstr ""
">10 LOCALIZAR EL OBJETIVO\n"
">20 EJECUTAR OBJETIVO\n"
">30 GOTO 10\n"
"\n"
"+1 Precisión, +15% de daño.\n"
"Dura 3 turnos. Se acumula hasta 3 veces."

#. ~ Name of martial art
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid "Centipede Kung Fu"
msgstr "Kung Fu del Ciempiés"

#. ~ Description of martial art "Centipede Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid ""
"One of the Five Deadly Venoms, used by Zhang Yiaotian.  Centipede Style uses"
" an onslaught of rapid strikes.  Each attack you land increases your attack "
"speed.  Critical hits increase your damage further."
msgstr ""
"Uno de los Cinco Venenos Mortales, usado por Zhang Yiaotian. El estilo de "
"los ciempiés utiliza un ataque de golpes rápidos. Cada ataque que realiza "
"aumenta su velocidad de ataque. Los golpes críticos aumentan tu daño aún "
"más."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Centipede Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid "You ready yourself to attack as fast as possible."
msgstr "Te preparas para atacar lo más rápido posible."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Centipede Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s assumes a centipede-like stance."
msgstr "%s adopta la postura del ciempiés."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Centipede Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid "Centipede's Frenzy"
msgstr "Frenesí del Ciempiés"

#. ~ Description of buff "Centipede Kung Fu" in martial art "Centipede's
#. Frenzy"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid ""
"Your attacks are a blur of hands and legs that become faster as your strike your opponents without rest.\n"
"\n"
"-4 move cost.\n"
"Lasts 3 turns.  Stacks 4 times."
msgstr ""
"Sus ataques son un borrón de manos y piernas que se vuelven más rápidos al golpear a sus oponentes sin descanso.\n"
"\n"
"El coste de un movimiento es - 4.\n"
"Dura 3 turnos. Se acumula hasta 4 veces."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Centipede Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid "Centipede's Venom"
msgstr "Veneno de Ciempiés"

#. ~ Description of buff "Centipede Kung Fu" in martial art "Centipede's
#. Venom"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Your venom burns your opponents at the worst of times.\n"
"\n"
"+15% damage.\n"
"Lasts 2 turns."
msgstr ""
"Tu veneno quema a tus oponentes en el peor momento posible.\n"
"\n"
"+15% de daño.\n"
"Dura 2 turnos."

#. ~ Name of martial art
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid "Lizard Kung Fu"
msgstr "Kung Fu del Lagarto"

#. ~ Description of martial art "Lizard Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid ""
"One of the Five Deadly Venoms, used by Meng Tianxia.  Lizard Style focuses "
"on using walls to your advantage.  Standing near a wall enables stronger "
"buffs and techniques."
msgstr ""
"Uno de los cinco venenos mortales, utilizado por Meng Tianxia. El estilo "
"lagarto se centra en el uso de los muros en beneficio propio. Estar cerca de"
" un muro permite utilizar técnicas y potenciadores más potentes."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Lizard Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid "You ready yourself to attack from any angle."
msgstr "Te preparas para atacar desde cualquier ángulo."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Lizard Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s assumes a lizard-like stance."
msgstr "%s adopta la postura del lagarto."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Lizard Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid "Lizard's Cunning"
msgstr "Astucia de Lagarto"

#. ~ Description of buff "Lizard Kung Fu" in martial art "Lizard's Cunning"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid ""
"Through patience and observation, you know how to turn the tide of battle in your favor.\n"
"\n"
"+2 accuracy, +2 blocking effectiveness."
msgstr ""
"A través de la paciencia y la observación, sabes cómo cambiar la marea de la batalla a tu favor.\n"
"\n"
"+2 Precisión, +2 Eficacia de Bloqueo."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Lizard Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid "Lizard's Haven"
msgstr "Refugio del Lagarto"

#. ~ Description of buff "Lizard Kung Fu" in martial art "Lizard's Haven"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid ""
"Staying near a wall further improves your chances to hit and avoid damage.\n"
"\n"
"+2 accuracy, +2 blocking effectiveness when near a wall."
msgstr ""
"Permanecer cerca de un muro mejora aún más tus posibilidades de golpear y evitar el daño.\n"
"\n"
"+2 de Precisión, +2 de Eficacia de Bloqueo cuando se está cerca de un muro."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Lizard Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid "Lizard's Leap"
msgstr "Salto de Lagarto"

#. ~ Description of buff "Lizard Kung Fu" in martial art "Lizard's Leap"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"By briefly pushing off a nearby wall and leaping, you can make yourself more dangerous and evasive.\n"
"\n"
"+2.0 Dodging skill, +10% critical hit chance.\n"
"Lasts 2 turns."
msgstr ""
"Al empujar brevemente de un muro cercano y saltar, puedes hacerte más peligroso y evasivo.\n"
"\n"
"Habilidad de Esquiva +2,0, probabilidad de golpe crítico +10%.\n"
"Dura 2 turnos."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Lizard Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid "Lizard's Perch"
msgstr "Percha del Lagarto"

#. ~ Description of buff "Lizard Kung Fu" in martial art "Lizard's Perch"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"From your high vantage point, you can strike downward and deal more damage.\n"
"\n"
"+10% damage while near a wall.\n"
"Lasts 3 turns."
msgstr ""
"Desde tu posición elevada, puedes golpear hacia abajo e infligir más daño.\n"
"\n"
"+10% de daño cuando estás cerca de un muro.\n"
"Dura 3 turnos."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Lizard Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid "Lizard's Venom"
msgstr "Veneno de lagarto"

#. ~ Description of buff "Lizard Kung Fu" in martial art "Lizard's Venom"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Your venom is a long lasting pain that your opponents will never forget.\n"
"\n"
"+15% damage.\n"
"Lasts 5 turns."
msgstr ""
"Tu veneno es un dolor duradero que tus oponentes nunca olvidarán.\n"
"\n"
"+15% de daño.\n"
"Dura 5 turnos."

#. ~ Name of martial art
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid "Scorpion Kung Fu"
msgstr "Kung Fu del Escorpión"

#. ~ Description of martial art "Scorpion Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid ""
"One of the Five Deadly Venoms, used by Gao Ji.  Scorpion Style is a "
"mysterious art which uses pincer-like hands and a stinger kick.  Moving "
"enables a stunning pincer attack.  Critical hits do massive damage and knock"
" your opponent back along with anyone your opponent comes in contact with."
msgstr ""
"Uno de los Cinco Venenos Mortales, usado por Gao Ji. El Estilo Escorpión es "
"un arte misterioso que utiliza manos como pinzas y una patada con aguijón. "
"El movimiento permite un ataque de pinza impresionante. Los golpes críticos "
"hacen muchísimo daño y hacen retroceder a tu oponente junto con cualquiera "
"con el que el oponente entre en contacto."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Scorpion Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid "You prepare to capture and sting your foes."
msgstr "Te preparas para capturar y picar a tus enemigos."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Scorpion Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s assumes a scorpion-like stance."
msgstr "%s adopta la postura del escorpión."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Scorpion Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid "Scorpion's Venom"
msgstr "Veneno de Escorpión"

#. ~ Description of buff "Scorpion Kung Fu" in martial art "Scorpion's Venom"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Your venom is a constant threat that nothing can escape from.\n"
"\n"
"+15% damage."
msgstr ""
"Tu veneno es una amenaza constante y nada puede escapar de él.\n"
"\n"
"+15% de daño."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Scorpion Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid "Scorpion's Charge"
msgstr "Carga de Escorpión"

#. ~ Description of buff "Scorpion Kung Fu" in martial art "Scorpion's Charge"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Rush forward and catch your prey!\n"
"\n"
"+10% damage.\n"
"Enables \"Pincer Strike\" technique.\n"
"Lasts 2 turns.  Stacks 2 times."
msgstr ""
"¡Apúrate y atrapa a tu presa!\n"
"\n"
"+10% de daño.\n"
"Permite la técnica del \"Golpe de Pinza\".\n"
"Dura 2 turnos. Se acumula hasta 2 veces."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Scorpion Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid "Scorpion's Intimidation"
msgstr "Intimidación del Escorpión"

#. ~ Description of buff "Scorpion Kung Fu" in martial art "Scorpion's
#. Intimidation"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid ""
"Nothing is scarier than an angry scorpion.  Your attacks can keep others at bay.\n"
"\n"
"+1 dodge attempt.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""
"Nada da más miedo que un escorpión enfadado. Tus ataques pueden mantener a raya a los demás.\n"
"\n"
"+1 a los intentos de Esquivar.\n"
"Dura 1 turno."

#. ~ Name of martial art
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid "Toad Kung Fu"
msgstr "Kung Fu del Sapo"

#. ~ Description of martial art "Toad Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid ""
"One of the Five Deadly Venoms, used by Liang Shen.  Masters of Toad Style "
"can focus their Strength to protect against all attacks.  You have powerful "
"armor against physical attacks, though you will lose focus when you move.  "
"You can meditate by pausing, giving yourself more armor for a short time."
msgstr ""
"Uno de los Cinco Venenos Mortales, usado por Liang Shen. Los Maestros del "
"Estilo del Sapo pueden concentrar su Fuerza para protegerse contra todos los"
" ataques. Tiene una poderosa armadura contra los ataques físicos, aunque "
"perderá la concentración cuando se mueva. Puedes meditar haciendo una pausa,"
" dándote más armadura por un corto tiempo."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Toad Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid "You pause for a moment and focus on your invincible body."
msgstr "Te detienes un momento y te concentras en tu cuerpo invencible."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Toad Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s assumes a toad-like stance."
msgstr "%s adopta una posición de sapo."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Toad Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid "Toad's Iron Skin"
msgstr "Piel de Hierro de Sapo"

#. ~ Description of buff "Toad Kung Fu" in martial art "Toad's Iron Skin"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Your body is as strong as iron, but only if you don't move.\n"
"\n"
"Bash, cut, and stab armor increased by 100% of Strength."
msgstr ""
"Tu cuerpo es tan fuerte como el hierro, pero sólo si no te mueves.\n"
"\n"
"Armadura contra daño contundente, cortante y perforante igual al 100% de Fuerza."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Toad Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid "Iron Skin Dissipation"
msgstr "Disipación de Hierro en la Piel"

#. ~ Description of buff "Toad Kung Fu" in martial art "Iron Skin Dissipation"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Moving causes you to lose your iron skin.\n"
"\n"
"Bash, cut, and stab armor reduced by 20% of Strength.\n"
"Lasts 5 turns.  Stacks 5 times."
msgstr ""
"Moverte causa que pierdas tu piel de hierro.\n"
"\n"
"Armadura contra daño contundente, cortante y perforante reducida en un 20% de tu Fuerza.\n"
"Dura 5 turnos. Se acumula hasta 5 veces."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Toad Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid "Toad's Meditation"
msgstr "Meditación de Sopa"

#. ~ Description of buff "Toad Kung Fu" in martial art "Toad's Meditation"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"By concentrating for a moment, you can bolster the strength of your iron skin.\n"
"\n"
"Bash, cut, and stab armor increased by 50% of Strength.\n"
"Lasts 2 turns."
msgstr ""
"Al concentrarte por un momento, puedes reafirmar la fuerza de tu piel de hierro.\n"
"\n"
"Armadura contra daño contundente, cortante y perforante incrementada en un 50% de tu Fuerza.\n"
"Dura 2 turnos."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Toad Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid "Toad's Venom"
msgstr "Veneno de Sapo"

#. ~ Description of buff "Toad Kung Fu" in martial art "Toad's Venom"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Your venom is a harsh lesson about the strength of your iron body.\n"
"\n"
"+15% damage.\n"
"Lasts 3 turns.  Stacks 3 times."
msgstr ""
"Tu veneno es una dura lección sobre la fuerza de tu cuerpo de hierro.\n"
"\n"
"+15% de daño.\n"
"Dura 3 turnos. Se acumula 3 veces."

#. ~ Name of martial art
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid "Viper Kung Fu"
msgstr "Kung Fu de la Víbora"

#. ~ Description of martial art "Viper Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid ""
"A legacy of the Five Deadly Venoms, use by Qi Dong.  Viper Style (originally"
" called Snake Style) is punishing to stunned opponents.  A stunning a foe "
"with a Viper Bite will allow you to finish them off with the legendary Viper"
" Strike."
msgstr ""
"Un legado de los Cinco Venenos Mortales, utilizado por Qi Dong. El Estilo "
"Víbora (originalmente llamado Estilo Serpiente) castiga a los rivales "
"aturdidos. Al aturdir a un enemigo con un Mordisco de Víbora, podrás acabar "
"con él con el legendario Golpe de Víbora."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Viper Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid "You prepare to strike your foes' weaknesses."
msgstr "Te preparas para atacar los puntos débiles de tus enemigos."

#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Viper Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s assumes a viper-like stance."
msgstr "%s adopta la postura de una víbora."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Viper Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid "Viper's Rattle"
msgstr "Cascabel de Víbora"

#. ~ Description of buff "Viper Kung Fu" in martial art "Viper's Rattle"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid ""
"You are terrifying monster on the battlefield!  Opponents will have a harder time fighting back.\n"
"\n"
"+1 accuracy, +1.0 Dodging skill.\n"
"Lasts 3 turns.  Stacks 2 times."
msgstr ""
"¡Eres un monstruo aterrador en el campo de batalla! Los oponentes tendrán más dificultades para defenderse.\n"
"\n"
"+1 Precisión, +1.0 habilidad de Esquivar.\n"
"Dura 3 turnos. Se acumula hasta 2 veces"

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Viper Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid "Viper's Patience"
msgstr "Paciencia de la Víbora"

#. ~ Description of buff "Viper Kung Fu" in martial art "Viper's Patience"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Every snake waits for the perfect moment to strike.  Turn your opponents' mistakes into your opportunity to strike!\n"
"\n"
"+1 dodge attempt, +1 accuracy, +5% critical hit chance."
msgstr ""
"Cada serpiente espera el momento perfecto para golpear. ¡Convierte los errores de tus oponentes en tu oportunidad para golpear!\n"
"\n"
"+1 en intentos de bloqueo, +1 en precisión, +5% a la probabilidad de golpe crítico."

#. ~ Buff name of martial art "Viper Kung Fu"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
msgid "Viper's Venom"
msgstr "Veneno de Víbora"

#. ~ Description of buff "Viper Kung Fu" in martial art "Viper's Venom"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Your venom is a harsh reminder to never tease a predator.\n"
"\n"
"+15% damage.\n"
"Lasts 4 turns."
msgstr ""
"Tu veneno es un duro recordatorio para no molestar nunca a un depredador.\n"
"\n"
"+15% de daño.\n"
"Dura 4 turnos."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json data/mods/MMA/mutations.json
msgid "Venom Mob Protege"
msgstr "Protegido Mafia Veneno"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Venom Mob Protege"
#: data/json/martialarts_fictional.json data/mods/MMA/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You are a pupil of the Venom Clan.  You start with one of the five deadly "
"venoms: Centipede, Viper, Scorpion, Lizard, or Toad."
msgstr ""
"Eres un pupilo del Clan del Veneno. Empiezas con uno de estos cinco venenos "
"mortales: Ciempiés, Víbora, Escorpión, Lagarto o Sapo."

