#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/obsolete.json
msgid "immature giant cellar spider"
msgid_plural "immature giant cellar spiders"
msgstr[0] "araña de patas largas gigante inmadura"
msgstr[1] "arañas de patas largas gigantes inmaduras"
msgstr[2] "arañas de patas largas gigantes inmaduras"

#. ~ Description of monster "immature giant cellar spider"
#: data/json/obsolete.json
msgid ""
"A newly-hatched mutant cellar spider, about the size of a beer bottle.  Too "
"small to possess much venom, but still quick and agile like an adult."
msgstr ""
"Una araña de bodega mutante recién nacida, del tamaño de una botella de "
"cerveza. Demasiado pequeña para poseer mucho veneno, pero sigue siendo "
"rápida y ágil como un adulto."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/obsolete.json
msgid "Retrieve chunks of gold for Cranberry"
msgstr "Recuperar trozos de oro de Cranberry"

#. ~ Description of mission "Retrieve chunks of gold for Cranberry"
#: data/json/obsolete.json
msgid ""
"Cranberry, a mercenary for Hub 01, has agreed to pay in full for their "
"contract for every 200 units of gold that you can bring them."
msgstr ""
"Cranberry, un mercenario del Hub 01, aceptó pagar la totalidad de su "
"contrato por cada 200 unidades de oro que le lleves."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve chunks of gold for Cranberry"
#: data/json/obsolete.json
msgid ""
"I'm still assigned to finding gold.  If you want to keep bringing it to me, "
"I'm willing to keep paying you.  Eight scrip per lot."
msgstr ""
"Sigo asignado a la búsqueda de oro. Si quieres seguir trayéndolo, estoy "
"dispuesto a seguir pagándote. Ocho pagarés por tanda."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve chunks of gold for Cranberry"
#: data/json/obsolete.json
msgid "Great!  Thanks."
msgstr "¡Genial! Gracias."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve chunks of gold for Cranberry"
#: data/json/obsolete.json
msgid "That's fine.  I really need to get back to being productive anyway."
msgstr "Está bien. Igual, tengo que volver a ser productivo."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve chunks of gold for Cranberry"
#: data/json/obsolete.json
msgid ""
"Banks and security vans are where I've had the most luck.  I'd start there."
msgstr ""
"Los bancos y las furgonetas de seguridad es donde he tenido más suerte. Yo "
"empezaría por ahí."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve chunks of gold for Cranberry"
#: data/json/obsolete.json
msgid "Hi again.  Got some gold for me?"
msgstr "Hola, otra vez. ¿Tienes algo de oro para mi?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve chunks of gold for Cranberry"
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json data/json/obsolete.json
msgid "I appreciate it.  Here's the scrip; don't spend it all in one place."
msgstr ""
"Te lo agradezco. Aquí está el pagaré; no lo gastes todo en un solo lugar."

#. ~ Vitamin name
#: data/json/obsolete.json
msgid "Vitamin A"
msgstr "Vitamina A"

#. ~ Vitamin name
#: data/json/obsolete.json
msgid "Vitamin B12"
msgstr "Vitamina B12"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/obsolete.json
msgid "first aid kit"
msgid_plural "first aid kits"
msgstr[0] "botiquín de primeros auxilios"
msgstr[1] "botiquines de primeros auxilios"
msgstr[2] "botiquines de primeros auxilios"

#. ~ Description of "first aid kit"
#: data/json/obsolete.json
msgid ""
"A typical universal first aid kit, one you'd see in a car or in a household."
"  It contains a variety of common medical items stored in case of accidents "
"and injuries.  Disassemble to get its content."
msgstr ""
"Un típico botiquín universal de primeros auxilios, uno que encontrías en un "
"coche o en una casa. Contiene una variedad de artículos médicos comunes "
"almacenados en caso de accidentes y lesiones. Desmóntalo para obtener su "
"contenido."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/obsolete.json
msgid "RDX charge"
msgid_plural "RDX charges"
msgstr[0] "carga de RDX"
msgstr[1] "cargas de RDX"
msgstr[2] "cargas de RDX"

#. ~ Description of "RDX charge"
#: data/json/obsolete.json
msgid ""
"This is a metal keg, filled with 50 liters worth of RDX and scrap metal.  "
"Contains a core of primary explosive to ensure that the charge detonates "
"completely and delivers its entire destructive power to everything in sight."
msgstr ""
"Este es un barril de metal de cerveza, lleno con 50 litros de RDX y "
"chatarra. Contiene un núcleo de explosivo primario para asegurar que la "
"carga detone completamente y entregue todo su poder destructivo a todo lo "
"que esté a la vista."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/obsolete.json
msgid "ANFO charge"
msgid_plural "ANFO charges"
msgstr[0] "carga de NAFO"
msgstr[1] "cargas de NAFO"
msgstr[2] "cargas de NAFO"

#. ~ Description of "ANFO charge"
#: data/json/obsolete.json
msgid ""
"This is a large metal keg filled with ANFO pellets and equipped with a "
"dynamite primer.  Use this item to light the fuse.  You will then have "
"twenty turns before it explodes and creates a large fireball."
msgstr ""
"Este es un gran barril de metal para cerveza lleno de perdigones de ANFO y "
"equipado con un pistón de dinamita. Usa este artículo para encender la "
"mecha. Tendrás veinte vueltas antes de que explote y cree una gran bola de "
"fuego."

#. ~ Terrain name
#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-medical.json
#: data/json/obsolete.json data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_lab.json
msgid "centrifuge"
msgstr "centrifugadora"

#. ~ Description of terrain "centrifuge"
#: data/json/obsolete.json
msgid ""
"This is a centrifuge, a liquid separating device with an automated analyzer "
"unit.  It could be used to analyze a medical fluid sample, such as blood, if"
" a test tube was placed in it."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una centrifugadora, un dispositivo de separación de líquidos con una"
" unidad analizadora automática. Podría usarse para analizar una muestra de "
"fluido médico, como sangre, si se colocara un tubo de ensayo en ella."

