msgid_plural "advanced UPSes"
msgstr[0] "UPSs mejorados"
msgstr[1] "UPSs mejorados"
msgstr[2] "UPSs mejorados"

#. ~ Description of "advanced UPS"
#: data/json/obsolete.json
msgid ""
"This is an advanced version of the unified power supply, or UPS.  This "
"device has been significantly redesigned to provide better efficiency as "
"well as to consume plutonium fuel batteries rather than regular batteries.  "
"Sadly, its plutonium reactor can't be charged in UPS charging station."
msgstr ""
"Esto es una versión mejorada del sistema de energía unificado, o UPS. Este "
"dispositivo ha sido rediseñado para proveer una mayor eficacia y también "
"para consumir células de plutonio, en lugar de baterías normales. "
"Lamentablemente, su reactor de plutonio no puede ser cargado en una estación"
" de carga UPS."

