#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Video Blogger"
msgstr "Video Blogger"

#. ~ Description of profession "Video Blogger" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You're a video blogger, creating and commenting video content and then "
"posting it on various platforms.  Now most of your fans are dead, alongside "
"your equipment.  Maybe leading a fanbase, moderating myriads of comments and"
" surviving shitstorms has taught you something valuable after all."
msgstr ""
"Eres un videoblogger, que crea y comenta contenidos de vídeo y los publica "
"en varias plataformas. Ahora la mayoría de tus fans están muertos, junto con"
" tu equipo. Quizá liderar una base de fans, moderar miríadas de comentarios "
"y sobrevivir a tormentas de mierda te haya enseñado algo valioso después de "
"todo."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Video Blogger"
msgstr "Video Blogger"

#. ~ Description of profession "Video Blogger" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
