#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "True Foodperson"
msgstr "Comidapersona Verdadero"

#. ~ Description of profession "True Foodperson" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You are the true Foodperson.  Some might think Foodperson is just a mascot, "
"but you know better.  The mask has become your face, you are real, and the "
"only thing standing between this world and oblivion is you."
msgstr ""
"Eres el verdadero Personacomida, algunos podrían pensar que Personacomida es"
" sólo una mascota, pero tú lo sabes mejor. La máscara se ha convertido en tu"
" cara, eres real, y lo único que se interpone entre este mundo y el olvido "
"eres tú."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
