"shot Major General, respected and decorated.  On the downside, years of desk"
" duty have left your shooting skills rusty, and all the medals in the world "
"won't protect you now."
msgstr ""
"Has ascendido de soldada rasa a General de División, siendo respetada y "
"condecorada. En el lado negativo, los años de trabajo de oficina han dejado "
"oxidadas tus habilidades de tiro, y todas las medallas del mundo no te "
"protegerán ahora."

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Marine Infantrymen"
msgstr "Soldado de Infantería Marina"

#. ~ Description of profession "Marine Infantrymen" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Some call you a 'Jarhead', other’s a 'Devil Dog', and still others have "
"dubbed you a 'Leatherneck'.  Before the Cataclysm, you were a soldier of the"
" US Marine Corps, a military professional forming the backbone to any "
"amphibious assault.  Whether it had been paratrooping out of helicopters or "
"storming enemy strongholds, the name of the Marines had become renowned all "
"across the world.  Now that that world has come to an end and military "
"command has collapsed in on itself as far as you can tell, you suppose that "
"its up to you to carry the memory of the Marines forwards into the "
"Cataclysm."
msgstr ""
"Algunos te llaman \"Cabeza Rapada\", otros \"Perro del Diablo\", y otros te "
"han apodado \"Marinero\". Antes del cataclismo, eras un soldado del Cuerpo "
"de Marines de los Estados Unidos, un profesional militar que formaba la "
"columna vertebral de cualquier asalto anfibio. Ya fuera lanzando paracaídas "
"desde helicópteros o asaltando fortalezas enemigas, el nombre de los marines"
" se había hecho famoso en todo el mundo. Ahora que ese mundo ha llegado a su"
" fin y que el mando militar se ha derrumbado sobre sí mismo, supones que te "
"corresponde llevar el recuerdo de los Marines hacia el Cataclismo."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Marine Infantrywoman"
msgstr "Soldado de Infantería Marina"

#. ~ Description of profession "Marine Infantrywoman" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Some call you a 'Jarhead', other’s a 'Devil Dog', and still others have "
"dubbed you a 'Leatherneck'.  Before the Cataclysm, you were a soldier of the"
" US Marine Corps, a military professional forming the backbone to any "
"amphibious assault.  Whether it had been paratrooping out of helicopters or "
