#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Naval Sailor"
msgstr "Marino Naval"

#. ~ Description of profession "Naval Sailor" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You’re a grizzled sailor of the US Navy, having spent the last few years "
"working shipside aboard an aircraft carrier.  Maintaining your vessel had "
"been your primary duty: conducting needed repairs, and generally being one "
"of hundreds of people whose job it was to insure that things were shipshape "
"and running smoothly.  Now that your ship has become a floating graveyard, "
"you’re not too sure that all the monkey wrenches and mugs of coffee in the "
"world can patch up this particular problem."
msgstr ""
"Eres un veterano de la Marina estadounidense que ha pasado los últimos años "
"trabajando a bordo de un portaaviones. El mantenimiento de tu barco era tu "
"principal tarea: realizar las reparaciones necesarias y, en general, ser uno"
" de los cientos de personas cuyo trabajo consistía en asegurarse de que todo"
" estuviera en orden y funcionara bien. Ahora que tu barco está convertido en"
" un cementerio flotante, no estás muy seguro de que todas las llaves "
"inglesas y tazas de café del mundo puedan solucionar este problema concreto."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Naval Sailor"
msgstr "Marinera Naval"

#. ~ Description of profession "Naval Sailor" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You’re a grizzled sailor of the US Navy, having spent the last few years "
"working shipside aboard an aircraft carrier.  Maintaining your vessel had "
"been your primary duty: conducting needed repairs, and generally being one "
"of hundreds of people whose job it was to insure that things were shipshape "
"and running smoothly.  Now that your ship has become a floating graveyard, "
"you’re not too sure that all the monkey wrenches and mugs of coffee in the "
"world can patch up this particular problem."
msgstr ""
"Eres una veterana de la Marina de los Estados Unidos y has pasado los "
"últimos años trabajando a bordo de un portaaviones. El mantenimiento de tu "
"barco era tu principal tarea: realizar las reparaciones necesarias y, en "
"general, ser uno de los cientos de personas cuyo trabajo consistía en "
"asegurarse de que todo estuviera en orden y funcionara bien. Ahora que tu "
"barco está convertido en un cementerio flotante, no estás muy seguro de que "
"todas las llaves inglesas y tazas de café del mundo puedan solucionar este "
"problema concreto."

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Navy Diver"
msgstr "Buzo de Marina"

#. ~ Description of profession "Navy Diver" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Before the Cataclysm, you used to be part of a Naval Special Warfare diving "
"group, a skilled soldier adept at underwater infiltration and marine combat."
"  You were just finishing suiting up for a practice dive before the screams "
"interrupted your preparations.  Now, you’ve got nothing to ward off your "
"former crew-mates except for your wetsuit, equipment, and training."
msgstr ""
"Antes del Cataclismo, formabas parte de un grupo de buceo de la Fuerza Naval"
" Especial, un soldado experto en infiltración submarina y combate marino. "
"Estabas terminando de vestirte para una inmersión de práctica cuando los "
"gritos interrumpieron tus preparativos. Ahora, no tienes nada para "
"protegerte de tus antiguos compañeros de tripulación, excepto tu traje de "
"neopreno, tu equipo y tu entrenamiento."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Navy Diver"
msgstr "Buzo de Marina"

#. ~ Description of profession "Navy Diver" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
