"neopreno, tu equipo y tu entrenamiento."

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Military Veteran"
msgstr "Militar Veterano"

#. ~ Description of profession "Military Veteran" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've served in the armed forces and after being discharged from the army, "
"you're sent to take medical treatment in one of the health care centers.  "
"Just when you thought you've overcome your war-time traumas and readjusted "
"to the normal life, the world has come to and end and your worst nightmare "
"has become a reality: living in an hellish battlefield."
msgstr ""
"Has servido en las fuerzas armadas y después de haber sido dado de baja, "
"fuiste enviado a uno de los centros de salud para recibir tratamiento "
"médico.  Justo cuando parecía que ibas a recuperarte de tus traumas de "
"guerra y ajustarte a la vida normal, el mundo se acabo y tu peor pesadilla "
"se ha convertido en realidad: vivir en un campo de batalla infernal."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Military Veteran"
msgstr "Militar Veterana"

#. ~ Description of profession "Military Veteran" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
