#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Military Recruit"
msgstr "Recluta Militar"

#. ~ Description of profession "Military Recruit" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Joining the military has been your dream for years.  You finally got in, "
"just in time for your training to get interrupted by some sort of national "
"emergency.  As far as you can tell, military command abandoned you in this "
"hellhole when you missed the emergency evac."
msgstr ""
"Entrar en el ejército ha sido tu sueño durante años. Finalmente entrastes, "
"justo a tiempo para que tu entrenamiento se viera interrumpido por una "
"especie de emergencia nacional. Por lo que puedes ver, el mando militar te "
"abandonó en este agujero infernal cuando te perdiste la evacuación de "
"emergencia."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Military Recruit"
msgstr "Recluta Militar"

#. ~ Description of profession "Military Recruit" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
