#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Special Operator"
msgstr "Operador Especial"

#. ~ Description of profession "Special Operator" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were the best of the best, the military's finest.  That's why you're "
"still alive, even after all your comrades fell to the undead.  As far as you"
" can tell, military command abandoned you in this hellhole when you missed "
"the emergency evac."
msgstr ""
"Eras lo mejor de lo mejor, lo más selecto del ejército. Por eso sigues vivo,"
" incluso después de que todos tus compañeros cayeran ante los muertos "
"vivientes. Por lo que sabes, el mando militar te abandonó en este infierno "
"cuando te perdiste la evacuación de emergencia."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Special Operator"
msgstr "Operadora Especial"

#. ~ Description of profession "Special Operator" for female
