#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Captive"
msgstr "Cautivo"

#. ~ Description of profession "Captive" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were following a road at night, trying to get away from the horrors of "
"the city, when you heard a voice calling out in the dark.  You followed, "
"hoping they were friendly, but suddenly felt a searing pain in your head and"
" blacked out.  You just woke up in this strange place… are you even on Earth"
" anymore?"
msgstr ""
"Estabas siguiendo un camino de noche, intentando alejarte de los horrores de"
" la ciudad, cuando oíste una voz que te llamaba en la oscuridad. La "
"seguiste, esperando que fueran amistosas, pero de repente sentiste un dolor "
"punzante en la cabeza y te desmayaste. Acabas de despertar en un lugar "
"extraño... ¿estás en la Tierra todavía?"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Captive"
msgstr "Cautivo"

#. ~ Description of profession "Captive" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
