#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Rescuer"
msgstr "Salvador"

#. ~ Description of profession "Rescuer" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were ready.  You went in determined to find and rescue your friends.  "
"Now the atmosphere in these twisting corridors grows heavy, and you don't "
"feel quite so confident anymore.  You might be the one in need of a rescue "
"soon."
msgstr ""
"Estabas preparado. Entrastes decidido a encontrar y rescatar a tus amigos. "
"Ahora la atmósfera en estos pasillos retorcidos se vuelve pesada, y ya no te"
" sientes tan seguro. Puede que pronto seas tú quien necesite un rescate "
"pronto."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Rescuer"
msgstr "Salvadora"

#. ~ Description of profession "Rescuer" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
