#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Survivalist"
msgstr "Supervivencialista"

#. ~ Description of profession "Survivalist" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Living off the land, far from civilization, is nothing new to you.  The only"
" difference is all the monsters that suddenly want you dead.  Your equipment"
" is basic, but versatile… except that your canteen's run out!"
msgstr ""
"Vivir de la tierra, lejos de la civilización, no es nada nuevo para ti. La "
"única diferencia son los monstruos que de repente te quieren matar. Tu "
"equipo es básico, pero versátil... ¡excepto que tu cantimplora se ha "
"agotado!"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
