"exista?"

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Police Detective"
msgstr "Detective de Policía"

#. ~ Description of profession "Police Detective" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were on the brink of a major breakthrough in your latest homicide case "
"when the Cataclysm struck.  Now your prime suspect is dead.  Everyone's "
"dead.  You could really use a smoke."
msgstr ""
"Estabas a punto de lograr un gran avance en tu último caso de homicidio "
"cuando se produjo el Cataclismo. Ahora tu principal sospechoso está muerto. "
"Todos están muertos. Te vendría bien un cigarro."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Police Detective"
msgstr "Detective de Policía"

#. ~ Description of profession "Police Detective" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
