" the innocent with a single, well-placed bullet.  Now survival itself is on "
"the line, and you can't afford to miss if you don't want to end up as "
"something's dinner."
msgstr ""
"Tu habilidad como francotiradora te ha sido muy útil en el cumplimiento de "
"tu deber, protegiendo a los inocentes con una sola bala bien colocada. "
"Ahora, la supervivencia está en juego, y no puedes darte el lujo de errar si"
" no quieres terminar siendo la cena de alguien."

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Riot Control Officer"
msgstr "Agente Antidisturbios"

#. ~ Description of profession "Riot Control Officer" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The riots were brutal, and that was before the dead rose and started to "
"devour the living.  The line you were holding broke.  It was only through a "
"bit of luck and a lot of head-bashing that you got away in one piece, and "
"the worst is yet to come."
msgstr ""
"Los disturbios fueron brutales, y eso fue antes de que los muertos se "
"levantaran y empezaran a devorar a los vivos. La línea que mantenías se "
"rompió. Sólo con un poco de suerte y un montón de golpes en la cabeza "
"conseguisteis salir de una pieza, y lo peor está por llegar."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Riot Control Officer"
msgstr "Agente Antidisturbios"

#. ~ Description of profession "Riot Control Officer" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
