#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Used Car Salesman"
msgstr "Vendedor de Coches Usados"

#. ~ Description of profession "Used Car Salesman" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"They said you'd sell your own mother for a dollar.  How dare they!  You've "
"been around the block a few times, and you'd charge way more than a dollar -"
" and get it, too!"
msgstr ""
"Dijeron que venderías a tu propia madre por un dólar. ¡Cómo se atreven! Has "
"dado unas cuantas vueltas a la manzana, y cobrarías mucho más que un dólar, "
"¡y además lo conseguirías!"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
