msgid ""
"Ever since you were a child you loved hunting, and one year you got a "
"shotgun for your birthday.  Why, if the world ended, there's nothing you'd "
"want at your side more than your trusty shotgun.  So, when it did, you made "
"sure to bring it along."
msgstr ""
"Desde que eras un crio te encantaba cazar, y un año te regalaron una "
"escopeta por tu cumpleaños. Si el mundo se acabara, nada te gustaría más que"
" tu fiel escopeta. Así que, cuando se acabó, te aseguraste de llevarla "
"contigo."

#. ~ Profession name for female
