#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Fast Food Cook"
msgstr "Cocinero Com. Rápida"

#. ~ Description of profession "Fast Food Cook" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The diners at the fancy burger joint where you worked were even more "
"irritable and unreasonable than usual today.  You showed them the meaning of"
" fast food… by running for your life!"
msgstr ""
"Los comensales de la elegante hamburguesería en la que trabajas parecen hoy "
"aún más irritables y poco razonables que de costumbre. Hora de demostrar el "
"significado de la comida rápida... ¡corriendo por tu vida!"

