msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Things got a little weird on your way to your weekly dance class.  Zombies "
"don't seem to know how to dance, but you're not about to let them step on "
"your toes."
msgstr ""
"Las cosas se han puesto un poco raras de camino a tu clase de baile semanal."
" Parece que los zombis no saben bailar, pero no vas a dejar que te pisen tus"
" dedos."

#. ~ Profession name for female
