#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Clown"
msgstr "Payaso"

#. ~ Description of profession "Clown" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"All you ever wanted was to make people laugh.  Dropping out of school and "
"performing at kids' parties was a dream come true until the world ended.  "
"There are precious few balloon animals in your future now."
msgstr ""
"Lo único que querías era hacer reír a la gente. Dejar la escuela y actuar en"
" fiestas infantiles era tu sueño hecho realidad hasta que el mundo se acabó."
" Hay muy pocos globos de animales en tu futuro actual."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Clown"
msgstr "Payasa"

#. ~ Description of profession "Clown" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
