"loco! ¡Se comieron a tus nietos! ¡Mecachis! Los vas a tener que hacer pagar "
"por lo que hicieron."

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Otaku"
msgstr "Otaku"

#. ~ Description of profession "Otaku" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"After many late nights with friends watching anime and eating snacks, you "
"decided to make the trip to the premier anime convention in the Northeast.  "
"Now zombies are eating everyone, and even worse, the convention is "
"cancelled!  At least you were ready in case your costume tore."
msgstr ""
"Después de muchas noches con amigos viendo anime y comiendo bocadillos, "
"decidiste hacer el viaje a la principal convención de anime del noreste. "
"Ahora los zombis se están comiendo a todo el mundo, y lo que es peor, ¡la "
"convención se ha cancelado! Al menos estabas preparado por si tu disfraz se "
"rompía."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Otaku"
msgstr "Otaku"

#. ~ Description of profession "Otaku" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
