msgstr ""
"Tu banda de ska se disolvió después de que el batería se convirtiera en "
"zombi. Ahora estás sola en el Cataclismo con unos cigarrillos y tu "
"reproductor mp3."

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Mail Carrier"
msgstr "Cartero"

#. ~ Description of profession "Mail Carrier" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Neither snow nor rain nor heat nor gloom of night stays you from the swift "
"completion of your appointed rounds, but nobody said anything about zombies."
msgstr ""
"Ni la nieve, ni la lluvia, ni el calor, ni la oscuridad de la noche, te "
"impiden completar rápidamente tus rondas, pero nadie dijo nada sobre los "
"zombis."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Mail Carrier"
msgstr "Cartera"

#. ~ Description of profession "Mail Carrier" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
