#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Guru"
msgstr "Gurú"

#. ~ Description of profession "Guru" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You spent many years traveling through the world, becoming wise and learned."
"  Normally, you can answer any question, but even you are not quite sure "
"what to do about the ravenous undead."
msgstr ""
"Te pasaste muchos años viajando por el mundo, volviéndote sabio e ilustrado."
" Comúnmente, podrías responder cualquier pregunta, pero ni siquiera estás "
"seguro de lo que se podría hacer con los voraces muertos vivientes."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
