#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Preacher"
msgstr "Pastor"

#. ~ Description of profession "Preacher" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You devoted your life to spreading the good word, always on the road, "
"traveling from town to town.  Now everything has gone to hell, you can't "
"host your daily podcast, and the undead don't seem particularly moved by "
"your sermons."
msgstr ""
"Dedicaste tu vida a difundir la buena palabra, siempre en la carretera, "
"viajando de pueblo en pueblo. Ahora todo se ha ido al infierno, no puedes "
"presentar tu podcast diario, y los muertos vivientes no parecen "
"particularmente conmovidos por tus sermones."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
