#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Skater Boy"
msgstr "Skater"

#. ~ Description of profession "Skater Boy" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You love to skate!  You've probably spent more time on a pair of blades than"
" off.  Things have gotten pretty bad, but at least the grown-ups aren't "
"telling you where you can't roll."
msgstr ""
"¡Amas patinar! Probablemente has pasado más tiempo con los patines puestos "
"que sin ellos. Las cosas se han puesto bastante mal, pero al menos los "
"mayores no te dicen por dónde no puedes rodar."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Skater Girl"
msgstr "Skater"

#. ~ Description of profession "Skater Girl" for female
