#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Gym Teacher"
msgstr "Profesor de Gimnasia"

#. ~ Description of profession "Gym Teacher" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"It was hard enough getting kids to run laps without having to worry about "
"them trying to eat your brains.  Zombies won't even line up when you blow "
"your whistle."
msgstr ""
"Ya es bastante difícil conseguir que los niños corran sin tener que "
"preocuparse de que intenten comerte los sesos. Los zombis ni siquiera se "
"ponen en fila cuando tocas el silbato."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
