" arrepentirte de haber salido de casa. ¡Has venido a probar algo de Nueva "
"Inglaterra, pero Nueva Inglaterra sigue intentando probarte a ti!."

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Naked and Afraid"
msgstr "Desnudo y asustado"

#. ~ Description of profession "Naked and Afraid" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"For some reason you are now completely naked!  Maybe you were robbed, maybe "
"you were in a nudist beach, or maybe you just enjoy the feeling of "
"liberation brought upon the wind touching your skin, whatever it is, you "
"lack clothes in a time when everyone wants a piece of you."
msgstr ""
"Por alguna razón, estás completamente desnudo. Tal vez te robaron, tal vez "
"estuviste en una playa nudista, o tal vez simplemente disfrutas de la "
"sensación de liberación que produce el viento al tocar tu piel, sea lo que "
"sea, te falta ropa en un momento en que todos quieren un pedazo de ti."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Naked and Afraid"
msgstr "Desnuda y asustada"

#. ~ Description of profession "Naked and Afraid" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
