#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Paramedic"
msgstr "Paramédico"

#. ~ Description of profession "Paramedic" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were separated from your partner while out on a call.  You managed to "
"hang onto some medical supplies, but it's looking like the only life that "
"needs saving now is yours."
msgstr ""
"Estabas respondiendo a una llamada con tu compañero antes de separaros. "
"Ahora solo tienes tu fiel ambulancia, preparada para transportar a los "
"pacientes durante el apocalipsis."

