msgstr ""
"Solías gobernar las carreteras antes de que se llenaran de restos, muertos "
"vivientes y horrores indescriptibles. ¡Al menos no hay límites de velocidad "
"en el apocalipsis!"

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Hazmat Unit"
msgstr "Unidad Hazmat"

#. ~ Description of profession "Hazmat Unit" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were deployed to autopsy one of the rioters showing feral behavior "
"before being put down.  When they got back up, you knew this was out of your"
" job description."
msgstr ""
"Te desplegaron para hacer la autopsia a uno de los alborotadores que "
"mostraba un comportamiento salvaje antes de ser sacrificado. Cuando volvio a"
" levantarse, supiste que esto estaba fuera de la descripción de tu trabajo."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Hazmat Unit"
msgstr "Unidad Hazmat"

#. ~ Description of profession "Hazmat Unit" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
