"para ganarte la vida. Allí, rápidamente llegaste a la cima y te convertiste "
"en la jefa. El gobierno estaba construyendo un caso RICO contra ti, pero el "
"día del juicio final llegó antes. Tu banda ha desaparecido, pero tu vida "
"pasada te preparó para un mundo en el que la violencia es moneda de cambio."

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Paranormal Investigator"
msgstr "Investigador Paranormal"

#. ~ Description of profession "Paranormal Investigator" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were dismissed from your position as a parapsychology professor at the "
"local university and started your own business as a paranormal investigator."
"  Your former colleagues didn't approve of your research, but it looks like "
"it's paying off now."
msgstr ""
"Te despidieron de tu puesto de profesor de parapsicología en la universidad "
"local y empezaste tu propio negocio como investigador paranormal. Tus "
"antiguos colegas no aprobaron tu investigación, pero parece que ahora está "
"dando sus frutos."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Paranormal Investigator"
msgstr "Investigadora Paranormal"

#. ~ Description of profession "Paranormal Investigator" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were dismissed from your position as a parapsychology professor at the "
"local university and started your own business as a paranormal investigator."
"  Your former colleagues didn't approve of your research, but it looks like "
"it's paying off now."
msgstr ""
"Te despidieron de tu puesto de profesora de parapsicología en la universidad"
" local y empezaste tu propio negocio como investigadora paranormal. Tus "
"antiguos colegas no aprobaron tu investigación, pero parece que ahora está "
"dando sus frutos."

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Bird Watcher"
msgstr "Observador de aves"

#. ~ Description of profession "Bird Watcher" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were at your favorite park looking at the robins when the Cataclysm "
"struck.  Now all you have are your binoculars and a lot of trivia about "
"local birds to share with any survivors you may find."
msgstr ""
"Estabas en tu parque favorito observando a los petirrojos cuando se produjo "
"el cataclismo. Ahora lo único que tienes son tus prismáticos y un montón de "
"curiosidades sobre las aves locales para compartirlas con los supervivientes"
" que puedas encontrar."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Bird Watcher"
msgstr "Observadora de aves"

#. ~ Description of profession "Bird Watcher" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were at your favorite park looking at the robins when the Cataclysm "
"struck.  Now all you have are your binoculars and a lot of trivia about "
"local birds to share with any survivors you may find."
msgstr ""
"Estabas en tu parque favorito observando a los petirrojos cuando se produjo "
"el cataclismo. Ahora lo único que tienes son tus prismáticos y un montón de "
"curiosidades sobre las aves locales para compartirlas con los supervivientes"
" que puedas encontrar."

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Portal Traveler"
msgstr "Viajero del Portal"

#. ~ Description of profession "Portal Traveler" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were abducted from your home, taken hostage and used as a test subject "
"in a lab.  The last test soon came, you were dressed in strange clothes and "
"sent to a room where you started to feel… different, you lost consciousness "
"and woke up in this place."
msgstr ""
"Fuiste secuestrado en tu casa, tomado como rehén y utilizado como sujeto de "
"pruebas en un laboratorio. La última prueba no tardó en llegar, te vistieron"
" con ropas extrañas y te enviaron a una habitación donde empezaste a "
"sentirte... diferente, perdiste la conciencia y despertaste en este lugar."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Portal Traveler"
msgstr "Viajera del Portal"

#. ~ Description of profession "Portal Traveler" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
