"sentirte... diferente, perdiste la conciencia y despertaste en este lugar."

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Ninja"
msgstr "Ninja"

#. ~ Description of profession "Ninja" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You always dreamed with being a ninja, so you practiced your movements, "
"dressed all in black and carried some common ninja weapons with you.  Now, "
"after much practice, you can finally call yourself a real ninja."
msgstr ""
"Siempre soñaste con ser un ninja, así que practicaste tus movimientos, te "
"vestiste de negro y llevaste contigo algunas armas ninja comunes. Ahora, "
"después de mucha práctica, por fin puedes considerarte un verdadero ninja."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Kunoichi"
msgstr "Kunoichi"

#. ~ Description of profession "Kunoichi" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You always dreamed with being a ninja, so you practiced your movements, "
"dressed all in black and carried some common ninja weapons with you.  Now, "
"after much practice, you can finally call yourself a real ninja."
msgstr ""
"Siempre soñaste con ser una ninja, así que practicaste tus movimientos, te "
"vestiste de negro y llevaste contigo algunas armas ninja comunes. Ahora, "
"después de mucha práctica, por fin puedes considerarte una verdadero ninja."

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Cheerleader"
msgstr "Porrista"

#. ~ Description of profession "Cheerleader" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Your last cheerleader routine ended abruptly after your partners started "
"cheering for the unliving team.  Let's hope your quick reflexes and "
"flexibility helps you to find new members for the squad."
msgstr ""
"Tu última rutina de animación terminó abruptamente después de que tus "
"compañeros empezaran a animar al equipo de los no vivos. Esperemos que tus "
"rápidos reflejos y tu flexibilidad te ayuden a encontrar nuevos miembros "
"para el equipo."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Cheerleader"
msgstr "Porrista"

#. ~ Description of profession "Cheerleader" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
