"años de entrenamiento salvarte una vez más? Averigüémoslo."

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Surfer"
msgstr "Surfista"

#. ~ Description of profession "Surfer" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You went to ride the waves, but the waves ended up riding you instead when a"
" putrid hand appeared from underwater and grabbed you by the ankle.  You "
"could have lost your surfboard in favor of a kickboard, but that will not "
"stop you from riding the next big wave, the wave of undead."
msgstr ""
"Fuiste a cabalgar las olas, pero las olas acabaron cabalgando sobre ti "
"cuando una mano pútrida apareció de debajo del agua y te agarró por el "
"tobillo. Podrías haber cambiado tu tabla de surf por una de patinaje, pero "
"eso no te impedirá cabalgar la siguiente gran ola, la de los muertos "
"vivientes."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Surfer"
msgstr "Surfista"

#. ~ Description of profession "Surfer" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
