"vivientes."

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Lifeguard"
msgstr "Salvavidas"

#. ~ Description of profession "Lifeguard" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Your job was to safeguard the lives of everyone in the beach, but when the "
"swimmers started drowning each other you knew the situation was out of your "
"hands."
msgstr ""
"Tu trabajo era salvaguardar la vida de todos en la playa, pero cuando los "
"nadadores empezaron a ahogarse unos a otros supiste que la situación estaba "
"fuera de tus manos."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Lifeguard"
msgstr "Salvavidas"

#. ~ Description of profession "Lifeguard" for female
