#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Hitman"
msgstr "Sicario"

#. ~ Description of profession "Hitman" for male
#. ~ Description of profession "Assassin" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were the best undercover agent they had, with a mission so vital that "
"you had to take it even with the riots going on.  Your target seems to have "
"turned feral as well as your contact, you are all alone now."
msgstr ""
"Eras el mejor agente encubierto que tenían, con una misión tan vital que "
"tuviste que tomarla incluso con los disturbios en marcha. Tu objetivo parece"
" haberse vuelto salvaje al igual que tu contacto, ahora estás solo."

