#. ~ Description of scenario "Surrounded" for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've attracted the attention of living dead in some way, now they're all "
"around and you'll likely have to fight through them if you want to escape."
msgstr ""
"Has atraído la atención de los muertos vivientes de alguna manera, ahora "
"están por todas partes y es probable que tengas que luchar a través de ellos"
" si quieres escapar."

