#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - Island Prison" for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were in a high-security prison right before the Cataclysm.  "
"Unfortunately, you're still in it, so you need to figure out how to escape."
"  It's located on a remote island to boot; you'll eventually need to escape "
"that also."
msgstr ""
"Estabas en una prisión de alta seguridad justo antes del Cataclismo. "
"Desafortunadamente sigues en ella, así que necesitas averiguar cómo escapar."
" Además, se encuentra en una isla remota, de la que también tendrás que "
"escapar."

