msgid "The Mascot Rises"
msgstr "La Mascota Se Pone En Pie"

#. ~ Description of scenario "The Mascot Rises" for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You just finished your shift and got back in the break room when you heard "
"the alarms and the security door shutting down behind you.  There's a lot of"
" customers out there and you're not sure Foodplace's delicious food™ is "
"going to be enough for them."
msgstr ""
"Acabas de terminar tu turno y vuelves a la sala de descanso cuando oyes las "
"alarmas y la puerta de seguridad cerrándose detrás de ti. Hay muchos "
"clientes ahí fuera y no estás seguro de que la deliciosa comida de "
"Lugarcomida™ vaya a ser suficiente para ellos."

