#. ~ Description of scenario "Helicopter Crash" for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"While being transported to a different military base, the pilot lost control"
" of the helicopter and crashed in the middle of nowhere.  Hopefully some of "
"the soldiers that were with you also survived the accident."
msgstr ""
"Mientras eras transportado a una base militar diferente, el piloto perdió el"
" control del helicóptero y se estrelló en medio de la nada. Esperemos que "
"algunos de los soldados que estaban contigo también hayan sobrevivido al "
"accidente."

