msgid ""
"You were participating in a mining operation when you found… something.  "
"You're not sure what, but it sure is dark down here."
msgstr ""
"Estabas participando en una operación minera cuando encontraste... algo. No "
"estás seguro de qué, pero solo hay oscuridad aquí abajo."

