#. ~ Description of scenario "Splintering Reality" for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You found yourself alone in an open field when reality began to heave and "
"crack all around you.  You need to find shelter, and fast."
msgstr ""
"Te encuentras solo en campo abierto cuando la realidad empieza a estirarse y"
" romperse a tu alrededor. Necesitas encontrar refugio enseguida."

