msgid "Challenge - Portal Dependent"
msgstr "Desafío - Dependiente del Portal"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - Portal Dependent" for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were caught in a huge and unstable portal storm, and were utterly "
"unprotected from the full force of its effects.  You're on the tail end of "
"the storm now, and while you've survived, you feel… different."
msgstr ""
"Te viste atrapado en una enorme e inestable tormenta de portales, y estabas "
"totalmente desprotegido de toda la fuerza de sus efectos. Ahora estás en la "
"cola de la tormenta, y aunque has sobrevivido, te sientes... diferente."

#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - Portal Dependent" for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json
