"unprotected from the full force of its effects.  You're on the tail end of "
"the storm now, and while you've survived, you feel… different."
msgstr ""
"Te viste atrapada en una enorme e inestable tormenta de portales, y estabas "
"totalmente desprotegida de toda la fuerza de sus efectos. Ahora estás en la "
"cola de la tormenta, y aunque has sobrevivido, te sientes... diferente."

#. ~ Scenario name for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scenario_male"
msgid "Mansion Escape"
msgstr "Escapa de la Mansión"

#. ~ Scenario name for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scenario_female"
msgid "Mansion Escape"
msgstr "Escapa de la Mansión"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Mansion Escape" for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were living the high life when the world ended, surrounded by riches and"
" extravagant food every day, but now you find yourself awakening from an "
"induced paralysis and carried to the basement of the mansion in which you "
"used to live, heavy footsteps resound around you, are you ready to survive "
"in this new world?"
msgstr ""
"Estabas viviendo la gran vida cuando el mundo se acabó, rodeado de riquezas "
"y comida extravagante cada día, pero ahora te encuentras despertando de una "
"parálisis inducida y llevado al sótano de la mansión en la que solías vivir,"
" pesados pasos resuenan a tu alrededor, ¿estás preparado para sobrevivir en "
"este nuevo mundo?"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Mansion Escape" for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were living the high life when the world ended, surrounded by riches and"
" extravagant food every day, but now you find yourself awakening from an "
"induced paralysis and carried to the basement of the mansion in which you "
"used to live, heavy footsteps resound around you, are you ready to survive "
"in this new world?"
msgstr ""
"Estabas viviendo la gran vida cuando el mundo se acabó, rodeado de riquezas "
"y comida extravagante cada día, pero ahora te encuentras despertando de una "
"parálisis inducida y llevado al sótano de la mansión en la que solías vivir,"
" pesados pasos resuenan a tu alrededor, ¿estás preparado para sobrevivir en "
"este nuevo mundo?"

#. ~ Starting location of scenario "Mansion Escape"
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "start_name"
msgid "Mansion"
msgstr "Mansión"

#. ~ Scenario name for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scenario_male"
msgid "Compromised Shelter"
msgstr "Refugio Comprometido"

#. ~ Scenario name for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scenario_female"
msgid "Compromised Shelter"
msgstr "Refugio Comprometido"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Compromised Shelter" for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You have survived the initial wave of panic, and have achieved (relative) "
"safety in one of the many government evac shelters.  However, the people you"
" came with started to turn and now they're out for your flesh!  You've holed"
" up in the basement for now, but sooner or later you have to make for the "
"door… and fast!"
msgstr ""
"Sobreviviste a la oleada inicial de pánico y has logrado una (relativa) "
"seguridad en uno de los muchos refugios de evacuación del gobierno. Pero la "
"gente con la que viniste empezó a cambiar y ahora quieren comerte. Por ahora"
" te has refugiado en el sótano, pero tarde o temprano tendrás que ir hacia "
"la puerta... ¡y rápido!"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Compromised Shelter" for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You have survived the initial wave of panic, and have achieved (relative) "
"safety in one of the many government evac shelters.  However, the people you"
" came with started to turn and now they're out for your flesh!  You've holed"
" up in the basement for now, but sooner or later you have to make for the "
"door… and fast!"
msgstr ""
"Sobreviviste a la oleada inicial de pánico y has logrado una (relativa) "
"seguridad en uno de los muchos refugios de evacuación del gobierno. Pero la "
"gente con la que viniste empezó a cambiar y ahora quieren comerte. Por ahora"
" te has refugiado en el sótano, pero tarde o temprano tendrás que ir hacia "
"la puerta... ¡y rápido!"

#. ~ Starting location of scenario "Compromised Shelter"
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "start_name"
msgid "In an Infested Shelter"
msgstr "En un refugio infestado"

#. ~ Scenario name for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scenario_male"
msgid "CVN Sailor"
msgstr "Marinero del CVN"

#. ~ Scenario name for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scenario_female"
msgid "CVN Sailor"
msgstr "Marinera del CVN"

#. ~ Description of scenario "CVN Sailor" for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"For some reason your mission off the coast of North Korea was ended in the "
"middle of a lake, in an unknown location.  You have no idea what's happened,"
" but now you have more important things to do."
msgstr ""
"Por alguna razón, tu misión en la costa de Corea del Norte ha terminado en "
"medio de un lago, en un lugar desconocido. No tienes ni idea de lo que pasó,"
" pero ahora tienes cosas más importantes que hacer."

#. ~ Description of scenario "CVN Sailor" for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json
