msgid ""
"For some reason your mission off the coast of North Korea was ended in the "
"middle of a lake, in an unknown location.  You have no idea what's happened,"
" but now you have more important things to do."
msgstr ""
"Por alguna razón, tu misión en la costa de Corea del Norte ha terminado en "
"medio de un lago, en un lugar desconocido. No tienes ni idea de lo que pasó,"
" pero ahora tienes cosas más importantes que hacer."

#. ~ Starting location of scenario "CVN Sailor"
