msgctxt "start_name"
msgid "Aircraft Carrier"
msgstr "Portaaviones"

#. ~ Scenario name for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scenario_male"
msgid "Golden Years"
msgstr "Años Dorados"

#. ~ Scenario name for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scenario_female"
msgid "Golden Years"
msgstr "Años Dorados"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Golden Years" for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"After a life time of hard work, you managed to settle down in a posh "
"retirement community.  Safe behind those walls, you would live a peaceful, "
"privileged life, away from all the crazy lunatics outside.  Then, the "
"crazies made it inside anyway, leaving you no choice but to deal with them "
"personally.  Welcome to your golden years."
msgstr ""
"Tras toda una vida de trabajo duro, consigues instalarte en una elegante "
"comunidad de jubilados. A salvo detrás de esos muros, vivirías una vida "
"pacífica y privilegiada, lejos de todos los locos del exterior. Luego, los "
"locos entraron de todos modos, no dejándote más remedio que lidiar con ellos"
" personalmente. Bienvenido a tus años dorados."

#. ~ Description of scenario "Golden Years" for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"After a life time of hard work, you managed to settle down in a posh "
