#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"Your employer could be no longer responding but you have decided to finish "
"your mission.  Hunt down and kill your mark."
msgstr ""
"Tu jefe puede no responder más, pero has decidido terminar tu misión. Caza y"
" mata a tu objetivo."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Life vow"
msgstr "Voto de vida"

#. ~ Description of mission "Life vow"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"Live your life to the fullest, prove to yourself that you can survive this "
"new obstacle in the same way that you have survived the last."
msgstr ""
"Vive tu vida al máximo, demuéstrate a ti mismo que puedes sobrevivir a este "
"nuevo obstáculo de la misma manera que has sobrevivido al anterior."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Prepare for your next show"
msgstr "Prepárate para tu próximo espectáculo"

#. ~ Description of mission "Prepare for your next show"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"Become the best clown, make sure that your next show will make everyone "
"laugh by training your social skills to perfection."
msgstr ""
"Conviértete en el mejor payaso, asegúrate de que tu próximo espectáculo hará"
" reír a todos entrenando tus habilidades sociales a la perfección."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Find a memory of your master"
msgstr "Encuentra un recuerdo de tu maestro"

#. ~ Description of mission "Find a memory of your master"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Find and wield a whip to remember your master even when separated."
msgstr ""
"Encuentra y blande un látigo para recordar a tu maestro incluso cuando están"
" separados."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Obtain your black belt"
msgstr "Consigue tu cinturón negro"

#. ~ Description of mission "Obtain your black belt"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"You could have become a master in martial arts if you had the chance, so "
"train until you achieve the level of a master in the old world, and find "
"yourself a nice black belt to commemorate the occasion."
msgstr ""
"Podrías haberte convertido en un maestro en artes marciales si hubieses "
"tenido la oportunidad, así que entrena hasta que alcances el nivel de un "
"maestro en el viejo mundo, y búscate un bonito cinturón negro para "
"conmemorar la ocasión."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Find a real katana"
msgstr "Encuentra una katana real"

#. ~ Description of mission "Find a real katana"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"The world has ended, but as an authentic samurai you lack a katana, you must"
" find one, quickly."
msgstr ""
"El mundo se acabó, pero como auténtico samurái te falta una katana, debes "
"encontrar una, rápido."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Protect your canine friends"
msgstr "Portege a tu amigo canino"

#. ~ Description of mission "Protect your canine friends"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"You have saved your dogs from the fall of the world, but they could still "
"suffer from danger everywhere.  Police dogs used some Kevlar harnesses for "
"protection…  Maybe your friends could use some too?"
msgstr ""
"Salvaste a tus perros de la ruina del mundo, pero aún podrían sufrir el "
"peligro en cualquier lugar. Los perros de la policía utilizan unos arneses "
"de kevlar para protegerse... ¿Quizá a tus amigos también les vendría bien?"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Hunt big game"
msgstr "Caza mayor"

#. ~ Description of mission "Hunt big game"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"The end of the world could have arrived, but you still crave for that one "
"big hunt.  Search and kill a black bear to remember the old days."
msgstr ""
"Puede que haya llegado el fin del mundo, pero sigues anhelando esa gran "
"cacería. Busca y mata un oso negro para recordar los viejos tiempos."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Become the protagonist"
msgstr "Conviértete en el protagonista"

#. ~ Description of mission "Become the protagonist"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"The world has become like an anime!  Zombies, mutants, the end of "
"civilization as we know it…  You must become the protagonist if you want to "
"survive, the plot armor will help you.  Go and kill 50 zombies to show your "
"protagonist potential."
msgstr ""
"¡El mundo se ha convertido en un anime! Zombis, mutantes, el fin de la "
"civilización tal y como la conocemos... Debes convertirte en el protagonista"
" si quieres sobrevivir, la pluma de la trama te ayudará. Ve y mata a 50 "
"zombies para demostrar tu potencial de protagonista."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Make the cops pay"
msgstr "Haz que los polis paguen"

#. ~ Description of mission "Make the cops pay"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"They wanted to put you behind bars, but are now dead, make them pay with "
"blood, unliving blood."
msgstr ""
"Querían ponerte entre rejas, pero ahora están muertos, hazles pagar con "
"sangre, sangre no viva."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Continue with your evolution"
msgstr "Continua tu evolución"

#. ~ Description of mission "Continue with your evolution"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"Your evolution to a more perfect form was interrupted by the Cataclysm.  "
"Restart your transformation process whatever it costs."
msgstr ""
"Tu evolución hacia una forma más perfecta fue interrumpida por el "
"Cataclismo. Reinicia tu proceso de transformación cueste lo que cueste."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Recover a part of yourself"
msgstr "Recupera una parte de ti"

#. ~ Description of mission "Recover a part of yourself"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"They took away something from you, something important.  You feel a "
"connection with this weather, maybe you can recover some portion of what you"
" lost in one of these storms."
msgstr ""
"Te han quitado algo, algo importante. Sientes una conexión con este clima, "
"tal vez puedas recuperar alguna porción de lo que perdiste en una de estas "
"tormentas."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Social butterfly"
msgstr "Mariposa social"

#. ~ Description of mission "Social butterfly"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"You have always had good social abilities.  Go and recruit 2 followers and "
"establish your leadership among them.  Don't forget to order them to build a"
" base of operations for you in the form of a survivor camp."
msgstr ""
"Siempre has tenido buenas habilidades sociales. Ve a reclutar 2 seguidores y"
" establece tu liderazgo entre ellos. No olvides ordenarles que construyan "
"una base de operaciones para ti a modo de campamento de supervivientes."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Kill your rivals"
msgstr "Mata a tus rivales"

#. ~ Description of mission "Kill your rivals"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"As a real ninja, you can't allow competitors for the night.  Kill 10 shady "
"zombies and demonstrate who is the real ninja here."
msgstr ""
"Como un verdadero ninja, no puedes permitir que tus competidores pasen de "
"esta noche. Mata a 10 zombies sombríos y demuestra quién es el verdadero "
"ninja aquí."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Find some cosplay suits"
msgstr "Encuentra algunos trajes cosplay"

#. ~ Description of mission "Find some cosplay suits"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"The world could have ended, but there are still some fantastic costumes out "
"there, just waiting for you to wear them.  Search them until you find them."
msgstr ""
"El mundo podría haberse acabado, pero todavía hay algunos disfraces "
"fantásticos por ahí, esperando a que te los pongas. Búscalos hasta que los "
"encuentres."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Find some skates"
msgstr "Encuentra algunos patines"

#. ~ Description of mission "Find some skates"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"You are a skater at heart, and as such you need some skates to drive by, any"
" kind will suffice."
msgstr ""
"Eres un patinador de corazón, y como tal necesitas unos patines para andar, "
"cualquier tipo será suficiente."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Dress with style"
msgstr "Viste con estilo"

#. ~ Description of mission "Dress with style"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"You need to always dress in style and fashion.  Find a gown or tuxedo for "
"your personal use."
msgstr ""
"Tienes que vestir siempre con estilo y a la moda. Busca un vestido o un "
"esmoquin para tu uso personal."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Find a tabletop game"
msgstr "Encuentra un juego de mesa"

#. ~ Description of mission "Find a tabletop game"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"As a Game Master, it's just unacceptable that you now lack your means to "
"play.  Find any tabletop game to play with any survivors you could find, "
"even a cards game will suffice."
msgstr ""
"Como Game Master, es inaceptable que ahora te falten medios para jugar. "
"Busca cualquier juego de mesa para jugar con los supervivientes que puedas "
"encontrar, incluso un juego de cartas será suficiente."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Ready or Not"
msgstr "Preparado o No"

#. ~ Description of mission "Ready or Not"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Survive all day from the crazy inhabitants of the mansion."
msgstr "Sobrevive todo un día a los locos habitantes de la mansión."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Find Antibiotics Before You Die!"
msgstr "¡Encuentra los antibióticos antes de que Mueras!"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Refuel your helicopter."
msgstr "Reabastece tu helicóptero."

#. ~ Description of mission "Refuel your helicopter."
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"You were flying towards a nearby private airport before your forced landing."
"  You could still reach it by ground, and scavenge it for fuel."
msgstr ""
"Estabas volando hacia un aeropuerto privado cercano antes de tu aterrizaje "
"forzoso. Todavía puedes llegar a él por tierra y rebuscar combustible."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Reach The Mansion And Finish This Delivery"
msgstr "Llega a la Mansión Y Termina Esta Entrega"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Kill your pursuer"
msgstr "Mata a tu perseguidor"

#. ~ Description of mission "Kill your pursuer"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"Since the start of the Cataclysm, something has been hunting you "
"relentlessly.  You can outrun it but never truly escape it.  It won't end "
"until one of you dies."
msgstr ""
"Desde el comienzo del Cataclismo, algo te ha estado persiguiendo "
"implacablemente. Puedes huir de ello, pero nunca podrás escapar de verdad. "
"No terminará hasta que uno de los dos muera."

