msgstr "¡pum!"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
msgid "wafting anemone"
msgstr "anémona flotante"

#. ~ Description of furniture "wafting anemone"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
msgid ""
"A fleshy white protuberance growing from the floor, with a cluster of "
"tendrils pouring out of it.  It looks almost exactly like a sea anemone, "
"even waving gently as though underwater."
msgstr ""
"Una protuberancia blanca y carnosa que crece en el suelo, con un grupo de "
"zarcillos que salen de ella. Se parece casi exactamente a una anémona de "
"mar, incluso se agita suavemente como si estuviera bajo el agua."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
msgid "gasping tube"
msgstr "tubo jadeante"

#. ~ Description of furniture "gasping tube"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
msgid ""
"This is a meaty green stalactite with a thickened hide like that of a "
"starfish, extending from the floor to the ceiling.  In the center is a "
"series of ports somewhat like mouths, from which pour bursts of a vile-"
"smelling gas."
msgstr ""
"Se trata de una carnosa estalactita verde con una piel engrosada como la de "
"una estrella de mar, que se extiende desde el suelo hasta el techo. En el "
"centro hay una serie de orificios que parecen bocas, de los que brotan "
"ráfagas de un gas de mal olor."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
msgid "twitching frond"
msgstr "frondosa sacudida"

#. ~ Description of furniture "twitching frond"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
msgid ""
"A spine resembling moth antennae juts from the ground, swaying gently in the"
" air.  Every so often, a cascade of energy arcs along it and discharges into"
" the ceiling."
msgstr ""
"Una columna vertebral que se asemeja a las antenas de una polilla sobresale "
"del suelo y se balancea suavemente en el aire. De vez en cuando, una cascada"
" de energía se arquea a lo largo de ella y se descarga en el techo."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
msgid "scarred lump"
msgstr "bulto cicatrizado"

#. ~ Description of furniture "scarred lump"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
msgid ""
"This is a pile of nondescript alien flesh, twitching and belching strange "
"gases out of injured orifices."
msgstr ""
"Se trata de un montón de carne alienígena anodina, que se retuerce y eructa "
"extraños gases por los orificios heridos."

#. ~ Bashing failed sound of furniture "scarred lump"
#. ~ Bashing sound of furniture "spider egg sack"
#. ~ Bashing sound of furniture "ruptured egg sack"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-eggs.json
msgid "splat!"
msgstr "¡splat!"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
msgid "slimy pod"
msgstr "vaina viscosa"

#. ~ Description of furniture "slimy pod"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
msgid ""
"This is a slick, translucent pod suspended on a thin stalk.  It is covered "
"in a thick mucus, obscuring whatever is floating in the gel-like substance "
"inside."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una vaina resbaladiza y translúcida suspendida en un tallo delgado. "
"Está cubierta por una espesa mucosidad, que oscurece lo que está flotando en"
" la sustancia gelatinosa del interior."

