msgstr "whump."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
msgid "organ pod"
msgstr "vaina de órgano"

#. ~ Description of furniture "organ pod"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
msgid ""
"This is a translucent pod suspended on a thin stalk.  Inside you can see the"
" dimly outlined shape of human organs, floating in some kind of preservative"
" goo."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una vaina translúcida suspendida en un tallo delgado. En el interior"
" se puede ver la forma poco marcada de los órganos humanos, flotando en "
"algún tipo de sustancia conservante."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
msgid "resin pod"
msgstr "vaina de resina"

#. ~ Description of furniture "resin pod"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
msgid ""
"This is a translucent pod suspended on a thin stalk.  Inside is a clean, "
"clear resinous-looking fluid.  You could fairly easily tear it from the "
"stalk and take it with you."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una vaina translúcida suspendida en un tallo delgado. En el interior"
" hay un fluido limpio, claro y de aspecto resinoso. Podrías arrancarlo del "
"tallo y llevártelo contigo."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
msgid "fleshy altar"
msgstr " altar carnoso"

#. ~ Description of furniture "fleshy altar"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
msgid ""
"This pulsing protuberance juts from the floor, its sides covered in scaled, "
"oozing skin.  The surface is flat, but undulates softly.  A handful of "
"unidentifiable appendages reach from the sides, suggesting a sort of "
"nightmarish living Autodoc."
msgstr ""
"Esta protuberancia palpitante sobresale del suelo, con sus lados cubiertos "
"de piel escamosa y rezumante. La superficie es plana, pero se ondula "
"suavemente. Un puñado de apéndices inidentificables salen de los lados, "
"sugiriendo una especie de Autodoc viviente de pesadilla."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
msgid "scrap antenna"
msgstr "antena de chatarra"

#. ~ Description of furniture "scrap antenna"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
msgid ""
"This contraption looks like some sort of cobbled-together transmitter or "
"receiver antenna.  It consists of a number of mismatched blinking lights, "
"spinning servos, and dangling wires connected to a heft metal box."
msgstr ""
"Este artilugio parece una especie de antena transmisora o receptora "
"improvisada. Consiste en una serie de luces parpadeantes que no coinciden, "
"servos que giran y cables que cuelgan conectados a una caja metálica pesada."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
msgid "pictographic signpost"
msgstr "cartel pictográfico"

#. ~ Description of furniture "pictographic signpost"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
msgid ""
"This simple scrap metal sign has a series of pictographs on it depicting "
"what seems to be a trade interaction.  There is a crude but understandable "
"directions map beneath it."
msgstr ""
"Este sencillo cartel de chatarra tiene una serie de pictogramas que "
"representan lo que parece ser una transacción comercial. Debajo hay un tosco"
" pero comprensible mapa de direcciones."

