msgstr "frufrú"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
msgid "less than nothing"
msgstr "menos que nada"

#. ~ Description of furniture "less than nothing"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-alien.json
msgid "There is nothing here.  Not even time or space."
msgstr "No hay nada aquí. Ni siquiera espacio o tiempo."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "cooling unit"
msgstr "unidad de refrigeración"

#. ~ Description of furniture "cooling unit"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid ""
"A large, blocky appliance encased in sheet metal.  This commonplace fixture "
"is used for cooling large indoor areas."
msgstr ""
"Un aparato grande, en forma de bloque, revestido de chapa. Este aparato tan "
"habitual se utiliza para refrigerar grandes superficies interiores."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "central air filter"
msgstr "filtro de aire central"

#. ~ Description of furniture "central air filter"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid ""
"A large synthetic membrane used to filter out dust, smoke, mites, and other "
"contaminants from air that passes through it."
msgstr ""
"Una gran membrana sintética utilizada para filtrar el polvo, el humo, los "
"ácaros y otros contaminantes del aire que la atraviesa."

#. ~ Description of furniture "dishwasher"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid ""
"A large, boxy machine that uses hot water and soap to efficiently clean "
"batches of dishes.  Now that it's sat powerless for a while, a putrid scent "
"of rot is leaking from inside."
msgstr ""
"Una máquina grande y cuadrada que utiliza agua caliente y jabón para limpiar"
" eficientemente las tandas de platos. Ahora que lleva un tiempo sin "
"funcionar, de su interior se desprende un pútrido olor a podrido."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "dryer"
msgstr "secadora"

#. ~ Description of furniture "dryer"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid ""
"A common household appliance used to quickly dry large batches of clothing "
"after they have been washed."
msgstr ""
"Un electrodoméstico común utilizado para secar rápidamente grandes lotes de "
"ropa después de haberla lavado."

#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Vehicle part name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/obsolete.json
#: data/mods/BlazeIndustries/vehicleparts/blaze_other_parts.json
msgid "refrigerator"
msgstr "nevera"

#. ~ Description of furniture "refrigerator"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid ""
"A tall metal storage container that, if powered, will refrigerate food and "
"other perishables for preservation."
msgstr ""
"Un contenedor metálico alto que si recibe energía, refrigerará los alimentos"
" y otros productos perecederos para su conservación."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "glass door fridge"
msgstr "Nevera con puerta de cristal"

#. ~ Description of furniture "glass door fridge"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid ""
"A modern refrigerator with a thick sheet of glass in the door, often "
"specially treated to be more insulative.  Allows seeing the contents without"
" letting out the cold air, which used to be a minor convenience, and now "
"saves precious minutes until spoilage."
msgstr ""
"Un frigorífico moderno con una gruesa lámina de vidrio en la puerta, a "
"menudo tratada especialmente para ser más aislante. Permite ver el contenido"
" sin dejar salir el aire frío, lo que antes era una comodidad menor, y ahora"
" ahorra preciosos minutos hasta el deterioro."

#. ~ Description of furniture "freezer"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid ""
"A chest freezer that could be used to freeze foods, if it were connected to "
"a working power source."
msgstr ""
"Un armario congelador que podría utilizarse para congelar alimentos, si "
"estuviera conectado a una fuente de energía que funcione."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "furnace"
msgstr "horno industrial"

#. ~ Description of furniture "furnace"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid ""
"A gas-powered forced-air central heating unit, with an internal fan to push "
"the air through a building's ventilation system to keep it warm."
msgstr ""
"Una unidad de calefacción central de aire forzado a gas, con un ventilador "
"interno para empujar el aire a través del sistema de ventilación de un "
"edificio para mantenerlo caliente."

#. ~ Description of furniture "washing machine"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid ""
"A large, chunky machine that uses soap and large amounts of water to wash "
"batches of clothes with minimal effort."
msgstr ""
"Una máquina grande y gruesa que utiliza jabón y grandes cantidades de agua "
"para lavar lotes de ropa con el mínimo esfuerzo."

#. ~ Description of furniture "oven"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid ""
"A standard convection-based oven, commonly used for heating and cooking "
"food.  It can safely contain a fire, although it's not adequately "
"ventilated.  You could disconnect it and plug it in to a working power grid,"
" or power it with UPS."
msgstr ""
"Un horno estándar basado en convección, utilizado habitualmente para "
"calentar y cocinar alimentos. Puede contener un fuego con seguridad, aunque "
"no está adecuadamente ventilado. Podrías desconectarlo y enchufarlo a una "
"red eléctrica que funcione, o alimentarlo con un UPS."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "gas oven"
msgstr "horno de gas"

#. ~ Description of furniture "gas oven"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid ""
"A standard gas powered oven, commonly used for heating and cooking food.  "
"With the state of nearby gas lines unknown it's best not to put any fire "
"near it."
msgstr ""
"Un horno de gas estándar, utilizado habitualmente para calentar y cocinar "
"alimentos. Pero sabiendo el estado de las líneas de gas cercanas es mejor no"
" poner fuego cerca de él."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "gas oven and microwave combo"
msgstr "combo de horno de gas y microondas"

#. ~ Description of furniture "gas oven and microwave combo"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid ""
"A standard gas powered oven, commonly used for heating and cooking food.  "
"With the state of nearby gas lines unknown it's best not to put any fire "
"near it.  You could disassemble the shelving holding them together and pull "
"the microwave out."
msgstr ""
"Un horno de gas estándar, utilizado habitualmente para calentar y cocinar "
"alimentos. Debido a que se desconoce el estado de las tuberías de gas "
"cercanas, es mejor no hacer fuego cerca de ellas. Podrías desmontar la "
"estantería que los mantiene unidos y sacar el microondas."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "blacksmith bellows"
msgstr "fuelles de herrero"

#. ~ Description of furniture "blacksmith bellows"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid ""
"An old device for pushing air into a blacksmith's forge to strengthen the "
"fire and maintain a high temperature.  Useless in its current state, but "
"good for parts."
msgstr ""
"Antiguo dispositivo para introducir aire en la fragua del herrero para "
"reforzar el fuego y mantener una temperatura elevada. Inútil en su estado "
"actual, pero bueno para partes."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "blacksmith drop hammer"
msgstr "martillo pilón de herrero"

#. ~ Description of furniture "blacksmith drop hammer"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid ""
"An anvil with a large metal hammer suspended above it in a metal framework."
"  If it were working, it would be useful for shaping softened metal plates, "
"though now it is only useful for parts."
msgstr ""
"Un yunque con un gran martillo de metal suspendido sobre él en una "
"estructura metálica. Si funcionara, sería útil para dar forma a las placas "
"de metal reblandecido, aunque ahora solo sirve para partes."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "document shredder"
msgstr "trituradora de documentos"

#. ~ Description of furniture "document shredder"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid ""
"A simple electronic device mounted to a large basket.  It is designed to "
"efficiently destroy paper documents with sensitive information.  Good for "
"parts, as identity theft and corporate espionage probably aren't big "
"concerns anymore."
msgstr ""
"Un sencillo dispositivo electrónico montado en una gran papelera. Está "
"diseñado para destruir eficazmente los documentos en papel con información "
"sensible. Es bueno para las partes, ya que el robo de identidad y el "
"espionaje corporativo probablemente ya no son grandes preocupaciones."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "server stack"
msgstr "pila de servidores"

#. ~ Description of furniture "server stack"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid ""
"A large rack of specialized computers for storing and transmitting "
"information.  Powerless and largely useless for its intended purpose, the "
"laptops mounted inside can still be used if removed."
msgstr ""
"Un gran bastidor de ordenadores especializados para almacenar y transmitir "
"información. Sin energía y en gran medida inútil para su propósito, los "
"ordenadores portátiles montados en su interior pueden seguir utilizándose si"
" se extraen."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "large satellite dish"
msgstr "gran antena parabólica"

#. ~ Description of furniture "large satellite dish"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid ""
"A large, concave metal panel with simple electronics used to receive signals"
" from satellites.  While the hundreds of expensive machines orbiting the "
"planet will likely continue to function indefinitely, their various purposes"
" have all been lost."
msgstr ""
"Un gran panel metálico cóncavo con una electrónica sencilla que sirve para "
"recibir señales de los satélites. Aunque es probable que los cientos de "
"costosas máquinas que orbitan el planeta sigan funcionando indefinidamente, "
"sus diversos propósitos se han perdido."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "mounted solar panel"
msgstr "panel solar montado"

#. ~ Description of furniture "mounted solar panel"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid ""
"A set of photovoltaic power generators, which turns solar radiation into "
"useable electricity.  While useful before the Cataclysm, they have become "
"priceless tools, invaluable to any survivor."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de generadores de energía fotovoltaica, que convierte la "
"radiación solar en electricidad utilizable. Mientras que eran útiles antes "
"del Cataclismo, ahora se han convertido en herramientas de valor "
"incalculable para cualquier superviviente."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-barriers.json
msgid "road barricade"
msgstr "barricada de camino"

#. ~ Description of furniture "road barricade"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-barriers.json
msgid ""
"A large wooden blockade used to block passage through a road.  It is lined "
"with reflective tape to increase visibility.  Despite the name, it does "
"little to stop a moving car."
msgstr ""
"Es un gran obstáculo de madera que se usa para bloquear el tránsito de una "
"calle. Está bordeado con cinta adhesiva reflectante para incrementar su "
"visibilidad. A pesar de su nombre, no logra mucho para detener a un vehículo"
" en movimiento."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-barriers.json
msgid "gravelbag barricade"
msgstr "barricada de sacos de grava"

#. ~ Description of furniture "gravelbag barricade"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-barriers.json
msgid ""
"A low wall made of stacked gravelbags, uncommonly used to catch bullets and "
"block flooding."
msgstr ""
"Un muro bajo hecho de sacos de grava apilados, no comunmente utilizado para "
"atrapar balas y bloquear inundaciones."

#. ~ Bashing sound of furniture "gravelbag barricade"
#. ~ Bashing sound of furniture "gravelbag wall"
#. ~ Bashing sound of furniture "earthbag barricade"
