#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-decorative.json
msgid ""
"A massive block of stone that has been carefully carved into a work of "
"timeless art."
msgstr ""
"Un enorme bloque de piedra que ha sido cuidadosamente tallado en una obra de"
" arte intemporal."

