#. ~ Description of terrain "linoleum tile"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid ""
"A section of flooring made out of a tough, rubbery material.  Colored a "
"simple white."
msgstr ""
"Una sección del suelo hecha de un material duro y gomoso. De color blanco "
"simple."

#. ~ Description of terrain "linoleum tile"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid "A section of flooring made out of a tough, gray, rubbery material."
msgstr "Una sección del suelo hecha de un material duro, gris y gomoso."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid "painted waxed floor"
msgstr "suelo pintado encerado"

#. ~ Description of terrain "painted waxed floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid "This section of wax flooring has been painted."
msgstr "Esta sección del suelo de cera ha sido pintada."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid "radiation platform"
msgstr "plataforma de radiación"

#. ~ Description of terrain "radiation platform"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid ""
"A dual purpose platform that serves as a containment, and as a device that "
"exposes items places on in to the radioactive source, by temporarily "
"hoisting the radioactive material stored within.  Operated from external "
"console."
msgstr ""
"Una plataforma de doble propósito que sirve como contención y como "
"dispositivo que expone los artículos colocados en la fuente radioactiva al "
"elevar temporalmente el material radioactivo almacenado en su interior. "
"Operado desde una consola externa."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid "junk metal floor"
msgstr "piso de metal chatarra"

#. ~ Description of terrain "junk metal floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid ""
"A simple roof and floor of rusty scrap metal bolted and wire-tied to a "
"makeshift frame.  Very fashionable in post-apocalyptic shantytowns.  Hope "
"you like the sound of rain on corrugated metal."
msgstr ""
"Un simple techo y piso de chatarra oxidada atornillada y atada con alambre a"
" un marco improvisado. Muy de moda en los barrios de chabolas post-"
"apocalípticos. Espero que te guste el sonido de la lluvia sobre el metal "
"corrugado."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "dirt"
msgstr "tierra"

#. ~ Description of terrain "dirt"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid ""
"It's dirt.  Looks like some fine soil for tillage.  Could also be dug out "
"for construction projects."
msgstr ""
"Tierra. Parece que es buena para cultivar. También se puede excavar para "
"proyectos de construcción."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid "sand"
msgstr "arena"

#. ~ Description of terrain "sand"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid ""
"A large area of fine sand that could be useful in a number of ways, if it "
"was extracted properly."
msgstr ""
"Es un área grande con arena que podría utilizarse de varias maneras, si se "
"la extrae de manera apropiada."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
