msgstr "ventana de cristal simple reforzada con cinta adhesiva"

#. ~ Description of terrain "taped reinforced single glazed window"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid ""
"A reinforced single glazed window.  Consists of giant sheet of reinforced "
"glass inserted into a window frame.  It's currently closed.  This one has "
"been blocked out with duct tape.  You could remove the duct tape by cutting "
"it off."
msgstr ""
"Una ventana reforzada de un solo cristal. Consiste en una lámina gigante de "
"vidrio reforzado insertada en un marco de ventana. Actualmente está cerrada."
" Esta ha sido bloqueada con cinta adhesiva. Se puede quitar la cinta "
"adhesiva cortándola."

