msgid ""
"A reinforced quadruple glazed window.  Consists of four giant sheets of "
"reinforced glass inserted into a window frame.  It's currently closed.  This"
" one has been blocked out with duct tape.  You could remove the duct tape by"
" cutting it off."
msgstr ""
"Una ventana de cristal cuádruple reforzado. Consiste en cuatro láminas "
"gigantes de vidrio reforzado insertadas en un marco de ventana. Actualmente "
"está cerrada. Esta ha sido bloqueada con cinta adhesiva. Se puede quitar la "
"cinta adhesiva cortándola."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "plastic window"
msgstr "ventana de plástico"

#. ~ Description of terrain "plastic window"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid ""
"A closed makeshift window comprising a sheet of translucent, rigid plastic "
"secured in a wooden frame.  It'll do in a pinch."
msgstr ""
"Una ventana improvisada y cerrada que consiste en una lámina de plástico "
"rígido y translúcido sujeta a un marco de madera. Servirá en caso de apuro."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "open plastic window"
msgstr "ventana de plástico abierta"

#. ~ Description of terrain "open plastic window"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid ""
"A makeshift window comprising a sheet of translucent, rigid plastic secured "
"in a wooden frame.  It'll do in a pinch.  It's open and can be crawled "
"through."
msgstr ""
"Una ventana improvisada compuesta por una lámina de plástico rígido y "
"translúcido sujeta a un marco de madera. Servirá en caso de apuro. Está "
"abierta y se puede atravesar a gatas."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "plastic window with close.d curtains"
msgstr "ventana de plástico con cortinas cerradas"

#. ~ Description of terrain "plastic window with close.d curtains"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid ""
"A closed makeshift window with a closed curtain.  It's a sheet of "
"translucent, rigid plastic secured in a wooden frame.  There's a sheet drawn"
" across it to block the light.  It'll do in a pinch."
msgstr ""
"Una ventana improvisada con una cortina cerrada. Es una lámina de plástico "
"rígido y translúcido sujeta a un marco de madera. Hay una lámina que la "
"atraviesa para bloquear la luz. Servirá en caso de apuro."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "plastic window with curtains"
msgstr "ventana de plástico con cortinas"

#. ~ Description of terrain "plastic window with curtains"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid ""
"A closed makeshift window with an opened curtain.  It's a sheet of "
"translucent, rigid plastic secured in a wooden frame, with a sheet strung "
"about it to block the light as required.  It'll do in a pinch."
msgstr ""
"Una ventana improvisada cerrada con una cortina abierta. Es una lámina de "
"plástico rígido translúcido sujeta a un marco de madera, con una sábana "
"colgada alrededor para bloquear la luz cuando sea necesario. Servirá en caso"
" de necesidad."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "open plastic window with curtains"
msgstr "ventana de plástico con cortinas"

#. ~ Description of terrain "open plastic window with curtains"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid ""
"A makeshift window with an open curtain.  It's a sheet of translucent, rigid"
" plastic secured in a wooden frame, with a sheet strung about it to block "
"the light as required.  It'll do in a pinch.  It's open and can be crawled "
"through."
msgstr ""
"Una ventana improvisada con una cortina abierta. Es una lámina de plástico "
"rígido translúcido sujeta a un marco de madera, con una sábana colgada "
"alrededor para bloquear la luz cuando sea necesario. Servirá en caso de "
"necesidad. Está abierta y se puede pasar a gatas."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "reinforced plastic window"
msgstr "ventana de plástico reforzada"

#. ~ Description of terrain "reinforced plastic window"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid ""
"A closed reinforced makeshift window comprising three sheets of translucent,"
" rigid plastic secured in a wooden frame.  It'll do in a pinch."
msgstr ""
"Una ventana improvisada cerrada y reforzada que consta de tres láminas de "
"plástico rígido y translúcido sujetas a un marco de madera. Servirá en caso "
"de apuro."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "open reinforced plastic window"
msgstr "ventana abierta de plástico reforzado"

#. ~ Description of terrain "open reinforced plastic window"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid ""
"A reinforced makeshift window comprising three sheets of translucent, rigid "
"plastic secured in a wooden frame.  It'll do in a pinch.  It's open and can "
"be crawled through."
msgstr ""
"Una ventana improvisada y reforzada compuesta por tres láminas de plástico "
"rígido y translúcido sujetas a un marco de madera. Servirá en caso de apuro."
" Está abierta y se puede atravesar a gatas."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "reinforced plastic window with closed curtains"
msgstr "ventana de plástico reforzado con cortinas cerradas"

#. ~ Description of terrain "reinforced plastic window with closed curtains"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid ""
"A closed makeshift reinforced window with a closed curtain.  It's three "
"sheets of translucent, rigid plastic secured in a wooden frame.  There's a "
"sheet drawn across it to block the light.  It'll do in a pinch."
msgstr ""
"Una ventana improvisada reforzada con una cortina cerrada. Son tres láminas "
"de plástico rígido y translúcido sujetas a un marco de madera. Hay una "
"lámina que la atraviesa para bloquear la luz. Servirá en caso de apuro."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "reinforced plastic window with curtains"
msgstr "ventana de plástico reforzado con cortinas"

#. ~ Description of terrain "reinforced plastic window with curtains"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid ""
"A closed makeshift reinforced window with an opened curtain.  It's three "
"sheets of translucent, rigid plastic secured in a wooden frame, with sheets "
"strung about it to block the light as required.  It'll do in a pinch."
msgstr ""
"Una ventana reforzada e improvisada con una cortina abierta. Se trata de "
"tres láminas de plástico rígido y translúcido sujetas a un marco de madera, "
"con láminas atadas alrededor para bloquear la luz según sea necesario. "
"Servirá en caso de apuro."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "open reinforced plastic window with curtains"
msgstr "open reinforced plastic window with curtains"

#. ~ Description of terrain "open reinforced plastic window with curtains"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid ""
"A makeshift reinforced window with an opened curtain.  It's three sheets of "
"translucent, rigid plastic secured in a wooden frame, with a sheet strung "
"about it to block the light as required.  It'll do in a pinch.  It's open "
"and can be crawled through."
msgstr ""
"Una ventana reforzada improvisada con una cortina abierta. Se trata de tres "
"láminas de plástico rígido y translúcido sujetas a un marco de madera, con "
"una lámina colgada alrededor para bloquear la luz cuando sea necesario. "
"Servirá en caso de apuro. Está abierta y se puede atravesar a gatas."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "skylight frame"
msgstr "marco de tragaluz"

#. ~ Description of terrain "skylight frame"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "A wooden skylight frame."
msgstr "Un marco de madera de un tragaluz."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "tempered glass window"
msgstr "ventana de cristal templado"

#. ~ Description of terrain "tempered glass window"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid ""
"A closed tempered glass window.  Consists of a giant sheet of tempered glass"
" inserted into a window frame."
msgstr ""
"Una ventana cerrada de vidrio templado. Consiste en una lámina gigante de "
"vidrio templado insertada en un marco de ventana."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "open tempered glass window"
msgstr "ventana de cristal templado abierta"

#. ~ Description of terrain "open tempered glass window"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid ""
"A tempered glass window.  Consists of a giant sheet of tempered glass "
"inserted into a window frame.  It's open and can be crawled through."
msgstr ""
"Una ventana de vidrio templado. Consiste en una lámina gigante de vidrio "
"templado insertada en el marco de una ventana. Está abierta y se puede "
"atravesar."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "tempered glass window with closed curtains"
msgstr "ventana de cristal templado con cortinas cerradas"

#. ~ Description of terrain "tempered glass window with closed curtains"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid ""
"A closed tempered window with a fancy curtain on the inside that is closed "
"to block visibility and shut out any light."
msgstr ""
"Una ventana templada cerrada con una cortina de lujo en el interior que se "
"cierra para bloquear la visibilidad y cerrar cualquier luz."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "tempered glass window with curtains"
msgstr "ventana de vidrio templado con cortinas"

#. ~ Description of terrain "tempered glass window with curtains"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid ""
"A closed tempered window with a fancy curtain on the inside that can be "
"drawn closed to block visibility and shut out any light."
msgstr ""
"Una ventana templada cerrada con una elegante cortina en el interior que "
"puede cerrarse para bloquear la visibilidad y dejar fuera la luz."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "open tempered glass window with curtains"
msgstr "open tempered glass window with curtains"

#. ~ Description of terrain "open tempered glass window with curtains"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid ""
"A tempered window with a fancy curtain on the inside that can be drawn "
"closed to block visibility and shut out any light.  It's open and can be "
"crawled through."
msgstr ""
"Una ventana templada con una elegante cortina en el interior que puede "
"cerrarse para bloquear la visibilidad y dejar fuera la luz. Está abierta y "
"se puede atravesar a gatas."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid "porthole"
msgstr "ojo de buey"

#. ~ Description of terrain "porthole"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-windows.json
msgid ""
"A thick round window surrounded with a strong metal frame, the window is "
"sealed closed."
msgstr ""
"Una gruesa ventana redonda rodeada de un fuerte marco metálico, la ventana "
"se cierra herméticamente."

