msgstr "escaleras de madera a medio construir"

#. ~ Description of terrain "half-built wooden stairs"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-zlevel-transitions.json
msgid ""
"Half of a wooden staircase.  Some work still needs to be done before this "
"staircase is complete."
msgstr ""
"La mitad de una escalera de madera. Todavía hay que hacer algo de trabajo "
"antes de que esta escalera esté completa."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-zlevel-transitions.json
msgid "broken wooden stairs"
msgstr "escaleras de madera rotas"

#. ~ Description of terrain "broken wooden stairs"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-zlevel-transitions.json
msgid ""
"A number of planks are missing and the structure is beginning to sag and "
"fall apart.  It's going to need quite a bit of work to repair this "
"staircase."
msgstr ""
"Faltan varias tablas y la estructura está empezando a caerse y a "
"desmoronarse. Vas a necesitar bastante trabajo para reparar esta escalera."

#. ~ Description of terrain "wooden stairs"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-zlevel-transitions.json
msgid "A wooden staircase leading up"
msgstr "Una escalera de madera que conduce hacia arriba"

