#. ~ Description of magazine "light battery (high-capacity)"
#: data/json/items/battery.json
msgid ""
"This is a high-capacity light battery cell, universally compatible with all "
"kinds of small devices."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una célula de batería ligera de alta capacidad, universalmente "
"compatible con todo tipo de dispositivos pequeños."

#. ~ Magazine name
#: data/json/items/battery.json
