msgid_plural "Torso Alloy Plating CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Placas de Aleación Para Torso"
msgstr[1] "MBC Placas de Aleación Para Torso"
msgstr[2] "MBC Placas de Aleación Para Torso"

#. ~ Description of "Torso Alloy Plating CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"An advanced protective mesh that weaves into the user's flesh, protecting it"
" from physical trauma at the cost of mild encumbrance."
msgstr ""
"Una malla protectora avanzada que se entrelaza con la piel del usuario, "
"protegiéndolo de traumas físicos a costa de un poco de estorbo."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Battery System CBM"
msgid_plural "Battery System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Sistema de Baterías"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Sistema de Baterías"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Sistema de Baterías"

#. ~ Description of "Battery System CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A battery draining attachment to make use of the energy contained in normal,"
" everyday batteries."
msgstr ""
"Un sistema de carga de baterías biónicas, que permite utilizar la energía "
"contenida en las baterías normales y habituales."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Monomolecular Blade CBM"
msgid_plural "Monomolecular Blade CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Cuchilla Monomolecular"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Cuchilla Monomolecular"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Cuchilla Monomolecular"

#. ~ Description of "Monomolecular Blade CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A deadly foot-long blade made of advanced material that is installed inside "
"the forearm, capable of being extended through the back of the user's wrist "
"at the cost of a small amount of power.  Though exceptionally sharp, it will"
" prevent the user from holding anything else while extended."
msgstr ""
"Una cuchilla mortal hecha de materiales avanzados que esta instalada dentro "
"de tu antebrazo, capaz de ser extendida a través de la muñeca del usuario "
"con un coste pequeño de energía biónica. Aunque excepcionalmente afilada, no"
" te permitirá agarrar nada con la mano cuando este extendida."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Shotgun Arm CBM"
msgid_plural "Shotgun Arm CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Brazo Escopeta "
msgstr[1] "MBCs Brazo Escopeta "
msgstr[2] "MBCs Brazo Escopeta "

#. ~ Description of "Shotgun Arm CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A concealed, single shot 12 gauge shotgun that is implanted inside the left "
"forearm.  Perfect in a pinch."
msgstr ""
"Una escopeta escondida de un solo tiro del calibre 12 que se implanta dentro"
" del antebrazo izquierdo. Perfecta en caso de necesidad."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Blood Analysis CBM"
msgid_plural "Blood Analysis CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Análisis de Sangre"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Análisis de Sangre"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Análisis de Sangre"

#. ~ Description of "Blood Analysis CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Small sensors that are implanted in the user's heart, allowing them to "
"analyze their blood.  This will detect many illnesses, drugs, and other "
"conditions."
msgstr ""
"Pequeños sensores que son implantados en el corazón del usuario, "
"permitiéndoles analizar su sangre. Esto detectará muchas enfermedades, "
"drogas y otras condiciones."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Blood Filter CBM"
msgid_plural "Blood Filter CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Filtro de Sangre"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Filtro de Sangre"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Filtro de Sangre"

#. ~ Description of "Blood Filter CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A filtration system that is installed in the heart and can actively filter "
"out chemical impurities, primarily drugs, with limited impact on viruses.  "
"Note that it is not a targeted filter; ALL drugs in the system will be "
"affected."
msgstr ""
"Un sistema de filtración que se instala en el corazón y puede filtrar "
"activamente las impurezas químicas, principalmente los fármacos, con un "
"impacto limitado en los virus. Tenga en cuenta que no es un filtro dirigido;"
" TODOS los fármacos del sistema se verán afectados."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Cable Charger System CBM"
msgid_plural "Cable Charger System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Sistema Cargador Por Cable"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Sistema Cargador Por Cable"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Sistema Cargador Por Cable"

#. ~ Description of "Cable Charger System CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A complex port that is mounted above the hip.  While active, it will "
"recharge bionic power when connected to a battery via jumper cable."
msgstr ""
"Un complejo puerto que se monta sobre la cadera. Mientras esté activo, "
"recargará la energía biónica cuando se conecte a una batería mediante un "
"cable puente."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Subdermal Carbon Filament CBM"
msgid_plural "Subdermal Carbon Filament CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Filamento de Carbono Subdérmico"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Filamento de Carbono Subdérmico"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Filamento de Carbono Subdérmico"

#. ~ Description of "Subdermal Carbon Filament CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A thin armor made of carbon nanotubes, implanted just beneath the skin.  "
"This reduces bashing damage by 2 and cutting damage by 4."
msgstr ""
"Una fina armadura hecha de nanotubos de carbono, implantada justo debajo de "
"la piel. Reduce el daño contundente en 2 y el daño cortante en 4."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Chain Lightning CBM"
msgid_plural "Chain Lightning CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Rayos Encadenados"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Rayos Encadenados"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Rayos Encadenados"

#. ~ Description of "Chain Lightning CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A chain lightning generator that emits a blast of lightning at a target, "
"leaving a trail of lightning in its wake and jumping to additional targets "
"within 4 tiles of the previous target."
msgstr ""
"Un generador de rayos en cadena que emite una ráfaga de rayos a un objetivo,"
" dejando un rastro de relámpagos a su paso y saltando a objetivos "
"adicionales en un radio de 4 casillas del objetivo anterior"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Bionic Claws CBM"
msgid_plural "Bionic Claws CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Garras Biónicas"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Garras Biónicas"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Garras Biónicas"

#. ~ Description of "Bionic Claws CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Vicious, retractable claws that are implanted inside the user's fingers.  "
"These do considerable cutting damage, but prevent the user from holding "
"anything else while extended."
msgstr ""
"Garras feroces y retráctiles que se implantan dentro de los dedos del "
"usuario. Hacen un considerable daño cortante, pero impiden al usuario "
"sujetar cualquier cosa mientras estén extendidas."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Internal Climate Control CBM"
msgid_plural "Internal Climate Control CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Control Interno Climático"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Control Interno Climático"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Control Interno Climático"

#. ~ Description of "Internal Climate Control CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A network of thermal piping which eases the effects of high and low ambient "
"temperatures once activated."
msgstr ""
"Una red de tuberías térmicas que alivia los efectos de las altas y bajas "
"temperaturas ambientales una vez activado,"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Cloaking System CBM"
msgid_plural "Cloaking System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Sistema de Camuflaje"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Sistema de Camuflaje"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Sistema de Camuflaje"

#. ~ Description of "Cloaking System CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"This high-power system uses a set of cameras and LEDs to make the user blend"
" into their surroundings, rendering them fully invisible to eyes and optical"
" sensors.  However, this doesn't prevent detection from other means such as "
"infrared, sonar, etc."
msgstr ""
"Este sistema de gran potencia utiliza un conjunto de cámaras y LED para que "
"el usuario se mimetice con su entorno, haciéndolo totalmente invisible a los"
" ojos y a los sensores ópticos. Sin embargo, esto no impide la detección por"
" otros medios, como los infrarrojos, el sonar, etc."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Close Quarters Battle CBM"
msgid_plural "Close Quarters Battle CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Pelea en Espacios Cerrados"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Pelea en Espacios Cerrados"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Pelea en Espacios Cerrados"

#. ~ Description of "Close Quarters Battle CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A set of bionic processors and databanks, loaded with martial arts combat "
"programs.  While active, the CQB module will improve the user's hand-to-hand"
" combat skills, but prevents them from improving them through combat "
"experience."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de procesadores biónicos y bancos de datos, cargados con "
"programas de combate de artes marciales. Mientras esté activo, el módulo CQB"
" mejorará las habilidades de combate cuerpo a cuerpo del usuario, pero le "
"impide mejorarlas mediante la experiencia de combate."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Wired Reflexes CBM"
msgid_plural "Wired Reflexes CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Reflejos Conectados"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Reflejos Conectados"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Reflejos Conectados"

#. ~ Description of "Wired Reflexes CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Bionic nerve stimulators that greatly enhance reaction times, granting a +2 "
"bonus to dexterity."
msgstr ""
"Estimuladores nerviosos biónicos que mejoran enormemente los tiempos de "
"reacción, otorgando una bonificación de +2 a la destreza."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Expanded Digestive System CBM"
msgid_plural "Expanded Digestive System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Sistema Digestivo Expandido"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Sistema Digestivo Expandido"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Sistema Digestivo Expandido"

#. ~ Description of "Expanded Digestive System CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"This module contains three synthetic stomachs and industrial-grade "
"intestines which replace the user's corresponding organs.  Not only will "
"these extract much more nutrition from food, but also increase the user's "
"resistance to foodborne illness, and occasionally allow the digestion of "
"rotten food.  Installing this CBM will correct any abnormalities in the "
"patient's digestive system."
msgstr ""
"Este módulo contiene tres estómagos sintéticos e intestinos de grado "
"industrial que sustituyen a los órganos correspondientes del usuario. No "
"sólo extraerán mucha más nutrición de los alimentos, sino que también "
"aumentarán la resistencia del usuario a las enfermedades transmitidas por "
"los alimentos, y ocasionalmente permitirán la digestión de alimentos "
"podridos. La instalación de este MBC corregirá cualquier anomalía en el "
"sistema digestivo del paciente."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Enhanced Hearing CBM"
msgid_plural "Enhanced Hearing CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Audición Mejorada"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Audición Mejorada"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Audición Mejorada"

#. ~ Description of "Enhanced Hearing CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"While this bionic is active, the user's hearing will be drastically "
"improved, allowing them to hear ten times better than the average person.  "
"Additionally, high-intensity sounds will be automatically dampened before "
"they can damage their hearing."
msgstr ""
"Mientras este biónico esté activo, la audición del usuario mejorará "
"drásticamente, permitiéndole oír diez veces mejor que la persona promedio. "
"Adicionalmente, los sonidos de alta intensidad se amortiguarán "
"automáticamente antes de que puedan dañar su audición."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Directional EMP CBM"
msgid_plural "Directional EMP CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC PEM Direccional"
msgstr[1] "MBCs PEM Direccional"
msgstr[2] "MBCs PEM Direccional"

#. ~ Description of "Directional EMP CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Small parabolic EMP field generators that are mounted in the palm of the "
"user's right hand.  These can be used to instantly fire a wide, but short-"
"ranged blast which will disable electronics and robots."
msgstr ""
"Pequeños generadores de campo EMP parabólicos que se montan en la palma de "
"la mano derecha del usuario. Estos pueden ser usados para disparar "
"instantáneamente una amplia, pero de corto alcance explosión que desactivará"
" la electrónica y los robots."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "EMP Projector CBM"
msgid_plural "EMP Projector CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Proyector PEM"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Proyector PEM"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Proyector PEM"

#. ~ Description of "EMP Projector CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A ranged EMP generator system that is implanted in the user's right arm and "
"hand.  The system fires precise, single-target pulses that require time to "
"aim.  Extremely effective against electronic targets but mostly useless "
"otherwise."
msgstr ""
"Un sistema generador de EMP a distancia que se implanta en el brazo y la "
"mano derecha del usuario. El sistema dispara pulsos precisos de un solo "
"objetivo que requieren tiempo para apuntar. Extremadamente efectivo contra "
"objetivos electrónicos pero mayormente inútil de otra manera."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Ethanol Burner CBM"
msgid_plural "Ethanol Burner CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Quemador de Etanol"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Quemador de Etanol"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Quemador de Etanol"

#. ~ Description of "Ethanol Burner CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A reactor that burns alcohol as fuel in an extremely efficient reaction.  It"
" can store up to 500ml and accepts ethanol, methanol and denatured alcohol "
"as fuel."
msgstr ""
"Un reactor que quema alcohol como combustible en una reacción extremadamente"
" eficiente. Puede almacenar hasta 500 ml y acepta etanol, metanol y alcohol "
"desnaturalizado como combustible."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Aero-Evaporator CBM"
msgid_plural "Aero-Evaporator CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Aero-evaporador"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Aero-evaporador"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Aero-evaporador"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Diamond Cornea CBM"
msgid_plural "Diamond Cornea CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Córnea de Diamante"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Córnea de Diamante"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Córnea de Diamante"

#. ~ Description of "Diamond Cornea CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A set of diamond corneas which greatly enhance the user's vision, granting a"
" +2 bonus to perception."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de córneas de diamante que mejoran enormemente la visión del "
"usuario, otorgando una bonificación de +2 a la percepción."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Telescopic Eyes CBM"
msgid_plural "Telescopic Eyes CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Ojos Telescópicos"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Ojos Telescópicos"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Ojos Telescópicos"

#. ~ Description of "Telescopic Eyes CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"An array of high-powered, auto-focusing lenses that replaces much of the "
"material in the inner eye.  This fixes any vision problems and allows for an"
" increased vision range akin to binoculars."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de lentes de alta potencia y autoenfoque que sustituye gran "
"parte del material del interior del ojo. Esto soluciona cualquier problema "
"de visión y permite un mayor rango de visión similar al de unos prismáticos."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Facial Distortion CBM"
msgid_plural "Facial Distortion CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Distorsión Facial"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Distorsión Facial"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Distorsión Facial"

#. ~ Description of "Facial Distortion CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Through controlled application of electrochemical impulses, this bionic "
"module lets the user alter their facial structure so as to subtly affect the"
" reactions of others.  This grants a bonus to all social interactions."
msgstr ""
"Mediante la aplicación controlada de impulsos electroquímicos, este módulo "
"biónico permite al usuario alterar su estructura facial para afectar "
"sutilmente las reacciones de los demás. Esto otorga una bonificación a todas"
" las interacciones sociales."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Dielectric Capacitance System CBM"
msgid_plural "Dielectric Capacitance System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Sistema de Capacitancia Dieléctrica"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Sistema de Capacitancia Dieléctrica"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Sistema de Capacitancia Dieléctrica"

#. ~ Description of "Dielectric Capacitance System CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A network of miniature piezoelectric capacitors, implanted throughout the "
"body to protect from external electrical discharge."
msgstr ""
"Una red de condensadores piezoeléctricos en miniatura, implantados en todo "
"el cuerpo para proteger de las descargas eléctricas externas."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Fingerhack CBM"
msgid_plural "Fingerhack CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Dedo Hack"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Dedo Hack"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Dedo Hack"

#. ~ Description of "Fingerhack CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A miniature electrohack, surgically embedded in a finger of the right hand."
"  This is an all-purpose hacking unit used to override control panels and "
"the like, but not computers.  Computer proficiency is important, and a "
"failed use may cause damage."
msgstr ""
"Un electrohack en miniatura, incrustado quirúrgicamente en un dedo de la "
"mano derecha. Esta es una unidad de hackeo polivalente utilizada para anular"
" paneles de control y similares, pero no ordenadores. El dominio de la "
"computadora es importante, y un uso fallido puede causar daños."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Flashbang Generator CBM"
msgid_plural "Flashbang Generator CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Generador de Destellos"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Generador de Destellos"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Generador de Destellos"

#. ~ Description of "Flashbang Generator CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A combination of LEDs and speakers that create a flash and sound comparable "
"to a flashbang grenade, deafening and blinding nearby enemies."
msgstr ""
"Una combinación de LEDs y altavoces que crean un destello y un sonido "
"comparable al de una granada de destello, ensordeciendo y cegando a los "
"enemigos cercanos."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Cranial Flashlight CBM"
msgid_plural "Cranial Flashlight CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Linterna Craneal"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Linterna Craneal"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Linterna Craneal"

#. ~ Description of "Cranial Flashlight CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A small, but powerful LED flashlight that is mounted between the eyes."
msgstr "Una pequeña pero potente linterna LED que se monta entre los ojos."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "LED Tattoo CBM"
msgid_plural "LED Tattoo CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Tatuaje LED"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Tatuajes LED"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Tatuaje LED"

#. ~ Description of "LED Tattoo CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"An LED display implanted beneath the epidermis that can display patterns or "
"pictures through the skin.  When active it glows dimly, providing a very "
"small amount of light."
msgstr ""
"Una pantalla LED implantada debajo de la epidermis que puede mostrar "
"patrones o imágenes a través de la piel. Cuando está activo, brilla "
"tenuemente, proporcionando una cantidad muy pequeña de luz."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Integrated Dosimeter CBM"
msgid_plural "Integrated Dosimeter CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Dosímetro Integrado"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Dosímetro Integrado"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Dosímetro Integrado"

#. ~ Description of "Integrated Dosimeter CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Small radiation sensors that are implanted throughout the body, allowing the"
" user to analyze their level of absorbed radiation.  They will also alert "
"the user whenever exposed to environmental radiation."
msgstr ""
"Pequeños sensores de radiación que se implantan en todo el cuerpo y que "
"permiten al usuario analizar su nivel de radiación absorbida. También "
"alertan al usuario cuando se expone a la radiación ambiental."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Respirator CBM"
msgid_plural "Respirator CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Respirador"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Respirador"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Respirador"

#. ~ Description of "Respirator CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A complex respiration augmentation system that increases the user's maximal "
"oxygen uptake and allows for underwater breathing akin to gills.  Will "
"automatically activate if the user is drowning."
msgstr ""
"Un complejo sistema de aumento de la respiración que aumenta la captación "
"máxima de oxígeno del usuario y te permite respirar bajo el agua como si "
"tuvieras branquias. Se activa automáticamente si el usuario se está "
"ahogando."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Terranian Sonar CBM"
msgid_plural "Terranian Sonar CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Sonar Terrestre"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Sonar Terrestre"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Sonar Terrestre"

#. ~ Description of "Terranian Sonar CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Precision sonar equipment, implanted in the feet to allow the detection of "
"below-ground movement, buried traps, and unstable terrain."
msgstr ""
"Equipo sonar de precisión, implantado en los pies para permitir la detección"
" de movimientos bajo tierra, trampas enterradas y terrenos inestables."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Heat Drain CBM"
msgid_plural "Heat Drain CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Drenaje de Calor"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Drenaje de Calor"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Drenaje de Calor"

#. ~ Description of "Heat Drain CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"While fighting unarmed against a warm-blooded opponent, there is a chance "
"that a successful hit will drain body heat, inflicting a small amount of "
"extra damage, and recharging the user's bionic power reserves slightly."
msgstr ""
"Al luchar sin armas contra un oponente de sangre caliente, existe la "
"posibilidad de que un golpe exitoso drene el calor del cuerpo, infligiendo "
"una pequeña cantidad de daño extra y recargando ligeramente las reservas de "
"poder biónico del usuario."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Thermal Dissipation CBM"
msgid_plural "Thermal Dissipation CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Disipación Térmica"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Disipación Térmica"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Disipación Térmica"

#. ~ Description of "Thermal Dissipation CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Powerful heatsinks and supermaterials are woven into the user's flesh.  "
"While powered, this system will prevent external heat damage up to 2000 "
"degrees Fahrenheit.  Note that this does not affect the internal body "
"temperature."
msgstr ""
"Poderosos disipadores térmicos y supermateriales se tejen en la carne del "
"usuario. Cuando esta encendido, este sistema evitará daños por calor externo"
" hasta los 1090 grados Celsius. Tenga en cuenta que esto no afecta a la "
"temperatura interna del cuerpo."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Hydraulic Muscles CBM"
msgid_plural "Hydraulic Muscles CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Musculatura Hidráulica"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Musculatura Hidráulica"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Musculatura Hidráulica"

#. ~ Description of "Hydraulic Muscles CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A hydraulic muscle support system that when active, increases strength by "
"20."
msgstr ""
"Un sistema de apoyo muscular hidráulico que, cuando está activo, aumenta la "
"fuerza a 20."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Infrared Vision CBM"
msgid_plural "Infrared Vision CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Visión Infrarroja"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Visión Infrarroja"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Visión Infrarroja"

#. ~ Description of "Infrared Vision CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A bionic module that extends the range of vision into the infrared, allowing"
" the user to see warm-blooded creatures in the dark and through smoke."
msgstr ""
"Un módulo biónico que amplía el rango de visión al infrarrojo, permitiendo "
"al usuario ver criaturas de sangre caliente en la oscuridad y a través del "
"humo."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Cerebral Booster CBM"
msgid_plural "Cerebral Booster CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Estimulador Cerebral"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Estimulador Cerebral"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Estimulador Cerebral"

#. ~ Description of "Cerebral Booster CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Bionic coprocessors that are implanted in the brain, granting a +2 bonus to "
"intelligence."
msgstr ""
"Coprocesadores biónicos que se implantan en el cerebro, otorgando un "
"bonificación +2 a la inteligencia."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Finger-Mounted Laser CBM"
msgid_plural "Finger-Mounted Laser CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Dedo Láser"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Dedo Láser"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Dedo Láser"

#. ~ Description of "Finger-Mounted Laser CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A small, high-powered laser that is embedded in the fingertip.  This long "
"range weapon is not incredibly damaging, but is very accurate, and has the "
"potential to start fires."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño láser de alta potencia que está incrustado en la punta del dedo. "
"Esta arma de largo alcance no es increíblemente dañina, pero es muy precisa,"
" y tiene el potencial de iniciar incendios."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Leukocyte Breeder System CBM"
msgid_plural "Leukocyte Breeder System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Sistema Cultivador de Leucocitos"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Sistema Cultivador de Leucocitos"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Sistema Cultivador de Leucocitos"

#. ~ Description of "Leukocyte Breeder System CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Bionic stimulators which augment the user's haematopoiesis system, allowing "
"them to accelerate white blood cell production using bionic power.  It is "
"designed for continuous use and may cause unpleasant side effects when "
"turned off."
msgstr ""
"Estimuladores biónicos que aumentan el sistema de hematopoyesis del usuario,"
" permitiéndole acelerar la producción de glóbulos blancos usando energía "
"biónica. Está diseñado para un uso continuo y puede causar efectos "
"secundarios desagradables cuando se apaga."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Finger Lighter CBM"
msgid_plural "Finger Lighter CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Dedo Mechero"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Dedo Mechero"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Dedo Mechero"

#. ~ Description of "Finger Lighter CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Powerful fire starters which extend from the tip of both hands' index "
"fingers."
msgstr ""
"Poderosos iniciadores de fuego que se extienden desde la punta de los dedos "
"índices de ambas manos."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Fingerpick CBM"
msgid_plural "Fingerpick CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Dedo Ganzúa"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Dedo Ganzúa"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Dedo Ganzúa"

#. ~ Description of "Fingerpick CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"An electronic lockpick that is embedded in a fingertip.  This automatic "
"system will quickly unlock all but the most advanced key locks without any "
"skill required on the part of the user."
msgstr ""
"Una ganzúa electrónica que está incrustada en la punta de un dedo. Este "
"sistema automático desbloqueará rápidamente todas las cerraduras de llave, "
"excepto las más avanzadas, sin necesidad de ninguna habilidad por parte del "
"usuario."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Electromagnetic Unit CBM"
msgid_plural "Electromagnetic Unit CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Unidad Electromagnética"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Unidad Electromagnética"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Unidad Electromagnética"

#. ~ Description of "Electromagnetic Unit CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A powerful electromagnet that is implanted into the user's right hand, "
"allowing them to indiscriminately pull all nearby magnetic objects towards "
"them.  Unlucky bystanders might be injured or killed by flying objects."
msgstr ""
"Un poderoso electroimán que se implanta en la mano derecha del usuario, "
"permitiéndole atraer indiscriminadamente hacia él todos los objetos "
"magnéticos cercanos. Los desafortunados espectadores pueden resultar heridos"
" o muertos por objetos voladores."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Nictating Membrane CBM"
msgid_plural "Nictating Membrane CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Membrana Nictante"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Membrana Nictante"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Membrana Nictante"

#. ~ Description of "Nictating Membrane CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A thin membrane that closes over the eyes while underwater, negating any "
"vision penalties."
msgstr ""
"Una fina membrana que se cierra sobre los ojos mientras estás bajo el agua, "
"negando cualquier penalización a la visión."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Enhanced Memory Banks CBM"
msgid_plural "Enhanced Memory Banks CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Bancos de Memoria Mejorados"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Bancos de Memoria Mejorados"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Bancos de Memoria Mejorados"

#. ~ Description of "Enhanced Memory Banks CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A set of highly-advanced quantum storage drives used to enhance memory.  "
"While active, they increase the rate that the user learns skills."
msgstr ""
"Es un conjunto muy avanzado de discos de almacenamiento cuántico, usados "
"para mejorar la memoria. Cuando está activado, incrementa la velocidad para "
"aprender habilidades."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Metabolic Interchange CBM"
msgid_plural "Metabolic Interchange CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Intercambio Metabólico"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Intercambio Metabólico"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Intercambio Metabólico"

#. ~ Description of "Metabolic Interchange CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"This module interconnects the user's digestive system and power supply, "
"letting them replenish bionic energy by burning calories."
msgstr ""
"Este módulo interconecta el sistema digestivo y la fuente de alimentación "
"del usuario, permitiéndole reponer la energía biónica mediante la quema de "
"calorías."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Weather Reader CBM"
msgid_plural "Weather Reader CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Lector Climático"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Lector Climático"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Lector Climático"

#. ~ Description of "Weather Reader CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A multitude of scientific instruments and sensors collect environmental "
"data.  The data is compiled and presented as a simple readout of the current"
" weather.  It also passively tells the user their external temperature."
msgstr ""
"Una multitud de instrumentos y sensores científicos recogen datos "
"medioambientales. Los datos son compilados y presentados como una simple "
"lectura del clima actual. También le dice pasivamente al usuario su "
"temperatura externa."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Repair Nanobots CBM"
msgid_plural "Repair Nanobots CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Nanobots Reparadores"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Nanobots Reparadores"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Nanobots Reparadores"

#. ~ Description of "Repair Nanobots CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A fleet of tiny dormant robots.  While activated they will flit about the "
"user's body, repairing damage and stopping bleeding at the cost of power."
msgstr ""
"Una flota de pequeños robots dormidos. Cuando se activen, revolotearán por "
"el cuerpo del usuario, reparando los daños y deteniendo la hemorragia a "
"costa de la energía."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Artificial Night Generator CBM"
msgid_plural "Artificial Night Generator CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Generador Artificial de Noche"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Generador Artificial de Noche"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Generador Artificial de Noche"

#. ~ Description of "Artificial Night Generator CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"When active, this bionic eliminates all light within a 15 tile radius "
"through destructive interference."
msgstr ""
"Cuando está activo, este biónico elimina toda la luz en un radio de 15 "
"posiciones a través de interferencias destructivas."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Implanted Night Vision CBM"
msgid_plural "Implanted Night Vision CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Visión Nocturna Implantada"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Visión Nocturna Implantada"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Visión Nocturna Implantada"

#. ~ Description of "Implanted Night Vision CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"This bionic module modifies the user's eyes to amplify existing light, "
"allowing them to see in the dark."
msgstr ""
"Este módulo biónico modifica los ojos del usuario para amplificar la luz "
"existente, permitiéndole ver en la oscuridad."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Offensive Defense System CBM"
msgid_plural "Offensive Defense System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Sistema de Defensa Ofensiva"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Sistema de Defensa Ofensiva"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Sistema de Defensa Ofensiva"

#. ~ Description of "Offensive Defense System CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A thin forcefield gets projected around the user's body, continually "
"draining power.  This field does not deflect attacks, but rather delivers a "
"strong shock, damaging unarmed attackers and those with a conductive weapon."
msgstr ""
"Un delgado campo de fuerza se proyecta alrededor del cuerpo del usuario, "
"drenando continuamente la energía. Este campo no desvía los ataques, sino "
"que da una fuerte descarga eléctrica, dañando a los atacantes desarmados y a"
" los que tienen un arma conductora."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Sensory Dulling CBM"
msgid_plural "Sensory Dulling CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Adormecimiento Sensorial"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Adormecimiento Sensorial"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Adormecimiento Sensorial"

#. ~ Description of "Sensory Dulling CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"This module lets the user's nervous system inhibit pain signals, allowing "
"them to dull their senses at will.  However, the use of this system may "
"cause delayed reaction times and drowsiness."
msgstr ""
"Este módulo permite al sistema nervioso del usuario inhibir las señales de "
"dolor, permitiéndole embotar sus sentidos a voluntad. Sin embargo, el uso de"
" este sistema puede causar retrasos en los tiempos de reacción y "
"somnolencia."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Power Armor Interface CBM"
msgid_plural "Power Armor Interface CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Interfaz de Armadura de Energía"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Interfaz de Armadura de Energía"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Interfaz de Armadura de Energía"

#. ~ Description of "Power Armor Interface CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Interfaces the user's bionic power system with the internal charging port on"
" suits of power armor, allowing them to draw from the user's bionic power "
"banks."
msgstr ""
"Interfaz del sistema de energía biónica del usuario con el puerto de carga "
"interno de los trajes de armadura de energía, permitiendo extraer energía de"
" los bancos de energía biónica del usuario."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Power Armor Interface Mk. II CBM"
msgid_plural "Power Armor Interface Mk. II CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Interfaz MCB de Armadura de Energía Mk. II"
msgstr[1] "Interfaces MBCs de Armadura de Energía Mk. II"
msgstr[2] "Interfaces MBCs de Armadura de Energía Mk. II"

#. ~ Description of "Power Armor Interface Mk. II CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Interfaces the user's bionic power system with the internal charging port on"
" suits of power armor, allowing them to draw from the user's bionic power "
"banks.  Twice as efficient as the Mk. I model.  The Mk. II was designed by "
"DoubleTech Inc., to meet the popularity of the Mk. II power armor series."
msgstr ""
"Interfaz del sistema de energía biónica del usuario con el puerto de carga "
"interno de los trajes de armadura de energía, permitidlhs extraer energía de"
" los bancos de energía biónica del usuario. Dos veces más eficiente que el "
"modelo Mk. I. El Mk. II fue diseñado por DoubleTech Inc., para satisfacer la"
" popularidad de la serie de armaduras de energía Mk. II."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Power Storage CBM"
msgid_plural "Power Storage CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Almacenamiento de Energía"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Almacenamiento de Energía"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Almacenamiento de Energía"

#. ~ Description of "Power Storage CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A Compact Bionics Module that upgrades the user's power capacity by 100 "
"units.  Having at least one of these is a prerequisite to using powered "
"bionics.  The user will also need a power supply, found in various CBMs."
msgstr ""
"Un Módulo Biónico Compacto que aumenta la capacidad de energía del usuario "
"en 100 unidades. Tener al menos uno de estos módulos es un requisito previo "
"para poder usar biónica que usa energía. El usuario también necesitará una "
"fuente de energía, que se encuentra en varios MBCs."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Power Storage Mk. II CBM"
msgid_plural "Power Storage Mk. II CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Almacenamiento MCB de Energía Mk. II"
msgstr[1] "Almacenamientos MBCs de Energía Mk. II"
msgstr[2] "Almacenamientos MBCs de Energía Mk. II"

#. ~ Description of "Power Storage Mk. II CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A Compact Bionics Module developed at DoubleTech Industries as a replacement"
" for the highly successful Power Storage CBM.  Increases the user's power "
"capacity by 250 units."
msgstr ""
"Un Módulo Biónico Compacto desarrollado en las Industrias DoubleTech como "
"reemplazo del altamente exitoso MBC de Almacenamiento de Energía. Aumenta la"
" capacidad de energía del usuario en 250 unidades."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Probability Travel CBM"
msgid_plural "Probability Travel CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Viaje Cuántico"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Viaje Cuántico"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Viaje Cuántico"

#. ~ Description of "Probability Travel CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Increases the body's wavelength, allowing the user to quantum tunnel through"
" walls, reappearing on the other side.  Power drain in standby is minimal, "
"but each tile tunneled through costs 250 bionic power."
msgstr ""
"Aumenta la longitud de onda del cuerpo, permitiendo al usuario hacer un "
"túnel cuántico a través de los muros, reapareciendo en el otro lado. El "
"consumo de energía en espera es mínimo, pero cada posición que se atraviesa "
"cuesta 250 unidades de energía biónica."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Air Filtration System CBM"
msgid_plural "Air Filtration System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Sistema de Filtrado de Aire"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Sistema de Filtrado de Aire"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Sistema de Filtrado de Aire"

#. ~ Description of "Air Filtration System CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"An advanced filtration system that is implanted in the trachea.  If toxins, "
"or airborne diseases find their way into the windpipe, the filter will "
"attempt to remove them."
msgstr ""
"Un avanzado sistema de filtración que se implanta en la tráquea. Si las "
"toxinas, o enfermedades transmitidas por el aire encuentran su camino hacia "
"la tráquea, el filtro intentará eliminarlas."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Radiation Scrubber System CBM"
msgid_plural "Radiation Scrubber System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Sistema Depurador de Radiación"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Sistema Depurador de Radiación"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Sistema Depurador de Radiación"

#. ~ Description of "Radiation Scrubber System CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A system of advanced piezomechanical blood filters that are implanted "
"throughout your body, allowing the user to purge themself of absorbed "
"radiation at the cost of some bionic power."
msgstr ""
"Un sistema de avanzados filtros piezomecánicos de sangre que se implantan en"
" todo el cuerpo, permitiendo al usuario purgar la radiación absorbida a "
"costa de energía biónica."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Fingertip Razors CBM"
msgid_plural "Fingertip Razors CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Uña Cuchillas"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Uña Cuchillas"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Uña Cuchillas"

#. ~ Description of "Fingertip Razors CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A set of ten double-edged, four centimeter long razor-sharp claws that are "
"implanted underneath the fingernails.  These will deal a small amount of "
"unarmed slashing damage whenever the user's fingertips are uncovered."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de diez garras de doble filo, de cuatro cm de largo, que se "
"implantan debajo de las uñas. Estas garras causarán una pequeña cantidad de "
"daño por corte sin armas cuando las puntas de los dedos del usuario no estan"
" cubiertas."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Gasoline Fuel Cell CBM"
msgid_plural "Gasoline Fuel Cell CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Interfaz Mk. II de Armadura de Energía"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Pila Combustible de Gasolina"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Pila Combustible de Gasolina"

#. ~ Description of "Gasoline Fuel Cell CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A small gasoline fuel cell able to convert gasoline to bionic power.  It's "
"connected to a diffuse network of bio-plastic bladders able to hold up to "
"500 ml of gasoline."
msgstr ""
"Una pequeña célula de combustible de gasolina capaz de convertir la gasolina"
" en energía biónica. Está conectada a una red difusa de vejigas bio-"
"plásticas capaces de contener hasta 500 ml de gasolina."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Recycler Unit CBM"
msgid_plural "Recycler Unit CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Unidad Recicladora"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Unidad Recicladora"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Unidad Recicladora"

#. ~ Description of "Recycler Unit CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A series of filters and processors that is implanted in the user's digestive"
" system, allowing them to reclaim waste liquid and, to a lesser degree, "
"nutrients.  The net effect is a greatly reduced need to eat and drink."
msgstr ""
"Una serie de filtros y procesadores que se implanta en el sistema digestivo "
"del usuario, permitiéndole recuperar el líquido de desecho y, en menor "
"grado, nutrientes. El efecto neto es una gran reducción de la necesidad de "
"comer y beber."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Remote Controller CBM"
msgid_plural "Remote Controller CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Controlador Remoto"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Controlador Remoto"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Controlador Remoto"

#. ~ Description of "Remote Controller CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A small module that connects to the user's brain and allows them to "
"interface with nearby devices with wireless capabilities."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño módulo que se conecta al cerebro del usuario y le permite "
"interactuar con dispositivos cercanos con capacidades inalámbricas."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Sonic Resonator CBM"
msgid_plural "Sonic Resonator CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Resonador Sónico"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Resonador Sónico"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Resonador Sónico"

#. ~ Description of "Sonic Resonator CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"This bionic module allows the user's entire body to resonate at very high "
"power, creating a short-range shockwave.  While it will not do much damage "
"to creatures, solid objects such as walls and doors will be damaged."
msgstr ""
"Este módulo biónico permite que todo el cuerpo del usuario resuene a muy "
"alta potencia, creando una onda de choque de corto alcance. Aunque no "
"causará mucho daño a las criaturas, los objetos sólidos como los muros y las"
" puertas seran dañados."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Olfactory Mask CBM"
msgid_plural "Olfactory Mask CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Máscara Olfativa"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Máscara Olfativa"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Máscara Olfativa"

#. ~ Description of "Olfactory Mask CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"While this system is powered, the user's body will produce very little odor,"
" making it nearly impossible for creatures to track them by scent."
msgstr ""
"Mientras este sistema esté activado, el cuerpo del usuario producirá muy "
"poco olor, haciendo casi imposible que las criaturas lo rastreen por el "
"olor."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Electroshock Unit CBM"
msgid_plural "Electroshock Unit CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Unidad de Electroshock"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Unidad de Electroshock"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Unidad de Electroshock"

#. ~ Description of "Electroshock Unit CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"While fighting unarmed, or with a weapon that conducts electricity, there is"
" a chance that a successful hit will shock the user's opponent, inflicting "
"extra damage and disabling them temporarily at the cost of some energy."
msgstr ""
"Mientras luchas desarmado, o con un arma que conduce la electricidad, existe"
" la posibilidad de que un golpe con exito electrocute al oponente del "
"usuario, infligiendo un daño extra e incapacitándolo temporalmente a costa "
"de algo de energía."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Shockwave Generator CBM"
msgid_plural "Shockwave Generator CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Generador de Onda de Choque"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Generador de Onda de Choque"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Generador de Onda de Choque"

#. ~ Description of "Shockwave Generator CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"This bionic module generates a powerful shockwave, knocking back all nearby "
"creatures.  Targets are stunned briefly, take damage and additional stun "
"upon impact with impassable terrain, and knock back any creatures they "
"collide with."
msgstr ""
"Este módulo genera una onda de choque poderosa, empujando todas las "
"criaturas cercanas. Los objetivos serán dañados, aturdidos brevemente, "
"golpeados en el impacto contra el terreno intransitable, y empujarán a otras"
" criaturas con las que choquen."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Synaptic Accelerator CBM"
msgid_plural "Synaptic Accelerator CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Acelerador Sináptico"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Acelerador Sináptico"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Acelerador Sináptico"

#. ~ Description of "Synaptic Accelerator CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Bionic stimulators that enhance the nervous system, granting a 10% boost to "
"your speed."
msgstr ""
"Estimuladores biónicos que mejoran el sistema nervioso, dando un 10% de "
"impulso a su velocidad."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Muscle Augmentation CBM"
msgid_plural "Muscle Augmentation CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Aumento Muscular"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Aumento Muscular"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Aumento Muscular"

#. ~ Description of "Muscle Augmentation CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Myomer fibers that enhance the muscular system, granting a +2 bonus to "
"strength."
msgstr ""
"Fibras mioméricas que mejoran el sistema muscular, otorgando una "
"bonificación de +2 a la fuerza."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Autonomous Surgical Scalpels CBM"
msgid_plural "Autonomous Surgical Scalpels CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Bisturís Quirúrgicos Autónomos"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Bisturís Quirúrgicos Autónomos"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Bisturís Quirúrgicos Autónomos"

#. ~ Description of "Autonomous Surgical Scalpels CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A system of surgical grade scalpels that is implanted in the user's fingers."
"  They allow for automated precise cuts and can be used as a high-quality "
"butchering tool."
msgstr ""
"Un sistema de bisturís de grado quirúrgico que se implanta en los dedos del "
"usuario. Permiten realizar cortes precisos automatizados y pueden ser "
"utilizados como una herramienta de descuartizado de alta calidad."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Anti-Glare Compensators CBM"
msgid_plural "Anti-Glare Compensators CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Compensadores Anti-Reflejo"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Compensadores Anti-Reflejo"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Compensadores Anti-Reflejo"

#. ~ Description of "Anti-Glare Compensators CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A set of quick-reacting transition lenses that are installed over the user's"
" eyes.  They negate glare penalties, partially protect from bright flashes, "
"and protect the eyes when welding."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de lentes de transición de reacción rápida que se instalan sobre"
" los ojos del usuario. Anulan las penalizaciones por deslumbramiento, "
"protegen parcialmente de los destellos brillantes y protegen los ojos al "
"soldar."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Targeting System CBM"
msgid_plural "Targeting System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Sistema de Selección de Objetivos"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Sistema de Selección de Objetivos"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Sistema de Selección de Objetivos"

#. ~ Description of "Targeting System CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"This bionic module contains range finders and synchronizes the movement of "
"the user's eyes with their arms, to a degree.  Shots they fire will be much "
"more accurate, particularly at long ranges."
msgstr ""
"Este módulo biónico contiene telémetros y sincroniza el movimiento de los "
"ojos del usuario con sus brazos, hasta cierto punto. Los disparos que "
"realices serán mucho más precisos, sobre todo a larga distancia."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Teleportation Unit CBM"
msgid_plural "Teleportation Unit CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Unidad de Teletransporte"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Unidad de Teletransporte"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Unidad de Teletransporte"

#. ~ Description of "Teleportation Unit CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"This highly experimental unit folds space over short distances, instantly "
"transporting the user's body up to 25 feet in a random duration at the cost "
"of much power.  Note that prolonged or frequent use may have dangerous side "
"effects."
msgstr ""
"Esta unidad altamente experimental pliega el espacio en distancias cortas, "
"transportando instantáneamente el cuerpo del usuario hasta 7.5 metros en una"
" duración aleatoria a costa de mucha energía.  Tenga en cuenta que el uso "
"prolongado o frecuente puede tener efectos secundarios peligrosos."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Time Dilation CBM"
msgid_plural "Time Dilation CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Dilatación Temporal"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Dilatación Temporal"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Dilatación Temporal"

#. ~ Description of "Time Dilation CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"At the cost of all stored bionic power, the user may increase their body "
"speed and reactions dramatically, essentially freezing time.  Violent or "
"rapid movements may cause damage due to friction."
msgstr ""
"A costa de toda la energía biónica almacenada, el usuario puede aumentar la "
"velocidad y las reacciones de su cuerpo de forma drástica, esencialmente "
"congelando el tiempo. Los movimientos violentos o rápidos pueden causar "
"daños debido a la fricción."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Integrated Multitool CBM"
msgid_plural "Integrated Multitool CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Multiherramienta Integrada"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Multiherramienta Integrada"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Multiherramienta Integrada"

#. ~ Description of "Integrated Multitool CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A surgically implanted set of compact tools and a welder which runs off the "
"user's power banks.  Includes screwdriving heads, a multi-purpose knife, a "
"low-power impact wrench and a nail prying tool."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de herramientas compactas implantadas quirúrgicamente y un "
"soldador que funciona con los bancos de energía del usuario. Incluye "
"cabezales para atornillar, una navaja multiusos, una llave de impacto de "
"baja potencia y una herramienta para arrancar clavos."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Joint Torsion Ratchet CBM"
msgid_plural "Joint Torsion Ratchet CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Articulaciones Cinéticas"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Articulaciones Cinéticas"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Articulaciones Cinéticas"

#. ~ Description of "Joint Torsion Ratchet CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Torsion ratchets that replace the user's joints to slowly generate power "
"when they move.  These can be toggled to generate more power, but movement "
"will require more effort."
msgstr ""
"Unos engranajes reemplazan las articulaciones del usuario para generar "
"lentamente energía al moverse. Pueden activarse para generar más energía, "
"pero el movimiento requerirá más esfuerzo."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Joint Servo CBM"
msgid_plural "Joint Servo CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Articulaciones Servo"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Articulaciones Servo"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Articulaciones Servo"

#. ~ Description of "Joint Servo CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A set of servomotors that get installed on leg joints to provide power-"
"assisted movement.  They are optimized for running, but walking also "
"requires less effort while this bionic is active.  However, when it's "
"offline it will hamper the user's movement."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de servomotores que se instalan en las articulaciones de las "
"piernas para proporcionar un movimiento asistido. Están optimizados para "
"correr, pero caminar también requiere menos esfuerzo mientras este biónico "
"está activo. Sin embargo, cuando está desconectado, obstaculizará el "
"movimiento del usuario."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Uncanny Dodge CBM"
msgid_plural "Uncanny Dodge CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Evasión Asombrosa"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Evasión Asombrosa"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Evasión Asombrosa"

#. ~ Description of "Uncanny Dodge CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Bionic processors that augment the user's nervous system, allowing them to "
"dodge attacks beyond normal human capability."
msgstr ""
"Procesadores biónicos que aumentan el sistema nervioso del usuario, "
"permitiéndole esquivar ataques más allá de la capacidad humana normal."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Unified Power System CBM"
msgid_plural "Unified Power System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Sistema de Energía Unificado"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Sistema de Energía Unificado"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Sistema de Energía Unificado"

#. ~ Description of "Unified Power System CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A Unified Power System that is wired into the user's bionic power banks.  "
"Objects that run on a UPS can now directly draw power from the bionic power "
"supply."
msgstr ""
"Un Sistema de Energía Unificado que está conectado a los bancos de energía "
"biónica del usuario. Los objetos que funcionan con un UPS pueden ahora "
"obtener energía directamente de la fuente de energía biónica."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Internal Chronometer CBM"
msgid_plural "Internal Chronometer CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Cronómetro Interno"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Cronómetro Interno"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Cronómetro Interno"

#. ~ Description of "Internal Chronometer CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"This bionic module contains an atomic clock, complete with silent alarm "
"clock function."
msgstr ""
"Este módulo biónico contiene un reloj atómico completo, con función de "
"despertador silencioso."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Water Extraction Unit CBM"
msgid_plural "Water Extraction Unit CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Unidad de Extracción de Agua"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Unidad de Extracción de Agua"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Unidad de Extracción de Agua"

#. ~ Description of "Water Extraction Unit CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"This module contains nanotubes that are embedded in the palm of the hand to "
"pump any available fluid out of a dead body, cleanse it of impurities and "
"convert it into potable water.  Water container not included."
msgstr ""
"Este módulo contiene nanotubos que se incrustan en la palma de la mano para "
"bombear cualquier líquido disponible de un cadáver, limpiarlo de impurezas y"
" convertirlo en agua potable. No se incluye el contenedor de agua."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Intravenous Needletip CBM"
msgid_plural "Intravenous Needletip CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Aguja Intravenosa"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Aguja Intravenosa"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Aguja Intravenosa"

#. ~ Description of "Intravenous Needletip CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A small tube with a retractable needle that terminates in a net of tiny "
"hoses instead of a plunger.  Installed, it allows the user to draw "
"substances directly into their bloodstream akin to a regular syringe."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño tubo con una aguja retráctil que termina en una red de pequeñas "
"mangueras en lugar de un émbolo. Instalado, permite al usuario extraer "
"sustancias directamente a su corriente sanguínea como una jeringa normal."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Titanium Skeletal Bracing CBM"
msgid_plural "Titanium Skeletal Bracing CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Soporte Esquelético de Titanio"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Soporte Esquelético de Titanio"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Soporte Esquelético de Titanio"

#. ~ Description of "Titanium Skeletal Bracing CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A set of hinges, springs, and other synthetic augments for the skeletal "
"structure.  These artificial enhancers strengthen the knees and elbows, "
"allowing the user to carry more weight."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de bisagras, resortes y otros aumentos sintéticos para la "
"estructura esquelética. Estas mejoras artificiales fortalecen las rodillas y"
" los codos, lo que le permite al usuario soportar más peso."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Taste Modifier CBM"
msgid_plural "Taste Modifier CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Modificador del Gusto"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Modificador del Gusto"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Modificador del Gusto"

#. ~ Description of "Taste Modifier CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A set of highly sensitive sensors implanted in the user's mouth, combined "
"with a sophisticated analyzer.  While active, it will block all unpleasant "
"taste and texture at the cost of bionic energy."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de sensores de alta sensibilidad implantados en la boca del "
"usuario, combinados con un sofisticado analizador. Mientras esta activo, "
"bloqueará todo sabor y textura desagradables a costa de energía biónica."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Soporific Induction CBM"
msgid_plural "Soporific Induction CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Inductor Soporífero"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Inductor Soporífero"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Inductor Soporífero"

#. ~ Description of "Soporific Induction CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A microscopic electrode designed to gently stimulate a particular cluster of"
" neurons in the hypothalamus, helping the user to fall asleep."
msgstr ""
"Un electrodo microscópico diseñado para estimular suavemente un grupo "
"particular de neuronas en el hipotálamo, ayudando al usuario a dormir."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Squeaky Ankles CBM"
msgid_plural "Squeaky Ankles CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Tobillos Chillones"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Tobillos Chillones"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Tobillos Chillones"

#. ~ Description of "Squeaky Ankles CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A pair of defective bionics that make squeaking noises."
msgstr "Un par de biónicos defectuosos que hacen ruidos de chirrido."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Bionic-Induced Deformity CBM"
msgid_plural "Bionic-Induced Deformity CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Deformidad MBC Inducida por Biónico"
msgstr[1] "Deformidades MBCs Inducidas por Biónico"
msgstr[2] "Deformidades MBCs Inducidas por Biónico"

#. ~ Description of "Bionic-Induced Deformity CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A jumble of broken metal pieces that were removed during reconstructive "
"surgery."
msgstr ""
"Un amasijo de piezas metálicas rotas que fueron retiradas durante la cirugía"
" reconstructiva."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Acidic Discharge CBM"
msgid_plural "Acidic Discharge CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Descarga Ácida"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Descargas Ácidas"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Descargas Ácidas"

#. ~ Description of "Acidic Discharge CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"This CBM has been breached in several places and some acid is leaking from "
"it."
msgstr ""
"Este MBC se ha roto en varios lugares y algo de ácido se está escapando."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Electrical Discharge CBM"
msgid_plural "Electrical Discharge CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Descarga Eléctrica"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Descargas Eléctricas"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Descargas Eléctricas"

#. ~ Description of "Electrical Discharge CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "This CBM is a mess of naked wire and burnt resistors."
msgstr "Este MBC es una maraña de cables pelados y resistencias quemadas."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Electrical Drain CBM"
msgid_plural "Electrical Drain CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Drenaje Eléctrico"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Drenajes Eléctricos"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Drenajes Eléctricos"

#. ~ Description of "Electrical Drain CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"This CBM was wired incorrectly and would drain power from any system "
"connected to it."
msgstr ""
"Este MBC está cableado incorrectamente y drenará energía de cualquier "
"sistema al que se conecte."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Itchy Metal Thing CBM"
msgid_plural "Itchy Metal Thing CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Con picor metálico"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Con picor metálico"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Con picor metálico"

#. ~ Description of "Itchy Metal Thing CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"You can't recognize what this is supposed to be, but it's a very awkward "
"thing to have in one's body."
msgstr ""
"No puedes reconocer lo que se supone que es esto, pero es algo muy incómodo "
"de tener en el cuerpo."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Glowy Thing CBM"
msgid_plural "Glowy Thing CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Cosa Brillante"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Cosa Brillante"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Cosa Brillante"

#. ~ Description of "Glowy Thing CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "It's a… thing?  And it glows, at least it did when it was plugged in."
msgstr "Es una... ¿cosa? Y brilla, al menos lo hacía cuando estaba enchufado."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Leaky Bionic CBM"
msgid_plural "Leaky Bionic CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Biónico Agujereado"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Biónicos Agujereados"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Biónicos Agujereados"

#. ~ Description of "Leaky Bionic CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A mess of pierced pipes and broken seals, something unpleasant is leaking "
"from it."
msgstr ""
"Un lío de tuberías perforadas y sellos rotos, algo desagradable se está "
"filtrando."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Noisemaker CBM"
msgid_plural "Noisemaker CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Sonado"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Sonador"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Sonador"

#. ~ Description of "Noisemaker CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A malfunctioning bionic.  When powered, it occasionally emits a loud burst "
"of noise."
msgstr ""
"Un biónico que funciona mal. Cuando se alimenta, de vez en cuando emite una "
"fuerte explosión de ruido."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Bionic Nostril CBM"
msgid_plural "Bionic Nostril CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Fosa Nasal Biónica"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Fosa Nasal Biónica"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Fosa Nasal Biónica"

#. ~ Description of "Bionic Nostril CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"This thing was up someone's nose, they're probably glad to be rid of it."
msgstr ""
"Esta cosa estaba adentro de la nariz de alguien, que debe estar contento de "
"habérselo sacado."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Bionic Visual Impairment CBM"
msgid_plural "Bionic Visual Impairment CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Discapacidad Visual Biónica"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Discapacidad Visual Biónica"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Discapacidad Visual Biónica"

#. ~ Description of "Bionic Visual Impairment CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A defective bionic that impairs vision."
msgstr "Un biónico defectuoso que afecta la visión."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Power Overload CBM"
msgid_plural "Power Overload CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Sobrecarga de Energía"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Sobrecarga de Energía"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Sobrecarga de Energía"

#. ~ Description of "Power Overload CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A bunch of defective power circuits that are prone to short-circuiting."
msgstr ""
"Un montón de circuitos de energía defectuosos que son propensos a los "
"cortocircuitos."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Bionic Short Circuit CBM"
msgid_plural "Bionic Short Circuit CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Biónico en Cortocircuito"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Biónico en Cortocircuito"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Biónico en Cortocircuito"

#. ~ Description of "Bionic Short Circuit CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "This bionic is poorly wired and occasionally short-circuits."
msgstr "Esta biónica está mal cableado y ocasionalmente sufre cortocircuitos."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Endocrine Enervator CBM"
msgid_plural "Endocrine Enervator CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Enervador Endócrino"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Enervadores Endócrinos"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Enervador Endócrino"

#. ~ Description of "Endocrine Enervator CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"This malfunctioning bionic causes fatigue by altering the unfortunate user's"
" brain chemistry."
msgstr ""
"Este biónico que funciona mal causa cansancio al alterar la química cerebral"
" del desafortunado usuario."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Synaptic Regeneration System CBM"
msgid_plural "Synaptic Regeneration System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Sistema de Regeneración Sináptica"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Sistema de Regeneración Sináptica"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Sistema de Regeneración Sináptica"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Motor Control Overstimulator CBM"
msgid_plural "Motor Control Overstimulator CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Control Sobre-estimulador a Motor"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Controles Sobre-estimuladores a Motor"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Controles Sobre-estimuladores a Motor"

#. ~ Description of "Motor Control Overstimulator CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"The result of poor configuration, this bionic module frequently causes "
"debilitating muscle spasms."
msgstr ""
"El resultado de una mala configuración, este módulo biónico causa "
"frecuentemente espasmos musculares debilitantes."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Wire-Induced Stiffness CBM"
msgid_plural "Wire-Induced Stiffness CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Rigidez Inducida por Cable"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Rigidez Inducida por Cable"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Rigidez Inducida por Cable"

#. ~ Description of "Wire-Induced Stiffness CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A length of poorly installed wiring that would cause stiffness."
msgstr "Un tramo de cableado mal instalado que causaría rigidez."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Self-Locking Thumbs CBM"
msgid_plural "Self-Locking Thumbs CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Pulgares Auto-Trabables"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Pulgares Auto-Trabables"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Pulgares Auto-Trabables"

#. ~ Description of "Self-Locking Thumbs CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "A pair of faulty, self-locking thumb bionics."
msgstr "Un par de biónicos para el pulgar, defectuosos y con autobloqueo."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Visual Disruptor CBM"
msgid_plural "Visual Disruptor CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Interruptor Visual"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Interruptor Visual"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Interruptor Visual"

#. ~ Description of "Visual Disruptor CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A pair of defective ocular bionics that cause visual distortion and "
"pixelation."
msgstr ""
"Un par de biónicos oculares defectuosos que causan distorsión visual y "
"pixelación."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Voice Remodulator CBM"
msgid_plural "Voice Remodulator CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Remodulador de Voz"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Remodulador de Voz"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Remodulador de Voz"

#. ~ Description of "Voice Remodulator CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Part of the Autodoc's 'Cyborg Identity Package', this bionic gives the user "
"a creepy robot voice."
msgstr ""
"Este biónico, que forma parte del \"Paquete de Identidad Cyborg\" de "
"Autodoc, confiere al usuario una espeluznante voz de robot."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Electromagnetic Leak CBM"
msgid_plural "Electromagnetic Leak CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Drenaje Electromagnético"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Drenaje Electromagnético"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Drenaje Electromagnético"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Oil Generator CBM"
msgid_plural "Oil Generator CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Generador de Aceite"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Generador de Aceite"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Generador de Aceite"

#. ~ Description of "Oil Generator CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A CBM that generates power out of kerosene or motor oil.  It is fairly "
"efficient and can store up to 750ml of fuel but works somewhat slowly."
msgstr ""
"Un MBC que genera energía a partir de queroseno o aceite de motor. Es "
"bastante eficiente y puede almacenar hasta 750ml de combustible, pero "
"funciona con cierta lentitud."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Taste Fouler CBM"
msgid_plural "Taste Fouler CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Arruinador de Gusto"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Arruinador de Gusto"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Arruinador de Gusto"

#. ~ Description of "Taste Fouler CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A broken and mis-wired module that would cause food and drink to taste "
"terrible."
msgstr ""
"Es un módulo roto y mal conectado que causa que la comida y la bebida tengan"
" un gusto horrible."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Radioactive Leak CBM"
msgid_plural "Radioactive Leak CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Pérdida Radiactiva"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Pérdida Radiactiva"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Pérdida Radiactiva"

#. ~ Description of "Radioactive Leak CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"This broken CBM had been leaking radiation into its user.  The danger seems "
"to have been sealed off during the removal process but you definitely "
"shouldn't put it back."
msgstr ""
"Este MBC roto había estado filtrando radiación hacia su usuario. El peligro "
"parece haber sido sellado durante el proceso de remoción, pero "
"definitivamente no deberías volver a ponerlo."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Recoil Compensators CBM"
msgid_plural "Recoil Compensators CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Compensadores de Retroceso"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Compensadores de Retroceso"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Compensadores de Retroceso"

#. ~ Description of "Recoil Compensators CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A CBM that contains shock absorbers and kinetic braces which greatly reduce "
"the recoil of guns."
msgstr ""
"Este MBC contiene unos amortiguadores y soportes cinéticos que reducen mucho"
" el retroceso de las armas de fuego."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Sleep Mode Shutdown CBM"
msgid_plural "Sleep Mode Shutdown CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Apagado Modo Sueño"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Apagado Modo Sueño"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Apagado Modo Sueño"

#. ~ Description of "Sleep Mode Shutdown CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"This CBM completely shuts down all communication between the user's brain "
"and the rest of their body when they fall asleep, preventing them from "
"waking up under any circumstance until their natural sleep cycle completes."
"  An inability to trigger its effects manually makes it useless as an "
"anesthesia substitute."
msgstr ""
"Este MBC anula por completo toda la comunicación entre el cerebro del "
"usuario y el resto de su cuerpo cuando se queda dormido, impidiendo que se "
"despierte bajo cualquier circunstancia hasta que se complete su ciclo "
"natural de sueño. La imposibilidad de activar sus efectos manualmente lo "
"hace inútil como sustituto de la anestesia."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Trickle Charger CBM"
msgid_plural "Trickle Charger CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Cargador por Goteo"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Cargador por Goteo"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Cargador por Goteo"

#. ~ Description of "Trickle Charger CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A low-power, long-lasting bioelectric charger powered by small-scale nuclear"
" decay.  Energy output is low but requires no fuel source, and multiple "
"copies can be installed."
msgstr ""
"Es un cargador bioeléctrico de baja potencia y larga duración, alimentado "
"por una pequeña desintegración radiactiva. La salida de energía es poca pero"
" no requiere combustible, y se pueden instalar varias copias."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid "Throwing Assist CBM"
msgid_plural "Throwing Assist CBMs"
msgstr[0] "Asistente de Lanzamiento CBM"
msgstr[1] "Asistente de Lanzamiento CBMs"
msgstr[2] "Asistente de Lanzamiento CBMs"

#. ~ Description of "Throwing Assist CBM"
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"This CBM links the eyes to a series of nerve stimulators along the arms and "
"hands, resulting in a significant increase to throwing accuracy.  The user "
"enjoys a significant edge in baseball, and it turns out it works great with "
"fragmentation grenades too."
msgstr ""
"Este CBM vincula los ojos a una serie de estimuladores nerviosos a lo largo "
"de los brazos y manos, lo que da como resultado un aumento significativo de "
"la precisión de los lanzamientos. El usuario disfruta de una importante "
"ventaja en el béisbol, y resulta que también funciona muy bien con las "
"granadas de fragmentación."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/biosignatures.json
msgid "bird litter"
msgid_plural "bird litter"
msgstr[0] "desechos de pajaro"
msgstr[1] "desechos de pajaro"
msgstr[2] "desechos de pajaro"

#. ~ Description of "bird litter"
#: data/json/items/biosignatures.json
msgid "Bird droppings, feathers, and soiled bits of rubbish."
msgstr "Excrementos de pájaros, plumas y trocitos de basura sucios."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/biosignatures.json
msgid "cow pie"
msgid_plural "cow pies"
msgstr[0] "plasta de vaca"
msgstr[1] "plastas de vaca"
msgstr[2] "plastas de vaca"

#. ~ Description of "cow pie"
#: data/json/items/biosignatures.json
msgid ""
"A fresh cow pie; this could probably be used to make some great fertilizer."
msgstr ""
"Una plasta de vaca fresca, probablemente podría ser usada para hacer un gran"
" fertilizante."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/biosignatures.json
msgid "dog dung"
msgid_plural "dog dungs"
msgstr[0] "boñiga de perro"
msgstr[1] "boñigas de perro"
msgstr[2] "boñigas de perro"

#. ~ Description of "dog dung"
#: data/json/items/biosignatures.json
msgid "Droppings from a canine."
msgstr "Excrementos de un canino."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/biosignatures.json
msgid "manure"
msgid_plural "manures"
msgstr[0] "estiércol"
msgstr[1] "estiércol"
msgstr[2] "estiércol"

#. ~ Description of "manure"
#: data/json/items/biosignatures.json
msgid "Common manure, could probably be used to make some great fertilizer."
msgstr "Abono común, podría ser utilizado para hacer un buen fertilizante."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/biosignatures.json
msgid "roach dirt"
msgid_plural "roach dirts"
msgstr[0] "suciedad de cucaracha"
msgstr[1] "suciedad de cucarachas"
msgstr[2] "suciedad de cucarachas"

#. ~ Description of "roach dirt"
#: data/json/items/biosignatures.json
msgid "Large black pellets of rotting material."
msgstr "Bolitas grandes y negras de materia en descomposición."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/biosignatures.json
msgid "fetid goop"
msgid_plural "fetid goops"
msgstr[0] "pringue fetidos"
msgstr[1] "pringues fetidos"
msgstr[2] "pringues fetidos"

#. ~ Description of "fetid goop"
#: data/json/items/biosignatures.json
msgid ""
"A foul-smelling goop.  It has a disgusting texture and a powerful smell that"
" overwhelms every other smell around it."
msgstr ""
"Un pringe de mal olor. Tiene una textura asquerosa y un poderoso olor que "
"anula cualquier otro olor a su alrededor."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/biosignatures.json
msgid "chitin dust"
msgid_plural "chitin dust"
msgstr[0] "polvo de quitina"
msgstr[1] "polvo de quitina"
msgstr[2] "polvo de quitina"

#. ~ Description of "chitin dust"
#: data/json/items/biosignatures.json
msgid ""
"The dust left over by winged insects such as butterflies or moths.  It's "
"mostly chitin but may also contain dirt and other gross materials."
msgstr ""
"El polvo que dejan los insectos alados, como las mariposas o las polillas. "
"Es mayoritariamente quitina, pero también puede contener suciedad y otros "
"materiales asquerosos."

#. ~ Description of "anesthetic"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"A variety of powerful hypnotic, analgesic, and stimulative drugs.  It's "
"intended for use in specialized medical equipment, and can't be administered"
" manually.  You can reload an anesthesia kit with it."
msgstr ""
"Una variedad de poderosas drogas hipnóticas, analgésicas y estimulantes. "
"Está destinado a ser utilizado por un equipo médico especializado y no puede"
" ser administrado manualmente. Puedes recargar un kit de anestesia con él."

#. ~ Right now, it's just used in a quest, and should not spawn naturally.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "fertility supplement"
msgid_plural "fertility supplements"
msgstr[0] "suplemento de fertilidad"
msgstr[1] "suplementos de fertilidad"
msgstr[2] "suplementos de fertilidad"

#. ~ Right now, it's just used in a quest, and should not spawn naturally.
#. ~ Description of "fertility supplement"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "A pill for those looking to have children.  It is of no use to you."
msgstr "Una píldora para los que quieren tener hijos. No le sirve de nada."

#. ~ Density: 2g/cm3.  NOTE: Weights for chemical powders are 1/100 mol.
#. Weights are given for ONE UNIT.  Volume is for all units.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "sulfur"
msgid_plural "sulfur"
msgstr[0] "azúfre"
msgstr[1] "azúfre"
msgstr[2] "azúfre"

#. ~ Density: 2g/cm3.  NOTE: Weights for chemical powders are 1/100 mol.
#. Weights are given for ONE UNIT.  Volume is for all units.
#. ~ Description of "sulfur"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"A handful of pure sulfur.  Primarily used to make battery acid, sulfur is "
"sometimes used as fuel for explosives.  Can be burned to produce acidic "
"smoke that is deadly to bacteria and humans alike, or oxidized to make "
"paper-bleaching agents.  It is also a fungicide, and could be rubbed on your"
" skin to treat fungal infection."
msgstr ""
"Un puñado de azufre puro. Utilizado principalmente para fabricar ácido para "
"baterías, el azufre se emplea a veces como combustible para explosivos. "
"Puede quemarse para producir un humo ácido que es mortal para las bacterias "
"y los seres humanos por igual, u oxidarse para hacer agentes blanqueadores "
"de papel. También es un fungicida, y puede frotarse en la piel para tratar "
"una infección por hongos."

#. ~ density is around 2g/cm3
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "chunk of sulfur"
msgid_plural "chunks of sulfur"
msgstr[0] "trozo de azufre"
msgstr[1] "trozos de azufre"
msgstr[2] "trozos de azufre"

#. ~ density is around 2g/cm3
#. ~ Description of "chunk of sulfur"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "A chunk of pure sulfur.  Break it up to use it."
msgstr "Un trozo de azufre puro. Rómpelo para usarlo."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "cement"
msgid_plural "cement"
msgstr[0] "cemento"
msgstr[1] "cemento"
msgstr[2] "cemento"

#. ~ Description of "cement"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"Portland is most likely long gone, but its memory persists in cement.  This "
"ubiquitous binder can be used for all kinds of advanced masonry.  Just add "
"water."
msgstr ""
"Lo más probable es que Portland haya desaparecido hace tiempo, pero su "
"memoria persiste en el cemento. Este ubicuo aglutinante puede ser usado para"
" todo tipo de construcciones avanzadas. Sólo hay que añadir agua."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgctxt "material"
msgid "gravel"
msgid_plural "gravel"
msgstr[0] "gravilla"
msgstr[1] "gravilla"
msgstr[2] "gravilla"

#. ~ Description of "gravel"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "A handful of gravel, smaller than pebbles but larger than sand."
msgstr ""
"Un puñado de grava, más pequeña que los guijarros pero más grande que la "
"arena."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "shredded rubber"
msgid_plural "shredded rubber"
msgstr[0] "caucho triturado"
msgstr[1] "caucho triturado"
msgstr[2] "caucho triturado"

#. ~ Description of "shredded rubber"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "A handful of shredded rubber, usable as a mulch now."
msgstr "Un puñado de caucho triturado, utilizable como manto ahora."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "limestone"
msgid_plural "limestone"
msgstr[0] "caliza"
msgstr[1] "caliza"
msgstr[2] "caliza"

#. ~ Description of "limestone"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"A handful of small chunks of limestone.  Useful for experiments at science "
"fairs, but pretty useless as ammo.  Maybe something could be crafted from "
"this stuff…"
msgstr ""
"Un puñado de pequeños trozos de piedra caliza. Útiles para experimentos en "
"ferias de ciencias, pero bastante inútiles como munición. Tal vez se pueda "
"fabricar algo con estas cosas…"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "quicklime"
msgid_plural "quicklime"
msgstr[0] "cal"
msgstr[1] "cal"
msgstr[2] "cal"

#. ~ Description of "quicklime"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"The product of burning limestone, this white powder is a crucial ingredient "
"in making cement.  That said, it is also extremely caustic and will cause "
"severe burns to any tissue it comes in contact with.  This property could "
"probably be exploited."
msgstr ""
"El resultado de quemar piedra caliza. Este polvo blanco es un ingrediente "
"crucial para hacer cemento. Dicho esto, también es extremadamente cáustico y"
" provocará graves quemaduras en cualquier tejido orgánico con el que entre "
"en contacto. Esta característica probablemente pueda ser explotada."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "slaked lime"
msgid_plural "slaked lime"
msgstr[0] "cal hidratada"
msgstr[1] "cal hidratada"
msgstr[2] "cal hidratada"

#. ~ Description of "slaked lime"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
" A white odorless powder with many uses.  Also known as calcium hydroxide."
msgstr ""
"Es un polvo blanco sin olor con muchos usos. También se lo conoce como "
"hidróxido de calcio."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgctxt "material"
msgid "sand"
msgid_plural "sand"
msgstr[0] "arena"
msgstr[1] "arena"
msgstr[2] "arena"

#. ~ Description of "sand"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"A handful of New England sand.  If you had a stoked furnace, you could turn "
"it into glass.  Otherwise, it's only good for making cement."
msgstr ""
"Un puñado de arena de Nueva Inglaterra. Si tienes un buen horno, podrías "
"transformarlo en vidrio. Si no, solo sirve para hacer cemento."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "soil"
msgid_plural "soil"
msgstr[0] "tierra"
msgstr[1] "tierra"
msgstr[2] "tierra"

#. ~ Description of "soil"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"A pile of loosely-packed, slightly damp loamy soil.  This mixture of sand, "
"silt and clay is ideal for growing plants."
msgstr ""
"Una pila de tierra margosa ligeramente húmeda, no muy compactada. Esta "
"mezcla de arena, limo y arcilla es ideal para el crecimiento de plantas."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "limestone shard"
msgid_plural "limestone shards"
msgstr[0] "fragmento de caliza"
msgstr[1] "fragmentos de caliza"
msgstr[2] "fragmentos de caliza"

#. ~ Description of "limestone shard"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"A small shard of limestone.  Pretty flimsy and not much of a weapon, but its"
" alkaline properties may yet find some use."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño fragmento de caliza. Muy poco sólido y no sirve como arma, pero "
"sus propiedades alcalinas pueden tener alguna utilidad."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "rock salt"
msgid_plural "rock salt"
msgstr[0] "sal de roca"
msgstr[1] "sal de roca"
msgstr[2] "sal de roca"

#. ~ Description of "rock salt"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "A handful of rock salt crystals.  Could be refined into table salt."
msgstr ""
"Un puñado de cristales de sal de roca. Puede ser refinada para hacer sal de "
"mesa."

#. ~ density: 3.57–3.76 g/cm3
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "rhodonite"
msgid_plural "rhodonite"
msgstr[0] "rodonita"
msgstr[1] "rodonitas"
msgstr[2] "rodonitas"

#. ~ density: 3.57–3.76 g/cm3
#. ~ Description of "rhodonite"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"A chunk of rhodonite.  It has manganese dioxide covering and going through "
"it in veins, which can be obtained using a chisel."
msgstr ""
"Un trozo de rodonita. Tiene dióxido de manganeso que lo cubre y lo atraviesa"
" en sus venas, el cual se puede obtener usando un cincel."

#. ~ density: 5.64–5.68 g/cm3
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "zincite"
msgid_plural "zincite"
msgstr[0] "zincita"
msgstr[1] "zincitas"
msgstr[2] "zincitas"

#. ~ density: 5.64–5.68 g/cm3
#. ~ Description of "zincite"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"A chunk of zincite.  Could be refined into zinc oxide, then into zinc by "
"reduction with a source of carbon."
msgstr ""
"Un trozo de zincita. Puede ser refinado en óxido de zinc, y luego en zinc "
"por reducción con una fuente de carbón."

#. ~ $0.67 per charge for a $10 15-charge gallon of bleach.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "bleach"
msgid_plural "bleach"
msgstr[0] "lejía"
msgstr[1] "lejía"
msgstr[2] "lejía"

#. ~ $0.67 per charge for a $10 15-charge gallon of bleach.
#. ~ Description of "bleach"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "This is sodium hypochlorite, a common household cleaning agent."
msgstr ""
"Se trata de hipoclorito de sodio, un agente de limpieza doméstico común."

#. ~ Conditional name for "bleach" when FLAG matches DIRTY
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "bleach spill"
msgid_plural "bleach spills"
msgstr[0] "derrame de lejía"
msgstr[1] "derrames de lejía"
msgstr[2] "derrames de lejía"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "liquid ammonia"
msgid_plural "liquid ammonia"
msgstr[0] "amoníaco líquido"
msgstr[1] "amoníacos líquidos"
msgstr[2] "amoníaco líquido"

#. ~ Description of "liquid ammonia"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"This is anhydrous ammonia, a useful chemical compound.  It must be stored "
"under pressure or refrigerated.  Don't even think about drinking it."
msgstr ""
"Se trata de amoníaco anhidro, un compuesto químico muy útil. Debe ser "
"almacenado bajo presión o refrigerado. Ni se te ocurra beberlo."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "ammonia solution"
msgid_plural "ammonia solution"
msgstr[0] "solución de amoníaco"
msgstr[1] "soluciones de amoníaco"
msgstr[2] "solución de amoníaco"

#. ~ Description of "ammonia solution"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "This is ammonium hydroxide, a common household cleaning agent."
msgstr ""
"Se trata de hidróxido de amonio, un producto de limpieza doméstico común."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "liquid fertilizer"
msgid_plural "liquid fertilizer"
msgstr[0] "fertilizante líquido"
msgstr[1] "fertilizante líquido"
msgstr[2] "fertilizante líquido"

#. ~ Description of "liquid fertilizer"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "A nutrient-rich elixir for plants."
msgstr "Un elixir rico en nutrientes para plantas."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "commercial fertilizer"
msgid_plural "commercial fertilizer"
msgstr[0] "fertilizante comercial"
msgstr[1] "fertilizante comercial"
msgstr[2] "fertilizante comercial"

#. ~ Description of "commercial fertilizer"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "Nutrient-rich granules for plants."
msgstr "Gránulos ricos en nutrientes para plantas."

#. ~ Typically sold in larger quantities, but that's handled in the charge
#. count.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "fungicide"
msgid_plural "fungicide"
msgstr[0] "fungicida"
msgstr[1] "fungicida"
msgstr[2] "fungicida"

#. ~ Typically sold in larger quantities, but that's handled in the charge
#. count.
#. ~ Description of "fungicide"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"Agricultural-grade chemical anti-fungal powder designed to destroy "
"infections in plants."
msgstr ""
"Polvo químico anti-fúngico de grado agrícola, diseñado para destruir las "
"infecciones de las plantas."

#. ~ Typically sold in larger quantities, but that's handled in the charge
#. count.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "insecticide"
msgid_plural "insecticide"
msgstr[0] "insecticida"
msgstr[1] "insecticidas"
msgstr[2] "insecticidas"

#. ~ Typically sold in larger quantities, but that's handled in the charge
#. count.
#. ~ Description of "insecticide"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"Agricultural-grade chemical insecticide powder designed to eradicate insect "
"pests."
msgstr ""
"Polvo insecticida químico de grado agrícola diseñado para erradicar las "
"plagas de insectos."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "salt water"
msgid_plural "salt water"
msgstr[0] "agua salada"
msgstr[1] "agua salada"
msgstr[2] "agua salada"

#. ~ Description of "salt water"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "Water with salt added.  Not good for drinking."
msgstr "Agua con sal añadida. Mejor no beberlo."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "soapy water"
msgid_plural "soapy water"
msgstr[0] "agua con jabón"
msgstr[1] "agua con jabón"
msgstr[2] "agua con jabón"

#. ~ Description of "soapy water"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "Water with soap added.  Not good for drinking."
msgstr "Agua con jabón añadido. Mejor no beberlo."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "sewage sample"
msgid_plural "sewage samples"
msgstr[0] "muestra de aguas residuales"
msgstr[1] "muestras de aguas residuales"
msgstr[2] "muestras de aguas residuales"

#. ~ Description of "sewage sample"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "A sample of sewage from a treatment plant.  Gross."
msgstr ""
"Una muestra de agua de cloaca de una planta de tratamiento. Asqueroso."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "aluminum powder"
msgid_plural "aluminum powder"
msgstr[0] "polvo de aluminio"
msgstr[1] "polvo de aluminio"
msgstr[2] "polvo de aluminio"

#. ~ Description of "aluminum powder"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"A handful of finely-ground aluminum powder.  This strong reducing agent was "
"used in combination with various oxidants for chemical welding and "
"explosives alike.  Just before the Cataclysm, however, it was the basis of "
"virtually all commercial metallic-hued paints and anti-corrosive coatings."
msgstr ""
"Un puñado de polvo de aluminio finamente molido. Este fuerte agente reductor"
" se usa en combinación con varios oxidantes para realizar soldaduras "
"químicas y explosivos. Justo antes del Cataclismo, fue la base de "
"prácticamente todas las pinturas comerciales de tonos metálicos y "
"recubrimientos anticorrosivos."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "nickel powder"
msgid_plural "nickel powder"
msgstr[0] "níquel en polvo"
msgstr[1] "níquel en polvo"
msgstr[2] "níquel en polvo"

#. ~ Description of "nickel powder"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"A silvery-white metallic powder composed of nickel.  Common industrial uses "
"include production of stainless steel as well as other alloys."
msgstr ""
"Polvo metálico de color blanco plateado compuesto por níquel. Los usos "
"industriales más comunes incluyen la producción de acero inoxidable y otras "
"aleaciones."

#. ~ density: 7.14 g/cm3
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "zinc powder"
msgid_plural "zinc powder"
msgstr[0] "polvo de cinc"
msgstr[1] "polvo de cinc"
msgstr[2] "polvo de cinc"

#. ~ density: 7.14 g/cm3
#. ~ Description of "zinc powder"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"A handful of zinc powder.  While commercially used mostly in cosmetics and "
"for paints, hobbyists used to mix it with sulfur to make basic rocket fuel "
"or a smokescreen.  When treated with a strong acid, it will produce "
"hydrogen."
msgstr ""
"Un puñado de polvo de zinc. Aunque comercialmente es usado más que nada en "
"cosméticos y pinturas, algunos aficionados lo mezclan con azufre para hacer "
"combustible de cohetes básico y pantallas de humo. Cuando se mezcla con un "
"ácido fuerte, producirá hidrógeno."

#. ~ density: 5.1 g/cm3
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "zinc oxide"
msgid_plural "zinc oxide"
msgstr[0] "óxido de zinc"
msgstr[1] "óxido de zinc"
msgstr[2] "óxido de zinc"

#. ~ density: 5.1 g/cm3
#. ~ Description of "zinc oxide"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"A handful of zinc oxide.  It can be reduced into zinc, or used for some "
"other reactions of its own."
msgstr ""
"Un puñado de óxido de zinc. Puede ser reducido a zinc, o usado para algunas "
"otras reacciones por si solo."

#. ~ density: 5.026 g/cm3
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "manganese dioxide"
msgid_plural "manganese dioxide"
msgstr[0] "dióxido de manganeso"
msgstr[1] "dióxido de manganeso"
msgstr[2] "dióxido de manganeso"

#. ~ density: 5.026 g/cm3
#. ~ Description of "manganese dioxide"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"A handful of manganese dioxide powder.  Occurring naturally in the mineral "
"pyrolusite, it is used commercially in the production of alkaline and zinc-"
"carbon batteries."
msgstr ""
"Un puñado de polvo de dióxido de manganeso. Ocurre de forma natural en el "
"mineral pirolusita y se utiliza comercialmente en la producción de baterias "
"alcalinas y de zinc-carbono."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "acidic electrolyte paste"
msgid_plural "acidic electrolyte paste"
msgstr[0] "pasta electrolítica ácida"
msgstr[1] "pasta electrolítica ácida"
msgstr[2] "pasta electrolítica ácida"

#. ~ Description of "acidic electrolyte paste"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"A moisturized mixture of zinc chloride and manganese dioxide, slightly "
"acidic.  It can be used in the production of zinc-carbon batteries."
msgstr ""
"Mezcla hidratada de cloruro de zinc y dióxido de manganeso, ligeramente "
"ácida. Puede utilizarse en la producción de pilas de zinc-carbono."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "ferric chloride"
msgid_plural "ferric chloride"
msgstr[0] "cloruro férrico"
msgstr[1] "cloruro férrico"
msgstr[2] "cloruro férrico"

#. ~ Description of "ferric chloride"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"A dark green crystalline powder with a weak pungent smell similar to that of"
" hydrochloric acid.  Commonly used as a Lewis acid for catalyzing various "
"chemical reactions."
msgstr ""
"Polvo cristalino de color verde oscuro con un débil olor acre similar al del"
" ácido clorhídrico. Se utiliza habitualmente como ácido de Lewis para "
"catalizar diversas reacciones químicas."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "antimony trichloride"
msgid_plural "antimony trichloride"
msgstr[0] "tricloruro de antimonio"
msgstr[1] "tricloruro de antimonio"
msgstr[2] "tricloruro de antimonio"

#. ~ Description of "antimony trichloride"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"A soft colorless powder with a sharp pungent odor, also known as butter of "
"antimony.  It's a catalyst for polymerization, hydrocracking, and "
"chlorination reactions, and has some other niche uses."
msgstr ""
"Es un polvo incoloro y suave con un olor penetrante, también conocido como "
"mantequilla de antimonio. Es un catalizador para reacciones de "
"polimerización, hidrocraqueo y cloración, y tiene algunos otros usos "
"especializados."

#. ~ density: 1.984 g/cm3
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "potassium chloride"
msgid_plural "potassium chloride"
msgstr[0] "cloruro de potasio"
msgstr[1] "cloruro de potasio"
msgstr[2] "cloruro de potasio"

#. ~ density: 1.984 g/cm3
#. ~ Description of "potassium chloride"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"A handful of potassium chloride.  Although it occurs naturally in the "
"mineral sylvite, it can be produced as a byproduct of the reaction of "
"saltpeter and hydrochloric acid.  It can be used for making fertilizer, or "
"potassium hydroxide by way of electrolysis."
msgstr ""
"Un puñado de cloruro de potasio. Aunque se produce de forma natural en el "
"mineral silvita, puede producirse como subproducto de la reacción del "
"salitre y el ácido clorhídrico. Puede utilizarse para fabricar fertilizante,"
" o hidróxido de potasio por medio de la electrólisis."

#. ~ density: 2.12 g/cm3 (25 °C)
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "potassium hydroxide"
msgid_plural "potassium hydroxide"
msgstr[0] "hidróxido de potasio"
msgstr[1] "hidróxido de potasio"
msgstr[2] "hidróxido de potasio"

#. ~ density: 2.12 g/cm3 (25 °C)
#. ~ Description of "potassium hydroxide"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"A handful of potassium hydroxide.  Commonly called caustic potash, it was "
"mainly used industrially for its caustic nature.  It can be used as an "
"electrolyte in alkaline batteries, among other applications."
msgstr ""
"Un puñado de hidróxido de potasio. Comúnmente llamado potasa cáustica, fue "
"utilizado principalmente en la industria por su naturaleza cáustica. Puede "
"ser usado como electrolito en las baterias alcalinas, entre otras "
"aplicaciones."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "sulfuric acid"
msgid_plural "sulfuric acid"
msgstr[0] "ácido sulfúrico"
msgstr[1] "ácido sulfúrico"
msgstr[2] "ácido sulfúrico"

#. ~ Description of "sulfuric acid"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"Sulfuric acid: viscous, foul-smelling and extremely corrosive, particularly "
"to organic matter and evil clowns.  Although used to prepare a number of "
"chemicals, it is mostly known as battery acid, due to its widest commercial "
"application."
msgstr ""
"Ácido sulfúrico: viscoso, de olor fétido y extremadamente corrosivo, "
"particularmente para la materia orgánica y payasos malévolos. Aunque se usa "
"para preparar una cantidad de químicos, es mayormente conocido como ácido de"
" batería, debido a su amplia aplicación comercial."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "hydrochloric acid"
msgid_plural "hydrochloric acid"
msgstr[0] "ácido hidroclórico"
msgstr[1] "ácido hidroclórico"
msgstr[2] "ácido hidroclórico"

#. ~ Description of "hydrochloric acid"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"Hydrochloric acid, also known as muriatic acid.  It is a strong acid that "
"has a distinctive smell, important and frequently used ever since its "
"discovery.  It still has a vast multitude of uses."
msgstr ""
"Ácido clorhídrico, también conocido como ácido muriático. Es un ácido fuerte"
" con un olor distintivo, importante y usado frecuentemente desde su "
"descubrimiento. Tiene una gran cantidad de usos en la actualidad."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "acetone"
msgid_plural "acetone"
msgstr[0] "acetona"
msgstr[1] "acetona"
msgstr[2] "acetona"

#. ~ Description of "acetone"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"Acetone, best known as the primary constituent of most nail polish removers."
"  Flammable, and can be easily used for potent home-made explosives, as "
"demonstrated by the terrorist attacks of 2016."
msgstr ""
"Acetona, conocida por ser el principal ingrediente de la mayoría de los "
"quitaesmaltes. Es inflamable y puede ser utilizado para hacer explosivos "
"caseros, como se demostró en los ataques terroristas del 2016."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "nitric acid"
msgid_plural "nitric acid"
msgstr[0] "ácido nítrico"
msgstr[1] "ácido nítrico"
msgstr[2] "ácido nítrico"

#. ~ Description of "nitric acid"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"Nitric acid, a strong oxidant and an extremely corrosive material.  Mainly "
"used in the production of synthetic fertilizers, for etching of circuit "
"boards and in woodworking.  Remains quite useful both for making a vast "
"array of pyrotechnic and explosive agents and as a direct weapon: not many "
"beings enjoy being doused in nitric acid."
msgstr ""
"El ácido nítrico es un fuerte oxidante y un material extremadamente "
"corrosivo. Principalmente usado en la producción de fertilizantes "
"sintéticos, el grabado de placas de circuitos, y en la carpintería. Sigue "
"siendo bastante útil tanto para hacer una amplia gama de agentes "
"pirotécnicos y explosivos además de como un arma directa: ningún ser vivo "
"disfrutará al ser bañado en ácido nítrico."

#. ~ density: 5.22 g/cm3
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "chromium oxide"
msgid_plural "chromium oxide"
msgstr[0] "óxido de cromo"
msgstr[1] "óxido de cromo"
msgstr[2] "óxido de cromo"

#. ~ density: 5.22 g/cm3
#. ~ Description of "chromium oxide"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"A handful of chromium oxide.  This substance, typically known as the only "
"stable green pigment for paints, is also a mild oxidizer, which can be mixed"
" with aluminum powder to make thermite for welding.  If one had access to a "
"CVD machine and a laboratory worth of reagents, they might be able to "
"produce very durable ceramic layers."
msgstr ""
"Un puñado de óxido de cromo. Esta sustancia, conocida típicamente como el "
"único pigmento verde estable para las pinturas, es también un oxidante "
"suave, que puede mezclarse con polvo de aluminio para hacer termita para "
"soldadura. Si tuvieras acceso a una máquina CVD (Deposición Química de "
"Vapor) y a un laboratorio con reactivos, podrias producir capas de cerámica "
"muy resistentes."

#. ~ density: 2.22 g/cm3
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "calcium carbide"
msgid_plural "calcium carbide"
msgstr[0] "carburo de calcio"
msgstr[1] "carburo de calcio"
msgstr[2] "carburo de calcio"

#. ~ density: 2.22 g/cm3
#. ~ Description of "calcium carbide"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"A handful of calcium carbide, giving off a faint, garlic-like smell.  "
"Commercially, calcium carbide was used for on-the-spot manufacture of "
"acetylene and historically to power acetylene lamps.  If mixed with water "
"and sealed, it will explode with little strength, but with relatively loud "
"noise and could maybe be used as a decoy."
msgstr ""
"Un puñado de carburo de calcio, que desprende un débil olor a ajo. "
"Comercialmente, el carburo de calcio se usaba para la fabricación de "
"acetileno e históricamente para encender lámparas de acetileno. Si se mezcla"
" con agua y se sella, explotará con poca fuerza, pero con un gran ruido que "
"podria ser usado como señuelo."

#. ~ Description of "hexamine"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"A handful of waxy hexamine tablets.  This ubiquitous fuel was used to start "
"up almost every garden grill, and no 'real' camping trip could do its "
"cooking without it, until the Cataclysm.  Nowadays, it is even more valuable"
" than before, being the key component in the preparation of several "
"military-grade explosives."
msgstr ""
"Un puñado de tabletas de hexamina cerosa. Este combustible omnipresente se "
"usó para encender casi todas las parrillas de jardín y ningún camping "
"\"real\" podía cocinar sin ellas, hasta el Cataclismo. Hoy en día, es aún "
"más valioso que antes, siendo el componente clave en la preparación de "
"varios explosivos de grado militar."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "hydrogen peroxide (concentrated)"
msgid_plural "hydrogen peroxide (concentrated)"
msgstr[0] "agua oxigenada (concentrada)"
msgstr[1] "agua oxigenada (concentrada)"
msgstr[2] "agua oxigenada (concentrada)"

#. ~ Description of "hydrogen peroxide (concentrated)"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"Concentrated hydrogen peroxide is a powerful oxidant, violently decomposing "
"in contact with most reducing agents.  Can be used as rocket fuel or to make"
" high explosives.  Causes severe burns to any organic matter and may ignite "
"it on contact."
msgstr ""
"El peróxido de hidrógeno concentrado es un poderoso oxidante, que se "
"descompone violentamente en contacto con la mayoría de los agentes "
"reductores. Se puede usar como combustible de misiles o para hacer "
"explosivos potentes. Causa quemaduras severas a cualquier materia orgánica y"
" puede arder al contactar."

#. ~ Description of "plutonium"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"Some plutonium.  You should probably get very far away from this, if you "
"enjoy not being irradiated."
msgstr ""
"Algo de plutonio. Probablemente deberías alejarte mucho de esto, si "
"disfrutas no siendo irradiado."

#. ~ Description of "uranium"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"Some uranium.  You should probably get very far away from this, if you enjoy"
" not being irradiated."
msgstr ""
"Algo de uranio. Probablemente deberías alejarte mucho de esto, si te gusta "
"no ser irradiado."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "ammonium nitrate"
msgid_plural "ammonium nitrate"
msgstr[0] "nitrato de amonio"
msgstr[1] "nitrato de amonio"
msgstr[2] "nitrato de amonio"

#. ~ Description of "ammonium nitrate"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"Some ammonium nitrate.  This white, crystalline powder is commonly used as a"
" component of fertilizers and explosives.  Could also be dissolved in water "
"to sharply lower its temperature, but is there any use for this quality in "
"this new world?"
msgstr ""
"Una cantidad de nitrato de amonio. Este polvo blanco y cristalino se utiliza"
" comúnmente como componente en fertilizantes y explosivos. Puede disolverse "
"en agua para bajar bruscamente su temperatura, pero ¿Qué utilidad puede "
"tener este mundo que tenemos?"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "ammonium nitrate pellets"
msgid_plural "ammonium nitrate pellets"
msgstr[0] "bolitas de nit. de amonio"
msgstr[1] "bolitas de nit. de amonio"
msgstr[2] "bolitas de nit. de amonio"

#. ~ Description of "ammonium nitrate pellets"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"Some ammonium nitrate pellets.  These pellets are commonly used as a "
"component of fertilizers and explosives.  Could also be dissolved in water "
"to sharply lower its temperature, but is there any use for this quality in "
"this new world?"
msgstr ""
"Algunas bolitas de nitrato de amonio. Estas bolitas se usan comúnmente como "
"componente de fertilizantes y explosivos. También podrían ser disueltos en "
"agua para bajar bruscamente su temperatura, pero ¿tiene algún uso esta "
"calidad en este nuevo mundo?"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "saltpeter"
msgid_plural "saltpeter"
msgstr[0] "salitre"
msgstr[1] "salitre"
msgstr[2] "salitre"

#. ~ Description of "saltpeter"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"A handful of saltpeter.  Sometimes used as a fertilizer, this ubiquitous "
"nitrate is the principal constituent of black gunpowder and simple rocket "
"propellants, such as rocket candy."
msgstr ""
"Un puñado de salitre. A veces usado como fertilizante, este nitrato "
"omnipresente es el constituyente principal de la pólvora negra y de los "
"propulsores de misiles, como el combustible de caramelo."

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
#: data/mods/innawood/mining/furniture_and_terrain/veins.json
msgid "niter"
msgid_plural "niter"
msgstr[0] "nitro"
msgstr[1] "nitro"
msgstr[2] "nitro"

#. ~ Description of "niter"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"A large crystal of niter, the mineral form of potassium nitrate.  It can be "
"processed into saltpeter."
msgstr ""
"Un cristal grande de nitro, la forma mineral de nitrato de potasio.  Puede "
"ser procesado en salitre."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "aluminum sulfate"
msgid_plural "aluminum sulfate"
msgstr[0] "sulfato de aluminio"
msgstr[1] "sulfato de aluminio"
msgstr[2] "sulfato de aluminio"

#. ~ Description of "aluminum sulfate"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"Several crystals of aluminum sulfate.  Historically, an agent for purifying "
"water and as molluscicide, due to the fact that it degenerates their slime."
"  Just before the Cataclysm, its main uses were for adjusting the acidity of"
" the soil and as an additive to baking powder.  If mixed with a strong acid,"
" it could be used to saturate the soil with aluminum, causing all but the "
"most resistant of plants to wither and die."
msgstr ""
"Varios cristales de sulfato de aluminio. Históricamente, un agente para "
"potabilizar el agua y como molusquicida, debido a que degeneraba su "
"mucosidad. Justo antes del Cataclismo, sus usos principales eran ajustar la "
"acidez del suelo y como aditivo en polvo para hornear. Si se mezcla con un "
"ácido fuerte, puede ser usado para saturar el suelo con aluminio, lo que "
"hará que mueran o se marchiten todas las plantas excepto las más "
"resistentes."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "acetic acid"
msgid_plural "acetic acid"
msgstr[0] "ácido acético"
msgstr[1] "ácido acético"
msgstr[2] "ácido acético"

#. ~ Description of "acetic acid"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"Concentrated acetic acid, typically used as a chemical reagent and "
"antifungal agent.  Despite its horrid smell, it was used to prepare several "
"types of perfumes, but would making perfume not be too fancy for post-"
"apocalyptic New England?"
msgstr ""
"Ácido acético concentrado, normalmente usado como reactivo químico y agente "
"antifúngico. A pesar de su olor horrible, se usaba para preparar varios "
"tipos de perfumes, pero ¿hacer perfume no es demasiado elegante para una "
"Nueva Inglaterra post-apocalíptica?"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "formaldehyde"
msgid_plural "formaldehyde"
msgstr[0] "formaldehído"
msgstr[1] "formaldehido"
msgstr[2] "formaldehido"

#. ~ Description of "formaldehyde"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"Formaldehyde, here dissolved in water, was widely used before the Cataclysm "
"as a precursor to production of many chemicals and materials and as an "
"embalming agent.  Easily identifiable by its pungent odor.  Terribly toxic, "
"carcinogenic, and volatile."
msgstr ""
"El formaldehido, aquí disuelto en agua, era usado comúnmente antes del "
"Cataclismo como precursor en la producción de muchos químicos y materiales "
"como agente enbalsamador. Facilmente identificable por su olor acre. "
"Terriblemente tóxico, cancerígeno y volátil."

#. ~ Weight might not be accurate.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "thermite"
msgid_plural "thermite"
msgstr[0] "termita"
msgstr[1] "termita"
msgstr[2] "termita"

#. ~ Weight might not be accurate.
#. ~ Description of "thermite"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"A handful of silvery-greenish powder, produced by mixing aluminum and "
"chromium oxide.  This mixture, burning at a constant pace and at extremely "
"high temperature, was once used for on-the-spot welding.  Can be used as an "
"incendiary material in a pinch."
msgstr ""
"Un puñado de un polvo verde plateado, producido al mezclar aluminio con "
"óxido de cromo. Esta mezcla, quemada a un ritmo constante y una "
"extremadamente temperatura elevada, se utilizaba para hacer soldaduras "
"inmediatas. Puede ser usada como material incendiario en caso de necesidad."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "ANFO"
msgid_plural "ANFO"
msgstr[0] "NAFO"
msgstr[1] "NAFO"
msgstr[2] "NAFO"

#. ~ Description of "ANFO"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"Several brownish pellets that were made by allowing ammonium nitrate to "
"absorb an organic fuel.  This ammonium nitrate/fuel oil mixture, or ANFO, is"
" a common industrial explosive due to its stability and low price.  Burns "
"fast, but needs an explosive primer to detonate."
msgstr ""
"Varias bolitas marrones que fueron hechas absorbiendo combustible orgánico "
"en nitrato de amonio. Este mezcla de nitrato de amonio/gasolina o NAFO, es "
"un explosivo industrial común debido a su estabilidad y bajo precio. Se "
"quema rápido pero necesita un pistón explosivo para detonar."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "black gunpowder"
msgid_plural "black gunpowder"
msgstr[0] "pólvora negra"
msgstr[1] "pólvora negra"
msgstr[2] "pólvora negra"

#. ~ Description of "black gunpowder"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"A handful of black gunpowder, a mix of saltpeter, charcoal and sulfur.  "
"Pretty useless for making modern cartridges, as the soot produced when it "
"burns will quickly clog any firearm, but it could be used to make some "
"vicious bombs."
msgstr ""
"Un puñado de pólvora negra, una mezcla de salitre, carbón vegetal y azufre. "
"Bastante inútil para hacer cartuchos modernos, ya que el hollín que se "
"produce al quemarse obstruirá rápidamente cualquier arma de fuego, pero "
"podría ser utilizado para hacer algunas bombas atroces."

#. ~ Density of RDX is 1.858 g/cm3
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "RDX"
msgid_plural "RDX"
msgstr[0] "RDX"
msgstr[1] "RDX"
msgstr[2] "RDX"

#. ~ Density of RDX is 1.858 g/cm3
#. ~ Description of "RDX"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"Several off-white crystals of RDX, or hexogen: a military-grade, shelf-"
"stable high explosive.  Can be cast into shaped charges, or mixed with scrap"
" to pepper the blast area with high-velocity shrapnel."
msgstr ""
"Varios cristales blanquecinos de RDX o hexógeno: un alto explosivo de grado "
"militar, estable. Puede ser moldeado en cargas o mezclado con chatarra para "
"acribillar el área de la explosión con metralla de alta velocidad."

#. ~ Density of composition B is 1.65 g/cm3. Slightly rounded the volume from
#. 303 to 300
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "composition B"
msgid_plural "composition B"
msgstr[0] "composition B"
msgstr[1] "composition B"
msgstr[2] "composition B"

#. ~ Density of composition B is 1.65 g/cm3. Slightly rounded the volume from
#. 303 to 300
#. ~ Description of "composition B"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"Composition B is an explosive consisting of castable mixtures of RDX and "
"TNT.  It is used as the main explosive filling in artillery projectiles, "
"rockets, land mines, hand grenades and various other munitions."
msgstr ""
"La composición B es un explosivo que consiste en una mezcla fundible de RDX "
"y TNT. Se utiliza como el principal relleno explosivo en proyectiles de "
"artillería, cohetes, minas terrestres, granadas de mano y otras municiones "
"diversas."

#. ~ Density of RDX is 1.57 g/cm3
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "HMTD"
msgid_plural "HMTD"
msgstr[0] "HMTD"
msgstr[1] "HMTD"
msgstr[2] "HMTD"

#. ~ Density of RDX is 1.57 g/cm3
#. ~ Description of "HMTD"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"Hexamine peroxide: this fine, yellowish powder is a powerful primary "
"explosive, used to initiate detonation of more stable explosives, such as "
"RDX.  Relatively stable, but best not store it for too long."
msgstr ""
"Peróxido de hexamina: este polvo fino amarillento es un potente explosivo "
"primario, que se usa para iniciar la detonación de explosivos más estables, "
"como el RDX. Es relativamente estable pero mejor no tenerlo guardado por "
"mucho tiempo."

#. ~ Detonation velocity about 2500–3000 m/s near 0.5 g/cm3
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "APEX"
msgid_plural "APEX"
msgstr[0] "APEX"
msgstr[1] "APEX"
msgstr[2] "APEX"

#. ~ Detonation velocity about 2500–3000 m/s near 0.5 g/cm3
#. ~ Description of "APEX"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"Acetone peroxide: this fine, white crystalline powder is a powerful primary "
"explosive, used to initiate detonation of more stable explosives, such as "
"RDX.  Relatively stable, with a fruit like smell when pure."
msgstr ""
"Peróxido de acetona: este fino,  polvo cristalino blanco es un potente "
"explosivo primario, utilizado para iniciar la detonación de explosivos más "
"estables, como el RDX. Relativamente estable, con un olor a fruta cuando "
"está puro."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "improvised rocket fuel"
msgid_plural "improvised rocket fuel"
msgstr[0] "combustible de cohetes improvisado"
msgstr[1] "combustible de cohetes improvisado"
msgstr[2] "combustible de cohetes improvisado"

#. ~ Description of "improvised rocket fuel"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"A chunk of a zinc powder and sulfur mixture, bound together by superglue, "
"that can be used as an impromptu rocket fuel."
msgstr ""
"Un trozo de mezcla de polvo de zinc y azufre, unidos con superpegamento, que"
" puede ser usado como un combustible de misiles improvisado."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "water purification tablet"
msgid_plural "water purification tablets"
msgstr[0] "pastilla de purificación de agua"
msgstr[1] "pastillas de purificación de agua"
msgstr[2] "pastillas de purificación de agua"

#. ~ Description of "water purification tablet"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid ""
"Intended for the clarification and disinfection of unsafe drinking water, "
"these halazone-based purification tablets remove dangerous contaminants "
"using powerful chemicals.  The label says to use one tablet per unit of "
"water."
msgstr ""
"Diseñadas para la desinfección y clarificación del agua peligrosa, estas "
"tabletas de purificación a base de halazona, retiran los contaminantes "
"peligrosos utilizando poderosos químicos. La etiqueta dice que hay que usar "
"una tableta por unidad de agua."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "hickory root"
msgid_plural "hickory roots"
msgstr[0] "raíz de nogal americano"
msgstr[1] "raíces de nogal americano"
msgstr[2] "raíces de nogal americano"

#. ~ Description of "hickory root"
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "A root from a hickory tree.  It has an earthy smell."
msgstr "Una raíz de un árbol de nogal americano. Tiene olor a tierra."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/chemicals_and_resources.json
msgid "hickory nuts"
msgid_plural "hickory nuts"
msgstr[0] "nueces de pacana"
msgstr[1] "nueces de pacana"
