msgstr[0] "estuche duro DARPA"
msgstr[1] "estuches duros DARPA"
msgstr[2] "estuches duros DARPA"

#. ~ Description of "DARPA hard case"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A heavy and very durable protective case made of steel and thick plastic, "
"locked with a six dials.  A sticker with the logo of DARPA is attached to "
"the front, but looking at the surface, you can see that another marking - "
"formerly stenciled into the material - was recently and hastily destroyed."
msgstr ""
"Una caja protectora pesada y muy duradera hecha de acero y plástico grueso, "
"cerrada con seis diales. En la parte delantera lleva acoplada una pegatina "
"con el logotipo de DARPA, pero si se observa la superficie, se puede ver que"
" otra marca -anteriormente estarcida en el material- ha sido destruida "
"recientemente y de forma precipitada."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic.json
