msgstr[0] "par de binoculares"
msgstr[1] "pares de binoculares"
msgstr[2] "pares de binoculares"

#. ~ Description of "pair of binoculars"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A pair of optics with a neck strap attached.  Useful for seeing long "
"distances.  Wearing this item or carrying it in your inventory will double "
"the distance around you that is mapped during your travels.  You could also "
"use them to focus the sunlight."
msgstr ""
"Un par de ópticas con una correa para el cuello. Útiles para ver a grandes "
"distancias. Llevar este artículo o llevarlo en su inventario duplicará la "
"distancia alrededor de usted que se cartografíe durante sus viajes. También "
"puedes usarlos para enfocar la luz del sol."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "headlamp"
msgid_plural "headlamps"
msgstr[0] "linterna de cabeza"
msgstr[1] "linternas de cabeza"
msgstr[2] "linternas de cabeza"

#. ~ Description of "headlamp"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"This is an LED headlamp with an adjustable strap so as to be comfortably "
"worn on your head or attached to your helmet.  Use it to turn it on."
msgstr ""
"Una linterna de cabeza led con una correa ajustable para que sea cómoda de "
"ponerse en la cabeza o en un casco. Usar para encender."

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "headlamp"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "You turn the headlamp on."
msgstr "Enciendes la linterna de cabeza."

#. ~ "need_charges_msg" action message of item "headlamp"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "The headlamp batteries are dead."
msgstr "La batería de la linterna de cabeza está descargada."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "wearable camera"
msgid_plural "wearable cameras"
msgstr[0] "cámara portátil"
msgstr[1] "cámaras portátiles"
msgstr[2] "cámaras portátiles"

#. ~ Description of "wearable camera"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A point-and-shoot digital camera, with digital viewfinder, a backup 'iron-"
"sight', and flash.  You can look at your photos on the digital screen, or "
"transfer them with a memory card.  Takes conventional batteries.  This one "
"can be worn over your neck."
msgstr ""
"Una cámara digital automática, con visor digital, una \"mira de hierro\" de "
"apoyo y flash. Puedes ver tus fotos en la pantalla digital o transferirlas "
"con una tarjeta de memoria. Funciona con pilas convencionales. Se puede "
"llevar en el cuello."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "wearable professional camera"
msgid_plural "wearable professional cameras"
msgstr[0] "cámara profesional portátil"
msgstr[1] "cámaras profesionales portátiles"
msgstr[2] "cámaras profesionales portátiles"

#. ~ Description of "wearable professional camera"
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A 35mm digital SLR (single-lens reflex) camera, with optical and digital "
"viewfinders, zoom lens with auto-focus and stabilizer, and flash.  You can "
"view your photos on it or transfer them with a memory card; it runs on "
"conventional batteries.  Before the Cataclysm, you could have taken "
"professional-grade photos using this.  This one can be worn over your neck"
msgstr ""
"Una cámara digital SLR (réflex de un solo objetivo) de 35 mm, con visor "
"óptico y digital, objetivo zoom con autoenfoque y estabilizador, y flash. "
"Puedes ver tus fotos en ella o transferirlas con una tarjeta de memoria; "
"funciona con baterías convencionales. Antes del Cataclismo, podías hacer "
"fotos de nivel profesional con ella. Esta se puede llevar al cuello"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
