#. ~ Description of "40x46mm M576 buckshot"
#: data/json/items/ammo/40x46mm.json
msgid ""
"A 40x46mm buckshot load, designed for use in thick vegetation or room "
"clearing.  Due to the limitations of weapons built to fire 40x46mm grenades,"
" it's much less powerful than you'd expect."
msgstr ""
"Una carga de perdigones 40x46mm, diseñada para su uso en la vegetación "
"espesa o en la limpieza de habitaciones. Debido a las limitaciones de las "
"armas construidas para disparar granadas de 40x46mm, es mucho menos potente "
"de lo que cabría esperar."

