#. ~ Based on: https://www.amazon.com/XTACER-Multi-Function-4-Tubes-Training-
#. Takedown/dp/B072K4537K
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "multi-function quiver"
msgid_plural "multi-function quivers"
msgstr[0] "quiver multifunción"
msgstr[1] "quivers multifunción"
msgstr[2] "quivers multifunción"

#. ~ Based on: https://www.amazon.com/XTACER-Multi-Function-4-Tubes-Training-
#. Takedown/dp/B072K4537K
#. ~ Description of "multi-function quiver"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"A large cotton quiver capable of easily storing 16 arrows.  It includes a "
"bag and straps to store a takedown bow, as well as a small pouch for archery"
" accessories.  Use insert to store arrows or bolts and activate to "
"holster/draw your bow."
msgstr ""
"Un gran carcaj de algodón capaz de almacenar fácilmente 16 flechas. Incluye "
"una bolsa y correas para guardar un arco de desmontaje, así como una pequeña"
" bolsa para accesorios de tiro con arco. Utiliza 'insertar' para almacenar "
"flechas o pernos y actívalo para enfundar/desenfundar tu arco."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "tac vest"
msgid_plural "tac vests"
msgstr[0] "chaleco táctico"
msgstr[1] "chalecos tácticos"
msgstr[2] "chalecos tácticos"

#. ~ Description of "tac vest"
#. ~ Description of "XS tac vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"This light vest is meant to carry your magazines, shells and pistols.  They "
"are popular amongst law enforcement, but less so than combination tactical "
"vests incorporating Kevlar."
msgstr ""
"Este chaleco ligero está pensado para llevar tus cargadores, cartuchos y "
"pistolas. Son populares entre las fuerzas del orden, pero menos que los "
"chalecos tácticos combinados que incorporan Kevlar."

#. ~ "holster_prompt" action message of item "tac vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "Stash item"
msgstr "Almacenar objecto"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "XL tac vest"
msgid_plural "XL tac vests"
msgstr[0] "chaleco táctico XL"
msgstr[1] "chalecos tácticos XL"
msgstr[2] "chalecos tácticos XL"

#. ~ Description of "XL tac vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"This light vest is meant to carry your gear and ammunition comfortably "
"distributed about your torso.  They are popular amongst law enforcement, but"
" less so than combination tactical vests incorporating Kevlar.  Oversized "
"and easy to don, this vest can hold four magazines close at hand in its many"
" pouches."
msgstr ""
"Chaleco ligero destinado a llevar confortablemente tu equipo y municiones "
"distribuidas por el torso. Son populares entre las fuerzas del orden, pero "
"menos que los chalecos tácticos combinados que incorporan kevlar. De gran "
"tamaño y fácil de llevar, este chaleco puede almacenar hasta cuatro "
"cargadores a mano en sus muchos bolsillos."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "XS tac vest"
msgid_plural "XS tac vests"
msgstr[0] "chaleco táctico XS"
msgstr[1] "chalecos tácticos XS"
msgstr[2] "chalecos tácticos XS"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "light load bearing vest"
msgid_plural "light load bearing vests"
msgstr[0] "chaleco de carga ligera"
msgstr[1] "chalecos de carga ligera"
msgstr[2] "chalecos de carga ligera"

#. ~ Description of "light load bearing vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"This lightweight harness covered in MOLLE webbing is designed to attach a "
"few pouches, holsters and other PALS compatible accessories.  Preferred by "
"some soldiers over directly attaching accessories to a ballistic vest as "
"they can then be easily separated."
msgstr ""
"Este ligero arnés recubierto de correas en malla MOLLE está diseñada para "
"fijar unos pocos bolsillos, fundas y otros accesorios compatibles con PALS. "
"Algunos soldados lo prefieren en lugar de fijar directamente los accesorios "
"al chaleco balístico, ya que así pueden separarse fácilmente."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "load bearing vest"
msgid_plural "load bearing vests"
msgstr[0] "chaleco de carga"
msgstr[1] "chalecos de carga"
msgstr[2] "chalecos de carga"

#. ~ Description of "load bearing vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"This vest covered in MOLLE webbing is designed to attach pouches, holsters "
"and other PALS compatible accessories.  Preferred by some soldiers over "
"directly attaching accessories to a ballistic vest as they can then be "
"easily separated."
msgstr ""
"Este arnés recubierto de correas en malla MOLLE está diseñada para fijar "
"bolsillos, fundas y otros accesorios compatibles con PALS. Algunos soldados "
"lo prefieren en lugar de fijar directamente los accesorios al chaleco "
"balístico, ya que así pueden separarse fácilmente."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "load bearing vest with sling"
msgid_plural "load bearing vests with slings"
msgstr[0] "chaleco de carga con eslingas"
msgstr[1] "chalecos de carga con eslingas"
msgstr[2] "chalecos de carga con eslingas"

#. ~ Description of "load bearing vest with sling"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"This vest covered in MOLLE webbing is designed to attach pouches, holsters "
"and other PALS compatible accessories.  Preferred by some soldiers over "
"directly attaching accessories to a ballistic vest as they can then be "
"easily separated.  This one has a single point sling wrapped around the "
"shoulders using a system to keep your weapon extra secure."
msgstr ""
"Este chaleco revestido de cintas MOLLE está diseñado para sujetar bolsas, "
"fundas y otros accesorios compatibles con PALS. Algunos soldados lo "
"prefieren en lugar de sujetar directamente los accesorios a un chaleco "
"balístico, ya que así pueden quitarse fácilmente. Este tiene una eslinga de "
"un solo punto envuelta alrededor de los hombros usando un sistema para "
"mantener tu arma extra segura."

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "load bearing vest with sling"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "heavy load bearing vest with sling"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "breacher load bearing vest"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "survivor harness"
