#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid "breacher load bearing vest"
msgid_plural "breacher load bearing vests"
msgstr[0] "chaleco de carga tipo breacher"
msgstr[1] "chalecos de carga tipo breacher"
msgstr[2] "chalecos de carga tipo breacher"

#. ~ Description of "breacher load bearing vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/ammo_pouch.json
msgid ""
"This massive vest covered in MOLLE webbing is designed to attach a large "
"number of pouches, holsters and other PALS compatible accessories.  This one"
" has a single point sling wrapped around the shoulders using a system to "
"keep your weapon extra secure, as well as a set of strong magnets attached "
"to the torso and waist to hold a breaching shotgun."
msgstr ""
"Este enorme chaleco cubierto de cinchas MOLLE está diseñado para acoplarle "
"un gran número de bolsas, fundas y otros accesorios compatibles con PALS. "
"Este chaleco cuenta con una eslinga de un solo punto envuelta alrededor de "
"los hombros mediante un sistema para mantener tu arma extra segura, así como"
" un conjunto de fuertes imanes fijados al torso y a la cintura para sujetar "
"una escopeta de caza."

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "breacher load bearing vest"
