#. ~ Description of variant "airsoft vest" of item "stab vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
msgid ""
"A low-cost tactical vest styled in black camouflage, used in cosplay and "
"airsoft.  It'll let you shrug off airsoft pellets like a badass, but its "
"protection is mediocre against anything that's actually dangerous.  It "
"sports several small pouches, and includes touch fasteners to attach "
"identifying patches."
msgstr ""
"Es un chaleco de bajo costo con un diseño camuflado negro, utilizado en "
"cosplay y en partidas de airsoft. Te protege contra perdigones airsoft con "
"facilidad pero su protección es mediocre contra algo que sea verdaderamente "
"peligroso. Tiene varios bolsillos pequeños e incluye unas correas para poner"
" insignias identificatorias."

