msgid_plural "undergrown iridescent carapace plates"
msgstr[0] "placa caparazón iridiscente subdesarrollada"
msgstr[1] "placas caparazón iridiscentes subdesarrolladas"
msgstr[2] "placas caparazón iridiscentes subdesarrolladas"

#. ~ transforms over a day
#. ~ Description of "undergrown iridescent carapace plate"
#: data/json/items/armor/exotic.json
msgid ""
"A chunk of otherworldly carapace that seems to have been forced into the "
"shape of a ballistic plate with a slightly concave profile.  Scarred into "
"the outer surface is the label \"STRIKE FACE\".  The armor coverage is "
"spotty and it appears to be oozing and pulsing like it is in pain."
msgstr ""
"Un trozo de caparazón de otro mundo que parece haber sido forzado en forma "
"de placa balística con un perfil ligeramente cóncavo. En la superficie "
"exterior está grabada la etiqueta \"STRIKE FACE\". La cobertura de la "
"armadura es irregular y parece supurar y palpitar como si le doliera."

#. ~ transforms over a day
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/exotic.json
msgid "plate of scarred flesh"
msgid_plural "plates of scarred flesh"
msgstr[0] "placa de carne cicatrizada"
msgstr[1] "placas de carne cicatrizada"
msgstr[2] "placas de carne cicatrizada"

#. ~ transforms over a day
#. ~ Description of "plate of scarred flesh"
#: data/json/items/armor/exotic.json
msgid ""
"A chunk of otherworldly flesh that seems to have been forced into the shape "
"of a ballistic plate with a slightly concave profile.  There is no armor "
"left on this plate, just a mass of writhing alien flesh oozing in pain.  "
"However, it looks like it is slowly growing back."
msgstr ""
"Un trozo de carne de otro mundo que parece haber sido forzado en la forma de"
" una placa balística con un perfil ligeramente cóncavo. No queda ninguna "
"armadura en esta placa, sólo una masa de carne alienígena que se retuerce y "
"exuda dolor. Sin embargo, parece que está volviendo a crecer lentamente."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/exotic.json
msgid "second skin"
msgid_plural "second skins"
msgstr[0] "segunda piel"
msgstr[1] "segundas pieles"
msgstr[2] "segundas pieles"

#. ~ Description of "second skin"
#: data/json/items/armor/exotic.json
msgid ""
"A slimy layer of liquid has completely engulfed your body from the neck down"
" and seems to move with you - the sensation is uncomfortable.  The liquid "
"appears bound to the resonating collar at your neck; the inside of the "
"collar reads \"CAREFUL CHOKING HAZARD!  THIS WAY DOWN\".  The ooze flows "
"freely, covering your entire body but never crossing the gorget to get to "
"your head."
msgstr ""
"Una capa viscosa de líquido ha envuelto completamente tu cuerpo desde el "
"cuello hacia abajo y parece moverse contigo; la sensación es incómoda. El "
"líquido aparece ligado al collarín resonante de tu cuello; en el interior "
"del collarín se lee \"¡PELIGRO DE ASFIXIA! ESTE LADO HACIA ABAJO\". El "
"líquido fluye libremente, cubriendo todo tu cuerpo, pero sin llegar a cruzar"
" la garganta para llegar a tu cabeza."

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "second skin"
#: data/json/items/armor/exotic.json
msgid "Deactivate the device"
msgstr "Desactivar el dispositivo"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "second skin"
#: data/json/items/armor/exotic.json
msgid "The gorget hums and the liquid gets sucked back into it."
msgstr "El gorjal vibra y el líquido es absorbido de regreso a él."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/exotic.json
