msgstr[0] "funda de arma para espalda"
msgstr[1] "fundas de arma para espalda"
msgstr[2] "fundas de arma para espalda"

#. ~ Description of "back holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"A leather holster, big enough for a rifle or other large gun.  Designed to "
"be strapped to the back.  Whilst initially cumbersome, it becomes much "
"easier to use with practice.  Activate to holster/draw a gun."
msgstr ""
"Una funda de cuero, lo suficientemente grande para un rifle u otra arma "
"grande. Diseñada para ser atada a la espalda. Aunque al principio es "
"incómoda, se vuelve mucho más fácil de usar con la práctica. Activar para "
"enfundar/desenfundar un arma."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid "baldric holster"
msgid_plural "baldric holsters"
msgstr[0] "funda pirata"
msgstr[1] "fundas pirata"
msgstr[2] "fundas pirata"

#. ~ Description of "baldric holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"A leather harness which can hold up to six pistol-sized guns in total, "
"available for quick drawing.  Historically, similar harnesses were used by "
"pirates to carry multiple loaded flintlock pistols at once, as reloading "
"them is a lengthy process.  Activate to holster/draw a gun."
msgstr ""
"Un arnés de cuero que puede contener hasta seis pistolas en total, listas "
"para ser desenfundadas rápidamente. Históricamente, los piratas utilizaban "
"arneses similares para llevar varias pistolas de chispa cargadas a la vez, "
"ya que recargarlas era un proceso largo. Actívala para enfundar/desenfundar "
"un arma."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid "ankle holster"
msgid_plural "ankle holsters"
msgstr[0] "funda tobillera de pistola"
msgstr[1] "fundas tobillera de pistola"
msgstr[2] "fundas tobillera de pistola"

#. ~ Description of "ankle holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"A small concealed holster worn on the ankle.  It is awkward to use without "
"practice.  Activate to holster/draw a small pistol."
msgstr ""
"Una pequeña funda que se oculta en el tobillo. Difícil de usar si no estás "
"acostumbrado. Activar para enfundar/sacar una pequeña pistola."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid "bow sling"
msgid_plural "bow slings"
msgstr[0] "eslinga de arco"
msgstr[1] "eslingas de arco"
msgstr[2] "eslingas de arco"

#. ~ Description of "bow sling"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"A somewhat complicated set of straps and fabric to keep your bow close to "
"hand and (mostly) out of harm's way.  Activate to holster/draw your bow."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto algo complicado de correas y telas para mantener tu arco a mano "
"y (casi) protegido. Actívalo para enfundar/desenfundar tu arco."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid "single point sling"
msgid_plural "single point slings"
msgstr[0] "eslinga de un solo punto"
msgstr[1] "eslingas de un solo punto"
msgstr[2] "eslingas de un solo punto"

#. ~ Description of "single point sling"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"A harness going over your shoulder and across your chest.  Designed to "
"connect to a rifle at a single point with the rifle hanging off your front."
"  Great for fighting, not great for travel.  Activate to holster/draw your "
"weapon."
msgstr ""
"Un arnés que va por encima del hombro y a través del pecho. Diseñado para "
"conectarse a un rifle en un solo punto con el rifle colgando de su frente. "
"Es ideal para luchar, pero no para viajar. Activar para enfundar/sacar el "
"arma."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid "holster"
msgid_plural "holsters"
msgstr[0] "funda de pistola"
msgstr[1] "fundas de pistola"
msgstr[2] "fundas de pistola"

#. ~ Description of "holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"A leather strap worn on the hip for holding pistol-sized guns.  Activate to "
"holster/draw a gun."
msgstr ""
"Una correa de cuero que se lleva en la cadera para sujetar armas del tamaño "
"de una pistola. Se activa para enfundar/desenfundar un arma."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/bandoliers/holster.json
msgid "western holster"
msgid_plural "western holsters"
msgstr[0] "funda de western"
msgstr[1] "fundas de western"
msgstr[2] "fundas de western"

#. ~ Description of "western holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"A Western-style holster as worn by cowboys and gunfighters in the movies and"
" on TV. Has loops across the back to hold spare ammo.  Activate to "
"holster/draw a gun."
msgstr ""
"Una funda de estilo occidental como la que llevan los vaqueros y los "
"pistoleros en las películas. Tiene lazos en la espalda para guardar la "
"munición de repuesto. Activar para enfundar/desenfundar un arma."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid "fast draw holster"
msgid_plural "fast draw holsters"
msgstr[0] "funda rápida de pistola"
msgstr[1] "fundas rápidas de pistola"
msgstr[2] "fundas rápidas de pistola"

#. ~ Description of "fast draw holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"A comfortable quick-draw holster for small guns.  Activate to holster/draw a"
" gun."
msgstr ""
"Una cómoda funda de extracción rápida para armas pequeñas. Se activa para "
"enfundar/desenfundar un arma."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid "shoulder holster"
msgid_plural "shoulder holsters"
msgstr[0] "funda para hombros"
msgstr[1] "fundas para hombros"
msgstr[2] "fundas para hombros"

#. ~ Description of "shoulder holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"A comfortable quick-draw holster for larger pistols.  One side holsters a "
"gun, and the other side holds two magazines.  Activate to holster/draw a "
"gun."
msgstr ""
"Una cómoda funda de extracción rápida para pistolas grandes. En un lado se "
"enfunda una pistola y en el otro se guardan dos cargadores. Activar para "
"enfundar/desenfundar un arma."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid "deep concealment holster"
msgid_plural "deep concealment holsters"
msgstr[0] "funda de arma oculta"
msgstr[1] "fundas de arma oculta"
msgstr[2] "fundas de arma oculta"

#. ~ Description of "deep concealment holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"An elastic band with numerous provisions for concealing a very small pistol "
"close to the body.  It is awkward to use without practice.  Activate to "
"holster/draw a gun."
msgstr ""
"Una banda elástica con numerosas sujecciones para ocultar una pistola muy "
"pequeña cerca del cuerpo. Incómodo de usar sin práctica. Activar para "
"enfundar/sacar un arma."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid "belly band holster"
msgid_plural "belly band holsters"
msgstr[0] "funda de banda abdominal"
msgstr[1] "fundas de banda abdominal"
msgstr[2] "fundas de banda abdominal"

#. ~ Description of "belly band holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"A wide elastic belly belt with a built-in holster for a pistol and a spare "
"magazine.  It is very awkward to use without practice.  Activate to "
"holster/draw a gun."
msgstr ""
"Un cinturón elástico ancho con una funda incorporada para una pistola y un "
"cargador de repuesto. Es muy incómodo de usar sin práctica. Activar para "
"enfundar/desenfundar un arma."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid "large holster"
msgid_plural "large holsters"
msgstr[0] "funda grande"
msgstr[1] "fundas grandes"
msgstr[2] "fundas grandes"

#. ~ Description of "large holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"A belt holster consisting of a loop and strap intended for use with larger "
"firearms.  Slightly more cumbersome than a standard holster due to the "
"straps that hold it flat against your leg.  Activate to holster/draw a gun."
msgstr ""
"Una funda de cinturón con una hebilla del cinturón y correa para llevar "
"armas grandes. Un poco más incómoda que una funda normal debido a las "
"correas que la mantienen contra tu pierna.  Activar para enfundar/sacar un "
"arma."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid "XS holster"
msgid_plural "XS holsters"
msgstr[0] "funda de pistola XS"
msgstr[1] "fundas de pistola XS"
msgstr[2] "fundas de pistola XS"

#. ~ Description of "XS holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"A leather strap worn on the hip for holding pistol-sized guns.  The size of "
"the strap has been adjusted to fit someone with much smaller legs.  Activate"
" to holster/draw a gun."
msgstr ""
"Una correa de cuero que se lleva en la cadera para sujetar armas del tamaño "
"de una pistola. El tamaño de la correa se ajustó para adaptarse a alguien "
"con las piernas mucho más pequeñas. Activar para enfundar/desenfundar un "
"arma."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/hoods.json
msgid "beekeeping hood"
msgid_plural "beekeeping hoods"
msgstr[0] "campana de apicultor"
msgstr[1] "campanas de apicultor"
msgstr[2] "campanas de apicultor"

#. ~ Description of "beekeeping hood"
#: data/json/items/armor/hoods.json
