"generador diesel ICE que alimenta la armadura."

#. ~ This should probably changed to a pseudo-vehicle like the civilian
#. exoskeleton
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid "heavy combat exoskeleton"
msgid_plural "heavy combat exoskeletons"
msgstr[0] "exoesqueleto de combate pesado"
msgstr[1] "exoesqueletos de combate pesado"
msgstr[2] "exoesqueletos de combate pesado"

#. ~ This should probably changed to a pseudo-vehicle like the civilian
#. exoskeleton
#. ~ Description of "heavy combat exoskeleton"
#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid ""
"Colloquially known as a 'tank suit' in the media, these bulky exoskeletons, "
"covered in thick segmented armor plates, were tested in military service a "
"few years back and determined to be too heavy and expensive for regular use."
"  Now that it's in your hands, though, you have a massive suit of power "
"armor capable of resisting almost any small arms fire and most other forms "
"of attack.  On the other hand, it doubles your effective weight, and it's "
"almost impossible not to bump into things.  There is an integrated chemical-"
"resistant bodyglove that precludes wearing other clothing.  The armor is "
"outfitted with a variety of clips & clamps, allowing it to hold a few mags &"
" grenades, as well as a large rifle."
msgstr ""
"Conocido coloquialmente como \"traje de tanque\" en los medios de "
"comunicación, estos voluminosos exoesqueletos, cubiertos de gruesas placas "
"de blindaje segmentadas, se probaron en el servicio militar hace unos años y"
" se determinó que eran demasiado pesados y caros para su uso habitual. Sin "
"embargo, ahora que está en tus manos, tienes un enorme armadura de energía "
"capaz de resistir casi cualquier fuego de armas pequeñas y la mayoría de "
"otras formas de ataque. Por otro lado, duplica tu peso efectivo, y es casi "
"imposible no chocar con las cosas. Hay un guante corporal integrado "
"resistente a los productos químicos que impide llevar otra ropa. La armadura"
" está equipada con una variedad de ganchos y abrazaderas, lo que le permite "
"sostener algunos cargadores y granadas, así como un rifle grande."

