#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid "environmental combat helmet"
msgid_plural "environmental combat helmets"
msgstr[0] "casco de combate ambiental"
msgstr[1] "cascos de combate ambiental"
msgstr[2] "cascos de combate ambiental"

#. ~ Description of "environmental combat helmet"
#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid ""
"A fully enclosed combat helmet for hazardous environments, this was designed"
" to fit with a powered exoskeleton, using cameras to expand visual range.  "
"In practice, the cameras were unreliable and easily fouled.  The "
"environmental controls function best with direct-skin contact."
msgstr ""
"Un casco de combate totalmente cerrado para entornos peligrosos, diseñado "
"para acoplarse a un exoesqueleto motorizado, que utiliza cámaras para "
"ampliar el alcance visual. En la práctica, las cámaras eran poco fiables y "
"se ensuciaban con facilidad. Los controles ambientales funcionan mejor con "
"contacto directo con la piel."

