msgid "Hub 01 modular defense anchor"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 modular defense anchors"
msgstr[0] "ancla defensiva modular Hub 01"
msgstr[1] "anclas defensivas modulares Hub 01"
msgstr[2] "anclas defensivas modulares Hub 01"

#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 modular defense anchor"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid ""
"A custom-designed poncho for the true frontier explorer, made with aramid "
"fibers and robust ripstop nylon.  This one features a hardened skeleton of "
"ceramic plates running up and over the shoulders, and a portion of the front"
" has been raised upwards from the rest.  Lifting the fabric reveals a large "
"disc-shaped device installed into the garment, featureless except for a "
"prominent switch and Hub 01's logo in LED.  In addition to the poncho's "
"usual complement of storage, a battery compartment has been added that wires"
" into this device, featuring very specialized connectors and, perhaps a "
"little disconcertingly, radiation shielding."
msgstr ""
"Un poncho diseñado para el verdadero explorador fronterizo, hecho con tela "
"aramida y robusto nailon antidesgarro. Este tiene un esqueleto duro de "
"placas cerámicas que llegan hasta los hombros, y una parte en el frente está"
" levantado en comparación al resto. Debajo de la tela hay un dispositivo "
"grande en forma de disco instalado en la prenda, totalmente uniforme excepto"
" por un interruptor y el logo del Hub 01 hecho con leds. Además del "
"complemento de almacenamiento, tiene un compartimiento para batería que se "
"conecta al dispositivo, con unos conectores muy especializados y, tal vez un"
" poco desconcertante, protección contra radiación."

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "Hub 01 modular defense anchor"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "Turn on anchor"
msgstr "Activar ancla"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "Hub 01 modular defense anchor"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid ""
"You activate the anchor, and the Hub 01 logo on your front begins to glow "
"white."
msgstr ""
"Activás el ancla y el logo de Hub 01 en tu pecho empieza a brillar de color "
"blanco."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "Hub 01 modular defense anchor (on)"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 modular defense anchors (on)"
msgstr[0] "ancla defensiva modular Hub 01 (enc.)"
msgstr[1] "anclas defensivas modulares Hub 01 (enc.)"
msgstr[2] "anclas defensivas modulares Hub 01 (enc.)"

#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 modular defense anchor (on)"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid ""
"A custom-designed poncho for the true frontier explorer, made with aramid "
"fibers and robust ripstop nylon.  The logo of Hub 01 emblazoned on the chest"
" is glowing white."
msgstr ""
"Un poncho diseñado para el verdadero explorador fronterizo, hecho con tela "
"aramida y robusto nailon antidesgarro. Tiene el logo del Hub 01 estampado en"
" el pecho y brillando de color blanco."

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "Hub 01 modular defense anchor (on)"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "Turn off anchor"
msgstr "Desactivar ancla"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "Hub 01 modular defense anchor (on)"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "The Hub logo on your front stops glowing."
msgstr "El logo de Hub en tu pecho deja de brillar."

#. ~ nv goggles weight 1020g.  hub armor rig weight 960g for full body.
#. figure this strikes a decent midpoint, esp.  since weight here becomes head
#. encumb.  materials wise, same nylon/kevlar weave as the poncho; the visor
#. is being handwaved per the riot helmet and motorcycle helmet visors as
#. precedent.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "Hub 01 modular recon headgear"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 modular recon headgears"
msgstr[0] "Hub 01 casco modular de reconocimiento"
msgstr[1] "Hub 01 modular recon headgears"
msgstr[2] "Hub 01 modular recon headgears"

#. ~ nv goggles weight 1020g.  hub armor rig weight 960g for full body.
#. figure this strikes a decent midpoint, esp.  since weight here becomes head
#. encumb.  materials wise, same nylon/kevlar weave as the poncho; the visor
#. is being handwaved per the riot helmet and motorcycle helmet visors as
#. precedent.
#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 modular recon headgear"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid ""
"Heavy duty hooded headwear for the true frontier explorer, made with robust "
"Nylon sheeting reinforced with Kevlar fibers.  The top consists of a series "
"of plastic plates with hooks and velcro strips, perhaps for attaching "
"additional parts.  On the forehead of the assembly is a bulky box visor on a"
" mechanism to quickly pull it down over your eyes, with a cover on the side "
"to insert standard batteries.  Activate to lower the visor and use the light"
" amplification functions."
msgstr ""
"Capucha de alta resistencia para el verdadero explorador de la frontera, "
"fabricada con una robusta lámina de nailon reforzada con fibras de kevlar. "
"La parte superior consiste en una serie de placas de plástico con ganchos y "
"tiras de velcro, quizá para fijar piezas adicionales. En la parte frontal "
"del conjunto hay una voluminosa visera de caja con un mecanismo para bajarla"
" rápidamente sobre tus ojos, con una tapa en el lateral para insertar "
"baterías estándar. Se activa para bajar la visera y utilizar las funciones "
"de amplificación de la luz."

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "Hub 01 modular recon headgear"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "activate light-amp mode"
msgstr "activar modo amplificación de luz"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "Hub 01 modular recon headgear"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid ""
"You lower the visor and flick the control dial to light amplification mode."
msgstr ""
"Se baja la visera y se acciona el dial de control para el modo de "
"amplificación de la luz."

#. ~ "need_charges_msg" action message of item "Hub 01 modular recon headgear"
#. ~ "need_charges_msg" action message of item "Hub 01 modular recon headgear
#. (NV)"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "The visor's batteries are dead."
msgstr "Las baterías del visor están agotadas."

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "Hub 01 modular recon headgear"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "Hooks for an armored helm plate."
msgstr "Ganchos para una placa de timón blindada."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "Hub 01 modular recon headgear (NV)"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 modular recon headgear (NV)"
msgstr[0] "Hub 01 modular reconnaissance helmet (NV)"
msgstr[1] "Hub 01 casco modular de reconocimiento (NV)"
msgstr[2] "Hub 01 casco modular de reconocimiento (NV)"

#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 modular recon headgear (NV)"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid ""
"Heavy duty hooded headwear for the true frontier explorer.  The visor has "
"been lowered over the eyes, and is drawing low power to provide light "
"amplification by way of an infrared illuminator and detector.  Activate to "
"switch to full IR scanning."
msgstr ""
"Un casco de alta resistencia con capucha para el verdadero explorador de la "
"frontera. El visor se ha bajado sobre los ojos, y está tomando baja potencia"
" para proporcionar amplificación de la luz por medio de un iluminador y "
"detector de infrarrojos. Se activa para pasar a la exploración completa por "
"infrarrojos."

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "Hub 01 modular recon headgear (NV)"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "activate IR mode"
msgstr "activar modo IR"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "Hub 01 modular recon headgear (NV)"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "You flick the control dial to infra-red scanning mode."
msgstr "Se pone el dial de control en modo de escaneo por infrarrojos."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "Hub 01 modular recon headgear (IR)"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 modular recon headgear (IR)"
msgstr[0] "Hub 01 casco modular de reconocimiento (IR)"
msgstr[1] "Hub 01 casco modular de reconocimiento (IR)"
msgstr[2] "Hub 01 casco modular de reconocimiento (IR)"

#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 modular recon headgear (IR)"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid ""
"Heavy duty hooded headwear for the true frontier explorer.  The visor has "
"been lowered over the eyes, and is drawing moderate power to provide full "
"infra-red scanning, allowing you to see warm blooded creatures in the dark."
"  Activate to turn the visor off again."
msgstr ""
"Un gorro con capucha de alta resistencia para el verdadero explorador de la "
"frontera. El visor se ha bajado sobre los ojos, y está utilizando una "
"potencia moderada para proporcionar un escaneo infrarrojo completo, lo que "
"le permite ver a las criaturas de sangre caliente en la oscuridad. Actívala "
"para volver a apagar el visor."

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "Hub 01 modular recon headgear (IR)"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "You flick the visor off, and push it off your face."
msgstr "Te quitas la visera de un tirón y te la quitas de la cara."

