msgstr[2] "cascos abstractos"

#. ~ Tier 1 mantle
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "Hub 01 prototype mantle"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 prototype mantles"
msgstr[0] "manto prototipo Hub 01"
msgstr[1] "mantos prototipo Hub 01"
msgstr[2] "mantos prototipo Hub 01"

#. ~ Tier 1 mantle
#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 prototype mantle"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid ""
"3D printed armor for the upper body, made of thick and pliable polymer with "
"metallic fibers for reinforcement.  Several buckles and straps allow it to "
"be adjusted to fit you comfortably.  Despite its rough finish, it's clear "
"that a lot of thought has gone into the ergonomics and weight.  Designed to "
"clip to the chest and shoulders, its interior reads \"ATTACH TO MODULAR "
"DEFENSE SYSTEM\"."
msgstr ""
"Armadura impresa en 3D para el torso, hecha de polímero grueso y maleable "
"con fibras metálicas para reforzarlo. Varias hebillas y correas permiten "
"ajustarla para acomodarla a tu cuerpo. A pesar de sus terminaciones "
"irregulares, está claro que se le ha puesto mucho esfuerzo a su ergonomía y "
"su peso. Diseñada para engancharse al pecho y los hombros, en su interior "
"dice \"ENGANCHAR EN UN SISTEMA DEFENSIVO MODULAR\"."

#. ~ Tier 2 mantle
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "Hub 01 kinetic mantle"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 kinetic mantles"
msgstr[0] "manto kinético Hub 01"
msgstr[1] "mantos kinéticos Hub 01"
msgstr[2] "mantos kinéticos Hub 01"

#. ~ Tier 2 mantle
#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 kinetic mantle"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid ""
"3D printed armor for the upper body, made of thick and pliable polymer with "
"metallic fibers for reinforcement.  This model incorporates a rubber coating"
" that diffuses impacts and provides excellent protection from blunt trauma, "
"even if it does feel a bit like a rain coat.  Designed to clip to the chest "
"and shoulders, its interior reads \"ATTACH TO MODULAR DEFENSE SYSTEM\"."
msgstr ""
"Armadura impresa en 3D para el torso, hecha de polímero grueso y maleable "
"con fibras metálicas para reforzarlo. Este modelo incorpora una cobertura de"
" goma que amortigua impactos y brinda una protección excelente contra los "
"golpes, aunque parezca un simple prototipo. Diseñada para engancharse al "
"pecho y los hombros, en su interior dice \"ENGANCHAR EN UN SISTEMA DEFENSIVO"
" MODULAR\"."

#. ~ Tier 2 mantle
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "Hub 01 turnout mantle"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 turnout mantles"
msgstr[0] "manto de desvio Hub 01"
msgstr[1] "mantos de desvio Hub 01"
msgstr[2] "mantos de desvio Hub 01"

#. ~ Tier 2 mantle
#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 turnout mantle"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid ""
"3D printed armor for the upper body, made of thick and pliable polymer with "
"metallic fibers for reinforcement.  This model features heat-resistant "
"materials in the construction, providing protection from extreme heat "
"without sacrificing its overall performance.  Designed to clip to the chest "
"and shoulders, its interior reads \"ATTACH TO MODULAR DEFENSE SYSTEM\"."
msgstr ""
"Armadura impresa en 3D para el torso, hecha de polímero grueso y maleable "
"con fibras metálicas para reforzarlo. Este modelo está construido con "
"materiales resistentes al calor, lo que brinda protección contra calor "
"extremo sin sacrificar su desempeño general. Diseñada para engancharse al "
"pecho y los hombros, en su interior dice \"ENGANCHAR EN UN SISTEMA DEFENSIVO"
" MODULAR\"."

#. ~ Tier 2 mantle
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "Hub 01 ballistic mantle"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 ballistic mantles"
msgstr[0] "manto balístico Hub 01"
msgstr[1] "mantos balísticos Hub 01"
msgstr[2] "mantos balísticos Hub 01"

#. ~ Tier 2 mantle
#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 ballistic mantle"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid ""
"3D printed armor for the upper body, made of thick and pliable polymer with "
"metallic fibers for reinforcement.  Thanks to a slim under-layer of "
"synthetic fibers, it provides fantastic defense from small-arms fire, and "
"could take the edge off of a rifle bullet, too.  Designed to clip to the "
"chest and shoulders, its interior reads \"ATTACH TO MODULAR DEFENSE "
"SYSTEM\"."
msgstr ""
"Armadura impresa en 3D para el torso, hecha de polímero grueso y maleable "
"con fibras metálicas para reforzarlo. Gracias a una fina capa interior de "
"fibras sintéticas, brinda una defensa fantástica contra armas de bajo "
"calibre y también puede reducir el golpe de una bala de rifle. Diseñada para"
" engancharse al pecho y los hombros, en su interior dice \"ENGANCHAR EN UN "
"SISTEMA DEFENSIVO MODULAR\"."

#. ~ Tier 3 mantle
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "Hub 01 soldier mantle"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 soldier mantles"
msgstr[0] "manto de soldado Hub 01"
msgstr[1] "mantos de soldado Hub 01"
msgstr[2] "mantos de soldado Hub 01"

#. ~ Tier 3 mantle
#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 soldier mantle"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid ""
"3D printed armor for the upper body, sporting a professional finish and "
"stellar ergonomics.  Made of extremely tough UHMW polyethylene combined with"
" treated aramid fabric, it provides military-grade defense against zombies, "
"bullets, zombies with bullets, and plenty of other things that the Cataclysm"
" can throw at you.  Designed to clip to the chest and shoulders, its "
"interior reads \"ATTACH TO MODULAR DEFENSE SYSTEM\"."
msgstr ""
"Armadura impresa en 3D para el torso, con una terminación profesional y "
"ergonomía excelente. Está hecha con polietileno UHMW de extremada "
"resistencia combinado con tela aramida. Brinda defensa de grado militar "
"contra zombis, balas, zombis con balas y muchas otras cosas que el "
"Cataclismo te pueda presentar. Diseñada para enganchase al pecho y los "
"hombros, en su interior dice \"ENGANCHAR EN UN SISTEMA DEFENSIVO MODULAR\"."

#. ~ Tier 1 skirt
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "Hub 01 prototype skirt"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 prototype skirts"
msgstr[0] "falda prototipo Hub 01"
msgstr[1] "faldas prototipo Hub 01"
msgstr[2] "faldas prototipo Hub 01"

#. ~ Tier 1 skirt
#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 prototype skirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid ""
"3D printed armor for the thighs and knees, consisting of a skirt made of "
"segmented armor plates.  It features a simple integrated belt to let it fit "
"any waist size.  Despite its rough finish, it's clear that a lot of thought "
"has gone into the ergonomics and weight.  Designed to clip to the waist, its"
" interior reads \"ATTACH TO MODULAR DEFENSE SYSTEM\"."
msgstr ""
"Armadura impresa en 3D para los muslos y las rodillas que consiste en una "
"falda hecha de placas de armaduras segmentadas. Tiene un cinturón integrado "
"para poder ajustarse a cualquier tamaño de cintura. A pesar de sus "
"terminaciones irregulares, está claro que se le ha puesto mucho esfuerzo a "
"su ergonomía y su peso. Diseñada para engancharse a la cintura, en su "
"interior dice \"ENGANCHAR EN UN SISTEMA DEFENSIVO MODULAR\"."

#. ~ Tier 2 skirt
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "Hub 01 kinetic skirt"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 kinetic skirts"
msgstr[0] "falda kinética Hub 01"
msgstr[1] "faldas kinéticas Hub 01"
msgstr[2] "faldas kinéticas Hub 01"

#. ~ Tier 2 skirt
#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 kinetic skirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid ""
"3D printed armor for the thighs and knees, consisting of a skirt made of "
"segmented armor plates.  This model resembles scale armor, and provides "
"excellent protection from blunt trauma.  Designed to clip to the waist, its "
"interior reads \"ATTACH TO MODULAR DEFENSE SYSTEM\"."
msgstr ""
"Armadura impresa en 3D para los muslos y las rodillas que consiste en una "
"pollera hecha de placas de armaduras segmentadas. Este modelo se parece a "
"una armadura de escamas y brinda excelente protección contra los golpes. "
"Diseñada para engancharse a la cintura, en su interior dice \"ENGANCHAR EN "
"UN SISTEMA DEFENSIVO MODULAR\"."

#. ~ Tier 2 skirt
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "Hub 01 turnout skirt"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 turnout skirts"
msgstr[0] "falda de desvio Hub 01"
msgstr[1] "faldas de desvio Hub 01"
msgstr[2] "faldas de desvio Hub 01"

#. ~ Tier 2 skirt
#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 turnout skirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid ""
"3D printed armor for the thighs and knees, consisting of a skirt made of "
"segmented armor plates.  This version incorporates tight-fitting leggings "
"that provide some protection from extreme heat.  Designed to clip to the "
"waist, its interior reads \"ATTACH TO MODULAR DEFENSE SYSTEM\"."
msgstr ""
"Armadura impresa en 3D para los muslos y las rodillas que consiste en una "
"falda hecha de placas de armaduras segmentadas. Esta versión incorpora unas "
"perneras ajustadas que brindan un poco de protección contra el calor "
"extremo. Diseñada para engancharse a la cintura, en su interior dice "
"\"ENGANCHAR EN UN SISTEMA DEFENSIVO MODULAR\"."

#. ~ Tier 2 skirt
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "Hub 01 ballistic skirt"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 ballistic skirts"
msgstr[0] "falda balística Hub 01"
msgstr[1] "faldas balísticas Hub 01"
msgstr[2] "faldas balísticas Hub 01"

#. ~ Tier 2 skirt
#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 ballistic skirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid ""
"3D printed armor for the thighs and knees, consisting of a skirt made of "
"segmented armor plates.  It includes a reinforcing layer of aramid fabric in"
" addition to leg sleeves made of high-strength material, protecting your "
"sensitive bits from small-arms fire.  Designed to clip to the waist, its "
"interior reads \"ATTACH TO MODULAR DEFENSE SYSTEM\"."
msgstr ""
"Armadura impresa en 3D para los muslos y las rodillas que consiste en una "
"falda hecha de placas de armaduras segmentadas. Incluye una capa reforzada "
"de tela aramida además de unas mangas para las piernas hechas de un material"
" muy fuerte, que protege tus partes sensibles de armas de bajo calibre. "
"Diseñada para engancharse a la cintura, en su interior dice \"ENGANCHAR EN "
"UN SISTEMA DEFENSIVO MODULAR\"."

#. ~ Tier 3 skirt
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "Hub 01 soldier skirt"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 soldier skirts"
msgstr[0] "falda de soldado Hub 01"
msgstr[1] "faldas de soldado Hub 01"
msgstr[2] "faldas de soldado Hub 01"

#. ~ Tier 3 skirt
#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 soldier skirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid ""
"3D printed armor for the thighs and knees, sporting a professional finish "
"and stellar ergonomics.  Composed of segmented polyethylene armor plates "
"featuring a dense metal core sandwiched between layers of composite-grade "
"aramid fabric, it provides excellent protection for the upper legs to ensure"
" that you'll stay on your feet when it really matters.  Designed to clip to "
"the waist, its interior reads \"ATTACH TO MODULAR DEFENSE SYSTEM\"."
msgstr ""
"Armadura impresa en 3D para los muslos y las rodillas con una terminación "
"profesional y ergonomía excelente. Está compuesta de placas de polietileno "
"segmentadas con un núcleo de metal denso entre capas de tela de aramida "
"compuesta. Brinda una excelente protección a la parte superior de las "
"piernas para asegurar que puedas sostenerte en pie cuando más lo necesitas. "
"Diseñada para engancharse a la cintura, en su interior dice \"ENGANCHAR EN "
"UN SISTEMA DEFENSIVO MODULAR\"."

#. ~ Tier 1 vambraces
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "pair of Hub 01 prototype vambraces"
msgid_plural "pairs of Hub 01 prototype vambraces"
msgstr[0] "par de prototipos de vambrazas Hub 01"
msgstr[1] "pares de prototipos de vambrazas Hub 01"
msgstr[2] "pares de prototipos de vambrazas Hub 01"

#. ~ Tier 1 vambraces
#. ~ Description of "pair of Hub 01 prototype vambraces"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid ""
"3D printed arm guards, made of large and flexible polymer sheets wrapped "
"around the forearm.  The end of each sheet features a clip and drawstring, "
"to fit the armor to any size.  Despite the rough finish, it fits securely, "
"and feels quite comfortable."
msgstr ""
"Mangas impresas en 3D hechas de láminas de polímero grandes y flexibles que "
"se envuelven en el antebrazo. En la punta de cada lámina tiene un gancho y "
"un cordón para ajustar la armadura a cualquier tamaño. A pesar de su "
"terminación irregular, se ajustan de manera segura y se sienten bastante "
"cómodas."

#. ~ Tier 2 vambraces
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "pair of Hub 01 kinetic vambraces"
msgid_plural "pairs of Hub 01 kinetic vambraces"
msgstr[0] "par de avambrazos cinéticos Hub 01"
msgstr[1] "pares de avambrazos cinéticos Hub 01"
msgstr[2] "pares de avambrazos cinéticos Hub 01"

#. ~ Tier 2 vambraces
#. ~ Description of "pair of Hub 01 kinetic vambraces"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid ""
"3D printed arm guards, made of large and flexible polymer sheets wrapped "
"around the forearm.  These ones are built in an overlapping pattern that "
"diffuses impacts and provides excellent protection from blunt trauma."
msgstr ""
"Mangas impresas en 3D hechas de láminas de polímero grandes y flexibles que "
"se envuelven en el antebrazo. Estas están construidas con un diseño de "
"superposición de placas que dispersan los impactos y brindan una protección "
"excelente contra los golpes."

#. ~ Tier 2 vambraces
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid "pair of Hub 01 turnout vambraces"
msgid_plural "pairs of Hub 01 turnout vambraces"
msgstr[0] "par de avambrazos ignífugos Hub 01"
msgstr[1] "pares de avambrazos ignífugos Hub 01"
msgstr[2] "pares de avambrazos ignífugos Hub 01"

#. ~ Tier 2 vambraces
#. ~ Description of "pair of Hub 01 turnout vambraces"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid ""
"3D printed arm guards, made of large and flexible polymer sheets wrapped "
"around the forearm.  These ones include Nomex sleeves to protect your arms "
"from extreme heat."
msgstr ""
"Mangas impresas en 3D hechas de láminas de polímero grandes y flexibles que "
"se envuelven en el antebrazo. Estas incluyen mangas de Nomex para proteger "
