#. ~ Description of "ankle sheath"
#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
msgid ""
"A small concealed knife sheath worn on the ankle.  It is awkward to use "
"without practice.  Activate to sheathe/draw a weapon."
msgstr ""
"Una pequeña funda para cuchillo que se oculta en el tobillo. Es difícil de "
"usar sin práctica. Activar para enfundar/sacar un arma."

