msgstr[2] "fundas de espalda"

#. ~ Description of "back scabbard"
#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
msgid ""
"A leather scabbard, big enough for almost any sword.  Designed to be "
"strapped to the back, it's very difficult to draw from without considerable "
"practice.  Activate to sheath/draw a sword."
msgstr ""
"Una funda de cuero lo suficientemente grande para poner cualquier espada. "
"Diseñada para ser colgada en la espalda, pero es bastante difícil de usar "
"sin una práctica considerable. Activar para enfundar/sacar una espada."

