msgstr[2] "fundas de corteza de abedul"

#. ~ Description of "birchbark sheath"
#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
msgid ""
"A handcrafted sheath made from birch bark, for holding knives and other "
"small blades, with a strap attached.  Activate to sheathe/draw a weapon."
msgstr ""
"Una funda hecha a mano de corteza de abedul, para guardar cuchillos y otras "
"pequeñas cuchillas, con una correa. Activar para enfundar/sacar un arma."

