msgstr ""
"Es un bolso verde con diseño camuflado que se puede poner en los muslos y la"
" cadera utilizando sus correas ajustables. Para aquellos que tienen un "
"corazón militar."

#. ~ Variant name of item "drop leg bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "steampunk drop leg bag"
msgid_plural "steampunk drop leg bags"
msgstr[0] "bolso de pierna steampunk"
msgstr[1] "bolsos de pierna steampunk"
msgstr[2] "bolsos de pierna steampunk"

#. ~ Description of variant "steampunk drop leg bag" of item "drop leg bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A black and dark gold bag that can be worn on the thighs and hips using "
"adjustable buckled straps, with a steampunk design and chains all over it.  "
"Perfect for a wide variety of costumes."
msgstr ""
"Un bolso negro y dorado oscuro que se puede llevar en los muslos y las "
"caderas mediante correas ajustables con hebilla, con un diseño steampunk y "
"cadenas por todo el cuerpo. Perfecto para una gran variedad de disfraces."

#. ~ Variant name of item "drop leg bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid "skull drop leg bag"
msgid_plural "skull drop leg bags"
msgstr[0] "bolso de pierna de calavera"
msgstr[1] "bolsos de pierna de calavera"
msgstr[2] "bolsos de pierna de calavera"

#. ~ Description of variant "skull drop leg bag" of item "drop leg bag"
#: data/json/items/armor/storage.json
msgid ""
"A jet-black bag that can be worn on the thighs and hips using adjustable "
