#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "junkyard plate armor"
msgid_plural "junkyard plate armors"
msgstr[0] "armadura de placas de chatarra"
msgstr[1] "armaduras de placas de chatarra"
msgstr[2] "armaduras de placas de chatarra"

#. ~ Description of "junkyard plate armor"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A full set of steel armor made from sheet metal hammered into shape and "
"attached with chainmail covering the gaps.  For the modern knight on a "
"budget."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto completo de armadura de acero fabricado con láminas de metal "
"martilladas y unidas con cota de malla que cubre los huecos. Para el "
"caballero moderno con poco presupuesto."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "heavy junkyard plate armor"
msgid_plural "heavy junkyard plate armors"
msgstr[0] "armadura pesada de chatarra"
msgstr[1] "armaduras pesadas de chatarra"
msgstr[2] "armaduras pesadas de chatarra"

#. ~ Description of "heavy junkyard plate armor"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A full set of steel armor made from sheet metal hammered into shape and "
"attached with chainmail covering the gaps, with an extra-thick chestpiece.  "
"About as heavy as a car but nowhere near as mobile, this suit is nonetheless"
" quite protective."
msgstr ""
"Es un traje completo de armadura de acero hecha con láminas de metal unidas "
"a cota de malla para cubrir los espacios vacíos, con el peto más grueso. "
"Este traje es casi tan pesado como un auto pero no tan móvil, aunque "
"bastante protector."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "case hardened junkyard plate armor"
msgid_plural "case hardened junkyard plate armors"
msgstr[0] "armadura de placas de chatarra endurecida"
msgstr[1] "armaduras de placas de chatarra endurecidas"
msgstr[2] "armaduras de placas de chatarra endurecidas"

#. ~ Description of "case hardened junkyard plate armor"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A full set of steel armor made from sheet metal hammered into shape, "
"attached with chainmail, and case-hardened for extra strength.  It might be "
"crude and uncomfortably heavy, but it was clearly made by a skilled "
"metalworker and offers excellent protection."
msgstr ""
"Una armadura completa de acero hecha con láminas martilladas, unidas con "
"cota de malla y endurecidas para aumentar su resistencia. Puede que sea "
"tosca e incómoda, pero está claro que ha sido fabricada por un hábil "
"metalista y ofrece una excelente protección."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "heavy case hardened junkyard plate armor"
msgid_plural "heavy case hardened junkyard plate armors"
msgstr[0] "blindaje de placa de chatarra reforzada"
msgstr[1] "armaduras de placa de chatarra endurecida pesada"
msgstr[2] "armaduras de placa de chatarra endurecida pesada"

#. ~ Description of "heavy case hardened junkyard plate armor"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A full set of steel armor made from sheet metal hammered into shape, "
"attached with chainmail, with a double-thick chestpiece, and case-hardened "
"for extra strength.  Top-of-the-line in armor that looks like it was made "
"from banged-up lockers, for the skilled metalworker that values protection "
"over being able to move."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto completo de armadura de acero fabricada con láminas de metal "
"martilladas, unidas con cota de malla, con una pechera de doble grosor y "
"endurecida para una mayor resistencia. Una armadura de primera línea que "
"parece hecha con armarios desvencijados, para el metalista experto que "
"valora la protección por encima de la capacidad de movimiento."

