#. ~ Description of "riot armor suit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A full suit of black plastic body armor plates used by riot police.  "
"Cleverly placed velcro straps secure each piece, resulting in slightly less "
"encumbrance then its constituent parts.  Molle webbing is attached to the "
"thighs and the word POLICE is emblazoned across the front."
msgstr ""
"Un traje completo de placas de plástico negro para la policía "
"antidisturbios. Unas correas de velcro inteligentemente colocadas fijan cada"
" pieza, lo que resulta en un estorbo ligeramente menor que sus partes "
"constituyentes. Las correas Molle se sujetan a los muslos y la palabra "
"POLICE está estampada en la parte delantera."

