#. ~ Description of "arming pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"Thick pants made of quilted fabric, meant to be worn alongside a gambeson "
"under or without armor."
msgstr ""
"Pantalones gruesos de tejido acolchado, destinados a ser usados por debajo "
"de un gambesón o sin armadura."

#. ~ materials on this guy are slightly weird since it is trying to quilt soft
#. armor panels, so at thickest it is their thickness
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "Kevlar gambeson"
msgid_plural "Kevlar gambesons"
msgstr[0] "gambesón de Kevlar"
msgstr[1] "gambesones de Kevlar"
msgstr[2] "gambesones de Kevlar"

#. ~ materials on this guy are slightly weird since it is trying to quilt soft
#. armor panels, so at thickest it is their thickness
#. ~ Description of "Kevlar gambeson"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"Designed to mimic a thick jacket of quilted fabric that would be worn "
"underneath mail or other armor.  A base layer of aramid fabric has had "
"strips of soft body armor sewn into it to mimic quilting.  Use it to loosen "
"it if you want to wear it over your clothes."
msgstr ""
"Diseñado para imitar una chaqueta gruesa de tejido acolchado que se llevaría"
" debajo de la cota de malla u otra armadura. Una capa base de tejido de "
"aramida lleva cosidas tiras de armadura suave para imitar el acolchado. "
"Utilízala para aflojarla si quieres llevarla por encima de tu ropa."

#. ~ Item name
