#. ~ Description of "hazmat suit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"An impermeable whole-body garment worn as protection against hazardous "
"materials.  Restrictive and fragile, wearing it will provide complete "
"protection against ambient radiation.  It requires a separate gas mask for "
"full protection."
msgstr ""
"Una prenda impermeable para todo el cuerpo que se usa como protección contra"
" materiales peligrosos. Restrictivo y frágil, su uso proporciona una "
"protección completa contra la radiación ambiental. Requiere una máscara de "
"gas separada para una protección completa."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "flame-resistant suit"
msgid_plural "flame-resistant suits"
msgstr[0] "traje ignífugos"
msgstr[1] "trajes ignífugos"
msgstr[2] "trajes ignífugos"

#. ~ Description of "flame-resistant suit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A snug body suit made from thin and lightweight Nomex fire-resistant fabric."
"  Tough yet breathable, it is light and comfortable to wear under clothing."
msgstr ""
"Un traje ajustado, hecho de un tejido ligero y fino resistente al fuego "
"llamado Nomex. Resistente pero transpirable, es ligero y cómodo de llevar "
"bajo otra ropa."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
