msgstr[0] "traje ambiental Hub 01 (informal)"
msgstr[1] "trajes ambientales Hub 01 (informal)"
msgstr[2] "trajes ambientales Hub 01 (informal)"

#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 environmental suit (casual)"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A lightweight environmental suit incorporating Kevlar-lined boots, worn by "
"Hub personnel in their rare forays aboveground.  Colored brown and blue, the"
" upper portion has been tied around the waist casually."
msgstr ""
"Un traje ambiental ligero que incorpora botas forradas de Kevlar, usado por "
"el personal del Hub en sus raras incursiones en la superficie. De color "
"marrón y azul, la parte superior se ha atado a la cintura de forma informal."

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "Hub 01 environmental suit (casual)"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "activity suit (casual)"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "Wear normally"
msgstr "Ponérselo normalmente"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "Hub 01 environmental suit (casual)"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "activity suit (casual)"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "You untie the sleeves and put back on the top of the suit."
msgstr ""
"Te desatas las mangas y te vuelves a poner la parte superior del traje."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "activity suit"
msgid_plural "activity suits"
msgstr[0] "traje de actividad"
msgstr[1] "traje de actividades"
msgstr[2] "traje de actividades"

#. ~ Description of "activity suit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A single-piece brown and orange environmental suit, tailored in a way that "
"slightly recalls a military flight suit.  The letters \"X.E.D.R.A\" are "
"inscribed on its back, and a white shoulder patch on the right arm shows an "
"arrow reaching within rings of concentric circles.  It requires a separate "
"gas mask for full protection."
msgstr ""
"Un traje ambiental de una sola pieza de color marrón y naranja, "
"confeccionado de forma que recuerda ligeramente a un traje de vuelo militar."
" Lleva inscritas las letras \"X.E.D.R.A\" en la espalda, y un parche blanco "
"en el hombro, en el brazo derecho, muestra una flecha dentro de anillos de "
"círculos concéntricos. Requiere una máscara antigás independiente para una "
"protección completa."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "activity suit (casual)"
msgid_plural "activity suits (casual)"
msgstr[0] "traje de actividad (casual)"
msgstr[1] "trajes de actividad (casual)"
msgstr[2] "trajes de actividad (casual)"

#. ~ Description of "activity suit (casual)"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A single-piece brown and orange environmental suit, tailored in a way that "
"slightly recalls a military flight suit.  The upper portion has been tied "
"around the waist casually."
msgstr ""
"Un traje ambiental de una sola pieza, de color marrón y naranja, "
"confeccionado de una manera que recuerda ligeramente a un traje de vuelo "
"militar. La parte superior se ha atado a la cintura de forma informal."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "WS-47G moisture retention suit"
msgid_plural "WS-47G moisture retention suits"
msgstr[0] "traje de retención de humedad WS-47G"
msgstr[1] "trajes de retención de humedad WS-47G"
msgstr[2] "trajes de retención de humedad WS-47G"

#. ~ Description of "WS-47G moisture retention suit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The WebbStar moisture retention suit utilizes advanced technology to prevent"
" up to 30% of moisture loss through perspiration.  The suit is powered by "
"the micro-motions of the body, especially breathing and walking motions.  "
"Because of this, your walking speed is impaired while wearing it."
msgstr ""
"El traje de retención de humedad WebbStar utiliza tecnología avanzada para "
"prevenir hasta un 30% de pérdida de humedad a través de la transpiración. El"
" traje es impulsado por los micro-movimientos del cuerpo, especialmente al "
"respirar y caminar. Debido a esto, tu velocidad al caminar se ve dificultada"
" mientras lo lleva puesto."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "suit"
msgid_plural "suits"
msgstr[0] "traje"
msgstr[1] "trajes"
msgstr[2] "trajes"

#. ~ Description of "suit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A full-body cotton suit.  Makes the apocalypse a truly gentlemanly "
"experience."
msgstr ""
"Un traje de algodón de cuerpo entero. Hace que el apocalipsis también sea "
"una experiencia elegante."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "track touring suit"
msgid_plural "track touring suits"
msgstr[0] "traje de motociclista de circuito"
msgstr[1] "trajes de motociclista de circuito"
msgstr[2] "trajes de motociclista de circuito"

#. ~ Description of "track touring suit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A leather bodysuit with padding in high-impact areas, meant for "
"motorcyclists out on the track.  The leather is stiff but makes the armor "
"much sturdier and more protective than lighter counterparts."
msgstr ""
"Un traje de cuero acolchado en las áreas de mayor impacto, diseñado para los"
" motociclistas cuando están en el circuito.  El cuero es rígido pero hace "
"que el traje sea mucho más resistente y proteja más que otros trajes más "
"livianos."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "dress uniform"
msgid_plural "dress uniforms"
msgstr[0] "uniforme de gala"
msgstr[1] "uniformes de gala"
msgstr[2] "uniformes de gala"

#. ~ Description of "dress uniform"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A military officer's dress uniform from before the Cataclysm, complete with "
"rank and ribbons.  Just looking at it gives you an air of authority.  "
"Perhaps not the most practical military wear, but a very stylish option."
msgstr ""
"Un uniforme de gala de un oficial militar de antes del Cataclismo, completo "
"con el rango y galones. Solo mirarlo te da un aire de autoridad. Tal vez no "
"sea la ropa militar más práctica pero es una opción muy elegante."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "military flight suit"
msgid_plural "military flight suits"
msgstr[0] "traje militar de vuelo"
msgstr[1] "trajes militares de vuelo"
msgstr[2] "trajes militares de vuelo"

#. ~ Description of "military flight suit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A sage-green US military flight suit.  It has various insignia embroidered "
"onto it."
msgstr ""
"Un traje de vuelo militar estadounidense de color verde salvia. Lleva "
"bordadas varias insignias."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "nomad plate armor"
msgid_plural "nomad plate armors"
msgstr[0] "armadura de placas de nómada"
msgstr[1] "armaduras de placas de nómada"
msgstr[2] "armaduras de placas de nómada"

#. ~ Description of "nomad plate armor"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A full body multilayered suit of plate armor with a 4mm thick chest piece.  "
"The medium steel has been quenched, tempered and affixed over a full-body "
"layered suit of weight-distributing straps.  The armor has an integrated "
"breathable lycra jumpsuit and the torso has a spall liner of aramid panels."
"  Electronics run below the surface and circulate cool air to the skin, "
"drawing power from your internal CBM reservoir."
msgstr ""
"Un traje de armadura de placas de cuerpo entero con una pieza pectoral de 4 "
"mm de grosor. El acero medio ha sido templado, revenido y fijado sobre un "
"traje de capas de cuerpo entero con correas que distribuyen el peso. La "
"armadura lleva integrado un mono de lycra transpirable y el torso tiene un "
"revestimiento de paneles de aramida. La electrónica funciona por debajo de "
"la superficie y hace circular aire fresco hacia la piel, extrayendo energía "
"de su depósito interno MBC."

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "nomad plate armor"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "nomad light plate armor"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "nomad heavy plate armor"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "advanced nomad jumpsuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/custom_bodysuits.json
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "You turn the climate control on."
msgstr "Enciendes el control de clima."

#. ~ "need_charges_msg" action message of item "nomad plate armor"
