msgstr[2] "camisas sin mangas acolchadas de tela"

#. ~ Description of "cloth-padded sleeveless shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_armor.json
msgid ""
"A thick cotton shirt with the sleeves cut off and large amounts of cloth "
"sewn in to make a padded vest.  It would be fashionable, if not for all the "
"disparate colors from the patchwork cotton cannibalized from other random "
"clothes."
msgstr ""
"Un suéter grueso de algodón con las mangas cortadas y grandes cantidades de "
"tela cosida para formar un chaleco acolchado. Podría estar a la moda si no "
"fuera por todos los colores dispares de los retazos de algodón reciclados de"
" otras ropas."

