msgid_plural "football t-shirts"
msgstr[0] "camiseta de fútbol"
msgstr[1] "camisetas de fútbol"
msgstr[2] "camisetas de fútbol"

#. ~ Description of variant "football t-shirt" of item "t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A short-sleeved cotton shirt with the logo of a local football team printed "
"on its front and back."
msgstr ""
"Una camiseta de algodón de mangas cortas con el logo del equipo local de "
"fútbol americano impreso en la parte de adelante y atrás."

#. ~ Snippet of item "t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A short-sleeved cotton shirt with the text \"chown -R us ~your/base\" "
"printed on the front."
msgstr ""
"Es una camiseta de algodón de mangas cortas, con el texto \"chown -R us "
"~your/base\" impreso en la parte de adelante."

#. ~ Snippet of item "t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A light blue t-shirt with yellow block letters that say 'FDA Approved to "
"treat all diseases'."
msgstr ""
"Una camiseta celeste con letras cuadradas amarillas que dicen 'Aprobado por "
"el FDA para tratar todas las enfermedades'."

#. ~ Snippet of item "t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "A t-shirt with the text 'Anxiety is my super power'."
msgstr "Una camiseta con el texto 'La ansiedad es mi superpoder'."

#. ~ Snippet of item "t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "A t-shirt with the text 'Greetings from R'YLEH home of Cthulhu'."
msgstr "Una camiseta con el texto 'Saludos desde R'YLEH la casa de Cthulhu'."

#. ~ Snippet of item "t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "A t-shirt with the text 'Play robotfindskitten today'."
msgstr "Una camiseta con el texto 'Juega robotencuentrakitten hoy'."

#. ~ Snippet of item "t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A t-shirt with the text 'I survived the apocalypse and all I got was this "
"lousy T-shirt?'"
msgstr ""
"Una camiseta con el texto 'Yo sobreviví al apocalipsis y lo que obtuve fue "
"¿esta remera de cuarta?'"

#. ~ Snippet of item "t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A t-shirt with the text 'Zombies don't care whether or not you believe.'"
msgstr ""
"Una camiseta con el texto 'A los zombis no le importa si  crees o no crees'."

#. ~ Snippet of item "t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A t-shirt with the text 'Cthulhu for President: Why vote for the lesser "
"evil'."
msgstr ""
"Un camiseta con el texto 'Cthulhu Presidente: Porque votar al menos malo'."

#. ~ Snippet of item "t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A t-shirt with the text 'Cthulhu for President: This time the stars are "
"right'."
msgstr ""
"Un camiseta con el texto 'Cthulhu Presidente: Esta vez las estrellas tienen "
"razón'."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid "tour t-shirt"
msgid_plural "tour t-shirts"
msgstr[0] "camiseta de gira"
msgstr[1] "camisetas de gira"
msgstr[2] "camisetas de gira"

#. ~ Snippet of item "tour t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A short-sleeved cotton shirt with a death metal band's spidery, "
"indecipherable logo printed on the front."
msgstr ""
"Una camisa de algodón de manga corta con una banda de death metal de araña, "
"con un logo indescifrable impreso en el frente."

#. ~ Snippet of item "tour t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A short-sleeved cotton shirt with a muscle-bound, long-haired man printed on"
" the front.  He is riding a red dragon and wielding a flaming sword with "
"malicious glee."
msgstr ""
"Una camisa de algodón de manga corta con un hombre de pelo largo estampado "
"en la parte delantera. Está montando un dragón rojo y blandiendo una espada "
"de fuego con un regocijo malicioso."

#. ~ Snippet of item "tour t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A short-sleeved cotton shirt with a gore-spattered, guitar-playing zombie "
"printed on the front.  It's rather tasteless in light of current events."
msgstr ""
"Una camisa de algodón de manga corta con un zombi de gorra estampado en la "
"parte delantera. Es bastante insípida a la luz de los acontecimientos "
"actuales."

#. ~ Snippet of item "tour t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A short-sleeved cotton shirt with a pattern of complex geometric shapes and "
"transcendental imagery printed on the front."
msgstr ""
"Una camisa de algodón de manga corta con un patrón de formas geométricas "
"complejas e imágenes trascendentales impresas en el frente."

#. ~ Snippet of item "tour t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A short-sleeved cotton shirt with an image of a woman's face in portrait "
"printed on the front.  She is wearing a large blue mohawk, her face is set "
"in a snarl."
msgstr ""
"Una camisa de algodón de manga corta con una imagen del rostro de una mujer "
"en un retrato impreso en el frente. Lleva un gran mohawk azul, su cara está "
"puesta en un gruñido."

#. ~ Snippet of item "tour t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A short-sleeved black cotton shirt with a stylized representation of a radio"
" wave printed on the front."
msgstr ""
"Una camisa de algodón negro de manga corta con una estilizada representación"
" de una onda de radio impresa en el frente."

#. ~ Snippet of item "tour t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A short-sleeved cotton shirt, its front showing an image of an upside-down "
"American flag covered in anarchist graffiti, its edges frayed and burned."
msgstr ""
"Una camiseta de algodón de mangas cortas con la imagen de la bandera de "
"Estados Unidos dada vuelta y cubierta de graffitis anarquistas, sus bordes "
"están raídos y quemados."

#. ~ Snippet of item "tour t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A short-sleeved cotton shirt with an AK-47 on the front.  It is held up by a"
" clenched fist around its forestock, the fingers covered in crude looking "
"tattoos."
msgstr ""
"Una camisa de algodón de manga corta con un AK-47 en el frente. Se sostiene "
"con un puño cerrado alrededor de su ganado, los dedos cubiertos de tatuajes "
"de aspecto tosco."

#. ~ Snippet of item "tour t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A short-sleeved cotton shirt with an interstellar bounty hunter on the "
"front.  'My backpack's got jets'."
msgstr ""
"Una camiseta de algodón de mangas cortas con un cazarrecompensas "
"interestelar en la parte de adelante. 'Mi mochila me permite volar'."

#. ~ Snippet of item "tour t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A short-sleeved white cotton shirt with the words 'THE DARKEST OF THE "
"HILLSIDE THICKETS' with a picture of giant fantastical creatures dancing in "
"a line.  Below the picture read the words 'Where the Great Old Ones Are'."
msgstr ""
"Una camiseta blanca de algodón de mangas cortas con las palabras 'THE "
"DARKEST OF THE HILLSIDE THICKETS' con la imagen de unas fantásticas "
"criaturas gigantescas bailando en línea. Debajo de la imagen, estaban las "
"palabras 'Donde están Los Grandes Antiguos'."

#. ~ Snippet of item "tour t-shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/torso_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A short-sleeved black cotton shirt with the words 'THE DARKEST OF THE "
"HILLSIDE THICKETS' below a picture of a roofless green Dodge Charger with "
"five robed men in it.  The driver is throwing back a drink from a goblet, "
"the first passenger is chanting from a book, the other three passengers are "
"firing various guns at a blue flying eye with tentacles and a snail shell.  "
"Red letters read 'THE DUKES OF ALHAZRED'."
msgstr ""
"Una camiseta negra de algodón de mangas cortas con las palabras 'THE DARKEST"
" OF THE HILLSIDE THICKETS' debajo de una imagen de un Dodge Charger verde "
"sin techo con cinco hombres adentro. El conductor está mandándose un trago "
"de un cáliz, el primer pasajero está cantando con un libro, los otros tres "
"están disparando diversas armas hacia un ojo volador azul con tentáculos y "
"caparazón de caracol. Unas letras rojas dicen 'LOS DUKES DE ALHAZRED'."

