msgstr[2] "copias de La Vida Deliciosa: La Cocina Mexicana Definitiva"

#. ~ Description of "La Vida Deliciosa: Definitive Mexican Cuisine"
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"This cookbook has lots of colorful pictures of finished dishes and features "
"personal tips from the author/chef on nearly every recipe.  On the back "
"cover are two joyful photos of the author in the kitchen with their parents:"
" one as a child and one as an adult."
msgstr ""
"Este libro de recetas tiene muchas imágenes coloridas de platos terminados y"
" contiene consejos personales del autor/chef para casi todas las recetas.  "
"En la contratapa tiene dos fotos del autor en la cocina con sus padres: una "
"de cuando era niño y la otra de adulto."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "Sushi Made Easy"
msgid_plural "copies of Sushi Made Easy"
msgstr[0] "Sushi con Facilidad"
msgstr[1] "copias de Sushi con Facilidad"
msgstr[2] "copias de Sushi con Facilidad"

#. ~ Description of "Sushi Made Easy"
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A simple text for the aspiring sushi lover, this easy-to-read guide is "
"filled with lots of helpful illustrations for everything from basic rice "
"preparation to setting a proper Japanese table."
msgstr ""
"Un texto sencillo para el aspirante a amante del sushi, esta guía de fácil "
"lectura está repleta de ilustraciones útiles para todo, desde la preparación"
" básica del arroz hasta el montaje de una mesa japonesa adecuada."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "family cookbook"
msgid_plural "family cookbooks"
msgstr[0] "libro de cocina familiar"
msgstr[1] "libros de cocina familiar"
msgstr[2] "libros de cocina familiar"

#. ~ Description of "family cookbook"
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A big binder full of somebody's family recipes.  The well-turned pages and "
"creased corners speak volumes of the culinary knowledge contained within.  "
"You could probably learn a lot about cooking from studying this domestic "
"artifact."
msgstr ""
"Una gran carpeta llena de recetas de alguna familia. Las elegantes páginas y"
" esquinas arrugadas nos da una idea de la cantidad de conocimiento culinario"
" que contiene. Probablemente, puedas aprender mucho sobre cocina estudiando "
"este libro casero."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "Bon Appetit"
msgid_plural "issues of Bon Appetit"
msgstr[0] "Bon Appetit"
msgstr[1] "ediciones de Bon Appetit"
msgstr[2] "ediciones de Bon Appetit"

#. ~ Description of "Bon Appetit"
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"Exciting recipes and restaurant reviews.  Full of handy tips about cooking."
msgstr ""
"Recetas apasionantes y reseñas de restaurantes. Lleno de consejos útiles "
"para cocinar."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "Glamopolitan"
msgid_plural "issues of Glamopolitan"
msgstr[0] "Glamopolitan"
msgstr[1] "ediciones de Glamopolitan"
msgstr[2] "ediciones de Glamopolitan"

#. ~ Description of "Glamopolitan"
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"This is a full-size glossy women's magazine.  There are a few unoriginal "
"recipes and some simple cooking tips somewhere in between the fashion photos"
" and the sex advice columns."
msgstr ""
"Esta es de una revista femenina de tamaño considerable. Hay algunas recetas "
"poco originales y algunos consejos de cocina sencillos entre las fotos de "
"moda y las columnas de consejos sexuales."

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ That would translate out to The Scottish Book of Cookery, or The Scottish
#. Cookbook.
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "Ye Scots Beuk o Cuikery"
msgid_plural "copies of Ye Scots Beuk o Cuikery"
msgstr[0] "Ye Scots Beuk o Cuikery"
msgstr[1] "copias de Ye Scots Beuk o Cuikery"
msgstr[2] "copias de Ye Scots Beuk o Cuikery"

#. ~ Description of "Ye Scots Beuk o Cuikery"
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A semi-translated Gaelic cookbook from sixteenth century Scotland.  While a "
"bit difficult to read, as there are a disquieting number of illustrations of"
" people stabbing each other mixed with rants about 'True Scotsmen', it "
"provides insights into medieval Scottish cuisine and culture."
msgstr ""
"Un libro de cocina gaélica semitraducido de la Escocia del siglo XVI. Aunque"
" es un poco difícil de leer, ya que hay un número inquietante de "
"ilustraciones de personas apuñalándose unas a otras mezcladas con discursos "
"sobre el \"Verdadero Escocés\", proporciona información sobre la cocina y la"
" cultura escocesa medieval."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "The Vinegar Maker's Handbook"
msgid_plural "copies of Vinegar Maker's Handbook"
msgstr[0] "Manual del Fabricante de Vinagre"
msgstr[1] "copias del Manual del Fabricante de Vinagre"
msgstr[2] "copias del Manual del Fabricante de Vinagre"

#. ~ Description of "The Vinegar Maker's Handbook"
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"This book describes in detail all the ways that one can make vinegar.  You "
"would have thought that there wasn't much to making vinegar, but the girth "
"of this book tells you otherwise."
msgstr ""
"Este libro describe en detalle todas las maneras en que se puede hacer "
"vinagre. Seguro pensaste que no había mucha información sobre hacer vinagre,"
" pero el ancho de este libro te dice lo contrario."

#. ~ Later on add mead transforms that don't require distilling to this book
