msgid_plural "strawberry surprises"
msgstr[0] "sorpresa de fresa"
msgstr[1] "sorpresas de fresa"
msgstr[2] "sorpresas de fresa"

#. ~ Description of "strawberry surprise"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"Strawberries left to ferment with a few other choice ingredients offer up a "
"surprisingly palatable mixture; you barely even have to force yourself to "
"drink it after the first few gulps."
msgstr ""
"Fresas dejadas a fermentar con otros ingredientes seleccionados, lo que "
"produce una mezcla sorprendentemente sabrosa. Apenas te tienes que obligar a"
" beberla después de los primeros tragos."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
