#. ~ Description of "chunk of porkbelly"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"A fatty cut of pork from the belly, popular in some cuisine.  With proper "
"technique, it can be used to create bacon.  Not safe to consume in its "
"current raw form."
msgstr ""
"Un corte graso del cerdo procedente de la panza, popular en algunas cocinas."
" Con la técnica adecuada, puede utilizarse para crear tocino. No es seguro "
"consumirlo en su forma cruda actual."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
