msgid_plural "slabs of raw cured porkbelly"
msgstr[0] "rebanada de panza de cerdo curada cruda"
msgstr[1] "rebanadas de panza de cerdo curada cruda"
msgstr[2] "rebanadas de panza de cerdo curada cruda"

#. ~ Description of "slab of raw cured porkbelly"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"Porkbelly that has been preserved and flavored with salt and sugar to draw "
"out the moisture from the first layer.  Still raw, it is ready for smoking "
"into bacon."
msgstr ""
"Panceta conservada y aromatizada con sal y azúcar para extraer la humedad de"
" la primera capa. Todavía cruda, está lista para ser ahumada en forma de "
"panceta."

#. ~ High price to reflect the rarity and value of bacon. Note that this is
#. three pieces of it.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "large slab of uncut bacon"
msgid_plural "large slabs of uncut bacon"
msgstr[0] "gran rebanada de tocino sin cortar"
msgstr[1] "grandes rebanadas de tocino sin cortar"
msgstr[2] "grandes rebanadas de tocino sin cortar"

#. ~ High price to reflect the rarity and value of bacon. Note that this is
#. three pieces of it.
#. ~ Description of "large slab of uncut bacon"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"A huge slab of uncut smoked bacon.  You can eat it as is, but it would be "
"more efficient to cut it into smaller portions with a knife."
msgstr ""
"Un enorme trozo de tocino ahumado sin cortar. Se puede comer tal cual, pero "
"sería más eficiente cortarlo en porciones más pequeñas con un cuchillo."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
