msgstr[1] "riñones crudos"
msgstr[2] "riñones crudos"

#. ~ Description of "raw kidney"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"A chunk of kidney from an animal.  Preparing it for cooking is a challenge "
"unless you want the kitchen to smell strongly of urine."
msgstr ""
"Un trozo de riñón de un animal. Prepararlo para cocinar es un reto, a menos "
"que quieras que la cocina huela fuertemente a orina."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "raw human kidney"
msgid_plural "raw human kidneys"
msgstr[0] "riñón humano crudo"
msgstr[1] "riñones humanos crudos"
msgstr[2] "riñones humanos crudos"

#. ~ Description of "raw human kidney"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"A chunk of kidney from a human, which appears to have been extracted too "
"crudely to ever be useful as a transplant."
msgstr ""
"Un trozo de riñón de un humano, que parece haber sido extraído con demasiada"
" crudeza para que pueda ser útil como trasplante."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "raw demihuman kidney"
msgid_plural "raw demihuman kidneys"
msgstr[0] "riñón demihumano crudo"
msgstr[1] "riñones demihumanos crudos"
msgstr[2] "riñones demihumanos crudos"

#. ~ Description of "raw demihuman kidney"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "This is probably a piece of kidney extracted from a demihuman being."
msgstr ""
"Esto es probablemente un trozo de riñón extraído de un ser demi-humano."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "cooked kidney"
msgid_plural "cooked kidneys"
msgstr[0] "riñón cocinado"
msgstr[1] "riñones cocinados"
msgstr[2] "riñones cocinados"

#. ~ Description of "cooked kidney"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "No, this is not beans."
msgstr "No, esto no son alubias."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "raw mutant kidney"
msgid_plural "raw mutant kidney"
msgstr[0] "riñón mutante crudo"
msgstr[1] "riñones mutantes crudos"
msgstr[2] "riñones mutantes crudos"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "cooked mutant kidney"
msgid_plural "cooked mutant kidney"
msgstr[0] "riñón mutante cocinado"
msgstr[1] "riñones mutantes cocinados"
msgstr[2] "riñones mutantes cocinados"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "raw sweetbread"
msgid_plural "raw sweetbreads"
msgstr[0] "lechecilla cruda"
msgstr[1] "lechecillas crudas"
msgstr[2] "lechecillas crudas"

#. ~ Description of "raw sweetbread"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"A piece of the thymus or pancreas of an animal.  These are a delicacy, if "
"prepared properly."
msgstr ""
"Un trozo de timo o páncreas de un animal. Son un manjar, si se preparan "
"adecuadamente."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "raw human sweetbread"
msgid_plural "raw human sweetbreads"
msgstr[0] "molleja humana cruda"
msgstr[1] "mollejas humanas crudas"
msgstr[2] "mollejas humanas crudas"

#. ~ Description of "raw human sweetbread"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"A piece of the thymus or pancreas of a human, which appears to have been "
"extracted too crudely to ever be useful as a transplant."
msgstr ""
"Un trozo de timo o de páncreas de un ser humano, que parece haber sido "
"extraído con demasiada crudeza para que pueda ser útil como trasplante."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "raw demihuman sweetbread"
msgid_plural "raw demihuman sweetbreads"
msgstr[0] "molleja demihumana cruda"
msgstr[1] "mollejas demihumanas crudas"
msgstr[2] "mollejas demihumanas crudas"

#. ~ Description of "raw demihuman sweetbread"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"The consistency of this chunk of organ suggests possibly a thymus or "
"pancreas equivalent."
msgstr ""
"La consistencia de este trozo de órgano sugiere posiblemente un equivalente "
"al timo o al páncreas."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "cooked sweetbread"
msgid_plural "cooked sweetbreads"
msgstr[0] "lechecilla cocinada"
msgstr[1] "lechecillas cocinadas"
msgstr[2] "lechecillas cocinadas"

#. ~ Description of "cooked sweetbread"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"Normally a delicacy, but this style of preparation is missing something."
msgstr ""
"Normalmente es una delicia, pero a este estilo de preparación le falta algo."

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of an ammunition type
