#. ~ Description of "raw milk"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/dairy.json
msgid ""
"This is raw, unhomogenized and unpasteurized milk from a cow.  It couldn't "
"be any fresher unless you drank it straight from the cow, which might upset "
"it.  Depending on your dietary sensibilities, you might want to pasteurize "
"or even boil this before drinking."
msgstr ""
"Esta es leche cruda, no homogeneizada y no pasteurizada de una vaca. No "
"podría ser más fresca a menos que se beba directamente de la vaca, lo que "
"podría alterarla. Dependiendo de tu sensibilidad dietética, puede que "
"quieras pasteurizar o incluso hervirla antes de beberla."

