msgstr[1] "caviar post apocalíptico"
msgstr[2] "caviar post apocalíptico"

#. ~ Description of "post apocalyptic 'caviar'"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/egg.json
msgid ""
"Fish eggs that have been cured in a salty brine.  Can be vacuum sealed to "
"preserve freshness.  Technically caviar only came from a specific type of "
"Sturgeon roe but the FDA allows all cured fish to be referred to as caviar."
msgstr ""
"Huevos de pescado curados en una salmuera salada. Pueden sellarse al vacío "
"para conservar su frescura. Técnicamente, el caviar sólo procede de un tipo "
"específico de huevas de esturión, pero la FDA permite denominar caviar a "
"todo el pescado curado."

