msgstr[1] "Postres de fruta de alcachofa de Jerusalén"
msgstr[2] "Postres de fruta de alcachofa de Jerusalén"

#. ~ Description of "Jerusalem artichoke fruit dessert"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Chopped Jerusalem artichoke combined with any fruit that is in season or at "
"hand.  Surprisingly tasty."
msgstr ""
"Alcachofa de Jerusalén picada combinada con cualquier fruta que esté en "
"temporada o a mano. Sorprendentemente sabroso."

