#. ~ That's whisky without an 'e' because we're talking about Scotch whisky.
#. ~ Description of "haggis"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
msgid ""
"This traditional Scottish savory pudding is made of meat and offal mixed "
"with oatmeal, sewn into an animal's stomach and boiled.  Surprisingly tasty "
"and quite filling, it is best served with boiled root vegetables and strong "
"whisky."
msgstr ""
"Este tradicional pudín salado escocés hecho de carne y achuras mezcladas con"
" avena, cosido al estómago del animal y hervido. Sorprendentemente, es "
"sabroso y te llena bastante. Lo mejor es servirlo con raíces hervidas y un "
"whisky fuerte."

