#. ~ Description of "valencian paella"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
msgid ""
"A traditional dish originating from Spain, more specifically from the region"
" of Valencia.  A very tasty and filling dish made traditionally of rabbit, "
"beans, rice, chicken, spices and sometimes snails."
msgstr ""
"Un plato tradicional de España, específicamente de la región de Valencia.  "
"Es muy sabroso, sustancioso y está hecho tradicionalmente con conejo, "
"judías, arroz, pollo, especias y a veces caracoles."

#. ~ Nutrition information roughly based on a serving of 6 snails + butter and
#. veggies. if you know more pls expand
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/meat_dishes.json
