msgstr[1] "chicles con cafeína"
msgstr[2] "chicles con cafeina"

#. ~ Description of "caffeinated chewing gum"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "Sugar-free chewing gum with added caffeine, it's a nice pick-me-up."
msgstr "Chicle sin azúcar y con cafeína añadida, es un buen estimulante."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "caffeine pill"
msgid_plural "caffeine pills"
msgstr[0] "pastilla de cafeina"
msgstr[1] "pastillas de cafeina"
msgstr[2] "pastillas de cafeina"

#. ~ Description of "caffeine pill"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A No-doz brand caffeine pill, maximum strength.  Useful in pulling an all-"
"nighter, one pill is equivalent to a strong cup of coffee."
msgstr ""
"Pastillas de cafeína de marca No-doz, máxima fuerza. Útiles para aguantar de"
" sobras una noche, cada pastilla equivale a una taza de café fuerte."

#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "caffeine pill"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "You take a caffeine pill."
msgstr "Tomas una pastilla de cafeína."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "chewing tobacco"
msgid_plural "chewing tobaccos"
msgstr[0] "tabaco de mascar"
msgstr[1] "tabacos de mascar"
msgstr[2] "tabacos de mascar"

#. ~ Description of "chewing tobacco"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Mint-flavored chewing tobacco.  While absolutely terrible for your health, "
"it was once a favorite amongst baseball players, cowboys, and other macho "
"types."
msgstr ""
"Tabaco masticable con sabor a menta. Aunque es absolutamente terrible para "
"tu salud, fue muy utilizado por los jugadores de béisbol, vaqueros y otros "
"machos."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "hydrogen peroxide"
msgid_plural "hydrogen peroxide"
msgstr[0] "peroxido de hidrogeno"
msgstr[1] "peroxido de hidrogeno"
msgstr[2] "peroxido de hidrogeno"

#. ~ Description of "hydrogen peroxide"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Dilute hydrogen peroxide, for use as an antiseptic and for bleaching hair or"
" textiles.  Foams a little when in contact with organic matter, but "
"otherwise harmless."
msgstr ""
"Peróxido de hidrógeno diluido, para usar como antiséptico o blanqueador de "
"pelo o telas. Hace un poco de espuma cuando está en contacto con materia "
"orgánica, pero si no es inofensivo."

#. ~ Description of "cigarette"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A mixture of dried tobacco leaf, pesticides, and chemical additives, rolled "
"into a filtered paper tube.  Stimulates mental acuity and reduces appetite."
"  Highly addictive and hazardous to health, but lung cancer is kind of the "
"least of your concerns at this point."
msgstr ""
"Una mezcla de tabaco seco, pesticidas y aditivos químicos, enrollados en un "
"papel tubular con filtro. Estimula la agudeza mental y reduce el apetito. "
"Muy adictivo y dañino para la salud pero el cáncer de pulmón es la menor de "
"tus preocupaciones en este momento."

#. ~ Description of "cigar"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Rolled, cured tobacco leaf, addictive and hazardous to health.\n"
"A gentleman's vice, cigars set the civil man apart from the savage."
msgstr ""
"Hojas de tabaco curadas, enrolladas. Adictivo y peligroso para la salud.\n"
"El vicio de un caballero, los cigarros separan al hombre civilizado del salvaje."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "chloroform soaked rag"
msgid_plural "chloroform soaked rags"
msgstr[0] "trapo empapado con cloroformo"
msgstr[1] "trapos empapados con cloroformo"
msgstr[2] "trapos empapados con cloroformo"

#. ~ Description of "chloroform soaked rag"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "A debug item that lets you put NPCs (or yourself) to sleep."
msgstr ""
"Un objeto para depurar que te permite dormir a los PNJs (o a ti mismo)."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "codeine"
msgid_plural "codeine"
msgstr[0] "codeina"
msgstr[1] "codeina"
msgstr[2] "codeina"

#. ~ Description of "codeine"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A mild opiate used in the suppression of pain, cough, and other ailments.  "
"While relatively weak for a narcotic, it is still addictive, with a "
"potential for overdose."
msgstr ""
"Un opiáceo leve que se usa para calmar el dolor, la tos y otros achaques. "
"Aunque es un narcótico relativamente débil, es adictivo y tiene el potencial"
" de causar sobredosis."

#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "codeine"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "You take some codeine."
msgstr "Tomas codeína."

#. ~ Description of "cocaine"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Crystalline extract of the coca leaf, or at least, a white powder with some "
"of that in it.  A topical analgesic, it is more commonly used for its "
"stimulatory properties.  Highly addictive."
msgstr ""
"Extractos cristalinos de la hoja de coca, o por lo menos, polvo blanco con "
"algo de eso. Un anestésico de contacto, es utilizado más comúnmente por sus "
"propiedades estimulantes. Altamente adictiva."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "methacola"
msgid_plural "methacolas"
msgstr[0] "metacola"
msgstr[1] "metacolas"
msgstr[2] "metacolas"

#. ~ Description of "methacola"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A potent cocktail of amphetamines, caffeine and corn syrup, this stuff puts "
"a spring in your step, a fire in your eye, and a bad case of tachycardia "
"tremors in your somersaulting heart."
msgstr ""
"Una potente bebida de anfetaminas, cafeína y jarabe de maíz. Esto pone un "
"resorte en tus pasos, fuego en tus ojos, y unos temblores de taquicardia en "
"tu sobresaltado corazón."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "pair of contact lenses"
msgid_plural "pairs of contact lenses"
msgstr[0] "par de lentillas"
msgstr[1] "pares de lentillas"
msgstr[2] "pares de lentillas"

#. ~ Description of "pair of contact lenses"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A pair of extended-wear contacts with soft lenses designed to be discarded "
"after a week of use.  They are a great replacement for wearing glasses and "
"sit comfortably on the surface of the eye."
msgstr ""
"Un par lentes de contactos de uso prolongado, diseñados para ser descartados"
" después de una semana de uso. Son un buen reemplazo para las gafas y se "
"ponen cómodamente en la superficie del ojo."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "cotton balls"
msgid_plural "cotton balls"
msgstr[0] "bolitas de algodon"
msgstr[1] "bolitas de algodon"
msgstr[2] "bolitas de algodon"

#. ~ Description of "cotton balls"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Fluffy balls of clean, white cotton.  They can serve as makeshift bandages "
"in an emergency."
msgstr ""
"Bolitas peludas de algodón blanco. Pueden usarse como vendas improvisadas en"
" una emergencia."

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Sound description of spell "Cold Snap"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Tundra_Mage.json
msgid "crack"
msgid_plural "crack"
msgstr[0] "crack"
msgstr[1] "crack"
msgstr[2] "crack"

#. ~ Description of "crack"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Deprotonated cocaine crystals, incredibly addictive and deleterious to brain"
" chemistry."
msgstr ""
"Cristales de cocaína desprotonados, increíblemente adictivos y deletéreos "
"para la química cerebral."

#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "crack"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "You smoke your crack rocks.  Mother would be proud."
msgstr "Te fumas tus piedras de crack. Tu madre estaría orgullosa."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "non-drowsy cough syrup"
msgid_plural "non-drowsy cough syrup"
msgstr[0] "jarabe para la tos que no causa sueño"
msgstr[1] "jarabe para la tos que no causa sueño"
msgstr[2] "jarabe para la tos que no causa sueño"

#. ~ Description of "non-drowsy cough syrup"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Daytime cold and flu medication, non-drowsy formula.  Will suppress "
"coughing, aching, headaches and runny noses, but you'll still need lots of "
"fluids and rest."
msgstr ""
"Medicación diurna para el resfriado y la gripe. Esta fórmula no causa sueño."
" Frena la tos, los dolores, como el de cabeza y las narices que gotean. Vas "
"a necesitar descanso y mucho líquido."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "antiseptic"
msgid_plural "antiseptic"
msgstr[0] "antiseptico"
msgstr[1] "antisepticos"
msgstr[2] "antisepticos"

#. ~ Description of "antiseptic"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "A powerful antiseptic commonly used to disinfect wounds."
msgstr "Un potente antiséptico comúnmente utilizado para desinfectar heridas."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "makeshift antiseptic"
msgid_plural "makeshift antiseptics"
msgstr[0] "antiséptico improvisado"
msgstr[1] "antisépticos improvisados"
msgstr[2] "antisépticos improvisados"

#. ~ Description of "makeshift antiseptic"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Makeshift antiseptic made from ethanol.  Can be used to disinfect wounds."
msgstr ""
"Un antiséptico improvisado hecho con etanol. Puede ser utilizado para "
"desinfectar heridas."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "alcohol wipe"
msgid_plural "alcohol wipe"
msgstr[0] "toallita con alcohol"
msgstr[1] "toallitas con alcohol"
msgstr[2] "toallitas con alcohol"

#. ~ Description of "alcohol wipe"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A wet wipe saturated with alcohol and stored in a sterile package.  Used for"
" personal hygiene or disinfecting small wounds."
msgstr ""
"Una toallita humedecida con alcohol almacenada en un paquete esterilizado.  "
"Se puede utilizar para higiene personal o para desinfectar pequeñas heridas."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "prescription sedative"
msgid_plural "prescription sedative"
msgstr[0] "sedante de prescripción"
msgstr[1] "sedantes de prescripción"
msgstr[2] "sedantes de prescripción"

#. ~ Description of "prescription sedative"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A strong benzodiazepine drug used to treat muscle spasms, anxiety, seizures,"
" and panic attacks."
msgstr ""
"Una poderosa droga benzodiazepina utilizada para tratar los espasmos "
"musculares, la ansiedad, las convulsiones y los ataques de pánico."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "cannabis shatter"
msgid_plural "cannabis shatter"
msgstr[0] "concentrado de cannabis"
msgstr[1] "concentrados de cannabis"
msgstr[2] "concentrados de cannabis"

#. ~ Description of "cannabis shatter"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Concentrated cannabis extract, commonly known as dabs.  This particular "
"style of concentrate is in a thin sheet and shatters like glass at room "
"temperature.  Arguably one of the better styles of concentrate compared to "
"wax, crumble, or distillate.  Normal cannabis contains around 20% THC; this "
"shatter should be around 55% THC."
msgstr ""
"Extracto de cannabis concentrado, comúnmente conocido como dabs. Este tipo "
"de concentrado en particular es una fina lámina que se quiebra como el "
"vidrio a temperatura ambiente. En teoría es uno de los mejores estilos de "
"concentrado comparado con la cera, migajas o destilados.  El cannabis normal"
" contiene cerca del 20% de THC, este concentrado esta cerca del 55%."

#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "cannabis shatter"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "You take a dab.  Wow, that's got some killer terpenes!"
msgstr "Tomas una pizca. ¡Vaya, eso tiene unos terpenos asesinos!"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "cannabis wax"
msgid_plural "cannabis wax"
msgstr[0] "cera de cannabis"
msgstr[1] "ceras de cannabis"
msgstr[2] "ceras de cannabis"

#. ~ Description of "cannabis wax"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Concentrated cannabis extract, commonly known as dabs.  This particular "
"style of concentrate is yellow and waxy at room temperature.  Normal "
"cannabis contains around 20% THC; this wax should be around 45% THC."
msgstr ""
"Extracto de cannabis concentrado, comúnmente conocido como dabs. Este tipo "
"de concentrado en particular es amarillo y tiene la consistencia de la cera "
"a temperatura ambiente. El cannabis normal contiene cerca del 20% de THC, "
"esta cera esta cerca del 45%."

#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "cannabis wax"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "You take a dab of wax.  *cough cough* Good stuff!"
msgstr "Tomas una pizca de cera. *Toses ,toses* ¡Buena cosa!"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "cannabis distillate"
msgid_plural "cannabis distillate"
msgstr[0] "destilado de cannabis"
msgstr[1] "destilados de cannabis"
msgstr[2] "destilados de cannabis"

#. ~ Description of "cannabis distillate"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Concentrated cannabis extract.  This style of extract goes through the most "
"processing, eliminating most if not all harmful ingredients.  Normal "
"cannabis contains around 20% THC; this distillate should be around 88% THC."
"  Can be smoked using a refillable electronic cigarette."
msgstr ""
"Extracto concentrado de cannabis.  Este tipo de extracto ya pasó por la "
"mayor parte del proceso, eliminando casi todos o la mayoría de los "
"ingredientes dañinos.  El cannabis normal contiene cerca del 20% de THC, "
"este destilado debe esta cerca del 88%.  Puede ser fumado utilizando un "
"cigarrillo electrónico."

#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "cannabis distillate"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "You take a dab of distillate.  Sooooo smooth…"
msgstr "Bebes un poco de destilado. Taaaaan suave..."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "electronic cigarette"
msgid_plural "electronic cigarettes"
msgstr[0] "cigarrillo electronico"
msgstr[1] "cigarrillos electronicos"
msgstr[2] "cigarrillos electronicos"

#. ~ Description of "electronic cigarette"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"This battery-operated device vaporizes a liquid that contains flavorings and"
" nicotine.  A less harmful alternative to traditional cigarettes, but it's "
"still addictive.  It can't be reused once it's empty."
msgstr ""
"Este dispositivo a batería vaporiza un líquido que contiene aromatizantes y "
"nicotina. Una alternativa menos dañina de los cigarrillos tradicionales, "
"pero también adictivo. Puede ser reutilizado una vez que se vacía."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "saline eye drop"
msgid_plural "saline eye drops"
msgstr[0] "colirio"
msgstr[1] "colirios"
msgstr[2] "colirios"

#. ~ Description of "saline eye drop"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Sterile saline eye drops.  Can be used to treat dry eyes, or to wash out "
"contaminants."
msgstr ""
"Gotas para los ojos de solución salina estéril. Puede ser usada para tratar "
"ojos secos, o para lavar el ojo de contaminantes."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
msgid "flu shot"
msgid_plural "flu shots"
msgstr[0] "vacuna para la gripe"
msgstr[1] "vacunas para la gripe"
msgstr[2] "vacunas para la gripe"

#. ~ Description of "flu shot"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A pharmaceutical flu shot designed for mass vaccinations, still in its "
"packaging.  Purported to provide immunity to influenza, for the flu season "
"for which it was developed."
msgstr ""
"Una vacuna farmacéutica para la gripe, diseñada para vacunaciones en masa, "
"todavía en su paquete original.  Supuestamente te hace inmune a la gripe "
"para la temporada que fue diseñada."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_comestibles.json
msgid "chewing gum"
msgid_plural "chewing gums"
msgstr[0] "chicle"
msgstr[1] "chicles"
msgstr[2] "chicles"

#. ~ Description of "chewing gum"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "Bright pink sugar-free chewing gum."
msgstr "Chicle sin azúcar de un rosa brillante."

#. ~ Tougher to market a hand rolled, could be anything in there.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "hand-rolled cigarette"
msgid_plural "hand-rolled cigarettes"
msgstr[0] "cigarrillo liado"
msgstr[1] "cigarrillos liados"
msgstr[2] "cigarrillos liados"

#. ~ Tougher to market a hand rolled, could be anything in there.
#. ~ Description of "hand-rolled cigarette"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A roll-your-own cigarette.  Stimulates mental acuity and reduces appetite.  "
"Despite being hand crafted, it's still highly addictive and hazardous to "
"health."
msgstr ""
"Un cigarrillo liado con tabaco y papel de liar. Estimula la agudeza mental y"
" reduce el apetito. A pesar de ser casero, sigue siendo muy adictivo y "
"dañino para la salud."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "heroin"
msgid_plural "heroin"
msgstr[0] "heroina"
msgstr[1] "heroinas"
msgstr[2] "heroinas"

#. ~ Description of "heroin"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"An extremely strong opioid narcotic derived from morphine.  Incredibly "
"addictive, the risk of overdose is extreme, and the drug is contraindicated "
"for nearly all medical purposes."
msgstr ""
"Un narcótico opiáceo extremadamente fuerte, derivado de la morfina. "
"Increíblemente adictivo, el riesgo de sobredosis es extremo, y esta droga "
"está contraindicada para casi todos los propósitos médicos."

#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "heroin"
#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "morphine"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "You shoot up."
msgstr "Te metes heroina."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "potassium iodide tablet"
msgid_plural "potassium iodide tablets"
msgstr[0] "tableta de yoduro de potasio"
msgstr[1] "tabletas de yoduro de potasio"
msgstr[2] "tabletas de yoduro de potasio"

#. ~ Description of "potassium iodide tablet"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A potassium iodide tablet.  If taken prior to exposure, they help to "
"mitigate injury caused by radiation absorption."
msgstr ""
"Un comprimido de yoduro de potasio.  Si lo ingieres antes de estar expuesto "
"a la radiación, te puede ayudar a mitigar el daño y la absorción."

#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "potassium iodide tablet"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "You take some potassium iodide."
msgstr "Te tomas un comprimido de yoduro de potasio."

#. ~ Description of "joint"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Marijuana, cannabis, pot.  Whatever you want to call it, it's rolled up in a"
" piece of paper and ready for smokin'."
msgstr ""
"Marihuana, cannabis, hierba, como quieras llamarlo. Está enrollado en un "
"trozo de papel y listo para fumar."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "pink tab"
msgid_plural "pink tabs"
msgstr[0] "comprimido rosa"
msgstr[1] "comprimidos rosas"
msgstr[2] "comprimidos rosas"

#. ~ Description of "pink tab"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A tiny pink tabs resembling a postage stamp, dosed with some sort of drug.  "
"Really only useful for entertainment.  Will cause hallucinations."
msgstr ""
"Diminutas pestañas rosadas parecidas a los sellos postales, ya dosificadas "
"con algún tipo de droga. En realidad sólo son útiles para el "
"entretenimiento. Causarán alucinaciones."

#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "pink tab"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "You eat the pink tablet."
msgstr "Te tomas un comprimido rosa."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "medical gauze"
msgid_plural "medical gauzes"
msgstr[0] "gasa medica"
msgstr[1] "gasas medicas"
msgstr[2] "gasas medicas"

#. ~ Description of "medical gauze"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A decent-sized piece of cotton, sterilized and sealed.  It's designed for "
"medical purposes."
msgstr ""
"Un buen pedazo de algodón, esterilizado y sellado.  Está diseñado para uso "
"médico."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "low-grade methamphetamine"
msgid_plural "low-grade methamphetamine"
msgstr[0] "metanfetamina de baja calidad"
msgstr[1] "metanfetamina de baja calidad"
msgstr[2] "metanfetamina de baja calidad"

#. ~ Description of "low-grade methamphetamine"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A profoundly addictive and powerful stimulant.  While extremely effective at"
" enhancing alertness, it is hazardous to health and the risk of an adverse "
"reaction is great."
msgstr ""
"Un estimulante poderoso y profundamente adictivo. Aunque es extremadamente "
"efectiva para mejorar el estado de alerta, y el riesgo de una reacción "
"adversa es grande."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "high-grade methamphetamine"
msgid_plural "high-grade methamphetamine"
msgstr[0] "metanfetamina de alta calidad"
msgstr[1] "metanfetamina de alta calidad"
msgstr[2] "metanfetamina de alta calidad"

#. ~ Description of "high-grade methamphetamine"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A profoundly addictive and powerful stimulant.  While extremely effective at"
" enhancing alertness, it is hazardous to health and the risk of an adverse "
"reaction is great.  This one could have only been made by a great chemist."
msgstr ""
"Un estimulante poderoso y profundamente adictivo. Aunque es extremadamente "
"efectivo para mejorar el estado de alerta, es dañino para la salud y el "
"riesgo de una reacción adversa es grande. Sólo un gran químico podría "
"haberla fabricado."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "morphine"
msgid_plural "morphines"
