msgstr[2] "riñónes diabólicos"

#. ~ Description of "deviled kidney"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/offal_dishes.json
msgid ""
"A delicious way to prepare kidneys, originating from Victorian England.  You"
" had to make some substitutions in the devilling sauce, but it still came "
"out damn good."
msgstr ""
"Una manera deliciosa de preparar riñones, originaria de la Inglaterra "
"victoriana. Tienes que hacer algunas sustituciones para el preparado de la "
"salsa pero todavía salio bastante bueno."

#. ~ Item name
