msgid "diet pill"
msgid_plural "diet pills"
msgstr[0] "pildora dietética"
msgstr[1] "pildoras dietéticas"
msgstr[2] "pildoras dietéticas"

#. ~ Description of "diet pill"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid ""
"Not very nutritious.  Warning: contains calories, unsuitable for "
"breatharians."
msgstr ""
"No muy nutritivas. Advertencia: contiene calorías, inapropiado para los "
"respiracionistas."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "slime glob"
msgid_plural "slime globs"
msgstr[0] "glóbulo légamo"
msgstr[1] "glóbulos légamo"
msgstr[2] "glóbulos légamo"

#. ~ Description of "slime glob"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid ""
"A little hunk of glop that fell off a slime monster.  It doesn't seem "
"hostile, but it does wiggle occasionally."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño trozo de glóbulo que cayó de un monstruo légamo. No parece "
"hostil, pero se mueve ocasionalmente."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "honey comb"
msgid_plural "honey combs"
msgstr[0] "panal de miel"
msgstr[1] "panales de miel"
msgstr[2] "panales de miel"

#. ~ Description of "honey comb"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "A large chunk of wax filled with honey.  Very tasty."
msgstr "Un trozo grande de cera llena de miel. Muy sabroso."

#. ~ Description of "wax"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid ""
"A large chunk of beeswax.  Not very tasty or nourishing, but okay in an "
"emergency."
msgstr ""
"Un gran trozo de cera de abeja. No es sabroso ni nutritivo, pero puede "
"servir en una emergencía."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "royal jelly"
msgid_plural "royal jellies"
msgstr[0] "jalea real"
msgstr[1] "jaleas reales"
msgstr[2] "jaleas reales"

#. ~ Description of "royal jelly"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid ""
"A translucent hexagonal chunk of wax, filled with dense, milky, bitter and "
"acidic-tasting jelly.  Though some hold it as a panacea, it doesn't have any"
" medical benefit.  Still it is rich with the most beneficial substances the "
"hive can produce."
msgstr ""
"Un trozo de cera hexagonal translúcido, relleno de gelatina densa, lechosa, "
"amarga y de sabor ácido. Aunque algunos la consideran una panacea, no tiene "
"ningún beneficio médico. Aún así es rica en las sustancias más beneficiosas "
"que la colmena puede producir."

#. ~ It takes about 30 portions of honeydew to feed an adult (~2000 kkal).
#. 2000 kkal is about 10 raw chunks of mutant meat, which is 250% toxins.
#. Honeydew probably isn't as toxic as meat, so 30 portions of it would give
#. you 180% of toxins.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "honeydew"
msgid_plural "honeydews"
msgstr[0] "mielada"
msgstr[1] "mieladas"
msgstr[2] "mieladas"

#. ~ It takes about 30 portions of honeydew to feed an adult (~2000 kkal).
#. 2000 kkal is about 10 raw chunks of mutant meat, which is 250% toxins.
#. Honeydew probably isn't as toxic as meat, so 30 portions of it would give
#. you 180% of toxins.
#. ~ Description of "honeydew"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid ""
"A sugar-rich sticky substance, produced by aphids from plant sap.  Ants and "
"bees love it."
msgstr ""
"Una sustancia pegajosa rica en azúcar, producida por los pulgones a partir "
"de la savia de las plantas. Las hormigas y las abejas la adoran."

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Plant name of seed "Marloss seed"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid "Marloss berry"
msgid_plural "Marloss berries"
msgstr[0] "baya Marloss"
msgstr[1] "bayas Marloss"
msgstr[2] "bayas Marloss"

#. ~ Description of "Marloss berry"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid ""
"This looks like a blueberry the size of your fist, but pinkish in color.  It"
" has a strong but delicious aroma, but is clearly either mutated or of alien"
" origin."
msgstr ""
"Esto parece un arándano del tamaño de tu puño, pero con un color rosado. "
"Tiene un aroma fuerte y delicioso, pero claramente ha sufrido una mutación o"
" es de origen extraterrestre."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "Marloss gelatin"
msgid_plural "Marloss gelatin"
msgstr[0] "gelatina de Marloss"
msgstr[1] "gelatinas de Marloss"
msgstr[2] "gelatinas de Marloss"

#. ~ Description of "Marloss gelatin"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid ""
"This looks like a handful of lemon-colored liquid which has taken a set, "
"much like pre-Cataclysm Jello.  It has a strong but delicious aroma, but is "
"clearly either mutated or of alien origin."
msgstr ""
"Esto parece un puñado de líquido color limón que ha tomado un conjunto, muy "
"parecido a la gelatina de antes del Cataclismo. Tiene un fuerte pero "
"delicioso aroma, pero claramente ha sufrido una mutación o es de origen "
"alienígena."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "Mycus fruit"
msgid_plural "Mycus fruits"
msgstr[0] "fruta Mycus"
msgstr[1] "frutas Mycus"
msgstr[2] "frutas Mycus"

#. ~ Description of "Mycus fruit"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid ""
"Humans might call this a Gray Delicious apple: large, gray, and smells even "
"better than the Marloss.  If they didn't reject it for its alien origins.  "
"But we know better."
msgstr ""
"Los humanos podrían llamar a esto la Deliciosa Manzana Gris: grande, gris y "
"con mejor olor que la fruta de Marloss, si no la hubieran rechazado por su "
"origen extraterrestre. Pero nosotros sabemos que es mejor ."

