msgid ""
"An inactive eyebot.  Using this item involves turning it on and launching "
"the UAV.  If reprogrammed and rewired successfully, the eyebot will then "
"keep watch for intruders."
msgstr ""
"Un ojobot inactivo. Usar este objeto incluye encenderlo y lanzar el dron. Si"
" fue reprogramado y cableado exitosamente, el ojobot estará atento a los "
"intrusos."

#. ~ "friendly_msg" action message of item "inactive eyebot"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "The eyebot hums and takes to the sky."
msgstr "El ojobot zumba y se eleva hacia el cielo."

#. ~ "hostile_msg" action message of item "inactive eyebot"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid ""
"The eyebot beeps disapprovingly and focuses its camera on your face.  Say "
"cheese!"
msgstr ""
"El ojobot emite un pitido de desaprobación y enfoca su cámara en tu cara. "
"¡Diga \"queso\"!"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "inactive cleaner bot"
msgid_plural "inactive cleaner bots"
msgstr[0] "robot de limpieza inactivo"
msgstr[1] "robots de limpieza inactivos"
msgstr[2] "robots de limpieza inactivos"

#. ~ Description of "inactive cleaner bot"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid ""
"An inactive cleaner bot.  Using this item involves placing it on the ground "
"and turning it on.  If reprogrammed and rewired successfully, the cleaner "
"bot will respond to future commands."
msgstr ""
"Es un limpiabot inactivo. Usar este objeto incluye ponerlo en el suelo y "
"encenderlo. Si se programa y cablea exitosamente, el limpiabot responderá a "
"tus ordenes."

#. ~ "friendly_msg" action message of item "inactive cleaner bot"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "The cleaner bot emits a friendly beep and starts scrubbing."
msgstr "El robot limpiador emite un pitido amistoso y comienza a fregar."

#. ~ "hostile_msg" action message of item "inactive cleaner bot"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "The cleaner bot plays an error sound, but starts cleaning anyway."
msgstr ""
"El robot limpiador reproduce un sonido de error, pero empieza a limpiar de "
"todos modos."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "inactive miner bot"
msgid_plural "inactive miner bots"
msgstr[0] "robot minero inactivo"
msgstr[1] "robots mineros inactivos"
msgstr[2] "robots mineros inactivos"

#. ~ Description of "inactive miner bot"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid ""
"An inactive mining robot.  Using this item involves placing it on the ground"
" and turning it on.  If reprogrammed and rewired successfully, the miner bot"
" will respond to future commands."
msgstr ""
"Un minerobot inactivo. Usar este objeto incluye ponerlo en el suelo y "
"encenderlo. Si se programa y cablea exitosamente, el minerobot responderá a "
"tus ordenes."

#. ~ "friendly_msg" action message of item "inactive miner bot"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "The miner bot whirrs and tunnels into the ground."
msgstr "El minero hace zumbidos y túneles en la tierra."

#. ~ "hostile_msg" action message of item "inactive miner bot"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "The miner bot spins out of control and lunges at you.  Make way!"
msgstr ""
"El robot minero gira fuera de control y se abalanza sobre ti. ¡Abran paso!"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "inactive riot control bot"
msgid_plural "inactive riot control bots"
msgstr[0] "robot de control de disturbios inactivo"
msgstr[1] "robots de control de disturbios inactivos"
msgstr[2] "robots de control de disturbios inactivos"

#. ~ Description of "inactive riot control bot"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid ""
"An inactive riot control bot.  Using this item involves placing it on the "
"ground and turning it on.  If reprogrammed and rewired successfully, the "
"robot will bring order and peace to the horde."
msgstr ""
"Un controldisturbot inactivo. Usar este objeto incluye ponerlo en el suelo y"
" encenderlo. Si se programa y cablea exitosamente, el robot traerá la paz y "
"el orden."

#. ~ "friendly_msg" action message of item "inactive riot control bot"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "The riot control bot rolls into action."
msgstr "El robot antidisturbios entra en acción."

#. ~ "hostile_msg" action message of item "inactive riot control bot"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid ""
"The riot control bot gasses you and approaches with a pair of handcuffs!"
msgstr "El controldisturbot te gasea y se acerca con un par de esposas!"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
msgid "inactive skitterbot"
msgid_plural "inactive skitterbots"
msgstr[0] "arañabot inactivo"
msgstr[1] "arañabots inactivos"
msgstr[2] "arañabots inactivos"

#. ~ Description of "inactive skitterbot"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid ""
"An inactive skitterbot.  Using this item involves placing it on the ground "
"and turning it on.  If reprogrammed and rewired successfully, the robot will"
" race towards enemies and shock them."
msgstr ""
"Un arañabot inactivo. Usar este objeto incluye ponerlo en el suelo y "
"encenderlo. Si se programa y cablea exitosamente, el robot perseguirá a los "
"enemigos y les dará un electroshock."

#. ~ "friendly_msg" action message of item "inactive skitterbot"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "The skitterbot gives a quick bow and scurries away."
msgstr "El arañabot hace una rápida reverencia y se escapa."

#. ~ "hostile_msg" action message of item "inactive skitterbot"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "The skitterbot darts around you and menacingly clicks its tazers."
msgstr ""
"El arañabot se lanza a tu alrededor y hace clic amenazadoramente en sus "
"tazers."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "inactive lab defense bot"
msgid_plural "inactive lab defense bots"
msgstr[0] "robot defensor de laboratorio inactivo"
msgstr[1] "robots defensores de laboratorio inactivos"
msgstr[2] "robots defensores de laboratorio inactivos"

#. ~ Description of "inactive lab defense bot"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid ""
"An inactive experimental robot plundered from a science lab.  It resembles a"
" human-sized spider and was designed to deploy manhacks.  Using this item "
"involves placing it on the ground and turning it on.  If reprogrammed and "
"rewired successfully, the robot will race towards enemies and deploy a "
"variety of experimental devices."
msgstr ""
"Un robot experimental inactivo, sacado de un laboratorio. Parece una araña "
"de tamaño humano y diseñado para desplegar manhacks. Usar este objeto "
"incluye ponerlo en el suelo y encenderlo. Si se programa y cablea "
"exitosamente, el robot correrá hacia los enemigos y desplegará una variedad "
"de dispositivos experimentales."

#. ~ "friendly_msg" action message of item "inactive lab defense bot"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "The lab defense bot shudders briefly and skitters away."
msgstr ""
"El robot defensor de laboratorio tiembla por un momento y se estremece."

#. ~ "hostile_msg" action message of item "inactive lab defense bot"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid ""
"The lab defense bot raises its front legs and shines a multitude of colored "
"lights in your face!"
msgstr ""
"El robot de defensa del laboratorio levanta sus patas delanteras y te "
"ilumina la cara con una multitud de luces de colores."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "inactive milspec searchlight"
msgid_plural "inactive milspec searchlights"
msgstr[0] "foco reflector milspec inactivo"
msgstr[1] "focos reflectores milspec inactivos"
msgstr[2] "focos reflectores milspec inactivos"

#. ~ Description of "inactive milspec searchlight"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid ""
"An inactive military-grade automated searchlight.  Using this item involves "
"placing it on the ground and turning it on.  If reprogrammed and rewired "
"successfully, the searchlight will then identify you as an ally, survey the "
"area, and illuminate approaching hostiles.  Seems to have an unhealthy "
"fascination with you."
msgstr ""
"Un foco reflector militar inactivo. Usar este objeto incluye ponerlo en el "
"suelo y encenderlo. Si se programa y cablea exitosamente, el foco reflector "
"te identificará como aliado, investigará el área e iluminará a los enemigos "
"que se acerquen. Parece tener una fascinación insana contigo."

#. ~ "friendly_msg" action message of item "inactive milspec searchlight"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "The searchlight flares up and establishes a perimeter."
msgstr "El reflector se enciende y establece un perímetro."

#. ~ "hostile_msg" action message of item "inactive milspec searchlight"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid ""
"A bright light blinds you as the searchlight refuses to turn away from you."
msgstr ""
"Una luz brillante te ciega cuando el foco reflector se niega a apartarse de "
"ti."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "inactive dispatch"
msgid_plural "inactive dispatches"
msgstr[0] "despachador inactivo"
msgstr[1] "despachadores inactivos"
msgstr[2] "despachadores inactivos"

#. ~ Description of "inactive dispatch"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid ""
"An inactive Northrop Dispatch, guard model, serving as a mobile assembler "
"and deployer of kamikaze manhacks for defense.  Activate it to place it onto"
" the ground; due to a one-way switch triggered during deactivation, however,"
" it will be nonaggressive, and serves only as a distraction."
msgstr ""
"Un Despachador Northrop inactivo, modelo de guardia, que sirve como "
"ensamblador móvil y desplegador de manhacks kamikazes para la defensa. Se "
"activa para colocarlo en el suelo; sin embargo, debido a un interruptor "
"unidireccional activado durante la desactivación, no será agresivo, y sólo "
"sirve como distracción."

#. ~ "friendly_msg" action message of item "inactive dispatch"
#. ~ "friendly_msg" action message of item "inactive military dispatch"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "The dispatch whirrs onto its legs and searches for a target."
msgstr "El despachador zumba sobre sus piernas y busca un objetivo."

#. ~ "hostile_msg" action message of item "inactive dispatch"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "The dispatch turns on you, whacking at you with its arms!"
msgstr "¡El despachador se vuelve contra ti, golpeándote con sus brazos!"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "inactive military dispatch"
msgid_plural "inactive military dispatches"
msgstr[0] "despachador militar inactivo"
msgstr[1] "despachadores militares inactivos"
msgstr[2] "despachadores militares inactivos"

#. ~ Description of "inactive military dispatch"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid ""
"An inactive Northrop Dispatch, military model, serving as a mobile assembler"
" and deployer of lethal manhacks for combat situations.  Activate it to "
"place it onto the ground; due to a one-way switch triggered during "
"deactivation, however, it will be nonaggressive, and serves only as a "
"distraction."
msgstr ""
"Un Northrop Despachador inactivo, modelo militar, que sirve como ensamblador"
" y desplegador móvil de casetas letales para situaciones de combate. Se "
"activa para colocarlo en el suelo; sin embargo, debido a un interruptor "
"unidireccional activado durante la desactivación, no será agresivo y sólo "
"sirve como distracción."

#. ~ "hostile_msg" action message of item "inactive military dispatch"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "The dispatch turns on you, slashing at you with its arms!"
msgstr "¡El despachador se vuelve contra ti, te golpea con sus brazos!"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "inactive loudspeaker"
msgid_plural "inactive loudspeakers"
msgstr[0] "altavoz inactivo"
msgstr[1] "altavoces inactivos"
msgstr[2] "altavoces inactivos"

#. ~ Description of "inactive loudspeaker"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid ""
"This is an inactive automated loudspeaker.  Using this item involves placing"
" it on the ground and turning it on.  If reprogrammed and rewired "
"successfully, the loudspeaker will continuously shout pre-recorded messages."
msgstr ""
"Se trata de un altavoz automático inactivo. El uso de este artículo implica "
"colocarlo en el suelo y encenderlo. Si se reprograma y se recablea con "
"éxito, el altavoz gritará continuamente mensajes pregrabados."

#. ~ "friendly_msg" action message of item "inactive loudspeaker"
#. ~ "hostile_msg" action message of item "inactive loudspeaker"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "The loudspeaker activates and begins its nonstop shouts."
msgstr "El altavoz se activa y comienza sus gritos interminables."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "inactive tazer hack"
msgid_plural "inactive tazer hacks"
msgstr[0] "hacktazer inactivo"
msgstr[1] "hacktazers inactivos"
msgstr[2] "hacktazers inactivos"

#. ~ Description of "inactive tazer hack"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid ""
"An inactive tazer hack.  Manhacks are fist-sized robots that fly through the"
" air.  This one has a tazer and attacks by flying at its target and "
"delivering an electric shock.  Use this item to reprogram and release the "
"tazer hack.  Electronics and computer skills determine if the targeting "
"matrix is reprogrammed successfully."
msgstr ""
"Es un tazer-hack inactivo. Los manhacks son robots del tamaño de un puño que"
" vuelan por el aire. Este tiene una pistola eléctrica y su manera de atacar "
"es volar hacia el objetivo y causar un choque eléctrico. Lo puedes "
"reprogramar y soltar con el comando Usar. Tu habilidad en electrónica e "
"informática determinará si la reprogramación es exitosa."

#. ~ "friendly_msg" action message of item "inactive tazer hack"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "The tazer hack flies from your hand and surveys the area!"
msgstr "¡El hacktazer vuela desde tu mano e inspecciona el área!"

#. ~ "hostile_msg" action message of item "inactive tazer hack"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "You misprogram the tazer hack; run!"
msgstr "Programaste mal hacktazer; ¡corre!."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "inactive trifacet"
msgid_plural "inactive trifacets"
msgstr[0] "tricara inactivo"
msgstr[1] "tricaras inactivos"
msgstr[2] "tricaras inactivos"

#. ~ Description of "inactive trifacet"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid ""
"A featureless quartz pyramid that, although obviously artificial, shows no "
"real indication of ever having been an advanced robot.  Although this "
"trifacet could probably be reactivated, it's unlikely to recognize you as an"
" ally."
msgstr ""
"Una pirámide de cuarzo sin rasgos que, aunque obviamente es artificial, no "
"muestra ningún indicio real de haber sido alguna vez un robot avanzado. "
"Aunque este tricara podría reactivarse, es poco probable que te reconozca "
"como aliado."

#. ~ "friendly_msg" action message of item "inactive trifacet"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "Your attempt at reprogramming the trifacet is somehow successful!"
msgstr "¡Tu intento de reprogramar el tricara ha tenido algún éxito!"

#. ~ "hostile_msg" action message of item "inactive trifacet"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "The hostile trifacet violently unfolds just clear of your hand!"
msgstr ""
"¡El tricara hostil se despliega violentamente justo al lado de tu mano!"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "inactive security drone"
msgid_plural "inactive security drones"
msgstr[0] "dron de seguridad inactivo"
msgstr[1] "drones de seguridad inactivos"
msgstr[2] "drones de seguridad inactivos"

#. ~ Description of "inactive security drone"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid ""
"An inactive security drone.  They are fist-sized robots that fly through the"
" air.  They have a scanner, lens and speaker.  Use this item to reprogram "
"and activate the security drone.  Electronics and computer skill determines "
"if the targeting matrix is reprogrammed successfully."
msgstr ""
"Un dron de seguridad inactivo. Son robots del tamaño de un puño que vuelan "
"por el aire. Tiene un escáner, cámara y parlante. Puedes programar y activar"
" el dron de seguridad con el comando Usar. Tu habilidad en electrónica e "
"informática determinará si la programación es exitosa."

#. ~ "friendly_msg" action message of item "inactive security drone"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "The security drone flies from your hand and surveys the area!"
msgstr ""
"¡El dron de seguridad vuela desde tu mano y comienza a inspeccionar el área!"

#. ~ "hostile_msg" action message of item "inactive security drone"
#: data/json/items/corpses/inactive_bots.json
msgid "You misprogram the drone; it's hostile!"
msgstr "Fallastes al programar el dron. ¡Es hostil!"

#. ~ Item name
