msgid_plural "sleeping bags"
msgstr[0] "saco de dormir"
msgstr[1] "sacos de dormir"
msgstr[2] "sacos de dormir"

#. ~ Description of "sleeping bag"
#: data/json/items/generic/bedding.json
msgid ""
"A large sleeping bag that covers you head to toe, with a strap for carrying "
"it on your back when not in use.  This one is medium weight.  It is "
"currently unrolled; activate it to roll it up for easy storage."
msgstr ""
"Una bolsa de dormir grande que te cubre de la cabeza hasta los pies, con una"
" correa para llevarla en la espalda cuando no la usas. Esta es de mediano "
