#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/currency.json
msgid "merch"
msgid_plural "merch"
msgstr[0] "merc"
msgstr[1] "merc"
msgstr[2] "merc"

#. ~ $50 bills have substantial pre-Cataclysm value, but are worth 1 meat
#. jerky
#. ~ Description of "merch"
#: data/json/items/generic/currency.json
msgid ""
"The Free Merchant Certified Note, also known by names such as a 'c-note' or "
"'merch', is a currency based on old American bills.  Fifty dollar bills and "
"larger are printed with a promissory note signed by the treasurer of the "
"Free Merchants, along with a complex design.  The note explains that this "
"can be exchanged for food, water, and other services through the Free "
"Merchants in the Refugee Center."
msgstr ""
"La nota Certificada de los Mercaderes Libres, también conocido por nombres "
"como \"c-nota\" o \"merc\", es una moneda basada en antiguos billetes "
"americanos. Los billetes de 50 dólares y más grandes se imprimen con un "
"pagaré firmado por el tesorero de los Comerciantes Libres, junto con un "
"diseño complejo. La nota explica que puede ser intercambiada por comida, "
"agua y otros servicios a través de los Comerciantes Libres del Centro de "
"Refugiados."

#. ~ Low carat gold alloy for hardness, but it's still the best part of an
#. ounce of gold.  Yes, the weight is correct for the volume.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic/currency.json
