msgstr "Expulsas el casquillo gastado de la  %s."

#. ~ Name of a fault
#: data/json/items/gun/faults_gun.json
msgid "Unlubricated"
msgstr "Sin lubricación"

#. ~ Description of fault "Unlubricated"
#: data/json/items/gun/faults_gun.json
msgid ""
"Either this gun is brand new and came without lubrication or it was recently"
" cleaned with a solvent without oiling afterwards.  Either way, it's not "
"lubricated and will not cycle properly, and can even be damaged."
msgstr ""
"O bien esta pistola es nueva y vino sin lubricación o fue limpiada "
"recientemente con un disolvente sin aceite después. De cualquier manera, no "
"está lubricada y no funcionará correctamente, e incluso puede ser dañada."

#. ~ Name of mending method to fault "Unlubricated"
#: data/json/items/gun/faults_gun.json
msgid "Lubricate"
msgstr "Lubricar"

#. ~ Success message of mending method "Unlubricated" to fault "Lubricate"
#: data/json/items/gun/faults_gun.json
#, c-format
msgid "You lubricate the %s."
msgstr "Lubricas el %s."

#. ~ Name of a fault
#: data/json/items/gun/faults_gun.json
msgid "Fouling"
msgstr "Ensuciamiento"

#. ~ Description of fault "Fouling"
#: data/json/items/gun/faults_gun.json
msgid ""
"Fouling is caused by firing gunpowder loads repeatedly, which reduces "
"reliability and can eventually cause damage to the gun.  Fouling accumulates"
" slowly (unless blackpowder is used) due to the design of modern smokeless "
"powder found in the vast majority of retail cartridges and it is not a "
"significant problem until high levels of fouling are reached due to firing "
"thousands of rounds without cleaning your firearm."
msgstr ""
"El suciedad se produce al disparar cargas de pólvora repetidamente, lo que "
"reduce la fiabilidad y puede llegar a causar daños en el arma. El "
"ensuciamiento se acumula lentamente (a menos que se utilice la pólvora "
"negra) debido al diseño de la moderna pólvora sin humo que se encuentra en "
"la gran mayoría de los cartuchos de venta al por menor y no es un problema "
"significativo hasta que se alcanzan altos niveles de suciedad debido a que "
"se disparan miles de cartuchos sin limpiar el arma de fuego."

#. ~ Name of mending method to fault "Fouling"
#: data/json/items/gun/faults_gun.json
msgid "Clean gun"
msgstr "Limpiar arma"

#. ~ Name of mending method to fault "Fouling"
#: data/json/items/gun/faults_gun.json
msgid "Clean gun and lubricate"
msgstr "Limpiar alma y lubricar"

