#. ~ Description of magazine "HWP 60-round 12.3 magazine"
#: data/json/items/gun/robofac_gun.json
msgid ""
"A box magazine for use with the Hub 01 Hybrid Weaons Platform, developed for"
" the 12.3 ln round.  Physically speaking, this looks like one of the box "
"magazines that the Exodii use for their own guns, but with a more ergonomic "
"design afforded by the Hub's use of modern materials."
msgstr ""
"Un cargador de caja para ser usado en el Hub 01 Hybrid Weapons Platform, "
"desarrollado para la munición de 12.3. Físicamente hablando, esto parece un "
"cargador de caja que los Exodii usan en sus propias armas, pero con un "
"diseño mas ergonómico con el uso de materiales que el Hub se puede permitir."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "12 gauge pistol"
msgid_plural "12 gauge pistols"
msgstr[0] "pistola 12 gauge"
msgstr[1] "pistolas 12 gauge"
msgstr[2] "pistolas 12 gauge"

#. ~ Description of gun "12 gauge pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"A single shot pistol that loads 12 gauge shotgun shells, handcrafted from "
"scrap."
msgstr ""
"Una pistola de un disparo solo que utiliza los cartuchos de escopeta 12 "
"gauge. Está hecha a mano y con chatarra."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "12-gauge gatling gun"
msgid_plural "12-gauge gatling guns"
msgstr[0] "Ametralladora Gatling del 12-gauge"
msgstr[1] "Ametralladoras Gatling del 12-gauge"
msgstr[2] "Ametralladoras Gatling del 12-gauge"

#. ~ Description of gun "12-gauge gatling gun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"An electrically driven six barrel gatling shotgun, fed from handmade cloth "
"belts.  Even properly mounted, this seems like an unwieldy beast, and the "
"six separate barrels make for difficult zeroing.  The externally driven "
"action means this is much less likely to jam."
msgstr ""
"Una escopeta eléctrica de seis cañones, alimentada por cinturones de tela "
"hechos a mano. Incluso montada correctamente, parece una bestia poco "
"manejable, y los seis cañones separados hacen difícil la puesta a cero. La "
"acción externa significa que es mucho menos probable que se atasque."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "handmade lever shotgun"
msgid_plural "handmade lever shotguns"
msgstr[0] "escopeta de palanca casera"
msgstr[1] "escopetas de palanca caseras"
msgstr[2] "escopetas de palanca caseras"

#. ~ Description of gun "handmade lever shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"A short, homemade lever-action shotgun with a small internal tube magazine."
"  While still a primitive design - made from a pipe and a plank - it is a "
"formidable shotgun in its own right with room for improvement."
msgstr ""
"Una escopeta corta de palanca de fabricación casera con un pequeño cargador "
"de tubo interno. Aunque sigue siendo un diseño primitivo -hecho con un tubo "
"y un tablón-, es una escopeta formidable por derecho propio con margen de "
"mejora."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "compact bullpup shotgun"
msgid_plural "compact bullpup shotguns"
msgstr[0] "escopeta bullpup compacta"
msgstr[1] "escopetas bullpup compactas"
msgstr[2] "escopetas bullpup compactas"

#. ~ Description of gun "compact bullpup shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"This pump-action shotgun uses a system of twin magazines to carry 14 total "
"rounds of 12-gauge shotgun shells.  Each tube must be loaded separately, but"
" this offers the option of loading different ammunition for different "
"situations.  As the weapon’s trigger is situated forwards of the chamber in "
"what is termed as a 'bullpup' design, the firearm’s notably more compact "
"than its peers despite having a higher capacity when compared against more "
"classically designed shotguns."
msgstr ""
"Una escopeta única de acción de bombeo que usa un sistema de 2 cargadores de"
" tubo para llevar un total de 14 cartuchos calibre 12. Cada tubo tiene que "
"ser cargado por separado pero esto da la opción de cargar diferente munición"
" para diferentes situaciones. Además, tiene diseño 'bullpup' con el gatillo "
"del arma situado delante de la cámara y los cargadores, y por eso es "
"notablemente más compacta que armas similares a pesar de tener mayor "
"capacidad cuando se la compara con escopetas con un diseño más clásico."

#. ~ Variant name of gun "compact bullpup shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "Kel-Tec KSG"
msgid_plural "Kel-Tec KSG"
msgstr[0] "Kel-Tec KSG"
msgstr[1] "Kel-Tec KSG"
msgstr[2] "Kel-Tec KSG"

#. ~ Description of variant "compact bullpup shotgun" of gun "Kel-Tec KSG"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"A bullpup pump-action shotgun, the Kel-Tec KSG uses a pair of magazine tubes"
" to increase its capacity.  Each tube has to be loaded separately, but this "
"offers the option of loading different ammunition for different situations."
msgstr ""
"Es una escopeta bullpup de acción de bombeo, la Kel-Tec KSG utiliza un par "
"de tubos cargadores para aumentar su capacidad. Cada tubo debe ser cargado "
"por separado, pero esto brinda la posibilidad de cargar diferente munición "
"para diferentes situaciones."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "extended bullpup shotgun"
msgid_plural "extended bullpup shotguns"
msgstr[0] "escopeta bullpup extendida"
msgstr[1] "escopetas bullpup extendidas"
msgstr[2] "escopetas bullpup extendidas"

#. ~ Description of gun "extended bullpup shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"This pump-action shotgun uses a system of twin magazines to carry 24 total "
"rounds of 12-gauge shotgun shells.  Each tube must be loaded separately, but"
" this offers the option of loading different ammunition for different "
"situations.  As the weapon’s trigger is situated forwards of the chamber in "
"what is termed as a 'bullpup' design, the firearm’s still only as long as "
"conventional shotguns despite having a comparatively far higher capacity."
msgstr ""
"Esta escopeta usa un sistema de 2 cargadores de tubo para llevar un total de"
" 24 cartuchos calibre 12. Cada tubo tiene que ser cargado por separado pero "
"esto da la opción de cargar diferente munición para diferentes situaciones. "
"Además, tiene diseño 'bullpup' con el gatillo del arma situado delante de la"
" cámara y los cargadores, pero es igualmente larga como otras escopetas "
"convencionales a pesar de tener mayor capacidad que sus contrapartes más "
"tradicionales."

#. ~ Variant name of gun "extended bullpup shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "Kel-Tec KSG-25"
msgid_plural "Kel-Tec KSG-25"
msgstr[0] "Kel-Tec KSG-25"
msgstr[1] "Kel-Tec KSG-25"
msgstr[2] "Kel-Tec KSG-25"

#. ~ Description of variant "extended bullpup shotgun" of gun "Kel-Tec KSG-25"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"A bullpup pump-action shotgun, the Kel-Tec KSG-25 uses a pair of magazine "
"tubes to increase its capacity.  Each tube has to be loaded separately, but "
"this offers the option of loading different ammunition for different "
"situations.  The big brother of the KSG, it has a longer barrel and longer "
"magazine tubes."
msgstr ""
"La Kel-Tec KSG-25, una escopeta de acción de bomba, utiliza un par de tubos "
"de cargador para aumentar su capacidad. Cada tubo tiene que ser cargado por "
"separado, pero esto ofrece la opción de cargar diferentes municiones para "
"diferentes situaciones. El hermano mayor de la KSG, tiene un cañón más largo"
" y tubos de cargador más largos."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "6-round combat shotgun"
msgid_plural "6-round combat shotguns"
msgstr[0] "escopeta de 6 balas"
msgstr[1] "escopetas de 6 balas"
msgstr[2] "escopetas de 6 balas"

#. ~ Description of gun "6-round combat shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"The faithful friend of law-enforcement officers, military personnel, and "
"zombie-hunting action heroes alike, this quaint firearm with its over 20 "
"inch long barrel, 6-round magazine tube, and iconic pump-action design is as"
" simple as it is effective.  One of the most popular firearm designs in all "
"of history, this weapon can be reliably counted upon to do the job whether "
"one's simply looking to hunt, or to, with the right loads, turn the heads of"
" the living dead into a chunky zombie puree."
msgstr ""
"El amigo fiel de los oficiales de la ley, personal militar y héroes "
"cazadores de zombi. Esta pintoresca arma con su cañón de más de 50 "
"centímetros, su cargador de tubo de 6 balas y un diseño icónico de acción de"
" bombeo, es tan simple como efectiva. Con uno de los diseños más populares "
"de la historia, puede contarse con esta arma para realizar su trabajo ya sea"
" cazando, o con la munición adecuada, convirtiendo la cabeza de los muertos "
"vivos en puré de zombi."

#. ~ Variant name of gun "6-round combat shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "Mossberg 500 Field"
msgid_plural "Mossberg 500 Field"
msgstr[0] "Mossberg 500 Field"
msgstr[1] "Mossberg 500 Field"
msgstr[2] "Mossberg 500 Field"

#. ~ Description of variant "6-round combat shotgun" of gun "Mossberg 500
#. Field"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"The Mossberg 500 is a popular series of pump-action shotguns, often acquired"
" for military use.  It is noted for its high durability and low recoil.  "
"This one is fitted with a 28 inch barrel with sight rib."
msgstr ""
"La Mossberg 500 es una popular serie de escopetas de acción de bombeo, a "
"menudo adquirida para uso militar. Se destaca por su alta durabilidad y bajo"
" retroceso. Esta está equipada con un cañón de 28 pulgadas con una mira."

#. ~ Variant name of gun "6-round combat shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "Mossberg 500 Security"
msgid_plural "Mossberg 500 Security"
msgstr[0] "Mossberg 500 Security"
msgstr[1] "Mossberg 500 Security"
msgstr[2] "Mossberg 500 Security"

#. ~ Description of variant "6-round combat shotgun" of gun "Mossberg 500
#. Security"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"The Mossberg 500 is a popular series of pump-action shotguns, often acquired"
" for military use.  It is noted for its high durability and low recoil.  "
"This one is fitted with an 18.5 inch barrel."
msgstr ""
"La Mossberg 500 es una popular serie de escopetas de acción de bombeo, a "
"menudo adquirida para uso militar. Se destaca por su alta durabilidad y bajo"
" retroceso. Esta está equipada con un cañón de 18,5 pulgadas."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "9-round combat shotgun"
msgid_plural "9-round combat shotguns"
msgstr[0] "escopeta de 9 balas"
msgstr[1] "escopetas de 9 balas"
msgstr[2] "escopetas de 9 balas"

#. ~ Description of gun "9-round combat shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"A military oriented spin on the classic pump-action shotgun recipe, this "
"firearm features an extended magazine tube capable of fielding nine rounds "
"of 12 gauge shotshells.  Sporting a heavier barrel and a bayonet lug, it "
"makes for a highly intimidating weapon, as well as a satisfying answer to "
"most of the nasties you're liable to find in the post-apocalypse."
msgstr ""
"Esta arma, una versión militar de la clásica escopeta de bombeo, cuenta con "
"un tubo de cargador ampliado con capacidad para 9 cartuchos de calibre 12. "
"Con un cañón más pesado y una lengüeta de bayoneta, es un arma muy "
"intimidante, así como una respuesta satisfactoria a la mayoría de los "
"enemigos que se pueden encontrar en el post-apocalipsis."

#. ~ Variant name of gun "9-round combat shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "Mossberg 590A1"
msgid_plural "Mossberg 590A1"
msgstr[0] "Mossberg 590A1"
msgstr[1] "Mossberg 590A1"
msgstr[2] "Mossberg 590A1"

#. ~ Description of variant "9-round combat shotgun" of gun "Mossberg 590A1"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"The Mossberg 590A1 is a military and police oriented version of the Mossberg"
" 500.  It features a heavier barrel, a bayonet lug, and a different magazine"
" tube for easier cleaning and maintenance."
msgstr ""
"El Mossberg 590A1 es una versión orientada a la policía y al ejército del "
"Mossberg 500. Tiene un cañón más pesado, un cierre de bayoneta y un tubo de "
"cargador diferente para facilitar la limpieza y el mantenimiento."

#. ~ Variant name of gun "9-round combat shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "Franchi SPAS-12"
msgid_plural "Franchi SPAS-12s"
msgstr[0] "Franchi SPAS-12"
msgstr[1] "Franchi SPAS-12s"
msgstr[2] "Franchi SPAS-12s"

#. ~ Description of variant "9-round combat shotgun" of gun "Franchi SPAS-12"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"Mean and intimidating looking, the SPAS-12 has the dubious honor of being "
"declared a destructive device and being banned from import by name, adding "
"to its already considerable appeal.  It is a combination pump-action and "
"semi-automatic firearm, with an arm stabilizing hook for one handed "
"shooting."
msgstr ""
"De apariencia mezquina e intimidatoria, la SPAS-12 tiene el dudoso honor de "
"ser declarada dispositivo de destrucción y ser prohibida su importación, "
"además de su considerable atractivo. Es una combinación de acción de bombeo "
"y arma de fuego semiautomática, con un gancho de estabilización para "
"disparar con una mano."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "8-round auto-loading shotgun"
msgid_plural "8-round auto-loading shotguns"
msgstr[0] "escopeta de auto carga de 8 balas"
msgstr[1] "escopetas de auto carga de 8 balas"
msgstr[2] "escopetas de auto carga de 8 balas"

#. ~ Description of gun "8-round auto-loading shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"A semi-automatic smooth-bore shotgun, this weapon features respectable "
"ergonomics and room for 8 shotshells within its tubular magazine.  Suitable "
"both for competition shooting and offensive combat roles, this firearm is "
"faster to shoot than a traditional pump-action model, with the caveat that "
"it's harder to maintain than its manually operated siblings as it relies on "
"an internal gas system to cycle rounds rather than the user’s own physical "
"input."
msgstr ""
"Una escopeta semiautomática de ánima lisa, tiene una ergonomía respetable y "
"espacio para 8 cartuchos dentro de su cargador tubular. Adecuada tanto para "
"la competición como para la ofensiva, esta arma es más rápida para disparar "
"que el modelo tradicional de acción de bombeo, con la advertencia de ser más"
" difícil de mantener que sus parientes de operación manual, ya que depende "
"de un sistema de gas interno para rotar los cartuchos en lugar de la "
"manipulación del usuario."

#. ~ Variant name of gun "8-round auto-loading shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "Mossberg 930 SPX"
msgid_plural "Mossberg 930 SPXs"
msgstr[0] "Mossberg 930 SPX"
msgstr[1] "Mossberg 930 SPXs"
msgstr[2] "Mossberg 930 SPXs"

#. ~ Description of variant "8-round auto-loading shotgun" of gun "Mossberg
#. 930 SPX"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"This semi-automatic offering from Mossberg features a recoil reducing gas "
"system, rifle style sights and a factory-installed Picatinny rail.  "
"Affordable pricing and decent ergonomics make this a popular entry-level "
"3-gun shotgun."
msgstr ""
"Esta versión semiautomática de Mossberg posee un sistema de gas de reducción"
" de retroceso, miras de rifle y un riel Picatinny incorporado de fábrica. Su"
" precio accesible y ergonomía decente la hace una escopeta popular de nivel "
"3."

#. ~ Variant name of gun "8-round auto-loading shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "M1014"
msgid_plural "M1014s"
msgstr[0] "M1014"
msgstr[1] "M1014"
msgstr[2] "M1014"

#. ~ Description of variant "8-round auto-loading shotgun" of gun "M1014"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"Benelli's first gas-operated shotgun, featuring dual pistons for enhanced "
"reliability with various loads and a collapsible buttstock that reduces "
"length by almost 8 inches.  Adopted in 1999 as the M1014 Joint Service "
"Combat Shotgun, the Benelli M4 is one of the finest combat shotguns "
"available."
msgstr ""
"La primera escopeta de gas de Benelli, con pistones dobles para una mayor "
"fiabilidad con varias cargas y una culata plegable que reduce la longitud en"
" casi 8 pulgadas. Adoptada en 1999 como la Escopeta de Combate de Servicio "
"Conjunto M1014, la Benelli M4 es una de las mejores escopetas de combate "
"disponibles."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json data/mods/Generic_Guns/firearms/shot.json
msgid "double-barrel pipe shotgun"
msgid_plural "double-barrel pipe shotguns"
msgstr[0] "escopeta de caño de doble cañón"
msgstr[1] "escopetas de caño de doble cañón"
msgstr[2] "escopetas de caño de doble cañón"

#. ~ Description of gun "double-barrel pipe shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"A home-made double-barreled shotgun.  It is simply two pipes attached to a "
"stock, with a pair of hammers to strike the two rounds it holds."
msgstr ""
"Una escopeta de doble cañón hecha en casa. Son simplemente dos tubos con una"
" culata y un par de percutores para golpear las dos balas que contiene."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "pipe shotgun"
msgid_plural "pipe shotguns"
msgstr[0] "escopeta de tubo"
msgstr[1] "escopetas de tubo"
msgstr[2] "escopetas de tubo"

#. ~ Description of gun "pipe shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"A home-made shotgun.  It is simply a pipe attached to a stock, with a hammer"
" to strike the single round it holds."
msgstr ""
"Una escopeta hecha en casa. Es simplemente un tubo con una culata y un "
"percutor para golpear la bala que contiene."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "5-round hunting shotgun"
msgid_plural "5-round hunting shotguns"
msgstr[0] "escopeta de caza de 5 balas"
msgstr[1] "escopetas de caza de 5 balas"
msgstr[2] "escopetas de caza de 5 balas"

#. ~ Description of gun "5-round hunting shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"A classic shotgun in nearly every respect; big, bulky, and intimidating, "
"guns such as this one have been made for over a century in one form or "
"another, coming in both pump-action and semi-automatic models.  Serving both"
" competition-shooting, law-enforcement, and hunting roles, this firearm is "
"sporting a standard-capacity 5-round magazine tube.  Despite the firearm’s "
"low magazine space, what it lacks in capacity it makes up for in sheer "
"close-range effectiveness and stopping power."
msgstr ""
"Una clásica escopeta en casi todos sus aspectos: grande, voluminosa e "
"intimidante. Armas como esta han sido fabricadas por más de un siglo en una "
"forma u otra, modelos de acción de bombeo o semiautomáticos. Útil tanto para"
" competición, como para las fuerzas de la ley o cacería, esta arma tiene un "
"cargador de tubo con capacidad de 5 cartuchos. Su escasa capacidad de carga "
"la compensa con su efectividad a corto alcance y su potencia de detención."

#. ~ Variant name of gun "5-round hunting shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "Remington 870 Wingmaster"
msgid_plural "Remington 870 Wingmaster"
msgstr[0] "Remington 870 Wingmaster"
msgstr[1] "Remington 870 Wingmaster"
msgstr[2] "Remington 870 Wingmaster"

#. ~ Description of variant "5-round hunting shotgun" of gun "Remington 870
#. Wingmaster"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"With over 10 million made, the Remington 870 is one of the most popular "
"shotguns on the market, and finds use with hunters and law enforcement "
"agencies alike thanks to its high accuracy and muzzle velocity.  This one is"
" a 28 inch barreled model for hunting fowl and game."
msgstr ""
"Con más de 10 millones de unidades fabricadas, la Remington 870 es una de "
"las escopetas más populares del mercado, y se utiliza tanto para cazadores "
"como para las fuerzas del orden gracias a su gran precisión y velocidad de "
"cañón. Este es un modelo con cañón de 28 pulgadas para la caza de aves y "
"animales de caza."

#. ~ Variant name of gun "5-round hunting shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "Remington 1100 competition"
msgid_plural "Remington 1100 competitions"
msgstr[0] "Remington 1100 competition"
msgstr[1] "Remington 1100 competitions"
msgstr[2] "Remington 1100 competitions"

#. ~ Description of variant "5-round hunting shotgun" of gun "Remington 1100
#. competition"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"This semi-automatic shotgun features a self compensating gas system that "
"will feed a wide array of shells while also reducing recoil.  Introduced in "
"1963, it is favored by law enforcement, hunters and competition shooters, "
"and has been the best-selling autoloading shotgun in U.S. history.  This is "
"the nickel finished, teflon coated competition model, with a full length "
"magazine tube and 30 inch barrel."
msgstr ""
"Esta escopeta semiautomática cuenta con un sistema de gas autocompensado que"
" alimentará una amplia gama de proyectiles y reducirá el retroceso. "
"Introducida en 1963, es la favorita de las fuerzas del orden, los cazadores "
"y los tiradores de competición, y ha sido la escopeta de carga automática "
"más vendida en la historia de los Estados Unidos. Este es el modelo de "
"competición con acabado de níquel y recubrimiento de teflón, con un tubo de "
"cargador de longitud completa y un cañón de 30 pulgadas."

#. ~ Variant name of gun "5-round hunting shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "Browning Auto 5"
msgid_plural "Browning Auto 5s"
msgstr[0] "Browning Auto 5"
msgstr[1] "Browning Auto 5s"
msgstr[2] "Browning Auto 5s"

#. ~ Description of variant "5-round hunting shotgun" of gun "Browning Auto 5"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"This humble looking shotgun was the earliest successful semi-automatic "
"shotgun, and the second most successful in U.S. history, with over 2.7 "
"million made between 1902 and 1998.  The recoil tuning mechanism under the "
"handguard and long dwell time of the action make for pleasant shooting."
msgstr ""
"Esta humilde escopeta fue la primera escopeta semiautomática exitosa, y la "
"segunda más exitosa en la historia de los EE.UU., con más de 2,7 millones "
"fabricadas entre 1902 y 1998. El mecanismo de ajuste de retroceso bajo el "
"guardamanos y el largo tiempo de permanencia de la acción hacen que el "
"disparo sea agradable."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "breaching shotgun"
msgid_plural "breaching shotguns"
msgstr[0] "escopeta de brecha"
msgstr[1] "escopetas de brecha"
msgstr[2] "escopetas de brecha"

#. ~ Description of gun "breaching shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"This shotgun has a short barrel and no stock, and is set up for breaching "
"doors.  It is small enough to carry as a secondary weapon, but has fairly "
"unpleasant recoil and no sights."
msgstr ""
"Esta escopeta tiene un cañón corto y no tiene culata, y está preparada para "
"abrir puertas. Es lo suficientemente pequeña como para llevarla como arma "
"secundaria, pero tiene un retroceso bastante desagradable y no tiene miras."

#. ~ Variant name of gun "breaching shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "Remington 870 MCS"
msgid_plural "Remington 870 MCSs"
msgstr[0] "Remington 870 MCS"
msgstr[1] "Remington 870 MCSs"
msgstr[2] "Remington 870 MCSs"

#. ~ Description of variant "breaching shotgun" of gun "Remington 870 MCS"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"This Remington 870 Modular Combat System shotgun is currently set up for "
"breaching operations, with a 10 inch barrel and no stock.  It is small "
"enough to carry as a secondary weapon, specifically to pop open any pesky "
"doors you might come across.  The grip's design makes for controllable yet "
"unpleasant recoil, and the barrel lacks any sights."
msgstr ""
"Esta escopeta Remigton 870 con sistema de combate modular esta actualmente "
"configurada para operaciones de brecha, con un cañón de 25 centímetros y sin"
" culata.  Es lo suficientemente pequeña para llevar como arma secundaria, "
"específicamente para abrir puertas molestas con las que te puedes cruzar.  "
"El diseño de la empuñadura le da un retroceso desagradable pero controlable "
"y el cañón no posee miras."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "7-round riot shotgun"
msgid_plural "7-round riot shotguns"
msgstr[0] "escopeta antidisturbios de 7 balas"
msgstr[1] "escopetas antidisturbios de 7 balas"
msgstr[2] "escopetas antidisturbios de 7 balas"

#. ~ Description of gun "7-round riot shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"A brother of more typical hunting style shotguns, this particular model was "
"most often seen utilised for self-defence or law-enforcement purposes.  "
"Featuring a shortened 18.5 inch barrel and extended 7-round magazine tube, "
"it’s a very versatile and reliable weapon."
msgstr ""
"La hermana de la escopeta más típica de cacería, este modelo en particular "
"fue mayormente utilizado para defensa propia o por fuerzas de la ley. Tiene "
"un cañón acortado de 47 centímetros y cargador extendido de 7 balas, un arma"
" muy versátil y confiable."

#. ~ Variant name of gun "7-round riot shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "Remington 870 Express"
msgid_plural "Remington 870 Expresses"
msgstr[0] "Remington 870 Express"
msgstr[1] "Remington 870 Express"
msgstr[2] "Remington 870 Express"

#. ~ Description of variant "7-round riot shotgun" of gun "Remington 870
#. Express"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"With over 10 million made, the Remington 870 is one of the most popular "
"shotguns on the market, and finds use with hunters and law enforcement "
"agencies alike thanks to its high accuracy and muzzle velocity.  This one is"
" an 18.5 inch barreled defensive model."
msgstr ""
"Con más de 10 millones de unidades fabricadas, la Remington 870 es una de "
"las escopetas más populares del mercado, y se utiliza tanto para cazadores "
"como para las fuerzas del orden gracias a su gran precisión y velocidad de "
"cañón. Esta es un modelo defensivo con cañón de 18,5 pulgadas."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "revolving shotgun"
msgid_plural "revolving shotguns"
msgstr[0] "escopeta revolver"
msgstr[1] "escopetas revolver"
msgstr[2] "escopetas revolver"

#. ~ Description of gun "revolving shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"A shotgun modified to use a revolver cylinder mechanism, it can hold 6 "
"cartridges."
msgstr ""
"Es una escopeta modificada para usar el mecanismo de cilindro de un "
"revólver, puede almacenar 6 cartuchos."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "assault shotgun"
msgid_plural "assault shotguns"
msgstr[0] "escopeta de asalto"
msgstr[1] "escopetas de asalto"
msgstr[2] "escopetas de asalto"

#. ~ Description of gun "assault shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"Built in the same style as the venerable AK series of rifles, this Russian "
"exported firearm feeds from detachable magazines rather than making use of a"
" standard tubular design like most commercial shotguns.  With 10 and "
"30-round magazines available, reloading is rendered a much quicker procedure"
" than can ever be accomplished with conventional bottom-feeding firearms."
msgstr ""
"Fabricada en el mismo estilo que la venerable serie de rifles AK, esta arma "
"de exportación rusa se alimenta con cargadores extraíbles en lugar de usar "
"el diseño estándar tubular de la mayoría de las escopetas comerciales. Con "
"cargadores de 10 y de 30 balas disponibles, recargarla es un procedimiento "
"mucho más rápido de lo que puede ser en cualquier arma convencional de "
"alimentación por abajo."

#. ~ Variant name of gun "assault shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "Saiga-12"
msgid_plural "Saiga-12s"
msgstr[0] "Saiga-12"
msgstr[1] "Saiga-12"
msgstr[2] "Saiga-12"

#. ~ Description of variant "assault shotgun" of gun "Saiga-12"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"The Saiga-12 is a semi-automatic shotgun designed on the same Kalashnikov "
"pattern as the AK-47 rifle.  It reloads with a magazine, rather than one "
"shell at a time like most shotguns.  It is one of the last designs of "
"Mikhail Kalashnikov, and was popular in open division shotgun competitions "
"prior to its ban from import via executive order."
msgstr ""
"La Saiga-12 es una escopeta semiautomática diseñada con el mismo modelo de "
"Kalashnikov de los rifles AK-47. Utiliza un cargador, en lugar de tener que "
"poner cada cartucho uno a uno como en la mayoría de las escopetas. Es uno de"
" los últimos diseños de Mikhail Kalashnikov y fue popular en competiciones "
"de escopetas antes de prohibirse su importación por una orden ejecutiva."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "double barrel shotgun"
msgid_plural "double barrel shotguns"
msgstr[0] "escopeta de doble cañón"
msgstr[1] "escopetas de doble cañón"
msgstr[2] "escopetas de doble cañón"

#. ~ Description of gun "double barrel shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"An old shotgun, possibly antique.  It is little more than a pair of barrels,"
" a wood stock, and a hammer to strike the cartridges."
msgstr ""
"Una vieja escopeta, posiblemente una antigüedad. Es prácticamente un par de "
"cañones, una culata de madera y un percutor para pegarle a los cartuchos."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "single barrel shotgun"
msgid_plural "single barrel shotguns"
msgstr[0] "escopeta de un cañón"
msgstr[1] "escopetas de un cañón"
msgstr[2] "escopetas de un cañón"

#. ~ Description of gun "single barrel shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"An old shotgun, possibly antique.  It is little more than a barrel, a wood "
"stock, and a hammer to strike the cartridge.  Its simple design keeps it "
"both light and accurate."
msgstr ""
"Una vieja escopeta, posiblemente una antigüedad. Es prácticamente un cañón, "
"una culata de madera y un percutor para pegarle al cartucho. Su diseño "
"simple la hace ligera y precisa."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "automatic shotgun"
msgid_plural "automatic shotguns"
msgstr[0] "escopeta automática"
msgstr[1] "escopetas automáticas"
msgstr[2] "escopetas automáticas"

#. ~ Description of gun "automatic shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"This shotgun, deemed a destructive device, resembles a comically oversized "
"revolver.  It can hold 12 rounds of 12 gauge shot, and fire all of them in "
"under 3 seconds"
msgstr ""
"Esta escopeta, considerada un artefacto destructivo, se asemeja a un "
"revólver cómicamente sobredimensionado. Puede contener 12 balas de calibre "
"12 y dispararlas todas en menos de 3 segundos."

#. ~ Variant name of gun "automatic shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "Cobray Streetsweeper"
msgid_plural "Cobray Streetsweepers"
msgstr[0] "Cobray Streetsweeper"
msgstr[1] "Cobray Streetsweepers"
msgstr[2] "Cobray Streetsweepers"

#. ~ Description of variant "automatic shotgun" of gun "Cobray Streetsweeper"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"Less shotgun and more comically oversized revolver, the Cobray Streetsweeper"
" sold poorly before it was deemed a destructive device.  The cylinder is "
"driven by a clockspring, cannot be indexed by hand, and must be ejected with"
" an ejector rod.  Its unique design allows for all 12 shells to be fired in "
"under 3 seconds, as demonstrated by the ATF technical branch."
msgstr ""
"Menos escopeta y más revólver cómicamente sobredimensionado, el Cobray "
"Streetsweeper se vendió mal antes de ser considerado un dispositivo "
"destructivo. El cilindro es impulsado por un resorte de reloj, no puede ser "
"indexado a mano, y debe ser expulsado con una varilla eyectora. Su diseño "
"único permite que los 12 proyectiles se disparen en menos de 3 segundos, "
"como lo demuestra la rama técnica de la ATF."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "auto-loading bullpup shotgun"
msgid_plural "auto-loading bullpup shotguns"
msgstr[0] "escopeta de auto recarga bullup"
msgstr[1] "escopetas de auto recarga bullup"
msgstr[2] "escopetas de auto recarga bullup"

#. ~ Description of gun "auto-loading bullpup shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"Looking more like some form of sci-fi prop gun than an actual firearm, this "
"weapon uses a system of three different magazines to field 15 12-gauge "
"shotgun shells within a comparatively compact design.  Each tube has to be "
"loaded separately, but this offers the option of loading different "
"ammunition for different situations.  As the weapon’s trigger assembly is "
"situated forwards of the chamber and magazines in what is termed as a "
"'bullpup' design, the firearm’s notably more compact than its peers despite "
"having a higher capacity when compared against more classically designed "
"shotguns."
msgstr ""
"Parece más un arma de película de ciencia ficción que un arma real. Utiliza "
"un sistema de tres cargadores de tubo para dar lugar a 15 cartuchos en un "
"diseño comparativamente compacto. Cada tubo tiene que ser cargado por "
"separado, pero esto da la opción de cargar diferente munición para "
"diferentes situaciones. Además, tiene diseño 'bullpup' porque el gatillo del"
" arma está situado delante de la cámara y los cargadores, y por eso es "
"notablemente más compacta que armas similares a pesar de tener mayor "
"capacidad cuando se la compara con escopetas más clásicas."

#. ~ Variant name of gun "auto-loading bullpup shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "Tavor TS12"
msgid_plural "Tavor TS12s"
msgstr[0] "Tavor TS12"
msgstr[1] "Tavor TS12s"
msgstr[2] "Tavor TS12s"

#. ~ Description of variant "auto-loading bullpup shotgun" of gun "Tavor TS12"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"A triple tube magazine fed, gas-operated bullpup shotgun of Israeli Weapon "
"Industries make.  It is capable of loading 15 shells, all in a relatively "
"small package.  Like many other modern IWI designs, this looks more like a "
"sci-fi prop gun than a firearm.  An integral top rail is provided for "
"mounting sights."
msgstr ""
"Una escopeta bullpup de triple cargador y operada por gas fabricada por "
"Israeli Weapon Industries. Es capaz de cargar 15 cartuchos en un paquete "
"relativamente pequeño. Como muchos otros diseños de IWI, este parece más un "
"arma de ciencia ficción que un arma de fuego. Un riel integrado superior "
"permite montarle miras."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "bootleg lever-action shotgun"
msgid_plural "bootleg lever-action shotguns"
msgstr[0] "réplica de escopeta de acción de palanca"
msgstr[1] "réplicas de escopetas de acción de palanca"
msgstr[2] "réplicas de escopetas de acción de palanca"

#. ~ Description of gun "bootleg lever-action shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"A lever-action shotgun with a very short barrel and no stock, with room for "
"6 rounds of 12 gauge shotshells.  Likely a bootlegged replica of a pre-1900 "
"firearm, it would pair nicely with a motorcycle jacket and a Harley "
"Davidson, and seems ready to terminate your cataclysmic adversaries."
msgstr ""
"Una escopeta de acción de palanca con un cañón muy corto y sin culata con "
"capacidad de 6 cartuchos calibre 12. Probablemente sea una réplica de un "
"arma de antes de 1900, podría ser una buena combinación con una chaqueta de "
"motero y una Harley Davidson. Parece ser capaz de acabar con tus adversarios"
" cataclísmicos."

#. ~ Variant name of gun "bootleg lever-action shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "1887 bootleg shotgun"
msgid_plural "1887 bootleg shotguns"
msgstr[0] "réplica de escopeta 1887"
msgstr[1] "réplicas de escopetas 1887"
msgstr[2] "réplicas de escopetas 1887"

#. ~ Description of variant "bootleg lever-action shotgun" of gun "1887
#. bootleg shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"One of the first commercially successful repeating shotguns, the Winchester "
"1887 was specifically made lever-action at Winchester's request.  Though "
"later overshadowed in success by pump designs, the 1887 remains popular "
"today.  This one has a very short barrel, no stock, and would pair nicely "
"with a motorcycle jacket and a Harley Davidson."
msgstr ""
"Una de las primeras escopetas de repetición de éxito comercial, la "
"Winchester 1887 se hizo específicamente de palanca a petición de Winchester."
" Aunque más tarde se vio eclipsada en su éxito por los diseños de bombas, la"
" 1887 sigue siendo popular hoy en día. Esta tiene un cañón muy corto, sin "
"culata, y se combinaría muy bien con una chaqueta de motocicleta y una "
"Harley Davidson."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "6-round trenchgun"
msgid_plural "6-round trenchguns"
msgstr[0] "escopeta de trinchera de 6 balas"
msgstr[1] "escopetas de trinchera de 6 balas"
msgstr[2] "escopetas de trinchera de 6 balas"

#. ~ Description of gun "6-round trenchgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"Whether or not you ever wondered what would happen if one was to attach a "
"shotgun atop a sword, the result of such an inquiry now rests before you in "
"all its metallic glory.  Coming outfitted with a large 17 inch sword bayonet"
" and a wooden heat shield to protect the user’s hands from the barrel when "
"it heats up during firing, this pump-action shotgun practically drips menace"
" and looks like it’s straight out of the trenches of World War I.  There "
"aren't any more trenches to clear, so the next zombie-infested town will "
"have to suffice."
msgstr ""
"Si alguna vez te has preguntado qué pasaría si se acoplara una escopeta a "
"una espada, el resultado de esa pregunta está ahora ante ti en toda su "
"gloria. Equipada con una gran bayoneta de 17 pulgadas y un escudo térmico de"
" madera para proteger las manos del usuario del cañón cuando se calienta "
"durante el disparo, esta escopeta de bombeo prácticamente destila amenaza y "
"parece salida directamente de las trincheras de la Primera Guerra Mundial. "
"No hay más trincheras que limpiar, así que la próxima ciudad infestada de "
"zombis tendrá que ser suficiente."

#. ~ Variant name of gun "6-round trenchgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "M1897 Trench Gun"
msgid_plural "M1897 Trench Guns"
msgstr[0] "Escopeta de trinchera M1897"
msgstr[1] "Escopetas de trinchera M1897"
msgstr[2] "Escopetas de trinchera M1897"

#. ~ Description of variant "6-round trenchgun" of gun "M1897 Trench Gun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"The Winchester 1897 was one of the first commercially-successful pump-action"
" shotguns.  In its 'trench' configuration it has become a heavily-"
"romanticized American icon of World War I.  With its barrel shroud, bayonet "
"lug, and 17 inch bayonet, this shotgun is undeniably fearsome in appearance."
"  There aren't any more trenches to clear, so the next zombie-infested town "
"will have to suffice."
msgstr ""
"La Winchester 1897 fue una de las primeras escopetas de acción de bombeo "
"exitosas. Su configuración 'de trinchera' se ha convertido en un ícono "
"estadounidense de la Primera Guerra Mundial muy romantizada. Con su cañón "
"tapado, agarradera para bayoneta y bayoneta de 43 centímetros, esta escopeta"
" es innegablemente temida por su apariencia. Ya no hay tantas trincheras "
"para despejar, así que la próxima ciudad infectada de zombis va a tener que "
"ser el objetivo."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json data/mods/Generic_Guns/firearms/shot.json
msgid "slam-fire pipe shotgun"
msgid_plural "slam-fire pipe shotguns"
msgstr[0] "escopeta de cañón de disparo rápido"
msgstr[1] "escopetas de cañón de disparo rápido"
msgstr[2] "escopetas de cañón de disparo rápido"

#. ~ Description of gun "slam-fire pipe shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"A crude shotgun, composed of two thick steel pipes, an end cap, and a nail."
"  The lack of sights make this weapon only useful at point-blank range."
msgstr ""
"Una escopeta simple compuesta de dos cañones gruesos de acero, una tapa en "
"la punta y un clavo. La ausencia de miras la hacen solamente útil de cerca."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json data/mods/Generic_Guns/firearms/shot.json
msgid "double slam-fire pipe shotgun"
msgid_plural "double slam-fire pipe shotguns"
msgstr[0] "escopeta de cañón de doble tiro"
msgstr[1] "escopetas de cañón de doble tiro"
msgstr[2] "escopetas de cañón de doble tiro"

#. ~ Description of gun "double slam-fire pipe shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"A crude shotgun, composed of four thick steel pipes, two end caps, and two "
"nails.  The lack of sights make this weapon only useful at point-blank "
"range."
msgstr ""
"Una escopeta simple compuesta de cuatro cañones gruesos de acero, dos tapas "
"en la punta y dos clavos. La ausencia de miras la hacen solamente útil de "
"cerca."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "M26-MASS standalone shotgun"
msgid_plural "M26-MASS standalone shotguns"
msgstr[0] "escopeta independiente M26-MASS"
msgstr[1] "escopetas independientes M26-MASS"
msgstr[2] "escopetas independientes M26-MASS"

#. ~ Description of gun "M26-MASS standalone shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"The Modular Accessory Shotgun System is an underbarrel bolt-action shotgun "
"that was inspired by the \"Masterkey\" and which fixed most of its "
"predecessor's problems.  This one is configured for standalone usage."
msgstr ""
"El Sistema Modular de Accesorio de Escopeta es una escopeta de acción de "
"cerrojo de bajocañón inspirada por la \"Masterkey\" pero con la mayoría de "
"sus problemas solucionados. Esta está configurada para ser usada "
"independientemente."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/signal_flare.json
msgid "flaregun"
msgid_plural "flareguns"
msgstr[0] "pistola de bengalas"
msgstr[1] "pistolas de bengalas"
msgstr[2] "pistolas de bengalas"

#. ~ Description of gun "flaregun"
#: data/json/items/gun/signal_flare.json
msgid "A plastic single shot pistol that can be loaded with signal flares."
msgstr ""
"Es una pistola de plástico de un disparo solo que puede ser cargada con "
"bengalas."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/ups.json
msgid "XM34 EMP projector"
msgid_plural "XM34 EMP projectors"
msgstr[0] "proyector XM34 PEM"
msgstr[1] "proyectores XM34 PEM"
msgstr[2] "proyectores XM34 PEM"

#. ~ Description of gun "XM34 EMP projector"
#: data/json/items/gun/ups.json
msgid ""
"A powerful electrolaser developed by the R&D outfit \"Aerial Labs\".  "
"Especially effective against electronic targets."
msgstr ""
"Es un poderoso electroláser desarrollado por R&D \"Aerial Labs\". Es "
"especialmente efectivo contra objetivos electrónicos."

