"Tiene la hoja hecha de acero alto en carbono y con una empuñadura resistente, esto parece un arma en condiciones. El equilibrio parece bueno y la hoja esta bastante afilada."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "hardened rapier"
msgid_plural "hardened rapiers"
msgstr[0] "espada ropera de acero endurecido"
msgstr[1] "espadas roperas de acero endurecido"
msgstr[2] "espadas roperas de acero endurecido"

#. ~ Description of "hardened rapier"
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"This is a thin sword with an ornate hand guard.  It looks like the preferred weapon of gentlemen and swashbucklers.  Light and quick, it makes any battle a stylish battle.\n"
"\n"
"Made of hardened steel and with a molded grip that fits your hand perfectly, this weapon looks as good as any you might find in a museum.  The balance is perfect and the edge is as sharp as a razor."
msgstr ""
"Una espada fina con un la guarda decorada. Es como la que usaría un caballero o un espadachín. Ligera y rápida, hace que cualquier batalla sea con estilo.\n"
