msgid ""
"A soft shiny metal.  Before the apocalypse this would've been worth a small "
"fortune but now its value is greatly diminished."
msgstr ""
"Metal suave y brillante. Antes del apocalipsis hubiera valido una pequeña "
"fortuna, pero ahora su valor se ha depreciado mucho."

