msgid_plural "zinc"
msgstr[0] "zinc"
msgstr[1] "zinc"
msgstr[2] "zinc"

#. ~ Description of "zinc"
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid ""
"A slightly brittle metal.  Apart from being an essential mineral that the "
"body needs, it reacts readily with acids, alkalis and other non-metals.  It "
"can be crushed to make zinc powder, used in the production of batteries, "
"among other things."
msgstr ""
"Un metal ligeramente quebradizo. Aparte de ser un mineral esencial que el "
"cuerpo necesita, reacciona fácilmente con ácidos, alcalinos y otros no "
"metales. Puede ser aplastado para hacer polvo de zinc, utilizado en la "
"producción de baterias, entre otras cosas."

#. ~ Density 11.34g/cm³ ~ 2.8kg/250ml @ stack 1000 = 3g/unit
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid "lead"
msgid_plural "lead"
msgstr[0] "plomo"
msgstr[1] "plomo"
msgstr[2] "plomo"

#. ~ Density 11.34g/cm³ ~ 2.8kg/250ml @ stack 1000 = 3g/unit
#. ~ Description of "lead"
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid ""
"A soft dull metal known since ancient times.  Due to its malleability it has"
" a wide variety of uses including the manufacture of ammunition."
msgstr ""
"Un metal blando y sin brillo conocido desde la antigüedad. Debido a su "
"maleabilidad, tiene una gran variedad de usos, incluida la manufactura de "
"municiones."

#. ~ Weight should be 1.12g because magnesium is 64% less dense than aluminum
