#. ~ Description of "synthetic fabric patch"
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid ""
"This a 6 inch square patch of synthetic fabric.  Unlike you and other "
"natural materials, it won't degrade much with age.  Maybe that's less of a "
"bad thing now."
msgstr ""
"Se trata de un parche de tejido sintético de 15 centímetros cuadrados. A "
"diferencia de ti y de otros materiales naturales, no se degradará mucho con "
"el tiempo. Tal vez eso sea menos malo ahora."

#. ~ 180GSM, .63mm thick
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid "Lycra patch"
msgid_plural "Lycra patches"
msgstr[0] "parche de elastano"
msgstr[1] "parches de elastano"
msgstr[2] "parches de elastano"

#. ~ 180GSM, .63mm thick
#. ~ Description of "Lycra patch"
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid ""
"This is a 6 inch square patch of synthetic fabric blended with stretchy "
"Lycra fibers.  It could be used to make flexible yet strong clothing.  "
"Stylish, but bad for the environment; at least you're recycling it."
msgstr ""
"Es un pedazo de 15 centímetros cuadrados de tela sintética mezclada con "
"fibras flexibles de licra. Puede usarse para hacer ropa flexible pero "
"resistente. Es elegante pero mala para el medio ambiente; por lo menos estás"
" reciclando."

#. ~ Roughly 1.6 square meters of 1 mil (0.0254 mm) thick HDPE plastic,
#. density 0.94 g/cm3, like a strong garbage bag is made of.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid "large plastic sheet"
msgid_plural "large plastic sheets"
msgstr[0] "hoja de plástico grande"
msgstr[1] "hojas de plástico grandes"
msgstr[2] "hojas de plástico grandes"

#. ~ Roughly 1.6 square meters of 1 mil (0.0254 mm) thick HDPE plastic,
#. density 0.94 g/cm3, like a strong garbage bag is made of.
#. ~ Description of "large plastic sheet"
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid ""
"This is a large sheet of flexible plastic, the sort that might have been "
"used for commercial wrapping or for weather-sealing a home."
msgstr ""
"Es una hoja grande de plástico flexible, del tipo que usan para hacer "
"envolturas comerciales o para hacer burletes."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid "plastic sheet"
msgid_plural "plastic sheets"
msgstr[0] "lamina de plástico"
msgstr[1] "laminas de plástico"
msgstr[2] "laminas de plástico"

#. ~ Description of "plastic sheet"
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid ""
"This is a small sheet of flexible plastic, like a cut up garbage bag.  It "
"might be useful for waterproofing clothes."
msgstr ""
"Es una lámina pequeña de plástico flexible, como si fuera una bolsa de "
"basura cortada.  Puede servir para hacer ropa impermeable."

#. ~ Density of 1.2 g/cm3
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid "polycarbonate sheet"
msgid_plural "polycarbonate sheets"
msgstr[0] "lámina de policarbonato"
msgstr[1] "láminas de policarbonato"
msgstr[2] "láminas de policarbonato"

#. ~ Density of 1.2 g/cm3
#. ~ Description of "polycarbonate sheet"
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid ""
"This is a stack of polycarbonate sheets that can be used for, among other "
"things, vacuum molding."
msgstr ""
"Esto es una pila de láminas de policarbonato que pueden usarse para, entre "
"otras cosas, hacer molduras al vacío."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid "rigid plastic sheet"
msgid_plural "rigid plastic sheets"
msgstr[0] "lamina de plástico rígida"
msgstr[1] "laminas de plástico rígidas"
msgstr[2] "laminas de plástico rígidas"

#. ~ Description of "rigid plastic sheet"
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid ""
"A large, rigid sheet of translucent plastic, useful for all manner of "
"things; from construction to art, or even junior snowboarding."
msgstr ""
"Una gran hoja rígida de plástico translúcido, útil para todo tipo de cosas; "
"desde la construcción hasta el arte, o incluso para el snowboarding juvenil."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/stone.json
msgid "flaking rock"
msgid_plural "flaking rocks"
msgstr[0] "piedra redonda"
msgstr[1] "piedras redondas"
msgstr[2] "piedras redondas"

#. ~ Description of "flaking rock"
#: data/json/items/resources/stone.json
msgid ""
"A rock the size of a baseball, which chips in a semi-predictable way if "
"struck, leaving a sharp edge.  Makes a decent melee weapon, and is also good"
" for throwing at enemies."
msgstr ""
"Una roca del tamaño de una pelota de baseball, que se rompe de forma "
"semipredecible si se golpea, dejando un borde afilado. Funciona como arma de"
" combate c. a c. decente, y también es buena para lanzar a los enemigos."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/stone.json
msgid "flint"
msgid_plural "flints"
msgstr[0] "pedernal"
msgstr[1] "pedernales"
msgstr[2] "pedernales"

#. ~ Description of "flint"
#: data/json/items/resources/stone.json
msgid ""
"A chunk of flint, the kind of rock that can make sparks if stuck against "
"high-carbon steel.  It also chips in a semi-predictable way if struck, "
"leaving a sharp edge."
msgstr ""
"Es un pedazo de pedernal, el tipo de piedra que hace chispa si se golpea "
"contra acero de alto carbono. También puede partirse de una manera bastante "
"predecible si se golpea, dejando un borde afilado."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/stone.json
msgid "large rock"
msgid_plural "large rocks"
msgstr[0] "piedra grande"
msgstr[1] "piedras grandes"
msgstr[2] "piedras grandes"

#. ~ Description of "large rock"
#: data/json/items/resources/stone.json
msgid ""
"A heavy and large rock, big enough to be used as a primitive anvil, or "
"shaped into larger stone items."
msgstr ""
"Una roca pesada y grande, lo suficientemente grande para ser usada como un "
"yunque primitivo, o para darle forma a artículos de piedra más grandes."

#. ~ I am assuming this is made of rock wool, but it could also be fiberglass.
#. There is almost no practical difference for our purposes.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/stone.json
msgid "fiber insulation batt"
msgid_plural "fiber insulation batts"
msgstr[0] "capa aislante de fibra"
msgstr[1] "capas aislantes de fibra"
msgstr[2] "capas aislantes de fibra"

#. ~ I am assuming this is made of rock wool, but it could also be fiberglass.
#. There is almost no practical difference for our purposes.
#. ~ Description of "fiber insulation batt"
#: data/json/items/resources/stone.json
msgid ""
"A foil-wrapped batt of fibrous insulation: fire and moisture resistant, used"
" for hot appliances like dishwashers and ovens."
msgstr ""
"Es una capa aislante envuelta en papel de aluminio: es resistente al fuego y"
" a la humedad, se utiliza en electrodomésticos calientes como los "
"lavavajillas y los hornos."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid "grass yarn"
msgid_plural "grass yarns"
msgstr[0] "hilo de hierba"
msgstr[1] "hilos de hierba"
msgstr[2] "hilos de hierba"

#. ~ Description of "grass yarn"
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"Some primitive yarn made from coarse plant fibers like straw or grass.  Too "
"thick to sew with, but could be woven into a crude sheet of fabric."
msgstr ""
"Algún hilo primitivo hecho de fibras vegetales gruesas como paja o hierba. "
"Demasiado grueso para coserlo, pero podría ser tejido en una hoja de tejido "
"cruda."

