msgstr[0] "pellejo curado"
msgstr[1] "pellejos curados"
msgstr[2] "pellejos curados"

#. ~ Description of "cured hide"
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"A rolled up animal hide which has been scraped of extraneous hair and flesh "
"and treated to prevent decay.  It still requires tanning to become usable "
"leather."
msgstr ""
"Un pellejo enrollado de animal que ha sido rasqueteado para sacarle los "
"pelos y carne, y tratado para prevenir la descomposición. Todavía necesita "
"ser curtido para convertirse en cuero utilizable."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid "tanned hide"
msgid_plural "tanned hides"
msgstr[0] "pellejo curtido"
msgstr[1] "pellejos curtidos"
msgstr[2] "pellejos curtidos"

#. ~ Description of "tanned hide"
#: data/json/items/resources/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"A folded 12 inch by 24 inch sheet of leather made from carefully tanned "
"animal hide.  Can be cut up or used as is."
msgstr ""
"Una lamina grande plegada de cuero fabricada con un pellejo de animal "
"cuidadosamente curtida. Puede ser cortado o usado en su actual estado."

#. ~ Item name
