msgid "Pull pin"
msgstr "Quitar gancho de seguridad"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "flashbang"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "You pull the pin on the flashbang."
msgstr "Sacas el gancho de la granada de destello."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "active flashbang"
msgid_plural "active flashbangs"
msgstr[0] "granada de destello activada"
msgstr[1] "granadas de destello activadas"
msgstr[2] "granadas de destello activadas"

#. ~ Description of "active flashbang"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This flashbang is active, and will soon detonate with intense light and "
"sound, blinding, deafening and disorienting anyone nearby.  It may be a good"
" idea to throw it!"
msgstr ""
"Esta granada de destello está activada, y en cualquier momento detonará una "
"luz y un sonido intensos, encegueciendo, ensordeciendo y desorientando a "
"cualquier que esté cerca. ¡Puede ser una buena idea tirarla!"

#. ~ "no_deactivate_msg" action message of item "active flashbang"
#. ~ "no_deactivate_msg" action message of item "active grenade"
#. ~ "no_deactivate_msg" action message of item "active EMP grenade"
#. ~ "no_deactivate_msg" action message of item "active scrambler grenade"
#. ~ "no_deactivate_msg" action message of item "active military explosive
#. pipebomb"
#. ~ "no_deactivate_msg" action message of item "active tear gas payload"
#. ~ "no_deactivate_msg" action message of item "active cryo grenade"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json data/json/items/tool/misc.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/grenades.json
#, c-format
msgid "You've already pulled the %s's pin, try throwing it instead."
msgstr "Ya le sacaste el pasador a la %s, ahora intenta tirarla."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "fungicidal gas grenade"
msgid_plural "fungicidal gas grenades"
msgstr[0] "granada de gas fungicida"
msgstr[1] "granadas de gas fungicida"
msgstr[2] "granadas de gas fungicida"

#. ~ Description of "fungicidal gas grenade"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This is a canister grenade filled with fungicidal solution.  Use this item "
"to pull the pin and light the fuse, turning it into an active fungicidal "
"grenade.  In five seconds it will begin to expel a volatile spray that is "
"highly toxic to fungal life forms."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una granada de bote llena de solución fungicida. Usa este artículo "
"para tirar del pasador y encender la mecha, convirtiéndola en una granada "
"fungicida activa. En cinco segundos comenzará a expulsar un spray volátil "
"que es altamente tóxico para las formas de vida fúngica."

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "fungicidal gas grenade"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "makeshift fungicidal gas grenade"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "tear gas grenade"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "insecticidal gas grenade"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "makeshift insecticidal gas grenade"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "You pull the pin."
msgstr "Tiras de la anilla."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "armed fungicidal gas canister"
msgid_plural "armed fungicidal gas canisters"
msgstr[0] "bote de gas fungicida armado"
msgstr[1] "botes de gas fungicida armados"
msgstr[2] "botes de gas fungicida armados"

#. ~ Description of "armed fungicidal gas canister"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This fungicidal bomb has had its pin removed and is expelling highly toxic "
"gas."
msgstr ""
"A esta bomba fungicida le han quitado la clavija y está expulsando un gas "
"altamente tóxico."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "makeshift fungicidal gas grenade"
msgid_plural "makeshift fungicidal gas grenades"
msgstr[0] "granada de gas fungicida improvisada"
msgstr[1] "granadas de gas fungicidas improvisadas"
msgstr[2] "granadas de gas fungicidas improvisadas"

#. ~ Description of "makeshift fungicidal gas grenade"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This is a makeshift canister grenade filled with fungicidal solution.  Use "
"this item to pull the pin and light the fuse, turning it into an active "
"fungicidal grenade.  In five seconds it will begin to expel a volatile spray"
" that is highly toxic to fungal life forms."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una granada improvisada llena de solución fungicida. Usa este "
"artículo para tirar del pasador y encender la mecha, convirtiéndola en una "
"granada fungicida activa. En cinco segundos comenzará a expulsar un spray "
"volátil que es altamente tóxico para los hongos."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "armed makeshift fungicidal gas canister"
msgid_plural "armed makeshift fungicidal gas canisters"
msgstr[0] "bote de gas fungicida improvisado armado"
msgstr[1] "botes de gas fungicida improvisados armados"
msgstr[2] "botes de gas fungicida improvisados armados"

#. ~ Description of "armed makeshift fungicidal gas canister"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This makeshift fungicidal bomb has had its pin removed and is expelling "
"highly toxic haze."
msgstr ""
"A esta bomba fungicida improvisada le han quitado el alfiler y está "
"expulsando una neblina altamente tóxica."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "makeshift gas canister"
msgid_plural "makeshift gas canisters"
msgstr[0] "lata improvisada de gas"
msgstr[1] "latas improvisadas de gas"
msgstr[2] "latas improvisadas de gas"

#. ~ Description of "makeshift gas canister"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This is a crude gasbomb using household chemicals.  Use this item to arm it."
"  In three seconds it will begin to expel a highly toxic gas for a short "
"time.  This gas poisons those exposed to it, in addition to obscuring vision"
" and scent."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una bomba de gas rudimentaria que utiliza productos químicos "
"domésticos. Usa este objeto para armarla. En tres segundos comenzará a "
"expulsar un gas altamente tóxico durante un breve periodo de tiempo. Este "
"gas envenena a quienes se exponen a él, además de oscurecer la visión y el "
"olor."

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "makeshift gas canister"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "Arm"
msgstr "Brazo"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "makeshift gas canister"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "You arm the makeshift gas canister."
msgstr "Activas la lata improvisada de gas."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "active makeshift gas canister"
msgid_plural "active makeshift gas canisters"
msgstr[0] "bote de gas improvisado activo"
msgstr[1] "botes de gas improvisados activos"
msgstr[2] "botes de gas improvisados activos"

#. ~ Description of "active makeshift gas canister"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This homemade canister of poison gas has been unsealed, and is (or will "
"shortly be) expelling highly toxic gas.  You should consider getting rid of "
"it soon."
msgstr ""
"Esta lata de gas venenoso hecha en casa, ha sido sido abierta y está "
"largando (o lo hará en cualquier momento) un gas muy tóxico. Deberías "
"considerar saquírtela de encima lo antes posible."

#. ~ "no_deactivate_msg" action message of item "active makeshift gas
#. canister"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#, c-format
msgid "You've already armed the %s, try throwing it instead."
msgstr "Ya activaste la %s, ahora intenta tirarla."

#. ~ "sound_msg" action message of item "active makeshift gas canister"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "Hiss."
msgstr "Hiss."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "grenade"
msgid_plural "grenades"
msgstr[0] "granada"
msgstr[1] "granadas"
msgstr[2] "granadas"

#. ~ Description of "grenade"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This is a military-grade fragmentary hand grenade.  Use this item to pull "
"the pin and light the fuse.  You will then have five seconds before it "
"explodes; throwing it would be a good idea."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una granada de mano fragmentaria de grado militar. Utiliza este "
"objeto para sacar el pasador y encender la mecha. Tendrás cinco segundos "
"antes de que explote; lanzarla sería una buena idea."

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "grenade"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "incendiary grenade"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "cryo grenade"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/grenades.json
msgid "You pull the pin on the grenade."
msgstr "Sacas el gancho de la granada."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "active grenade"
msgid_plural "active grenades"
msgstr[0] "granada activada"
msgstr[1] "granadas activadas"
msgstr[2] "granadas activadas"

#. ~ Description of "active grenade"
#. ~ Description of "active military explosive small homemade grenade"
#. ~ Description of "active military explosive homemade grenade"
#. ~ Description of "active small homemade grenade"
#. ~ Description of "active homemade grenade"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This is an active grenade, and will explode any second now.  Better throw "
"it!"
msgstr ""
"Es una granada activada, y va a explotar en cualquier momento. ¡Tírala ya!"

#. ~ Something this useful doesn't come cheap after the apocalypse
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "EMP grenade"
msgid_plural "EMP grenades"
msgstr[0] "granada PEM"
msgstr[1] "granadas PEM"
msgstr[2] "granadas PEM"

#. ~ Something this useful doesn't come cheap after the apocalypse
#. ~ Description of "EMP grenade"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This is a grenade that generates an electromagnetic pulse with a low-"
"inductance capacitor bank discharged into a single-loop antenna.  It also "
"produces a mild electric shock cloud.  Use this item to pull the pin and "
"light the fuse, turning it into an active EMP grenade.  You will then have "
"three seconds before it detonates, creating an EMP field that damages robots"
" and drains bionic energy."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una granada que genera un pulso electromagnético con un banco "
"condensador de baja inducción descargado en una antena de espira. También "
"produce una leve nube de choque eléctrico.  Utiliza este objeto para tirar "
"del pasador y encender el fusible, convirtiéndola en una granada EMP activa."
" Tendrás tres turnos antes de que detone, creando un campo EMP que daña a "
"los robots y drene la energía biónica."

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "EMP grenade"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "You pull the pin on the EMP grenade."
msgstr "Sacas el gancho de la granada PEM."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/obsolete.json
#: data/mods/BlazeIndustries/items/gun/grenade.json
msgid "active EMP grenade"
msgid_plural "active EMP grenades"
msgstr[0] "granada PEM activada"
msgstr[1] "granadas PEM activadas"
msgstr[2] "granadas PEM activadas"

#. ~ Description of "active EMP grenade"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This EMP grenade is active, and will shortly detonate, creating a large EMP "
"field that damages robots and drains bionic energy as well as a mild "
"electric shock cloud.  You may not want to be holding it much longer."
msgstr ""
"Esta granada PEM está activa, y en breve detonará, creando un gran campo PEM"
" que daña a los robots y drena la energía biónica, así como una leve nube de"
" descarga eléctrica. Es posible que no quieras sostenerla mucho tiempo."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "incendiary grenade"
msgid_plural "incendiary grenades"
msgstr[0] "granada incendiaria"
msgstr[1] "granadas incendiarias"
msgstr[2] "granadas incendiarias"

#. ~ Description of "incendiary grenade"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This is a military-grade incendiary hand grenade.  Use this item to pull the"
" pin and light the fuse.  You will then have five seconds before it explodes"
" into a raging inferno; throwing it would be a good idea."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una granada de mano incendiaria de grado militar. Utiliza este "
"objeto para sacar el pasador y encender la mecha. Tendrás cinco segundos "
"antes de que explote y se convierta en un infierno; lanzarla sería una buena"
" idea."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "active incendiary grenade"
msgid_plural "active incendiary grenades"
msgstr[0] "granada incendiaria activada"
msgstr[1] "granadas incendiarias activadas"
msgstr[2] "granadas incendiarias activadas"

#. ~ Description of "active incendiary grenade"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This is an active incendiary grenade, likely to burst into an inferno any "
"second now.  Better throw it!"
msgstr ""
"Es una granada incendiaria activada, y va a explotar en un infierno en "
"cualquier momento. ¡Tirala ya!"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "canister grenade"
msgid_plural "canister grenades"
msgstr[0] "granada de lata"
msgstr[1] "granadas de lata"
msgstr[2] "granadas de lata"

#. ~ "message" action message of item "canister grenade"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#, c-format
msgid "You pull the pin on the %s."
msgstr "Sacas el gancho de la %s."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "tear gas grenade"
msgid_plural "tear gas grenades"
msgstr[0] "granada lacrimógina"
msgstr[1] "granadas lacrimóginas"
msgstr[2] "granadas lacrimóginas"

#. ~ Description of "tear gas grenade"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This is a canister grenade filled with noxious irritant.  Use this item to "
"pull the pin and light the fuse, turning it into an active tear gas grenade."
"  In five seconds it will begin to expel a highly toxic gas for some time.  "
"This gas damages and slows those who enter it, as well as obscuring vision "
"and scent."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una granada de bote llena de un irritante nocivo. Usa este artículo "
"para tirar del pasador y encender la mecha, convirtiéndola en una granada de"
" gas lacrimógeno activa. En cinco segundos comenzará a expulsar un gas "
"altamente tóxico durante algún tiempo. Este gas daña y frena a quienes "
"entran en él, además de oscurecer la visión y el olor."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "armed tear gas canister"
msgid_plural "armed tear gas canisters"
msgstr[0] "granada lacrimógina activada"
msgstr[1] "granadas lacrimóginas activadas"
msgstr[2] "granadas lacrimóginas activadas"

#. ~ Description of "armed tear gas canister"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This smoke bomb has had its pin removed and is expelling highly toxic gas."
msgstr ""
"Esta bomba de humo no tiene el gancho de seguridad y está largando un gas "
"muy tóxico."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "insecticidal gas grenade"
msgid_plural "insecticidal gas grenades"
msgstr[0] "granadasde gas insecticida"
msgstr[1] "granadas de gas insecticida"
msgstr[2] "granadas de gas insecticida"

#. ~ Description of "insecticidal gas grenade"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This is a canister grenade filled with insecticidal solution.  Use this item"
" to pull the pin and light the fuse, turning it into an active insecticidal "
"grenade.  In five seconds it will begin to expel a volatile spray that is "
"highly toxic to insect life forms."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una granada de bote llena de solución insecticida. Usa este artículo"
" para tirar del pasador y encender la mecha, convirtiéndola en una granada "
"insecticida activa. En cinco segundos comenzará a expulsar un aerosol "
"volátil que es altamente tóxico para las formas de vida de los insectos."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "armed insecticidal gas canister"
msgid_plural "armed insecticidal gas canisters"
msgstr[0] "bote de gas insecticida armado"
msgstr[1] "botes de gas insecticida armados"
msgstr[2] "botes de gas insecticida armados"

#. ~ Description of "armed insecticidal gas canister"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This insecticidal bomb has had its pin removed and is expelling highly toxic"
" haze."
msgstr ""
"A esta bomba insecticida le han quitado el alfiler y está expulsando una "
"neblina altamente tóxica."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "makeshift insecticidal gas grenade"
msgid_plural "makeshift insecticidal gas grenades"
msgstr[0] "granada de gas insecticida improvisada"
msgstr[1] "granadas de gas insecticida improvisadas"
msgstr[2] "granadas de gas insecticida improvisadas"

#. ~ Description of "makeshift insecticidal gas grenade"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This is a makeshift canister grenade filled with insecticidal solution.  Use"
" this item to pull the pin and light the fuse, turning it into an active "
"insecticidal grenade.  In five seconds it will begin to expel a volatile "
"spray that is highly toxic to insect life forms."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una granada de bote improvisada llena de solución insecticida. Usa "
"este artículo para tirar del pasador y encender la mecha, convirtiéndola en "
"una granada insecticida activa. En cinco segundos comenzará a expulsar un "
"aerosol volátil que es altamente tóxico para las formas de vida de los "
"insectos."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "armed makeshift insecticidal gas canister"
msgid_plural "armed makeshift insecticidal gas canisters"
msgstr[0] "granada de insecticida improvisada activada"
msgstr[1] "granadas de insecticida improvisadas activadas"
msgstr[2] "granadas de insecticida improvisadas activadas"

#. ~ Description of "armed makeshift insecticidal gas canister"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This makeshift insecticidal bomb has had its pin removed and is expelling "
"highly toxic haze."
msgstr ""
"A esta bomba insecticida improvisada se le ha quitado el alfiler y está "
"expulsando una neblina altamente tóxica."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "packed M72 LAW"
msgid_plural "packed M72 LAWs"
msgstr[0] "M72 LAW empaquetado"
msgstr[1] "M72 LAW empaquetados"
msgstr[2] "M72 LAW empaquetados"

#. ~ Description of "packed M72 LAW"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This is a M72 LAW, packed in its storage form.  Use it to pop it out and "
"make it ready to fire.  Once it is activated, it cannot be repacked."
msgstr ""
"Es un M73 LAW empaquetado en su forma para almacenamiento. Usalo para "
"abrirlo y dejarlo listo para disparar. Una vez que está activado, ya no "
"puede ser empaquetado."

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "packed M72 LAW"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "You pull the activating lever, readying the LAW to fire."
msgstr "Tiras de la palanca activadora, preparando el LAW para disparar."

#. ~ This is based on the Davy Crockett nuclear artillery shell, all other
#. man-portable nuclear weapons have far too high a yield.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "mininuke"
msgid_plural "mininukes"
msgstr[0] "minibomba nuclear"
msgstr[1] "minibombas nucleares"
msgstr[2] "minibombas nucleares"

#. ~ This is based on the Davy Crockett nuclear artillery shell, all other
#. man-portable nuclear weapons have far too high a yield.
#. ~ Description of "mininuke"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This is an extremely powerful weapon, a portable nuclear bomb.  Use it to "
"activate the timer.  You guess that the explosion would be large enough to "
"take out a small house."
msgstr ""
"Esta es un arma extremadamente poderosa, una bomba nuclear portátil. Úsala "
"para activar el temporizador. Supones que la explosión sería lo "
"suficientemente grande como para acabar con una casa pequeña."

#. ~ This is based on the Davy Crockett nuclear artillery shell, all other
#. man-portable nuclear weapons have far too high a yield.
#. ~ Description of "mininuke"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This miniature nuclear bomb has a light blinking on the side, showing that "
"it will soon explode.  You should probably get far, far away from it."
msgstr ""
"Esta bomba nuclear miniatura tiene una luz titilando en el costado, "
"indicando que pronto va a explotar. Deberías alejarte lo más posible de "
"ella."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "Molotov cocktail"
msgid_plural "Molotov cocktails"
msgstr[0] "cóctel molotov"
msgstr[1] "cócteles molotov"
msgstr[2] "cócteles molotov"

#. ~ Description of "Molotov cocktail"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"A bottle of flammable liquid with a rag inserted.  Use this item to light "
"the rag.  You will, of course, need a lighter or matches in your inventory "
"to do this.  After lighting it, throw it to cause fires."
msgstr ""
"Es una botella con líquido inflamable y un trapo metido adentro. Úsalo para "
"encender fuego el trapo. Vas a necesitar un encendedor o fósforos en tu "
"inventario para usarlo. Después de encenderlo, tíralo para prender fuego en "
"el impacto."

#. ~ Description of "Molotov cocktail"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"A bottle of flammable liquid with a flaming rag stoppered in its neck.  "
"Throwing it will shatter the bottle on impact and ignite a fireball.  "
"Dropping it will set you on fire, so don't do that unless you want to burn "
"to death."
msgstr ""
"Es una botella con un líquido inflamable y un trapo llameante metido en el "
"cuello. Al tirarlo se rompe la botella y se prende como una bola de fuego. "
"Si se te cae, te vas a prender fuego a ti mismo, así que no hagas eso "
"excepto que te quieras morir quemado."

#. ~ Something this useful doesn't come cheap after the apocalypse
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "scrambler grenade"
msgid_plural "scrambler grenades"
msgstr[0] "granada emisora de interferencias"
msgstr[1] "granadas emisoras de interferencias"
msgstr[2] "granadas emisoras de interferencias"

#. ~ Something this useful doesn't come cheap after the apocalypse
#. ~ Description of "scrambler grenade"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This is a specialized grenade, designed to scramble robots' IFF control "
"chips.  This converts the robot to your side for a short time, before the "
"backup systems kick in.  Use this item to pull the pin and light the fuse, "
"turning it into an active scrambler grenade."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una granada especializada, diseñada para alterar los chips de "
"control IFF de los robots. Esto convierte al robot a su lado por un corto "
"tiempo, antes de que los sistemas de respaldo hagan efecto. Usa este "
"elemento para tirar del pasador y encender el fusible, convirtiéndolo en una"
" granada codificadora activa."

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "scrambler grenade"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "You pull the pin on the scrambler grenade."
msgstr "Sacas el gancho de la granada emisora de interferencias."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "active scrambler grenade"
msgid_plural "active scrambler grenades"
msgstr[0] "granada emisora de interferencias activada"
msgstr[1] "granadas emisoras de interferencias activadas"
msgstr[2] "granadas emisoras de interferencias activadas"

#. ~ Description of "active scrambler grenade"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This scrambler grenade is active, and will soon detonate, releasing a "
"control wave that temporarily converts robots to your side."
msgstr ""
"Esta granada emisora de interferencias está activada, y en cualquier momento"
" detonará enviando una onda de control que convertirá temporalmente a los "
"robos en tus aliados."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "smoke bomb"
msgid_plural "smoke bombs"
msgstr[0] "bomba de humo"
msgstr[1] "bombas de humo"
msgstr[2] "bombas de humo"

#. ~ Description of "smoke bomb"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This is a canister grenade filled with a variety of pyrotechnic chemicals.  "
"Use this item to pull the pin and light the fuse, turning it into an active "
"smoke bomb.  Five seconds after you do that, it will begin to expel a thick "
"black smoke.  This smoke will slow those who enter it, as well as obscuring "
"vision and scent."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una granada de bote llena de una variedad de productos químicos "
"pirotécnicos. Usa este artículo para tirar del pasador y encender la mecha, "
"convirtiéndola en una bomba de humo activa. Cinco segundos después de hacer "
"eso, comenzará a expulsar un humo negro y espeso. Este humo frenará a "
"quienes entren en él, además de oscurecer la visión y el olor."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "armed smoke bomb"
msgid_plural "armed smoke bombs"
msgstr[0] "bomba de humo activada"
msgstr[1] "bombas de humo activadas"
msgstr[2] "bombas de humo activadas"

#. ~ Description of "armed smoke bomb"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "This smoke bomb has had its pin removed and is expelling thick smoke."
msgstr ""
"Esta bomba de humo no tiene el gancho de seguridad y está largando un humo "
"denso."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "rocket candy"
msgid_plural "rocket candies"
msgstr[0] "combustible de caramelo"
msgstr[1] "combustible de caramelo"
msgstr[2] "combustible de caramelo"

#. ~ Description of "rocket candy"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"A pear-shaped chunk of rocket candy obtained by heating saltpeter with sugar"
" and casting the obtained liquid.  Can serve as a rocket fuel, but also as a"
" smokescreen - if you lit the narrow end, you should be able to throw it "
"before the flame reaches the broad end."
msgstr ""
"Un trozo en forma de pera con combustible de caramelo obtenido calentando el"
" salitre con azúcar y vertiendo el líquido obtenido. Puede servir como "
"combustible para cohetes, pero también como cortina de humo - si se enciende"
" el extremo estrecho, debería ser capaz de lanzarlo antes de que la llama "
"llegue al extremo ancho."

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "rocket candy"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "Light candy"
msgstr "Encender caramelo"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "rocket candy"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "You light the rocket candy on fire.  Throw it!"
msgstr "Enciendes el cohete de caramelo. ¡Suéltalo!"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "burning rocket candy"
msgid_plural "burning rocket candies"
msgstr[0] "combustible de caramelo ardiendo"
msgstr[1] "combustible de caramelo ardiendo"
msgstr[2] "combustible de caramelo ardiendo"

#. ~ Description of "burning rocket candy"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This is a chunk of rocket candy that has been lit on fire and burns with a "
"loud hiss, spewing forth large amounts of smoke."
msgstr ""
"Este es un trozo de cohete de caramelo, que ha sido encendido y quemado y "
"está siseando, arrojando grandes cantidades de humo."

#. ~ "no_deactivate_msg" action message of item "burning rocket candy"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "You've already lit the fuse - get rid of it immediately!"
msgstr "Ya has encendido la mecha, ¡deshazte de ella inmediatamente!"

#. ~ "sound_msg" action message of item "burning rocket candy"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "Hsssss."
msgstr "Hsssss."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "military explosive small homemade grenade"
msgid_plural "military explosive small homemade grenades"
msgstr[0] "pequeña granada casera de explosivo militar"
msgstr[1] "pequeñas granadas caseras de explosivo militar"
msgstr[2] "pequeñas granadas caseras de explosivo militar"

#. ~ Description of "military explosive small homemade grenade"
#. ~ Description of "military explosive homemade grenade"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"A improvised explosive device cobbled together from parts.  Use this item "
"light the fuse.  You will then have some amount of time before it explodes; "
"throwing it would be a good idea."
msgstr ""
"Un artefacto explosivo improvisado, hecho de piezas. Usa este objeto para "
"encender la mecha. Tendrás algo de tiempo antes de que explote; lanzarlo "
"sería una buena idea."

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "military explosive small homemade grenade"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "military explosive homemade grenade"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "small homemade grenade"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "homemade grenade"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"You light the fuse on the improvised grenade.  Throw it before it blows in "
"your face!"
msgstr ""
"Enciendes la mecha de la granada improvisada. ¡Lánzala antes de que te "
"explote en la cara!"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "active military explosive small homemade grenade"
msgid_plural "active military explosive small homemade grenades"
msgstr[0] "pequeña granada casera de explosivo militar activada"
msgstr[1] "pequeñas granadas caseras de explosivo militar activadas"
