"These are a pair of makeshift steel scissors.  Despite the difference in "
"material and craftsmanship they are functionally identical to their aluminum"
" counterparts."
msgstr ""
"Un par de tijeras de acero improvisadas. A pesar de la diferencia de "
"material y fabricación, son funcionalmente idénticas a las que están hechas "
"de aluminio."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/stoneworking.json
msgid "bone billet"
msgid_plural "bone billets"
msgstr[0] "varilla de hueso"
msgstr[1] "varillas de hueso"
msgstr[2] "varillas de hueso"

#. ~ Description of "bone billet"
#: data/json/items/tool/stoneworking.json
msgid ""
"A thick short bone, usually used in flintknapping for soft-hammer "
"percussion."
msgstr ""
"Un hueso corto y grueso, usualmente usado para golpear con un pedernal para "
"la percusión de martillos blandos."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/stoneworking.json
msgid "wooden billet"
msgid_plural "wooden billets"
msgstr[0] "varilla de madera"
msgstr[1] "varillas de madera"
msgstr[2] "varillas de madera"

#. ~ Description of "wooden billet"
#: data/json/items/tool/stoneworking.json
msgid ""
"A thick short wooden stick, usually used in flintknapping for soft-hammer "
"percussion."
msgstr ""
"Un palo de madera corto y grueso, que se usa normalmente para golpear con un"
" pedernal para la percusión de martillos blandos."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/stoneworking.json
