msgstr[2] "langostas"

#. ~ Description of monster "lobster"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid ""
"A dark greenish crustacean in its natural habitat.  These were once "
"considered pests barely worth eating, then some marketing genius started "
"selling them to people as a delicacy and they took off in popularity… and "
"price."
msgstr ""
"Un crustáceo de color verde oscuro en su hábitat natural. Antes se "
"consideraba una plaga que apenas merecía la pena comer, pero un genio de la "
"mercadotecnia empezó a venderlos como un manjar y su popularidad se "
"disparó... y su precio."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
