msgid_plural "crayfish"
msgstr[0] "cangrejo de rio"
msgstr[1] "cangrejos de rio"
msgstr[2] "cangrejos de rio"

#. ~ Description of monster "crayfish"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid ""
"This crustacean looks like a tiny lobster, but is actually a completely "
"different species.  If you could get ahold of a bunch more of these, a hefty"
" pot of boiling water, and some spicy seasonings…"
msgstr ""
"Este crustáceo parece una langosta diminuta, pero en realidad es una especie"
" completamente diferente. Si pudieras conseguir un montón de ellas, una olla"
" grande de agua hirviendo y algunos condimentos picantes..."

