#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid ""
"An American eel.  They used to be quite common in these parts until the dams"
" were built.  They'll get a second chance now that those aren't running."
msgstr ""
"Una anguila americana. Solían ser bastante comunes en estas partes hasta que"
" se construyeron las presas. Tendrán una segunda oportunidad ahora que esas "
"no funcionan."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
