"horrible shrieking noises.  Often spotted near shipwrecks or other dark, "
"damp places, which it uses as nesting grounds."
msgstr ""
"Crustáceo del tamaño de un hombre revestido de quitina similar al hierro, "
"capaz de emitir horribles chillidos. A menudo se le ve cerca de naufragios u"
