#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid "fungal raptor"
msgid_plural "fungal raptors"
msgstr[0] "raptor fúngico"
msgstr[1] "raptores fúngicos"
msgstr[2] "raptores fúngicos"

#. ~ Description of monster "fungal raptor"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid ""
"Infested by a thick crust of fungal growth, this small, winged predator "
"darts through the air on three spongy wings that look like stretched human "
"hands.  A sheer, jagged spike juts out from the point where the wings meet."
"  It looks like nothing you've seen on Earth, and yet strangely like it is "
"made of human parts."
msgstr ""
"Este pequeño depredador alado, infestado por una corteza fúngica, se mueve a"
" toda velocidad por el aire con tres alas esponjosas que parecen manos "
"humanas estiradas. Una púa dentada y fina sobresale de la punta donde se "
"juntan las alas. No se parece a nada de lo que viste en la Tierra y sin "
"embargo parece estar hecho extrañamente de partes humanas."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "dark wyrm"
msgid_plural "dark wyrms"
msgstr[0] "wyrm oscuro"
msgstr[1] "wyrms oscuros"
msgstr[2] "wyrms oscuros"

#. ~ Description of monster "dark wyrm"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A huge mutated worm living deep underground.  It has a round, gaping mouth "
"lined with dagger-like teeth, and its flesh is slick with bubbling blue "
"slime."
msgstr ""
"Un enorme gusano mutado que vive bajo tierra. Tiene una boca redonda y "
"abierta con dientes en forma de daga, y su carne está impregnada de una baba"
" azul burbujeante."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "graboid"
msgid_plural "graboids"
msgstr[0] "graboid"
msgstr[1] "graboides"
msgstr[2] "graboides"

#. ~ Description of monster "graboid"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A monstrous beast the size of a semi truck with a tripartite mouth that "
"opens to reveal hundreds of writhing tongues with razor sharp edges.  It "
"keeps most of its enormous body hidden underground."
msgstr ""
"Una bestia monstruosa del tamaño de un camión con una boca tripartita que se"
" abre para revelar cientos de lenguas retorcidas con bordes afilados. "
"Mantiene la mayor parte de su enorme cuerpo escondido bajo tierra."

#. ~ Death message of monster "graboid"
#. ~ Death message of monster "giant worm"
#. ~ Death message of monster "slime"
#. ~ Death message of monster "brain slime"
#. ~ Death message of monster "big slime"
#. ~ Death message of monster "zombie hollow"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json data/json/monsters/slimes.json
#: data/json/monsters/zed_misc.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s splits in two!"
msgstr "¡El %s se separa en dos!"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "half worm"
msgid_plural "half worms"
msgstr[0] "mediogusano"
msgstr[1] "mediogusanos"
msgstr[2] "mediogusanos"

#. ~ Description of monster "half worm"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A squiggling severed portion of a wounded giant worm."
msgstr "Una parte movediza cortada de un gusano gigante herido."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "giant worm"
msgid_plural "giant worms"
msgstr[0] "gusano gigante"
msgstr[1] "gusanos gigantes"
msgstr[2] "gusanos gigantes"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant worm"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A huge, mutated creature that might once have been a nightcrawler.  It "
"possesses a large fanged mouth and a long slender body that comes up to your"
" shoulder, with even more surely hiding underground."
msgstr ""
"Una enorme criatura mutada que antes podría haber sido una lombriz. Posee "
"una gran boca con colmillos y un cuerpo largo y fino que es alto como hasta "
"tu hombro, pero seguro que tiene la mayoria del cuerpo oculto debajo del "
"suelo."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "large worm"
msgid_plural "large worms"
msgstr[0] "gusano grande"
msgstr[1] "gusanos grandes"
msgstr[2] "gusanos grandes"

#. ~ Description of monster "large worm"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A disturbingly large mutated subterranean creature similar to a "
"nightcrawler.  It possesses a fanged mouth and a long slender body that "
"comes up to your knees, with even more surely hiding underground."
msgstr ""
"Una enorme criatura mutada que antes podría haber sido una lombriz. Posee "
"una gran boca con colmillos y un cuerpo largo y fino que es alto como hasta "
"tu hombro, pero seguro que tiene más cuerpo oculto debajo del suelo."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "cockroach"
msgid_plural "cockroaches"
msgstr[0] "cucaracha"
msgstr[1] "cucarachas"
msgstr[2] "cucarachas"

#. ~ Description of monster "cockroach"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "An aggressive mutant cockroach the size of a small dog."
msgstr "Una agresiva cucaracha mutante del tamaño de un perro pequeño."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#: data/mods/Tamable_Wildlife/insect_spider.json
msgid "skittering plague"
msgid_plural "skittering plagues"
msgstr[0] "plaga de escabullidores"
msgstr[1] "plagas de escabullidores"
msgstr[2] "plagas de escabullidores"

#. ~ Description of monster "skittering plague"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A giant, sickly-looking cockroach that appears to be using the undead as its"
" primary food source.  The diet of infected flesh doesn't seem to harm it, "
"but something about the roach's biology is clearly changing.  It doesn't "
"seem interested in you."
msgstr ""
"Una cucaracha gigante de aspecto enfermizo que parece utilizar a los muertos"
" vivientes como su principal fuente de alimento. La dieta de carne infectada"
" no parece dañarla, pero algo en la biología de la cucaracha está claramente"
" cambiando. No parece interesada en ti."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#: data/mods/Tamable_Wildlife/insect_spider.json
msgid "plague nymph"
msgid_plural "plague nymphs"
msgstr[0] "plaga de ninfas"
msgstr[1] "plagas de ninfas"
msgstr[2] "plagas de ninfas"

#. ~ Description of monster "plague nymph"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A sickly-looking mutant cockroach about the size of a rat, raised from birth"
" on a healthy diet of zombie flesh.  It still has enough natural instinct "
"left to avoid approaching you."
msgstr ""
"Una cucaracha mutante de aspecto enfermizo y del tamaño de una rata, criada "
"desde su nacimiento con una saludable dieta de carne de zombi. Todavía le "
"queda suficiente instinto natural para evitar acercarse a ti."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#: data/mods/Tamable_Wildlife/insect_spider.json
msgid "plague vector"
msgid_plural "plague vectors"
msgstr[0] "vector de la plaga"
msgstr[1] "vectores de la plaga"
msgstr[2] "vectores de la plaga"

#. ~ Description of monster "plague vector"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"This giant cockroach has been feeding on the undead for some time and "
"started to mutate chaotically.  Extra limbs and growths sprout from its "
"thorax, and it is notably aggressive even to creatures much larger than "
"itself."
msgstr ""
"Esta cucaracha gigante lleva un tiempo alimentándose de muertos vivientes y "
"ha empezado a mutar caóticamente. De su tórax brotan extremidades y "
"crecimientos adicionales, y es notablemente agresiva incluso con criaturas "
"mucho más grandes que ella."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#: data/mods/Tamable_Wildlife/insect_spider.json
msgid "giant cockroach"
msgid_plural "giant cockroaches"
msgstr[0] "cucaracha gigante"
msgstr[1] "cucarachas gigantes"
msgstr[2] "cucarachas gigantes"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant cockroach"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A mutant cockroach the size of a dog.  This size advantage is apparently all"
" it needs to start regarding humans as food!"
msgstr ""
"Una cucaracha mutante del tamaño de un perro. Al parecer, esta ventaja de "
"tamaño es todo lo que necesita para empezar a considerar a los humanos como "
"comida."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#: data/mods/Tamable_Wildlife/insect_spider.json
msgid "giant cockroach nymph"
msgid_plural "giant cockroach nymphs"
msgstr[0] "cucaracha ninfa gigante"
msgstr[1] "cucarachas ninfas gigantes"
msgstr[2] "cucarachas ninfas gigantes"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant cockroach nymph"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A baby mutant cockroach about the size of a rat."
msgstr "Es una cucaracha mutante bebé, del tamaño de una rata."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#: data/mods/Tamable_Wildlife/insect_spider.json
msgid "pregnant giant cockroach"
msgid_plural "pregnant giant cockroaches"
msgstr[0] "cucaracha gigante embarazada"
msgstr[1] "cucarachas gigantes embarazadas"
msgstr[2] "cucarachas gigantes embarazadas"

#. ~ Description of monster "pregnant giant cockroach"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A mutant cockroach the size of a small dog.  Its abdomen is heavily swollen "
"with eggs."
msgstr ""
"Una cucaracha mutante del tamaño de un perro pequeño. Su abdomen está muy "
"hinchado con huevos."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "bee"
msgid_plural "bees"
msgstr[0] "abeja"
msgstr[1] "abejas"
msgstr[2] "abejas"

#. ~ Description of monster "bee"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A mutant bee the size of a small dog."
msgstr "Una abeja mutante del tamaño de un perro."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "giant bee"
msgid_plural "giant bees"
msgstr[0] "abeja gigante"
msgstr[1] "abejas gigantes"
msgstr[2] "abejas gigantes"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant bee"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"With a stinger the size of a kitchen knife, this dog-sized insect's black "
"and yellow markings warn you to leave it undisturbed."
msgstr ""
"Con un aguijón del tamaño de una cuchilla, este insecto del tamaño de un "
"perro es negro con rayas amarillas, que te advierten que te alejes y no "
"molestes."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "alpha bee"
msgid_plural "alpha bees"
msgstr[0] "abeja alfa"
msgstr[1] "abejas alfa"
msgstr[2] "abejas alfa"

#. ~ Description of monster "alpha bee"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"An enormous mutant bee with black and white markings and a long stinger "
"spelling doom."
msgstr ""
"Una enorme abeja mutante con marcas blancas y negras y un largo aguijón que "
"deletrea."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "centipede"
msgid_plural "centipedes"
msgstr[0] "ciempiés"
msgstr[1] "ciempiés"
msgstr[2] "ciempiés"

#. ~ Description of monster "centipede"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A brightly-colored mutant centipede the size of a small dog, skittering "
"quickly in the underbrush.  Probably won't think you're suitable prey, but "
"beware its venom."
msgstr ""
"Un ciempiés mutante de color brillante del tamaño de un perro pequeño, que "
"se desliza rápidamente en la maleza. Probablemente no piense que eres una "
"presa adecuada, pero ten cuidado con su veneno."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "giant centipede"
msgid_plural "giant centipedes"
msgstr[0] "Ciempiés gigante"
msgstr[1] "Ciempiés gigantes"
msgstr[2] "Ciempiés gigantes"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant centipede"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A two-meter-long centipede with a menacing set of venom-dripping mandibles "
"and a worrying number of grabbing appendages, moving swiftly on dozens of "
"spindly legs.  It has a pair of small compound eyes, but seems to mostly "
"orient itself with its antennae."
msgstr ""
"Un ciempiés de dos metros de largo con un amenazador conjunto de mandíbulas "
"que gotean veneno y un preocupante número de apéndices de agarre, que se "
"mueve rápidamente sobre docenas de patas flacas. Tiene un par de pequeños "
"ojos compuestos, pero parece orientarse mayormente con sus antenas."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "centipede matriarch"
msgid_plural "centipede matriarchs"
msgstr[0] "matriarca de ciempiés"
msgstr[1] "matriarcas de ciempiés"
msgstr[2] "matriarcas de ciempiés"

#. ~ Description of monster "centipede matriarch"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A giant centipede grown even larger, hind segments curled up to protect a "
"huge clump of eggs and its children of different ages.  Sometimes one of its"
" young gets shaken off by its clutchmates and disappears into the "
"underbrush."
msgstr ""
"Un ciempiés gigante que creció aún más, los segmentos traseros se curvan "
"para proteger a un enorme grupo de huevos y a sus hijos de diferentes "
"edades. A veces una de sus crías es sacudida por sus compañeros de nidada y "
"desaparece entre la maleza."

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "centipede matriarch"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "A small centipede is shaken off in the struggle!"
msgstr "¡Un pequeño ciempiés es sacudido en la lucha!"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "armored centipede"
msgid_plural "armored centipedes"
msgstr[0] "ciempiés blindado"
msgstr[1] "ciempiés blindados"
msgstr[2] "ciempiés blindados"

#. ~ Description of monster "armored centipede"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A huge mutated centipede covered in interlocking chitinous plates of "
"metallic gray, reminding you more of a runaway train car than any living "
"animal.  Its mandibles end in jagged points, seemingly specialised to hunt "
"prey at least as well-armored as itself.  You really don't want to try if "
"you'd fare better."
msgstr ""
"Un enorme ciempiés mutado cubierto de placas quitinosas entrelazadas de un "
"gris metálico, que te hace pensar más en un tren que en un animal vivo. Sus "
"mandíbulas terminan en puntas serradas, y parecen especiales para cazar "
"presas con tanta protección como él mismo ciempiés. La verdad es que no "
"quieres ni intentar cómo te va contra esto."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#: data/mods/Tamable_Wildlife/insect_spider.json
msgid "giant dragonfly naiad"
msgid_plural "giant dragonfly naiads"
msgstr[0] "libélula náyade gigante"
msgstr[1] "libélulas náyades gigantes"
msgstr[2] "libélulas náyades gigantes"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant dragonfly naiad"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A predatory, aquatic dragonfly larva, normally barely a centimeter long and "
"feeding on small fishes, grown to the size of a catfish.  Underneath its "
"sharp mandibles you can see that its folded lower jaw has changed into "
"something resembling a barbed spear."
msgstr ""
"La larva acuática depredadora de una libélula, normalmente de apenas un cm "
"de largo y que se alimenta de pequeños peces, crece hasta el tamaño de un "
"pez gato. Debajo de sus afiladas mandíbulas se puede ver que su mandíbula "
"inferior doblada se convirtió en algo parecido a una lanza de púas."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#: data/mods/Tamable_Wildlife/insect_spider.json
msgid "giant dragonfly"
msgid_plural "giant dragonflies"
msgstr[0] "libélula gigante"
msgstr[1] "libélulas gigantes"
msgstr[2] "libélulas gigantes"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant dragonfly"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A ferocious, bright green dragonfly, still lightning-fast despite growing to"
" the size of a schoolchild.  Its head is little more than a basketball-sized"
" pair of rainbow compound eyes, and its legs - already specialized for "
"grasping prey - end in curved talons."
msgstr ""
"Una feroz libélula verde brillante, que sigue siendo veloz como un rayo a "
"pesar de haber crecido hasta el tamaño de un niño de escuela. Su cabeza es "
"poco más que un par de ojos compuestos del tamaño de un balón de baloncesto,"
" y sus patas - ya especializadas para agarrar presas - terminan en garras "
"curvas."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#: data/mods/Tamable_Wildlife/insect_spider.json
msgid "fused dragonflies"
msgid_plural "fused dragonflies"
msgstr[0] "libélula fusionada"
msgstr[1] "libélulas fusionadas"
msgstr[2] "libélulas fusionadas"

#. ~ Description of monster "fused dragonflies"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"What appears to be a single, enormous insect with a swollen abdomen is "
"actually the unholy union of two dragonflies in the act of mating, bodies "
"still locked into the telltale heart shape.  The remains of their wings and "
"abdomens form an egg sac they sluggishly pull between them, periodically "
"dropping a handful of glistening eggs."
msgstr ""
"Lo que parece un único y enorme insecto con el abdomen hinchado es, en "
"realidad, la impía unión de dos libélulas en el acto de apareamiento, con "
"los cuerpos todavía encerrados en la reveladora forma de corazón. Los restos"
" de sus alas y abdómenes forman un saco de huevos que arrastran lentamente "
"entre ellos, dejando caer periódicamente un puñado de huevos relucientes."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "firefly"
msgid_plural "fireflies"
msgstr[0] "luciernaga"
msgstr[1] "luciernagas"
msgstr[2] "luciernagas"

#. ~ Description of monster "firefly"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A mutated firefly grown to the size of a large housecat, brightly glowing "
"abdomen bobbing up and down as it tries to impress its unseen mate.  It "
"looks strangely uninterested in you and everything else."
msgstr ""
"Una luciérnaga mutada que crece hasta el tamaño de un gato doméstico grande,"
" con un abdomen brillante que se balancea hacia arriba y hacia abajo "
"mientras trata de impresionar a su pareja invisible. Parece extrañamente "
"desinteresada en ti y en todo lo demás."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "fly"
msgid_plural "flies"
msgstr[0] "mosca"
msgstr[1] "moscas"
msgstr[2] "moscas"

#. ~ Description of monster "fly"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A mutant housefly the size of a small dog.  Its buzzing is high-pitched and "
"somehow sad."
msgstr ""
"Una mosca doméstica mutante del tamaño de un perro pequeño. Su zumbido es "
"agudo y de alguna manera triste."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "giant fly"
msgid_plural "giant flies"
msgstr[0] "mosca gigante"
msgstr[1] "moscas gigantes"
msgstr[2] "moscas gigantes"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant fly"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A tremendous housefly the size of a dog, predictably accompanied by a loud, "
"incessant buzzing sound."
msgstr ""
"Es una tremenda mosca común del tamaño de un perro y como era de esperar, la"
" acompaña un zumbido incesante y fuerte."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "frigate fly"
msgid_plural "frigate flies"
msgstr[0] "mosca fragata"
msgstr[1] "moscas fragata"
msgstr[2] "moscas fragata"

#. ~ Description of monster "frigate fly"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A mutant housefly the size of a cow, creating a loud buzzing sound as it "
"inexplicably stays airborne."
msgstr ""
"Una mosca doméstica mutante del tamaño de una vaca, que crea un fuerte "
"zumbido mientras se mantiene inexplicablemente en el aire."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "mosquito"
msgid_plural "mosquitos"
msgstr[0] "mosquito"
msgstr[1] "mosquitos"
msgstr[2] "mosquitos"

#. ~ Description of monster "mosquito"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A mutant mosquito the size of a small dog, buzzing and fluttering "
"erratically."
msgstr ""
"Un mosquito mutante del tamaño de un perro pequeño, zumbando y revoloteando "
"erráticamente."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "giant mosquito"
msgid_plural "giant mosquitos"
msgstr[0] "mosquito gigante"
msgstr[1] "mosquitos gigantes"
msgstr[2] "mosquitos gigantes"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant mosquito"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A giant mutant mosquito the size of a dog, fluttering erratically.  Its face"
" is dominated by a long, spear-tipped proboscis."
msgstr ""
"Un mosquito mutante gigante del tamaño de un perro, revoloteando "
"erráticamente. Su cara está dominada por una larga probóscide con punta de "
"lanza."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "bloodbank mosquito"
msgid_plural "bloodbank mosquitos"
msgstr[0] "mosquito banco de sangre"
msgstr[1] "mosquitos banco de sangre"
msgstr[2] "mosquitos banco de sangre"

#. ~ Description of monster "bloodbank mosquito"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A mutant mosquito the size of a cow, with huge, thin wings and legs.  Its "
"face is dominated by a long, spear-tipped proboscis."
msgstr ""
"Un mosquito mutante del tamaño de una vaca, con alas y patas enormes y "
"delgadas. Su cara está dominada por una larga probóscide con punta de lanza."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "cellar spider"
msgid_plural "cellar spiders"
msgstr[0] "araña de patas largas"
msgstr[1] "arañas de patas largas"
msgstr[2] "arañas de patas largas"

#. ~ Description of monster "cellar spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A cellar spider - also known as \"daddy long-legs\" - grown to distressing "
"size.  Its body is about the size of your head, with the long, spindly legs "
"raising it up to your knee.  It tries getting away from you with an "
"unnervingly fluid run."
msgstr ""
"Una araña de patas largas, conocida como \"papa piernas largas\", pero de un"
" tamaño preocupante. Su cuerpo es del tamaño de tu cabeza con las patas "
"larguiruchas más altas que tus rodillas. Intenta escaparse corriendo de "
"forma desconcertantemente fluida."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "giant cellar spider"
msgid_plural "giant cellar spiders"
msgstr[0] "araña de patas largas gigante"
msgstr[1] "arañas de patas largas gigantes"
msgstr[2] "arañas de patas largas gigantes"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant cellar spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A huge brown spider in constant movement, with a small body the size of a "
"child held up at chest level by a set of spindly legs that branch into "
"three-pronged graspers at the end.  Unlike the smaller variant it obviously "
"decided hunting you is worth a try, and follows you with mandibles "
"chittering in anticipation."
msgstr ""
"Una araña reclusa marrón enorme en constante movimiento con un pequeño "
"cuerpo del tamaño de un humano soportado por un grupo de patas larguiruchas "
"que se ramifican en tres pinzas puntiagudas. A diferencia de la variante más"
" pequeña, obviamente decidió que cazarte es una buena opción y te persigue "
"moviendo las mandíbulas con anticipación."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "mommy long-legs"
msgid_plural "mommy long legs"
msgstr[0] "mama piernas largas"
msgstr[1] "mamas piernas largas"
msgstr[2] "mamas piernas largas"

#. ~ Description of monster "mommy long-legs"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"This surprisingly shy giant cellar spider holds a head-sized ball of "
"crawling spiderlings of different ages in its mandibles, carefully balancing"
" on her long legs not to drop the precious cargo.  She seems uninterested in"
" you."
msgstr ""
"Esta sorprendentemente tímida araña gigante de patas largas sostiene en sus "
"mandíbulas una bola de crías de diferentes edades, y se balancea "
"cuidadosamente en sus patas largas para no dejar caer su preciada carga. No "
"parece tener interés en tu persona."

#. ~ Death message of monster "mommy long-legs"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "The spiderlings fall to the ground!"
msgstr "¡Las crías caen al suelo!"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "warehouse spider"
msgid_plural "warehouse spiders"
msgstr[0] "araña de almacén"
msgstr[1] "arañas de almacén"
msgstr[2] "arañas de almacén"

#. ~ Description of monster "warehouse spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A tangle of branching chitinous legs operating seemingly independently, "
"somehow still managing to carry a cow-sized central body.  A number of "
"malformed, twitching legs hang from the cephalothorax, but the head -and "
"especially the mandibles- still seem to be in working order."
msgstr ""
"Una maraña de patas quitinosas que operan de manera independiente, "
"aparentemente, y que por alguna razón logran llevar un cuerpo central del "
"tamaño de una vaca. Una cantidad de patas malformadas que se retuercen "
"cuelgan del cefalotórax pero la cabeza -y especialmente las mandíbulas- "
"todavía parecen estar funcionando."

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "warehouse spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "The maimed legs start twitching erratically!"
msgstr "¡Las patas mutiladas comienzan a retorcerse erráticamente!"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "detached spider leg"
msgid_plural "detached spider legs"
msgstr[0] "pata arácnida suelta"
msgstr[1] "patas arácnidas sueltas"
msgstr[2] "patas arácnidas sueltas"

#. ~ Description of monster "detached spider leg"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"The strangely branching leg of a mutated cellar spider that… fell?  crawled?"
"  off of the main body when hurt.  It now flails about blindly, irregular "
"clawed appendages grasping at anything that comes close."
msgstr ""
"Esta extrañamente ramificada pata de una araña de patas largas mutada que… "
"¿se cayó? ¿se arrastró? del cuerpo cuando fue herido. Ahora se agita "
"ciegamente, con apéndices agarrando cualquier cosa que tenga cerca."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "jumping spider"
msgid_plural "jumping spiders"
msgstr[0] "araña saltarina"
msgstr[1] "arañas saltarinas"
msgstr[2] "arañas saltarinas"

#. ~ Description of monster "jumping spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A mutant spider the size of a small dog with long forelegs, big eyes, and "
"oversized fangs."
msgstr ""
"Una araña mutante del tamaño de un perro pequeño con largas patas "
"delanteras, grandes ojos y colmillos de gran tamaño."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "giant jumping spider"
msgid_plural "giant jumping spiders"
msgstr[0] "araña saltarina gigante"
msgstr[1] "arañas saltarinas gigantes"
msgstr[2] "arañas saltarinas gigantes"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant jumping spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A dog-sized mutant spider with big forelegs and two pairs of inquisitive-"
"looking eyes.  It can leap quite quickly, even into the treetops."
msgstr ""
"Una araña mutante del tamaño de un perro con grandes patas delanteras y dos "
"pares de ojos de aspecto inquisitivo. Puede saltar con bastante rapidez, "
"incluso a las copas de los árboles."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "missile spider"
msgid_plural "missile spiders"
msgstr[0] "araña misil"
msgstr[1] "arañas misil"
msgstr[2] "arañas misil"

#. ~ Description of monster "missile spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"An enormous hairy mutated spider the size of a cow, with strong forelegs and"
" a raised, bloated thorax.  Its vast increase in size has caused it to lose "
"much of its mobility, and when near it you can smell rotten eggs for some "
"reason…"
msgstr ""
"Una enorme araña peluda mutada del tamaño de una vaca, con fuertes patas "
"delanteras y un tórax elevado e hinchado. Su enorme aumento de tamaño le ha "
"hecho perder gran parte de su movilidad, y cuando te acercas a ella puedes "
"oler a huevos podridos por alguna razón..."

#. ~ Death message of monster "missile spider"
#. ~ Death message of monster "cleaner bot"
#. ~ Death message of monster "unstable flesh-raptor"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json data/json/monsters/utility_bot.json
#: data/json/monsters/zed-winged.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s explodes!"
msgstr "¡%s explota!"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "trapdoor spider"
msgid_plural "trapdoor spiders"
msgstr[0] "araña trampilla"
msgstr[1] "arañas trampillas"
msgstr[2] "arañas trampillas"

#. ~ Description of monster "trapdoor spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A dark brown mutant spider the size of a dog with a bulbous thorax, big "
"eyes, and oversized fangs."
msgstr ""
"Una araña mutante marrón oscuro del tamaño de un perro con un tórax bulboso,"
" grandes ojos y colmillos de gran tamaño."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "giant trapdoor spider"
msgid_plural "giant trapdoor spiders"
msgstr[0] "araña trampilla gigante"
msgstr[1] "arañas trampillas gigantes"
msgstr[2] "arañas trampillas gigantes"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant trapdoor spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A gigantic dark brown spider with a bulbous thorax.  It digs a deep "
"underground burrow that serves as a pit to trap unwary prey."
msgstr ""
"Una gigantesca araña marrón oscuro con un tórax bulboso. Cava una profunda "
"madriguera subterránea que sirve como foso para atrapar presas incautas."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "deathtrap spider"
msgid_plural "deathtrap spiders"
msgstr[0] "araña trampa mortal"
msgstr[1] "arañas trampa mortal"
msgstr[2] "arañas trampa mortal"

#. ~ Description of monster "deathtrap spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A cow-sized mutant spider with strong, thick legs and a bulbous thorax, dark"
" brown in color.  Anything it pulls into its underground lair is unlikely to"
" see the light of day again."
msgstr ""
"Una araña mutante del tamaño de una vaca, con patas fuertes y gruesas y un "
"tórax bulboso, de color marrón oscuro. Todo lo que arrastra a su guarida "
"subterránea es poco probable que vuelva a ver la luz del día."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "web spinning spider"
msgid_plural "web spinning spiders"
msgstr[0] "araña tejedora"
msgstr[1] "arañas tejedoras"
msgstr[2] "arañas tejedoras"

#. ~ Description of monster "web spinning spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A light gray mutant spider the size of a dog with a long legs, big eyes, and"
" oversized fangs."
msgstr ""
"Una araña mutante gris claro del tamaño de un perro con patas largas, ojos "
"grandes y colmillos de gran tamaño."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "giant web spider"
msgid_plural "giant web spiders"
msgstr[0] "araña gigante"
msgstr[1] "arañas gigantes"
msgstr[2] "arañas gigantes"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant web spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A giant, light gray mutant grass spider, it waits for prey to become "
"ensnared in the vast webs that it weaves between the trees."
msgstr ""
"Una gigantesca araña mutante de la hierba, de color gris claro, espera a que"
" la presa quede atrapada en las vastas redes que teje entre los árboles."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "wyrd spider"
msgid_plural "wyrd spiders"
msgstr[0] "araña destino"
msgstr[1] "arañas destino"
msgstr[2] "arañas destino"

#. ~ Description of monster "wyrd spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A cow-sized mutated grass spider with long spindly legs, light gray in "
"color.  It moves ponderously, depending on its webs to prevent prey from "
"fleeing."
msgstr ""
"Una araña herbívora mutada del tamaño de una vaca, con largas y enjutas "
"patas, de color gris claro. Se mueve pesadamente, dependiendo de sus telas "
"para evitar que las presas huyan."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "immature giant web spider"
msgid_plural "immature giant web spiders"
msgstr[0] "araña gigante inmadura"
msgstr[1] "arañas gigantes inmaduras"
msgstr[2] "arañas gigantes inmaduras"

#. ~ Description of monster "immature giant web spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A juvenile giant grass spider, about the size of a beer bottle.  Too young "
"to be venomous, or to walk proficiently for that matter"
msgstr ""
"Una araña de la hierba gigante joven, del tamaño de una botella de cerveza. "
"Demasiado joven para ser venenosa, o para caminar con destreza."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "black widow spider"
msgid_plural "black widow spiders"
msgstr[0] "araña viuda negra"
msgstr[1] "arañas viuda negra"
msgstr[2] "arañas viuda negra"

#. ~ Description of monster "black widow spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A black mutant spider the size of a small dog with a long legs, big eyes, "
"and oversized fangs.  There is a red hourglass shape on its thorax."
msgstr ""
"Una araña negra mutante del tamaño de un pequeño perro con patas largas, "
"grandes ojos y colmillos de gran tamaño. Tiene una forma de reloj de arena "
"rojo en su tórax."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "giant black widow"
msgid_plural "giant black widows"
msgstr[0] "viuda negra gigante"
msgstr[1] "viudas negras gigantes"
msgstr[2] "viudas negras gigantes"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant black widow"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A dog-sized mutated black widow spider.  There is a red hourglass shape on "
"its thorax.  A highly venomous nightmare come to life."
msgstr ""
"Una araña viuda negra mutada del tamaño de un perro. Tiene una forma de "
"reloj de arena rojo en su tórax. Una pesadilla altamente venenosa cobra "
"vida."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "black death widow"
msgid_plural "black death widows"
msgstr[0] "viuda negra"
msgstr[1] "viudas negras"
msgstr[2] "viudas negras"

#. ~ Description of monster "black death widow"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A cow-sized mutated black widow spider with a distinctive red hourglass "
"shape on its thorax.  Still possesses its infamous venom, but it probably "
"doesn't even need that to crush you like a bug."
msgstr ""
"Una araña viuda negra mutada del tamaño de una vaca con una distintiva forma"
" de reloj de arena rojo en su tórax. Todavía posee su infame veneno, pero "
"probablemente ni siquiera lo necesita para aplastarte como a un insecto."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "giant black widow spiderling"
msgid_plural "giant black widow spiderlings"
msgstr[0] "cría de viuda negra gigante"
msgstr[1] "crías de viuda negra gigante"
msgstr[2] "crías de viuda negra gigante"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant black widow spiderling"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"The horrid spawn of a giant black widow spider.  Even as a newborn, this "
"foul creature knows only how to kill."
msgstr ""
"El retoño hórrido de una araña viuda negra gigante. Incluso así como recién "
"nacida, esta horrible criatura solo sabe matar."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "wolf spider"
msgid_plural "wolf spiders"
msgstr[0] "araña lobo"
msgstr[1] "arañas lobo"
msgstr[2] "arañas lobo"

#. ~ Description of monster "wolf spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A shaggy brown mutant spider the size of a dog with eight long legs, two "
"especially big eyes, and oversized fangs."
msgstr ""
"Una araña mutante marrón peluda del tamaño de un perro con patas largas, dos"
" ojos especialmente grandes y colmillos de gran tamaño."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "giant wolf spider"
msgid_plural "giant wolf spiders"
msgstr[0] "araña-lobo gigante"
msgstr[1] "arañas-lobo gigantes"
msgstr[2] "arañas-lobo gigantes"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant wolf spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A wolf spider mutated to about thirty times its normal size, it moves "
"quickly and aggressively to catch and consume prey."
msgstr ""
"Una araña lobo mutada que creció una treinta veces su tamaño normal. Se "
"mueve rápidamente y de manera agresiva para cazar y consumir a su presa."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "necrowolf spider"
msgid_plural "necrowolf spiders"
msgstr[0] "araña necrolobo"
msgstr[1] "arañas necrolobos"
msgstr[2] "arañas necrolobos"

#. ~ Description of monster "necrowolf spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A cow-sized, hairy mutant wolf spider.  Its mouthparts have noticeably "
"changed, and it moves much more slowly now with the additional weight it "
"needs to carry."
msgstr ""
"Una araña lobo mutante peluda del tamaño de una vaca. Sus piezas bucales han"
" cambiado notablemente, y ahora se mueve mucho más despacio con el peso "
"adicional que necesita llevar."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#: data/mods/Tamable_Wildlife/insect_spider.json
msgid "wasp larva"
msgid_plural "wasp larvae"
msgstr[0] "larva de avispa"
msgstr[1] "larvas de avispa"
msgstr[2] "larvas de avispa"

#. ~ Description of monster "wasp larva"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A dog-sized white grub, featureless apart from a vestigal mouthpart.  It "
"hangs upside-down in its cell, and regurgitates sweet-smelling fluid in "
"return for the scraps of viscera fed to it by the workers below."
msgstr ""
"Una larva blanca del tamaño de un perro, sin más rasgos que un vestigio de "
"boca. Está colgado boca abajo en su celda y regurgita un líquido de olor "
"dulce a cambio de los restos de vísceras que le dan los trabajadores de "
"abajo."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "wasp pupa"
msgid_plural "wasp pupae"
msgstr[0] "pupa de avispa"
msgstr[1] "pupas de avispa"
msgstr[2] "pupas de avispa"

#. ~ Description of monster "wasp pupa"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A wasp larva undergoing metamorphosis into a full-grown giant wasp.  It "
"looks like a strangely immobile adult coated in a thin white membrane, its "
"legs and wings packed tightly into its cell."
msgstr ""
"Una larva de avispa en proceso de metamorfosis a una avispa gigante adulta. "
"Parece un adulto extrañamente inmóvil recubierto de una fina membrana "
"blanca, con las patas y las alas apretadas en su celda."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "wasp"
msgid_plural "wasps"
msgstr[0] "avispa"
msgstr[1] "avispas"
msgstr[2] "avispas"

#. ~ Description of monster "wasp"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A huge wasp the size of a large cat with bright yellow markings on her jet-"
"black carapace and a threatening stinger.  She flies around erratically, "
"searching for smaller prey."
msgstr ""
"Una enorme avispa del tamaño de un gato grande con marcas amarillas "
"brillantes en su caparazón negro azabache y un amenazante aguijón. Vuela "
"erráticamente en busca de presas más pequeñas."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "wasp guard"
msgid_plural "wasp guards"
msgstr[0] "avispa guardiana"
msgstr[1] "avispas guardianas"
msgstr[2] "avispas guardianas"

#. ~ Description of monster "wasp guard"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A mutated wasp worker, buzzing around the nest.  While her foraging sisters "
"are relatively content to leave you be, this one won't hesitate to attack "
"anything she considers a threat to the nest.  Don't linger."
msgstr ""
"Una avispa obrera mutada, zumbando alrededor de su nido. Mientras que sus "
"hermanas, buscadoras de alimento, se contentan con vivir y dejar vivir, ésta"
" no dudará en atacar cualquier cosa que considere una amenaza para el nido. "
"No te detengas."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "wasp queen"
msgid_plural "wasp queens"
msgstr[0] "avispa reina"
msgstr[1] "avispas reina"
msgstr[2] "avispas reina"

#. ~ Description of monster "wasp queen"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A mutated wasp queen grown to the size of a person, laying a single white "
"egg in each empty cell she comes across while scurrying around on the paper "
"walls of her home.  She struggles to fit into some of them, but the newer "
"cells seem to be getting larger…"
msgstr ""
"Una reina avispa mutada que ha crecido hasta alcanzar el tamaño de una "
"persona, pone un solo huevo blanco en cada celda vacía que encuentra "
"mientras corretea por los muros de papel de su hogar. Le cuesta encajar en "
"algunos de ellos, pero las nuevas celdas parecen ser cada vez más grandes..."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "giant wasp"
msgid_plural "giant wasps"
msgstr[0] "avispa gigante"
msgstr[1] "avispas gigantes"
msgstr[2] "avispas gigantes"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant wasp"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A gigantic wasp worker, scouring the landscape for an easy meal to feed the "
"next generation.  Her abdomen glowers with ominous yellow stripes and ends "
"in a half-hidden stinger the size of a kitchen knife."
msgstr ""
"Una gigantesca avispa obrera, recorriendo el paisaje en busca de una comida "
"fácil para alimentar a la próxima generación. Su abdomen brilla con ominosas"
" rayas amarillas y termina con un aguijón semioculto del tamaño de un "
"cuchillo de cocina."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "giant wasp guard"
msgid_plural "giant wasp guards"
msgstr[0] "avispa guardiana gigante"
msgstr[1] "avispas guardianas gigantes"
msgstr[2] "avispas guardianas gigantes"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant wasp guard"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A wasp worker grown to the size of a person, buzzing around her home.  While"
" her foraging sisters are relatively content to live and let live, this one "
"won't hesitate to attack anything she considers a threat to the nest.  Don't"
" linger."
msgstr ""
"Una avispa obrera del tamaño de una persona, zumbando alrededor de su casa. "
"Mientras que sus hermanas, buscadoras de alimento, se contentan con vivir y "
"dejar vivir, ésta no dudará en atacar cualquier cosa que considere una "
"amenaza para el nido. No te detengas."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "giant wasp queen"
msgid_plural "giant wasp queens"
msgstr[0] "avispa reina gigante"
msgstr[1] "avispas reina gigante"
msgstr[2] "avispas reina gigante"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant wasp queen"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A yellowjacket queen grown to the size of a horse, towering over her "
"daughters.  Even with her abdomen swollen with eggs and wings long unused "
"she still poses a threat to interlopers, should her children have failed at "
"subduing them."
msgstr ""
"Una reina de chaqueta amarilla crecida hasta el tamaño de un caballo, se "
"eleva sobre sus hijas. Incluso con su abdomen hinchado de huevos y las alas "
"sin usar sigue siendo una amenaza para los entrometidos, en caso de que sus "
"hijos hayan fracasado en someterlos."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#: data/mods/Tamable_Wildlife/insect_spider.json
msgid "dermatik larva"
msgid_plural "dermatik larvae"
msgstr[0] "larva dermática"
msgstr[1] "larvas dermáticas"
msgstr[2] "larvas dermáticas"

#. ~ Description of monster "dermatik larva"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A fat white grub as big as a squirrel, with a pair of large, spadelike "
"mandibles."
msgstr ""
"Una larva blanca y gorda, grande como una ardilla, con un par de mandíbulas "
"largas, con forma de palas."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "dermatik"
msgid_plural "dermatiks"
msgstr[0] "dermatik"
msgstr[1] "dermatiks"
msgstr[2] "dermatiks"

#. ~ Description of monster "dermatik"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A colorful parasitoid wasp grown to the size of a dog, with a huge "
"ovipositor extruding from her abdomen.  She darts around in search of a "
"suitable home for her many, many children."
msgstr ""
"Una colorida avispa parasitoide del tamaño de un perro, con un enorme "
"ovipositor que sale de su abdomen. Se lanza en busca de un hogar adecuado "
"para sus muchos, muchos hijos."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "dermatik midwife"
msgid_plural "dermatik midwives"
msgstr[0] "matrona dermatik"
msgstr[1] "matronas dermatik"
msgstr[2] "matronas dermatik"

#. ~ Description of monster "dermatik midwife"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A dermatik grown even larger, her wings and ovipositor chewed off by her "
"sisters.  She now stands watch in the nest, tending to the unfortunate hosts"
" dragged home and ensuring they don't perish before their purpose is "
"fulfilled."
msgstr ""
"Una dermatik crecida aún más, con sus alas y su ovipositor masticados por "
"sus hermanas. Ahora vigila en el nido, atendiendo a los desafortunados "
"huéspedes arrastrados a casa y asegurándose de que no perezcan antes de "
"cumplir su propósito."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "motionless deer"
msgid_plural "motionless deers"
msgstr[0] "ciervo inmóvil"
msgstr[1] "ciervos inmóviles"
msgstr[2] "ciervos inmóviles"

#. ~ Description of monster "motionless deer"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A paralyzed, emaciated deer.  It spasms as it notices your presence, "
"terrified eyes darting around the muddy chamber when it fails to stand and "
"flee."
msgstr ""
"Un ciervo paralizado y demacrado. Tiene espasmos al notar tu presencia, sus "
"ojos aterrorizados recorren la cámara de barro cuando no logra ponerse de "
"pie y huir."

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "motionless deer"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "The sudden motion of their host cause some dermatik larvae to flee!"
msgstr ""
"¡El movimiento repentino de su huésped hace que algunas larvas de dermatik "
"huyan!"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "helpless dog"
msgid_plural "helpless dogs"
msgstr[0] "perro desvalido"
msgstr[1] "perros desvalidos"
msgstr[2] "perros desvalidos"

#. ~ Description of monster "helpless dog"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A barely living dog, panting in a pool of slime and blood.  As you draw near"
" it lets out a faint whimper, and you see the smallest hint of a twitch in "
"its tail."
msgstr ""
"Un perro apenas vivo, jadeando en un charco de baba y sangre. Cuando te "
"acercas, suelta un leve gemido y ves un mínimo movimiento de su cola."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "twitching spider"
msgid_plural "twitching spiders"
msgstr[0] "araña temblorosa"
msgstr[1] "arañas temblorosas"
msgstr[2] "arañas temblorosas"

#. ~ Description of monster "twitching spider"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A giant, mutated spider lying on its back, legs twitching without pause.  A "
"translucent slime, mixed with its ichor seeps from its joints, and its "
"chitin is marked by numerous exit wounds."
msgstr ""
"Una araña gigante y mutada que yace sobre su espalda, con las patas "
"moviéndose sin pausa. Una baba translúcida, mezclada con su icor, se filtra "
"de sus articulaciones, y su quitina está marcada por numerosas heridas de "
"salida."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "ant"
msgid_plural "ants"
msgstr[0] "hormiga"
msgstr[1] "hormigas"
msgstr[2] "hormigas"

#. ~ Description of monster "ant"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A mutant red ant the size of a dog, covered in chitinous plates.  She "
"possesses a pair of wriggling antennae and vicious-looking mandibles."
msgstr ""
"Una hormiga roja mutante del tamaño de un perro cubierto de placas "
"quitinosas. Posee un par de antenas que se retuercen y unas mandíbulas de "
"aspecto feroz."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#: data/mods/Tamable_Wildlife/insect_spider.json
msgid "giant ant"
msgid_plural "giant ants"
msgstr[0] "hormiga gigante"
msgstr[1] "hormigas gigantes"
msgstr[2] "hormigas gigantes"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant ant"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"An enormous red ant covered in chitinous plates.  She possesses a pair of "
"wriggling antennae and vicious-looking mandibles."
msgstr ""
"Una enorme hormiga roja cubierta de placas de quitina. Posee un par de "
"antenas bamboleantes y mandíbulas de apariencia feroz."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid "acidic ant"
msgid_plural "acidic ants"
msgstr[0] "hormíga ácida"
msgstr[1] "hormígas ácidas"
msgstr[2] "hormígas ácidas"

#. ~ Description of monster "acidic ant"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A dog-sized mutant brown ant with a swollen abdomen that ends with a small "
"orifice at the tip.  Glistening liquid drips out periodically."
msgstr ""
"Una hormiga mutante marrón del tamaño de un perro con un abdomen hinchado, "
"que termina con un pequeño orificio en la punta del cual gotea un líquido "
"brillante periódicamente."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
#: data/mods/Tamable_Wildlife/insect_spider.json
msgid "giant acidic ant"
msgid_plural "giant acidic ants"
msgstr[0] "hormiga ácida gigante"
msgstr[1] "hormigas ácidas gigantes"
msgstr[2] "hormigas ácidas gigantes"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant acidic ant"
#: data/json/monsters/insect_spider.json
msgid ""
"A monstrous brown ant with a swollen abdomen that ends with a small orifice "
"at the tip.  Glistening liquid seems to drip out periodically."
msgstr ""
"Una hormiga marrón monstruosa con un abdomen hinchado, que termina con un "
"pequeño orificio en la punta del cual gotea un líquido brillante "
"periódicamente."

