msgstr "el drone escanea tus credenciales de identificación (ID)"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/lab_security_drones.json
msgid "GM security drone"
msgid_plural "GM security drones"
msgstr[0] "dron de seguridad MV (Mantenimiento Verde)"
msgstr[1] "drones de seguridad MV (Mantenimiento Verde)"
msgstr[2] "drones de seguridad MV (Mantenimiento Verde)"

#. ~ Description of monster "GM security drone"
#. ~ Description of monster "OM security drone"
#. ~ Description of monster "BM security drone"
#. ~ Description of monster "LGR security drone"
#. ~ Description of monster "BS security drone"
#: data/json/monsters/lab_security_drones.json
msgid ""
"A small quadcopter drone, it has a camera and speaker visible.  It patrols "
"the surrounding area in a regular manner, continuously scanning individuals "
"it encounters even if there is hardly anything left of them."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño dron cuadricóptero, con cámara y altavoz visibles. Patrulla los "
"alrededores de forma regular, escaneando continuamente a los individuos que "
"encuentra aunque apenas quede nada de ellos."

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "GM security drone"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "OM security drone"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "BM security drone"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "LGR security drone"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "BS security drone"
#: data/json/monsters/lab_security_drones.json
msgid "Remain still.  Scanning for authorization."
msgstr "Quédese quieto. Escaneando autorización."

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/json/monsters/lab_security_drones.json
