msgid_plural "dachshunds"
msgstr[0] "dachshund"
msgstr[1] "dachshunds"
msgstr[2] "dachshunds"

#. ~ Description of monster "dachshund"
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"A wiener dog!  This awkward looking dog can be a useful watchdog, plus it "
"looks adorable as it bumbles around.  Needless to say, it doesn't make a "
"good attack dog."
msgstr ""
"Un perro salchicha. Este perro de aspecto torpe puede ser un útil perro "
"guardián, además de tener un aspecto adorable cuando va dando tumbos. No "
"hace falta decir que no es un buen perro de ataque."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid "dachshund puppy"
msgid_plural "dachshund puppies"
msgstr[0] "cachorro de dachshund"
msgstr[1] "cachorros de dachshund"
msgstr[2] "cachorros de dachshund"

#. ~ Description of monster "dachshund puppy"
