msgstr "Vamos a negociar entonces."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CITY_COP.json data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_HEALER_GREY.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_OLD_MAGUS.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_TECHNO_KID.json
msgid "I'm sorry, I gotta go."
msgstr "Lo siento, me tengo que ir."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CITY_COP.json
msgid ""
"This is a nice, secure building.  I'd be a fool to leave.  Been living off "
"the vending machines, but I found the code for the evidence lockup so I've "
"been doing some trading with other survivors."
msgstr ""
"Este es un edificio bonito y seguro. Sería un tonto si me fuera. He estado "
"viviendo de las máquinas expendedoras, pero encontré el código de la sala de"
" evidencias, así que he estado haciendo algunos intercambios con otros "
"supervivientes."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CITY_COP.json
msgid "What kind of stuff was in the evidence lockup?"
msgstr "¿Qué clase de cosas había en el depósito de pruebas?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CITY_COP.json
msgid "You've seen other survivors?"
msgstr "¿Has visto a otros supervivientes?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CITY_COP.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_HEALER_GREY.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_OLD_MAGUS.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_TECHNO_KID.json
msgid "What can you sell me?"
msgstr "¿Qué me puedes vender?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CITY_COP.json
msgid ""
"Knives… drugs… um… drugs and shiny things.  Thieves steal all sorts of "
"stuff."
msgstr ""
"Cuchillos... drogas... um... drogas y cosas brillantes. Los ladrones roban "
"todo tipo de cosas."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CITY_COP.json
msgid "Well, let me check out some of that stuff."
msgstr "Bueno, déjame ver algunas de esas cosas."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CITY_COP.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, there are some like me that have holed up around town.  We do some "
"trading… and then sometimes a stranger wanders through thinking they'll find"
" something better here than they left behind."
msgstr ""
"Sí, hay algunos como yo que se han refugiado en la ciudad. Hacemos algo de "
"comercio... y a veces un extraño pasa por aquí pensando que encontrará algo "
"mejor que lo que dejó atrás."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
msgid "Hey again.  *kzzz*"
msgstr "Hola otra vez. *kzzz*"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid ""
"I… I'm free.  *Zzzt* I'm actually free!  *bzzz* Look, you're the first "
"person I've seen in a long time."
msgstr ""
"Yo... estoy libre. *Zzzt* ¡Realmente estoy libre! *bzzz* Mira, eres la "
"primera persona que veo en mucho tiempo."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyropod_classes.json
msgid "Hey.  Let's chat for a second."
msgstr "Oye. Vamos a charlar un segundo."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid "That's because I saved you.  Listen, I could use your help…"
msgstr "Eso es porque te salvé. Escucha, me vendría bien tu ayuda..."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid ""
"Big fucking deal.  Do what I say or I'll shove that chip back where it "
"belongs."
msgstr ""
"Gran puto asunto. Haz lo que digo o te meteré ese chip de vuelta a donde "
"pertenece."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid "Sorry, I'm nobody.  Enjoy your freedom, I guess."
msgstr "Lo siento, no soy nadie. Disfruta de tu libertad, supongo."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid "*buzz* Great!  So what happens now?"
msgstr "*zumbido* ¡Genial! ¿Y qué pasa ahora?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyropod_classes.json
msgid "Come with me.  We can help each other out."
msgstr "Ven conmigo. Podemos ayudarnos mutuamente."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyropod_classes.json
msgid "We both go our separate ways.  Enjoy your freedom."
msgstr "Los dos vamos por caminos separados. Disfruta de tu libertad."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid ""
"…Wait.  *BEEP* Why do I believe you?  *ZZZT* You could be just as bad as "
"them!"
msgstr ""
"...Espera. *BEEP* ¿Por qué te creo? *ZZZT* ¡Podrías ser tan malo como ellos!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid ""
"I wouldn't have pulled your chip out if I didn't want you to think for "
"yourself."
msgstr "No te habría sacado el chip si no quisiera que pensaras por ti mismo."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
msgid ""
"For all you know, I did.  I'm being nice for now.  You'd better hope that it"
" lasts."
msgstr ""
"Por lo que sabes, lo pude ser. Estoy siendo amable por ahora. Será mejor que"
" esperes que dure."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyropod_classes.json
msgid "Forget it.  Enjoy your freedom."
msgstr "Olvídalo. Disfruta de tu libertad."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid ""
"Okay, okay, *BUZZ* I'm sorry!  Don't hurt me again!  Anything but the chip!"
msgstr ""
"Vale, vale, *ZUMBIDO* ¡Lo siento! ¡No me hagas daño otra vez! ¡Cualquier "
"cosa menos el chip!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyropod_classes.json
msgid "Follow me and do my bidding, then."
msgstr "Sígueme y haz lo que te diga, entonces."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyropod_classes.json
msgid "Get out of my sight."
msgstr "Fuera de mi vista."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyropod_classes.json
msgid "No, *I'm* sorry, I didn't mean that.  Go do what you want."
msgstr "No, lo siento, no quise decir eso. Ve a hacer lo que quieras."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid "…kill… *ZTZTZT* …you!"
msgstr "…matar… *ZTZTZT* …te!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyropod_classes.json
msgid "Run while you still can!"
msgstr "¡Corre mientras puedas!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyropod_classes.json
msgid "Not if I kill you first!"
msgstr "¡No si te mato primero!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyropod_classes.json
msgid "I'm sorry!  I shouldn't have said that!"
msgstr "Lo siento. ¡No debería haber dicho eso!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid "Yeah, *beeeeep* I don't think so.  Bye."
msgstr "Sí, *beeeeep* no lo creo. Adiós."

