msgstr "Era una causa perdida de todas formas..."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Retrieve Deposit Box"
msgstr "Recuperar Caja de Depósito"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Deposit Box"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Now I don't mean to upset you but I'm not sure what I can do with the "
"accounting ledger at the moment.  We do have a new lead though, the ledger "
"has a safe deposit box under the regional manager's name.  Guess what, dumb "
"sucker wrote down his combination.  Come with me to retrieve the box and you"
" can keep any of the goodies in it that I can't use to press charges against"
" these bastards."
msgstr ""
"Ahora yo no quiero molestarte pero no estoy seguro de qué  hacer con el "
"libro de contabilidad en este momento. Aunque tenemos una nueva pista , el "
"libro tiene una caja de seguridad a nombre del gerente regional. Adivina "
"qué, el idiota escribió su combinación en él. Acompañame a recuperar la caja"
" y te podrás quedar con cualquier tesoro que no pueda usar para presentar "
"cargos contra estos bastardos."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Deposit Box"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "You may make a tidy profit from this."
msgstr "Tu puedes obtener un beneficio considerable de esto."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Deposit Box"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I know it isn't pressing but the world is going to be just as corrupt when "
"we start rebuilding unless we take measure to stop those who seek to rule "
"over us."
msgstr ""
"Ya sé que no es urgente pero el mundo va a ser igual de corrupto cuando "
"empecemos a reconstruirlo si no tomamos medidas para frenar a esos que "
"buscan gobernarnos."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Deposit Box"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "This shouldn't be hard unless we run into a horde."
msgstr ""
"Esto no debería ser muy difícil, salvo que nos encontremos con una horda."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Deposit Box"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Great, anything I can't use to prosecute the bastards is yours, as promised."
msgstr ""
"Genial, todo lo que no pueda usar para enjuiciar al bastardo es tuyo, como "
"prometí."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Retrieve Software"
msgstr "Recuperar Software"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Software"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Oh man, I can't believe I forgot to download it…"
msgstr "Oh tío, no puedo creer que me haya olvidado de descargarlo..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Software"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "There's some important software on my computer that I need on USB."
msgstr "Hay software importante en mi ordenador que necesito en un USB."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Software"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Thanks!  Just pull the data onto this USB drive and bring it to me."
msgstr ""
"¡Gracias! Sólo tienes que descargar los datos en esta unidad USB y "
"traérmelo."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Software"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Stick"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Seriously?  It's an easy job…"
msgstr "¿En serio? Es un trabajo fácil..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Software"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Take this USB drive.  Use the console, and download the software."
msgstr "Toma esta unidad USB. Usa la consola, y descarga el software."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Software"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "So, do you have my software yet?"
msgstr "¿Ya tienes mi software?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Software"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Stick"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Excellent, thank you!"
msgstr "¡Excelente, gracias!"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Software"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Stick"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Wow, you failed?  All that work, down the drain…"
msgstr "Vaya, ¿has fallado? Todo ese trabajo, por el desagüe..."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
msgid "Analyze Zombie Blood"
msgstr "Analizar Sangre de Zombi"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Analyze Zombie Blood"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
msgid "It could be very informative to perform an analysis of zombie blood…"
msgstr ""
"Podría ser muy informativo realizar un análisis de la sangre de los "
"zombis..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Analyze Zombie Blood"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I need someone to get a sample of zombie blood, take it to a hospital, and "
"perform a centrifuge analysis of it."
msgstr ""
"Necesito que alguien consiga una muestra de sangre de zombi, la lleve al "
"hospital, y realice un análisis de centrifugado con ella."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Analyze Zombie Blood"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Excellent.  Take this blood draw kit; once you've produced a zombie corpse, "
"use it to extract blood from the body, then take it to a hospital for "
"analysis."
msgstr ""
"Excelente. Toma este kit de extracción de sangre; una vez que hayas creado "
"un cadáver de zombi, úsalo para extraer sangre del cuerpo, y luego llévalo a"
" un hospital para su análisis."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Analyze Zombie Blood"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
msgid ""
"Are you sure?  The scientific value of that blood data could be priceless…"
msgstr ""
"¿Estás seguro? El valor científico de esos datos de sangre podría ser "
"inestimable..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Analyze Zombie Blood"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
msgid ""
"The centrifuge is a bit technical; you might want to study up on the usage "
"of computers before completing that part."
msgstr ""
"El centrifugado es un poco técnico; tal vez quieras estudiar el uso de "
"ordenadores antes de completar esa parte."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Analyze Zombie Blood"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
msgid "Well, do you have the data yet?"
msgstr "Bien. ¿Tienes el dato ya?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Analyze Zombie Blood"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Analyze Alien Fungus"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
#: data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Excellent!  This may be the key to removing the infection."
msgstr "¡Excelente! Esto puede ser la clave para quitar la infección."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Analyze Zombie Blood"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
msgid "Wait, you couldn't possibly have the data!  Liar!"
msgstr "¡Esperá, no puede ser que tengas la información! ¡Mentiroso!"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Analyze Zombie Blood"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
msgid "What a shame, that data could have proved invaluable…"
msgstr "Qué lástima, esos datos podrían haber sido muy valiosos..."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Investigate Cult"
msgstr "Investigar Culto"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Investigate Cult"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"You have no idea how interesting this diary is.  I have two very promising "
"leads… first things first, the Catholic Church has been performing its own "
"investigations into global cult phenomenon and it appears to have become "
"very interested in a local cult as of recently.  Could you investigate a "
"location for me?  I'm not sure what was going on here but the priest seemed "
"fairly worried about it."
msgstr ""
"No tienes ni idea de lo interesante que es este diario. Tengo dos pistas muy"
" prometedoras... primero, la Iglesia Católica ha estado realizando sus "
"propias investigaciones sobre el fenómeno de los cultos globales y parece "
"que se ha interesado mucho en un culto local desde hace poco. ¿Podrías "
"investigar una localización para mí? No estoy seguro de lo que estaba "
"pasando aquí, pero el sacerdote parecía bastante preocupado por ello."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Investigate Cult"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I wish you the best of luck, may whatever god you please guide your path… "
"You may need it this time more than the past excursions you have gone on.  "
"There is a note about potential human sacrifice in the days immediately "
"before and after the outbreak.  The name of the cult is believed to be the "
"Church of Starry Wisdom but it is noted that accounts differ."
msgstr ""
"Te deseo la mejor de las suertes, que cualquier dios que te agrade te guíe "
"por el camino... Puede que esta vez la necesites más que en las anteriores "
"excursiones que has hecho. Hay una nota sobre el potencial de sacrificio "
"humano en los días inmediatamente anteriores y posteriores al brote. Se cree"
" que el nombre del culto es la Iglesia de la Sabiduría Estelar, pero se ha "
"anotado que los relatos difieren."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Investigate Cult"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I doubt the site is still occupied but I'd carry a firearm at least… I'm not"
" sure what you might be looking for but I'm positive you'll find something "
"out of the ordinary if you look long enough."
msgstr ""
"Dudo que el sitio esté todavía ocupado pero yo llevaría un arma de fuego al "
"menos... No estoy seguro de lo que podrías estar buscando pero estoy seguro "
"de que encontrarás algo fuera de lo común si buscas lo suficiente."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Investigate Cult"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I'm positive there is something there… there has to be, any luck?"
msgstr ""
"Estoy seguro de que hay algo ahí... tiene que haberlo, ¿ha habido suerte?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Investigate Cult"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Thank you, your account of these… demonic creations proves the fears the "
"churches had were well founded.  Our priority should be routing out any "
"survivors of this cult… I don't known if they are responsible for the "
"outbreak but they certainly know more about it than I do."
msgstr ""
"Gracias, tu relato de estas... creaciones demoníacas prueba que los temores "
"que tenían las iglesias estaban bien fundados. Nuestra prioridad debe ser "
"eliminar a los supervivientes de esta secta... No sé si son responsables del"
" brote, pero ciertamente saben más sobre ello que yo."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Prison Visionary"
msgstr "Preso Visionario"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prison Visionary"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I have another task if you are feeling up to it.  There is a prisoner that "
"the priest made special mention of.  I was wondering if you could see what "
"may have happened to him or if he left anything in his cell.  The priest "
"admits the individual is rather unstable, to put it lightly, but the priest "
"personally believed the man was some kind of repentant visionary.  I'm not "
"in a position to cast out the account just yet… it seems the man has "
"prophesied events accurately before concerning the Church of Starry Wisdom."
msgstr ""
"Tengo otra tarea si te sientes con ganas. Hay un prisionero del que el "
"sacerdote hizo mención especial. Me preguntaba si podría ver lo que le ha "
"pasado o si ha dejado algo en su celda. El sacerdote admite que el individuo"
" es bastante inestable, para decirlo a la ligera, pero el sacerdote "
"personalmente creía que el hombre era una especie de visionario arrepentido."
" Parece que el hombre ha profetizado con precisión los eventos de la Iglesia"
" de la Sabiduría Estelar."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prison Visionary"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I wish you the best of luck, may whatever god you please guide your path… I "
"can only imagine that the prison will be a little slice of hell.  I'm not "
"sure what they would have decided to do with the inmates when they knew "
"death was almost certain."
msgstr ""
"Te deseo la mejor de las suertes, que el dios que te agrade guíe tu "
"camino... Sólo puedo imaginar que la prisión será un pequeño trozo del "
"infierno. No estoy seguro de lo que ellos habrán decidido hacer con los "
"reclusos cuando supieron que la muerte era casi segura. "

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prison Visionary"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"The worst case scenario will probably be that the prisoners have escaped "
"their cells and turned the building into their own little fortress.  Best "
"case, the building went into lock-down and secured the prisoners in their "
"cells.  Either way, navigating the building will pose its own difficulties."
msgstr ""
"En el peor de los casos, los prisioneros se escaparon de sus celdas y "
"convirtieron el edificio en su propia fortaleza. En el mejor de los casos, "
"el edificio fue cerrado completamente y los prisioneros quedaron en sus "
"celdas. De cualquier manera, investigar el edificio va a tener sus "
"dificultades."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prison Visionary"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Thank you, I'm not sure what to make of this but I'll ponder your account."
msgstr ""
"Gracias, no estoy seguro de qué hacer con esto pero voy a reflexionar sobre "
"tu informe."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Deputy Badge"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Well damn, you must be the guys here to pick me up…"
msgstr ""
"Bueno, maldita sea, ustedes deben ser los que están aquí para recogerme..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Deputy Badge"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I got the brief so I know what I'm getting into.  Let me be upfront, treat "
"me like shit and I'm going to cover my own hide.  However, you treat me well"
" and give me something to believe in, even if it's just a shiny bit of "
"metal, and I'll do you right.  Without a strong band a man doesn't stand a "
"chance in this world.  You ready to take charge boss?  This world could use "
"a Sheriff just about now."
msgstr ""
"Tengo el informe, así que sé en qué me estoy metiendo. Déjame ser franco, "
"tratame como a una mierda y solo me preocupare de mi propio pellejo. Sin "
"embargo, si me tratas bien y me das algo en lo que creer, incluso si es sólo"
" un brillante trozo de metal, te lo compensaré con creces. Sin una grupo "
"fuerte, un hombre no tiene ninguna oportunidad en este mundo. ¿Estás listo "
"para tomar el mando, jefe? A este mundo le vendría bien un sheriff ahora "
"mismo."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Deputy Badge"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Before we get into a major fight just make sure we have the gear we need, "
"boss."
msgstr ""
"Antes de entrar en una pelea importante, asegúrate de que tenemos el equipo "
"necesario jefe."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Deputy Badge"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I don't think you're going to find many other survivors who haven't taken up"
" a faction yet."
msgstr ""
"No creo que vayas a encontrar otros supervivientes que ya no hayan elegido "
"un bando."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Deputy Badge"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I'm a pretty good shot with a rifle or pistol."
msgstr "Soy muy buen tirador con un rifle o pistola."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Deputy Badge"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Any problems boss?"
msgstr "¿Algún problema, jefe?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Deputy Badge"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Wait… are you really making me a deputy?"
msgstr "Espera... ¿realmente me estás haciendo un ayudante?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Deputy Badge"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Recruit Tracker"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I don't think so…"
msgstr "Creo que no ..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Deputy Badge"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill 100 Zombies"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Horde Master"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Recruit Tracker"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Quitting already?"
msgstr "¿Dejar de fumar ya?"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Kill 100 Zombies"
msgstr "Matar 100 Zombis"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill 100 Zombies"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Recruit Tracker"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "You seem to know this new world better than most…"
msgstr "Pareces conocer este nuevo mundo mejor que la mayoría..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill 100 Zombies"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"You're kitted out better than most… would you be interested in making this "
"world a little better for the rest of us?  The towns have enough supplies "
"for us survivors to start securing a foothold but we don't have anyone with "
"the skills and equipment to thin the masses of undead.  I'll lend you a hand"
" to the best of my ability but you really showed promise taking out that "
"other beast.  You, I, and a 100 zombies laid to rest, what do you say?"
msgstr ""
"Estás mejor equipado que la mayoría... ¿te interesaría hacer este mundo un "
"poco mejor para el resto? Los pueblos tienen suficientes suministros para "
"que los supervivientes podamos empezar a asegurar un punto de apoyo, pero no"
" tenemos a nadie con las habilidades y el equipo para reducir las masas de "
"no-muertos. Te echaré una mano lo mejor que pueda, pero realmente has "
"demostrado ser prometedor eliminando a esa otra bestia. Tú, yo y 100 zombis "
"esperando descansar, ¿qué dices?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill 100 Zombies"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Hell ya, we may get ourselves killed but we'll be among the first legends of"
" the apocalypse."
msgstr ""
"Demonios si, puede que nos matemos pero estaremos entre las primeras "
"leyendas del apocalipsis."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill 100 Zombies"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Recruit Tracker"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Hey, I know I wouldn't volunteer for it either… but then I remember that "
"most of us survivors won't make it unless someone decides to take the "
"initiative."
msgstr ""
"Eh, sé que yo tampoco me ofrecería como voluntario... ...pero recuerdo que "
"la mayoría de los supervivientes no lo lograremos a menos que alguien decida"
" tomar la iniciativa."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill 100 Zombies"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I'd secure an ammo cache and try to sweep a town in multiple passes."
msgstr ""
"Yo aseguraría un alijo de municiones y trataría de barrer un pueblo en "
"múltiples pasadas."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill 100 Zombies"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Horde Master"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Got this knocked out?"
msgstr "¿Ya noqueaste a este?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill 100 Zombies"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Man… you're a goddamn machine.  It was a pleasure working with you.  You "
"know, you may just change our little neck of the world if you keep this up."
msgstr ""
"Tío... eres una maldita máquina. Ha sido un placer trabajar contigo. Sabes, "
"tu podrías cambiar nuestro pequeño rincón del mundo si sigues así."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill 100 Zombies"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I don't think that was quite a hundred dead zeds."
msgstr "No me parece que eso eran cien zetas muertos."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Kill Horde Master"
msgstr "Matar Líder de Horda"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Horde Master"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I've heard some bad rumors so I hope you are up for another challenge…"
msgstr ""
"He oído algunos malos rumores así que espero que estes preparado para otro "
"reto..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Horde Master"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Apparently one of the other survivors picked up on an unusually dense horde "
"of undead moving into the area.  At the center of this throng there was a "
"'leader' of some sort.  The short of it is, kill the son of a bitch.  We "
"don't know what it is capable of or why it is surrounded by other zombies "
"but this thing reeks of trouble.  Do whatever it takes but we can't risk it "
"getting away."
msgstr ""
"Aparentemente uno de los otros supervivientes se topó con una inusualmente "
"densa horda de no-muertos moviéndose en el área. En el centro de esta "
"multitud había un \"líder\" de algún tipo. En resumen, mata al hijo de puta."
" No sabemos de qué es capaz o por qué está rodeado de otros zombis, pero "
"esta cosa apesta a problemas. Haz lo que sea necesario pero no podemos "
"arriesgarnos a que se escape."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Horde Master"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I'll lend you a hand but I'd try and recruit another gunslinger if you can."
msgstr ""
"Te echaré una mano pero yo intentaría reclutar a otro pistolero si puedes."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Horde Master"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "What's the use of walking away, they'll track you down eventually."
msgstr "De qué sirve escaparse, eventualmente te van a rastrear."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Horde Master"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Don't risk torching the building it may be hiding in if it has a basement.  "
"The sucker may still be alive under the rubble and ash."
msgstr ""
"No te arriesgues a incendiar el edificio en el que se esconde si tiene un "
"sótano. El mamón puede estar vivo bajo los escombros y las cenizas."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Horde Master"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "May that bastard never get up again."
msgstr "Que este bastardo nunca se vuelva a levantar de nuevo."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Horde Master"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I don't think we got it yet."
msgstr "No creo que lo hayamos conseguido todavía."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Kill Jabberwock"
msgstr "Matar Jabberwock"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Jabberwock"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"The eater of the dead… something was ripping zombies to shreds and only "
"leaving a few scattered limbs…"
msgstr ""
"El comedor de los muertos... algo estaba haciendo trizas a los zombis y sólo"
" dejaba unos pocos miembros dispersos..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Jabberwock"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"A few days ago another survivor and I were trying to avoid the cities by "
"staying in the woods during the day and foraging for gear at night.  It "
"worked well against the normal zed's but one night something caught onto our"
" trail and chased us for ten minutes or so until we decided to split up and "
"meet-up back here.  My buddy never showed up and I don't have the means to "
"kill whatever it was.  Can you lend a hand?"
msgstr ""
"Hace unos días, otro superviviente y yo intentábamos evitar las ciudades "
"quedándonos en el bosque durante el día y buscando equipo por la noche. "
"Funcionó bien en contra de los zed normales, pero una noche algo nos siguió "
"el rastro y nos persiguió durante diez minutos más o menos hasta que "
"decidimos separarnos y reunirnos aquí. Mi amigo nunca apareció y no tengo "
"los medios para matar lo que sea que haya sido. ¿Podrías echarme una mano?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Jabberwock"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Thanks, make sure you're ready for whatever the beast is."
msgstr "Gracias, preparate para lo que sea que es esa bestia."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Jabberwock"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Hey, I know I wouldn't volunteer for it either."
msgstr "Eh, sé que yo tampoco me ofrecería como voluntario."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Jabberwock"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I'd carry a shotgun at least, it sounded pretty big."
msgstr "Llevaría al menos una escopeta, sonaba bastante grande."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Jabberwock"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"You look a little shaken up, I can't tell you how glad I am that you killed "
"it though."
msgstr ""
"Te veo un poco agitado... no te puedo decir cuánto me alegra que lo hayas "
"matado."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Jabberwock"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Something in the shadows still seems to stare at me when I look at the "
"woods."
msgstr "Algo en las sombras todavía parece mirarme cuando voy al bosque."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Jabberwock"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I'm glad you came back alive… I wasn't sure if I had sent you to your death."
msgstr ""
"Me alegro de que hayas vuelto con vida... No estaba seguro de si te había "
"enviado a tu muerte."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Kill Zombie Mom"
msgstr "Matar Mamá Zombi"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Zombie Mom"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Zombie Bear"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Oh god, I can't believe it happened…"
msgstr "Oh dios, no puedo creer que haya sucedido..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Zombie Mom"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"My mom… she's… she was killed, but then she just got back up… she's one of "
"those things now.  Can you put her out of her misery for me?"
msgstr ""
"Mi madre... ella... fue asesinada, pero luego volvió a levantarse... es una "
"de esas cosas ahora. ¿Puedes sacarla de su miseria por mí?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Zombie Mom"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Zombie Bear"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Thank you… she would've wanted it this way."
msgstr "Gracias... ella lo hubiera querido así."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Zombie Mom"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Zombie Bear"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Please reconsider, I know she's suffering…"
msgstr "Por favor, reconsidéralo. Sé que ella está sufriendo..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Zombie Mom"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Find a gun if you can, make it quick…"
msgstr "Encuentra un arma si puedes, date prisa..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Zombie Mom"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Well…?  Did you… finish things for my mom?"
msgstr "¿Y bien… ? ¿Terminaste... las cosas para mi mamá?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Zombie Mom"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Zombie Bear"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Thank you.  I couldn't rest until I knew that was finished."
msgstr "Gracias. No podía descansar hasta saber que se había terminado. "

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Zombie Mom"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill Zombie Bear"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Really… that's too bad."
msgstr "Realmente... eso es muy malo."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Null mission"
msgstr "Misión nula"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Reach Farm House"
msgstr "Llegar a Casa de Granja"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Reach Farm House"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I just need a place to start over…"
msgstr "Solo quiero un sitio para empezar de nuevo..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Reach Farm House"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I've accepted that everyone I used to know is dead… one way or another.  I "
"really wish I could have done something to save my brother but he was one of"
" the first to go.  I'd like to start over, just rebuild at one of the farms "
"in the countryside.  Can you help me secure one?"
msgstr ""
"He aceptado que todos los que conocí están muertos... de una forma u otra. "
"Realmente desearía haber podido hacer algo para salvar a mi hermano, pero "
"fue uno de los primeros en irse. Me gustaría empezar de nuevo, reconstruir "
"una de las granjas del campo. ¿Puedes ayudarme a asegurar una?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Reach Farm House"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Thank you, let's find a remote one so we don't have to worry about many "
"zombies."
msgstr ""
"Gracias, vamos a buscar una que esté alejada así no nos tenemos que "
"preocupar por muchos zombis."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Reach Farm House"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Please, I just don't know what to do otherwise."
msgstr "Por favor, no sé qué otra cosa hacer."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Reach Farm House"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Traveling the backroads would be a good way to search for one."
msgstr ""
"Viajar por los caminos secundarios sería una buena manera de buscar uno."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Reach Farm House"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Shall we keep looking for a farm house?"
msgstr "¿Deberíamos seguir buscando una granja?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Reach Farm House"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Well, my adventuring days are over.  I can't thank you enough.  Trying to "
"make this place self sustaining will take some work but the future is "
"looking brighter.  At least it ought to be safe for now.  You'll always be "
"welcome here."
msgstr ""
"Bien, mis días de aventuras han terminado. No puedo agradecertelo "
"suficientemente. Intentar que este lugar sea autosuficiente requerirá algo "
"de trabajo, pero el futuro se ve bonito. Al menos debería ser seguro por "
"ahora. Siempre serás bienvenido aquí."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Reach Farm House"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Well Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/godco/godco_missions.json data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I guess it was just a pipe dream."
msgstr "Supongo que no era más que un sueño imposible."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Reach FEMA Camp"
msgstr "Llegar a Campamento FEMA"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Reach FEMA Camp"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Maybe they escaped to one of the camps…"
msgstr "Tal vez escaparon a uno de los campos..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Reach FEMA Camp"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I can't thank you enough for bringing me the patient records but I do have "
"another request.  You seem to know your way around… could you take me to one"
" of the FEMA camps?  I know some were overrun but I don't want to believe "
"all of them could have fallen."
msgstr ""
"No puedo agradecerte lo suficiente por traerme los registros de los "
"pacientes, pero tengo otra petición. Parece que sabes cómo funciona... "
"¿podrías llevarme a uno de los campamentos de la FEMA? Sé que algunos fueron"
" invadidos, pero no quiero creer que todos hayan caído."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Reach FEMA Camp"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Thank you, just bring me to the camp… I just want to see."
msgstr "Gracias, sólo llévame al campamento... Sólo quiero verlo."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Reach FEMA Camp"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Please, I don't know what else to do."
msgstr "Por favor, no sé qué otra cosa hacer."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Reach FEMA Camp"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"We should go at night, if it is overrun then we can quickly make our escape."
msgstr ""
"Deberíamos ir a la noche, si está infestado entonces podemos escaparnos "
"rápidamente."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Reach FEMA Camp"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Any leads on where a camp might be?"
msgstr "¿Alguna pista de dónde puede estar el campamento?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Reach FEMA Camp"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I guess this wasn't as bright an idea as I thought."
msgstr "Supongo que esta idea no era tan brillante como creía."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Reach Safety"
msgstr "Alcanzar Sitio Seguro"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Recover Priest's Diary"
msgstr "Recuperar Diario del Cura"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Recover Priest's Diary"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"From what I understand, the creatures you encountered surrounding this relic"
" were unlike anything I've heard of.  It is laughable that I now consider "
"the living dead to be part of our ordinary reality.  Never-the-less, the "
"church must have some explanation for these events.  I have located the "
"residence of a local clergy man, could you go to this address and recover "
"any items that may reveal what the church's stance is on these events?"
msgstr ""
"Por lo que entiendo, las criaturas que encontrasteis alrededor de esta "
"reliquia no se parecen a nada de lo que he oído. Es gracioso que ahora "
"considere a los muertos vivientes como parte de nuestra realidad ordinaria. "
"Sin embargo, la iglesia debe tener alguna explicación para estos eventos. He"
" localizado la residencia de un clérigo local, ¿podrías ir a esta dirección "
"y recuperar cualquier objeto que pueda revelar cuál es la postura de la "
"iglesia sobre estos eventos?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Recover Priest's Diary"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"If the information is confidential the priest must have it hidden within his"
" own home."
msgstr ""
"Si la información es confidencial, el cura debe haberla ocultado dentro de "
"su propia casa."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Recover Priest's Diary"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Thank you, a diary is exactly what I was looking for."
msgstr "Gracias, un diario es exactamente lo que estaba buscando."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Recruit Tracker"
msgstr "Reclutar Rastreador"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Recruit Tracker"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"We've got another problem to deal with but I don't think we can handle it on"
" our own.  So, I sent word out and found us a volunteer… of sorts.  He's "
"vain as hell but has a little skill with firearms.  He was supposed to "
"collect whatever he had of value and is going to meet us at a cabin in the "
"woods.  Wasn't sure how long we were going to be so I told him to just camp "
"there until we picked him up."
msgstr ""
"Tenemos otro problema con el que lidiar pero no creo que podamos manejarlo "
"por nuestra cuenta. Así que, envié un mensaje y nos encontré un "
"voluntario... de algún tipo. Es muy vanidoso, pero tiene un poco de "
"habilidad con las armas de fuego. Se supone que iba a coger lo que tuviera "
"de valor y se reunirá con nosotros en una cabaña en el bosque. No estaba "
"seguro de cuánto tiempo íbamos a estar, así que le dije que acampara allí "
"hasta que pasaramos."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Recruit Tracker"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Rodger, if he's a no-show then any other gunslinger will do… but I doubt "
"he'll quit before we even begin."
msgstr ""
"Rodger, si no se presenta, cualquier otro pistolero lo hará... ...pero dudo "
"que renuncie antes de que empecemos."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Recruit Tracker"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I hope the bastard is packing heat… else we'll need to grab him a gun before"
" we hit our next target."
msgstr ""
"Espero que el bastardo esté armado... ...si no, tendremos que darle un arma "
"antes de llegar a nuestro próximo objetivo."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Recruit Tracker"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Found a gunslinger?"
msgstr "¿Encontraste un pistolero?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Recruit Tracker"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Great, just let me know when you are ready to wade knee-deep in an ocean of "
"blood."
msgstr ""
"Buenísimo, avisame cuando estés listo para meterte hasta las rodillas en un "
"océano de sangre."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Find Lost Dog"
msgstr "Encontrar Perro Perdido"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Lost Dog"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Oh, my poor puppy…"
msgstr "Oh, mi pobre cachorrito..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Lost Dog"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I left my poor dog in a house, not far from here.  Can you retrieve it?"
msgstr ""
"Dejé a mi pobre perro en una casa, no muy lejos de aquí. ¿Puedes "
"recuperarlo?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Lost Dog"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Thank you!  Please hurry back!"
msgstr "¡Gracias! ¡Por favor vuelve deprisa!"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Lost Dog"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Please, think of my poor little puppy!"
msgstr "¡Por favor, piensa en mi pobre perrito!"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Lost Dog"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Take my dog whistle; if the dog starts running off, blow it and he'll return"
" to your side."
msgstr ""
"Toma mi silbato para perros; si el perro empieza a correr, sopla y volverá a"
" tu lado."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Lost Dog"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Have you found my dog yet?"
msgstr "¿Has encontrado ya a mi perro?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Lost Dog"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Thank you so much for finding him!"
msgstr "¡Muchísimas gracias por encontrarlo!"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Lost Dog"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Oh no!  My poor puppy…"
msgstr "¡Oh, no! Mi perrito…"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Break into armory to retrieve family photo"
msgstr "Irrumpe en la armería para recuperar la foto de familia"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Break into armory to retrieve family photo"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I need you to get my family photo from the armory safe."
msgstr "Necesito que saques mi foto familiar de la caja fuerte de la armería."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Break into armory to retrieve family photo"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I left the only photo I have from my family in the armory.  I don't have the"
" code, can you get in?"
msgstr ""
"Dejé la única foto que tengo de mi familia en la armería. No tengo el "
"código, ¿puedes entrar?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Break into armory to retrieve family photo"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Break into armory to retrieve valued
#. possession"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_missions.json
msgid "Thanks, it's great to see someone willing to help a out."
msgstr "Gracias, es genial ver a alguien dispuesto a ayudar."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Break into armory to retrieve family photo"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Break into armory to retrieve valued
#. possession"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_missions.json
msgid ""
"Well, I'll find someone else to do it for me, real shame with all those guns"
" locked up too…"
msgstr ""
"Bueno, encontraré a alguien más que lo haga por mí, una verdadera lástima "
"tener todas esas armas encerradas..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Break into armory to retrieve family photo"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Break into armory to retrieve valued
#. possession"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_missions.json
msgid "You look like a resourceful sort, maybe you can hack it or something."
msgstr "Pareces un tipo con recursos, tal vez puedas hackearlo o algo así."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Break into armory to retrieve family photo"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Got the photo?  Should've been in my gun safe."
msgstr ""
"¿Tienes la foto? Debería haber estado en la caja de seguridad de mi arma."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Break into armory to retrieve family photo"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Break into armory to retrieve valued
#. possession"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_missions.json
msgid "Thanks!  I'll be sure to put in a good word for you around town."
msgstr "¡Gracias! Me aseguraré de hablar bien de ti en la ciudad."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Break into armory to retrieve family photo"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Smokes, let's go."
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Break into armory to retrieve valued
#. possession"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Go into deep woods to retrieve family seeds"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard1.json
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_missions.json
#: data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "OK, then hand it over."
msgstr "Vale, entonces dámelo."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Break into armory to retrieve family photo"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Smokes, let's go."
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Go into deep woods to retrieve family seeds"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard1.json
#: data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Shit happens."
msgstr "Mala suerte."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Prove your worth to Foodperson"
msgstr "Demuestra tu valor a Foodperson"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prove your worth to Foodperson"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Prove your dedication to Foodplace."
msgstr "Prueba tu dedicación a LugarComida"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prove your worth to Foodperson"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Show me the proof of your loyalty to the great Foodplace, and I'll consider "
"you worthy of my friendship.  Ten loyalty cards should be enough, I'm sure "
"you already have much more than that waiting for you at home, right?"
msgstr ""
"Muéstrame la prueba de tu lealtad al gran Lugarcomida, y te consideraré "
"digno de mi amistad. Diez tarjetas de lealtad deberían ser suficientes, "
"estoy seguro de que ya tienes mucho más que eso esperándote en casa, "
"¿verdad?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prove your worth to Foodperson"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "That's the spirit!  Good luck kid."
msgstr "¡Ese es el espíritu! Buena suerte, chico."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prove your worth to Foodperson"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "That's alright not everyone is cutout for this."
msgstr "Está bien, no todo el mundo está preparado para esto."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prove your worth to Foodperson"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Those are very precious, people would probably keep them on their person or "
"in bank vaults.  And definitely not throw them in the trash!"
msgstr ""
"Son muy valiosas, la gente probablemente las guardaría con ella o en las "
"bóvedas de los bancos. ¡Y definitivamente no los tirarían a la basura!"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prove your worth to Foodperson"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "How is it going?  Do you have them?"
msgstr "¿Cómo va todo? ¿Los tienes?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prove your worth to Foodperson"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"YES!  I knew you could do it!  You proved your worth and I'm proud to call "
"you a friend."
msgstr ""
"¡SÍ! ¡Sabía que podías hacerlo! Demostraste tu valía y estoy orgulloso de "
"llamarte amigo."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prove your worth to Foodperson"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Well… where are they?"
msgstr "Bueno... ¿dónde están?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prove your worth to Foodperson"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I'm so disappointed in you kid…"
msgstr "Estoy tan decepcionado de ti, chico..."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Prove You're A Survivor"
msgstr "Demuestra que eres un Superviviente"

#. ~ Description of mission "Prove You're A Survivor"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Prove you're a survivor by surviving for 10 days after the Cataclysm, and "
"then returning to the person who gave you this mission."
msgstr ""
"Demuestra que eres un superviviente sobreviviendo durante 10 días después "
"del cataclismo, y luego regresando a la persona que te dio esta misión."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prove You're A Survivor"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "It's hard to tell who actually has the skills to survive these days…"
msgstr ""
"Es difícil decir quién tiene realmente las habilidades para sobrevivir en "
"estos días..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prove You're A Survivor"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"It's hard surviving out here on our own, and we'd probably have a better "
"chance working together.  Problem is, I don't really know you and what "
"you're capable of.  You might have what it takes, or you might not.  Either "
"way, I'm going to need some proof.  Come back in a few days and I'll gladly "
"follow you.  It's basically a win-win for me: either you come back and I'll "
"know you've got what it takes, or you don't and I'll know that I was right "
"not to follow you."
msgstr ""
"Es difícil sobrevivir aquí por nuestra cuenta, y probablemente tendríamos "
"una mejor oportunidad de trabajar juntos. El problema es que no te conozco "
"ni sé de qué eres capaz. Puede que tengas lo que hace falta, o puede que no."
" De cualquier manera, voy a necesitar alguna prueba. Vuelve en unos días y "
"con gusto te seguiré. Es básicamente un ganar-ganar para mí: o vuelves y "
"sabré que tienes lo que se necesita, o no lo tienes y sabré que hice bien en"
" no seguirte."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prove You're A Survivor"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I'll see you then… or I won't, and then I'll know I made the right decision."
msgstr ""
"Te veré entonces... o no lo haré, y entonces sabré que tomé la decisión "
"correcta."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prove You're A Survivor"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Don't die.  If you're asking me for advice, that doesn't bode well for you."
msgstr ""
"No te mueras. Si me estás pidiendo consejo, eso no es un buen augurio para "
"ti."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prove You're A Survivor"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Well, you're not dead… yet."
msgstr "Bueno, no estás muerto... todavía."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prove You're A Survivor"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I'll be honest, I wasn't really expecting to see you again.  A promise is a "
"promise, I'll follow you now!"
msgstr ""
"Seré honesto, no esperaba verte de nuevo. Una promesa es una promesa, ¡te "
"seguiré ahora!"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prove You're A Survivor"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I know time is relative and all that."
msgstr "Sé que el tiempo es relativo y todo eso."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prove You're A Survivor"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I'm not quite sure how you failed to survive AND are talking to me."
msgstr "No estoy muy seguro de cómo no sobreviviste Y me estás hablando."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Gather cattail stalks to create cattail jelly"
msgstr "Recoger tallos de totora para crear gelatina de totora"

#. ~ Description of mission "Gather cattail stalks to create cattail jelly"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Gather <color_light_blue>80 cattail stalks</color> from the swamp and bring "
"them back to <color_light_red>learn how to craft cattail jelly</color>.  "
"Raise your <color_light_blue>survival skill to at least 1</color> by "
"harvesting cattail stalks.  <color_light_blue>Bring back the provided "
"bag</color> as well."
msgstr ""
"Reúne <color_light_blue>80 tallos de totora</color> del pantano y tráelos de"
" vuelta para a<color_light_red>prender a hacer gelatina</color> de totora. "
"Aumenta tu habilidad de <color_light_blue>supervivencia al menos a 1 "
"</color>recogiendo tallos de totora<color_light_blue>. Trae también</color> "
"la bolsa que se te ha dado."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather cattail stalks to create cattail jelly"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Medical services are a little sparse following <the_cataclysm>, but people "
"have been surviving using their wits and the bounty of Mother Nature for a "
"long time.  Care to learn a little?"
msgstr ""
"Los servicios médicos tienen poco seguimiento <the_cataclysm>, pero la gente"
" ha estado sobreviviendo usando su ingenio y la bondad de la Madre "
"Naturaleza durante mucho tiempo. ¿Te gustaría aprender un poco?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather cattail stalks to create cattail jelly"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Did you know that cattails are a source of a jelly that works as an "
"antiseptic and analgesic?  Something like that is likely to be mighty "
"helpful out here.  I want you to take this bag, head to the nearest swamp, "
"collect 80 cattail stalks, and bring them back here.  In exchange, I'll show"
" you how to harvest the jelly."
msgstr ""
"¿Sabías que las totoras son una fuente de jalea que funciona como "
"antiséptico y analgésico? Algo así es probable que sea de gran ayuda aquí. "
"Quiero que tomes esta bolsa, vayas al pantano más cercano, recojas 80 tallos"
" de totora y los traigas aquí. A cambio, te mostraré cómo cosechar la "
"gelatina."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather cattail stalks to create cattail jelly"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Great!  This bag should be big enough to hold all of the stalks we'll need."
"  Don't forget to bring it back."
msgstr ""
"¡Genial! Esta bolsa debería ser lo suficientemente grande para contener "
"todos los tallos que necesitamos. No te olvides de traerla de vuelta."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather cattail stalks to create cattail jelly"
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk_fluff.json
#: data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Your loss."
msgstr "Tú te lo pierdes."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather cattail stalks to create cattail jelly"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "The cattails grow in the fresh water in swamps.  You can't miss them."
msgstr ""
"Las totoras crecen en el agua dulce de los pantanos. No puedes perdértelas."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather cattail stalks to create cattail jelly"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Got those cattail stalks yet?  Don't forget to bring back my bag and to work"
" on improving your survival skill as well."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather cattail stalks to create cattail jelly"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Great!  Hand them over and I'll show you how this works."
msgstr "¡Genial! Entrégamelos y te mostraré cómo funciona esto."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather cattail stalks to create cattail jelly"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "OK, then hand them over."
msgstr "Bien, entonces entrégamelos."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather cattail stalks to create cattail jelly"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Well, that's a shame."
msgstr "Bueno, es una pena."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Angry pyromaniac"
msgstr "pirómano enfadado"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Angry pyromaniac"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Oh man, I want to <swear> burn it so bad…"
msgstr "Oh tio, <swear> quiero quemarlo con tantas ganas..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Angry pyromaniac"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I'm so <swear> infuriated!  I've got an enemy that ruined my life, and now I"
" want to get revenge!  I don't care about <the_cataclysm>, I just want to "
"burn his house!  Would you help me, <name_g>?"
msgstr ""
"¡Estoy <swear> cabreado! ¡Tengo un enemigo que arruinó my vida y ahora "
"quiero venganza! No me importa el <the_cataclysm>. ¡Sólo quiero quemar su "
"casa! ¿Me ayudarás, <name_g>?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Angry pyromaniac"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Good.  Let's go to his house and <swear> burn it down!  Oh, by the way, "
"could you bring gasoline with you, <name_g>?  I was so angry I forgot to "
"bring it with me…"
msgstr ""
"Bien. ¡Vamos a su casa y  <swear> hagamosla arder hasta los cimientos, ! eh,"
"  por cierto, ¿podrías traer gasolina contigo, <name_g>?  Estaba tan "
"cabreado que se me olvidó..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Angry pyromaniac"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Seriously?  It's such an easy job…"
msgstr "¿De verdad? Es un trabajo tan fácil..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Angry pyromaniac"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Angry pizzaiolo"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid "Maybe we can find some gasoline at gas station."
msgstr "Tal vez podamos encontrar algo de gasolina en la gasolinera."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Angry pyromaniac"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Angry pizzaiolo"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
#: data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Are you ready, <name_g>?"
msgstr "¿Estás listo, <name_g>?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Angry pyromaniac"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Sweet, sweet revenge!  Ah, smells so nice!  Feels like the smell of napalm "
"in the morning!  All his stuff, and probably even that <name_b>, will burn "
"to ashes in a matter of minutes.  You helped me get my revenge, so I'll "
"follow you to the end, <name_g>!"
msgstr ""
"¡Dulce, dulce venganza! ¡mmm, qué bien huele! ¡Se siente como el olor del "
"napalm por las mañanas! Todas sus cosas y probablemente ese <name_b>, se "
"convertirá en ceniza en cuestión de minutos. Me ayudaste con mi venganza, "
"ahora te seguiré hasta el final, <name_g>!"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Angry pyromaniac"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Wow, you failed?  How…"
msgstr "Guau, ¿fallastes? Cómo…"

