#: data/json/npcs/godco/NPC_Julian_Ray.json
#: data/json/npcs/godco/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
#: data/json/npcs/godco/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
#: data/json/npcs/godco/NPC_Sonia_Greene.json
#: data/json/npcs/godco/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
