#. critical.  Real name: Gavin Wheeler
#. ~ Smokes is a firefighter that volunteered to take stock of what was
#. available and keep inventory. He's gradually had more lumped onto him as
#. the Free Merchants struggle to put themselves together, but he feels
#. obligated to help, even though he doesn't really want to have all the
#. responsibility he does.
