msgstr "No hagas ruido. Pueden oírte."

#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_postit_migo"
#: data/json/snippets/lab.json
msgid ""
"Resin return: 0.45 on vegetable matter, 0.51 on meat, 0.66 on nonsedated "
