#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_meat_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Meat from a heavily mutated animal.  It has an unsettling loose and spongy "
"texture, but smells… mostly normal.  There are strange tangles and "
"formations in it that don't appear natural at all: bits of bone and hair "
"crusted up inside the muscle, as if trying to form another organism.  Still,"
" it seems digestible at least, if you cook it and remove the worst parts."
msgstr ""
"Carne de un animal fuertemente mutado. Tiene una inquietante textura suelta "
"y esponjosa, pero huele... mayormente normal. Hay extraños enredos y "
"formaciones en ella que no parecen naturales en absoluto: trozos de hueso y "
"pelo encostrados en el interior del músculo, como si se tratara de formar "
"otro organismo. Aún así, parece digerible al menos, si lo cocinas y quitas "
"las peores partes."

#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_meat_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Meat from a heavily mutated animal.  Although it came from muscle tissue, it"
" has a curious swirling grain pattern, and at the center of each grain is a "
"knot of hard, cartilaginous tissue.  It smells offputting."
msgstr ""
"Carne de un animal muy mutado. Aunque procede de tejido muscular, tiene un "
"curioso patrón de grano arremolinado, y en el centro de cada grano hay un "
"nudo de tejido duro y cartilaginoso. Tiene un olor desagradable."

#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_meat_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Meat from a heavily mutated animal.  This is from muscle, but in the fascial"
" tissue between the muscles, thick spiny hairs have grown.  Foul-smelling, "
"cream-colored fluid gushes out whenever a hair pulls loose."
msgstr ""
"Carne de un animal muy mutado. Esto es de un músculo, pero en el tejido "
"facial entre los músculos han crecido gruesos pelos espinosos. Un fluido "
"maloliente y de color crema sale a borbotones cada vez que se suelta un "
"pelo."

#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_meat_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Meat from a heavily mutated animal.  Although this came from muscle, it has "
"a thick cordlike texture and smells like leather and bread mold."
msgstr ""
"Carne de un animal muy mutado. Aunque procede de un músculo, tiene una "
"textura espesa como un cordón y huele a cuero y a moho del pan."

#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_meat_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"This is a cooked chunk of meat from a mutated animal.  It has an unsettling,"
" spongy texture, but otherwise tastes… mostly normal.  Hopefully you got all"
" the bits of hair and bone out…"
msgstr ""
"Este es un trozo de carne cocido de un animal mutado. Tiene una textura "
"esponjosa e inquietante, pero por lo demás tiene un sabor... casi normal. "
"Esperemos que hayas sacado todos los trozos de pelo y hueso..."

#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_meat_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"This is a cooked chunk of meat from a mutated animal.  You thought you'd "
"cleared out all the gross parts, but while cooking, a fluid-filled sac "
"inside burst and covered it in some kind of thick grease."
msgstr ""
"Esto es un trozo de carne cocinada de un animal mutante. Pensabas que habías"
" limpiado todas las partes asquerosas, pero mientras se cocinaba, un saco "
"lleno de líquido en su interior se reventó y lo cubrió de una especie de "
"grasa espesa."

#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_meat_desc"
#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_tainted_mutant_meat_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"This is a cooked chunk of meat from a mutated animal.  The surface is "
"peppered with divots from the pieces you had to dig out to make it seem "
"edible."
msgstr ""
"Esto es un trozo de carne cocida de un animal mutante. La superficie está "
"salpicada de muescas de los trozos que has tenido que extraer para que "
"parezca comestible."

#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_meat_desc"
#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_tainted_mutant_meat_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"This is a cooked chunk of meat from a mutated animal.  Heat caused the "
"muscles to twist and move as if they were alive, and now it has writhed "
"itself into a dense knot."
msgstr ""
"Esto es un trozo de carne cocida de un animal mutado. El calor hizo que los "
"músculos se retorcieran y se movieran como si estuvieran vivos, y ahora se "
"ha retorcido hasta formar un denso nudo."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tainted_mutant_meat_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Poisonous meat from a heavily mutated animal.  It has an unsettling loose "
"and spongy texture and a putrid smell.  There are strange tangles and "
"formations in it that don't appear natural at all: bits of bone and hair "
"crusted up inside the muscle, as if trying to form another organism.  You'd "
"have to be truly desperate to try eating this."
msgstr ""
"Carne venenosa de un animal muy mutado. Tiene una inquietante textura suelta"
" y esponjosa y un olor pútrido. Tiene extraños enredos y formaciones que no "
"parecen naturales en absoluto: trozos de hueso y pelo encostrados dentro del"
" músculo, como si trataran de formar otro organismo. Hay que estar realmente"
" desesperado para intentar comer esto."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tainted_mutant_meat_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Poisonous meat from a heavily mutated animal.  Although it came from muscle "
"tissue, it has a curious swirling grain pattern, and at the center of each "
"grain is a knot of hard, cartilaginous tissue.  Its smell is nauseating."
msgstr ""
"Carne venenosa de un animal muy mutado. Aunque proviene de tejido muscular, "
"tiene un curioso patrón de granos arremolinados, y en el centro de cada "
"grano hay un nudo de tejido duro y cartilaginoso. Su olor es nauseabundo."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tainted_mutant_meat_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Poisonous meat from a heavily mutated animal.  This is from muscle, but in "
"the fascial tissue between the muscles, thick spiny hairs have grown.  Foul-"
"smelling, cream-colored fluid gushes out whenever a hair pulls loose."
msgstr ""
"Carne venenosa de un animal muy mutado. Es de músculo, pero en el tejido "
"fascial entre los músculos han crecido gruesos pelos espinosos. Un fluido "
"maloliente y de color crema sale a borbotones cada vez que se suelta un "
"pelo."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tainted_mutant_meat_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Poisonous meat from a heavily mutated animal.  Although this came from "
"muscle, it has a thick cordlike texture and smells like leather and bread "
"mold."
msgstr ""
"Carne venenosa de un animal muy mutado. Aunque procede de un músculo, tiene "
"una textura espesa como un cordón y huele a cuero y a moho del pan."

#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_tainted_mutant_meat_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"This is a cooked chunk of meat from a mutated animal.  It has an unsettling,"
" spongy texture, but otherwise tastes… mostly normal.  Hopefully you won't "
"vomit while eating this…"
msgstr ""
"Este es un trozo de carne cocida de un animal mutado. Tiene una textura "
"esponjosa e inquietante, pero por lo demás tiene un sabor... casi normal. "
"Espero que no vomites mientras comes esto..."

#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_tainted_mutant_meat_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"This is a cooked chunk of meat from a mutated animal.  You thought you'd "
"cleared out all the gross parts, but while cooking, a fluid-filled sac "
"inside burst and covered it in some kind of foul-smelling thick grease."
msgstr ""
"Esto es un trozo de carne cocida de un animal mutante. Pensabas que habías "
"limpiado todas las partes asquerosas, pero mientras se cocinaba, un saco "
"lleno de líquido en su interior se reventó y lo cubrió de una especie de "
"grasa espesa y maloliente."

#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_brain_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The brain of a heavily-mutated animal.  A thick net of interlocking veins "
"cocoons it, and the surface has a rainbow sheen like an oil slick.  When you"
" reach towards it, the whole thing starts shuddering and it comes loose from"
" the spinal cord, as if it's trying to escape."
msgstr ""
"Es el cerebro de un animal muy mutado. Lo cubre una red gruesa de venas "
"interconectadas y en la superficie tiene un brillo iridiscente como si fuera"
" aceitoso. Cuando te acercas, empieza a temblar y se suelta de la espina "
"dorsal como si estuviera intentando escapar."

#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_brain_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The brain of a heavily-mutated animal.  Shining white in color and brittle "
"to the touch like hard cheese, you can hardly believe it was a living organ "
"moments before.  On the base the pure whiteness is broken up by a huge, "
"spasming artery filled with yellow gunk."
msgstr ""
"Es el cerebro de un animal muy mutado. De un color blanco brillante y frágil"
" al tacto como un queso duro, apenas si podéis creer que hace poco era un "
"órgano vivo. En su base, el blanco puro está interrumpido por una arteria "
"enorme y con espasmos, llena de un residuo amarillo."

#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_brain_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The brain of a heavily-mutated animal.  Vestigial, still-twitching eyes are "
"strewn across its surface, each with a different-shaped pupil.  Hidden "
"between the hemispheres you find an embryonic copy of the creature's face, "
"eyes darting around in a mad spasm."
msgstr ""
"Es el cerebro de un animal muy mutado. Unos ojos residuales que todavía ser "
"retuercen están desparramados por su superficie, cada uno con una pupila de "
"diferente forma. Oculto entre los hemisferios encontráis una copia "
"embriónica de la cara de la criatura, con los ojos moviéndose a toda "
"velocidad como en un espasmo insano."

#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_brain_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Something, probably the brain, from a heavily-mutated animal.  The spinal "
"cord gives way to a chaotic tangle of loose neural fibers without any of "
"semblance of a solid anatomy, and the whole mess is visibly shrinking now "
"that you got it out of the creature's liquor."
msgstr ""
"Algo, probablemente el cerebro, de un animal muy mutado. La espina dorsal "
"muestra la maraña caótica de fibras neurales sueltas sin dar el aspecto de "
"haber sido una anatomía sólida, y todo eso se encoge ahora que lo sacaste "
"del jugo de la criatura."

#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_brain_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"This is a piece of cooked brain from a mutated animal.  Whatever gave its "
"surface an oily sheen has coagulated into bluish clumps of goo settled into "
"the grooves.  You try to scrape them off, but they seem fused with the "
"tissue beneath."
msgstr ""
"Este es un pedazo cocinado de cerebro de un animal mutado. Sea lo que sea "
"que le da ese brillo aceitoso a su superficie, se coaguló formando viscosos "
"pedazos azules metidos en las ranuras. Tratas de sacarlos pero parecen "
"fusionados con el tejido."

#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_brain_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"A piece of cooked brain from a heavily-mutated animal.  A circulatory vessel"
" at the base of it burst while cooking, slathering the whole thing in "
"faintly citrus-smelling yellow liquid.  While the smell is almost "
"appetizing, the faint taste of ammonia is anything but."
msgstr ""
"Es un pedazo cocinado de cerebro de un animal muy mutado. Un vaso sanguíneo "
"en su base se reventó cuando lo estabas cocinando, llenando todo de un "
"líquido amarillo de leve olor cítrico. Aunque el olor es casi apetecible, el"
" suave gusto a amoníaco es todo lo contrario."

#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_brain_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"A piece of cooked brain from a heavily-mutated animal.  The eyes jutting out"
" of the surface have grown milky, and a good few of them fell off, each "
"revealing a small depression dominated by a short root of veins and nerve.  "
"Judging by the spongy texture, some remain buried in the deeper tissues."
msgstr ""
"Es un pedazo cocinado de cerebro de un animal muy mutado. Los ojos que "
"sobresalen de la superficie se han vuelto blanquecinos y varios de ellos se "
"cayeron, cada uno revelando un pequeño agujero dominado por una raíz corta "
"de venas y nervios. A juzgar por la textura esponjosa, algunos quedaron "
"hundidos en los tejidos más profundos."

#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_brain_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"A cooked piece of what passes for a brain in some mutant animals.  The whole"
" thing came apart into a coarse jelly interspersed with hair-thin, branching"
" nerves that seem to move slightly.  The texture is horrible, but it tastes "
"better than starvation."
msgstr ""
"Es un pedazo cocinado por lo que vendría a ser el cerebro de algún animal "
"mutado. Todo se desarmó en una gelatina gruesa entremezclada con nervios "
"finos como pelo que parecen moverse levemente. La textura es horrible pero "
"tiene mejor sabor que la hambruna."

#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_lung_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"A piece of lung you removed from a mutated animal.  Strange, transparent, "
"swaying tubes filled with a clear liquid emerge from the mostly-normal lung "
"tissue.  Some broke off during the butchery, and the escaped liquid coats "
"your tools, hardening on contact with the air like superglue."
msgstr ""
"Es un pedazo de pulmón que sacaste de un animal mutado. Unos tubos extraños,"
" transparentes y que todavía se mueven llenos de un líquido claro emergen "
"del tejido casi normal del pulmón. Algunos se rompieron durante el "
"descuartizamiento y el líquido que salió manchó tus herramientas, "
"endureciéndose al contacto con el aire como superpegamento."

#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_lung_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"A piece of lung from a heavily-mutated animal.  Even after removing the "
"diaphragm, the tissue itself keeps rhythmically expanding and contracting, "
"sending a gurgling whine through the truncated windpipe with each breath.  "
"It takes far too long for it to grow still."
msgstr ""
"Es un pedazo de pulmón de una animal muy mutado. Incluso después de sacar el"
" diafragma, el tejido parece seguir expandiéndose y contrayéndose "
"rítmicamente, dejando escapar un quejido gorgoteante por la tráquea cortada."
" Tarda mucho tiempo en quedarse completamente quieto."

#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_lung_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"A piece of lung from a heavily-mutated animal.  The airways are broken up in"
" regular intervals by what resemble vocal cords, and whenever you push some "
"air through the tissue a cacophony of screams erupts from them."
msgstr ""
"Es un pedazo de pulmón de un animal muy mutado. Las vías respiratorias están"
" interrumpidas en intervalos regulares por lo que parecen cuerdas vocales, y"
" cuando empujas un poco de aire a través del tejido, una cacofonía de gritos"
" salen de ellas."

#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_lung_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"A piece of lung from a heavily-mutated animal.  The whole thing is filled "
"with a foul-smelling, greenish foam bubbling from strange glands lining the "
"trachea, making you wonder how the creature could breathe at all.  It does "
"explain the attitude, at least."
msgstr ""
"Es un pedazo de pulmón de un animal muy mutado. Está todo lleno de una "
"espuma verdosa de olor nauseabundo que burbujea de una extrañas glándulas "
"dentro de la tráquea, lo que te hace preguntar cómo hacía la criatura para "
"respirar. Explica su actitud, eso sí."

#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_lung_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"A piece of lung from a heavily-mutated animal.  The airways are lined with "
"rows of tiny, stone-hard barbs, each pointing towards the outside, as if "
"they were made to keep something out."
msgstr ""
"Es un pedazo de pulmón de un animal muy mutado. Las vías respiratorias están"
" llenas de filas de puntas pequeñas duras como piedras, cada una apuntando "
"hacia afuera como si estuvieran diseñadas para mantener algo afuera."

#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_lung_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"A cooked piece of a mutant animal's lung.  With a lot of work you can cut "
"around the hardened shell of translucent gunk, but your only reward is "
"getting to the spongy, gray, mostly-flavorless mass of tissue beneath."
msgstr ""
"Un pedazo cocinado del pulmón de un animal mutado. Con mucho trabajo puedes "
"cortar alrededor del caparazón endurecido de mugre translúcida, pero tu "
"recompensa será conseguir una masa de tejido esponjoso, gris y casi sin "
"sabor."

#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_lung_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"A cooked piece of a mutant animal's lung.  The heat somehow made the tissue "
"swell up, with some alveoli bursting and collapsing on themselves.  The "
"whole thing turned to the consistency of cotton candy, but with a faint "
"taste of yeast replacing the sugary goodness."
msgstr ""
"Es un pedazo cocinado del pulmón de un animal mutante. El calor hizo que el "
"tejido se hinche, algunos alveolos explotaron y colapsaron. Ahora quedó con "
"la misma consistencia que el algodón de azúcar pero con un leve sabor a "
"levadura en lugar del azúcar."

#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_lung_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"A cooked piece of a mutant animal's lung.  Deep within, the extraneous vocal"
" cords you didn't manage to remove turned to chewy morsels.  The taste is "
"almost good enough to make you forget the way they sounded while you were "
"cooking it."
msgstr ""
"Es un pedazo cocinado del pulmón de un animal mutante. Muy adentro de él, "
"las extrañas cuerdas vocales que no pudiste sacar se volvieron gomosos. El "
"sabor es casi tan bueno como para hacerte olvidar la manera en que sonaban "
"mientras lo estabas cocinando."

#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_lung_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"A cooked piece of a mutant animal's lung.  The glands exuding the green foam"
" have solidified, and the foam itself seems to have evaporated without a "
"trace.  The smell is detestable, but the glands have a taste and consistency"
" remarkably like hardboiled egg yolk."
msgstr ""
"Es un pedazo cocinado del pulmón de un animal mutante. Las glándulas que "
"rezumaban una espuma verde están solidificadas y la espuma parece haberse "
"evaporado sin dejar rastro. El olor es detestable pero las glándulas tienen "
"el sabor y la consistencias muy parecido al huevo hervido."

#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_liver_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"A chunk of liver from a mutated animal.  The surface is pockmarked by "
"hexagonal scar tissue, and some surprisingly active flatworms still seem to "
"cling to it.  About half of them seem to be in the process of being digested"
" by their meal, instead of the other way around."
msgstr ""
"Es un pedazo de hígado de un animal mutado. La superficie está lleno de "
"cicatrices hexagonales y algunos gusanos planos sorprendentemente activos "
"todavía parecen aferrarse a ella. Casi la mitad de ellos parecen estar en "
"proceso de ser digeridos por su carne, en lugar de ser al revés."

#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_liver_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"A chunk of liver from a mutated animal.  Most of its volume is taken up by a"
" gigantic cyst filled with tiny, crab-like creatures.  Upon opening it the "
"contents spray to the ground, with the suddenly homeless inhabitants "
"scurrying for cover.  The rest of it looks relatively normal, if only in "
"comparison."
msgstr ""
"Es un pedazo de hígado de un animal mutado. La mayor parte de su volumen "
"está tomado por quiste gigantesco lleno de criaturas pequeñas similares a "
"cangrejos. Al abrirlo, el contenido sale despedido al suelo, y sus "
"habitantes sorprendidos sin hogar se escurren buscando refugio. El resto se "
"ve relativamente normal, por lo menos en comparación."

#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_liver_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"A chunk of liver from a mutated animal.  The gall bladder has transformed "
"into a bundle of hair and skin, and what appeared to be brownish veins "
"originating from it turn out to be solitary, curled hairs crisscrossing "
"beneath the surface of the organ.  At least you can remove them with a "
"gentle pull on the central mass, but the whole liver collapses in a "
"gelatinous heap afterwards."
msgstr ""
"Es un pedazo de hígado de un animal mutado. La bilis de la vejiga se ha "
"transformado en un manojo de pelo y piel, y lo que parecen ser venas "
"marrones que salían de ella resultaron ser pelos enrulados entrecruzándose "
"debajo de la superficie del órgano. Por lo menos puedes sacarlos de la masa "
"central con un leve tirón, pero todo el hígado colapsa en una pila "
"gelatinosa después de eso."

#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_liver_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"A chunk of liver from a mutated animal.  The surface is blackened and hard "
"but cracked, exposing a few strips of fresh pink tissue underneath.  After "
"cracking the shell fully open, the inner tissue begins swelling at an "
"alarming rate before turning gray and lifeless."
msgstr ""
"Un pedazo de hígado de un animal mutado. La superficie está ennegrecida y "
"dura pero rota, exponiendo unas pocas tiras de tejido rosa debajo. Después "
"de romper y dejarlo totalmente abierto, el tejido interno empieza a "
"hincharse a una velocidad alarmante antes de volverse gris y muerto."

#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_liver_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"A cooked chunk of liver from a mutated animal.  Getting all the parasites - "
"if that's what they were - off was more effort than this meal is probably "
"worth, and the consistency suffered considerably from having to dig them out"
" from the depth of the organ."
msgstr ""
"Es un pedazo cocinado de hígado de un animal mutado. Sacarle todos los "
"parásitos - si es que son eso - te llevó más esfuerzo de lo que esta comida "
"probablemente valga, y la consistencia sufrió considerablemente por haberlos"
" sacado desde lo profundo del órgano."

#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_liver_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"A cooked chunk of liver from a mutated animal.  Instead of the matte gray-"
"brown of a normal liver, this one turned disconcertingly orange after "
"heating it up, and finger-sized flakes detach themselves from it at the "
"slightest touch.  The taste reminds you of slightly overripe avocado, but "
"that's still better than you expected."
msgstr ""
"Un pedazo cocinado de hígado de un animal mutado. En lugar del color marrón "
"gris mate de un hígado normal, este se volvió desconcertantemente naranja "
"luego de calentarlo, y unos copos del tamaño de un dedo se sueltan al mínimo"
" toque. El sabor te hace acordar a un aguacate un poquito pasado de maduro, "
"pero eso es mejor de lo que esperabas."

#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_liver_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"A cooked chunk of liver from a mutated animal.  The channels left by the "
"hairs you removed have filled with an oily black liquid, lending a "
"surprisingly nice look to the cut surface.  On biting into it the fluid "
"hardens unexpectedly, leaving you to chew much longer than you'd like to."
msgstr ""
"Es un pedazo cocinado de hígado de un animal mutado. Los canales que "
"quedaron de los pelos que sacaste se llenaron con un líquido aceitoso negro,"
" dejando una sorprendente apariencia agradable en la superficie. Cuando lo "
"mordéis, el líquido se endurece de manera inesperada, haciéndote masticar "
"mucho más tiempo de lo que esperabas."

#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_liver_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"A cooked chunk of liver from a mutated animal.  The tissue split apart "
"following the veins before hardening, reminding you of a warped gray flower "
"with a sinuous vein for a stem.  Perhaps surprisingly, it tastes not "
"entirely unlike liver."
msgstr ""
"Un pedazo cocinado de hígado de un animal mutado. El tejido se partió por "
"las venas antes de endurecerse, recordándote una flor gris retorcida con una"
" vena sinuosa como tallo. Tal vez sorprendentemente, su sabor no es tan "
"diferente al de un hígado normal."

#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_kidney_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"A piece of kidney from a mutated animal.  While cutting into it your knife "
"slips, opening a large gash on its side from which tiny, beautiful pearls "
"roll out.  Before your eyes they start glistening with humidity and melt, "
"leaving no trace beyond a stinging stench."
msgstr ""
"Un pedazo de riñón de un animal mutado. Al cortarlo, tu cuchillo resbala "
"abriendo un gran tajo en un costado desde el cual unas pequeñas perlas "
"hermosas salen rodando. Ante tus ojos, comienzan a brillan de humedad y se "
"derriten sin dejar rastro además de un hedor punzante."

#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_kidney_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"A piece of kidney from a mutated animal.  The tissue is broken up by pointy,"
" brittle crystals you need to carefully cut around, lest they embed in your "
"hand.  When you're done about half the meat is gone."
msgstr ""
"Es un pedazo de riñón de un animal mutado. El tejido está roto por unos "
"cristales puntiagudos y brillantes que tienes que esquivar cuidadosamente al"
" cortar para que no se te claven en la mano. Cuando terminas, la mitad de la"
" carne desapareció."

#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_kidney_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"A piece of kidney from a mutated animal.  Most of the volume is taken up by "
"clear cysts filled with liquid, leaving you to pop them one by one to try "
"and salvage some usable tissue.  The result looks about as appetizing as it "
"sounds, but you suppose it's technically edible."
msgstr ""
"Es un pedazo de riñón de un animal mutado. La mayor parte de su volumen está"
" ocupada por unos quistes claros llenos de líquido, haciéndote reventarlos "
"uno por uno para intentar rescatar algo del tejido. El resultado parece tan "
"apetecible como suena pero supones que técnicamente es comestible."

#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_kidney_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"A piece of kidney from a mutated animal.  Accessory kidneys bud off the "
"ureter in clumps, like red, slightly quivering grapes.  The main organ "
"continues the same fractal structure, fraying  into myriad tiny berries "
"still connected to a stem."
msgstr ""
"Es un pedazo de riñón de un animal mutado. Unos riñones supernumerarios "
"brotan de la uretra en grupo como uvas rojas y vibrantes. El órgano "
"principal continúa la misma estructura fractal, deshilachándose en infinitas"
" pequeñas frutas todavía conectadas al tallo."

#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_kidney_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"A cooked piece of kidney from a mutated animal.  Cooking it exposed myriad "
"tiny, glistening stones embedded into the tissue, making your teeth screech "
"with every bite despite your care not to crack your teeth.  It tastes sickly"
" sweet, and a stinging aftertaste lingers in your mouth for a long time."
msgstr ""
"Es un pedazo cocinado de riñón de un animal mutado. Al cocinarlo, quedaron "
"expuestos innumerables piedras pequeñas y brillantes metidas en el tejido, "
"haciendo que tus dientes rechinen con cada mordida a pesar de tu cuidado por"
" no romperte un diente. Tiene un sabor empalagosamente dulce y un resabio "
"punzante te queda un la boca por largo tiempo."

#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_kidney_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"A cooked piece of kidney from a mutated animal.  Cooking loosened the tissue"
" enough for it to come apart from the lightest pull, while exposing long, "
"off-white strands that connect the different parts together."
msgstr ""
"Es un pedazo cocinado de riñón de un animal mutado. Al cocinarlo el tejido "
"se aflojó lo suficiente como para romperse al mínimo tirón, exponiendo unas "
"hebras largas y blancuzcas que conectan las diferentes partes."

#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_mutant_kidney_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"A cooked piece of kidney from a mutated animal.  You swear it grew new cysts"
" while you were cooking it, each of which sports a different color.  You're "
"not sure you want to know how the dark blue one tastes."
msgstr ""
"Es un pedazo cocinado de riñón de un animal mutado. Juras que le han crecido"
" nuevos quistes mientras lo estabas cocinando, cada uno de diferente color. "
"No estás seguro de querer saber qué sabor tienen los que son azul oscuro."

#. ~ Snippet in category "bug_organs_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"These organs came from a giant mutant bug, and you really aren't sure what "
"to make of them.  There are things you've never seen in any anatomy book, "
"with spines and hair and other unidentified parts protruding seemingly at "
"random."
msgstr ""
"Estos órganos proceden de un bicho mutante gigante, y realmente no estás "
"seguro de qué hacer con ellos. Hay cosas que nunca has visto en ningún libro"
" de anatomía, con espinas y pelos y otras partes no identificadas que "
"sobresalen aparentemente al azar."

#. ~ Snippet in category "bug_organs_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"These organs came from a giant mutant bug.  They have a sickly green color, "
"and one of them ripped when you were removing it, revealing an inner surface"
" that looks like row upon row of human fingers, nails and all."
msgstr ""
"Estos órganos proceden de un bicho mutante gigante. Tienen un color verde "
"enfermizo, y uno de ellos se desgarró cuando lo estabas quitando, revelando "
"una superficie interior que parece una fila y otra de dedos humanos, con "
"uñas y todo."

#. ~ Snippet in category "bug_organs_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"This is a huge, thick, fleshy sac you removed from a giant mutant bug.  The "
"surface is covered in smooth, soft skin, and beneath it is a coiled, twisted"
" mess of cordlike tissue."
msgstr ""
"Este es un enorme y grueso saco carnoso que extrajiste de un bicho mutante "
"gigante. La superficie está cubierta de piel suave y lisa, y debajo hay un "
"lío enrollado y retorcido de tejido similar a un cordón."

#. ~ Snippet in category "bug_organs_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"This is a long, corded organ you removed from a giant mutant bug.  It ran "
"from the head to the abdomen and has long tendrils coming off it, not unlike"
" a spinal cord."
msgstr ""
"Este es un órgano largo y con cuerdas que extrajistes de un bicho mutante "
"gigante. Va desde la cabeza hasta el abdomen y tiene largos zarcillos que "
"salen de él, no muy diferentes de una médula espinal."

#. ~ Snippet in category "bug_organs_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"This is a meaty gray organ you removed from a mutant.  It has a chalky "
"yellow coating that burns your skin, and several unidentifiable fleshy tubes"
" sticking out of it.  The smell it gives off stings your nostrils.  You're "
"pretty confident no natural creature has one of these."
msgstr ""
"Este es un órgano gris carnoso que has extraído de un mutante. Tiene una "
"capa amarilla calcárea que te quema la piel, y varios tubos carnosos "
"inidentificables que salen de él. El olor que desprende te escuece en las "
"fosas nasales. Estás seguro de que ninguna criatura natural tiene uno de "
"estos."

#. ~ Snippet in category "bug_organs_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"This organ meat, retrieved from a mutated creature, looks like a series of "
"small mammalian hearts arranged in series on a long fleshy tube.  At the end"
" of the chain is a large fleshy sac resembling a stomach."
msgstr ""
"Esta carne de órgano, obtenida de una criatura mutante, parece una serie de "
"pequeños corazones de mamífero dispuestos en serie en un largo tubo carnoso."
" Al final de la cadena hay un gran saco carnoso que se parece a un estómago."

#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_bug_organs_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Some disturbing hairs have been burned off during cooking, but you still "
"have difficulty convincing yourself to eat them."
msgstr ""
"Algunos pelos molestos se han quemado durante la cocción, pero aún así te "
"cuesta convencerte de comerlos."

#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_bug_organs_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"You have cooked a pile of *things* that used to be green, and it still looks"
" green under the light.  You think your face will turn that color after "
"eating them."
msgstr ""
"Has cocinado un montón de *cosas* que antes eran verdes, y todavía se ven "
"verdes bajo la luz. Crees que tu cara se volverá de ese color después de "
"comerlas."

#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_bug_organs_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"It's cooked.  You can force yourself to believe that the cordlike tissue "
"inside is noodles with ketchup and Italian spices."
msgstr ""
"Está cocinado. Puedes forzarte a creer que el tejido fibroso del interior "
"son fideos con ketchup y especias italianas."

#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_bug_organs_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"After you cooked it, you tore this long thing into small pieces.  Maybe this"
" can prevent it from reviving in your intestines."
msgstr ""
"Después de cocinarlo, rompiste esta cosa larga en trozos pequeños. Tal vez "
"esto pueda evitar que reviva en tus intestinos."

#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_bug_organs_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"You're glad it didn't break your kitchen utensils.  Now you hope it won't "
"damage your digestive system."
msgstr ""
"Te alegras de que no haya roto tus utensilios de cocina. Ahora esperas que "
"no dañe tu sistema digestivo."

#. ~ Snippet in category "cooked_bug_organs_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Looking at this pile of biological tissues with strange smell, you don't "
"know what kind of organs they belong to in medicine.  Of course, you're "
"pretty sure they're not boiled tomatoes."
msgstr ""
"Mirando este montón de tejidos biológicos con olor extraño, no sabes a qué "
"tipo de órganos pertenecen en medicina. Por supuesto, estás seguro de que no"
" son tomates hervidos."

#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_bug_lung_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"You're pretty sure this is lung tissue.  It looks like a lung from a larger "
"mammal, like a dog, but instead of a few distinct lobes, it has dozens of "
"lobes arranged in sheets.  Strange spindles and gnarled tumescences dot the "
"surface."
msgstr ""
"Estás bastante seguro de que esto es tejido pulmonar. Parece un pulmón de un"
" mamífero más grande, como un perro, pero en lugar de unos pocos lóbulos "
"distintos, tiene docenas de lóbulos dispuestos en láminas. Extraños husos y "
"tumorcillos nudosos salpican la superficie."

#. ~ Snippet in category "mutant_bug_lung_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"You're pretty sure this is lung tissue.  It has a vaguely wing-like shape, "
"with a series of nodules around what would be the trailing edge of the "
"'wing'.  A cluster of quills in each corner of the organ held it to the "
"bug's carapace like clasps."
msgstr ""
"Estás bastante seguro de que esto es tejido pulmonar. Tiene una forma "
"vagamente parecida a un ala, con una serie de nódulos alrededor de lo que "
"sería el borde de salida del \"ala\". Un grupo de púas en cada esquina del "
"órgano lo sujetaba al caparazón del bicho como si fueran broches."

#. ~ Snippet in category "chitin_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"A piece of a bug's exoskeleton, but mutated.  The inner side is lined with "
"veins and strange, hooked protuberances."
msgstr ""
"Un trozo del exoesqueleto de un bicho, pero mutado. La cara interna está "
"recubierta de venas y extrañas protuberancias ganchudas."

#. ~ Snippet in category "chitin_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"A piece of a bug's exoskeleton.  Stringy lines of nervous tissue and blood "
"vessels still cling to the inner surface."
msgstr ""
"Un trozo del exoesqueleto de un insecto. Líneas fibrosas de tejido nervioso "
"y vasos sanguíneos todavía se aferran a la superficie interior."

#. ~ Snippet in category "endochitin_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"A piece of rigid, tube-shaped chitin from the inside of a giant bug.  It "
"seemed to be performing some kind of support role.  You're quite sure normal"
" insects don't have these."
msgstr ""
"Un trozo de quitina rígida, con forma de tubo, del interior de un bicho "
"gigante. Parecía estar realizando algún tipo de función de apoyo. Estás "
"bastante seguro de que los insectos normales no tienen esto."

#. ~ Snippet in category "endochitin_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"A long, flexible rod of chitin from inside a giant mutant bug.  It is laced "
"with blood vessels and chitinous nodules."
msgstr ""
"Una varilla larga y flexible de quitina del interior de un bicho mutante "
"gigante. Está repleta de vasos sanguíneos y nódulos quitinosos."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"As you peel away the outer shell, you find veins lining the chitin plates"
msgstr ""
"Al pelar la cáscara exterior, te encuentras las venas que recubren las "
"placas de quitina"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "With the creature dead, its carapace comes away surprisingly easily"
msgstr ""
"Con la criatura muerta, su caparazón se desprende con sorprendente facilidad"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"There's a thin membrane, much like skin, spread over the chitin of this "
"creature"
msgstr ""
"Hay una fina membrana, muy parecida a la piel, extendida sobre la quitina de"
" esta criatura"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Under the carapace of this mutant is a bristly, velcro-like material"
msgstr ""
"Bajo el caparazón de este mutante hay un material erizado, parecido al "
"velcro"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The anatomy concealed beneath seems almost like a small mammal given a shell"
" and twisted into the shape of an arthropod"
msgstr ""
"La anatomía que se esconde debajo parece casi un pequeño mamífero al que se "
"le ha dado un caparazón y se ha retorcido en forma de artrópodo"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "You crack the beast open like a horrific lobster"
msgstr "Abres a la bestia como una horrible langosta"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The chitin holds tight to the creature, and you need to snap and tear it "
"away, sawing at tough fibers beneath"
msgstr ""
"La quitina se adhiere fuertemente a la criatura, y hay que romperla y "
"desgarrarla, aserrando las duras fibras que hay debajo"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The moment you start cutting into the corpse, a few of what you thought were"
" extra legs detach and scurry off into the undergrowth"
msgstr ""
"En el momento en que empiezas a cortar el cadáver, algunas de las que creías"
" que eran patas extra se desprenden y se escabullen entre la maleza"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"For your first cut you connect the dozen openings on the creature's sides, "
"only to reveal a finger-sized wriggling grub in each"
msgstr ""
"Para tu primer corte conectas la docena de aberturas en los lados de la "
"criatura, sólo para revelar una larva del tamaño de un dedo en cada una"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Your work disturbs the parasites still clinging to the joints of the "
"creature, and a few size you up as a potential new home before scurrying "
"away"
msgstr ""
"Tu trabajo molesta a los parásitos que aún se aferran a las articulaciones "
"de la criatura, y algunos te consideran como un posible nuevo hogar antes de"
" huir"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Spaced evenly across the entire body you find small sacs of eggs in various "
"stages of growth"
msgstr ""
"Espaciados uniformemente por todo el cuerpo se encuentran pequeños sacos de "
"huevos en diferentes etapas de crecimiento"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Its intestines grew into a labyrinthine tangle, like so many worms devouring"
" each other"
msgstr ""
"Sus intestinos crecieron en una maraña laberíntica, como tantos gusanos "
"devorándose unos a otros"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Inside, half-formed organs press against spongy meat that doesn't look "
"anything like raw arthropod meat from normal creatures"
msgstr ""
"En el interior, los órganos a medio formar presionan contra una carne "
"esponjosa que no se parece en nada a la carne cruda de los artrópodos de las"
" criaturas normales"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Beneath, you find a collection of hooked spines that seem to have been "
"clasping it on somehow"
msgstr ""
"Debajo, se encuentra una colección de espinas enganchadas que parecen haber "
"sido sujetadas de alguna manera"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Inside is a complex, still-squirming mess of strange appendages and organs "
"that bear only a passing resemblance to any natural creature"
msgstr ""
"En tu interior hay un complejo y todavía retorcido lío de extraños apéndices"
" y órganos que sólo se parecen de pasada a cualquier criatura natural"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Beneath the chitin, the meat is covered in thick, bristly hair hiding a "
"chaotic bramble of half-formed, mutated organs"
msgstr ""
"Debajo de la quitina, la carne está cubierta de pelos gruesos y erizados que"
" esconden una caótica zarza de órganos mutantes a medio formar"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Inside is a tangled mess of organs and tissues that do not appear entirely "
"natural"
msgstr ""
"En tu interior hay una maraña de órganos y tejidos que no parecen del todo "
"naturales"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Inside the creature you find lungs, hearts, and intestines more like a "
"mammal than a giant bug"
msgstr ""
"En el interior de la criatura se encuentran pulmones, corazones e intestinos"
" más propios de un mamífero que de un bicho gigante"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Despite the apparent death of the whole, some organs still pump, beat, and "
"churn on undisturbed"
msgstr ""
"A pesar de la aparente muerte del conjunto, algunos órganos siguen "
"bombeando, latiendo y moviéndose sin ser manipulados"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_descriptive>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The meat inside gives off a horrifying stench, and seems to be covered in "
"thin damp hair, like a newborn animal gone horribly wrong"
msgstr ""
"La carne de tu interior desprende un hedor espantoso, y parece estar "
"cubierta de un fino pelo húmedo, como un animal recién nacido que ha salido "
"terriblemente mal"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_descriptive>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Small bundles of fiber break loose as you work, splitting open to reveal "
"twisted, half-formed copies of the creature itself"
msgstr ""
"Pequeños manojos de fibra se desprenden mientras trabajas, abriéndote para "
"revelar copias retorcidas y medio formadas de la propia criatura"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_descriptive>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"It is difficult to work, as the spongey tissue tears apart under your tools"
msgstr ""
"Es difícil de trabajar, ya que el tejido esponjoso se desgarra bajo tus "
"herramientas"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_descriptive>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Despite its outward appearance, both the organs and the endolymph of this "
"creature is pristinely white"
msgstr ""
"A pesar de su aspecto exterior, tanto los órganos como la endolinfa de esta "
"criatura son de un blanco impoluto"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_descriptive>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Some of your cuts meet nerves, and the already stiff corpse shudders with "
"movement each time"
msgstr ""
"Algunos de tus cortes se encuentran con los nervios, y el ya rígido cadáver "
"se estremece con el movimiento cada vez"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_descriptive>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"You follow what you think are superfluous veins into the deep, finding a "
"gorged, tick-like creature at their convergence"
msgstr ""
"Sigues lo que crees que son venas superfluas en las profundidades, "
"encontrando una criatura atiborrada de garrapatas en tu convergencia"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_descriptive>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Every cut reveals an organ you can't quite recognize, and you start to "
"wonder what your insides look like by now"
msgstr ""
"Cada corte revela un órgano que no puedes reconocer del todo, y empiezas a "
"preguntarte cómo son tus entrañas a estas alturas"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_descriptive>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"You are dizzied by the rainbow coloration of the creature's muscles, "
"clashing with the bloody mess in its guts"
msgstr ""
"Te marea la coloración del arco iris de los músculos de la criatura, que "
"choca con el desorden sangriento en sus tripas"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_descriptive>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"As you cut into its flesh you are disturbed by its sickly-sweet smell, like "
"fermenting fruit"
msgstr ""
"Al cortar su carne te molesta su olor enfermizo y dulce, como de fruta en "
"fermentación"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_descriptive>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"There are fist-sized globs of nervous tissue dotted about its insides, "
"sending the corpse into a spasm every time you touch one"
msgstr ""
"Hay globos de tejido nervioso del tamaño de un puño repartidos por su "
"interior, que hacen que el cadáver sufra un espasmo cada vez que se toca uno"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_general_descriptive>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The muscles grow stiff, and begin leaking a dark gray liquid that pools "
"around your feet"
msgstr ""
"Los músculos se ponen rígidos y comienzan a gotear un líquido gris oscuro "
"que forma un charco a tus pies"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Its legs contain no muscles, just sinews hanging in yellow-green ichor"
msgstr ""
"Sus piernas no tienen músculos, sólo tendones que cuelgan de un ichor "
"amarillo-verdoso."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The legs fall off easily, leaving the main body looking like an armored worm"
msgstr ""
"Las patas se desprenden fácilmente, dejando el cuerpo principal con el "
"aspecto de un gusano acorazado"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Each pair of legs is slightly different.  These end in hooks, the next in "
"talons like a bird's, there's a pair of chitinous tentacles"
msgstr ""
"Cada par de patas es ligeramente diferente. Estas terminan en ganchos, las "
"siguientes en garras como las de un pájaro, hay un par de tentáculos "
"quitinosos"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The mandibles keep snapping, and acrid-smelling venom wets the soil.  You "
"decide to begin your work at its tail"
msgstr ""
"Las mandíbulas siguen chasqueando, y el veneno de olor acre moja el suelo. "
"Decides comenzar tu trabajo en su cola"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"You're startled as its antenna whips out and briefly coils around your arm"
msgstr ""
"Te sorprendes cuando su antena se extiende y se enrosca brevemente alrededor"
" de tu brazo"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Underneath the surface, there are small plates of chitin dotted about, much "
"harder than the rest"
msgstr ""
"Bajo la superficie, hay pequeñas placas de quitina con puntos, mucho más "
"duras que el resto"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"On its tail end the segments get smaller and smaller, until they terminate "
"in a small copy of the head, looking backwards"
msgstr ""
"En su extremo de cola los segmentos se hacen cada vez más pequeños, hasta "
"que terminan en una pequeña copia de la cabeza, mirando hacia atrás"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The chitin of the head is caked in old blood and lymph of its previous "
"victims"
msgstr ""
"La quitina de la cabeza está empapada de sangre vieja y linfa de sus "
"víctimas anteriores"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_descriptive>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"You find vacuoles filled with its venom in the most unexpected nooks, "
"forcing you to work carefully"
msgstr ""
"Encuentras vacuolas llenas de su veneno en los rincones más inesperados, lo "
"que te obliga a trabajar con cuidado"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_descriptive>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The indescribable stench of the remains of its last meal make you question "
"your decision to butcher it"
msgstr ""
"El indescriptible hedor de los restos de su última comida te hace cuestionar"
" tu decisión de descuartizarlo"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_descriptive>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"On some organs you see the same swollen ulcers as around your own wounds.  "
"It seems not all of it is venom-proof"
msgstr ""
"En algunos órganos se ven las mismas úlceras hinchadas que alrededor de tus "
"propias heridas. Parece que no todo es a prueba de veneno"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_descriptive>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"This one's very blood stinks like its venom, and even the slightest drop "
"makes your skin itch"
msgstr ""
"La propia sangre de éste apesta como su veneno, e incluso la más mínima gota"
" hace que te pique la piel"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_descriptive>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"There is order to the chaos in this one.  Each segment's insides is a "
"perfect copy of the last, down to each sinew"
msgstr ""
"Hay orden en el caos en este caso. El interior de cada segmento es una copia"
" perfecta del anterior, hasta cada tendón"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_descriptive>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"This one smells disturbingly appetizing, like a memory of a childhood meal "
"whose details you forgot"
msgstr ""
"Este huele inquietantemente apetecible, como el recuerdo de una comida de la"
" infancia cuyos detalles has olvidado"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_mom>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"By the time you reach the rear of the matriarch, most of its offspring have "
"disappeared into the grass.  Some stuck around feeding on their unhatched "
"siblings, unwilling to give up the easy meal until the last moment"
msgstr ""
"Cuando llegas a la parte trasera de la matriarca, la mayoría de sus crías "
"han desaparecido en la hierba. Algunas se han quedado alimentándose de sus "
"hermanos no nacidos, sin querer renunciar a la comida fácil hasta el último "
"momento"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_mom>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The moment the matriarch grows still, the last third of its body flops to "
"the ground, letting go of dozens of eggs and small centipedes"
msgstr ""
"En el momento en que la matriarca se queda quieta, el último tercio de su "
"cuerpo cae al suelo, dejando escapar decenas de huevos y pequeños ciempiés"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_mom>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"After cleaning away the rotten meat and mess of eggs shrouding the "
"matriarch's hind segments, you find its carapace chewed open, and much of "
"its flesh already eaten by its ever-hungry young"
msgstr ""
"Después de limpiar la carne podrida y el amasijo de huevos que cubren los "
"segmentos traseros de la matriarca, encuentras su caparazón abierto a "
"mordiscos, y gran parte de su carne ya devorada por sus siempre hambrientas "
"crías"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_mom>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"As if they noticed the death of their mother, the dozens of centipedes still"
" clinging to it attack each other with a sudden frenzy.  You decide to give "
"them time to disperse before continuing"
msgstr ""
"Como si se hubieran dado cuenta de la muerte de su madre, las decenas de "
"ciempiés que aún se aferran a ella se atacan entre sí con un repentino "
"frenesí. Decides darles tiempo para que se dispersen antes de continuar"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_mega>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Since your tools barely have purchase on its carapace you decide to dig the "
"meat and viscera out from your first cut.  At times, you disappear up to "
"your waist in its armored insides"
msgstr ""
"Dado que tus herramientas apenas tienen compra en su caparazón, decides "
"desenterrar la carne y las vísceras de tu primer corte. A veces, desapareces"
" hasta la cintura en sus entrañas acorazadas"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_mega>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"As you cut more and more meat away, some of the resilient chitin plates fall"
" away with a loud squelch"
msgstr ""
"A medida que se corta más y más carne, algunas de las resistentes placas de "
"quitina se desprenden con un fuerte chirrido"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_mega>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"To bypass the armor you had to start your work by its mandibles, inches away"
" from its venom-coated fangs and the remains of chitin, bones, and strands "
"of Kevlar stuck between their points"
msgstr ""
"Para sortear la armadura había que empezar el trabajo por sus mandíbulas, cm"
" a cm desde sus colmillos recubiertos de veneno y los restos de quitina, "
"huesos y hebras de Kevlar pegados entre sus puntas"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_mega>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"This feels more like scrapping a car than butchering an animal.  Instead of "
"veins and legs you find yourself thinking about joints, panels, and cabling"
msgstr ""
"Esto se parece más a desguazar un coche que a descuartizar un animal. En "
"lugar de venas y piernas, te encuentras pensando en juntas, paneles y "
"cableado"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_mega>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"On closer inspection, the head's armor is pocked by finger-sized holes with "
"jagged edges, reminiscent of the creature's fangs"
msgstr ""
"En una inspección más cercana, la armadura de la cabeza está llena de "
"agujeros del tamaño de un dedo con bordes dentados, que recuerdan a los "
"colmillos de la criatura"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_centipede_mega>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"In a hidden organ without an obvious connection to the outside world, you "
"find a seemingly forgotten handful of glistening eggs"
msgstr ""
"En un órgano oculto sin conexión evidente con el mundo exterior, encuentras "
"un puñado aparentemente olvidado de huevos brillantes"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_ground_beetle_exterior>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"When you sever the vestigial wings, a spurt of mud-thick fluid gushes up and"
" every leg twitches"
msgstr ""
"Cuando cortas las alas vestigiales, un chorro de líquido espeso como el "
"barro brota y todas las piernas se agitan"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_ground_beetle_exterior>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Prying off the elytra is easier than you thought it would be, but a thicker "
"duplicate lies beneath, melted into the veiny wings"
msgstr ""
"Arrancar los élitros es más fácil de lo que pensabas, pero debajo hay un "
"duplicado más grueso, fundido en las alas venosas"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_ground_beetle_exterior>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"You hack off the legs, finding them surprisingly light once the knotted "
"veins within are drained"
msgstr ""
"Cortas las piernas, encontrándolas sorprendentemente ligeras una vez que las"
" venas anudadas dentro son drenadas"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_ground_beetle_exterior>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The thick chitin is difficult to saw through, and rooted so deeply in fat "
"that each panel you pull off comes with dangling ropes of sinew and grease"
msgstr ""
"La gruesa quitina es difícil de aserrar y está tan arraigada en la grasa que"
" cada panel que arrancas viene con cuerdas colgantes de tendones y grasa"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_ground_beetle_exterior>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Each leg bears too many hooks and outcrops to count, and they look far too "
"much like teeth for your liking"
msgstr ""
"Cada pata lleva demasiados ganchos y afloramientos para contarlos, y se "
"parecen demasiado a los dientes para tu gusto"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_ground_beetle_exterior>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The eyes are easily pulled loose, though with them spills out numerous "
"coiled ropes of nerve, sinew, and something halfway between"
msgstr ""
"Los ojos se desprenden fácilmente, aunque con ellos se derraman numerosas "
"cuerdas enrolladas de nervios, tendones y algo a medio camino de los "
"anteriores"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_ground_beetle_interior>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"A lattice of glossy tubes still holds the mound of foamy fat and organs in "
"place after the abdomen falls apart"
msgstr ""
"Un entramado de tubos brillantes sigue manteniendo el montículo de grasa "
"espumosa y los órganos en su sitio después de que el abdomen se caiga"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_ground_beetle_interior>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The head is occupied entirely by organic hydraulics wrapped in muscle, and "
"you dont find tangled strands of brain tissue until the thorax"
msgstr ""
"La cabeza está ocupada en su totalidad por hidráulica orgánica envuelta en "
"músculo, y no se encuentran hilos de tejido cerebral enredados hasta el "
"tórax"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_ground_beetle_interior>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"A fist-sized organ next to the chain of hearts still subtly throbs, and you "
"find broken shards of chitin inside it after a swift hacking"
msgstr ""
"Un órgano del tamaño de un puño junto a la cadena de corazones sigue "
"palpitando sutilmente, y encuentras fragmentos rotos de quitina en su "
"interior tras un rápido hachazo"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_ground_beetle_interior>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"You find a clutch of stillborn grubs inside, curled up in their parents "
"fatty innards with eggshells nearby"
msgstr ""
"Encuentras una nidada de larvas nacidas muertas en el interior, acurrucadas "
"en las entrañas grasas de sus padres con cáscaras de huevo cerca"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_ground_beetle_interior>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The reproductive organs of this beetle, sealed inside a chitin casket, have "
"coiled into a mockery of nature and bristle with half-developed eggs"
msgstr ""
"Los órganos reproductores de este escarabajo, sellados dentro de un ataúd de"
" quitina, se han enrollado en una burla de la naturaleza y se erizan con "
"huevos a medio desarrollar"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_ground_beetle_interior>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Something that looks like it belongs in an engine lies between the splayed "
"out lungs, and it sprays grease five paces when you puncture it"
msgstr ""
"Algo que parece pertenecer a un motor se encuentra entre los pulmones "
"extendidos, y rocía grasa a cinco pasos cuando lo pinchas"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_ground_beetle_mega>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"A small landslide of flesh and gristle buries you to the waist at one point,"
" and you could swear something was slithering near your ankles"
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño desprendimiento de carne y cartílago te entierra hasta la cintura"
" en un momento dado, y podrías jurar que algo se desliza cerca de tus "
"tobillos"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_ground_beetle_mega>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"When you grab one particularly bristled organ, it writhes and nearly escapes"
" your grasp before you can smash it.  You find developing wings in the paste"
msgstr ""
"Cuando agarras un órgano especialmente erizado, se retuerce y casi se te "
"escapa antes de que puedas aplastarlo. Encuentras alas en desarrollo en la "
"pasta"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_ground_beetle_mega>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"A much smaller second shell lies buried deep inside the beetle, an "
"entomological matryoshka that contains within itself… oh, fecal matter"
msgstr ""
"Un segundo caparazón mucho más pequeño yace enterrado en el interior del "
"escarabajo, una matrioska entomológica que contiene en su interior... oh, "
"materia fecal"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_ground_beetle_mega>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Chunks of meat, bone, and fabric inside one of the digestive tracts are "
"still easy to identify, and you wonder what their name was"
msgstr ""
"Trozos de carne, hueso y tela en el interior de uno de los tractos "
"digestivos siguen siendo fáciles de identificar, y uno se pregunta cuál era "
"su nombre"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_ground_beetle_mega>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"A bundle of gigantic wasp eggs is buried in the beast, but all are pierced "
"with wirey tubes draining nutrients and fluid from their fetal husks"
msgstr ""
"Un paquete de huevos de avispa gigantescos están enterrados en la bestia, "
"pero todos están perforados con tubos alámbricos que drenan nutrientes y "
"fluidos de sus cáscaras fetales"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_ground_beetle_mega>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"You finish up, coming to grips with the fact that toxins suffuse every inch "
"of the truckload of meat you just pulled from this mutant beetle"
msgstr ""
"Terminas, asimilando el hecho de que las toxinas impregnan cada centímetro "
"del camión de carne que acabas de sacar de este escarabajo mutante"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_flying_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The wings of this creature break apart upon the slightest touch into myriad "
"identical rainbow crystals"
msgstr ""
"Las alas de esta criatura se rompen al menor toque en una miríada de "
"cristales de arco iris idénticos"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_flying_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Even as the body grows still, the wings keep on beating slowly"
msgstr "Aunque el cuerpo se quede quieto, las alas siguen batiendo lentamente"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_flying_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "The chitin of this one is light and brittle, like an empty eggshell"
msgstr ""
"La quitina de éste es ligera y frágil, como una cáscara de huevo vacía"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_flying_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Where you came to expect smooth chitin you find exposed flesh, shot with a "
"web of hardened strands"
msgstr ""
"Donde esperabas una quitina lisa, encuentras carne expuesta, disparada con "
"una red de hebras endurecidas"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_flying_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "You cough as you inhale the fine, colorful dust shedded from the wings"
msgstr "Toses al inhalar el fino y colorido polvo desprendido de las alas"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_flying_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The carapace of this one still feels hot to the touch, especially around the"
" wings"
msgstr ""
"El caparazón de este todavía se siente caliente al tacto, especialmente "
"alrededor de las alas"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_flying_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"What you thought was shuddering chitinous fuzz on the creature's back is, in"
" reality, thousands of miniature copies of its main wings, flapping in "
"unison"
msgstr ""
"Lo que creías que era una temblorosa pelusa quitinosa en la espalda de la "
"criatura es, en realidad, miles de copias en miniatura de sus alas "
"principales, batiendo al unísono"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_flying_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "The wings are held in place by stiff muscles, reaching into the deep"
msgstr ""
"Las alas se mantienen en su lugar por medio de músculos rígidos, llegando a "
"lo más profundo"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_flying_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Underneath the chitin you find bundles of small, floating pearls, each held "
"in place by a single strand of sinew"
msgstr ""
"Debajo de la quitina se encuentran manojos de pequeñas perlas flotantes, "
"cada una de ellas sujeta por una sola hebra de tendón"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_flying_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Near its wings you find a black, bubbling organ still periodically emitting "
"a bundle of floating bubbles"
msgstr ""
"Cerca de sus alas se encuentra un órgano negro y burbujeante que sigue "
"emitiendo periódicamente un haz de burbujas flotantes"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_flying_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"As you open its intestines by mistake, you can barely pull your finger away "
"from the dozen snapping mandibles on its inside"
msgstr ""
"Al abrir sus intestinos por error, apenas puedes apartar el dedo de la "
"docena de mandíbulas que chasquean en su interior"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_flying_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The space not taken up by the now-familiar floating sacs is almost entirely "
"filled by a sticky, homogenous yellow jelly that seems to actively try to "
"avoid your knife"
msgstr ""
"El espacio que no está ocupado por los ya conocidos sacos flotantes está "
"casi totalmente ocupado por una gelatina amarilla pegajosa y homogénea que "
"parece tratar de evitar activamente tu cuchillo"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_flying_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The wings are rooted in its flesh by an almost transparent, fractal root "
"structure, making you question if it always belonged to the creature"
msgstr ""
"Las alas están arraigadas en su carne por una estructura de raíces casi "
"transparente y fractal, lo que hace que te preguntes si siempre perteneció a"
" la criatura"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_firefly>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "The light of its abdomen flickers with each cut, growing ever dimmer"
msgstr "La luz de su abdomen parpadea con cada corte, cada vez más tenue"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_firefly>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "An errant cut coats your tools with foul-smelling, glowing goop"
msgstr ""
"Un corte errante cubre tus herramientas con un pringue brillante de olor "
"nauseabundo."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_firefly>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"What you saw as a homogenous light from a distance was the result of myriad "
"strands of glowing chitin crisscrossing just beneath the carapace"
msgstr ""
"Lo que veías como una luz homogénea desde la distancia era el resultado de "
"una miríada de hilos de quitina brillante que se entrecruzaban justo debajo "
"del caparazón"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_firefly>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"This one's very flesh is glowing with a blinding intensity, lighting up your"
" gruesome work"
msgstr ""
"La propia carne de éste brilla con una intensidad cegadora, iluminando tu "
"horripilante trabajo"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_wasp_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "<bug_harvest_flying_chitin>"
msgstr "<bug_harvest_flying_chitin>"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_wasp_chitin>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_spider_chitin>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_acid_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "<bug_harvest_general_chitin>"
msgstr "<bug_harvest_general_chitin>"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_wasp_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Its chitin is sturdier than usual for the flying insects, and marked by the "
"struggles of its previous victims"
msgstr ""
"Su quitina es más resistente de lo habitual en los insectos voladores, y "
"está marcada por las luchas de sus anteriores víctimas"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_wasp_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The stripes on the back of its abdomen are warped into a nauseating spiral "
"you can't tear your eyes away from"
msgstr ""
"Las rayas de la parte posterior de su abdomen se deforman en una espiral "
"nauseabunda de la que no puedes apartar los ojos"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_wasp_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Upon closer inspection, the uniform black stripes reveal themselves to be "
"rows upon rows of glistening eyes"
msgstr ""
"Si se observan más de cerca, las rayas negras uniformes se revelan como "
"filas y filas de ojos brillantes"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_wasp_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"With each cut, the stinger springs from its sheath, tip bending ever so "
"slightly towards your leg"
msgstr ""
"Con cada corte, el aguijón sale de su vaina, la punta se dobla ligeramente "
"hacia tu pierna"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_wasp_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The stripes -so uniform at a distance- reveal themselves to be jagged, "
"strangely familiar patterns, like the cursive of an unknown language"
msgstr ""
"Las rayas -tan uniformes a distancia- se revelan como patrones dentados, "
"extrañamente familiares, como la cursiva de un idioma desconocido"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_wasp_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "<bug_harvest_flying_deeper>"
msgstr "<bug_harvest_flying_deeper>"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_wasp_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_spider_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_acid_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "<bug_harvest_general_deeper>"
msgstr "<bug_harvest_general_deeper>"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_wasp_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The chaotic bundle of organs in its torso look much like those of other "
"mutated insects, but as you near the abdomen there's order to the madness: "
"comparatively neat rows of venom-filled glands, each feeding into a "
"reservoir at the base of the stinger"
msgstr ""
"El caótico conjunto de órganos de su torso se parece mucho a los de otros "
"insectos mutados, pero a medida que te acercas al abdomen hay un orden en la"
" locura: filas comparativamente ordenadas de glándulas llenas de veneno, "
"cada una de las cuales se alimenta de un depósito en la base del aguijón"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_wasp_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "You open a stomach, releasing a gush of sweet-smelling gray fluid"
msgstr ""
"Abres un estómago, liberando un chorro de un fluido gris de olor dulce"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_wasp_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "For its apparent hunger for meat, its intestines seem almost atrophied"
msgstr ""
"Para su aparente hambre de carne, sus intestinos parecen casi atrofiados"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_wasp_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Your knife reaches the retracted stinger and slips on its smooth surface, "
"opening half a dozen venom glands in the process.  You dearly hope that you "
"have not cut yourself"
msgstr ""
"Tu cuchillo alcanza el aguijón retraído y se desliza sobre su superficie "
"lisa, abriendo media docena de glándulas de veneno en el proceso. Esperas "
"sinceramente no haberte cortado"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_wasp_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"You find a handful of dead grubs underneath its chitin, near a chewed-open "
"venom gland"
msgstr ""
"Encuentras un puñado de gusanos muertos debajo de su quitina, cerca de una "
"glándula de veneno masticada"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_wasp_queen>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Deep, deep within the dead queen you find a smooth, brightly colored plaque "
"the size of your fingernail, reading <number><number>"
msgstr ""
"Profundamente, en lo más profundo de la reina muerta se encuentra una placa "
"lisa y de colores brillantes del tamaño de la uña, en la que se lee "
"<number><number>"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_wasp_queen>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Some of the now-familiar venom glands also contain dozens of shiny white "
"eggs, undisturbed by their deadly surroundings"
msgstr ""
"Algunas de las ya conocidas glándulas venenosas también contienen docenas de"
" brillantes huevos blancos, imperturbables a su mortal entorno"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_wasp_queen>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"As you cut into its abdomen you disturb a handful of normal-sized, wingless "
"wasps clinging to a strange, tubular organ.  They crawl a few steps before "
"falling lifelessly to the ground"
msgstr ""
"Al cortarle el abdomen, se ve un puñado de avispas de tamaño normal y sin "
"alas que se aferran a un extraño órgano tubular. Se arrastran unos pasos "
"antes de caer sin vida al suelo"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_wasp_queen>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Some of the egg clusters are ransacked by fat, white worms tunneling blindly"
" through its flesh"
msgstr ""
"Algunos de los racimos de huevos son saqueados por gusanos gordos y blancos "
"que hacen túneles a través de su carne"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_spider_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The fangs spray a sickly green liquid to the ground when you touch them"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_spider_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"One of its eyes falls to the ground and shatters into a dozen jagged "
"splinters"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_spider_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The stiff hairs of its chitin seem to shift slightly, points reaching for "
"your skin"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_spider_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Your first few cuts only succeed in peeling back the upper, hairy layer of "
"chitin, leaving a glassy green carapace"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_spider_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"You hit a hard, scarred spot with your tool and reveal a cross-section of "
"chitin with hundreds of stripes, like the rings of a tree"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_spider_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The fangs are connected to fist-sized venom glands, still churning with life"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_spider_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The imposing mandibles give way to a surprisingly thin tube and atrophied "
"digestive track.  It must have done most of its digesting outside"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_spider_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"A huge reddish lump reveals itself to be a sort of lung with a deflating "
"noise.  You're blasted with hot air and droplets of hemolymph"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_spider_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Something not unlike a heart still spasms in the depth of the corpse, and "
"the legs twitch to its rhythm"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_acid_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Steaming puddles of acid spill from its outer shell as you pull it back"
msgstr ""
"Charcos humeantes de ácido se derraman de su cáscara exterior cuando se tira"
" hacia atrás"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_acid_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "Steaming acid burbles from the creature's chitin as you peel it back"
msgstr "El ácido humeante brota de la quitina de la criatura cuando la pelas"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_acid_chitin>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Several acid glands rupture as you peel back the carapace, sending streams "
"of steaming caustic fluids spraying around"
msgstr ""
"Varias glándulas ácidas se rompen al pelar el caparazón, enviando chorros de"
" fluidos cáusticos humeantes rociando alrededor"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_acid_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The organs themselves have an acrid odour, but don't seem as caustically "
"acidic as the outer shell"
msgstr ""
"Los propios órganos tienen un olor acre, pero no parecen tan cáusticamente "
"ácidos como la cubierta exterior"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_acid_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"You carefully avoid breaking through pockets of what you think may be acid-"
"secreting glands"
msgstr ""
"Evita cuidadosamente romper las bolsas de lo que cree que pueden ser "
"glándulas secretoras de ácido"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_acid_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Thick, ropey cords of tissue beneath its chitin protect an inner layer of "
"strange organs, resembling those of a bird more than anything"
msgstr ""
"Unas gruesas cuerdas de tejido bajo su quitina protegen una capa interna de "
"extraños órganos, que se parecen más a los de un pájaro que a cualquier otra"
" cosa."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_acid_descriptive>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "<bug_harvest_general_descriptive>"
msgstr "<bug_harvest_general_descriptive>"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_acid_descriptive>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The powerfully acidic vapors coming from the carcass make it hard to work"
msgstr ""
"Los vapores fuertemente ácidos que salen de la carcasa dificultan el trabajo"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_acid_descriptive>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The tissues of the creature are full of half-formed organs, their purpose "
"unclear"
msgstr ""
"Los tejidos de la criatura están llenos de órganos a medio formar, su "
"propósito no está claro"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<bug_harvest_acid_descriptive>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Several times, you nearly burn yourself piercing a concealed gland full of "
"acid"
msgstr ""
"Varias veces, casi te quemas perforando una glándula oculta llena de ácido"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<incubator_mammal>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The skin is so riddled with wounds that you barely need to cut to pull it "
"away."
msgstr ""
"La piel está tan plagada de heridas que apenas hay que cortar para "
"arrancarla."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<incubator_mammal>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The poor creature has stopped breathing, but there's still a lot of movement"
" in the corpse."
msgstr ""
"La pobre criatura ha dejado de respirar, pero todavía hay mucho movimiento "
"en el cadáver."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<incubator_mammal>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The larvae seem to have taken care to leave enough intact not to kill their "
"host, but the rest is practically hollow."
msgstr ""
"Las larvas parecen haber tenido cuidado de dejar lo suficiente intacto su "
"huésped para no matarlo, pero el resto está prácticamente vacío."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<incubator_mammal>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"You have to pause often to stomp on the slower grubs, who only now realized "
"that their home is growing cold."
msgstr ""
"Hay que detenerse a menudo para pisar a los gusanos más lentos, que sólo "
"ahora se han dado cuenta de que su hogar se está enfriando."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<incubator_mammal>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Its stomach is full of grubs even more malformed than the rest.  The runt of"
" the litter got recycled, it seems."
msgstr ""
"Su estómago está lleno de larvas aún más malformadas que el resto. El más "
"pequeño de la camada fue reciclado, parece."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<incubator_mammal>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"In the beginning you take care to separate parasite and host, but after a "
"while you give up and start cutting through."
msgstr ""
"Al principio te cuidaste de separar parásito y huésped, pero al cabo de un "
"tiempo se abandona y se empieza a cortar."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_outer>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The skin comes off with a sickening snap, and reveals a billion tiny black "
"tendrils grasping after it"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_outer>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"What you thought were black veins under the skin are actually some sort of "
"elastic net, snapping apart with a loud \"TWANG\" when your tool cuts them"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_outer>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"This one's skin consists of dozens of layers, each of slightly different "
"color, sandwiched between a gelatinous mass"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_outer>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"With every cut the creature shifts slightly, splayed limbs inching closer to"
" how it looked when it was…alive?  Whatever the right word is you hope it "
"stopped, if only for now"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_outer>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Whatever this is, it doesn't look dead so much as staying still.  You still "
"feel like it's looking at you, even as you cut it apart"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_inner>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The white flesh keeps quivering, grasping and pulling your tool occasionally"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_inner>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"There are no strange smells, no random organs strewn about its insides.  "
"Somehow that is more disconcerting than the mutated animals you took apart "
"until now"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_inner>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Even though it's made of something like flesh, you can't help but feel like "
"you're disassembling an intricate machine"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_inner>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Its parts don't want to stay apart, slowly moving to close your cuts.  You "
"resign yourself to removing every chunk and placing it on the ground beside "
"the corpse, where they finally grow still"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_inner>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Every so often your tool hits something bone-hard in the deep, but when you "
"cut there the second time the flesh parts smoothly"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_acid_outer>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_electric_outer>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "<zombie_amalgamation_outer>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_acid_outer>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The caustic buboes connect to a web of sickly green veins running down the "
"creature's limbs.  You take care not to nick them"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_acid_outer>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"You slip and tear into an acid gland and can't help but pause and watch as "
"the substance inside dissolves a good chunk of flesh before growing inert"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_acid_outer>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Its skin feels less flexible than usual, and coated in a greasy film on the "
"outside"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_acid_outer>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"A new, fist-sized green bubo emerges from your cut before your eyes, as if "
"it was waiting just below the surface.  You'll have to be careful"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_acid_inner>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_electric_inner>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "<zombie_amalgamation_inner>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_acid_inner>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"No organs beyond various sizes of the acid glands in neat rows, as if they "
"were replacement parts ready to deploy"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_acid_inner>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Your tool takes on a rainbow sheen from working in the creature's innards, "
"and seems to give off a thin smoke.  You might want to hurry"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_acid_inner>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The green veins stand out before the stark white background and there is a "
"hair-thin space surrounding each, as if the flesh was hesitant to touch "
"whatever is carried inside"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_electric_outer>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Sparks still dance around its limbs, and you're hesitant to start cutting"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_electric_outer>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"There is no movement from the body, but you can still hear a faint crackling"
" from inside"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_electric_outer>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Sparks dance between your tool and its skin, but disappear without any harm"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_electric_outer>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The skin is filled with tiny black crystals embedded in a dizzying fractal "
"pattern emanating from the central glowing organ"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_electric_inner>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Your smell ozone and burned hair as you hack the crackling corpse to pieces"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_electric_inner>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Most of its insides are taken up by the warped organ still humming with "
"electricity.  Cutting into it proves harder than expected, not the least "
"because of the sparks"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_amalgamation_electric_inner>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Finger-thick strands connect the glowing organ to the base of a limb, and "
"the normally white flesh is blackened along its path"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<arachnid_harvest>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "<bug_harvest_general_chitin>."
msgstr "<bug_harvest_general_chitin>."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<arachnid_harvest>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<centipede_harvest>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "<bug_harvest_general_chitin>.  <bug_harvest_general_deeper>."
msgstr "<bug_harvest_general_chitin>.<bug_harvest_general_deeper>,"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<arachnid_harvest>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"<bug_harvest_general_chitin>.  <bug_harvest_general_deeper>.  "
"<bug_harvest_general_descriptive>."
msgstr ""
"<bug_harvest_general_chitin>.<bug_harvest_general_deeper>.<bug_harvest_general_descriptive>."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<centipede_harvest>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "<bug_harvest_centipede_chitin>."
msgstr "<bug_harvest_centipede_chitin>."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<centipede_harvest>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"<bug_harvest_centipede_chitin>.  <bug_harvest_general_deeper>.  "
"<bug_harvest_centipede_descriptive>."
msgstr ""
"<bug_harvest_centipede_chitin>.<bug_harvest_general_deeper>.<bug_harvest_centipede_descriptive>."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<centipede_mom_harvest>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<centipede_mega_harvest>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "<centipede_harvest>"
msgstr "<centipede_harvest>"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<centipede_mom_harvest>"
#: data/json/snippets/mutant_anatomy.json
msgid "<centipede_harvest>  <bug_harvest_centipede_mom>."
msgstr "<centipede_harvest> <bug_harvest_centipede_mom>."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<centipede_mega_harvest>"
