#. ~ Snippet in category "tree_communion"
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "You picture yourself as one branch among many."
msgstr "Te imaginas a ti mismo como una rama entre muchas."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tree_communion"
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "New knowledge blooms within you."
msgstr "El nuevo conocimiento florece dentro de ti."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tree_communion"
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "The horizon beckons with promises of pollen."
msgstr "El horizonte te llama con promesas de polen."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tree_communion"
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "Your awareness grows in directions heretofore unknown."
msgstr "Tu conciencia crece en direcciones hasta ahora desconocidas."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tree_communion"
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "A tree falls in a forest, and you hear its sound."
msgstr "Un árbol cae en un bosque y escuchas su sonido."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tree_communion"
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "You feel the hum of untold biomass."
msgstr "Sientes el zumbido de una biomasa incalculable."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tree_communion"
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "A tingle of understanding runs from your roots and up your spine."
msgstr ""
"Un cosquilleo de comprensión corre desde tus raíces y sube por tu columna "
"vertebral."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tree_communion"
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "You gain new appreciation for the interconnectedness of life."
msgstr "Se obtiene una nueva apreciación de la interconexión de la vida."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tree_communion"
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "You ask, and the trees answer."
msgstr "Si preguntas, los árboles responden."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tree_communion"
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "You see the forest for the trees."
msgstr "Ves el bosque por los árboles."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tree_communion"
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid ""
"In the minute shifts and pivots of the trees, you hear the language of the "
"universe."
msgstr ""
"En los diminutos desplazamientos y pivotes de los árboles, se escucha el "
"lenguaje del universo."

