#. ~ Snippet in category "artisan_docs"
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid ""
"A collection of sketches and CAD designs marked up with a pencil.  They "
"depict a classic rifle and several diagrams of curved wooden maces.  The "
"word 'OBREZ?' is written clearly on the front sheet.  There are two distinct"
" sets of handwriting making notes."
msgstr ""
"Una colección de bocetos y diseños CAD marcados con un lápiz. Representan un"
" rifle clásico y varios diagramas de mazas de madera curvadas. La palabra "
"\"OBREZ?\" está escrita claramente en la primera hoja. Hay dos grupos "
"distintos de escritura en las notas."

#. ~ Snippet in category "artisan_docs"
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid ""
"A collection of sketches and CAD designs marked up with a pencil.  They "
"depict a large mace with an internal gas reservoir and venting holes between"
" the steel segments.  There are additional diagrams labeled 'IGNITION "
"SYSTEM' and 'TRIGGER?'.  There are two distinct sets of handwriting making "
"notes."
msgstr ""
"Una colección de bocetos y diseños CAD marcados con un lápiz. Representan "
"una gran maza con un depósito de gas interno y orificios de ventilación "
"entre los segmentos de acero. Hay diagramas adicionales etiquetados como "
"\"SISTEMA DE IGNICIÓN\" y \"¿Disparador?\". Hay dos grupos distintos de "
"escritura en las notas."

#. ~ Snippet in category "artisan_docs"
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid ""
"A collection of sketches and CAD designs marked up with a pencil.  They "
"depict a bladed weapon with some audio equipment implanted.  Doodles of hair"
" metal rock stars line the page, as well as the words 'LETS, HEAR IT FOR "
"FRANKY'.  There are two distinct sets of handwriting making notes."
msgstr ""
"Una colección de bocetos y diseños CAD marcados con un lápiz. Representan un"
" arma blanca con un equipo de audio implantado. En la página aparecen "
"garabatos de estrellas de rock de hair metal, así como las palabras \"LETS, "
"HEAR IT FOR FRANKY\". Hay dos grupos distintos de escritura en las notas."

#. ~ Snippet in category "artisan_docs"
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid ""
"A collection of sketches and CAD designs marked up with a pencil.  They "
"depict a sledgehammer with a moving center.  There is a references doc for a"
" powder actuated nail gun stapled to the sheets.  There are two distinct "
"sets of handwriting making notes."
msgstr ""
"Una colección de bocetos y diseños CAD marcados con un lápiz. Representan un"
" mazo con un centro móvil. Hay un documento de referencias para una pistola "
"de clavos accionada por pólvora grapada a las hojas. Hay dos grupos "
"distintos de escritura en las notas."

