"and don't wanna go back.\""
msgstr ""
"\"He encontrado una barra de chocolate en mi almohada al llegar a casa ayer "
"por la noche.  Me fui y no pienso regresar más.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"this demon thing came after me  it got me good  i shot it but i dont know "
"if ill make it\""
msgstr ""
"\"esta cosa del demonio vino después de mí, me puso bien, disparé pero no sé"
" si hace mal\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"DANNY IF YOU READ THIS THIS IS CLARA WE'RE ALL OKAY AND WE'RE HEADING TO "
"THE RIVER.  A BOAT SAID THEY WERE DOCKED NEARBY.\""
msgstr ""
"\"DANNY, SI LEES ESTO, SOY CLARA. ESTAMOS TODOS BIEN Y NOS DIRIGIMOS AL RÍO."
" UN BOTE ESTÁ ATRACADO CERCA.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"When I think of all the dead people I get mad, because I was supposed to "
"be the next big leader.  WHERES MY CHANCE!??\""
msgstr ""
"\"Cuando pienso en toda la gente muerta me pongo malo, porque se suponía que"
" iba a ser el próximo líder. ¿¿¡DÓNDE ESTÁ MI OPORTUNIDAD!??\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"A man in a black robe came up to me, said he wanted to make a deal…\""
msgstr ""
"\"Un hombre con una bata negra se me acercó, dijo que quería hacer un "
"trato...\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Cha-cha-cha-chia!  Saw a woman today, with fungus coming out her head like"
" hair tendrils.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Cha-Cha-Cha-chia!  Hoy vi a una mujer, con un hongo que le salía de la "
"cabeza como zarcillos de pelo.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"The damn Autodoc overrides wouldn't work and I didn't have my hospital ID."
"  I couldn't save them alone.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Las malditas anulaciones de Autodoc no funcionaban y no tenía mi "
"identificación del hospital. No pude salvarlos solo\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Save the cyborgs!  Please, whoever reads this, you must help them!  Knock "
"them out or deactivate them, I don't care how you do it.  But put their "
"unconscious body on that Autodoc and remove the chip that is messing up "
"their brain!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Salven a los cyborgs! Por favor, quienquiera que lea esto, ¡debe "
"ayudarlos! Noquéalos o desactívalos, no me importa cómo lo hagas. ¡Pero "
"pongan su cuerpo inconsciente en ese Autodoc y quítenles el chip que está "
"desordenando su cerebro!\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"\"Gotta slow down, man.  I don't think we spend more than 20% of our time "
"fightin',  Put some Marley on and take off that racketus tripcore nonsense, "
"man.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Para el carro, hombre. No creo que hayamos pasado más del 20% de nuestro "
"tiempo peleando. Pon un poco de Marley y dejémonos de tonterías, tío.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"I kept shooting with my handgun, but I never got any better!\""
msgstr "\"Seguí disparando con mi pistola, nunca tuve nada mejor.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"ITS OKEY GUYS!  I BARRYED A TIME CAPSUL IN MY BACKYARD!  I PUT IN SOME "
"HOEHOES.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡ESTÁ BIEN, CHICOS! ¡ENTERRÉ UNA CÁPSULA DEL TIEMPO EN EL PATIO DE MI "
"CASA! PUSE ALGUNOS HOEHOES.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I got my tinfoil hat on.  Good thing too, cause this monster was starrin "
"at me kinda funny, trying to freeze my mind in place.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Tengo puesto mi sombrero de papel de aluminio. Está bien esta cosa porque "
"este monstruo se quedaba mirándome de forma divertida, tratando de congelar "
"mi mente.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"You want my advice?  Smoke crack, it gets shit done.\""
msgstr "\"¿Quieres mi consejo? Fuma crack, consigue que la mierda se haga.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"ALWAYS WITH THE EFFICIENCY GUYS; YOURE ALWAYS WORKING TO GO HOME TO PAY "
"RENT TO SLEEP TO WAKE UP TO WORK AGAIN.  STOP\""
msgstr ""
"\"SIEMPRE CON LOS CHICOS EFICIENTES; ESTÁS SIEMPRE TRABAJANDO PARA IR LUEGO "
"A CASA, A PAGAR EL ALQUILER, A DORMIR, A DESPERTAR, IR AL TRABAJO DE NUEVO. "
"STOP\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"IM OFF TO THUNDERDOME, BYE SUCKERS.\""
msgstr "\"ESTOY FUERA DE LA CÚPULA DEL TRUENO, ADIÓS PRINGAOS.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"If you get a parasite, take some sand and some vodka.  Rub the sand into "
"the afflicted area, real good too; like you're washing your hair.  Then "
"rinse with vodka.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Si tienes un parásito, toma un poco de vodka y arena. Frota la arena en la"
" zona afligida realmente bien; como cuando te lavas el cabello. Luego "
"enjuaga con vodka.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"I put my toilet water into a gastank.  Then I poured it into a glass cup."
"  Then I drank it without vomiting my insides back into the toilet.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Puse mi agua de retrete en un tanque de gas. Después lo vertí en una taza "
"de cristal. Luego me lo bebí sin vomitar mis entrañas en el inodoro.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"This isn't real this is a test to turn you into a Manchurian Candidate!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Esto no es real, esto es una prueba para convertirte en un Candidato "
"Manchuriano.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"They're all hiding on an oil rig, I heard it myself over the AM airwaves."
"  They think they're the nobles of the 21st century, the prigs.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Se esconden en una plataforma petrolífera, he oído por mí mismo sobre las "
"ondas de radio de AM. Piensan que son los nobles del siglo XXI, los "
"presumidos.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Some of 'em are big.  Real big.  Don't stick around, I saw my mate get "
"fucking torn in half!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Algunos son regrandes. Muy grandes. No te quedes parado, ¡a un amigo lo "
"partieron al medio!\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"po p y fl ow er s don t ea at them\""
msgstr "\"flo r es de a ma po la no te las co omas\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Some guy is walking through the horde without a scratch.  Please tell me "
"they're docile now.  Please fucking tell me.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Un tipo está caminando a través de la horda sin recibir ni un rasguño. Por"
" favor, dime que ahora son dóciles. Dímelo, joder.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"Why are all the lawnmowers broken?!\""
msgstr "\"¡¿Por qué están rotas todas las cortadoras de cesped?!\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Some bridges, they're right next to each other, right?  If you see "
"something up ahead one of those, just careen through to the other side.  My "
"van was long enough to bridge right across!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Algunos puentes, están uno al lado del otro, ¿no? Si ves algo en uno, salí"
" rápidamente para el otro lado. ¡Mi camioneta era lo suficientemente larga "
"para poder cruzar!\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"BURN BURN BURN BURN BURN ALL BURN ALL BURN ALL BURN\""
msgstr ""
"\"QUÉMENSE QUÉMENSE QUÉMENSE QUÉMENSE QUÉMENSE TODOS QUÉMENSE TODOS QUÉMENSE"
" TODOS QUÉMENSE\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"I took all the supplies.  Don't follow me.  I'm sorry, man.  I have to "
"look out for myself now.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Me llevé todos los suministros. No me sigas. Perdoname, che. Tengo que "
"cuidarme.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"My next-door neighbor had a katana in his basement!\""
msgstr "\"¡El vecino de al lado tenía una katana en el sótano!\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"Am I the last one alive?\""
msgstr "\"¿Soy el único que queda vivo?\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"Boyfriend stole my pistol while I was asleep.  I locked him in the "
"bathroom and set the house on fire.  At least he attracted their "
"attention.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Mi novio se robó mi pistola cuando estaba durmiendo. Lo encerré en el baño"
" y prendí fuego a la casa. Por lo menos, ahora consiguió llamarles la "
"atención.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"I get air conditioners, but… this whole place is frozen to ice!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Tengo aire acondicionado, pero... ¡todo este lugar está congelado a bajo "
"cero!\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"A wood ax works pretty well against them.  So does a machete, but you "
"can't cut down a tree.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Un hacha de madera va bastante bien contra ellos. También un machete, pero"
" no puedes cortar un árbol con el.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"Why would you hide in a farm?  Sure, it's isolated, but if they know where"
" you are, you don't exactly have cover on all sides.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Para qué te vas a esconder en una granja? Claro, está alejada, pero si "
"encuentran dónde estás, no estás bien cubierto por los lados.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"Imagine if this spread to, like, Australia.  Zombie kangaroos.  Haha…\""
msgstr ""
"\"Imagina si esto se extendiera a, por ejemplo, Australia. Canguros zombis. "
"Haha...\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"how DO I use THESE bionic THINGS?  I just STUCK the wires IN my WRIST and "
"now I CAN'T STOP twitching.  AND now my LEG hurts!  Is THAT acid?!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Cómo USO estas COSAS biónicas? Ya me METÍ los cables EN la MUÑECA y ahora"
" NO PUEDO parar de retorcerme. ¡Y me duele la PIERNA! ¡¿ESO es ácido?!\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I tried playing memorial music for my dead brother, on a radio.  They must"
" have been attracted to it.  I can't see his grave through the crowd "
"anymore.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Quise pasar música para recordar a mi hermano muerto, en la radio. Eso los"
" debe haber atraído. Ya no puedo ver su tumba por entre la horda.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Took a picture of a dead dog leaping right onto a soldier.  Sweet fucking "
"shot!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Saqué una foto de un perro muerto saltándole encima a un soldado. ¡Una "
"jodida delicia de foto\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"Gas mask is nice and all, but I can hardly run with it on.\""
msgstr ""
"\"La máscara de gas está buena y qué sé yo, pero casi no puedo correr con "
"esto puesto.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"They set up the roadblock guns to run automatically.  TV said those fuckin"
" things needed a human to keep em safe, they ain't safe now.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Configuraron las armas de bloqueo de carreteras para que funcionaran "
"automáticamente. La televisión dijo que esas malditas cosas necesitaban un "
"humano para mantenerlas a salvo, ellos ya no están a salvo ahora.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"The evac shelters are a death trap.  They took everyone else away but "
"something in the driver's eyes told me not to go.  Now it's just me.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Los refugios de evacuación son una trampa mortal. Se llevaron a todos los "
"demás, pero algo en los ojos del conductor me dijo que no fuera. Ahora sólo "
"soy yo\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I made mushroom babies.  My arms hurt.  I hurt.  I had mushroom babies.  "
"They are growing now.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Hice bebés de hongos. Me duelen los brazos. Me duelo. Tengo bebés hongos. "
"Ahora están creciendo.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"It doesn't matter how you die.  You're gonna turn into one of them.\""
msgstr "\"No importa cómo te mueras. Igual, te vas a convertir en uno de ellos.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"WHY DO ALL THE DEAD CHILDREN GO TO SCHOOL\""
msgstr "\"POR QUÉ TODOS LOS NIÑOS MUERTOS VAN A LA ESCUELA\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"Don't keep your goddamn casings!  They'll just weigh you down.\""
msgstr "\"¡No te quedes con las casquillos de mierda! Te van pesar un montón.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Local auto shop is full of the things.  And to think I worked with them on"
" repairing cars… now they're just… fucking corpses.\""
msgstr ""
"\"La tienda de autos local está llena de cosas. Y pensar que trabajé con "
"ellos en la reparación de coches... ahora son sólo... malditos cadáveres.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"DON'T EAT THE SLIME DON'T EAT THE SLIME DON'T EAT THE SLIME\""
msgstr ""
"\"NO TE COMAS LOS LÉGAMOS NO TE COMAS LOS LÉGAMOS NO TE COMAS LOS LÉGAMOS\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I used to be human.  But… my arms… they are like tentacles.  I slither "
"along akin to a snail and I shed my feathers every day.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Yo solía ser humano. Pero... mis brazos... son como tentáculos. Me deslizo"
" como un caracol y me despojo de mis plumas todos los días.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Killed a giant worm thing, but now I'm only three feet tall.  Should've "
"just left the damn worm alone, now none of my clothes fit!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Maté una cosa gusano gigante, pero ahora sólo mido un metro de altura. "
"¡Debí dejar al maldito gusano en paz, ahora ninguna ropa me queda bien!\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"I don't have enough time to double tap.  You don't either.\""
msgstr "\"No tengo tiempo para hacer un doble tap. Tú tampoco lo tienes.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"PINK TALL ONES RUN RUN RUN RUN RUN\""
msgstr "\"ALTOS ROSAS CORRÉ CORRÉ CORRÉ CORRÉ CORRÉ\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"Are they still human inside?\""
msgstr "\"¿Todavía son humanos en su interior?\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"the eye it watches me it follows me everywhere help\""
msgstr "\"el ojo me mira me sigue a todos lados ayuda\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"tHE Portal it's so COld\""
msgstr "\"eL Portal está tan FRío\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"GOD CAN'T SAVE US\""
msgstr "\"DIOS NO NOS PUEDE SALVAR\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"SHOOT YOURSELF, LET IT END QUICKLY\""
msgstr "\"PEGATE UN TIRO, HACÉ QUE TERMINE TODO RÁPIDO\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"There are five basic rules to survival.  One, stay prepared and watchful."
"  Two, keep your iron sights lined up or succumb.  Three, stay FAR WAY from "
"all\""
msgstr ""
"\"Hay cinco reglas básicas de supervivencia. Una, preparado y atento. Dos, "
"mantener la vista fija o sucumbir. Tres, mantente MUY LEJOS de todos.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"The bricks of this bathroom look like a face.  Haha… it's all I can focus "
"on.  At least let me shit before you break down the door.  Please…\""
msgstr ""
"\"Los ladrillos de este baño parecen una cara. Jaja... es todo en lo que "
"puedo concentrarme. Por lo menos déjame cagar antes de que derribes la "
"puerta. Por favor...\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"What the hell are they mining for in these shafts?\""
msgstr "\"¿Qué mierda están buscando en estas minas?\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"I am one with the plants.\""
msgstr "\"Me consustancie con las plantas.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"Broadsword!  Yeah!\""
msgstr "\"¡Espada ancha! ¡Sí!\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"If you see a trail of dirt getting displaced in your direction… run.  Run "
"for your life.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Si ves un rastro de suciedad desplazándose en tu dirección... corre. Corre"
" por tu vida\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"DINT ATE THE MUSHROM\""
msgstr "\"NO COMI EL HOGNO\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"Libraries are useless after the apocalypse.\""
msgstr "\"Las bibliotecas son útiles después del apocalipsis.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I swear to God I've seen these plant things before!  In a book, or "
"something!  I swear…\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Juro por Dios que he visto estas plantas antes! ¡En un libro, o algo así!"
" Juro...\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"Is robbing a bank easier or harder now that all the guards are undead?\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Robar un banco es más fácil o más difícil con los guardias siendo muertos"
" vivientes?\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"Make sure your car is REALLY stopped before you get out.\""
msgstr "\"Asegúrate de que el coche haya frenado TOTALMENTE antes de bajarte.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I found some kind of stone pyramid with spikes.  I feel… I feel like I'm "
"being watched.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Encontré una especie de pirámide de piedra con púas. Siento... siento que "
"estoy siendo observado\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"Why would you ever hide in a damn gun store?  The owner… he was a moron "
"alright.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Por qué te esconderías en una maldita armería? El dueño... era un idiota,"
" vale.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"THEY DON'T feel ANYTHING\""
msgstr "\"ELLOS NO sienten NADA\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"What was the government doing, anyway?\""
msgstr "\"¿Qué estaba haciendo el gobierno, de todos modos?\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Is that one pharmaceutical company gonna come out with a, like, cure for "
"this anytime soon?\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Esa compañía farmacéutica va a desarrollar una cura para esto dentro de "
"poco tiempo?\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"THE MARLEY WAS RIGHT\""
msgstr "\"EL MARLEY TENÍA RAZÓN\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Squeeze some ammonia into zombie flesh and hold it tight.  You smell like "
"one of them!  I think.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Estruja un poco de amoníaco con carne de zombi y pulsa fuerte. ¡Vas a "
"tener el mismo olor que ellos! Creo.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I thought my damn terminal cancer was bad enough… now the dead are "
"rising?!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Pensé que mi maldito cáncer terminal era lo suficientemente malo... "
"¡¿Ahora los muertos se están levantando?!\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"THE GOO IS IN THE WATER DON'T DRINK WATER\""
msgstr "\"LA VISCOSIDAD ESTÁ EN EL AGUA NO TOMES EL AGUA\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"Don't let the ember go out please don't go out I need you precious fire.\""
msgstr ""
"\"No dejes que las brasas salgan, por favor no salgas. Necesito tu precioso "
"fuego.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"Everyone used their gas to get to another town… but it's the same story "
"everywhere.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Todos usaron su gasolina para llegar a otro pueblo... pero es la misma "
"historia en todas partes.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"There's still an evacuation point at Concord, spread the word.\""
msgstr "\"Todavía hay un punto de evacuación en Concord, corran la voz\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"STAY AWAY FROM CONCORD\""
msgstr "\"ALEJENSE DE CONCORD\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"Most things can be taken out with a shotgun.  More things can be taken out"
" with a grenade.  Imagine what a mini-nuke does.\""
msgstr ""
"\"La mayoría de las cosas se pueden solucionar con una escopeta. Y más cosas"
" se pueden solucionar con una granada. Imaginate lo que hacen las minibombas"
" nucleares.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Come to the bar if you see this, let's re-enact a zombie movie, friends.\""
msgstr "\"Ve al bar si lees esto, vamos a recrear una película de zombis.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"They are NOT slow!  They are NEVER slow!\""
msgstr "\"¡NO son lentos! ¡NUNCA son lentos!\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"I had a phobia of bees BEFORE they grew to enormous sizes.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Le tenía miedo a las abejas ANTES de que crecieran a esos tamaños "
"enormes.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"Your backpack's gonna weigh you down in the water.  Hell, feel free to get"
" naked.  Nobody's going to judge your modesty.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Tu mochila te va a hundir en el agua. Así que a la mierda, siéntete libre "
"de nadar en bolas. Nadie te va a juzgar.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"Guns too loud.  Crossbow too long.  Running is best.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Las armas hacen mucho ruido. Las ballestas son lentas. Lo mejor es "
"correr.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#, no-c-format
msgid "\"99.9% dead?  I'd like to see a million zombies on Wall Street.\""
msgstr ""
"¿\"99,9% de muertos\"? Me gustaría ver un millón de zombis en Wall Street\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"Crawled in through the vents.  Whole office building is infested.\""
msgstr "\"Se metieron por la ventilación. Todo el edificio está infestado.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Don't shoot the people who get bit!  It's OK!  Death is the only thing "
"that makes you turn!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡No le dispares a la gente que fue mordida! ¡Están bien! ¡La muerte es lo "
"único que te hace convertirte!\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Check your friends for bites, don't let them hide it and turn on you.  "
"Only way out is to shoot em in the head.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Revisa a tus amigos en busca de mordeduras, no dejes que lo escondan y se "
"vuelvan contra ti. La única salida es dispararles en la cabeza\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Zombies, walkers, dead ones, undead, reanimated, zed, animata, biters.  "
"Did I miss any?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Zombis, caminantes, muertos, muertos vivientes, reanimados, zetas, "
"animata, mordedores. ¿Me falta alguno?\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"All I've got is this keg of beer and an appetite.  Come at me, "
"apocalypse!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Todo lo que me queda es este barril de cerveza y hambre. ¡Vení, "
"apocalipsis!\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"My cousin says that murder nowadays is just a war crime.  War for what, I "
"don't know, since the undead seem to be rebels without a cause.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Mi primo dice que por estos días, el asesinato es un crimen de guerra. "
"Guerra sobre qué, no sé, los muertos vivientes parecen rebeldes sin causa.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"SWAMPS RUN SWAMPS NO SWAMPS RUN\""
msgstr "\"PANTANOS CORRÉ PANTANOS NO PANTANOS CORRÉ\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"They said a walking cane was a useless weapon… but then I hit one of them "
"with it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Dijeron que un bastón para caminar era un arma inútil... ...pero luego "
"golpeé a uno de ellos con él.\"\"Dijeron que un bastón para caminar era un "
"arma inútil... ...pero luego golpeé a uno de ellos con él.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"River water around these parts is extremely safe.  Probably more safe than"
" the damn tap water at this point.\""
msgstr ""
"\"El agua del río en estos lugares es extremadamente confiable. "
"Probablemente, ahora sea más segura que el agua de mierda del grifo.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"DON't bomB THe PORtals it MAKES iT WORSE\""
msgstr "\"NO le PonGAS BomBAS a los PORtales es PEOR\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"No wonder all the camps got overrun, they kept a goddamn zombie test "
"subject!  Each and every one of 'em!\""
msgstr ""
"\"No me sorprende que todos los campamentos hayan sido invadidos, ¡mantenían"
" a un zombi de mierda para estudiarlo! ¡Todos los campamentos!\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"I just realized how damn demented those fliers are.\""
msgstr "\"Me acabo de dar cuenta que tan demenciales son esos folletos.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"I propose a new currency: 9mm.\""
msgstr "\"Yo propongo una nueva moneda: el 9mm.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"My skin is crawling and I teleport every few minutes… what is going o\""
msgstr ""
"\"Mi piel se mueve y me teletransporto cada pocos minutos ... que está "
"pasando\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"You can't see them through the smoke but they can't either.\""
msgstr "\"No los puedes ver a través del humo pero ellos tampoco te ven.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"There's gotta be a better use of all this rebar…\""
msgstr "\"Tiene que haber un mejor uso de todas estas barras corrugadas...\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"met schoolhouse of people, all crazy and mad they were, ate killed all of "
"them, yum\""
msgstr ""
"\"encontré escuela de gente, todos locos y rayados estaban, comí maté a "
"todos, rico\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"STAY AWAY FROM THE BIG ONES IN THE FOREST\""
msgstr "\"NO TE ACERQUES A LOS GIGANTES DEL BOSQUE\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"got into a prison with a halligan bar.  makes me wonder how they kept "
"prisoners inside\""
msgstr ""
"\"me metí en una cárcel con una barra halligan. me hace pensar en cómo "
"mantenían a los presos adentro\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"This thing isn't a car any more.  It's just a fucking mountain of metal on"
" wheels, which I live in.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Esta cosa ya no es un coche. Es una montaña de metal de mierda con ruedas,"
" en la que vivo.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Anyone else seen those really… SQUARE-looking towns?  I don't think "
"they're normal.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Alguien más ha visto esos pueblos de aspecto realmente... cuadrado? No "
"creo que sean normales\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"big z threw me on top of the building, legs broken but at least im safe "
"for a few more minutes\""
msgstr ""
"\"'Big Z' me tiró en la parte superior del edificio, tengo las piernas rotas"
" pero al menos estoy seguro por unos minutos más\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I'm starting to feel bad about disabling all these turrets and stealing "
"their ammunition.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Estoy empezando a sentirme mal sobre la desactivación de estas torretas y "
"robar sus municiones\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"Make sure you strip the house for all available resources-- tubes, pipes, "
"ceramics, sheets, strings, and more\""
msgstr ""
"«Asegúrate de desmontar la casa para encontrar todos los recursos "
"disponibles-- tubos, cerámicas, chapas, cuerdas y más»"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"FUCK FAUX-MUTANTS, BEING 'EXTREMELY THIRSTY' DOES NOT COUNT\""
msgstr "\"PUTOS MUTANTES FALSOS, ESTAR 'EXTREMADAMENTE SEDIENTO' NO CUENTA\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"There's nothing wrong with eating people if you HAVE to.  I mean, I only "
"did it because I didn't want to waste my potato chips!\""
msgstr ""
"\"No hay nada de malo en comerse a la gente si TIENES que hacerlo. O sea, "
"sólo lo hice porque no quería perder mis patatas fritas\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"all these fuckin eyebots really take the piss out of kops\""
msgstr "\"todos estos malditos ojobots se burlan de los policías\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"CHINA DID THIS\""
msgstr "\"CHINA HIZO ESTO\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"RUSSIA DID THIS\""
msgstr "\"RUSIA HIZO ESTO\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Thank You RivTech.  Thank You For Good Coffee.  Will Always Stay Awake For"
" You Rivtech.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Gracias RivTech. Gracias por el buen café. Siempre permanecerás despierto "
"por RivTech.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"See, now I'm just not sure where I'm putting all these storage batteries "
"in my body!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Ves, ahora no estoy seguro donde estoy poniendo todas estas pilas en mi "
"cuerpo!\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"dont try to leave they will shoot you\""
msgstr "\"no trates de irte porque te dispararán\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I'd like to thank my high-school culinary arts class for teaching me how "
"to make RDX and mutagenic serum.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Me gustaría dar las gracias a mi instituto en la clase de artes culinarias"
" por enseñarme cómo hacer RDX y suero mutágeno.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"Makayla Sanchez burned down my fucking house\""
msgstr "\"Makayla Sánchez fue quemada en mi puta casa\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"he calls himself the 'man with the hands', don't approach\""
msgstr "\"se llama a sí mismo 'hombre con manos', no te acerques\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"So… what happens if the military rescues us?  We're all freaks by now, "
"right?  How the fuck are we gonna go back to real life?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Entonces... ¿qué pasa si los militares nos rescatan? Ya somos todos unos "
"raros, ¿verdad? ¿Cómo coño vamos a volver a la vida real?\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Not sure if my companion WANTED to turn into a bird, but I was the one "
"giving her the serum, and I saved her life!  That's fair, right?\""
msgstr ""
"\"No estoy seguro si mi compañero QUERÍA convertirse en un ave, pero fue "
"darle el suero, ¡y le salvé la vida! Es justo, ¿no?\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"I've never been very confident, is that why my shots keep missing?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Nunca he sido muy confiado, ¿es por eso que fallan todos mis disparos?\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"FIRE BAD.  NOW NAKED.  PLEASE HELP.\""
msgstr "\"EL FUEGO ES MALO. AHORA DESNUDO. POR FAVOR AYÚDENME.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Heard of a place up in Maine where people have their shit together.  "
"Hundreds of people, defense, food and shelter… let's go raid it, guys!\""
msgstr ""
"\"He oído hablar de un lugar en Maine donde la gente tiene sus cosas en "
"común. Cientos de personas, defensa, comida y refugio... ¡vamos a asaltarlo,"
" chicos!\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"KASHWAK: NO-FO\""
msgstr ""
"\"KASHWAK: NO-FO\" (una referencia a que Kashwak no tiene servicio "
"telefónico)"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"The whispering fog is taking me in like a blanket.  I'm warm now.  I'm "
"finally\""
msgstr ""
"\"La neblina susurrante me atrapa como una manta. Estoy caliente ahora. Me "
"siento bien\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"got a video recording of hour one when the portals were still up.  pretty "
"cool\""
msgstr ""
"\"Conseguí una grabación de video de la hora en la que los portales todavía "
"estaban allí. Precioso\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Stuck here.  Zombies outside.  Friends were outside too, now they're part "
"of zombies.  Need to be quiet\""
msgstr ""
"\"Atrapado aquí. Zombis afuera. Mis amigos estaban afuera, ahora son parte "
"de los zombis. Necesito estar callado\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"if anyones reading this, please tell my mom i was right about insects "
"being superior\""
msgstr ""
"\"si alguien lee esto, por favor, decir a mi mamá que tenía razón acerca de "
"que los insectos son superiores\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Diamond coated sword!  Diamond coated hammer!  Diamond coated clothes!  "
"Diamond coated hands help\""
msgstr ""
"\"Espada recubierta de diamante. Martillo recubierto de diamante. Ropa "
"recubierta de diamante. Las manos recubiertas de diamante ayudan.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"waded through 14 miles of sewage for playboy magazine, wasnt worth it\""
msgstr ""
"\"me metí a través de 14 millas de aguas residuales por una revista Playboy,"
" no valió la pena\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"I'm coming back for this note in twelve hours.  If I don't, take all my "
"shit!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Vuelvo a por esta nota en doce horas. Si no lo consigo, coge toda mi "
"mierda.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"all my friends died when they came near me.  there's nothing funny about "
"that\""
msgstr ""
"\"todos mis amigos murieron cuando estaban cerca de mí. no hay nada de "
"divertido en ello\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"DOG NOT REAL DOG\""
msgstr "\"EL PERRO NO ES UN PERRO REAL\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"This is all just a dream, right??!  I'M GOING TO WAKE UP, SHE'S GOING TO "
"BE OK\""
msgstr ""
"\"Todo esto es sólo un sueño, ¿verdad? VOY A DESPERTAR, ELLA VA A ESTAR "
"BIEN\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"wek ik spak\""
msgstr "\"wek ik spak\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"IT'S BURIED!  THE TEMPLE IS BURIED!\""
msgstr "\"¡ESTÁ ENTERRADO! ¡EL TEMPLO ESTÁ ENTERRADO!\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"If I had a dollar for every cash card I've found, I'd have more money than"
" is on these stupid things!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Si tuviera un dólar por cada tarjeta de crédito que he ido encontrando, "
"tendría más dinero que esas cosas estúpidas!\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"can never have enough Kevlar.  basically just live in a Kevlar turtle "
"shell.\""
msgstr ""
"\"nunca puedes tener suficiente Kevlar. básicamente vive en un caparazón de "
"tortuga hecho de Kevlar.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"MY GLITTERING SNAKE COMPELS YOU!  OBEY!\""
msgstr "\"¡MI SERPIENTE BRILLANTE TE OBLIGA! ¡OBEDÉCELA!\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"can sunstasin self frorever off fof my funggnaloid babiues oout fo yme "
"arms eat themm up eatbtb my chidlldren\""
msgstr ""
"\"Puedes creer que mis bebés fungaloides salen de mis brazos para luego "
"comérmelos y así tener más hijos\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Gonna settle down one day.  Nice big orchard, couple of friends/future "
"family to spend time with, and a nice system of fortifications to keep us "
"safe.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Algún día me estableceré. Un buen huerto, un par de amigos/futura familia "
"con la que pasar el tiempo y un buen sistema de fortificaciones para "
"mantenernos a salvo.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"a ctulaly don t mi nd  t he cold it   s  f i ne in h ere  nn    o "
"problem\""
msgstr ""
"\"no me preo-cupa el frí-o act-ualme-nte, se está bi-en en est-e lug-ar, "
"ning-ún problema\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"tried to shoot myself but the nanobots fixed it, fucked up the controls, "
"now i can't turn them off i just want it to be over\""
msgstr ""
"\"he intentado dispararme a mí mismo pero los nanobots me arreglan, jodiendo"
" los controles. ahora no puedo apagarme, solo quiero que termine esto\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Tried wearing dead zombie clothes, but they still knew I was alive!  It's "
"like they're a hivemind, man!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Traté de vestir con ropas de zombi muerto, pero aún sabían que estaba "
"vivo! ¡Es como si leyeran mi mente, tío!\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"riddle.  what's 1/4 feathers, 1/4 scales, 1/4 metal, and 1/4 flesh?  "
"answer: sorry, but you should know this one.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Enigma. ¿Qué son 1/4 de plumas, 1/4 de escamas, 1/4 de metal y 1/4 de "
"carne? Respuesta: lo siento, pero tú deberías saberlo. \""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"For anyone that's reading this, I just want to confirm (FROM AN UNBIASED "
"SOURCE) that it was NOT the scientists' fault.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Para cualquier persona que lea esto, sólo quiero confirmar (DESDE UNA "
"FUENTE IMPARCIAL) que NO fue culpa de los científicos.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"We're the eagle-eyes in the sky!  Just two mutant avians in our "
"helicopter!  Filming the Cataclysm!  Check us out on any working "
"electronics!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Somos los ojos de águila en el cielo! ¡Dos aves mutantes en nuestro "
"helicóptero! ¡Filmando el cataclismo! ¡Compruébalo en cualquier aparato "
"electrónico!\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"WE'RE GOING TO SAIL TO CANADA, BITCHES!\""
msgstr "\"¡VAMOS A NAVEGAR HACIA CANADÁ, ZORRAS!\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"Anyone hear about that guy who tried to sail his family to Canada?  What a"
" moron, right?\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Alguien ha oído hablar sobre un tío que ha intentado navegar con su "
"familia a Canadá? Vaya idiota, ¿verdad?\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"recently canadian border has gotten more dangerous don't go there\""
msgstr ""
"\"la reciente frontera canadiense se ha vuelto más peligrosa, no vayas "
"allí\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"Hey, what happened to my dad's airboat?!\""
msgstr "\"Eh, ¿Qué ha pasado con el bote neumático de mi padre?\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"Reading is good!  Never stop reading.  Read EVERYTHING.\""
msgstr "\"¡Leer es bueno! Nunca dejes de leer. Lee TODO.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"I'm gonna be honest here, I'm really gonna die soon so I dont want to gt "
"forgnottedn ples dont forntget me y nrmmy name is h@@hbhbh\""
msgstr ""
"\"Voy a ser honesto aquí, realmente voy a morir pronto por lo que no quiero "
"quer seh molvidedn, porg favord no meg olvidesh, mi nombre es h@@hbhbh\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"all it takes to seal a wound is a sawblade and a match!  trust me\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Todo lo que se necesita para cauterizar una herida es una hoja de sierra "
"y una cerilla! Confía en mí\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I wonder what's in this sarcophagus?  Maybe it's a real sarcophagus.  "
"Maybe there's a big guy named God under here.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Me pregunto, ¿qué habrá en este sarcófago? Tal vez es un sarcófago real. "
"Tal vez haya un gran tipo llamado Dios aquí abajo.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"these hulks aint so incredible when ya got .50\""
msgstr "\"estas moles no son tan increíbles cuando tienes calibre .50\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"WBLF 970 went off-air three days ago.  There's nobody left on the radio.  "
"Might as well throw this thing away…\""
msgstr ""
"\"WBLF 970 no emite desde hace tres días. No queda nadie en la radio. Bien "
"podría tirar esta cosa...\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"I've heard it's safer across the Mississippi.  Going to start driving "
"today.  If you're reading this, pray for me\""
msgstr ""
"\"He oído que es más seguro cruzar el Mississippi. Voy a empezar a conducir "
"hoy. Si estás leyendo esto, reza por mí\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"We have Landed our Comet.  The Sky is Ablaze.\""
msgstr "\"Hemos aterrizado nuestro cometa. El cielo está ardiendo.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"Last one standing.  It's good feeling.  I win.  I win I win I win I win I "
"win\""
msgstr ""
"\"Soy el último que queda. Qué buena sensación. Gané, gané, gané, gané, "
"gané, gané...\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"Adderall cures weakness, tramadol cures death\""
msgstr "\"Adderall cura la debilidad, Tramadol cura la muerte\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"These turrets keep dodging my FUCKING BULLETS!\""
msgstr "\"¡Esas torretas siguen esquivando mis PUTAS BALAS!\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"Best way to train is by throwing pebbles at birds.  You'll be a legend.\""
msgstr ""
"\"La mejor manera de entrenar es lanzar guijarros a los pájaros. Serás una "
"leyenda.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"new bedford is overrun.  i'm sorry.  we tried.\""
msgstr "\"Nuevo Bedford fue invadido. Lo siento. Lo intentamos.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Check out my cooking show on The Television!  Making Mannwurst sausages "
"out of some of those assholes who tried to raid my kitchen earlier…\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Mira mi programa de cocina en la televisión! Haciendo salchichas "
"Mannwurst de algunos de esos gilipollas que intentaron asaltar mi cocina "
"antes...\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Renting out my rat tunnels for 50 9mm rounds a night.  I dug them with my "
"own claws, so you know they're the best.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Alquilo mis túneles de ratas una noche por 50 balas de 9mm. Los cavé con "
"mis propias garras, para que sepas que son los mejores.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Anyone wanna listen to some music at full volume and shoot the Zs that "
"approach?  You pick the tunes if I get some ammo.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Alguien quiere escuchar música a todo volumen y disparar a los zombis que"
" se acerquen? Escoges las canciones si me das un poco de munición.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Lots of new easy ways to burn calories now.  Fighting animata, managing "
"the fields, running with my wings buzzing, and more.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Hay un montón de nuevas maneras de quemar calorías ahora. Luchando contra "
"la animata, gestionar los campos, correr con mis alas zumbando y mucho "
"más.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"FLAMING SWORD HUMANE.  CAUTERIZES WOUNDS.  SURGICAL.\""
msgstr "\"ESPADA LLAMEANTE HUMANA. CAUTERIZA LAS HERIDAS. QUIRÚRGICA\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"knife screams it screams i cant breathe so scared help me please help\""
msgstr ""
"\"no hago más que oir gritos y gritos, no puedo respirar, estoy muy "
"asustado, ayúdame por favor, ayúdeme\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"when it started, we could still hope The Man was gonna save us…\""
msgstr "\"cuando empezó, todavía podíamos esperar que El Hombre nos salvara...\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Hey, Ted.  Alexander and Cass and I are heading to Z-Mobile for the last "
"of the meth.  Keep the lizard fetus fed for us, OK?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Hola, Ted. Alexander, Cass y yo nos dirigimos a Z-Mobile por lo de la "
"metanfetamina. Mantened el feto del lagarto bien alimentado por nosotros, "
"¿OK?\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"i say we call the material from melting down cars and dead robots "
"'massachusetite' or 'vermontsteel' or 'connecticut composite'\""
msgstr ""
"\"digo que podíamos llamar a los materiales de fusión de coches y robots "
"muertos 'massachusetite' o 'vermontsteel' o 'compuesto de connecticut'\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"Sometimes what you need when you're infected, bleeding, sick and hungover "
"is a J and some chips.\""
msgstr ""
"\"A veces lo que necesitas cuando estés infectado, sangrando, enfermo y con "
"resaca es una J y algunas chips.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"This has to be China's fault.  Seriously, why is nobody suspecting the "
"people we're having a cold war with!  This is an invasion!  These aren't "
"zombies, it's just camouflage!  WAKE UP, SHEEPLE!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Esto tiene que ser culpa de China. En serio, ¿por qué nadie sospecha de la"
" gente con la que tenemos una guerra fría? ¡Esto es una invasión! ¡Estos no "
"son zombis, es sólo camuflaje! ¡DESPIERTA, OVEJA!\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"Hahahahaa stupid fuck in his mansion, with his plate armor and big axe.  "
"Guy never swung the thing in his life.  Can't block bullets, dipshit\""
msgstr ""
"\"Jajajajaa vaya estúpido, con su mansión, con su armadura y su gran hacha. "
"El tío nunca hizo oscilar esa cosa en su vida. No puede bloquear balas, "
"capullo.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I woke up with a dozen bears in a tribe outside the vault.  One was "
"covered in red markings, glowing-- speaking.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Me desperté con una docena de osos en una tribu fuera de la bóveda. Uno de"
" ellos estaba cubierto de marcas de color rojo brillantes-- hablando.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"poor guy.  watched him from afar with my binocs for months and months.  "
"today he died fighting.  feels like i knew him even though i never "
"approached.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Pobre chico. Le observaba desde lejos con mis prismáticos durante meses y "
"meses. Hoy murió luchando. Siento como que lo conocía, aunque nunca me "
"acerqué.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"ENGLAND DID THIS\""
msgstr "\"INGLATERRA HIZO ESTO\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"That little fakkin rat din say anythin till we whacked him with a steel "
"chain!  Then 'e just wanted to know if he could buy the chain!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Esa pequeña rata de mierda no había dicho nada hasta que la golpeamos con"
" una cadena de acero! ¡Luego sólo queríamos saber si podía comprar la "
"cadena!\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"tom, adorned with fluid sacs three layers deep, crawls to safety like a "
"slug\""
msgstr ""
"\"tom, adornado con sacos de líquido con tres capas profundas, se arrastra a"
" la seguridad como un slug\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"my friend turned fuckin insane and ate his arms and then his sister's "
"arms!  he looked rather cross\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Mi amigo se volvió jodidamente loco y se comió sus brazos, y luego los "
"brazos de su hermana! Parecía bastante desquiciado\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"Starting today, the hallucinations are my only friends.\""
msgstr "\"Empezando hoy, las alucinaciones son mis únicas amigas.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"For sale: zombaby shoes, very filthy\""
msgstr "\"En venta: zapatos de Zombebés, muy sucios\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"Started my own brewery recently.  I just need some glass bottles, now!  "
"Several thousand!  I'm planning way ahead.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Empecé mi propia cervecería recientemente. Sólo necesito algunas botellas "
"de cristal, ¡ahora! ¡Cientos de miles! Lo estoy planeando.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Heard recently of some radio op who lives in a skyscraper, announcing "
"where those hordes are going.  Couldn't find the frequency, though.\""
msgstr ""
"\"He oído hablar recientemente de algunos operadores de radio que viven en "
"un rascacielos, anunciando donde van esas hordas. No podía encontrar la "
"frecuencia siquiera.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"Woah, bud!  Not all cannibals eat meat!\""
msgstr "\"¡Ey, tío! ¡No todos los caníbales comen carne!\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"ay why aint my bullets fuckin explodin\""
msgstr "\"¡Ay, por qué mis balas no explotan, joder!\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"Those Fiktok clan people picked this place clean… no food…\""
msgstr "\"Esa gente del clan Fiktok dejaron limpio este lugar... sin comida...\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"The fewer people in New England, the stronger we'll become.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Cuanta menos gente haya en Nueva Inglaterra, más fuerte nos "
"convertiremos.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"It all boils down to the Apex Predator.\""
msgstr "\"Todo se reduce al Apex Predator.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"King Jameson ik goner!  Thee cyber limbs isk falleng off me body!  Stak "
"pyroteknik I heear!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡El rey Jameson se fue! ¡Tres ciber-miembros cayeron en mi cuerpo! ¡Que "
"comiencen los fuegos artificiales!\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"Got my mortar and pestle.  Now if I could just find some avocados…\""
msgstr ""
"\"Tengo mi mortero y mi mazo. Ahora si pudiera encontrar algunos "
"aguacates...\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"saw a girl standing with the mushrooms.  spores coming out of slits in her"
" neck.  she looked happy.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Vi a una chica de pie con los hongos. Las esporas salían de las rendijas "
"de su cuello. Se veía feliz.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Found some pink berries.  Eating them makes bushes into more pink berries."
"  Infinite berry.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Encontré unos frutos rosados. Comerlos convierten los arbustos en más "
"frutos rosados. Frutos infinitos.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"m ust grow                 unity\""
msgstr "\"d ebemos crecer                 unidad\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"AMY IS FUNGUS.  DO NOT LISTEN IF SHE ASKS YOU TO TAKE OFF MASK\""
msgstr "\"AMY ES UN HONGO. NO ESCUCHES SI TE PIDE QUE TE QUITES LA MÁSCARA\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"my rabbi follows a new god now.  asks us to call him a local guide.  i "
"dont mind, he keeps us fed\""
msgstr ""
"\"Mi rabino sigue a un nuevo dios ahora. Nos pide que lo llamemos guía "
"local. No me importa, nos mantiene alimentados\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"Fungus are helping us.  Help them and they will unite us\""
msgstr "\"Los hongos nos están ayudando. Ayúdalos y nos unirán\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Saw a boy couldnt be older than 16.  Walked straight through the mushroom "
"tower.  THROUGH IT\""
msgstr ""
"\"Vi a un chico que no podía ser mayor de 16 años. Caminó directamente a "
"través de la torre de hongos. A TRAVÉS DE ELLA\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Found some food in a box outside my house.  We ate it and now the "
"fungaloids aren't harming us.  I think we are a mushroom now\""
msgstr ""
"\"Encontré un poco de comida en una caja fuera de mi casa. Nos comimos todo "
"y ahora los fungaloides no nos quieren lastimar. Creo que somos un hongo "
"ahora\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"saw the girl again.  she looked dead exhausted and walked right into the "
"fungus.  30 mins later and she walked out good as new\""
msgstr ""
"\"Vi a la chica de nuevo. Parecía muerta de cansancio y se metió en el "
"hongo. 30 minutos más tarde y salió como nueva\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"HADENSBROOK REBUILT AROUND FUNGUS.  THEY EAT GRAY APPLES AND SPREAD IT\""
msgstr ""
"\"HADENSBROOK RECONSTRUIDO ALREDEDOR DE UN HONGO. COMEN MANZANAS GRISES Y LO"
" ESPARCEN\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"mycus must grow\""
msgstr "\"el mycus debe crecer\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"School bus with solar panels = TRUST.  Gave us berries and seeds, we were "
"out of food\""
msgstr ""
"\"Autobús escolar con paneles solares = CONFIANZA\". Nos dio bayas y "
"semillas, nos estábamos quedando sin comida\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"d o nThelp scho Ol buss makE seeeedS ARe FUNGUS!! !\""
msgstr "\"¡n o Ayudes buss Esco lar hacER semiiiiillas SOn HONGOS!\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Go to every fungus patch you find but WEAR A SUIT.  Food there is very "
"very filling.  Look for pink berries, blue flowers\""
msgstr ""
"\"Ve a todos los hongos que encuentres, pero USA UN TRAJE. La comida allí es"
" muy, muy gratificante. Busca bayas rosas, flores azules\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"red blue yellow berry seed sap bloom flowers tower mycus mycus mycus.\""
msgstr ""
"rojo azul amarillo bayas semillas savia flores flores torre mycus mycus "
"mycus"

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Husband 30 yrs died in bombs.  Mushrooms brought him back.  GIVE YOURSELF "
"TO THEm AND THEY WILL HELP YOU\""
msgstr ""
"\"Esposo 30 años murió en bombardeo. Hongos lo revivieron. ENTREGATE A ELLOs"
" Y ELLOS TE AYUDARÁN\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Lisa always was a fan of sports.  Thank God these Global Athletics Games "
"in Harran started some time before the outbreak, so she was able to leave "
"New England before it was quarantined.  I can only hope there are no "
"zombies, as we do have here, in the city she flew to.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Lisa siempre fue una fanática de los deportes. Gracias a Dios, estos "
"Juegos Atléticos Globales en Harran comenzaron un tiempo antes del brote, "
"así que pudo dejar Nueva Inglaterra antes de que fuera puesta en cuarentena."
" Sólo puedo esperar que no haya zombis, como los que tenemos aquí, en la "
"ciudad a la que ella voló.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Don't mix powders, them books said.  Do Not Mix powders.  Didn't listen "
"did I.  Blew my goddamn pinky off, near lost my right eye.\""
msgstr ""
"\"No mezcles polvos, decían los libros. No mezclar polvos. No le hice caso. "
"Me volé el maldito meñique, casi pierdo mi ojo derecho\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"followed what toby wrote down.  shells looked like theyd hold more, I put "
"in some more.  traded most to h raiders for crank.  shot my 38 today and it "
"fuckn exploded.  low on crank, good as dead, no gun, no toby.  headed to "
"montreal real sorry bout the bullets\""
msgstr ""
"\"Seguí lo que Toby escribió. Los proyectiles parecían poder aguantar más, "
"por lo que puse más. Cambié la mayoría a los saqueadores por Cristal. Hoy  "
"disparé mi 38 y explotó. Bajo en cristal, tan bueno como muerto, sin arma, "
"sin Toby. Me dirigí a Montreal. Lo siento mucho por las balas\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"…damn those hybrid cars are efficient.  wish I was smart enough to finagle"
" that engine controller out of it… heard scrapper Joe put one in his "
"deathmobile and now doesn't need gas at all… then again, Joe is full of "
"shit…\""
msgstr ""
"\"...esos malditos coches híbridos son eficientes. Desearía ser lo "
"suficientemente inteligente como para sacar el controlador del motor... "
"escuché que Joe el Desguazador puso uno en su automóvil de la muerte y ahora"
" no necesita gasolina en absoluto... pero claro, Joe es un mentiroso...\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"⋯bioluminescent, 5' diameter⋯  appears to be an immense disembodied "
"eyeball, capable of flight and [illegible] thought\""
msgstr ""
"\"⋯bioluminiscente, de 5' de diámetro⋯ parece ser un inmenso globo ocular "
"incorpóreo, capaz de volar y [ilegible] pensar\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"What's the deal with boiling water?  Rain water is distilled naturally!  "
"It's perfectly safe, you could save so much time if you didn't boil it.  I "
"drunk some river water, and I'm fine!\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Qué pasa con el agua hirviendo? El agua de lluvia se destila de forma "
"natural. Es perfectamente segura, podrías ahorrar mucho tiempo si no la "
"hirvieras. ¡Yo he bebido agua del río y estoy bien!\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Went to the emergency shelter, some guy walked in, walked out, grabbed a "
"rock, smashed a bench to bits, carved a plank out of it, walked out again.  "
"Haven't seen them in 3 days… wonder what their story is.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Fui al refugio de emergencia, un tipo entró, salió, agarró una piedra, "
"rompió un banco en pedazos, talló un tablón de él, y salió de nuevo. No lo "
"he vuelto a ver en 3 días... me pregunto cuál es su historia\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"This note is covered in gray goo, ew… \"I know I have a fetish but THIS IS "
"TOO MUCH.  My hands are made of slime.  My hair is slime.  My body is "
"covered in slime.  I can't even use a crowbar 'cause of slime.  Wherever I "
"go I leave a trail of slime.  Everything's slime.  My bag is falling off my "
"back into slime.\""
msgstr ""
"Esta nota está cubierta de baba gris, ew... \"Sé que tengo un fetiche pero "
"ESTO ES DEMASIADO. Mis manos están hechas de baba. Mi pelo es baba. Mi "
"cuerpo está cubierto de baba. Ni siquiera puedo usar una palanca por culpa "
"de la baba. Dondequiera que vaya, dejo un rastro de baba. Todo es baba. Mi "
"bolsa se me cae de la espalda en baba\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"A page from a notebook, with a morse code reference and the following "
"decoded message: \"Whiskey echo whiskey - Lima alpha delta\""
msgstr ""
"Una página de un cuaderno, con una referencia en código morse y el siguiente"
" mensaje decodificado: \"Whisky eco whisky - Lima alfa delta\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"See if you want to be, extra annoying you can, nod off to the, dump and "
"go, help, Erin to dig up the, last, peice\""
msgstr ""
"\"Mira si quieres ser, extra molesto puedes, asentir al, vertedero e ir, a "
"ayudar, a Erin a desenterrar el, último, trozo\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I saw one of those Foodplace workers on the street.  Honestly, they look "
"no different alive than dead.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Vi a uno de esos trabajadores de Lugarcomida en la calle. Sinceramente, no"
" parecen diferentes vivos que muertos\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"DO NOT go to the irradiation plants!  My truck looks like swiss cheese "
"after the turrets had their way with me.  I'm gonna be stuck roadside for "
"hours while I patch up this mess.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡NO vayas a las plantas de irradiación! Mi camión parece un queso suizo "
"después de que las torretas hayan hecho de las suyas. Voy a estar atascado "
"en la carretera durante horas mientras remiendo este desastre\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I can imagine people sending their 'love and prayers' on social media.  "
"Love doesn't kill zeds, prayer doesn't put food in my belly.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Me imagino a la gente enviando su \"amor y sus oraciones\" en las redes "
"sociales. El amor no mata a los zetas, la oración no pone comida en mi "
"barriga\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I used to take everything at face value.  If you couldn't measure it, "
"couldn't explain it, couldn't put a number to it, it wasn't real.  Then this"
" shit happened.  Real funny.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Solía tomar todo al pie de la letra. Si no podías medirlo, no podías "
"explicarlo, no podías ponerle un número, no era real. Entonces toda esta "
"mierda ocurrió. Muy divertido\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "This note is covered in gray goo, ew… \"Blorble\""
msgstr "Esta nota está cubierta de una sustancia gris, ew... \"Blorble\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Saw some chick in the forest.  Her body is all green and shit, and she was"
" covered in leaves and vines.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Vi a una chica en el bosque. Su cuerpo era todo verde y mierda, y estaba "
"cubierta de hojas y enredaderas\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Good news: My teachers aren't trying to tear my limbs off about my "
"homework.  Bad news: My teachers are trying to tear my limbs off "
"regardless.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Buenas noticias: Mis profesores no intentan arrancarme los miembros por "
"mis deberes. Malas noticias: Mis profesores intentan arrancarme los miembros"
" a pesar de todo\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"G, I've stopped the bleeding, I'll be fine.  Can't stay here any longer, "
"there's too much commotion outside.  Meet me back at our usual spot, we will"
" retrieve our stuff together, don't go alone.  Be careful when exiting out "
"the back, I saw one of them running around with a spear.\""
msgstr ""
"\"G, he detenido la hemorragia, estaré bien. No puedo quedarme aquí por más "
"tiempo, hay demasiado alboroto afuera. Reúnete conmigo en nuestro lugar "
"habitual, recuperaremos nuestras cosas juntos, no vayas solo. Ten cuidado al"
" salir por la parte de atrás, vi a uno de ellos corriendo con una lanza\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"To whoever may find this, I've had enough of cowering and hiding.  I have "
"realized I can't outlast whatever this is.  I saw something different at the"
" grocery store down the block.  Skulking around on all four, faster than all"
" the others.  It jumped at me from behind a car.  It's as if they were all "
"changing.  I'm sure I'll see many more of these as time goes on.  I'm "
"leaving.  Whatever you want, take it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"A quienquiera que encuentre esto, ya me he cansado de acobardarme y "
"esconderme. Me he dado cuenta de que no puedo sobrevivir a lo que sea esto. "
"Vi algo diferente en la tienda de comestibles de la siguiente calle. "
"Merodeando sobre las cuatro patas, más rápido que todos los demás. Saltó "
"hacia mí desde detrás de un coche. Es como si todos estuvieran cambiando. "
"Estoy seguro de que veré muchos más de estos con el paso del tiempo. Me voy."
" Lo que quieras, tómalo\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"G, I hope you're finding my notes and the supply drops.  Use my binocs, if"
" they're still there, and check out the roof.  Avoid the huge tower.  I "
"don't know what's inside, but the noises that come out of it can't signal "
"anything good.\""
msgstr ""
"\"G, espero que encuentres mis notas y las provisiones. Usa mis prismáticos,"
" si todavía están ahí, y comprueba el tejado. Evita la torre enorme. No sé "
"qué hay dentro, pero los ruidos que salen de ella no pueden indicar nada "
"bueno\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Anyone reading this, stay off the roads.  Me and the boys were ambushed by"
" some goons there.  If you see a fallen tree blocking your path, just turn "
"around and go back.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Cualquiera que lea esto, permanezca fuera de las carreteras. Los chicos y "
"yo fuimos emboscados por unos matones allí. Si ven un árbol caído bloqueando"
" su camino, den la vuelta y regresen\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Mike, we have your dog and that ginger fuck you run around with.  You know"
" where to find us.  Come alone, it's time to pay up.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Mike, tenemos a tu perro y a ese puto pelirrojo con el que corres. Ya "
"sabes dónde encontrarnos. Ven solo, es hora de pagar\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"5 gallons of water, 3 cans of chicken, 3 cans of soup, 14 9mm rounds.  "
"GUNSHOP -> CHECK GARAGE -> CUT THROUGH YARDS -> HOME\""
msgstr ""
"\"25 litros de agua, 3 latas de pollo, 3 latas de sopa, 14 balas de 9mm. "
"TIENDA DE ARMAS -> COMPROBAR EL GARAJE -> CORTAR A TRAVÉS DE PATIOS -> "
"CASA\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"G, don't head straight through, go around.  There's a glowing one just "
"hanging out in the alley.  I tried stabbing it but it zapped me with some "
"sort of static electricity and I ran back here.  I'll try to whack it with a"
" club next time.\""
msgstr ""
"\"G, no te dirijas directamente, da la vuelta. Hay uno que brilla en el "
"callejón. Intenté apuñalarlo, pero me dio una especie de electricidad "
"estática y volví aquí. Intentaré golpearlo con un palo la próxima vez\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"STOP FOLLOWING ME I CAN HEAR YOU IN THE DARK\""
msgstr "\"DEJA DE SEGUIRME, PUEDO OÍRTE EN LA OSCURIDAD\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"G, If you find this, I'm at the farm just out of town.  I'll need to stay "
"there a few days, I've been wounded by one of those overgrown bastards, shot"
" a spike right into my thigh.  I'll wait for you there as long as I can, "
"stay safe.\""
msgstr ""
"\"G, si encuentras esto, estoy en la granja a las afueras de la ciudad. "
"Necesitaré quedarme allí unos días, he sido herido por uno de esos bastardos"
" enormes, me disparó una púa justo en el muslo. Te esperaré allí todo lo que"
" pueda, mantente a salvo\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"G, the city is full of them.  I don't know how, it's as if we never came "
"through here.  They're the same ones we'd put down, I am sure of it.  They "
"got back up and now look more dangerous than ever.  I saw one of them just "
"snatch a bird right off the roof with its long hands.  You have to use the "
"sewers.  I know we agreed not to travel underground, but as horrible as it "
"is down there, I fear our world up here is no longer ours either.\""
msgstr ""
"\"G, la ciudad está llena de ellos. No sé cómo, es como si nunca hubiéramos "
"pasado por aquí. Son los mismos que habíamos abatido, estoy seguro. "
"Volvieron a levantarse y ahora parecen más peligrosos que nunca. Vi a uno de"
" ellos arrebatar un pájaro del techo con sus largas manos. Tienes que usar "
"las alcantarillas. Sé que acordamos no viajar bajo tierra, pero por muy "
"horrible que sea allí abajo, me temo que nuestro mundo aquí arriba tampoco "
"es ya nuestro.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"G, move only after dark.  I saw lights in the distance, I think there "
"might be someone living around here.  Wish I had my radio right now.\""
msgstr ""
"\"G, muévete sólo cuando oscurezca. Vi luces en la distancia, creo que puede"
" haber alguien viviendo por aquí. Desearía tener mi radio ahora mismo\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"G, I have not found any of your notes, which means you're either taking a "
"different path or have already made your way back home.  In the case you're "
"still out here somewhere, if you see the sky suddenly grow dark, hide "
"indoors immediately, I have a feeling this storm is far from over.\""
msgstr ""
"\"G, no he encontrado ninguna de tus notas, lo que significa que o bien "
"estás tomando un camino diferente o ya has hecho el camino de vuelta a casa."
" En el caso de que sigas por aquí, si ves que el cielo se oscurece de "
"repente, escóndete en el interior inmediatamente, tengo la sensación de que "
"esta tormenta está lejos de terminar\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid "\"2236\""
msgstr "\"2236\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"G, be careful around those bulging and pulsating corpses.  I saw one "
"today.  I think there's something eating away at those things.  I didn't "
"stick around to find out.  I burnt the entire building down, just to be "
"sure, so you should have relatively safe passage.\""
msgstr ""
"\"G, ten cuidado con esos cadáveres abultados y palpitantes. Hoy he visto "
"uno. Creo que hay algo comiendo esas cosas. No me quedé para averiguarlo. "
"Quemé todo el edificio, sólo para estar seguro, así que deberías tener un "
"paso relativamente seguro\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"G, I ran into an actual human today!  He was looking for his daughter.  We"
" exchanged some food and traded information on the surrounding area.  He "
"spoke of a family living on a farm out in the fields, surviving and "
"thriving!  Maybe it's time we carved ourselves a peaceful place in this "
"hell.  We'll discuss this once we meet back home.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡G, hoy me encontré con un humano de verdad! Estaba buscando a su hija. "
"Intercambiamos algo de comida e intercambiamos información sobre los "
"alrededores. Habló de una familia que vive en una granja en los campos, "
"sobreviviendo y prosperando. Tal vez sea hora de que nos forjemos un lugar "
"pacífico en este infierno. Lo discutiremos cuando nos encontremos en casa\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "note"
#: data/json/snippets/survivor_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"G, There's something not right with the forests here.  The ground there "
"feels soft and is overgrown with some sort of mushrooms.  Be careful not to "
"breathe in the dust they kick up, I accidentally took a whiff and have been "
"coughing and vomiting since.  The map shows there's a cabin just outside "
"town, I'll lay low  there until I feel better.  I'm almost home.  I know you"
" will be waiting for me there.\""
msgstr ""
"\"G, hay algo que no está bien en los bosques de aquí. El suelo es blando y "
"está cubierto de algún tipo de hongo. Ten cuidado de no respirar el polvo "
"que levantan, yo accidentalmente tomé una bocanada y he estado tosiendo y "
"vomitando desde entonces. El mapa muestra que hay una cabaña a las afueras "
"del pueblo, me quedaré allí hasta que me sienta mejor. Ya casi estoy en "
"casa. Sé que me estarás esperando allí\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"Welcome to the Cataclysm tutorial!  As you play, pop-ups like this one will appear to guide you through the basic game actions.\n"
"\n"
"At any time, you can press <keybind:HELP_KEYBINDINGS> to open the <color_light_cyan>Keybindings menu</color> to view or modify the controls for the game or specific menu that you are in.\n"
"\n"
"Pressing <keybind:POPUP_WAIT:QUIT> will close the pop-up."
msgstr ""
"¡Bienvenido al tutorial de Cataclysm! Mientras juegas, aparecerán ventanas emergentes como esta para guiarte a través de las acciones básicas del juego.\n"
"\n"
"En cualquier momento, puedes pulsar <keybind:HELP_KEYBINDINGS> para abrir el <color_light_cyan>Menú de atajos de teclado</color> para ver o modificar los controles del juego o del menú específico en el que te encuentres.\n"
"\n"
"Al pulsar <keybind:POPUP_WAIT:QUIT> se cerrará la ventana emergente."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"The character in the center of the screen represents you.  By default, you can move around using the <color_yellow>numpad</color>, <color_yellow>vikeys</color>, or the <color_yellow>arrow keys</color>.\n"
"\n"
"Movement Controls:\n"
"North: <keybind:UP>\n"
"South: <keybind:DOWN>\n"
"West: <keybind:LEFT>\n"
"East: <keybind:RIGHT>\n"
"Northwest: <keybind:LEFTUP>\n"
"Northeast: <keybind:RIGHTUP>\n"
"Southwest: <keybind:LEFTDOWN>\n"
"Southeast: <keybind:RIGHTDOWN>\n"
"Wait in place: <keybind:pause>\n"
"\n"
"You can also use <keybind:SELECT> to select the location you want to move, and then press it again to confirm the movement.\n"
"\n"
"To continue the tutorial, please move to the door to the east."
msgstr ""
"El personaje en el centro de la pantalla te representa. Por defecto, puedes moverte con el <color_yellow>teclado numérico</color>, las <color_yellow>vikeys</color> o las<color_yellow> teclas de dirección</color>.\n"
"\n"
"Controles de movimiento:\n"
"Norte: <keybind:UP>\n"
"Sur: <keybind:DOWN>\n"
"Oeste: <keybind:LEFT>\n"
"Este: <keybind:RIGHT>\n"
"Noroeste: <keybind:LEFTUP>\n"
"Noreste: <keybind:RIGHTUP>\n"
"Sudoeste: <keybind:LEFTDOWN>\n"
"Sureste: <keybind:RIGHTDOWN>\n"
"Esperar quieto: <keybind:pause>\n"
"\n"
"También puedes usar <keybind:SELECT> para seleccionar el lugar al que quieras moverte, y pulsarlo de nuevo para confirmar el movimiento.\n"
"\n"
"Para continuar con el tutorial, muévete hacia la puerta del este."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"Most of the time your character will be walking when you move.  But sometimes it's useful to change your movement mode to something else.\n"
"\n"
"There are four movement modes:\n"
"<color_light_cyan>Walking</color>: default mode, average movement speed, stamina draining speed, and noise\n"
"<color_light_cyan>Running</color>: <color_light_green>move much faster</color>, but will <color_light_red>drain your stamina quickly</color>\n"
"<color_light_cyan>Crouching</color>: will make your character <color_light_green>less visible to monsters</color> by allowing you to hide behind some obstacles, <color_light_red>decreased movement speed</color> and <color_light_green>noise</color>\n"
"<color_light_cyan>Prone</color>: <color_light_green>even less visibility</color> to monsters, <color_light_red>even less movement speed</color> and <color_light_green>noise</color>\n"
"\n"
"Pressing <keybind:open_movement> will open the <color_light_cyan>Movement Mode</color> menu, which allows you to switch the mode at any time.  There are extra keybindings that can be set to switch to each mode individually for convenience.\n"
"\n"
"To continue the tutorial, please move to the end of the corridor."
msgstr ""
"La mayor parte del tiempo tu personaje estará caminando cuando te muevas. Pero a veces es útil cambiar el modo de movimiento por otro.\n"
"\n"
"Hay cuatro modos de movimiento:\n"
"<color_light_cyan>Caminar</color>: modo por defecto, velocidad media de movimiento, velocidad de drenaje de vigor y ruido.\n"
"<color_light_cyan>Correr</color>: <color_light_green>se mueve mucho más rápido</color>, pero <color_light_red>drena tu vigor rápidamente</color>\n"
"<color_light_cyan>Arrastrarse</color>: hará que tu personaje <color_light_green>sea menos visible para los monstruos</color> permitiéndote esconderte detrás de algunos obstáculos, <color_light_red>velocidad de movimiento disminuida</color> y <color_light_green>ruido</color>\n"
"<color_light_cyan>Prone</color>: <color_light_green>incluso menos visibilidad</color> para los monstruos, <color_light_red>incluso menos velocidad de movimiento</color> y <color_light_green>ruido</color>\n"
"\n"
"Al pulsar <keybind:open_movement> se abrirá el menú del <color_light_cyan>Modo de Movimiento</color>, que te permite cambiar de modo en cualquier momento. Hay combinaciones de teclas adicionales que se pueden configurar para cambiar a cada modo individualmente para mayor comodidad.\n"
"\n"
"Para continuar con el tutorial, por favor, muévete hasta el final del pasillo."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"You can also use the mouse to see things around you.  The "
"<color_light_cyan>Mouse view</color> window will appear on the sidebar, and "
"you'll be able to get information on the terrain, monsters, and items in the"
" world around you.  Alternatively, you can press <keybind:look> to open the "
"<color_light_cyan>Look Around</color> window."
msgstr ""
"También puedes utilizar el ratón para ver las cosas que te rodean. La "
"ventana<color_light_cyan> Vista del Ratón aparecerá en la barra lateral, y "
"podrás obtener información sobre el terreno, los monstruos y los objetos del"
" mundo que te rodea. Alternativamente puedes pulsar<keybind:look> para abrir"
" la ventana <color_light_cyan>Mirar Alrededor</color>."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"You're standing next to a closed door.  To open it, either walk into it, or "
"press <keybind:open> and then a movement key.  Using <keybind:open> will "
"also let you open windows, gates, fences, safes and more."
msgstr ""
"Estás junto a una puerta cerrada. Para abrirla, camina hacia a ella o pulsa "
"<keybind:open> y luego una tecla de movimiento. Pulsar <keybind:open> "
"también te permitirá abrir ventanas, puertas, vallas, cajas fuertes y mucho "
"más."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"You can close an opened door by pressing <keybind:close> and then a movement"
" key.  Closing doors behind you can often slow down crowds of monsters "
"greatly."
msgstr ""
"Puedes cerrar una puerta abierta pulsando <keybind:close> y a continuación "
"una tecla de movimiento. Cerrar las puertas detrás de ti suele ralentizar "
"mucho a las multitudes de monstruos."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"Most monsters will have to smash their way through a closed door.  If a door"
" is locked or partially broken, you can smash it by pressing <keybind:smash>"
" and then a movement key."
msgstr ""
"La mayoría de los monstruos tendrán que destrozar una puerta cerrada. Si una"
" puerta está cerrada o parcialmente rota, puedes romperla pulsando "
"<keybind:smash> y a continuación una tecla de movimiento."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"You can smash through windows by pressing <keybind:smash> and then a "
"movement key.  A smashed window takes a long time to climb through, and it's"
" possible to hurt yourself on the broken glass, but it's a good last-ditch "
"escape route.  Smashing a broken window again will clear the glass so you "
"can move through it safely, although it will still be quite slow.  Almost "
"everything can be smashed, given you have enough strength or are doing "
"enough damage."
msgstr ""
"Puedes destrozar las ventanas pulsando <keybind:smash> y a continuación una "
"tecla de movimiento. Se tarda mucho en atravezar una ventana rota, y es "
"posible hacerse daño con los cristales rotos, pero es una buena vía de "
"escape en caso de necesidad. Si vuelves a golpear la ventana, el cristal se "
"caerá y podrás moverte por ella con seguridad de no cortarte, aunque seguirá"
" siendo lento pasar por ella. Casi todo se puede romper, siempre que tengas "
"suficiente fuerza o hagas suficiente daño."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"You just stepped on a space with one or more items.  If you wish to pick it up, press <keybind:pickup>.  To select the tile directly underneath you, press <keybind:pause>.\n"
"\n"
"In the <color_light_cyan>Pickup</color> menu, press:\n"
"<keybind:RIGHT> to select the items you wish to pick up\n"
"<keybind:LEFT> to deselect\n"
"<keybind:CONFIRM> to confirm\n"
"\n"
"Note that you don't need to stand directly on the space with items to pick them up, you can pick them up when standing near them.\n"
"\n"
"If the item is too big to fit in any of your pockets, or is a weapon that you want to wield, you can press <keybind:wield> to wield it from the ground or from the <color_light_cyan>Pickup</color> menu.\n"
"\n"
"To continue the tutorial, please pick up the <color_light_cyan>baseball bat</color> you're standing on and move to the door to the south."
msgstr ""
"Acaba de pasar por una posición con uno o más objetos. Si deseas recogerlos, pulsa <keybind:pickup>. Para seleccionar la posición que está justo debajo de tí, pulsa <keybind:pause> .\n"
"\n"
"En el menú de <color_light_cyan>Recogida</color>, pulsa\n"
"<keybind:RIGHT> para seleccionar los elementos que deseas recoger\n"
"<keybind:LEFT> para deseleccionarlos\n"
"<keybind:CONFIRM> para confirmar la acción\n"
"\n"
"Ten en cuenta que no es necesario que te sitúes directamente sobre la posición con objetos para recogerlos, puedes recogerlos cuando te encuentres en una posición adyacente a ellos.\n"
"\n"
"Si un objeto es demasiado grande para caber en alguno de tus bolsillos, o es un arma que quieres empuñar, puedes pulsar <keybind:wield> para empuñarlo desde el suelo o desde el menú de <color_light_cyan>Recogida</color>.\n"
"\n"
"Para continuar con el tutorial, recoge el <color_light_cyan>bate de béisbol</color> sobre el que te encuentras y dirígete a la puerta del sur."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"There is a display rack next to you with a steel spear lying on it.  You can press <keybind:wield> to directly wield an item, without the need of picking it up first.  Pressing <keybind:wield> will open the <color_light_cyan>Wield item</color> menu.  Select the item you want to wield and confirm by pressing <keybind:CONFIRM>.\n"
"\n"
"As you have no free space in your inventory, you will have to drop the <color_light_cyan>baseball bat</color> on the ground before you can wield the spear.\n"
"\n"
"If you wish to free your hands (i.e. wield nothing), press <keybind:wield> and select your currently wielded item.  Alternatively, you could drop the wielded item by pressing <keybind:drop> and selecting your currently wielded item.\n"
"\n"
"To continue the tutorial, please wield the spear and move to the counters west of you."
msgstr ""
"Hay un estante a tu lado con una lanza de acero. Puedes pulsar <keybind:wield> para blandir directamente un objeto, sin necesidad de recogerlo primero. Al pulsar <keybind:wield>, se abrirá el menú de <color_light_cyan>Pulsar objeto</color>. Selecciona el objeto que quieres blandir y confírmalo pulsando <keybind:CONFIRM>.\n"
"\n"
"Como no tienes espacio libre en tu inventario, tendrás que dejar caer el <color_light_cyan>bate de béisbol</color> al suelo antes de poder empuñar la lanza.\n"
"\n"
"Si deseas liberar tus manos (es decir, no empuñar nada), pulsa <keybind:wield> y selecciona el objeto que estés empuñando. Alternativamente, puedes dejar caer el objeto que empuñas pulsando <keybind:drop> y seleccionando tu objeto empuñado en ese momento.\n"
"\n"
"Para continuar con el tutorial, empuña la lanza y muévete hacia los mostradores que están al oeste de tu posición."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"There is a <color_light_cyan>water dispenser</color> around the corner.  "
"Pick up the <color_light_cyan>plastic bottle</color> from the rack and "
"proceed to the dispenser."
msgstr ""
"Hay un <color_light_cyan>dispensador de agua</color> a la vuelta de la "
"esquina. Recoge la <color_light_cyan>botella de plástico</color> del estante"
" y dirígete al dispensador."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"The item you just picked up is a type of clothing!  To wear clothing, press "
"<keybind:wear> and then select an item.  To take off clothing, press "
"<keybind:take_off>, or simply take it off and drop it in one action by "
"pressing <keybind:drop>."
msgstr ""
"¡El objeto que acabas de recoger es un tipo de ropa!. Para ponerte ropa, "
"pulsa <keybind:wear> y a continuación selecciona un objeto. Para quitarte la"
" ropa, pulsa <keybind:take_off>, o simplemente quítatela y tirala en una "
"sola acción al pulsar <keybind:drop>."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"The item you just picked up is a good weapon!  To wield a weapon, press "
"<keybind:wield>, then pick what to wield.  To wield nothing, either drop "
"your weapon with <keybind:drop>, or press <keybind:wield> to put it away.  A"
" zombie has spawned nearby.  To attack it, simply move into it."
msgstr ""
"¡El objeto que acabas de recoger es una buen arma! Para empuñar un arma, "
"pulsa <keybind:wield>, y a continuación elige que empuñao. Para no empuñar "
"nada, o soltar tu arma pulsa <keybind:drop> , o pulsa <keybind:wield> para "
"guardarla. Ha aparecido un zombi cerca. Para atacarlo, simplemente muévete "
"hacia él."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"The item you just picked up is a comestible!  To eat a comestible, press "
"<keybind:eat>.  Comestibles are items you can use up, like food, drink, "
"pills, etc.  Most food expires eventually, so be careful.  Some comestibles,"
" especially drugs, can cause subtle, long-term effects."
msgstr ""
"¡El objeto que acabas de recoger es un comestible! Para comer un comestible,"
" pulsa <keybind:eat>. Los comestibles son objetos que puedes consumir, como "
"comida, bebida, pastillas, etc. La mayoría de los alimentos caducan con el "
"tiempo, así que ten cuidado. Algunos comestibles, especialmente las drogas, "
"pueden causar efectos sutiles a largo plazo."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"The item you just picked up is a tool!  To activate a tool, press "
"<keybind:apply>.  Some tools have a set charge, which can be reloaded once "
"depleted.  Others are single-use items, and still others are reusable."
msgstr ""
"¡El objeto que acabas de recoger es una herramienta! Para activar una "
"herramienta, pulsa <keybind:apply>. Algunas herramientas tienen una carga "
"fija, que puede ser recargada una vez se agota. Otras son de un solo uso y "
"otras son reutilizables."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"The item you just picked up is a firearm!  Guns are very powerful weapons "
"but they require ammunition.  Firearms have many special attributes.  Most "
"modify the damage done by their ammunition.  They also have dispersion, "
"which affects their chance to hit.  Some guns are semi-automatic, while "
"others can fire a burst.  Some firearms (mainly bows and other muscle-"
"powered weapons) have a range, which is added on top of the ammo's range "
"when firing."
msgstr ""
"¡El objeto que acabas de recoger es un arma de fuego!. Las armas de fuego "
"son armas muy poderosas, pero requieren munición. Las armas de fuego tienen "
"muchos atributos especiales. La mayoría modifican el daño causado por su "
"munición. También tienen dispersión, que afecta a su probabilidad de "
"acertar. Algunas armas son semiautomáticas, mientras que otras pueden "
"disparar una ráfaga. Algunas armas de fuego (sobre todo los arcos y otras "
"armas de potencia muscular) tienen un alcance, que se añade al alcance de la"
" munición al disparar."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"The item you just picked up is ammunition, used with a gun.  It has many "
"special attributes.  The damage value is the maximum done on a standard hit;"
" a critical hit or headshot will do much more damage.  Some monsters or NPCs"
" will wear armor which reduces the damage from gunfire; a high armor-pierce "
"value will reduce this effect.  The range is the maximum range the ammo can "
"achieve, and the dispersion affects its chance to hit."
msgstr ""
"El objeto que acabas de recoger es munición para un arma. Tiene muchos "
"atributos especiales. El valor de daño es el máximo hecho en un golpe "
"estándar; un golpe crítico o un disparo a la cabeza harán mucho más daño. "
"Algunos monstruos o NPCs llevarán una armadura que reduce el daño de los "
"disparos; un valor alto de penetración de armadura reducirá este efecto. El "
"alcance es la distancia máxima que puede alcanzar la munición, y la "
"dispersión afecta a su probabilidad de golpear."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"You just put on an article of clothing that provides physical protection.  "
"There are three types of damage that clothing defends against: "
"<color_light_cyan>bashing</color>, <color_light_cyan>cutting</color>, and "
"<color_light_cyan>ballistic</color>.  Most monsters deal bashing damage, but"
" cutting is often the more deadly of the two.  Not many enemies deal "
"ballistic damage; among them are some robots, turrets, and non-playable "
"characters (NPCs)."
msgstr ""
"Acabas de ponerte una prenda de vestir que te proporciona protección física."
" Hay tres tipos de daño contra los que la ropa te protege: "
"<color_light_cyan>contundente</color>, <color_light_cyan>cortante</color> y "
"<color_light_cyan>balístico</color>. La mayoría de los monstruos infligen "
"daño contundente, pero el corte suele ser el más letal de los dos. No hay "
"muchos enemigos que inflijan daño perforante, entre ellos algunos robots, "
"torretas y personajes no jugables (PNJs)."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"You just put on an article of clothing that provides ample storage space.  This will allow you to carry more stuff, but be aware that there is also a limit on the weight you can carry which depends on your strength.  The item you put on also encumbered your torso.  This will make combat a little more difficult.  To check encumbrance, press <keybind:player_data>.\n"
"\n"
"To continue the tutorial, please move to the corridor to the north and wear all clothing you find on the racks."
msgstr ""
"Te acabas de poner una prenda que te proporciona un amplio espacio de almacenamiento. Esto te permitirá llevar muchas más cosas, pero ten en cuenta que también hay un límite en el peso que puedes llevar el cual depende de la fuerza. La prenda que te pongas también te incomodará el torso. Esto hará que el combate sea un poco más difícil. Para comprobar la incomodidad, pulsa <keybind:player_data>.\n"
"\n"
"Para continuar con el tutorial, dirígete al pasillo del norte y ponte toda la ropa que encuentres en los estantes."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"You just put on an article of clothing that protects against the "
"environment.  The most common and important are respiratory devices, which "
"will protect you against smoke, airborne toxins or organisms, and other "
"common hazards.  However, they also make it a little harder to breath when "
"running, so you'll move more slowly.  To check your encumbrance, press "
"<keybind:player_data>."
msgstr ""
"Te acabas de poner un objeto que te protege contra el medio ambiente. Los "
"más comunes e importantes son los dispositivos respiratorios, los cuales "
"protegen contra el humo, las toxinas, los organismos presentes en el aire y "
"otros peligros comunes. Sin embargo, también te dificultan un poco la "
"respiración al correr, por lo que te moverás más lentamente. Para comprobar "
"la incomodidad, pulsa <keybind:player_data>."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"If you press <keybind:inventory> and then the letter of your weapon, you'll "
"see its combat stats.  Bashing damage ignores most armor, but varies greatly"
" and requires strength.  Cutting damage is a fixed amount, but is blocked by"
" armor.  The To-hit bonus affects your chances of hitting.  The amount of "
"time it takes to swing your melee weapon depends on both its size and "
"weight; small, compact weapons are the fastest."
msgstr ""
"Si pulsas <keybind:inventory> y luego la letra de tu arma, verás sus "
"estadísticas de combate. El daño contundente ignora la mayoría de las "
"armaduras, pero varía mucho y requiere fuerza. El daño cortante es una "
"cantidad fija, pero es bloqueado por la armadura. La bonificación por golpe "
"afecta tus probabilidades de golpear. La cantidad de tiempo que te lleva "
"realizar un ataque con tu arma cuerpo a cuerpo depende tanto de su tamaño "
"como su peso; las armas pequeñas y compactas son las más rápidas."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"Hitting a monster will stun it briefly, allowing you to escape or get in "
"another attack.  Your dexterity and melee skills are used to determine "
"whether an attack hits, while strength affects damage."
msgstr ""
"Cuando golpeás a un monstruo lo vas a aturdir momentáneamente, lo que te "
"permite escapar o volver a atacarlo. Tu destreza y tu habilidad para el "
"cuerpo a cuerpo son los que determinan si acertás tus golpes, mientras que "
"la fuerza determina el daño."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"Looks like you suddenly felt pain.  The pain status is indicated on the sidebar and also in the <keybind:player_data> menu.\n"
"\n"
"Small amounts of pain are tolerable, but as it gets worse your stats will drop and you will move much slower.  To reduce pain, take painkillers like <color_light_cyan>codeine</color> on the rack nearby (by activating it with <keybind:apply>), or simply wait it out."
msgstr ""
"Parece que de repente has sentido dolor. El estado del dolor se indica en la barra lateral y también en el menú <keybind:player_data>.\n"
"\n"
"Las pequeñas cantidades de dolor son tolerables, pero a medida que aumenta el dolor, tus estadísticas bajarán y te moverás mucho más lento. Para reducir el dolor, toma analgésicos como la <color_light_cyan>codeína</color> en el estante cercano (activándolo con <keybind:apply>), o simplemente espera a que se pase."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"When you kill a monster it will often leave behind a corpse.  Corpses can be"
" important sources of food, but you must butcher them by standing on the "
"corpse and pressing <keybind:butcher>.  You'll need a bladed weapon in your "
"inventory, preferably a small, very sharp one.  An unskilled butcher may "
"only get a few pieces of meat, or none at all.  Note that many monsters, "
"such as zombies, leave tainted meat, unsuitable for consumption."
msgstr ""
"Cuando matas a un monstruo generalmente queda un cadáver. Los cadáveres "
"pueden ser fuentes de comida pero tienes que descuartizarlos parándote en el"
" mismo espacio y pulsando <keybind:butcher>. Vas a necesitar un arma blanca "
"en el inventario, mejor si es pequeña y muy afilada. Si el descuartizamiento"
" no te sale bien, solo obtendrás algunos trozos de carne, o ninguno. "
"Acuérdate que muchos monstruos, como los zombis, dejan carne contaminada que"
" no se puede consumir."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"That drug you just took is a <color_light_cyan>painkiller</color>.  Painkillers are very important to keep on hand, as pain both penalizes your stats and makes you slower.  Be careful though, as the stronger painkillers can make you woozy, and some are even addictive.\n"
"\n"
"Please also note that painkillers don't work the moment you take them.  They need some time to start working, and you don't need to take another dose right now if you don't see the immediate effect.  Just wait, and sooner or later the pain will start going away."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"That drug you just took placed an effect on you.  To check your effects, "
"press <keybind:player_data>.  Most only last a short while, while others, "
"like chronic disease, last until cured by some other means."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"You just drank a bottle of water, reducing your thirst level and reducing "
"the water level in the bottle.  You'll probably want to drop empty bottles, "
"or you might want to save them to refill from a water source later."
msgstr ""
"Te tomaste una botella de agua, reduciendo tu nivel de sed y reduciendo el "
"nivel de agua en la botella. Probablemente quieras dejar algunas botellas "
"vacías, o tal vez quieras guardarlas para volverlas a llenar."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"You just activated a grenade!  You probably want to throw it.  To throw an "
"item, press <keybind:throw> and then select the item to throw.  The maximum "
"range depends on your strength and the object's weight and size.  Throwing "
"isn't very good in most combat situations, but if you've got some fire "
"power…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"This thing here on the floor is a <color_light_cyan>trap</color>.  Traps are"
" permanent until set off, and can be an important defensive tactic, "
"particularly when sleeping in unsafe territory.  Try stepping on the bubble "
"wrap.  Don't worry, it's harmless, but it will make some noise.  There are "
"other types of traps that will cause varying amounts of damage or even "
"teleport you, so watch your step carefully."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"In the next room you'll find a row of racks with a gun, a magazine for it, and ammo for it.  To be able to fire a gun, you'll need to insert a magazine with ammo in it.  Press <keybind:reload_item> to open the <color_light_cyan>Reload item</color> menu and put ammo in the magazine, and then press <keybind:reload_item> once again to insert a magazine into a gun.\n"
"\n"
"If you wish to unload your gun, possibly to change ammunition types, press <keybind:unload>."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"Finally, to fire a gun, press <keybind:fire>. You'll automatically target the last monster you shot at, or the closest monster to you.  You can change your target with the <color_yellow>movement keys</color>, or cycle through monsters with <keybind:TARGET:PREV_TARGET> and <keybind:TARGET:NEXT_TARGET>.  Select the <color_light_cyan>dummy</color> as a target and press <keybind:fire> to fire a a single shot.  With many guns, you can change the fire mode to burst or full auto by pressing <keybind:select_fire_mode>.\n"
"\n"
"There are detailed instructions on how to aim and fire in the <color_light_cyan>Aiming and firing</color> menu, so make sure to check it carefully.\n"
"\n"
"To continue the tutorial, please fire a couple of times at the dummy and move to the corridor to the west."
msgstr ""
"Por último, para disparar un arma, pulsa <keybind:fire>. Apuntarás automáticamente al último monstruo al que hayas disparado, o al más cercano a ti. Puedes cambiar de objetivo con las teclas de movimiento <color_yellow> y </color>, o recorrer los monstruos con <keybind:TARGET:PREV_TARGET>  y  <keybind:TARGET:NEXT_TARGET>. Selecciona el <color_light_cyan>maniquí</color> como objetivo y pulsa <keybind:fire> para disparar un solo tiro. Con muchas armas, puedes cambiar el modo de disparo a ráfaga o totalmente automático pulsando <keybind:select_fire_mode>.\n"
"\n"
"Hay instrucciones detalladas sobre cómo apuntar y disparar en el menú <color_light_cyan>Apuntando y disparando</color>, así que asegúrate de comprobarlo cuidadosamente.\n"
"\n"
"Para continuar con el tutorial, dispara un par de veces al muñeco y dirígete al pasillo del oeste."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"Firing your gun will increase your recoil level.  You can see its level in "
"the <color_light_cyan>Aiming and firing</color> menu (by pressing "
"<keybind:fire>).  Generally speaking, the more damaging the ammo, the worse "
"the recoil.  Recoil severely reduces your chance to hit, but you can "
"eliminate recoil by pausing (<keybind:pause>) for a turn.  High strength "
"reduces recoil, so weak characters might want to stick to .22 or 9x19mm "
"guns."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"This is a staircase leading down.  To go downstairs, step onto the staircase"
" and press the <keybind:LEVEL_DOWN> key.  Similarly, to go upstairs, stand "
"on the staircase leading up and press the <keybind:LEVEL_UP> key."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una escalera que lleva hacia abajo. Para bajar, ponte en la escalera"
" y pulsa la tecla <keybind:LEVEL_DOWN> . Del mismo modo, para subir, sitúate"
" en la escalera que lleva hacia arriba y pulsa la tecla <keybind:LEVEL_UP>."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"It's dark down here!  Without a source of light, you'll be limited to seeing"
" only one space in any direction.  You'll encounter darkness while "
"underground or at night.  Press <keybind:LEVEL_UP> to go back upstairs, and "
"look around for a flashlight."
msgstr ""
"¡Está oscuro aquí abajo! Sin una fuente de luz, estás limitado a ver "
"solamente un espacio en todas las direcciones. Va a estar oscuro siempre que"
" estés bajo tierra o sea de noche. Pulsa <keybind:LEVEL_UP> para subir otra "
"vez, y busca una linterna."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"It's dark down here!  Fortunately, you have a "
"<color_light_cyan>flashlight</color>.  Press <keybind:apply> and then select"
" your flashlight to turn it on."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"From a water source like this, you can fill any containers you might have.  Examine the dispenser by pressing <keybind:examine>.  Next, press <color_yellow>'c'</color> to fill a container, then select the <color_light_cyan>plastic bottle</color> to put the water into.\n"
"\n"
"The Examine command (<keybind:examine>) can be used for interacting with many types of terrain and furniture.\n"
"\n"
"To continue the tutorial, please fill the plastic bottle with water, drink a little of it (by pressing <keybind:eat> and selecting <color_light_cyan>clean water</color>), and then move to the corridor to the north."
msgstr ""
"Desde una fuente de agua como ésta, puedes llenar cualquier recipiente que tengas. Examina el dispensador <color_yellow>'e'</color> y pulsa <color_yellow>'c'</color> para llenar un recipiente, a continuación selecciona la <color_light_cyan>botella de plástico</color> en la que poner el agua.\n"
"El comando Examinar <color_yellow>'e'</color> se puede utilizar para interactuar con muchos tipos de terreno y muebles.\n"
"\n"
"Para continuar con el tutorial, llena la botella con agua, bebe un poco de ella (pulsando <color_yellow>'E'</color> y seleccionando agua potable), y luego dirígete al corredor del norte."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"There is a <color_light_cyan>dummy</color> standing before you.  Let's attack it.  To do this, simply move into it.\n"
"\n"
"After you've dealt with it, please move to the door behind it."
msgstr ""
"Hay un <color_light_cyan>pelele</color> enfrente a ti. Vamos a atacarlo. Para ello, simplemente muévete hacia él.\n"
"\n"
"Una vez que te hayas ocupado de él, muévete hacia la puerta que hay detrás."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"This door is locked.  There are several ways to deal with locked doors (lockpicking and prying being the most common), but right now you don't have the necessary tools at hand.  Instead, you can simply bash it with your <color_light_cyan>baseball bat</color> by pressing <keybind:smash> and then selecting the direction.\n"
"\n"
"Note that not every door can be bashed down.  Some doors will require more strength than you have or a stronger weapon.  If you're not seeing any damage being done after a few swings, an alternative approach might be needed.\n"
"\n"
"To continue the tutorial, please smash the door."
msgstr ""
"Esta puerta está cerrada. Hay varias formas de lidiar con las puertas cerradas en el juego (ganzúas, palancas y algunas otras), pero ahora mismo no tienes las herramientas necesarias a mano. Así que simplemente se contundente con tu <color_light_cyan>bate</color> pulsando <color_yellow>'s'</color> y a continuación seleccionando la dirección.\n"
"Ten en cuenta que no todas las puertas pueden ser tiradas a golpes, y para algunas puertas puede que simplemente no tengas la fuerza o el arma necesaria para lograrlo.\n"
"\n"
"Para continuar con el tutorial, destroza la puerta."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"Bashing things is hard work that will deplete your stamina.  You can see how much stamina you have on the sidebar.  The less stamina you have, the slower your movement and most actions will be.  To restore stamina, you need only to wait.  You can press <keybind:wait> to open the <color_light_cyan>Wait for how long</color> menu and select the amount of time you want to wait.  Select option <color_light_cyan>Wait until you catch your breath</color> to fully restore all lost stamina.\n"
"\n"
"Be careful about doing too many strenuous activities as you will build up your weariness over time, which will stack movement and action penalties on top of your stamina cost.  You can watch your <color_light_cyan>Weary Transition</color> in the sidebar as you are performing longer activities to see their effect on  your weariness.  To reduce your weariness, you just need to rest or do less strenuous activities for a while."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"There is another <color_light_cyan>dummy</color> standing behind the counters.  Most melee weapons require standing directly adjacent to your target in order to hit it.\n"
"\n"
"Fortunately, some long weapons such as spears are able to perform reach attack with a range of 2 or 3, so if you have one, you don't need to climb onto the counters to stand next to the dummy.  The <color_light_cyan>steel spear</color> has a range of 2, so you can hit the dummy right over the counters.  To use the reach attack, press the <keybind:fire> key.  Once you select your target, press <keybind:CONFIRM> to confirm.\n"
"\n"
"After you've dealt with the dummy, please move to the corridor to the south."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"Always wielding a <color_light_cyan>steel spear</color> in your hands might be inconvenient.  Fortunately, there is a <color_light_cyan>spear strap</color> lying on the rack nearby.  You can wear it by pressing <keybind:wear>.\n"
"To take off any worn item, you can press <keybind:take_off>.\n"
"\n"
"To continue the tutorial, please wear the spear strap."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"You can put the <color_light_cyan>steel spear</color> in the <color_light_cyan>spear strap</color> to free your hands.  Press <keybind:apply> to open the <color_light_cyan>Use item</color> menu, then select the spear strap, then select the spear, and finally press <keybind:CONFIRM> to confirm.\n"
"\n"
"To continue the tutorial, please put the <color_light_cyan>steel spear</color> in the <color_light_cyan>spear strap</color> and move down the corridor."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"Cataclysm uses a container-based inventory.  Putting something into your inventory requires wearing some clothing or container with pockets that are big enough to hold it.  The <color_light_cyan>spear strap</color> is one example of such containers.  Pockets have finite dimensions, so you can't put an item that has more volume or is longer than a pocket.\n"
"\n"
"To view your inventory, press <keybind:inventory>.  You'll see that you have only your worn clothes, of which only your jeans have 4 small pockets.  Select your jeans and press <keybind:CONFIRM> to see their description and amount of pockets.  To scroll through the description, press <keybind:PAGE_UP> and <keybind:PAGE_DOWN>.\n"
"\n"
"To continue the tutorial, move to the western rack and wear (<keybind:wear>) the <color_light_cyan>backpack</color> to increase the available capacity of your inventory."
msgstr ""
"El juego utiliza un inventario basado en contenedores. Esto significa que para poner algo en tu inventario, tienes que llevar alguna ropa o contenedor con bolsillos que te proporcionen espacio libre para los objetos. La <color_light_cyan>correa de la lanza</color> es un ejemplo de este tipo de contenedores. Los bolsillos tienen dimensiones finitas, por lo que no puedes poner un objeto que tenga mayor volumen o longitud que el propio bolsillo.\n"
"Para ver tu inventario, pulsa <color_yellow>'i'</color>. Verás que sólo tienes tu ropa usada, de la cual sólo tus vaqueros tienen 4 bolsillos pequeños. Selecciona tus vaqueros y pulsa <color_yellow>Enter</color> para ver su descripción y la cantidad de bolsillos. Para desplazarte por la descripción, pulsa <color_yellow>'<'</color> y <color_yellow>'>'</color>.\n"
"\n"
"Para continuar con el tutorial, acércate al estante y ponte (<color_yellow>'W'</color>) la <color_light_cyan>mochila</color> para aumentar la capacidad disponible de tu inventario."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"There is a <color_light_cyan>flashlight</color> and a <color_light_cyan>light disposable battery</color> lying on the rack.  Flashlights are very useful tools as they allow you to see in the dark.\n"
"\n"
"To continue the tutorial, please reload the flashlight by pressing <keybind:reload_item>.  Take it with you and move to the stairs."
msgstr ""
"Hay una <color_light_cyan>linterna</color> y una <color_light_cyan>batería desechable</color> en el estante. Las linternas son herramientas muy útiles ya que te permiten ver en la oscuridad.\n"
"\n"
"Para continuar con el tutorial, recarga la linterna pulsando <keybind:reload_item>, llévatela y ve hacia las escaleras."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"A <color_light_cyan>flashlight</color> is a good thing to have, but it drains its battery quickly, so it won't last very long.  A much better solution for long-lasting lighting is a <color_light_cyan>gasoline lantern</color>.  Reload the lantern with <color_light_cyan>gasoline</color> (<keybind:reload_item>) and then activate it (<keybind:apply>) while standing nearby.  A <color_light_cyan>lighter</color> will help you to fire the lantern.\n"
"\n"
"Some tools (such as lamps, dehydrators, bathroom scales etc) don't need to be picked up before activating and allow remote use.\n"
"\n"
"After you light the lantern, you can safely turn off your flashlight to conserve its energy; the lit lantern will give you enough light for any actions and will last much longer.\n"
"\n"
"To continue the tutorial, please light the lantern and then move to the corridor to the east."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"Looks like you're hungry!  The hunger status is indicated on the sidebar.  Let's make a <color_light_cyan>peanut butter sandwich</color> from <color_light_cyan>peanut butter</color> and <color_light_cyan>crackers</color> on the counter next to the wall.\n"
"\n"
"To make food, you need to use the <color_light_cyan>Crafting</color> menu.  Press <keybind:craft> to open the menu.  Press <keybind:NEXT_TAB> and <keybind:PREV_TAB> to toggle crafting categories and select the <color_light_cyan>FOOD</color> category.  From there, select peanut butter sandwich and press <keybind:CONFIRM> to start crafting.\n"
"\n"
"Note that you don't need to stand directly near the counter to be able to craft.  The <color_light_cyan>crafting radius</color> is 6 tiles, so while you're standing no farther than 6 tiles from any crafting components and tools, your character is able to still get them in order to use them.\n"
"\n"
"To continue the tutorial, please craft the peanut butter sandwich and then eat it by pressing <keybind:eat>."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"In the next room, you can find a <color_light_cyan>paint brush</color> and several cans of <color_light_cyan>paint</color>.  You can use them to paint the wall in your preferred color.  To do this, open the <color_light_cyan>Construction</color> menu by pressing <keybind:construct> and toggling the categories with <keybind:LEFT> and <keybind:RIGHT>.  Find the <color_light_cyan>Decorative</color> category and select one of the options to paint the wall.\n"
"\n"
"To continue the tutorial, please paint some walls and move further south."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"There are 10 <color_light_cyan>baseballs</color> lying on the floor.  You might not need all 10, or you might not have enough space in your pockets.  To pick up a specific amount of items, press <keybind:pickup>, select the stack of items, and type a number on the keyboard (Multiple numbers can be used for large stacks).  Finish the selection with <keybind:INVENTORY:TOGGLE_ENTRY>.  The cursor should change to a <color_light_cyan>#</color> symbol.\n"
"\n"
"You can throw a baseball at the <color_light_cyan>dummy</color> in the end of the corridor by pressing <keybind:throw>.\n"
"\n"
"To complete the tutorial, throw some baseballs at the dummy and then move to the end of the corridor to the north."
msgstr ""
"Hay 10 pelotas de <color_light_cyan>béisbol</color> en el suelo. Puede que no necesites las 10, o que no tengas suficiente espacio en tus bolsillos. Para recoger una cantidad específica de objetos, pulsa <keybind:pickup>, selecciona la pila de objetos y pulsa el número en el teclado (Se pueden utilizar varios números para pilas grandes). Termina la selección con <keybind:INVENTORY:TOGGLE_ENTRY>.El cursor debería cambiar al símbolo <color_light_cyan># </color>.\n"
"\n"
"Puedes lanzar una pelota de béisbol al <color_light_cyan>pelele</color> del final del pasillo pulsando <keybind:throw>.\n"
"\n"
"Para completar el tutorial, lanza algunas pelotas de béisbol al pelele y luego dirígete al final del corredor hacia el norte."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tutorial_messages"
#: data/json/snippets/tutorial.json
msgid ""
"Congratulations!  You have completed the tutorial.  Here is some last-minute advice.\n"
"\n"
"You can press <keybind:action_menu> to open the <color_light_cyan>Action menu</color>.  It provides a convenient way to access various actions.\n"
"\n"
"Not sure what keys you can press in a given menu?  Press the <keybind:HELP_KEYBINDINGS> to open the <color_light_cyan>Keybindings</color> menu.  It allows you to view the existing keybindings and modify them to your liking.  Sometimes there will be lesser used or convenience actions without a default keybinding, which you can also set.\n"
"\n"
"You can continue exploring the tutorial rooms, or you can exit the tutorial by pressing <keybind:save>.  This will save your game and exit to the main menu."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "valentine"
#: data/json/snippets/valentines.json
msgid ""
"There is a picture of a kitten pouncing; blood faintly drips from its claws."
"  \"I'd kill!  For you to be my valentine.\""
msgstr ""
"Hay una imagen de un gatito abalanzándose; la sangre gotea débilmente de sus"
" garras. \"¡Mataría! Para que fueras mi Valentín\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "valentine"
#: data/json/snippets/valentines.json
msgid ""
"A police robot stalks between office cubicles while an indistinct person "
"hides under a desk.  \"Don't hide from love!\""
msgstr ""
"Un robot de policía acecha entre los cubículos de la oficina mientras una "
"persona indistinta se esconde bajo un escritorio. \"¡No te escondas del "
"amor!\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "valentine"
#: data/json/snippets/valentines.json
msgid "A picture of a bloody steak.  \"My love can feed you.\""
msgstr "Una foto de un bistec ensangrentado. \"Mi amor puede alimentarte\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "valentine"
#: data/json/snippets/valentines.json
msgid ""
"A rustic campground at night lit by a campfire.  \"We should go away "
"together.  Where no one can find us.\""
msgstr ""
"Un camping rústico por la noche iluminado por una hoguera. \"Deberíamos "
"irnos juntos. Donde nadie pueda encontrarnos\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "valentine"
#: data/json/snippets/valentines.json
msgid ""
"A girl with a giant spoon stirs a cauldron with a boy inside and a fire "
"below.  \"You suit my taste just right, Valentine\""
msgstr ""
"Una chica con una cuchara gigante agita un caldero con un chico dentro y un "
"fuego debajo. \"Te ajustas a mi gusto, Valentín\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "valentine"
#: data/json/snippets/valentines.json
msgid ""
"A person stepping out from the forest.  \"Don't be afraid, it's me, your "
"valentine!\""
msgstr ""
"Una persona saliendo del bosque. \"¡No tengas miedo, soy yo, tu Valentín!\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "valentine"
#: data/json/snippets/valentines.json
msgid ""
"A building that says 'Crematorium' on it.  \"Ashes to ashes, dust to dust, "
"show me a Valentine, that I can trust\""
msgstr ""
"Un edificio que dice \"Crematorio\". \"Cenizas a las cenizas, polvo al "
"polvo, muéstrame un Valentín, en el que pueda confiar\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "valentine"
#: data/json/snippets/valentines.json
msgid ""
"A popular RPG character.  \"We should adventure together.\"  In the "
"background, a village in flames."
msgstr ""
"Un popular personaje de RPG. \"Deberíamos aventurarnos juntos\". Al fondo, "
"un pueblo en llamas."

#. ~ Snippet in category "valentine"
#: data/json/snippets/valentines.json
msgid ""
"A picture of a room that looks like your bedroom.  \"I can't wait to see you"
" again, Valentine.  Sweet dreams.\""
msgstr ""
"Una foto de una habitación que se parece a tu dormitorio. \"No puedo esperar"
" a verte de nuevo, Valentín. Dulces sueños\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "valentine"
#: data/json/snippets/valentines.json
msgid ""
"A girl smiles into the camera.  Behind her a house is on fire.  \"I'm "
"burning, I'm burning, I'm burning for you, my valentine!\""
msgstr ""
"Una chica sonríe a la cámara. Detrás de ella, una casa está en llamas. \"¡Me"
" estoy quemando, me estoy quemando, me estoy quemando por ti, mi Valentín!\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Freakazoid_1"
#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
msgid ""
"The scariest thing in the world would be… if all the air in the world turned"
" to WOOD!"
msgstr ""
"Lo más aterrador del mundo sería... ¡si todo el aire del mundo se "
"convirtiera en MADERA!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Freakazoid_2"
#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
msgid ""
"Okay, like, the scariest thing in the world would be… if like you went to "
"grab something and it wasn't there!"
msgstr ""
"Vale, lo más aterrador del mundo sería... ¡si fueras a coger algo y no "
"estuviera ahí!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Simpsons_1"
#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
msgid ""
"Could Jesus microwave a burrito so hot, that he himself couldn't eat it?"
msgstr ""
"¿Podría Jesús calentar en el microonda un burrito y dejarlo tan caliente que"
" ni siquiera él mismo podría comerlo?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Simpsons_2"
#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
msgid "They call them fingers, but I never see them fing."
msgstr "Los llaman dedos, pero son más de dos."

#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Simpsons_3"
#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
msgid "…oh, there they go."
msgstr "... oh, ahí se van."

#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Timothy_Leary"
#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
msgid "Science is all metaphor."
msgstr "La ciencia es todo metáfora."

#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_IASIF"
#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
msgid "Science is a liar sometimes."
msgstr "La ciencia a veces es mentirosa."

#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Durr"
#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
msgid "Science is… wait, what was I talking about again?"
msgstr "La ciencia es... espera, ¿de qué estaba hablando otra vez?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Dazed_and_Confused_1"
#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
msgid ""
"Behind every good man there is a woman, and that woman was Martha "
"Washington, man."
msgstr ""
"Detrás de todo gran hombre hay una mujer, y esa mujer era Martha Washington,"
" tío."

#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Dazed_and_Confused_2"
#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
msgid ""
"Every day, George would come home, and she would have a big fat bowl waiting"
" for him when he came in the door, man."
msgstr ""
"Todos los días, George volvía a casa y ella tenía preparado un gran bol, "
"ahí, esperando que venga, tío."

#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Dazed_and_Confused_3"
#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
msgid "She was a hip, hip, hip lady, man."
msgstr "Era una tía buena, hombre."

#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Dazed_and_Confused_4"
#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
msgid "Walkin' down the hall, by myself, smokin' a j with fifty elves."
msgstr "Caminando por el pasillo, solo, fumando hierba con cincuenta elfos."

#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Half_Baked_1"
#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
msgid "You ever see the back of a twenty dollar bill… on weed?"
msgstr ""
"¿Alguna vez viste el reverso de un billete de veinte dólares... en la "
"hierba?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Half_Baked_2"
#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
msgid ""
"Oh, there's some crazy shit, man.  There's a dude in the bushes.  Has he got"
" a gun?  I dunno!"
msgstr ""
"Uh, ahí hay algo muy loco, tío. Hay un tipo en los arbustos. ¿Tiene un arma?"
" ¡No sé!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Half_Baked_3"
#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
msgid "RED TEAM GO, RED TEAM GO!"
msgstr "¡AGUANTE EL EQUIPO ROJO, AGUANTE!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Half_Baked_4"
#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
msgid "That weed was the shiz-nittlebam snip-snap-sack."
msgstr "Esa hierba estaba mortal."

#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Bible"
#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
msgid "You have a sudden urge to flip your bible open to Genesis 1:29…"
msgstr "Tienes un impulso repentino de abrir tu biblia a Génesis 1:29..."

#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Big_Lebowski"
#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
msgid "That rug really tied the room together…"
msgstr "Esa alfombra realmente unió la habitación..."

#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Mitch_Hedberg"
#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
msgid "I used to do drugs… I still do, but I used to, too."
msgstr "Solía drogarme... todavía lo hago, pero solía hacerlo, antes también."

#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Bob_Marley"
#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
msgid "The herb reveals you to yourself."
msgstr "La hierba te revela a ti mismo."

#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Bill_Hicks"
#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
msgid ""
"You suddenly realize that all matter is merely energy condensed to a slow "
"vibration, and we are all one consciousness experiencing itself "
"subjectively."
msgstr ""
"De repente, te das cuenta que toda la materia no es más que energía "
"condensada en una vibración lenta, y que todos somos una consciencia que se "
"experimenta a sí misma de manera subjetiva."

#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Steve_Martin_1"
#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
msgid "I usually only smoke in the late evening."
msgstr "Usualmente, solo fumo tarde a la noche."

#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Steve_Martin_2"
#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
msgid ""
"Oh, occasionally the early evening, but usually the late evening, or the "
"mid-evening."
msgstr ""
"Ah, ocasionalmente temprano a la noche, pero usualmente tarde a la noche, o "
"a mitad de la noche."

#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Steve_Martin_3"
#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
msgid "Just the early evening, mid-evening and late evening."
msgstr "Y temprano a la mañana, a media mañana y tarde a la mañana."

#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Steve_Martin_4"
#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
msgid ""
"Occasionally, early afternoon, early mid-afternoon, or perhaps the late mid-"
"afternoon."
msgstr ""
"Ocasionalmente, temprano a la tarde, temprano a media tarde, o también  "
"tarde a la media tarde."

#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Steve_Martin_5"
#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
msgid "Oh, sometimes the early-mid-late-early-morning."
msgstr "Ah, y a veces temprano a la tarde-noche a mitad de la mañana."

#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Steve_Martin_6"
#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
msgid "…But never at dusk."
msgstr "... Pero nunca al anochecer."

#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Cheech_and_Chong"
#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
msgid "Dave's not here, man."
msgstr "Dave no está ahí, tío."

#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Real_Life_1"
#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
msgid "Man, a cheeseburger sounds SO awesome right now."
msgstr "Tío, una hamburguesa con queso vendría MUY bien en este momento."

#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Real_Life_2"
#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
msgid "Eh… maybe not."
msgstr "Eh... mejor no."

#. ~ Snippet in category "weed_Real_Life_3"
#: data/json/snippets/weed_messages.json
msgid "I guess, maybe, without the cheese… yeah."
msgstr "Creo que, en una de esas, sin queso... sí."

