#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/books.json
msgid "landfall survival manual"
msgid_plural "landfall survival manuals"
msgstr[0] "manual de supervivencia de aterrizaje"
msgstr[1] "manuales de supervivencia de aterrizaje"
msgstr[2] "manuales de supervivencia de aterrizaje"

#. ~ Description of "landfall survival manual"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/books.json
msgid ""
"A small folio indicating how to best utilize the equipment of your landfall "
"survival kit during an emergency.  Its first page urges you to remain calm, "
"and to consult your escape pod's control console for further instructions."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño folleto que indica cómo utilizar mejor el equipo de tu kit de "
"supervivencia de aterrizaje durante una emergencia. Su primera página le "
"insta a mantener la calma y a consultar la consola de control de su cápsula "
"de escape para obtener más instrucciones."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/books.json
msgid "Cyrus Whateley's Notes on Repurposing mi-go victims"
msgid_plural "copies of Cyrus Whateley's Notes"
msgstr[0] ""
"Notas de Cyrus Whateley Sobre La Reconversión de las víctimas de mi-go"
msgstr[1] "copias de Notas de Cyrus Whateley"
msgstr[2] "copias de Notas de Cyrus Whateley"

#. ~ Description of "Cyrus Whateley's Notes on Repurposing mi-go victims"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/books.json
msgid ""
"A folio of notes written by a madman.  They seem to suggest ways to re-"
"animate the dead and create various affronts to the natural order."
msgstr ""
"Un folleto de notas escritas por un loco. Parecen sugerir formas de reanimar"
" a los muertos y crear diversas afrentas al orden natural."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/books.json
msgid "Dr Moreau and You"
msgid_plural "copies of Dr Moreau and You"
msgstr[0] "Dr Moreau y Tu"
msgstr[1] "copias de Dr Moreau y Tu"
msgstr[2] "copias de Dr Moreau y Tu"

#. ~ Description of "Dr Moreau and You"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/books.json
msgid ""
"In what many considered a stunning example of poor taste and others "
"considered overt speciesism this text on the creation of Uplifted Animals "
"references a story about sapient animals killing their creator.  Otherwise a"
" dry text about genetic modification."
msgstr ""
"En lo que muchos consideraron un ejemplo impresionante de mal gusto y otros "
"consideraron un especismo manifiesto, este texto sobre la creación de "
"Animales Ascendidos hace referencia a una historia sobre animales sapientes "
"que matan a su creador. Por lo demás, un texto seco sobre la modificación "
"genética."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/books.json
msgid "Millyficent's Diary"
msgid_plural "copies of Millyficent's Diary"
msgstr[0] "El Diario de Millyficent"
msgstr[1] "copias de El Diario de Millyficent"
msgstr[2] "copias de El Diario de Millyficent"

#. ~ Description of "Millyficent's Diary"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/books.json
msgid ""
"A pocket-sized book filled to the margins with cramped handwriting and notes"
" on the biology of Mi-Go and other musings.  It's hard to understand and "
"quite gruesome in some places and written in a shorthand or cipher in "
"others."
msgstr ""
"Un libro de bolsillo lleno hasta los márgenes con una escritura apretada y "
"notas sobre la biología de Mi-Go y otras reflexiones. Es difícil de entender"
" y bastante espantoso en algunos lugares y escrito en taquigrafía o cifrado "
"en otros."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/books.json
msgid "useful recipes for resistance"
msgid_plural "copies of useful recipes for resistance"
msgstr[0] "recetas útiles Para resistencia"
msgstr[1] "copias de recetas útiles para la resistencia"
msgstr[2] "copias de recetas útiles para la resistencia"

#. ~ Description of "useful recipes for resistance"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/books.json
msgid ""
"Recipes for Resistance is a collection of tales, strategies and recipes for "
"working against corporate rule.  Very simple language is used in the recipes"
" but it drags out the explanations."
msgstr ""
"Recetas Para la Resistencia es una colección de cuentos, estrategias y "
"recetas para trabajar en contra de las reglas corporativas. Se utiliza un "
"lenguaje muy simple en las recetas, pero alarga las explicaciones."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/books.json
msgid "Working in Boreal Conditions and Beyond"
msgid_plural "copies of Working in Boreal Conditions and Beyond"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "Working in Boreal Conditions and Beyond"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/books.json
msgid ""
"A corporate manual for conditions of inhospitable cold.  It includes "
"instructions for building devices and substances that will aid in survival "
"in extreme weather or even the lack thereof."
msgstr ""
"Un manual corporativo para condiciones de frío inhóspito. Incluye "
"instrucciones para la construcción de dispositivos y sustancias que ayudan a"
" la supervivencia en condiciones climáticas extremas o incluso la falta de "
"ellas."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/books.json
msgid "Unusual Ammunitions of the Corporations"
msgid_plural "copies of Unusual Ammunitions of the Corporations"
msgstr[0] "Municiones Inusuales de las Corporaciones"
msgstr[1] "copias de Municiones Inusuales de las Corporaciones"
msgstr[2] "copias de Municiones Inusuales de las Corporaciones"

#. ~ Description of "Unusual Ammunitions of the Corporations"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/books.json
msgid ""
"A lab book dedicated to reverse engineering various ammunitions found "
"throughout the solar system.  Written in a format to allow barely trained "
"technicians to *safely* replicate these rounds."
msgstr ""
"Un libro de laboratorio dedicado a la ingeniería inversa de varias "
"municiones encontradas en todo el sistema solar. Escrito en un formato que "
"permite a los técnicos apenas entrenados a *seguramente* replicar estas "
"municiones."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/books.json
msgid "Applications of Salus IV Lichen"
msgid_plural "copies of Applications of Salus IV Lichen"
msgstr[0] "Aplicaciones del Liquen de Salus IV"
msgstr[1] "copias de Aplicaciones del Liquen de Salus IV"
msgstr[2] "copias de Aplicaciones del Liquen de Salus IV"

#. ~ Description of "Applications of Salus IV Lichen"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/books.json
msgid ""
"A sheaf of notes detailing some species of lichen.  Most of the information "
"is useless to you except for the fact that the majority of Salus IV "
"lifeform's metabolism rely on a macronutrient that acts like a neurotoxin "
"for humans.  One useful note is a detailed procedure to neutralize said "
"neurotoxin."
msgstr ""
"Un montón de notas que detallan algunas especies de líquenes. La mayor parte"
" de la información es inútil para tí excepto por el hecho de que la mayoría "
"del metabolismo de la forma de vida de Salus IV depende de un macronutriente"
" que actúa como una neurotoxina para los humanos. Una nota útil es un "
"procedimiento detallado para neutralizar dicha neurotoxina."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/books.json
msgid "TsKBEM Exoskeleton user manual"
msgid_plural "copies of TsKBEM Exoskeleton user manuals"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "TsKBEM Exoskeleton user manual"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/books.json
msgid ""
"A somewhat hefty manual in Russian with accompanying English text which goes in-depth into the proper usage and maintenance of TsKBEM brand Exoskeletons.\n"
"\n"
"While it mainly pertains to the old TsKBEM exoskeletons, the knowledge within could still help out with modular exoskeletons in general."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/casing.json
msgid "25mm casing"
msgid_plural "25mm casings"
msgstr[0] "casquillo 25mm"
msgstr[1] "casquillos 25mm"
msgstr[2] "casquillos 25mm"

#. ~ Description of "25mm casing"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/casing.json
msgid "A large casing from a spent 25mm cartridge."
msgstr "Un casquillo grande de un cartucho de 25mm gastado."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cast_spell_items.json
msgid "caster"
msgid_plural "casters"
msgstr[0] "lanzador"
msgstr[1] "lanzadores"
msgstr[2] "lanzadores"

#. ~ Description of "caster"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cast_spell_items.json
msgid "A generic techno doodad used to cast spells."
msgstr "Un tecno doodad genérico usado para hacer hechizos."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cast_spell_items.json
msgid "hologram transposition caster"
msgid_plural "hologram transposition casters"
msgstr[0] "lanzador de transposición de hologramas"
msgstr[1] "lanzadores de transposición de hologramas"
msgstr[2] "lanzadores de transposición de hologramas"

#. ~ Description of "hologram transposition caster"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cast_spell_items.json
msgid ""
"A small metallic sphere with a recessed bottom up top.  When activated it "
"will allow you to swap positions with an existing hologram."
msgstr ""
"Una pequeña esfera metálica con un hueco de abajo hacia arriba. Cuando se "
"activa, le permitirá intercambiar posiciones con un holograma existente."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cast_spell_items.json
msgid "hologram flare caster"
msgid_plural "hologram flare casters"
msgstr[0] "lanzador de bengalas de hologramas"
msgstr[1] "lanzadores de bengalas de hologramas"
msgstr[2] "lanzadores de bengalas de hologramas"

#. ~ Description of "hologram flare caster"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cast_spell_items.json
msgid ""
"A small metallic sphere with a recessed bottom up top.  When activated it "
"will allow you to select a hologram, which will explode in a blinding flash,"
" stunning anything nearby."
msgstr ""
"Una pequeña esfera metálica con un hueco de abajo hacia arriba. Cuando se "
"activa, le permitirá seleccionar un holograma, que explotará en un destello "
"cegador, aturdiendo a todo lo que esté cerca."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cast_spell_items.json
msgid "decoy caster"
msgid_plural "decoy casters"
msgstr[0] "lanzador de señuelos"
msgstr[1] "lanzadores de señuelos"
msgstr[2] "lanzadores de señuelos"

#. ~ Description of "decoy caster"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cast_spell_items.json
msgid ""
"A small metallic sphere with a recessed bottom up top.  When activated it "
"will a holographic decoy in a location of your choosing."
msgstr ""
"Una pequeña esfera metálica con un hueco de abajo hacia arriba. Cuando se "
"activa, es un señuelo holográfico en un lugar de su elección."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cast_spell_items.json
msgid "decoy field caster"
msgid_plural "decoy field casters"
msgstr[0] "lanzador de campo de señuelos"
msgstr[1] "lanzadores de campo de señuelos"
msgstr[2] "lanzadores de campo de señuelos"

#. ~ Description of "decoy field caster"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cast_spell_items.json
msgid ""
"A small metallic sphere with a recessed bottom up top.  When activated it "
"will create several holographic decoys around you."
msgstr ""
"Una pequeña esfera metálica con un hueco de abajo hacia arriba. Cuando se "
"activa creará varios señuelos holográficos a su alrededor."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cast_spell_items.json
msgid "recall rig"
msgid_plural "recall rigs"
msgstr[0] "equipo de recuperación"
msgstr[1] "equipos de recuperación"
msgstr[2] "equipos de recuperación"

#. ~ Description of "recall rig"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cast_spell_items.json
msgid ""
"A complex antennae assembly worn around the upper torso that allows its user"
" to home and teleport towards previously configured teleport pads.  Although"
" relatively functional, it's much inferior to the translocation systems of "
"old, and a successful teleport requires standing perfectly still for several"
" minutes."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cast_spell_items.json
msgid "translocator"
msgid_plural "translocators"
msgstr[0] "teletransportador"
msgstr[1] "teletransportadores"
msgstr[2] "teletransportadores"

#. ~ Description of "translocator"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cast_spell_items.json
msgid ""
"An arcane device from the late Hyperspace Era, vaguely resembling a wrist "
"computer made from malleable glass.  It can be activated to quickly deploy a"
" translocator buoy or to teleport to previously activated buoys."
msgstr ""
"Un dispositivo arcano de finales de la Era Hiperespacial, que se asemeja "
"vagamente a una computadora de muñeca hecha de vidrio maleable. Puede "
"activarse para desplegar rápidamente una boya teletransportadora o para "
"teletransportarse a boyas previamente activadas."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cbms.json
msgid "Solar Panels CBM"
msgid_plural "Solar Panels CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Paneles Solares"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Paneles Solares"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Paneles Solares"

#. ~ Description of "Solar Panels CBM"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cbms.json
msgid ""
"Installed on your back is a set of retractable solar panels.  When in direct"
" sunlight, they will automatically deploy and slowly recharge your power "
"level."
msgstr ""
"Instalados en tu espalda hay un conjunto de paneles solares retráctiles. "
"Cuando reciba luz solar directa, se desplegarán automáticamente y recargarán"
" lentamente tu nivel de energía."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cbms.json
msgid "Deployable Grenade Launcher CBM"
msgid_plural "Deployable Grenade Launcher CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Lanzagranadas Desplegable"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Lanzagranadas Desplegable"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Lanzagranadas Desplegable"

#. ~ Description of "Deployable Grenade Launcher CBM"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cbms.json
msgid ""
"A small, folding tube that attaches to your right arm.  Once implanted, it "
"can serve as a portable, integrated tool for firing 40mm grenades and "
"canisters."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño tubo plegable que se fija a tu brazo derecho. Una vez se "
"implanta, puede servir como una herramienta portátil integrada para lanzar "
"granadas de 40mm y contenedores."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cbms.json
msgid "Monofilament Whip CBM"
msgid_plural "Monofilament Whip CBMs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "Monofilament Whip CBM"
#. ~ Description of bionic "Monofilament Whip"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cbms.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A carbon nanotube wire covertly installed in your right arm.  When "
"activated, it extends to its full length and can be used to strike enemies "
"both at close and long range."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cbms.json
msgid "Linguistic Coprocessor CBM"
msgid_plural "Linguistic Coprocessor CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Coprocesador Lingüístico"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Coprocesador Lingüístico"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Coprocesador Lingüístico"

#. ~ Description of "Linguistic Coprocessor CBM"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cbms.json
msgid ""
"A microcomputer installed into the left hemisphere of your brain to increase"
" the speed that it processes language.  When installed, it provides a "
"passive boost to reading speed."
msgstr ""
"Una microcomputadora instalada en el hemisferio izquierdo de tu cerebro para"
" incrementar la velocidad de procesamiento de lenguaje. Cuando está "
"instalado, acelera tu velocidad de lectura."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cbms.json
msgid "Archeotech Grav Chute CBM"
msgid_plural "Archeotech Grav Chute CBMs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "Archeotech Grav Chute CBM"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cbms.json
msgid ""
"Pre-Discontinuity bionic module that was implanted into elite drop troops "
"who could jump from their insertion vehicle during the radar disruption of "
"reentry.  While active, the field will prevent damage to your body from "
"severe impacts, at the cost of impaired movement."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cbms.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
msgid "Power Storage, salvaged"
msgid_plural "several salvaged Power Storage cbms"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "Power Storage, salvaged"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cbms.json
msgid ""
"A battered and used Compact Bionics Module that upgrades the user's power "
"capacity by 50 units.  Having at least one of these is a prerequisite to "
"using powered bionics.  The user will also need a power supply, found in "
"various CBMs."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cbms.json
msgid "Dopamine Stimulators CBM"
msgid_plural "Dopamine Stimulators CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Estimulador de Dopamina"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Estimulador de Dopamina"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Estimulador de Dopamina"

#. ~ Description of "Dopamine Stimulators CBM"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cbms.json
msgid ""
"A set of tiny bionic nerve stimulators that install into the reward center "
"of your brain.  When run with bionic power, it periodically releases a hit "
"of dopamine and other reward chemicals, inducing a state of euphoria and "
"suppressing fear."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de diminutos estimuladores nerviosos biónicos que se instalan en"
" el centro de recompensa de tu cerebro. Cuando funciona con el poder "
"biónico, periódicamente libera un golpe de dopamina y otros químicos de "
"recompensa, induciendo un estado de euforia y suprimiendo el miedo."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cbms.json
msgid "Counteractive Reflexes CBM"
msgid_plural "Counteractive Reflexes CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Reflejos Reactivo"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Reflejos Reactivos"
msgstr[2] "MBCs Reflejos Reactivos"

#. ~ Description of "Counteractive Reflexes CBM"
#. ~ Description of bionic "Counteractive Reflexes"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cbms.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Cybernetic stimulators installed across your nervous system boost your "
"reflexes whenever you are hit in melee, granting you an extra action.  This "
"bionic must be active to function."
msgstr ""
"Los estimuladores cibernéticos instalados a través de tu sistema nervioso "
"potencian tus reflejos cada vez que te golpean en el combate c. a c. "
"otorgándote una acción extra. Este biónico debe estar activo para funcionar."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cbms.json
msgid "Melee Optimization Unit CBM"
msgid_plural "Melee Optimization Unit CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Unidad de Optimización C. a C."
msgstr[1] "MBCs Unidad de Optimización C. a C."
msgstr[2] "MBCs Unidad de Optimización C. a C."

#. ~ Description of "Melee Optimization Unit CBM"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cbms.json
msgid ""
"An implanted AI executes the optimal followup for each of your melee "
"strikes, allowing you to chain them with unnatural speed and grace.  This "
"bionic must be active to function."
msgstr ""
"Una IA implantada ejecuta el seguimiento óptimo para cada uno de tus golpes "
"c. a c. permitiéndote encadenarlos con una velocidad y gracia antinaturales."
" Esta biónico debe estar activo para funcionar."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cbms.json
