#. ~ I figured bionic preppers would have a sci-fi solution to some low tech
#. problems.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/items.json
msgid "folded atomic butter churn"
msgid_plural "folded atomic butter churns"
msgstr[0] "mantequera atómica plegable"
msgstr[1] "mantequeras atómicas plegables"
msgstr[2] "mantequeras atómicas plegables"

#. ~ I figured bionic preppers would have a sci-fi solution to some low tech
#. problems.
#. ~ Description of "folded atomic butter churn"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/items.json
msgid ""
"The Rivtech Churninator 4000, the only churn to be banned by 13 religious "
"sects.  The legs are currently folded up for travel.  Unlike a standard "
"churn that requires cream separated from raw milk this churn requires only "
"raw milk, salt and a healthy respect for glowing objects."
msgstr ""
"El Rivtech Churninator 4000, la única mantequera que ha sido prohibido por "
"13 sectas religiosas. Las piernas están actualmente plegadas para viajar. A "
"diferencia de una mantequera estándar que requiere crema separada de la "
"leche cruda, esta mantequera sólo requiere leche cruda, sal y un respeto "
"saludable por los objetos brillantes."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/items.json
