msgstr[2] "cortadores a batería (off)"

#. ~ Description of "power cutter (off)"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid ""
"A huge, gas-powered saw with a diamond blade.  If it has gasoline, it can be"
" turned on to turn it into a powerful metal cutting tool."
msgstr ""
"Una enorme sierra de gas con una hoja de diamante. Si tiene gasolina, se "
"puede encender para convertirla en una poderosa herramienta para cortar "
"metales."

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "power cutter (off)"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "exosuit power cutter (off)"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_melee.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid "You rev up the power cutter!"
msgstr "¡Acelera el cortador de energía!"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid "power cutter (on)"
msgid_plural "power cutters (on)"
msgstr[0] "cortador a batería (on)"
msgstr[1] "cortadores a batería (on)"
msgstr[2] "cortadores a batería (on)"

#. ~ Description of "power cutter (on)"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid ""
"A huge, gas-powered saw with a diamond blade, currently a whirling blur.  "
"It's consuming gasoline, but can be used as a fantastic tool for cutting "
"metal.  You can also use it as a terrifying weapon, if you're into that sort"
" of thing."
msgstr ""
"Una enorme sierra de gas con una hoja de diamante, actualmente un borrón "
"giratorio. Consume gasolina, pero puede ser usada como una fantástica "
"herramienta para cortar metal. También puedes usarla como un arma "
"aterradora, si te gusta ese tipo de cosas."

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "power cutter (on)"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "exosuit power cutter (on)"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_melee.json
