#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid "oxygen candle"
msgid_plural "oxygen candles"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "oxygen candle"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid ""
"An ignitable device that produces oxygen through an exothermic chemical "
"reaction.  Often stocked as the last backup in case of total life support "
"failure.  You could activate it, but that would just waste it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "UPS"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid ""
"This is a unified power supply, or UPS.  It is a device developed jointly by"
" military and scientific interests for use in combat and the field.  The UPS"
" is designed to power armor and some guns, but drains batteries quickly.  It"
" can be worn strapped to either leg for ease of access, and it's been "
"waterproofed to protect the delicate electronics.  Has its own custom "
"battery, rechargeable and with higher capacity, but not removable"
msgstr ""
"Este es un Sistema de Energía Unificado, o UPS. Es un dispositivo "
"desarrollado conjuntamente por intereses militares y científicos para su uso"
" en combate y en el campo. El UPS está diseñado para alimentar armaduras de "
"energía y algunas armas, pero agota las baterías rápidamente. Se puede "
"llevar atado a cualquiera de las piernas para facilitar el acceso, y ha sido"
" impermeabilizado para proteger los delicados componentes electrónicos. "
"Tiene su propia batería personalizada, recargable y de mayor capacidad, pero"
" no extraíble"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid "bionic maintenance toolkit"
msgid_plural "bionic maintenance toolkits"
msgstr[0] "kit de herramientas de mantenimiento biónico"
msgstr[1] "kits de herramientas de mantenimiento biónico"
msgstr[2] "kits de herramientas de mantenimiento biónico"

#. ~ Description of "bionic maintenance toolkit"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid ""
"A set of very small tools and encrypted digital keys normally used to repair"
" bionic modules in clinical settings.  They will allow you to disassemble "
"simple bionics, but anything more complex would require even more "
"specialized tools."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de herramientas muy pequeñas y claves digitales encriptadas que "
"normalmente se utilizan para reparar módulos biónicos en entornos clínicos. "
"Te permitirán desmontar biónicos sencillos, pero cualquier cosa más compleja"
" requeriría herramientas aún más especializadas."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid "complete bionic toolkit"
msgid_plural "complete bionic toolkits"
msgstr[0] "kit de herramientas biónicas completas"
msgstr[1] "kits de herramientas biónicas completas"
msgstr[2] "kits de herramientas biónicas completas"

#. ~ Description of "complete bionic toolkit"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid ""
"A set of very small robotic tools and encrypted digital keys originally "
"designed to disassemble and test the quality of industrially produced "
"bionics.  A highly skilled and patient engineer could use them to manually "
"assemble new cybernetics."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de herramientas robóticas muy pequeñas y claves digitales "
"encriptadas, originalmente diseñadas para desmontar y probar la calidad de "
"la biónica producida industrialmente. Un ingeniero altamente cualificado y "
"paciente podría utilizarlas para ensamblar manualmente nueva cibernética."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid "cybernetic power port mod"
msgid_plural "cybernetic power port mods"
msgstr[0] "mod de puerto de energía cibernética"
msgstr[1] "mods de puerto de energía cibernética"
msgstr[2] "mods de puerto de energía cibernética"

#. ~ Description of "cybernetic power port mod"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid ""
"This device replaces standard power connections and battery ports for "
"electronic devices with a carefully-shaped port that hooks into bionic "
"implants.  When applied, it will convert an item to run directly off of "
"bionic power."
msgstr ""
"Este dispositivo sustituye las conexiones de alimentación estándar y los "
"puertos de batería para dispositivos electrónicos por un puerto de forma "
"cuidadosa que se engancha a los implantes biónicos. Cuando se aplique, "
"convertirá un artículo para que funcione directamente con energía biónica."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid "control laptop"
msgid_plural "control laptops"
msgstr[0] "portátil de control"
msgstr[1] "portátiles de control"
msgstr[2] "portátiles de control"

#. ~ Description of "control laptop"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid ""
"A modified laptop, now additionally capable of transmitting in the ultra-"
"high frequencies utilized by robots.  Activate it to command robots from "
"afar."
msgstr ""
"Un portátil modificado, ahora capaz de transmitir en frecuencias ultra altas"
" utilizadas por los robots. Activarlo para comandar los robots desde lejos. "

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid "control laptop - lit screen"
msgid_plural "control laptops - lit screen"
msgstr[0] "portátil de control - pantalla encendida"
msgstr[1] "portátiles de control - pantalla encendida"
msgstr[2] "portátiles de control - pantalla encendida"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid "portable virtual reality rig"
msgid_plural "portable virtual reality rigs"
msgstr[0] "equipo de realidad virtual portátil"
msgstr[1] "equipos de realidad virtual portátiles"
msgstr[2] "equipos de realidad virtual portátiles"

#. ~ Description of "portable virtual reality rig"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid ""
"A portable virtual reality rig with glasses for the HUD and the computing "
"functions wrapped around the torso.  When powered on it will provide an "
"overlay on everything you experience."
msgstr ""
"Una prenda de realidad virtual portátil con gafas para el HUD y con "
"funciones informáticas envueltas en el torso. Cuando se enciende "
"proporcionará una superposición en todo lo que experimentas."

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "portable virtual reality rig"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid "power on holosuite"
msgstr "encender holosuite"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "portable virtual reality rig"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid "The holosuite comes to life around you."
msgstr "La holosuite cobra vida a tu alrededor."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid "vr rig - holosuite deployed"
msgid_plural "vr rigs - holosuite deployed"
msgstr[0] "equipo de realidad virtual - holosuite desplegada"
msgstr[1] "equipos de realidad virtual - holosuite desplegada"
msgstr[2] "equipos de realidad virtual - holosuite desplegada"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "vr rig - holosuite deployed"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid "You power down the virtual overlay."
msgstr "Apagas la sobreposición virtual."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid "folded nanotech forge"
msgid_plural "folded nanotech forges"
msgstr[0] "forja de nanotecnología plegada"
msgstr[1] "forjas de nanotecnología plegadas"
msgstr[2] "forjas de nanotecnología plegadas"

#. ~ Description of "folded nanotech forge"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid ""
"Matrioshka Fabritechnics created this portable nanotech forge for when "
"expeditions are setting up a basecamp far from population centers.  Once "
"deployed it can be used to craft ultratech marvels that otherwise are too "
"minute for human crafting."
msgstr ""
"Matrioshka Fabritechnics creó esta forja nanotecnológica portátil para "
"cuando las expediciones están montando un campamento base lejos de los "
"centros de población. Una vez desplegada, puede ser usada para fabricar "
"maravillas ultraterrenas que de otra manera serían demasiado pequeñas para "
"la fabricación humana."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid "pseudo nano forge"
msgid_plural "pseudo nano forges"
msgstr[0] "pseudo nano forjas"
msgstr[1] "pseudo nano forjas"
msgstr[2] "pseudo nano forjas"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid "folded diamond press"
msgid_plural "folded diamond presses"
msgstr[0] "prensa de diamante plegable"
msgstr[1] "prensas de diamantes plegables"
msgstr[2] "prensas de diamantes plegables"

#. ~ Description of "folded diamond press"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid ""
"Matrioshka Fabritechnics this device that can create pressures beyond those "
"that create diamonds.  Once deployed it can be used to craft ultratech "
"marvels that require substances of singular qualities."
msgstr ""
"Matrioshka Fabritechnics este dispositivo que puede crear presiones más allá"
" de las que crean los diamantes. Una vez desplegado, puede ser usado para "
"fabricar maravillas ultraterrenas que requieren sustancias de cualidades "
"singulares."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid "pseudo diamond press"
msgid_plural "pseudo diamond presses"
msgstr[0] "pseudo prensa de diamante"
msgstr[1] "pseudo prensas de diamantes"
msgstr[2] "pseudo prensas de diamantes"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/vehicle_items.json
msgid "robot carrier"
msgid_plural "robot carriers"
msgstr[0] "transportador de robots"
msgstr[1] "transportadores de robots"
msgstr[2] "transportadores de robots"

#. ~ Description of "robot carrier"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/vehicle_items.json
msgid ""
"A heavy frame outfitted with tie-downs and attachment points for carrying "
"cargo, with additional railings to keep a large machine in place.  It is "
"meant to hold large drones and robots for transport.  Use it on a suitable "
"robot to capture, use it on an empty tile to release."
msgstr ""
"Un marco pesado equipado con amarres y puntos de sujeción para el transporte"
" de carga, con barandillas adicionales para mantener una máquina grande en "
"su lugar. Está destinado a albergar grandes zánganos y robots para su "
"transporte. Úsalo en un robot adecuado para capturar, úsalo en un espacio "
"para soltar."

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Vehicle part name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/vehicle_items.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/vehicle_parts.json
msgid "exosuit maintenance gantry"
msgid_plural "exosuit maintenance gantries"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "exosuit maintenance gantry"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/vehicle_items.json
msgid ""
"A vehicle-mounted gantry for supporting an exosuit upright during "
"maintenance and repair.  Includes the specialized tools needed for complex "
"repairs and will also charge the suit's power when activated from the "
"vehicle's controls."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
msgid "CE-4 \"The Claw\" (Non-Lethal)"
msgid_plural "CE-4 \"The Claws\" (Non-Lethal)"
msgstr[0] "CE-4 \"La Garra\" (No-Letal)"
msgstr[1] "CE-4 \"Las Garras\" (No-Letal)"
msgstr[2] "CE-4 \"Las Garras\" (No-Letal)"

#. ~ Description of "CE-4 "The Claw" (Non-Lethal)"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
msgid ""
"The CE-4, commonly known as \"The Claw\", is a popular self-defense weapon "
"used by corporate enforcers everywhere, especially on dangerous frontier "
"worlds.  Made from a cylinder of heat activated memory-alloy, the flick of a"
" switch allows it to morph between a less-lethal bludgeon form and a "
"sharpened, super heated blade.  Currently, it is in its less-lethal "
"configuration, and looks like a sleek side-handle metal baton."
msgstr ""
"El CE-4, comúnmente conocido como \"La Garra\", es un arma de autodefensa "
"muy popular que utilizan los agentes corporativos de todo el mundo, "
"especialmente en los peligrosos mundos fronterizos. Fabricada con un "
"cilindro de aleación de memoria activada por el calor, con sólo pulsar un "
"interruptor puede cambiar entre una forma de garrote menos letal y una hoja "
"afilada y supercaliente. Actualmente, se encuentra en su configuración menos"
" letal, y tiene el aspecto de un elegante bastón metálico de mango lateral."

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "CE-4 "The Claw" (Non-Lethal)"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
msgid ""
"You activate the claw, and its bludgeoning surface slowly flattens into an "
"edge as it begins to glow red-hot"
msgstr ""
"Activas la garra, y su superficie de golpeo se aplana lentamente en un borde"
" mientras comienza a brillar al rojo vivo"

#. ~ "need_charges_msg" action message of item "CE-4 "The Claw" (Non-Lethal)"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
msgid "The claw is out of charge."
msgstr "La garra no tiene carga."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
msgid "CE-4 \"The Claw\" (Lethal)"
msgid_plural "CE-4 \"The Claws\" (Lethal)"
msgstr[0] "CE-4 \"La Garra\" (Letal)"
msgstr[1] "CE-4 \"Las Garras\" (Letal)"
msgstr[2] "CE-4 \"Las Garras\" (Letal)"

#. ~ Description of "CE-4 "The Claw" (Lethal)"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
msgid ""
"The CE-4, commonly known as \"The Claw\", is a popular self-defense weapon "
"used by corporate enforcers everywhere, especially on dangerous frontier "
"planets.  Made from a cylinder of heat activated memory-alloy, the flick of "
"a switch allows it to morph between a less-lethal bludgeon form and a "
"sharpened, super heated blade.  Currently, it is in its lethal "
"configuration, and looks like a sleek sword, humming softly as its blade "
"glows from heat."
msgstr ""
"El CE-4, comúnmente conocido como \"La Garra\", es un arma de autodefensa "
"muy popular que utilizan los agentes corporativos de todo el mundo, "
"especialmente en los peligrosos planetas fronterizos. Fabricada con un "
"cilindro de aleación de memoria activada por el calor, con sólo pulsar un "
"interruptor puede cambiar entre una forma de garrote menos letal y una hoja "
"afilada y supercaliente. Actualmente, está en su configuración letal, y "
"parece una elegante espada, zumbando suavemente mientras su hoja brilla por "
"el calor."

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "CE-4 "The Claw" (Lethal)"
#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "exosuit air supply module (on)"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_modules.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
msgid "Deactivate"
msgstr "Desactivar"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "CE-4 "The Claw" (Lethal)"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
msgid ""
"The blade stops humming, and its edge dissipates into a smooth curve as it "
"cools."
msgstr ""
"La hoja deja de zumbar y su filo se disipa en una suave curva al enfriarse."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
msgid "Alien lune"
msgid_plural "Alien lunes"
msgstr[0] "luna Alien"
msgstr[1] "lunas Alien"
msgstr[2] "lunas Alien"

#. ~ Description of gun "Alien lune"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
msgid ""
"A delicate strand of light links the antipodes of this crescent-shaped "
"device.  If the strand is interrupted, the device clanks and shudders before"
" violently emitting a bolt of plasma from its apex."
msgstr ""
"Un delicado hilo de luz une las antípodas de este dispositivo en forma de "
"media luna. Si el hilo se interrumpe, el dispositivo choca y se estremece "
"antes de emitir violentamente un rayo de plasma desde su vértice."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
msgid "hydraulic gauntlet"
msgid_plural "hydraulic gauntlets"
msgstr[0] "guantelete hidráulico"
msgstr[1] "guanteletes hidráulicos"
msgstr[2] "guanteletes hidráulicos"

#. ~ Description of "hydraulic gauntlet"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
msgid ""
"A huge, heavy metal gauntlet lined with tubing and gauges.  Slow and "
"unwieldy, it uses internal pressure to deliver devastating blows, but takes "
"tremendous strength to use effectively.  Thanks to an internal microreactor,"
" it doesn't require power of its own."
msgstr ""
"Un enorme y pesado guante de metal forrado con tubos y medidores. Lento y "
"poco manejable, utiliza la presión interna para dar golpes devastadores, "
"pero requiere una tremenda fuerza para ser usado efectivamente. Gracias a un"
" microreactor interno, no requiere energía propia."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
msgid "psychrophile handling gloves"
msgid_plural "psychrophile handling gloves"
msgstr[0] "guante de manejo para psicrófilo"
msgstr[1] "guantes de manejo para psicrófilos"
msgstr[2] "guantes de manejo para psicrófilos"

#. ~ Description of "psychrophile handling gloves"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
msgid ""
"These gloves are designed for handling organisms that live in extremely cold"
" temperatures.  They can also be used to freeze your foes to death."
msgstr ""
"Estos guantes están diseñados para manejar organismos que viven en "
"temperaturas extremadamente frías. También pueden ser usados para congelar a"
" tus enemigos hasta la muerte."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
msgid "deployed grenade launcher"
msgid_plural "deployed grenade launchers"
msgstr[0] "lanzagranada desplegable"
msgstr[1] "lanzagranadas desplegable"
msgstr[2] "lanzagranadas desplegable"

#. ~ Description of gun "deployed grenade launcher"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
msgid ""
"A grenade launcher mounted onto your right-hand wrist.  Less powerful than a"
" proper grenade launcher, but infinitely more portable, and quick to reload."
msgstr ""
"Un lanzagranadas montado en su muñeca derecha. Menos potente que un "
"verdadero lanzagranadas, pero infinitamente más portátil y rápido de "
"recargar."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json data/mods/No_Hope/items.json
msgid "Tankbot Main Gun"
msgid_plural "Tankbot Main Gun"
msgstr[0] "Arma Principal de Tanquebot"
msgstr[1] "Armas Principales de Tanquebot"
msgstr[2] "Armas Principales de Tanquebot"

#. ~ Description of gun "Tankbot Main Gun"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json data/mods/No_Hope/items.json
msgid ""
"The 120mm cannon from a tankbot.  If you have this, you'd best be debugging!"
msgstr ""
"Un cañón de 120mm que pertenecía a un tanquebot. Si tienes esto... ¡Mejor "
"que que estes depurando!"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
msgid "titanium bat"
msgid_plural "titanium bats"
msgstr[0] "bate de titanio"
msgstr[1] "bates de titanio"
msgstr[2] "bates de titanio"

#. ~ Description of "titanium bat"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
msgid ""
"A luxury baseball bat made out of titanium that was banned from competitive "
"sport due to the increased performance that put defenders at risk."
msgstr ""
"Un lujoso bate de béisbol hecho de titanio que fue prohibido en el deporte "
"de competición debido al aumento del rendimiento que ponía en riesgo a los "
"defensores."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
msgid "bodyguard knife"
msgid_plural "bodyguard knives"
msgstr[0] "cuchillo de guardaespalda"
msgstr[1] "cuchillos de guardaespaldas"
msgstr[2] "cuchillos de guardaespaldas"

#. ~ Description of "bodyguard knife"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
msgid ""
"Designed to evade security measures, this knife is a must have for any "
"Cataclysm dinner party."
msgstr ""
"Diseñado para evadir las medidas de seguridad, este cuchillo es "
"imprescindible para cualquier cena del Cataclismo."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
msgid "trident"
msgid_plural "tridents"
msgstr[0] "tridente"
msgstr[1] "tridentes"
msgstr[2] "tridentes"

#. ~ Description of "trident"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
msgid ""
"A three pronged spear that is surface treated to be used confidently above "
"and below water."
msgstr ""
"Una lanza de tres puntas que es tratada en la superficie para ser usada con "
"confianza por encima y por debajo del agua."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
msgid "Aztlani bow"
msgid_plural "Aztlani bows"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of gun "Aztlani bow"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
msgid ""
"An ornate bow used by Aztlani nobility during hunting rituals.  Designed to fell the plated creatures of Aztlan, its articulated and power assisted limbs allow it to fire projectiles with a strength comparable to modern assault rifles.\n"
"\n"
"With its drawing aid system currently disabled, firing it will require truly superhuman strength.  It can be activated to toggle it drawing assist functionality."
msgstr ""
"Un arco ornamentado utilizado por la nobleza Aztlaní durante los rituales de caza. Diseñado para abatir a las criaturas acorazadas de Aztlán, sus extremidades articuladas y asistidas le permiten disparar proyectiles con una fuerza comparable a la de los modernos rifles de asalto. \n"
"\n"
"Con su sistema de ayuda a la tracción actualmente desactivado, dispararlo requerirá una fuerza verdaderamente sobrehumana. Puede activarse para activar la función de ayuda al tensado."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
msgid "Aztlani bow (active)"
msgid_plural "Aztlani bows (active)"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of gun "Aztlani bow (active)"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
msgid ""
"An ornate bow used by Aztlani nobility during hunting rituals.  Designed to fell the plated creatures of Aztlan, its articulated and power assisted limbs allow it to fire projectiles with a strength comparable to modern assault rifles.\n"
"\n"
"With its drawing aid system enabled, it can be much more easily drawn, at the cost of a modest amount of UPS power consumption per arrow.  It can be activated to toggle it drawing assist functionality."
msgstr ""
"Un arco ornamentado usado por la nobleza Aztlani durante los rituales de caza. Diseñado para atacar las criaturas chapadas de Aztlan, sus extremidades articuladas y asistidas por potencia le permiten disparar proyectiles con una fuerza comparable a la de un rifle de asalto moderno.\n"
"\n"
"Con su sistema de ayuda de tensado habilitado, se puede tensar fácilmente, a costa de un consumo moderado de energía de la UPS por cada flecha. Puede ser activado para encender su funcionalidad de tensado rápido."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
msgid "Aztlani hunting sword"
msgid_plural "Aztlani hunting swords"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "Aztlani hunting sword"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
msgid ""
"An ornate, single-handed sword used by Aztlani hunters to finish injured "
"game.  Made from gleaming composite alloy, its tip and frontal blade have "
"been sharpened to a monomolecular point, while its back features a serrated "
"saw edge."
msgstr ""
"Una espada ornamentada de una sola mano utilizada por los cazadores aztlani "
"para rematar las piezas de caza heridas. Fabricada con una aleación "
"compuesta brillante, su punta y su hoja frontal han sido afiladas hasta "
"conseguir una punta monomolecular, mientras que su parte posterior presenta "
"un filo de sierra dentado."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
msgid "salvage bow"
msgid_plural "salvage bows"
msgstr[0] "arco recuperado"
msgstr[1] "arcos recuperados"
msgstr[2] "arcos recuperados"

#. ~ Description of gun "salvage bow"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
msgid ""
"A bow made from readily-available materials, and quickly and cheaply put "
"together.  It is not made to be pretty, but to get a job done.  Its nocks "
"and string are made of shape-memory alloy that help increase string tension "
"in the string.  The memory alloy requires a UPS source to be activated."
msgstr ""
"Un arco creado con materiales facilmente disponibles, y facil y barato de "
"crear. No fue creado para ser bonito, pero hace su trabajo. Su culatin y "
"cuerdas estan hechos de una aleación con forma de memoria que ayuda a "
"incrementar su tensión de cuerda. La aleación requiere una fuente UPS para "
"ser activada."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
msgid "salvage crossbow"
msgid_plural "salvage crossbows"
msgstr[0] "ballesta recuperada"
msgstr[1] "ballestas recuperadas"
msgstr[2] "ballestas recuperadas"

#. ~ Description of gun "salvage crossbow"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
msgid ""
"A crossbow constructed of readily available materials, and quickly and "
"cheaply put together.  While it isn't very pretty, it gets the job done, and"
" its drawing mechanism is motorized allowing quick reloading."
msgstr ""
"Una ballesta construida con materiales fáciles de conseguir y montada de "
"forma rápida y barata. Aunque no es muy bonita, cumple su función, y su "
"mecanismo de tiro está motorizado, lo que permite una recarga rápida."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
msgid "monofilament whip"
msgid_plural "monofilament whips"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "monofilament whip"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
msgid ""
"A long filament of nested carbon nanotubes only a few microns in diameter.  "
"In essence a very thin, very strong and very sharp blade that you throw at a"
" moment's notice."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/ammo/10mm.json
msgid "10mm FMJ caseless"
msgid_plural "10mm FMJ caseless"
msgstr[0] "10mm FMJ sin casquillo"
msgstr[1] "10mm FMJ sin casquillo"
msgstr[2] "10mm FMJ sin casquillo"

#. ~ Description of "10mm FMJ caseless"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/ammo/10mm.json
msgid ""
"Standardized 10mm ammunition with a brass jacketed projectile.  For as long "
"as you can remember bullets like these have been used for military, law "
"enforcement, and civilian use."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/ammo/10mm.json
msgid "10mm JHP caseless"
msgid_plural "10mm JHP caseless"
msgstr[0] "10mm JHP sin casquillo"
msgstr[1] "10mm JHP sin casquillo"
msgstr[2] "10mm JHP sin casquillo"

#. ~ Description of "10mm JHP caseless"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/ammo/10mm.json
msgid ""
"Standardized 10mm ammunition with a hollow point projectile.  While they "
"have inferior penetration to FMJ rounds, their expansion slightly increases "
"stopping power against unarmed targets and reduces overpenetration."
msgstr ""

#. ~ tiny guided rockets.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/ammo/10mm.json
msgid "10mm SDART"
msgid_plural "10mm SDART"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ tiny guided rockets.
#. ~ Description of "10mm SDART"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/ammo/10mm.json
msgid ""
"High precision 10mm microjet darts.  These low velocity rounds can adjust "
"mid-flight to exploit weaknesses in the target's defenses."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/ammo/25mm.json
msgid "25mm canister shot"
msgid_plural "25mm canister shot"
msgstr[0] "bote de metralla 25mm"
msgstr[1] "bote de metralla 25mm"
msgstr[2] "bote de metralla 25mm"

#. ~ Description of "25mm canister shot"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/ammo/25mm.json
msgid ""
"A 25mm grenade with a canister shot load, deals devastating damage against "
"moderately armored foes within mid to close range.  Relatively low tech and "
"affordable when compared to other 25mm grenades, these are often fielded by "
"frontier outfits due to their adequate performance in anti-drone and close "
"quarters combat."
msgstr ""
"Una granada de 25 mm con una carga de bote de metralla, que causa un daño "
"devastador contra enemigos con un blindaje moderado a media o corta "
"distancia. Con una tecnología relativamente simple y asequible en "
"comparación con otras granadas de 25 mm, a menudo son utilizadas por los "
"equipos fronterizos debido a su adecuado rendimiento en el combate antidrón "
"y en el combate de proximidad."

#. ~ expensive illegal ammo
#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/ammo/25mm.json
msgid "25mm FRAG"
msgid_plural "25mm FRAG"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ expensive illegal ammo
#. ~ Description of "25mm FRAG"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/ammo/25mm.json
msgid ""
"Standard issue UICA 25mm rounds, each loading a plastic explosive charge "
"within a frangible ceramic projectile."
msgstr ""

#. ~ expensive illegal ammo
#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/ammo/25mm.json
