"A surprisingly heavy rod with a tungsten core, this looks like it could "
"pierce a tank.  When fired from a mining rod launcher, it will briefly map "
"out the area surrounding the impact."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "exosuit interface fitting"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_components.json
msgid ""
"A small connector used in the construction of exosuit plating and modules, "
"these allow the exosuit to provide power and transfer data.  Larger items "
"will require additional fittings to produce."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_frame.json
