msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "exosuit frame"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_frame.json
msgid ""
"This is a standard exosuit frame.  Designed to be modular, it can accept a "
"variety of power supplies, defensive and offensive systems, and utility "
"tools.  Slots exist for the head, torso, power supply, back, arms, and legs."
msgstr ""

#. ~ "need_charges_msg" action message of item "exosuit frame"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_frame.json
msgid "The suit does not have enough charge."
msgstr "El traje no tiene suficiente carga."

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "exosuit frame"
