#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
msgid "cooked piece of alien lung"
msgid_plural "cooked pieces of alien lung"
msgstr[0] "trozo cocinado de pulmón alienígena"
msgstr[1] "trozos cocinados de pulmón alienígena"
msgstr[2] "trozos cocinados de pulmón alienígena"

#. ~ Description of "cooked piece of alien lung"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
msgid ""
"The organ no longer leaks out a strange liquid, and has faded to a light "
"blue color.  It looks chewy, and has an unpleasant smell."
msgstr ""
"El órgano ya no pierde líquido, y se ha desvanecido a un color azul claro. "
"Parece masticable, y tiene un olor desagradable."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
msgid "raw alien liver"
msgid_plural "raw alien livers"
msgstr[0] "hígado alienígena crudo"
msgstr[1] "hígados alienígenas crudos"
msgstr[2] "hígados alienígenas crudos"

#. ~ Description of "raw alien liver"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
msgid ""
"A porous hard organ.  Hazarding a guess from all the large blood vessels "
"going in and out, this is the liver.  It smells rancid."
msgstr ""
"Un órgano duro y poroso. Supones que debido a todos los grandes vasos "
"sanguíneos que entran y salen, este es el hígado. Huele rancio."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
msgid "cooked alien liver"
msgid_plural "cooked alien livers"
msgstr[0] "hígado extraterrestre cocinado"
msgstr[1] "hígados extraterrestres cocinados"
msgstr[2] "hígados extraterrestres cocinados"

#. ~ Description of "cooked alien liver"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
msgid ""
"After some time cooking, the pores of the organ have shrunk, and it's much, "
"much softer - almost yogurt-like in its consistency.  It still smells awful."
msgstr ""
"Después de un tiempo de cocción, los poros del órgano se han encogido, y es "
"mucho, mucho más suave - casi como el yogur en consistencia. Todavía huele "
"horrible."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
msgid "raw alien brains"
msgid_plural "raw alien brains"
msgstr[0] "cerebro alienígena crudo"
msgstr[1] "cerebros alienígenas crudos"
msgstr[2] "cerebros alienígenas crudos"

#. ~ Description of "raw alien brains"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
msgid ""
"A brain butchered from an alien organism.  It looks somewhat similar to its "
"earthly analogues, barring its light-blue coloration and gland riddled "
"frontal lobe."
msgstr ""
"Un cerebro masacrado de un organismo alienígena. Se ve algo similar a sus "
"análogos terrestres, salvo por su coloración azul claro y su lóbulo frontal "
"lleno de glándulas."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
msgid "cooked alien brains"
msgid_plural "cooked alien brains"
msgstr[0] "cerebro alienígena cocinado"
msgstr[1] "cerebros alienígenas cocinados"
msgstr[2] "cerebros alienígenas cocinados"

#. ~ Description of "cooked alien brains"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
msgid ""
"Fried and scrambled, this doesn't look the most appetizing, but it's edible "
"(you hope)."
msgstr ""
"Frito y revuelto, esto no parece muy apetecible, pero es comestible (eso "
"esperas)."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
msgid "raw alien kidney"
msgid_plural "raw alien kidneys"
msgstr[0] "riñón alienígena crudo"
msgstr[1] "riñones alienígenas crudos"
msgstr[2] "riñones alienígenas crudos"

#. ~ Description of "raw alien kidney"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
msgid ""
"You are guessing here, but this is likely the kidney of the animal.  The "
"ammonia smell was the biggest hint."
msgstr ""
"Estás adivinando aquí, pero es probable que sea el riñón de un animal. El "
"olor a amoníaco fue la mayor pista."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
msgid "cooked alien kidney"
msgid_plural "cooked alien kidneys"
msgstr[0] "riñón alienígena cocinado"
msgstr[1] "riñones alienígenas cocinados"
msgstr[2] "riñones alienígenas cocinados"

#. ~ Description of "cooked alien kidney"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
msgid ""
"Thoroughly cooked and prepared, this alien organ has acquired the filthy "
"ammonia smell of a poorly mopped spaceship deck.  Even if it were safe to "
"eat, you are not sure you'd want to."
msgstr ""
"Totalmente cocinado y preparado, este órgano alienígena ha adquirido el "
"asqueroso olor a amoníaco de una cubierta de nave espacial mal fregada. "
"Incluso si fuera seguro comerlo, no estás seguro de querer hacerlo."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
msgid "raw alien sweetbread"
msgid_plural "raw alien sweetbreads"
msgstr[0] "lechecilla cruda alienigena"
msgstr[1] "lechecillas crudas alienigenas"
msgstr[2] "lechecillas crudas alienigenas"

#. ~ Description of "raw alien sweetbread"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
msgid ""
"You got this chunk of meat from the throat of the animal; it looks "
"different?"
msgstr ""
"Obtuviste este trozo de carne de la garganta del animal, ¿se ve diferente?"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
msgid "cooked alien sweetbread"
msgid_plural "cooked alien sweetbreads"
msgstr[0] "lechecilla alienígena cocinada"
msgstr[1] "lechecillas alienígenas cocinadas"
msgstr[2] "lechecillas alienígenas cocinadas"

#. ~ Description of "cooked alien sweetbread"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
msgid ""
"Well, it's definitely not muscle, you can tell now.  It oozes a purple "
"liquid out onto your hand as you hold it."
msgstr ""
"Bueno, definitivamente no es músculo, puedes decirlo ahora. Supura un "
"líquido púrpura en tu mano mientras la sostienes."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid "alien bone"
msgid_plural "alien bones"
msgstr[0] "hueso alienígena"
msgstr[1] "huesos alienígenas"
msgstr[2] "huesos alienígenas"

#. ~ Description of "alien bone"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
msgid "Obviously bones.  Could be used to make some stuff, like needles."
msgstr ""
"Obviamente los huesos. Podrían usarse para hacer algunas cosas, como agujas."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
msgid "chunk of alien fat"
msgid_plural "chunks of alien fat"
msgstr[0] "trozo de grasa alienígena"
msgstr[1] "trozos de grasa alienígena"
msgstr[2] "trozos de grasa alienígena"

#. ~ Description of "chunk of alien fat"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
msgid ""
"Freshly butchered fat from an alien.  You could eat it cooked or raw, but it"
" is more safely used for crafting non edible-products."
msgstr ""
"Grasa recién cortada de un extraterrestre. Se puede comer cocinada o cruda, "
"pero es más seguro usarla para la fabricación de productos no comestibles."

#. ~ *May* have been commercially traded.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid "alien tallow"
msgid_plural "alien tallows"
msgstr[0] "sebos extraterrestres"
msgstr[1] "sebos extraterrestres"
msgstr[2] "sebos extraterrestres"

#. ~ *May* have been commercially traded.
#. ~ Description of "alien tallow"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
msgid ""
"A smooth white block of cleaned and rendered alien animal fat.  It'll last "
"for a very long time, but you are unsure of its edibility.  Can be used as "
"an ingredient in many foods and projects."
msgstr ""
"Un bloque blanco y liso de grasa animal alienígena procesada y limpia. "
"Durará mucho tiempo, pero no estás seguro de si es comestible. Puede ser "
"usada como ingrediente en muchas comidas y proyectos."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
msgid "alien lard"
msgid_plural "alien lard"
msgstr[0] "manteca de alienígena"
msgstr[1] "manteca de alienígena"
msgstr[2] "manteca de alienígena"

#. ~ Description of "alien lard"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
msgid ""
"A smooth white block of dry-rendered animal fat.  It'll last for a very long"
" time, but you are unsure of its edibility.  Can be used as an ingredient in"
" many foods and projects."
msgstr ""
"Un bloque blanco y liso de grasa animal procesada seca. Durará mucho tiempo,"
" pero no estas seguro de si es comestible. Puede ser usada como ingrediente "
"en muchas comidas y proyectos."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
msgid "unidentifiable alien organs"
msgid_plural "unidentifiable alien organs"
msgstr[0] "órgano alienígena no identificable"
msgstr[1] "órganos alienígenas no identificables"
msgstr[2] "órganos alienígenas no identificables"

#. ~ Description of "unidentifiable alien organs"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
msgid ""
"An unidentifiable pile of organs; you have no idea how you'd prepare them."
msgstr ""
"Una pila inidentificable de órganos; no tienes ni idea de cómo los "
"prepararías."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
msgid "alien cracklins"
msgid_plural "alien cracklins"
msgstr[0] "chicharrón de alien"
msgstr[1] "chicharrones de alien"
msgstr[2] "chicharrones de alien"

#. ~ Description of "alien cracklins"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
msgid ""
"Bits of alien fat and skin that have been fried until they are crispy and "
"delicious (at least, you hope they are)."
msgstr ""
"Trozos de grasa y piel alienígena fritos hasta que estén crujientes y "
"deliciosos (al menos, eso esperas)."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
msgid "freezerburned human cracklins"
msgid_plural "freezerburned human cracklins"
msgstr[0] "chicharrones de humano quemado por el frio"
msgstr[1] "chicharrones de humano quemado por el frio"
msgstr[2] "chicharrones de humano quemado por el frio"

#. ~ Description of "freezerburned human cracklins"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
msgid ""
"Green scraps of rancid fat and skin, and while they have been fried to a "
"crisp, they still don't smell any better."
msgstr ""
"Restos verdes de grasa y piel rancia, y aunque se han frito hasta quedar "
"crujientes, todavía no huelen mejor."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
msgid "raw alien hide"
msgid_plural "raw alien hides"
msgstr[0] "pellejos de alienigena crudos"
msgstr[1] "pellejos de alienigena crudos"
msgstr[2] "pellejos de alienigena crudos"

#. ~ Description of "raw alien hide"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
msgid ""
"A carefully folded raw skin harvested from an alien animal.  You can cure it"
" for storage and tanning, or eat it if you're desperate enough."
msgstr ""
"Una piel cruda cuidadosamente doblada y cosechada de un animal alienígena. "
"Puedes curarla para almacenarla y curtirla, o comerla si estás lo "
"suficientemente desesperado."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
msgid "raw alien pelt"
msgid_plural "raw alien pelts"
msgstr[0] "pelaje alienígena cruda"
msgstr[1] "pelajes alienígenas crudas"
msgstr[2] "pelajes alienígenas crudas"

#. ~ Description of "raw alien pelt"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/alienfood.json
msgid ""
"A carefully folded raw skin harvested from a fur-bearing alien animal.  It "
"still has the fur attached.  You can cure it for storage and tanning, or eat"
" it if you're desperate enough."
msgstr ""
"Una piel cruda cuidadosamente doblada y cosechada de un animal alienígena "
"con pelaje. Todavía tiene el pelaje adherido. Puedes curarla para "
"almacenarla y curtirla, o comerla si estás lo suficientemente desesperado."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/bug_brew.json
msgid "mealgrub growth medium"
msgid_plural "mealgrub growth mediums"
msgstr[0] "medio de crecimiento de gusanos de harina"
msgstr[1] "medios de crecimiento de gusanos de harina"
msgstr[2] "medios de crecimiento de gusanos de harina"

#. ~ Description of "mealgrub growth medium"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/bug_brew.json
msgid ""
"All sorts of organic substances rendered into a nutritious goop that can be "
"used as a growth medium in grub aquaculture.  Urban myth claims that its "
"original formula was just bottled industrial runoff.  Whatever the case, "
"mealgrubs thrive within it."
msgstr ""
"Todo tipo de sustancias orgánicas convertidas en un pringue nutritivo que "
"puede utilizarse como medio de crecimiento en la acuicultura de gusanos. El "
"mito urbano afirma que su fórmula original era sólo un vertido industrial "
"embotellado. Sea cual sea el caso, los gusanos de harina prosperan en él."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/bug_brew.json
msgid "mealgrub spores"
msgid_plural "mealgrub spores"
msgstr[0] "esporas de gusanos de harina"
msgstr[1] "esporas de gusanos de harina"
msgstr[2] "esporas de gusanos de harina"

#. ~ Description of "mealgrub spores"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/bug_brew.json
msgid ""
"Mealgrubs are a staple aquacultural product, treasured for their ability to "
"process nearly any organic substance into safe for consumption animal "
"protein.  As the result of very heavy-handed gene-modding these are "
"proprietary organisms, and strictly speaking, it's illegal to grow them "
"without a license."
msgstr ""
"Los engordadores de larvas son un producto acuícola básico, apreciado por su"
" capacidad para procesar casi cualquier sustancia orgánica y convertirla en "
"proteína animal segura para el consumo. Como resultado de una modificación "
"genética muy intensa, se trata de organismos patentados y, estrictamente "
"hablando, es ilegal cultivarlos sin licencia."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/bug_brew.json
msgid "mealgrub broth"
msgid_plural "mealgrub broth"
msgstr[0] "caldo de gusanos de comida"
msgstr[1] "caldos de gusanos de harina"
msgstr[2] "caldos de gusanos de harina"

#. ~ Description of "mealgrub broth"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/bug_brew.json
msgid ""
"Growth medium seeded with mealgrub eggs.  Once placed in a growing vat, they"
" should be ready for harvesting in around 76 hours.  The immature grub's "
"metabolism can produce toxic by-products so caution is advisable."
msgstr ""
"Medio de crecimiento sembrado con huevos de gusanos de harina. Una vez "
"colocados en una cuba de crecimiento, deberían estar listos para la cosecha "
"en unas 76 horas. El metabolismo del gusano inmaduro puede producir "
"subproductos tóxicos, por lo que se recomienda precaución."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/bug_brew.json
msgid "live mealgrubs"
msgid_plural "live mealgrubs"
msgstr[0] "gusanos de harina vivos"
msgstr[1] "gusanos de harina vivos"
msgstr[2] "gusanos de harina vivos"

#. ~ Description of "live mealgrubs"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/bug_brew.json
msgid ""
"Thousands of mature mealworms, squirming in the viscous remains of their "
"growth medium.  They are ready for harvest, and in fact require speedy "
"cleaning and processing, as the harvest can quickly rot in this stage."
msgstr ""
"Miles de gusanos de la harina maduros, retorciéndose en los restos viscosos "
"de su medio de crecimiento. Están listos para la cosecha, y de hecho "
"requieren una rápida limpieza y procesamiento, ya que la cosecha puede "
"pudrirse rápidamente en esta etapa."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/bug_brew.json
msgid "mealgrubs"
msgid_plural "mealgrubs"
msgstr[0] "gusanos de harina"
msgstr[1] "gusanos de harina"
msgstr[2] "gusanos de harina"

#. ~ Description of "mealgrubs"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/bug_brew.json
msgid ""
"A handful of edible and heavily genemoded grubs, each only slightly thinner than your thumb.  Engineered in the wake of the XXII century to feed an overpopulated Earth and its fledgling colonies these are sturdy, easily grown and scalable crop.\n"
"\n"
"Removed from their growth solution they'll quickly die and desiccate, as these already have.  They could be safely eaten with no further processing, for a nutritious if somewhat striking meal."
msgstr ""
"Un puñado de gusanos comestibles y fuertemente modificados genéticamente, cada uno de ellos un poco más delgado que tu pulgar. Creados en el siglo XXII para alimentar a una Tierra superpoblada y a sus nuevas colonias, son robustos, fáciles de cultivar y escalables.\n"
"\n"
"Si se les retira de su solución de crecimiento, morirán y se secarán rápidamente, como ya lo han hecho estas. Pueden ser comidos con seguridad sin más procesamiento, para una comida nutritiva aunque algo impactante."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
msgid "nutriment"
msgid_plural "nutriments"
msgstr[0] "nutrimento"
msgstr[1] "nutrimentos"
msgstr[2] "nutrimentos"

#. ~ Description of "nutriment"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
msgid ""
"A crumbly white biscuit half the size of your thumb, packed with vitamins "
"and calories.  Provides a whole meal's nutrition in portable form, but it's "
"a little hard to keep down, thanks to the rancid taste and chalky texture."
msgstr ""
"Una galleta blanca y desmenuzable del tamaño de la mitad de tu pulgar, llena"
" de vitaminas y calorías. Proporciona la nutrición completa de una comida en"
" forma portátil, pero es un poco difícil de bajar, gracias al sabor rancio y"
" la textura calcárea."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
msgid "nutriment water"
msgid_plural "nutriment waters"
msgstr[0] "agua de nutrimento"
msgstr[1] "aguas de nutrimento"
msgstr[2] "aguas de nutrimento"

#. ~ Description of "nutriment water"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
msgid ""
"Nutriment that has been dissolved in water to dilute its taste.  Unnervingly"
" resembles spoiled milk."
msgstr ""
"Nutrimento que ha sido disuelto en agua para diluir su sabor. Se asemeja "
"inquietantemente a la leche estropeada."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
msgid "Spite Soda"
msgid_plural "Spite Sodas"
msgstr[0] "Gaseosa Rencor"
msgstr[1] "Gaseosas Rencor"
msgstr[2] "Gaseosas Rencor"

#. ~ Description of "Spite Soda"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
msgid ""
"Spite Soda, the only soda native to the Salus system.  'Stay Frosty, Drink "
"Spite'.  Visitors to the Salus system who have drank Spite Soda have "
"described it as the taste of transhumanist dialectical materialism."
msgstr ""
"Gaseosa Rencor, la única gaseosa nativa del sistema Salus. 'Mantente Helado,"
" Bebe Rencor'. Los visitantes del sistema Salus que tomaron Gaseosa Rencor "
"la describen como el sabor de materialismo dialéctico transhumanista."

#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "Spite Soda"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
msgid ""
"You take a swig, it tastes like it was distilled in a hyperspace engine."
msgstr ""
"Tomas un trago y sabe como si hubiera sido destilado en un motor "
"hiperespacial."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
msgid "H₂O™"
msgid_plural "H₂O™"
msgstr[0] "H₂O™"
msgstr[1] "H₂O™"
msgstr[2] "H₂O™"

#. ~ Description of "H₂O™"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
msgid ""
"When Thistle Industries successfully trademarked the chemical formula of "
"water, you thought the world had gone irreparably insane, but things have "
"only gotten worse since."
msgstr ""
"Cuando Thistle Industries registró con éxito la fórmula química del agua, "
"pensastes que el mundo se había vuelto irremediablemente loco, pero las "
"cosas sólo han empeorado desde entonces."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
msgid "food cubes"
msgid_plural "food cubes"
msgstr[0] "cubos de comida"
msgstr[1] "cubos de comida"
msgstr[2] "cubos de comida"

#. ~ Description of "food cubes"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
msgid ""
"Smoothly blended edibles, neatly shaped into cubes for maximum enjoyment."
msgstr ""
"Comestibles mezclados suavemente, con forma de cubos para un máximo "
"disfrute."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
msgid "Foodplace's Food-to-go™"
msgid_plural "Foodplace's Food-to-go™"
msgstr[0] "Comida para llevar™  de Lugarcomida"
msgstr[1] "Comida para llevar™  de Lugarcomida"
msgstr[2] "Comida para llevar™  de Lugarcomida"

#. ~ Description of "Foodplace's Food-to-go™"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
msgid ""
"Foodplace™ easy-storage Food-to-go™ the choice Food™ for the contemporary "
"Foodman™."
msgstr ""
"Comida para llevar™  fácil de almacenar de Lugarcomida™ la eleccion Comida ™"
" para el Hombrecomida™ contemporáneo."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
msgid "loop 'fruit'"
msgid_plural "loop 'fruits'"
msgstr[0] "cereales loop 'fruit's"
msgstr[1] "cereales loop 'fruit's"
msgstr[2] "cereales loop 'fruit's"

#. ~ Description of "loop 'fruit'"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
msgid "Rings of caramelized yellow colorant, tasting not exactly like apple."
msgstr ""
"Anillos de colorante amarillo caramelizado, con sabor no exactamente a "
"manzana."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
msgid "cee wafers"
msgid_plural "cee wafers"
msgstr[0] "galletas cee"
msgstr[1] "galletas cee"
msgstr[2] "galletas cee"

#. ~ Description of "cee wafers"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
msgid ""
"Smooth crackers colored grayish-green.  Used to be perfectly edible seaweed,"
" or so the wrapper claims."
msgstr ""
"Suaves galletas de color verde grisáceo. Solía ser un alga perfectamente "
"comestible, o eso dice el envoltorio."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
msgid "beefsim"
msgid_plural "beefsims"
msgstr[0] "símilvacuno"
msgstr[1] "símilvacuno"
msgstr[2] "símilvacuno"

#. ~ Description of "beefsim"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
msgid ""
"Soy or pureed rat?  Better not to know.\n"
"(But its probably both.)"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
msgid "soup, flavor 27"
msgid_plural "soup, flavor 27"
msgstr[0] "sopa, sabor 27"
msgstr[1] "sopa, sabor 27"
msgstr[2] "sopa, sabor 27"

#. ~ Description of "soup, flavor 27"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
msgid ""
"Yellow chunks float on creamy liquid, like flotsam on a filthy summer pond."
"  Branding implies at least 26 other flavors, but you have neither seen or "
"heard about any of them."
msgstr ""
"Trozos amarillos flotan en un líquido cremoso, como los restos de un sucio "
"estanque de verano. La marca implica al menos otros 26 sabores, pero no has "
"visto ni oído hablar de ninguno de ellos."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
msgid "landfall survival rations"
msgid_plural "landfall survival rations"
msgstr[0] "ración de supervivencia de aterrizaje"
msgstr[1] "raciones de supervivencia de aterrizaje"
msgstr[2] "raciones de supervivencia de aterrizaje"

#. ~ Description of "landfall survival rations"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
msgid ""
"Sealed emergency rations invariably found within an escape pod's inventory."
"  This particular pack should provide around a day's worth of nutrition.  "
"Required by regulation but rarely ever used, the design of these \"meals\" "
"prioritizes a long shelf life and a very low bulk-cost.  Which lends them "
"their disgusting taste of greased sawdust."
msgstr ""
"Raciones de emergencia selladas que invariablemente se encuentran en el "
"inventario de una cápsula de escape. Este paquete en particular debería "
"proporcionar alrededor de un día de nutrición. Requerido por la regulación "
"pero raramente usado, el diseño de estas \"comidas\" prioriza una larga vida"
" útil y un muy bajo costo a granel. Lo que les da su desagradable sabor a "
"aserrín engrasado."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
msgid "caffex"
msgid_plural "caffex"
msgstr[0] "caffex"
msgstr[1] "caffex"
msgstr[2] "caffex"

#. ~ Description of "caffex"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
msgid ""
"A dark and soapy beverage, pre-brewed and loaded with synthetic caffeine."
msgstr ""
"Una bebida oscura y jabonosa, pre-conservada y cargada con cafeína "
"sintética."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/comestibles.json
msgid "heat retention cream"
msgid_plural "heat retention creams"
msgstr[0] "crema de retención de calor"
msgstr[1] "cremas de retención de calor"
msgstr[2] "cremas de retención de calor"

#. ~ Description of "heat retention cream"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/comestibles.json
msgid ""
"Rub this on your skin when you are expecting exposure to extreme cold "
"temperatures.  Cannot protect from instant frostbite.  Smells like the "
"inside of a sheep."
msgstr ""
"Aplique sobre su piel cuando espere exponerse a temperaturas extremadamente "
"frías. No puede proteger de la congelación instantánea. Huele como el "
"interior de una oveja."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/comestibles.json
msgid "heat retention cream xtreme"
msgid_plural "heat retention cream xtremes"
msgstr[0] "crema de retención de calor extremo"
msgstr[1] "cremas de retención de calor extremo"
msgstr[2] "cremas de retención de calor extremo"

#. ~ Description of "heat retention cream xtreme"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/comestibles.json
msgid ""
"This product was advertised before the Cataclysm for extreme cold "
"environment protection.  You remember a demonstration involving a woman "
"coating her hand in this and plunging it in liquid nitrogen for a second.  "
"You're pretty sure that was staged."
msgstr ""
"Este producto fue anunciado antes del Cataclismo para la protección "
"ambiental contra el frío extremo. Recuerdas una demostración en la que una "
"mujer cubría su mano con esto y la sumergía en nitrógeno líquido por un "
"segundo. Estás bastante seguro de que eso fue un montaje."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/comestibles.json
msgid "atomic butter"
msgid_plural "atomic butter"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "atomic butter"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/comestibles.json
msgid ""
"A yellow stick of milkfat and milk solids, made from cow's milk and the "
"power of the atom.  All radiation levels are confirmed to be in line with "
"background exposure and any cancers later in life have nothing to do with "
"this butter or any products made with this butter.  By consuming this butter"
" you indemnify and hold harmless the Rivtech Corporation, its parent company"
" and subsidiaries and any agents, directors or officers of the Rivtech "
"Corporation from any losses or damages that may occur as a result of "
"consuming this butter in any form or fashion."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Should add a Mercurial version with stronger performance enhancing
#. effects later on.  As a quest/alliance reward?
#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/medicine.json
msgid "synthetic blood"
msgid_plural "synthetic blood"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Should add a Mercurial version with stronger performance enhancing
#. effects later on.  As a quest/alliance reward?
#. ~ Description of "synthetic blood"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/medicine.json
msgid ""
"A chalk white blood analogue for emergency medical use.  Far more efficient "
"at oxygenation than natural blood, it can also be used as a general "
"performance enhancer.  Once injected, it will be metabolized or otherwise "
"expunged from the the body in around 8 hours."
msgstr ""

#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "synthetic blood"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/medicine.json
#, c-format
msgid "You inject the %s."
msgstr ""

