msgstr[2] "fotónicos hipergeométricos"

#. ~ Description of "hypergeometric photonics"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/circuity_scrap.json
msgid ""
"In your hands lies a self-contained digital universe.  Its programs glowing "
