msgid_plural "E-150bs"
msgstr[0] "E-150b"
msgstr[1] "E-150bs"
msgstr[2] "E-150bs"

#. ~ Description of gun "E-150b"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/laser.json
msgid ""
"A silver, elegantly-wrought laser pistol that fires armor-piercing bolts of "
"golden light.  A now-irreplaceable historical artifact built by the "
"engineering AIs of the late Hyperspace Era, it is as precious as it is "
"deadly."
msgstr ""
"Una pistola láser plateada, elegantemente forjada, que dispara rayos de luz "
"dorada que perforan la armadura. Se trata de un artefacto histórico ya "
"insustituible, construido por las IAs de ingeniería de finales de la Era "
"Hiperespacial, y es tan valioso como mortífero."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/laser.json
msgid "V14 laser pistol"
msgid_plural "V14 laser pistols"
msgstr[0] "pistola láser V14"
msgstr[1] "pistolas láser V14"
msgstr[2] "pistolas láser V14"

#. ~ Description of gun "V14 laser pistol"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/laser.json
msgid ""
"An incredibly ancient and outdated laser pistol design with origins "
"traceable to Earth's early Space Age.  One of the few 'open-hardware' guns, "
"its leaked and widely-circulated design specifications allow this weapon to "
"retain some popularity within backwater worlds."
msgstr ""
"Un diseño de pistola láser increíblemente antiguo y anticuado cuyos orígenes"
" se remontan a la primera Edad Espacial de la Tierra. Es una de las pocas "
"pistolas de \"hardware abierto\", y sus especificaciones de diseño filtradas"
" y ampliamente difundidas permiten que esta arma conserve cierta popularidad"
" en los mundos atrasados."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/laser.json
msgid "Makeshift Scrambler Rifle"
msgid_plural "Makeshift Scrambler Rifles"
msgstr[0] "Rifle De Interferencias Improvisado"
msgstr[1] "Rifles De Interferencias Improvisados"
msgstr[2] "Rifles De Interferencias Improvisados"

#. ~ Description of gun "Makeshift Scrambler Rifle"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/laser.json
msgid ""
"This 'energy weapon' appears to be haphazardly jury-rigged from commercially"
" available electronics.  It has a radar dish placed where a barrel would be,"
" and the frame of a weapon is covered in a mesh of wiring.  Despite its "
"appearance, this weapon can temporarily stun robots if you manage to hit "
"their sensors."
msgstr ""
"Esta \"arma de energía\" parece haber sido improvisada a partir de "
"componentes electrónicos disponibles en el mercado. Tiene una antena "
"parabólica colocada donde estaría un cañón, y el armazón del arma está "
"cubierto por una malla de cables. A pesar de su apariencia, esta arma puede "
"aturdir temporalmente a los robots si consigues alcanzar sus sensores."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/laser.json
msgid "xm34 EMP projector"
msgid_plural "xm34 EMP projectors"
msgstr[0] "proyector PEM xm34"
msgstr[1] "proyectores PEM xm34"
msgstr[2] "proyectores PEM xm34"

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/mining_rod.json
msgid "mining rod launcher"
msgid_plural "mining rod launchers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of gun "mining rod launcher"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/mining_rod.json
msgid ""
"Based on an old TsKBEM design, this is a rail launcher used in mining "
"exploration.  The rod is fired into a rock face and a seismic mapper on the "
"launcher displays ore veins.  Not being designed for combat, it is difficult"
" to use without the augmented strength of an exosuit and the reloading "
"process is quite slow.  The barrel is covered in warning labels indemnifying"
" the manufacturer of any injuries caused by misuse."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/plasma.json
msgid "plasma gun"
msgid_plural "plasma guns"
msgstr[0] "arma de plasma"
msgstr[1] "armas de plasma"
msgstr[2] "armas de plasma"

#. ~ Description of gun "plasma gun"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/plasma.json
msgid "A plasma gun."
msgstr "Una pistola de plasma."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/plasma.json
msgid "PAM-41 2g"
msgid_plural "PAM-41 2gs"
msgstr[0] "PAM-41 2g"
msgstr[1] "PAM-41 2gs"
msgstr[2] "PAM-41 2gs"

#. ~ Description of gun "PAM-41 2g"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/plasma.json
msgid ""
"A short and stubby 2 gram plasma railgun occasionally used by espatiers as a"
" hull breaching tool.  Like larger plasma weapons, it propels toroids of "
"plasma that detonate on contact, but its reduced size heavily hampers its "
"range and damage output.  Fired within an atmosphere, its very low range "
"makes it dangerous to shooter and target alike."
msgstr ""
"Un cañón de riel de plasma de 2 gramos, corto y rechoncho, utilizado "
"ocasionalmente por los espaciadores como herramienta para romper el casco. "
"Al igual que las armas de plasma más grandes, propulsa toroides de plasma "
"que detonan al contacto, pero su reducido tamaño dificulta en gran medida su"
" alcance y su producción de daños. Si se dispara dentro de una atmósfera, su"
" escaso alcance lo hace peligroso tanto para el tirador como para el "
"objetivo."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/plasma.json
msgid "377-UASTA (weaponized)"
msgid_plural "377-UASTA (weaponized)"
msgstr[0] "377-UASTA (convertido en arma)"
msgstr[1] "377-UASTA- (convertido en arma)"
msgstr[2] "377-UASTA- (convertido en arma)"

#. ~ Description of "377-UASTA (weaponized)"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/plasma.json
msgid ""
"A common modification for directed plasma torches that involves the installation of oversize capacitor banks and judiciously bypassed safety mechanisms, allowing them to function as a deadly if decidedly short-ranged weapons.  In most cases, the resulting \"gun\" can still perform its original metalworking functions, albeit at a much lower efficiency.\n"
"\n"
"Unlike purposefully made plasma weapons, the propelled plasma bottle won't cause a considerable explosion upon contact, allowing for relatively safe operation within enclosed spaces."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/projectile.json
msgid "bionic skullgun"
msgid_plural "bionic skullguns"
msgstr[0] "pistola calavera biónica"
msgstr[1] "pistolas calavera biónica"
msgstr[2] "pistolas calavera biónica"

#. ~ Description of gun "bionic skullgun"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/projectile.json
msgid "Bionic one-shot subdermal .40 pistol integrated with your head."
msgstr "Pistola biónica subdérmica del .40 integrada en la cabeza."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/projectile.json
msgid "makeshift rail rifle"
msgid_plural "makeshift rail rifles"
msgstr[0] "rifle de rail improvisado"
msgstr[1] "rifles de rail improvisados"
msgstr[2] "rifles de rail improvisados"

#. ~ Description of gun "makeshift rail rifle"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/projectile.json
msgid ""
"A single-shot, break-action, electrically propelled, steel rail launcher "
"handcrafted from scrap.  The hypervelocity metal stake that it fires is "
"accelerated to the point of spontaneous combustion by a Lorentz force "
"generated by electromagnetic induction, powered by a standard UPS."
msgstr ""
"Un lanzador de rieles de acero, hecho a mano y con chatarra, de disparo "
"único, de acción-de-ruptura y propulsado electricamente. La estaca de metal "
"a hipervelocidad que dispara está acelerada al punto de llegar a la "
"combustión espontánea por la fuerza de Lorentz generada por la inducción "
"electromagnética. Se alimenta de un UPS estandar."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/voltaic.json
msgid "R-PROTON ENR"
msgid_plural "R-PROTON ENRs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of gun "R-PROTON ENR"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/voltaic.json
msgid ""
"Within the solid barrel of the Raaz PROTON, an electrical anomaly is "
"carefully duplicated through magnetic stimulation and projected outwards.  "
"Freed from containment, the anomaly will temporarily settle in the physical "
"world and quickly emit its stored electrical charge before dissipating."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Firing mode of gun "R-PROTON ENR"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/voltaic.json
msgid "Pulse "
msgstr "Pulso"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "electrolaser conversion"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gunmods/laser_gunmods.json
msgid ""
"A set of high-tech electronics and optics.  This converts a laser pistol "
"into a less-lethal electrolaser capable of stunning targets, at the cost of "
"decreased damage output and increased power consumption."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de electrónica y óptica de alta tecnología. Convierte una "
"pistola láser en un electroláser menos letal capaz de aturdir a los "
"objetivos, a costa de reducir el daño y aumentar el consumo de energía."

#. ~ Description of gun mod "high density capacitor"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gunmods/laser_gunmods.json
msgid ""
"A capacitor with a higher energy density increases range and damage, at the "
"cost of doubling power consumption."
msgstr ""
"Un condensador con mayor densidad de energía aumenta el alcance y el daño, a"
" costa de duplicar el consumo de energía."

#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gunmods/sights.json
msgid "terrible iron sights"
msgid_plural "terrible iron sights"
msgstr[0] "mira de hierro terrible"
msgstr[1] "miras de hierro terribles"
msgstr[2] "miras de hierro terribles"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "terrible iron sights"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gunmods/sights.json
msgid ""
"The iron sights of this weapon are infamously terrible, making aiming much "
"harder than it needs to be."
msgstr ""
"Las miras de hierro de esta arma son infames y hacen que apuntar sea mucho "
"más difícil de lo necesario."

#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gunmods/sights.json
msgid "holographic aim-assist system"
msgid_plural "holographic aim-assist system"
msgstr[0] "sistema holográfico de ayuda a la puntería"
msgstr[1] "sistemas holográficos de ayuda a la puntería"
msgstr[2] "sistemas holográficos de ayuda a la puntería"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "holographic aim-assist system"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gunmods/sights.json
msgid ""
"An advanced ballistic computer calculates projectile trajectories, hit-"
"probabilities, and enemy movements, before outputting the information into "
"an AR holo display.  It greatly increases both accuracy and aiming speed."
msgstr ""
"Un avanzado ordenador de balística calcula las trayectorias de los "
"proyectiles, las probabilidades de impacto y los movimientos del enemigo, "
"antes de emitir la información en una pantalla holográfica de RA. Aumenta "
"enormemente la precisión y la velocidad de puntería."

#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gunmods/sights.json
msgid "ballistic computer"
msgid_plural "ballistic computer"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of gun mod "ballistic computer"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gunmods/sights.json
msgid ""
"An integrated ballistic computer completely replaces the sights of this "
"weapon.  Aiming depends on a small glass screen on which targets are "
"automatically highlighted."
msgstr ""

