msgstr[2] "RMGS5 8x40mm cargadores de velocidad"

#. ~ Description of magazine "RMGS5 8x40mm speedloader"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/magazine/8x40mm.json
msgid ""
"This speedloader, made by Rivtech for use with the RM99 revolver, can hold 5"
" rounds of 8x40mm caseless rounds and quickly reload a compatible revolver."
msgstr ""
"Este cargador de velocidad fabricado por Rivtech para usar con el revólver "
"RM99, contiene 5 balas 8x40mm sin casquillo y rápidamente recargar el "
"revólver compatible."

#. ~ Magazine name
