msgstr ""

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture.json
msgid "escape pod seat"
msgstr "asiento de la cápsula de escape"

#. ~ Description of furniture "escape pod seat"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture.json
msgid ""
"The cushioned and upright facing seat of a single-seater escape pod.  A "
"storage space beneath it holds survival supplies."
msgstr ""
"El asiento acolchado y orientado hacia arriba de la cápsula de escape "
"monoplaza. Un espacio de almacenamiento debajo de él contiene suministros de"
" supervivencia."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture.json
msgid "chirurgic suite"
msgstr "suite quirúrgica"

#. ~ Description of furniture "chirurgic suite"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture.json
msgid ""
"A multitude of surgical arms seamlessly meld with the chromed ceiling.  They"
" expectantly unravel with your approach, animated by an AI whose "
"performances blur the lines between medicine and art."
msgstr ""
"Una multitud de brazos quirúrgicos se funden a la perfección con el techo "
"cromado. Se desenvuelven con expectación cuando te acercas, animados por una"
" IA cuyas actuaciones desdibujan los límites entre la medicina y el arte."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture.json
msgid "Autodoc Mk. XVI"
msgstr "Autodoc Mk. XVI"

#. ~ Description of furniture "Autodoc Mk. XVI"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture.json
msgid ""
"A commercial surgical robot often found within licensed clinics and "
"corporate hospitals.  Its various AI routines assist during surgery, but "
"they are no replacement for the actual operator's skill."
msgstr ""
"Un robot quirúrgico comercial que suele encontrarse en clínicas autorizadas "
"y hospitales corporativos. Sus diversas rutinas de IA ayudan durante la "
"cirugía, pero no sustituyen a la habilidad del operador real."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture.json
msgid "salvaged Autodoc"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of furniture "salvaged Autodoc"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture.json
msgid ""
"The kind of worn-down and dubiously safe surgical device that is perfectly "
"at home in a back alley clinic.  It would take great skill to safely operate"
" this."
msgstr ""
"El tipo de dispositivo quirúrgico desgastado y de dudosa seguridad que se "
"encuentra perfectamente en una clínica de callejón. Se necesitaría una gran "
"habilidad para operar esto con seguridad."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture.json
msgid "sleep pod"
msgstr "capsula de sueño"

#. ~ Description of furniture "sleep pod"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture.json
msgid ""
"This is a climate controlled sleep pod.  An easy way to reduce energy costs "
"in dense urban environments."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una cápsula para dormir con control climático. Una forma sencilla de"
" reducir los costes energéticos en entornos urbanos densos."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture.json
msgid "cryo pod"
msgstr "capsula criogénica"

#. ~ Description of furniture "cryo pod"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture.json
msgid ""
"This is a long term sleep pod.  Cryo pods are mostly used by people waiting "
"a short term for organs or criminals avoiding heat right after a crime."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una capsula para dormir un largo tiempo. Las capsulas criogénicas "
"son usadas principalmente por personas que esperan un corto plazo para "
"obtener órganos o criminales que evitan el peligro después de un crimen."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture.json
msgid "cryo pylon"
msgstr "pilón criogénico"

#. ~ Description of furniture "cryo pylon"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture.json
msgid ""
"This super chilled pylon is so cold it seems to pull in warmth towards "
"itself and create a light breeze of freezing air."
msgstr ""
"Este pilón superfrío es tan frío que parece atraer el calor hacia sí mismo y"
" crear una ligera brisa de aire helado."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture.json
msgid "active micro heat mill"
msgstr "micromolino de calor activo"

#. ~ Description of furniture "active micro heat mill"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture.json
msgid ""
"This comparatively-small wind turbine heat mill turns wind energy into a "
"relatively small amount of constant heat.  This heat provides a modicum of "
"respite from the neverending cold of Salus IV; they were sometimes built in "
"the dozens to create agricultural zones outside of greenhouses."
msgstr ""
"Este molino de calor, comparativamente pequeño, convierte la energía eólica "
"en una cantidad relativamente pequeña de calor constante. Este calor "
"proporciona un mínimo respiro del interminable frío de Salus IV; a veces se "
"construyeron por docenas para crear zonas agrícolas fuera de los "
"invernaderos."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture.json
msgid "broken micro heat mill"
msgstr "micromolino de calor roto"

#. ~ Description of furniture "broken micro heat mill"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture.json
msgid ""
"This broken-down heat mill once provided respite from the cold.  Designed to"
" operate without human maintenance indefinitely, but has broken down - or "
"been intentionally damaged."
msgstr ""
"Este molino de calor roto proporcionó una vez un respiro del frío. Diseñado "
"para funcionar sin mantenimiento humano indefinidamente, pero se ha "
"averiado... o ha sido dañado intencionadamente."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture.json
msgid "CRISPR Biolab"
msgstr "Biolaboratorio CRISPR"

#. ~ Description of furniture "CRISPR Biolab"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture.json
msgid ""
"A boxy looking device of arms, droppers, and pipettes.  It was used pre-"
"Cataclysm to do gene-editing experiments."
msgstr ""
"Un dispositivo de aspecto cuadrado con brazos, goteros y pipetas. Se "
"utilizaba antes del Cataclismo para hacer experimentos de edición genética."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture.json
msgid "nano forge"
msgstr "nano forja"

#. ~ Description of furniture "nano forge"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture.json
msgid ""
"Matrioshka Fabritechnics nano forge looks like a solid black box.  Apertures"
" for ingredients open with a hum as the console commands are entered.  DO "
"NOT INSERT ANY PART OF YOUR ANATOMY."
msgstr ""
"La nano forja de Matrioshka Fabritechnics parece una sólida caja negra. Las "
"aberturas para los ingredientes se abren con un zumbido cuando se introducen"
" los comandos de la consola. NO INTRODUZCA NINGUNA PARTE DE SU ANATOMÍA."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture.json
msgid "3D printer"
msgstr "impresora 3D"

#. ~ Description of furniture "3D printer"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture.json
msgid ""
"This box was used for rapid prototyping of products and for general "
"entertainment purposes in the masses."
msgstr ""
"Esta caja se utilizaba para la creación rápida de prototipos de productos y "
"para el entretenimiento general de las masas."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture.json
msgid "translocator buoy"
msgstr "boya de teletransporte"

#. ~ Description of furniture "translocator buoy"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture.json
msgid ""
"A near undetectable spatial distortion field centered around a free floating"
" golden mote.  Examining it from up close would let you encode it for use "
"with a translocation device."
msgstr ""
"Un campo de distorsión espacial casi indetectable centrado en una mota "
"dorada que flota libremente. Examinarla de cerca te permitiría codificarla "
"para usarla con un dispositivo de teletransporte."

#. ~ Bashing sound of furniture "translocator buoy"
#. ~ Bashing failed sound of furniture "translocator buoy"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture.json
msgid "a faint echo."
msgstr "un débil eco."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture.json
msgid "telepad"
msgstr "telepuerto"

#. ~ Description of furniture "telepad"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture.json
msgid ""
"A smooth tile of metal, hiding beneath it the complex machinery of a "
"translocator.  The engineering required to build these is poorly understood "
"nowadays, so this one has likely been here since the Hyperspace Era.  "
"Examining it from up close would let you encode it for use with a "
"translocation device."
msgstr ""
"Una baldosa lisa de metal, que esconde bajo ella la compleja maquinaria de "
"un teletransportador. La ingeniería necesaria para construirlos es poco "
"conocida hoy en día, así que es probable que éste haya estado aquí desde la "
"Era del Hiperespacio. Examinarla de cerca te permitiría codificarla para "
"usarla con un dispositivo de teletransportación."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture.json
msgid "neural net inserter"
msgstr "insertador de red neuronal"

#. ~ Description of furniture "neural net inserter"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture.json
msgid ""
"This device looks like a cross between some kind of nightmare dentistry "
"equipment and socketing tool mounted on a slide that lets it drop precisely "
"down.  Useful for those projects that require putting delicate items into "
"hard to reach spaces."
msgstr ""
"Este dispositivo parece un cruce entre una especie de equipo de odontología "
"de pesadilla y una herramienta de encaje montada en una corredera que le "
"permite descender con precisión. Útil para aquellos proyectos que requieren "
"colocar elementos delicados en espacios de difícil acceso."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture.json
msgid "monomolecular saw"
msgstr "sierra monomolécular"

#. ~ Description of furniture "monomolecular saw"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture.json
msgid ""
"A wire the size of a cheescutter runs in a single direction in this tool, "
"allowing atomically precise cuts at almost any angle.  Even unpowered it "
"gives off a visual distortion for several inches around it to prevent you "
"from losing a hand.  It is impossible to deconstruct this device without the"
" wire self destructing."
msgstr ""
"Un cable del tamaño de un cortador de queso corre en una sola dirección en "
"esta herramienta, lo que permite realizar cortes atómicamente precisos en "
"casi cualquier ángulo. Incluso sin alimentación, emite una distorsión visual"
" durante varios centímetros a su alrededor para evitar que se pierda una "
"mano. Es imposible deconstruir este dispositivo sin que el cable se "
"autodestruya."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture.json
msgid "military SICC terminal"
msgstr "terminal SICC militar"

#. ~ Description of furniture "military SICC terminal"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture.json
msgid ""
"Console interface for a Standard Interstellar Communications Cluster.  With "
"the machine connected to it broken, it can only be salvaged for parts."
msgstr ""
"Interfaz de Consola para un Grupo de Comunicaciones Interestelar Estándar. "
"Con la máquina conectada a ella rota, sólo puede ser desguazada por piezas."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture.json
msgid "military SICC master computing array"
msgstr "matriz de computación maestra SICC militar"

#. ~ Description of furniture "military SICC master computing array"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture.json
msgid ""
"A massive metal construct reaching as high as the ceiling, this Master "
"Computing Array of a Standard Interstellar Communications Cluster used to be"
" the pinnacle of quantum waveform manipulation technology.  Now, though, "
"it's nothing more than a box full of delicious electronics."
msgstr ""
"Una enorme construcción metálica que llega hasta el techo, esta array de "
"computación maestra de un clúster de comunicaciones interestelar estándar "
"solía ser el pináculo de la tecnología de manipulación de la forma de onda "
"cuántica. Ahora, sin embargo, no es más que una caja llena de deliciosa "
"electrónica."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture.json
msgid "sabotaged military SICC master computing array"
msgstr "matriz de computación maestra SICC militar saboteada"

#. ~ Description of furniture "sabotaged military SICC master computing array"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture.json
msgid ""
"Vandalized remains of a Standard Interstellar Communications Cluster.  Wires"
" and connectors spill out from a torn side panel, revealing the mangled "
"carcass of a century-old beast.  Although stripped of its core components, "
"careful searching may reveal useful electronics for scavengers like you."
msgstr ""
"Restos vandalizados de un grupo de Comunicaciones Interestelares Estándar. "
"Los cables y los conectores se desprenden de un panel lateral desgarrado, "
"revelando la carcasa destrozada de una bestia centenaria. Aunque está "
"desprovista de sus componentes principales, una búsqueda cuidadosa puede "
"revelar componentes electrónicos útiles para los rebuscadores como tú."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture.json
msgid "military SICC satellite link"
msgstr "lenlace por satélite SICC militar"

#. ~ Description of furniture "military SICC satellite link"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture.json
msgid ""
"A large satellite dish mounted on a towering amplification platform, linked "
"to an orbital satellite that probably doesn't exist anymore.  Although the "
"satellite dish is of little use due to the unorthodox geometry, the "
"amplifier circuitry will prove invaluable for high-energy gadgets."
msgstr ""
"Una gran antena parabólica montada en una altísima plataforma de "
"amplificación, conectada a un satélite orbital que probablemente ya no "
"existe. Aunque la antena parabólica es poco útil debido a su geometría poco "
"ortodoxa, los circuitos de amplificación resultarán muy valiosos para los "
"artilugios de alta energía."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture.json
msgid "military SICC power supply"
msgstr "fuente de energía SICC militar"

#. ~ Description of furniture "military SICC power supply"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture.json
msgid ""
"Dedicated power supply module for a Standard Interstellar Communications "
"Cluster.  Capable of drawing thousands of watts during operation, it "
"requires a dedicated heat dissipation array to function normally."
msgstr ""
"Módulo de suministro de energía dedicado a un Grupo de Comunicaciones "
"Interestelares Estándar. Capaz de consumir miles de vatios durante su "
"funcionamiento, requiere una matriz de disipación de calor específica para "
"funcionar con normalidad."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture.json
msgid "destroyed military SICC power supply"
msgstr "fuente de energía SICC militar destruida"

#. ~ Description of furniture "destroyed military SICC power supply"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture.json
msgid ""
"An incoherent mess of molten polymer and charred metamaterial, this badly "
"damaged module used to be the power supply for a Standard Interstellar "
"Communications Cluster.  It seems to have undergone a catastrophic overload "
"event, which is weird considering the array of failsafes these things are "
"equipped with."
msgstr ""
" Una lio incoherente de polímero fundido y metamaterial carbonizado, este "
"módulo tan dañado solía ser la fuente de alimentación de un Grupo de "
"Comunicaciones Interestelares Estándar. Parece haber sufrido una sobrecarga "
"catastrófica, lo que resulta extraño si se tiene en cuenta la serie de "
"dispositivos de seguridad con los que están equipados."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture.json
msgid "military SICC heat dissipation array"
msgstr "matriz de disipación de calor SICC militar"

#. ~ Description of furniture "military SICC heat dissipation array"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture.json
msgid ""
"A miniature forest of metallic fins and sparkling panels, this is a "
"dedicated heat dissipation module for a Standard Interstellar Communications"
" Cluster.  It is installed outside to utilize the frigid air for maximum "
"cooling."
msgstr ""
"Es un bosque miniatura de aletas metálicas y paneles brillantes pero es en "
"realidad un módulo dedicado de disipación de calor para el Equipo Estándar "
"de Comunicaciones Interestelares. Está instalado afuera para utilizar el "
"aire frío para un enfriamiento máximo."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture.json
msgid "DIRT data interface"
msgstr "interfaz de datos DIRT"

#. ~ Description of furniture "DIRT data interface"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture.json
msgid ""
"All-in-one integrated console for a Driving Intelligent Realtime Topography "
"rover-mounted vehicular terrain scanner system.  In other words, a useless "
"display monitor."
msgstr ""
"Consola integrada todo en uno para un sistema de escáner de terreno "
"vehicular montado en un rover de Conducción Inteligente de Topografía en "
"Tiempo Real. En otras palabras, una pantalla inútil."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture.json
msgid "DIRT computation core"
msgstr "núcleo de computación DIRT"

#. ~ Description of furniture "DIRT computation core"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture.json
msgid ""
"Data analysis and computing core for a DIRT terrain scanner system.  Rugged "
"design and internal shock absorbers help this hefty metal box withstand "
"extreme cold and harsh driving conditions."
msgstr ""
"Núcleo de análisis de datos y computación para un sistema de escáner de "
"terreno DIRT. El diseño robusto y los amortiguadores internos ayudan a esta "
"robusta caja metálica a soportar el frío extremo y las duras condiciones de "
"conducción."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture.json
msgid "dismantled DIRT computation core"
msgstr "núcleo de computación DIRT desmantelado"

#. ~ Description of furniture "dismantled DIRT computation core"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture.json
msgid ""
"It seems that you are not the first one to think of dismantling this "
"precious metal box for the goodies inside - The top lid of this DIRT "
"computational core is missing, and the hollowed-out insides are clearly "
"visible from the opening."
msgstr ""
"Parece que no es usted el primero que piensa en desmontar esta preciosa caja"
" de metal para encontrar las golosinas de su interior - La tapa superior de "
"este núcleo computacional DIRT ha desaparecido, y las entrañas huecas son "
"claramente visibles desde la apertura."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture.json
msgid "DIRT scanner array"
msgstr "matriz de escáner DIRT"

#. ~ Description of furniture "DIRT scanner array"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture.json
msgid ""
"Mounted on a self-stabilizing gimbal, this high-tech sphere is full of "
"various sensors and scanners that automatically map out the surrounding "
"terrain with an amazing accuracy."
msgstr ""
"Montada en un artilugio autoestabilizador, esta esfera de alta tecnología "
"está repleta de diversos sensores y escáneres que cartografían "
"automáticamente el terreno circundante con una precisión asombrosa."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_lab.json
msgid "high-performance liquid chromatographer"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Computer name placed on map lab_1side
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/lab_cryo_room.json
