#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/aliens.json
msgid "labbit"
msgid_plural "labbits"
msgstr[0] "lonejo"
msgstr[1] "lonejos"
msgstr[2] "lonejos"

#. ~ Description of monster "labbit"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/aliens.json
msgid ""
"A rabbit from earth, genetically modified to eat the lichen of Salus IV.  "
"Its fur is rust colored and its ears are shortened to preserve warmth."
msgstr ""
"Un conejo de la tierra, modificado genéticamente para comer el liquen de "
"Salus IV. Su pelaje es de color óxido y sus orejas están acortadas para "
"conservar el calor."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/aliens.json
msgid "garlander"
msgid_plural "garlanders"
msgstr[0] "guirnalda"
msgstr[1] "guirnaldas"
msgstr[2] "guirnaldas"

#. ~ Description of monster "garlander"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/aliens.json
msgid ""
"A ribbon-like alien that glides along the ground on countless hair-thin "
"legs, wrapping around sources of body heat to absorb as much as it can "
"before gliding on."
msgstr ""
"Un alienígena con forma de cinta que se desliza por el suelo sobre "
"innumerables y finas patas, rodeando las fuentes de calor corporal para "
"absorber todo lo que pueda antes de seguir deslizándose."

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "garlander"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/aliens.json
msgid "The air around the garlander feels unnaturally cold!"
msgstr "El aire alrededor de la guirnalda se siente anormalmente frío."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/aliens.json
msgid "anchor-boatman"
msgid_plural "anchor-boatmen"
msgstr[0] "arrastrabarquero"
msgstr[1] "arrastrabarqueros"
msgstr[2] "arrastrabarqueros"

#. ~ Description of monster "anchor-boatman"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/aliens.json
msgid ""
"The anchor-boatman, borne on the frozen wind like a predatory dandelion "
"seed, subtly inclines its rigid parachutes as it drifts towards its prey, "
"its clawed tentacles undulating and flicking as they taste the air for signs"
" of life.  Soft things that get too close are hooked, bled out, and dragged "
"behind it for months as it extracts every bit of nutrition it can.  "
"Scavengers that try to take its prey often join them."
msgstr ""
"El arrastrabarqueros, llevado por el viento helado como una semilla de "
"diente de león depredadora, inclina sutilmente sus rígidos paracaídas "
"mientras se acerca a su presa, sus tentáculos con garras ondulan y aletean "
"mientras prueban el aire en busca de señales de vida. Las cosas blandas que "
"se acercan demasiado son enganchadas, desangradas y arrastradas detrás de él"
" durante meses mientras extrae toda la nutrición que puede. Los carroñeros "
"que intentan llevarse su presa a menudo se unen a ellos."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/aliens.json
msgid "runner"
msgid_plural "runners"
msgstr[0] "corredor"
msgstr[1] "corredores"
msgstr[2] "corredores"

#. ~ Description of monster "runner"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/aliens.json
msgid ""
"A large fluffy three-legged herbivore, extremely fast and cowardly.  It "
"usually grazes alone, and relies on its keen senses to stay safe."
msgstr ""
"Un gran herbívoro de tres patas, extremadamente rápido y cobarde. Suele "
"pastar en solitario y confía en sus agudos sentidos para mantenerse a salvo."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/aliens.json
msgid "grazer"
msgid_plural "grazers"
msgstr[0] "pastante"
msgstr[1] "pastantes"
msgstr[2] "pastantes"

#. ~ Description of monster "grazer"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/aliens.json
msgid ""
"A large furred herbivore, with its heavy head constantly against the ground."
"  It uses its clawed hooves to shovel up the snow to reach any dead plant "
"life to eat."
msgstr ""
"Es un gran herbívoro peludo, con su pesada cabeza constantemente contra el "
"suelo. Utiliza sus pezuñas con garras para palear la nieve y alcanzar "
"cualquier planta muerta para comer."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/aliens.json
msgid "hevel"
msgid_plural "hevels"
msgstr[0] "hevel"
msgstr[1] "heveles"
msgstr[2] "heveles"

#. ~ Description of monster "hevel"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/aliens.json
msgid ""
"A small creature covered in blue down, scurrying across the ground fast as "
"it digs through the snow with claws buried in its down, looking for food.  "
"It works in large packs with its fellow kin."
msgstr ""
"Una pequeña criatura cubierta de plumón azul, que se desliza rápidamente por"
" el suelo mientras escarba en la nieve con las garras enterradas en el "
"plumón, en busca de comida. Trabaja en grandes manadas con sus congéneres."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/aliens.json
msgid "venandi"
msgid_plural "venatores"
msgstr[0] "venadi"
msgstr[1] "venadores"
msgstr[2] "venadores"

#. ~ Description of monster "venandi"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/aliens.json
msgid ""
"A six-legged animal, showing relative intelligence in not only its ability "
"to track and hunt down prey, but its strategy of covering itself with the "
"skin of its hunts to warm itself."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/aliens.json
msgid "terror bird"
msgid_plural "terror birds"
msgstr[0] "temor alado"
msgstr[1] "temores alados"
msgstr[2] "temores alados"

#. ~ Description of monster "terror bird"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/aliens.json
msgid ""
"A tall bird with two long, muscular legs, a long neck, and a long sharp "
"beak."
msgstr ""
"Un pájaro alto con dos patas largas y musculares, un largo cuello y un pico "
"largo y puntiagudo."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/mutants.json
msgid "frost maddened human"
msgid_plural "frost maddened humans"
msgstr[0] "humano enloquecido por la escarcha"
msgstr[1] "humanos enloquecidos por la escarcha"
msgstr[2] "humanos enloquecidos por la escarcha"

#. ~ Description of monster "frost maddened human"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/mutants.json
msgid ""
"Sky blue irises cover the entirety of the eye.  What happened to this person"
" during their deep freeze?"
msgstr ""
"El iris azul cielo cubre la totalidad del ojo. ¿Qué le ocurrió a esta "
"persona durante su congelación?"

#. ~ Description of monster "mon_cryokinetic"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/mutants.json
msgid ""
"Sky blue irises with gray floating flecks cover the entirety of the eye.  "
"Flurries seem to emanate from around them."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mon_cryokinetic"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/mutants.json
msgid "A burst of frozen air explodes from their lungs!"
msgstr "¡Una ráfaga de aire helado explota de sus pulmones!"

