msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of monster "skittish scavenger"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/reavers_and_bandits.json
msgid ""
"A scavenger willing to engage in violence to scavenge your remains.  Will "
"run after a reasonable show of force from their would be victims."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Targeting sound of special attack of monster "skittish scavenger"
