#. ~ Description of monster "opportunistic bandit"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/reavers_and_bandits.json
msgid ""
"Armed with a rifle, this bandit seems to feel quite sure of their impending "
"victory."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Targeting sound of special attack of monster "opportunistic bandit"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/reavers_and_bandits.json
msgid "\"I bet you're worth a pretty penny!\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
msgid "brain blaster"
msgid_plural "brain blasters"
msgstr[0] "blaster cerebral"
msgstr[1] "blasters cerebrales"
msgstr[2] "blasters cerebrales"

#. ~ Description of monster "brain blaster"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
msgid ""
"The mi-go have set up some defenses here.  This horrifying techo-organic "
"amalgamation appears to use brains in jars as their operating system.  On "
"the plus side it looks like an easy headshot."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
msgid "Whately family brain blaster"
msgid_plural "Whately family brain blasters"
msgstr[0] "blaster cerebral de la familia Whately"
msgstr[1] "blasters cerebrales de la familia Whately"
msgstr[2] "blasters cerebrales de la familia Whately"

#. ~ Description of monster "Whately family brain blaster"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
msgid ""
"The Whately family deploys mi-go style techno-organic defensive turrets.  "
"They claim that these turrets are made from family members near death, but "
"you have doubts."
msgstr ""
"La familia Whately despliega torretas defensivas tecno-orgánicas de estilo "
"mi-go. Afirman que estas torretas están hechas con miembros de la familia "
"próximos a la muerte, pero tú tienes dudas."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
msgid "Wraitheon Pathfinder"
msgid_plural "Wraitheon Pathfinders"
msgstr[0] "Navegador Wraitheon"
msgstr[1] "Navegadores Wraitheon"
msgstr[2] "Navegadores Wraitheon"

#. ~ Description of monster "Wraitheon Pathfinder"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
msgid ""
"The Wraitheon Pathfinder is a massive, house-height armored robot.  It is "
"armed to the teeth with a 40mm anti-material grenade launcher, a 5.56 anti-"
"personnel gun, and an electroshock capability to defend against melee "
"strikes.  Manufactured by Wraitheon for the ESCA military, it was used along"
" with infantry thanks to the flexibility of its reverse-jointed legs."
msgstr ""
"El Navegador Wraitheon es un enorme robot blindado de la altura de una casa."
" Está armado hasta los dientes con un lanzagranadas antimaterial de 40 mm, "
"un cañón antipersona 5.56 y una capacidad de electrochoque para defenderse "
"de los ataques c. a c. Fabricado por Wraitheon para el ejército de la ESCA, "
"se utilizó junto con la infantería gracias a la flexibilidad de sus patas de"
" articulación inversa."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
msgid "Wraitheon Regulator"
msgid_plural "Wraitheon Regulators"
msgstr[0] "Regulador Wraitheon"
msgstr[1] "Reguladores Wraitheon"
msgstr[2] "Reguladores Wraitheon"

#. ~ Description of monster "Wraitheon Regulator"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
msgid ""
"Designed by Wraitheon, the Regulator is a refrigerator-sized UGV designed "
"for high-risk urban fighting.  Armed with an anti-material missile launcher,"
" a 40mm grenade launcher, and several anti-personnel weapons, it's designed "
"to match the fervor of freedom fighters with the industrial might of Earth."
msgstr ""
"Diseñado por Wraitheon, el Regulador es un vehículo aéreo no tripulado del "
"tamaño de un refrigerador, diseñado para la lucha urbana de alto riesgo. "
"Armado con un lanzamisiles antimaterial, un lanzagranadas de 40 mm y varias "
"armas antipersona, está diseñado para igualar el fervor de los luchadores "
"por la libertad con el poderío industrial de la Tierra."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
msgid "tripod"
msgid_plural "tripods"
msgstr[0] "trípode"
msgstr[1] "trípodes"
msgstr[2] "trípodes"

#. ~ Description of monster "tripod"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
msgid ""
"The Honda Crop King.  Originally designed for agriculture, it has a trio of "
"spiked retractable cables and where it used to mount pesticide sprayer the "
"PrepNet Phyle have modified it to have a flamethrower for their war against "
"the Mycus."
msgstr ""
"El Rey de la Cosecha de Honda. Originalmente diseñado para la agricultura, "
"tiene un trío de cables retráctiles con púas y donde solía montar el "
"rociador de pesticidas la PrepNet Phyle lo han modificado para tener un "
"lanzallamas para su guerra contra el Mycus."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
msgid "Wraitheon Sentinel-lx"
msgid_plural "Wraitheon Sentinels-lx"
msgstr[0] "Centinela-lx Wraitheon"
msgstr[1] "Centinelas-lx Wraitheon"
msgstr[2] "Centinelas-lx Wraitheon"

#. ~ Description of monster "Wraitheon Sentinel-lx"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
msgid ""
"Its exterior plates are sable and gold, this luxurious variant of a "
"Wraitheon drone was once kept as a bodyguard by society's wealthiest.  Still"
" with its wrist sword extended, it resembles an ancient knight, standing an "
"eternal watch."
msgstr ""
"Sus placas exteriores son de color sable y oro, esta lujosa variante de un "
"zángano de Wraitheon se mantuvo una vez como guardaespaldas de los más ricos"
" de la sociedad. Todavía con su espada de muñeca extendida, se asemeja a un "
"antiguo caballero, que vigila eternamente."

#. ~ Targeting sound of special attack of monster "Wraitheon Sentinel-lx"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
msgid "\"Dispatching hostile with lethal force.\""
msgstr "\"Despachando a los hostiles con fuerza letal.\""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
msgid "bloodhound drone"
msgid_plural "bloodhound drones"
msgstr[0] "dron sabueso"
msgstr[1] "drones sabueso"
msgstr[2] "drones sabueso"

#. ~ Description of monster "bloodhound drone"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
msgid ""
"A small, spiked quadcopter robot equipped with a high-power spotlight.  This"
" automated seeker drone was originally designed to harry and harass "
"fugitives while maintaining visual contact for other pursuers."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño robot cuadricóptero de púas equipado con un foco de alta "
"potencia. Este dron buscador automatizado fue diseñado originalmente para "
"hostigar y acosar a los fugitivos mientras mantenía el contacto visual con "
"otros perseguidores."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
msgid "ENIAC Seneschal"
msgid_plural "ENIAC Seneschals"
msgstr[0] "Senescal ENIAC"
msgstr[1] "Senescales ENIAC"
msgstr[2] "Senescales ENIAC"

#. ~ Description of monster "ENIAC Seneschal"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
msgid ""
"One of the many cheaper models produced by ENIAC.  It is supposedly multi-"
"purpose, and equipped with several tools to facilitate this; however, it is "
"commonly used for janitorial work."
msgstr ""
"Uno de los muchos modelos más baratos producidos por ENIAC. Se supone que es"
" polivalente y está equipado con varias herramientas para facilitarlo; sin "
"embargo, se utiliza habitualmente para trabajos de limpieza."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
msgid "TsKBEM Likvidator"
msgid_plural "TsKBEM Likvidators"
msgstr[0] "Likvidator TsKBEM"
msgstr[1] "Likvidators TsKBEM"
msgstr[2] "Likvidators TsKBEM"

#. ~ Description of monster "TsKBEM Likvidator"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
msgid ""
"A now ancient industrial robot line first made by the Soviet TsKBEM, and "
"still in use thanks to its easily obtained fabrication schematics.  Built to"
" operate within nuclear reactors and waste repositories, the Likvidator is "
"assembled around an armored bipedal chassis that mounts several heavy "
"manipulator arms.  Legend claims it was originally designed after a nuclear "
"disaster during early space-age Earth."
msgstr ""
"Una antigua línea de robots industriales fabricada por primera vez por el "
"TsKBEM soviético, y que sigue en uso gracias a sus esquemas de fabricación "
"fáciles de obtener. Construido para operar dentro de reactores nucleares y "
"depósitos de residuos, el Likvidator está montado alrededor de un chasis "
"bípedo blindado que monta varios brazos manipuladores pesados. La leyenda "
"afirma que fue diseñado originalmente después de un desastre nuclear durante"
" los primeros años de la era espacial en la Tierra."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
msgid "ENIAC Famulus"
msgid_plural "ENIAC Famuli"
msgstr[0] "Famulus ENIAC"
msgstr[1] "Famuli ENIAC"
msgstr[2] "Famuli ENIAC"

#. ~ Description of monster "ENIAC Famulus"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
msgid ""
"A top of the line luxury model, the Famulus is a humaniform robot, derived "
"from Wraitheon schematics with slight alterations to give it a more human "
"appearance.  Designed to be a robotic servant, its AI tailored for the needs"
" of each customer, it is arguably one of the few commercial robots to pass "
"the Turing test."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
msgid "TsKBEM Udarnik"
msgid_plural "TsKBEM Udarniks"
msgstr[0] "Udarnik TsKBEM"
msgstr[1] "Udarniks TsKBEM"
msgstr[2] "Udarniks TsKBEM"

#. ~ Description of monster "TsKBEM Udarnik"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
msgid ""
"A highly customizable light industrial and agricultural robot.  Its original design dates back to the ancient Soviet Union; the aptly named Udarnik \"shock worker\" was the trigger behind the automation revolution, and with subsequent adaptations, became the workhorse of early human space colonization.  Although outdated by modern standards, the Udarnik is still commonly seen in frontier worlds - thanks to its easily obtainable fabrication schematics.\n"
"\n"
"This particular version is equipped with a mix of construction and heavy cargo-handling tools and was likely involved in the construction of colony buildings."
msgstr ""
"Un robot industrial ligero y agrícola altamente personalizable. Su diseño original se remonta a la antigua Unión Soviética; el bien llamado \"trabajador de choque\" Udarnik fue el desencadenante de la revolución de la automatización y, con posteriores adaptaciones, se convirtió en el caballo de batalla de la primera colonización espacial humana. Aunque anticuado para los estándares modernos, el Udarnik todavía se ve con frecuencia en los mundos fronterizos, gracias a sus esquemas de fabricación fáciles de obtener. \n"
"\n"
"Esta versión en particular está equipada con una mezcla de herramientas de construcción y de manipulación de carga pesada y probablemente participó en la construcción de edificios de colonias."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
msgid "TsKBEM Brandspojt"
msgid_plural "TsKBEM Brandspojts"
msgstr[0] "Brandspojt TsKBEM"
msgstr[1] "Brandspojts TsKBEM"
msgstr[2] "Brandspojts TsKBEM"

#. ~ Description of monster "TsKBEM Brandspojt"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
msgid ""
"An old and decidedly uncommon firefighter robot of Soviet design.  Crab-like"
" in form, its back mounts a squat water tank beneath a turreted water "
"cannon.  While effective for its original function, the design lacks the "
"flexibility of others from the TsKBEM, and most Brandspojt units still in "
"existence are museum pieces."
msgstr ""
"Un antiguo y poco común robot de bomberos de diseño soviético. Con forma de "
"cangrejo, su espalda monta un tanque de agua en cuclillas bajo un cañón de "
"agua con torreta. Aunque es eficaz para su función original, el diseño "
"carece de la flexibilidad de otros del TsKBEM, y la mayoría de las unidades "
"Brandspojt que aún existen son piezas de museo."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
msgid "faulty surgical droid"
msgid_plural "faulty surgical droids"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of monster "faulty surgical droid"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
msgid ""
"A free roaming medical robot capable of administering powerful anesthetics "
"and performing complex surgical operations, usually in that order.  Faulty "
"bio-diagnostic programs resulted in numerous lawsuits before the Cataclysm."
msgstr ""
"Un robot médico itinerante capaz de administrar potentes anestésicos y "
"realizar complejas operaciones quirúrgicas, normalmente en ese orden. Los "
"programas de bio-diagnóstico defectuosos resultaron en numerosas demandas "
"antes del Cataclismo."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
msgid "rat snatcher"
msgid_plural "rat snatchers"
msgstr[0] "ladrón rata"
msgstr[1] "ladrones rata"
msgstr[2] "ladrones rata"

#. ~ Description of monster "rat snatcher"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
msgid ""
"A small and flimsy hexapod drone that relies on sheer speed to hunt rats and"
" other small pests.  It has either gone rampant or been maliciously "
"reprogrammed."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño y endeble dron hexápodo que se basa en la velocidad para cazar "
"ratas y otras pequeñas plagas. Se ha desbocado o ha sido reprogramado con "
"malicia."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
msgid "grab-bot"
msgid_plural "grab-bots"
msgstr[0] "robots-recogedor"
msgstr[1] "robots-recogedores"
msgstr[2] "robots-recogedores"

#. ~ Description of monster "grab-bot"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
msgid ""
"A salvaged skitterbot repurposed to grab onto and immobilize enemies.  It's "
"meant to work in a pack."
msgstr ""
"Es un arañabot reconvertido para agarrar e inmovilizar a los enemigos. Está "
"pensado para trabajar en manada."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
msgid "pest hunter"
msgid_plural "pest hunters"
msgstr[0] "cazador de plagas"
msgstr[1] "cazadores de plagas"
msgstr[2] "cazadores de plagas"

#. ~ Description of monster "pest hunter"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
msgid ""
"A salvaged skitterbot refitted with an 8mm integrated firearm.  The robot's "
"small size precludes rapid-fire, due to recoil, and requires the use of "
"lightweight caseless ammo."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
msgid "Wraitheon Aegis"
msgid_plural "Wraitheon Aegises"
msgstr[0] "Aegis Wraitheon"
msgstr[1] "Aegises Wraitheon"
msgstr[2] "Aegises Wraitheon"

#. ~ Description of monster "Wraitheon Aegis"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
msgid ""
"One of the many models of Wraitheon-manufactured but supposedly non-military"
" robots, the Aegis is a bulky and heavy riot control machine with "
"electroshock capabilities and an integrated riot shotgun."
msgstr ""
"Uno de los muchos modelos de robots fabricados por Wraitheon pero "
"supuestamente no militar, el Aegis es una voluminosa y pesada máquina "
"antidisturbios con capacidad de electrochoque y una escopeta antidisturbios "
"integrada."

#. ~ No ammo sound of special attack of monster "Wraitheon Aegis"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
msgid "click click!"
msgstr "¡click click!"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
msgid "Wraitheon Imaginifer"
msgid_plural "Wraitheon Imaginifers"
msgstr[0] "Imaginifer Wraitheon"
msgstr[1] "Imaginifers Wraitheon"
msgstr[2] "Imaginifers Wraitheon"

#. ~ Description of monster "Wraitheon Imaginifer"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
msgid ""
"The Imaginifer, one of the few examples of true humaniform robots, was "
"manufactured by Wraitheon for ESCA militaries.  They are designed to "
"complement infantry soldiers, being able to use their gear and transports.  "
"While similar in shape, they are far removed from the ENIAC's Famulus.  The "
"Wraitheon humaniforms are designed to take full advantage of a humanoid "
"shape, not to look human; programmed for game theory, not for sapience."
msgstr ""
"El Imaginifer, uno de los pocos ejemplos de verdaderos robots humaniformes, "
"fue fabricado por Wraitheon para los militares de la ESCA. Están diseñados "
"para complementar a los soldados de infantería, pudiendo utilizar sus "
"equipos y transportes. Aunque tienen una forma similar, están muy alejados "
"de los Famulus de la ENIAC. Los humaniformes Wraitheon están diseñados para "
"aprovechar al máximo la forma humanoide, no para parecer humanos; "
"programados para la teoría del juego, no para la sapiencia."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
msgid "Wraitheon Hashashiyyin"
msgid_plural "Wraitheon Hashashiyyins"
msgstr[0] "Hashashiyyin Wraitheon"
msgstr[1] "Hashashiyyins Wraitheon"
msgstr[2] "Hashashiyyins Wraitheon"

#. ~ Description of monster "Wraitheon Hashashiyyin"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
msgid ""
"The Hashashiyyin is unorthodox in its design as a military humaniform.  "
"While it keeps the strength of most Wraitheon humaniforms, it also "
"prioritizes stealth.  It comes equipped with an integrated 5x50mm flechette "
"gun."
msgstr ""
"El Hashashiyyin es poco ortodoxo en su diseño como humanoide militar. Aunque"
" mantiene la fuerza de la mayoría de los humanoides de Wraitheon, también da"
" prioridad al sigilo. Viene equipado con un arma de flechettes integrada de "
"5x50mm."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
msgid "Wraitheon Suppressor"
msgid_plural "Wraitheon Suppressors"
msgstr[0] "Supresor Wraitheon"
msgstr[1] "Supresores Wraitheon"
msgstr[2] "Supresores Wraitheon"

#. ~ Description of monster "Wraitheon Suppressor"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
msgid ""
"Looking more like a tank than a robot, the Suppressor is built to deal with "
"vehicles (including tanks) and personnel alike.  Equipped with a 40mm "
"grenade launcher, it can easily dispatch anything in its path."
msgstr ""
"Con un aspecto más parecido al de un tanque que al de un robot, el Supresor "
"está construido para hacer frente a vehículos (incluidos los tanques) y a "
"personal por igual. Equipado con un lanzagranadas de 40 mm, puede acabar "
"fácilmente con todo lo que se cruce en su camino."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
msgid "Wraitheon Fulgent"
msgid_plural "Wraitheon Fulgents"
msgstr[0] "Fulgente Wraitheon"
msgstr[1] "Fulgentes Wraitheon"
msgstr[2] "Fulgentes Wraitheon"

#. ~ Description of monster "Wraitheon Fulgent"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
msgid ""
"An autonomous anti-personnel weapons platform, mounting a laser on an "
"insectoid chassis.  The Fulgent designation excels at 'controlling' riots "
"and (sometimes simultaneously) putting down potential freedom fighters."
msgstr ""
"Una plataforma autónoma de armas antipersona, que monta un láser en un "
"chasis insectoide. La designación Fulgente destaca en el \"control\" de "
"disturbios y (a veces simultáneamente) en la eliminación de potenciales "
"combatientes por la libertad."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
msgid "Wraitheon Irradiant"
msgid_plural "Wraitheon Irradiants"
msgstr[0] "Irradiante Wraitheon"
msgstr[1] "Irradiantes Wraitheon"
msgstr[2] "Irradiantes Wraitheon"

#. ~ Description of monster "Wraitheon Irradiant"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
msgid ""
"An autonomous anti-armor weapons platform, mounting a 5kg plasma railgun "
"over an insectoid chassis.  The Irradiant designation excels at ambush and "
"midrange combat, where it can leverage its superior agility and reduced "
"sensor profile to successfully engage technologically advanced foes."
msgstr ""
"Plataforma anit-blindado autónoma que monta un cañón de riel de plasma de 5 "
"kg sobre un chasis insectoide. La designación Irradiante destaca en las "
"emboscadas y el combate a medio alcance, donde puede aprovechar su agilidad "
"superior y su reducido perfil de sensores para enfrentarse con éxito a "
"enemigos tecnológicamente avanzados."

#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "Wraitheon Irradiant"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
msgid ""
"The Irradiant emits a chilling robotic shrill as it fires its plasma "
"railgun."
msgstr ""
"La Irradiante emite un escalofriante chillido robótico al disparar su cañón "
"de riel de plasma."

#. ~ Targeting sound of special attack of monster "Wraitheon Irradiant"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
msgid "the climbing pitch of a charging plasma railgun"
msgstr "el tono ascendente de un  cañón de riel de plasma cargándose"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
msgid "Wraitheon Isohypsa"
msgid_plural "Wraitheon Isohypsas"
msgstr[0] "Isohypsa Wraitheon"
msgstr[1] "Isohypsas Wraitheon"
msgstr[2] "Isohypsas Wraitheon"

#. ~ Description of monster "Wraitheon Isohypsa"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
msgid ""
"A bulky if not particularly large aerial drone, with an advanced AI "
"overwatch unit and a bulbous carapace, mostly dedicated to mounting high-"
"resolution sensors.  As an autonomous drone control platform, the Isohypsa "
"is principally meant to coordinate and enhance the combat capabilities of "
"simpler Wraitheon robots in lieu of human operators."
msgstr ""
"Un dron aéreo voluminoso, aunque no especialmente grande, con una unidad de "
"vigilancia de IA avanzada y un caparazón abultado, dedicado principalmente a"
" montar sensores de alta resolución. Como plataforma de control de drones "
"autónomos, el Isohypsa está pensado principalmente para coordinar y mejorar "
"las capacidades de combate de los robots Wraitheon más sencillos en lugar de"
" los operadores humanos."

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "Wraitheon Isohypsa"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
msgid "The Isohypsa emits a rapid sequence of sibilant tones!"
msgstr "¡La Isohypsa emite una rápida secuencia de tonos sibilantes!"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
msgid "Wraitheon Kabura-ya"
msgid_plural "Wraitheon Kabura-yas"
msgstr[0] "Kabura-ya Wraitheon"
msgstr[1] "Kabura-yas Wraitheon"
msgstr[2] "Kabura-yas Wraitheon"

#. ~ Description of monster "Wraitheon Kabura-ya"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
msgid ""
"A microplane drone designed to seek enemy personnel before detonating at "
"close range."
msgstr ""
"Un dron microplano diseñado para buscar al personal enemigo antes de detonar"
" a corta distancia."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
msgid "Wraitheon Frequency"
msgid_plural "Wraitheon Frequencies"
msgstr[0] "Frecuencia Wraitheon"
msgstr[1] "Frecuencias Wraitheon"
msgstr[2] "Frecuencias Wraitheon"

#. ~ Description of monster "Wraitheon Frequency"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
msgid ""
"An autonomous weapons platform, made to disrupt or disable electronics - "
"especially other robots - with an electromagnetic pulse."
msgstr ""
"Una plataforma armamentística autónoma, hecha para interrumpir o inutilizar "
"la electrónica -especialmente otros robots- con un pulso electromagnético."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/scavbots.json
msgid "bee bot"
msgid_plural "bee bots"
msgstr[0] "robot abeja"
msgstr[1] "robots abeja"
msgstr[2] "robots abeja"

#. ~ Description of monster "bee bot"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/scavbots.json
msgid ""
"A salvaged utility robot converted into an AI monitored bee hive that "
"periodically removes and delivers honey combs."
msgstr ""
"Un robot utilitario recuperado y convertido en una colmena supervisada por "
"la IA que extrae y entrega periódicamente panales de miel."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/scavbots.json
msgid "floating lantern"
msgid_plural "floating lanterns"
msgstr[0] "linterna flotante"
msgstr[1] "linternas flotantes"
msgstr[2] "linternas flotantes"

#. ~ Description of monster "floating lantern"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/scavbots.json
msgid "A salvaged drone repurposed into a mobile light source."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/scavbots.json
msgid "floating heater"
msgid_plural "floating heaters"
msgstr[0] "calentador flotante"
msgstr[1] "calentadores flotantes"
msgstr[2] "calentadores flotantes"

#. ~ Description of monster "floating heater"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/scavbots.json
msgid ""
"A salvaged eyebot repurposed into a floating space heater.  It emits a "
"constant jet of warm air to heat an enclosed space."
msgstr ""
"Un globo ocular recuperado se ha reutilizado en un calefactor flotante. "
"Emite un chorro constante de aire caliente para calentar un espacio cerrado."

#. ~ Description of species "UPLIFT"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/species.json
msgid "an intelligent animal created by man before the Cataclysm"
msgstr "un animal inteligente creado por el hombre antes del Cataclismo"

#. ~ Description of species "ALIEN_ARTHROPOD"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/species.json
msgid "an alien arthropod"
msgstr "un artrópodo alienígena"

#. ~ Foot steps of species "ALIEN_ARTHROPOD"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/species.json
msgid "chittering."
msgstr "chirriando."

#. ~ Description of species "ALIEN_FLOATER"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/species.json
msgid "a floating alien"
msgstr "un alienígena flotante"

#. ~ Description of species "MOXIE"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/species.json
msgid "a humanoid monster"
msgstr "un mostruo humanoide"

#. ~ Description of species "BIOMACHINE"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/species.json
msgid "an unusual creature"
msgstr "una criatura inusual"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/turrets.json
msgid "x-ray laser turret"
msgid_plural "x-ray laser turrets"
msgstr[0] "torreta laser rayos x"
msgstr[1] "torretas laser rayos x"
msgstr[2] "torretas laser rayos x"

#. ~ Description of monster "x-ray laser turret"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/turrets.json
msgid ""
"The TX-5LR Cerberus is an upgrade to its predecessors.  It features a state "
"of the art x-ray laser cannon system with three barrels.  Each barrel will "
"fire once and be exhausted until the part can be replaced."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/uplifted_monsters.json
msgid "Schwarz Walder"
msgid_plural "Schwarz Walders"
msgstr[0] "Schwarz Walder"
msgstr[1] "Schwarz Walders"
msgstr[2] "Schwarz Walders"

#. ~ Description of monster "Schwarz Walder"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/uplifted_monsters.json
msgid ""
"Schwarz Walders are a bipedal uplifted animal originally developed by a "
"German company as forest rangers for the expanded Black Forest Conservation "
"Area.  Like all Uplifts they have a human level of intelligence and are "
"indentured laborers to the corporation that grew and raised them, until they"
" reach age of enfranchisement dictated by UICA regulations or they earn "
"their citizenship early.  Shortly afterward the creation of the first "
"Schwarz Walders it was determined that they also made excellent long range "
"reconnaissance units that could operate independently indefinitely.  This "
"was one of the most popular Uplift models before the Discontinuity, and many"
" frontier planets still retain significant feral and otherwise independent "
"populations.  They are skilled marksmen and this one appears to be armed "
"with an smg."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Targeting sound of special attack of monster "Schwarz Walder"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/uplifted_monsters.json
msgid "\"You should walk away.\""
msgstr "\"Deberías irte.\""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/uplifted_monsters.json
msgid "Schwarz Walder cub"
msgid_plural "Schwarz Walder cubs"
msgstr[0] "cachorro Schwarz Walder"
msgstr[1] "cachorros Schwarz Walder"
msgstr[2] "cachorros Schwarz Walder"

#. ~ Description of monster "Schwarz Walder cub"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/uplifted_monsters.json
msgid ""
"A young Schwarz Walder.  If one is out here, a very protective parent is "
"likely nearby."
msgstr ""
"Un joven Schwarz Walder. Si uno está aquí, es probable que un padre muy "
"protector esté cerca."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/uplifted_monsters.json
msgid "infeme"
msgid_plural "infemes"
msgstr[0] "infeme"
msgstr[1] "infemes"
msgstr[2] "infemes"

#. ~ Description of monster "infeme"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/uplifted_monsters.json
msgid ""
"The Infeme are uplifted from apes and other near-human ancestors.  The Zulu "
"word for monkey became the catch-all term for many species of uplifts "
"whether majority chimp, gorilla or baboon.  Several worlds experienced a "
"series of events similar to the old pre-spaceflight movie series 'Planet of "
"the Apes' during the Discontinuity."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/uplifted_monsters.json
msgid "Cecaelian survivor"
msgid_plural "Cecaelian survivors"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of monster "Cecaelian survivor"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/uplifted_monsters.json
msgid ""
"The Cecaelia were the corporate answer to the frailty of unmodified humans "
"under the sea.  These individuals have spent a lifetime beneath the waves "
"seeing conflicts you can't even imagine."
msgstr ""
"Los Cecalianos fueron la respuesta corporativa a la fragilidad de los "
"humanos no modificados bajo el mar. Estos individuos han pasado una vida "
"bajo las olas viendo conflictos que ni siquiera puedes imaginar."

#. ~ Targeting sound of special attack of monster "Cecaelian survivor"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/uplifted_monsters.json
msgid "\"Under the water, it's an endless war.\""
msgstr "\"Bajo el agua, es una guerra interminable.\""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/uplifted_monsters.json
msgid "Cecaelian Spawn"
msgid_plural "Cecaelian Spawns"
msgstr[0] "Generador Cecaliano"
msgstr[1] "Generadores Cecalianos"
msgstr[2] "Generadores Cecalianos"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/water_mobs.json
#: data/mods/Mythos/monsters/mythos.json
msgid "deep one"
msgid_plural "deep ones"
msgstr[0] "profundo"
msgstr[1] "profundos"
msgstr[2] "profundos"

#. ~ Description of monster "deep one"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/water_mobs.json
msgid ""
"An alien that appears to have evolved for survival in the depths.  Its "
"tubular gray body bears numerous sets of paired appendages with clawed "
"protrusions, and a pair of thick muscular fins.  You see glimpses of its "
"shape, shifting in and out of the water."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/water_mobs.json
msgid "deep one slaver"
msgid_plural "deep one slavers"
msgstr[0] "esclavo profundo"
msgstr[1] "esclavos profundos"
msgstr[2] "esclavos profundos"

#. ~ Description of monster "deep one slaver"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/water_mobs.json
msgid ""
"An alien that appears to have evolved for survival in the depths.  Its "
"tubular gray body bears numerous sets of paired appendages with clawed "
"protrusions, and a pair of thick muscular fins.  You see glimpses of its "
"shape, shifting in and out of the water.  It is carrying a conical object "
"that hums with an odd keening sound."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/zombies.json
msgid "Haunting Forest Walker"
msgid_plural "Haunting Forest Walkers"
msgstr[0] "Caminante del Bosque Atormentado"
msgstr[1] "Caminantes del Bosque Atormentados"
msgstr[2] "Caminantes del Bosque Atormentados"

#. ~ Description of monster "Haunting Forest Walker"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/zombies.json
msgid ""
"This towering zombie is covered in wounds and shedding fur.  Once it may "
"have prevented forest fires in national parks, now it kills anything it "
"catches."
msgstr ""
"Este imponente zombi está cubierto de heridas y muda de pelo. Antes podía "
"evitar los incendios forestales en los parques nacionales, ahora mata todo "
"lo que pilla."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/zombies.json
msgid "rotting grodd"
msgid_plural "rotting grodds"
msgstr[0] "grodd podrido"
msgstr[1] "grodds podridos"
msgstr[2] "grodds podridos"

#. ~ Description of monster "rotting grodd"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/zombies.json
msgid ""
"Imagine a gorilla.  Now imagine it dead and rotting and somehow looking at "
"you with more hate than you had previously imagined possible."
msgstr ""
"Imagina un gorila. Ahora imagina que está muerto y podrido y que, de alguna "
"manera, te mira con más odio del que habías imaginado posible."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/zombies.json
msgid "Ghoulodon"
msgid_plural "Ghoulodons"
msgstr[0] "Ghoulodon"
msgstr[1] "Ghoulodons"
msgstr[2] "Ghoulodons"

#. ~ Description of monster "Ghoulodon"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/zombies.json
msgid ""
"An undead Uplifted Elephant of ginormous size.  It still wears its assault "
"grade armor."
msgstr ""
"Un Elefante Ascendido no muerto de tamaño descomunal. Todavía lleva su "
"armadura de grado asalto."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/zombies.json
msgid "Dead Sea Witch"
msgid_plural "Dead Sea Witches"
msgstr[0] "Bruja del Mar Muerto"
msgstr[1] "Brujas del Mar Muerto"
msgstr[2] "Brujas del Mar Muerto"

#. ~ Description of monster "Dead Sea Witch"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/zombies.json
msgid ""
"There is driftwood coming out of oozing wounds.  It moves towards you on a "
"mass of writhing tentacles, black eyes like the deepest trench of the sea."
msgstr ""
"Hay madera que sale de las heridas rezumantes. Avanza hacia ti sobre una "
"masa de tentáculos que se retuercen, ojos negros como la fosa más profunda "
"del mar."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/zombies.json
msgid "MoxPhore Scavenger"
msgid_plural "MoxPhore Scavengers"
msgstr[0] "Rebuscador MoxPhore"
msgstr[1] "Rebuscadores MoxPhore"
msgstr[2] "Rebuscadores MoxPhore"

#. ~ Description of monster "MoxPhore Scavenger"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/zombies.json
msgid ""
"A human stands here, towering around 2 meters high.  Its flesh is frozen "
"solid, colored black and blue from frostbite.  It constantly scratches at "
"its flesh with its claw-like hands, surveying the land with frozen and foggy"
" eyes."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/zombies.json
msgid "MoxPhore Spartan"
msgid_plural "MoxPhore Spartans"
msgstr[0] "Espartano MoxPhore"
msgstr[1] "Espartanos MoxPhore"
msgstr[2] "Espartanos MoxPhore"

#. ~ Description of monster "MoxPhore Spartan"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/zombies.json
msgid ""
"A human stands here, its body bulging and ripped as the tissue is torn, "
"showing bluish muscle, and gray bones.  Ice crystals jut out of its visible "
"wounds as it wanders."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/zombies.json
msgid "MoxPhore Regenerator"
msgid_plural "MoxPhore Regenerators"
msgstr[0] "Regenerador MoxPhore"
msgstr[1] "Regeneradores MoxPhore"
msgstr[2] "Regeneradores MoxPhore"

#. ~ Description of monster "MoxPhore Regenerator"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/zombies.json
msgid ""
"A human stands here, comically thin and scratching its scar-ridden flesh, "
"any flesh it rips off grows back in seconds."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/zombies.json
msgid "MoxPhore Tangler"
msgid_plural "MoxPhore Tanglers"
msgstr[0] "Enredado MoxPhore"
msgstr[1] "Enredados MoxPhore"
msgstr[2] "Enredados MoxPhore"

#. ~ Description of monster "MoxPhore Tangler"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/zombies.json
msgid ""
"A human stands here, several rust-colored limbs jut out of its back, moving "
"around and grabbing at the air while the person looks blankly around…."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/zombies.json
msgid "Speaker"
msgid_plural "Speakers"
msgstr[0] "Orador"
msgstr[1] "Oradores"
msgstr[2] "Oradores"

#. ~ Description of monster "Speaker"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/zombies.json
msgid ""
"A starfish-like creature stands here, covered in black metallic fur as it "
"stands out, pointing in a specific direction."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/zombies.json
msgid "MoxPhore Elder"
msgid_plural "MoxPhore Elders"
msgstr[0] "Anciano MoxPhore"
msgstr[1] "Ancianos MoxPhore"
msgstr[2] "Ancianos MoxPhore"

#. ~ Description of monster "MoxPhore Elder"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/zombies.json
msgid ""
"Numerous claw-like limbs closely wrap around this alien arachnid's head and "
"thorax, forming a protective barrier.  Its antennae twitch and writhe, and "
"it seems to grope wildly toward threats."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/zombies.json
msgid "MoxPhore Bloodhound"
msgid_plural "MoxPhore Bloodhounds"
msgstr[0] "Perro MoxPhore"
msgstr[1] "Perros MoxPhore"
msgstr[2] "Perros MoxPhore"

#. ~ Description of monster "MoxPhore Bloodhound"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/zombies.json
msgid ""
"The remains of a long lost colonist, shaped and rebuilt into a twisted "
"reflection of the insectoid and canid forms.  It scuttles across the ground,"
" looking blankly with vestigial eyes as it sniffs the air."
msgstr ""
"Los restos de un colono perdido hace tiempo, moldeados y reconstruidos en un"
" reflejo retorcido de las formas insectoides y cánidas. Se escabulle por el "
"suelo, mirando inexpresivamente con ojos vestigiales mientras olfatea el "
"aire."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/zombies.json
msgid "Moxphore Emetic"
msgid_plural "Moxphore Emetics"
msgstr[0] "Emético Moxphore"
msgstr[1] "Eméticos Moxphore"
msgstr[2] "Eméticos Moxphore"

#. ~ Description of monster "Moxphore Emetic"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/zombies.json
msgid ""
"Unidentifiable walking remains, hunched and wandering in apparent pain.  An "
"alien plant peeks meekly from its open mouth, leaking green liquid as its "
"host stumbles."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Harvest message
#: data/mods/Aftershock/monsterdrops/monsterdrops.json
msgid ""
"The freeze-burned leather parts easily, and thousands of fleshy floating "
"bubbles erupt from the distended carcass.  Most fly away before you can "
"reach them."
msgstr ""
"El cuero quemado por la congelación se desprende con facilidad, y miles de "
"burbujas carnosas flotantes brotan de la carcasa distendida. La mayoría "
"salen volando antes de que puedas alcanzarlas."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MIGO"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of warm, alien winds."
msgstr "Sueñas con vientos cálidos y alienígenas."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MIGO"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of landscapes lit by the light of alien moons."
msgstr "Sueñas con paisajes iluminados por la luz de lunas alienígenas."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MIGO"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You stand at the edge of a fissure into strange earth.  Mustard brown gasses"
" caress and lift your fronds"
msgstr ""
"Te encuentras al borde de una fisura en una tierra extraña. Los gases de "
"color marrón mostaza acarician y levantan tus frondas"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MIGO"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of being vivisected by humans.  One asks if the other thinks you "
"can feel pain."
msgstr ""
"Sueñas que los humanos te viviseccionan. Uno pregunta si el otro cree que "
"puedes sentir dolor."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MIGO"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Trapped in a cage, you mimic the sounds of your guard's spawn.  He threatens"
" you and enters the cage.  He screams, you recall."
msgstr ""
"Atrapado en una jaula, imitas los sonidos del engendro de tu guardia. Te "
"amenaza y entra en la jaula. El grita, tu recuerdas."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MIGO"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/dreams.json
msgid ""
"It's your birthday.  But everyone has given you these hideous metal and "
"plastic objects."
msgstr ""
"Es tu cumpleaños. Pero todo el mundo te ha regalado estos horribles objetos "
"de metal y plástico."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MIGO"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/dreams.json
msgid ""
"The stars await you, your chariot of fire is ready.  The holds are full of "
"slaves."
msgstr ""
"Las estrellas te esperan, tu carro de fuego está listo. Las bodegas están "
"llenas de esclavos."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MIGO"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/dreams.json
msgid "You have transitioned from a dying race to a glorious future."
msgstr "Has pasado de una raza moribunda a un futuro glorioso."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MASTODON"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You have a strange dream about thundering ponderously through ancient, "
"brittle tundras that crackle under your thick round feet."
msgstr ""
"Tienes un extraño sueño en el que atraviesas atronadoramente antiguas y "
"quebradizas tundras que crujen bajo tus gruesos y redondos pies."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MASTODON"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/dreams.json
msgid "Your dreams give you a strange, langourous, heavy feeling."
msgstr "Tus sueños le producen una sensación extraña, lánguida y pesada."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MASTODON"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of swinging your heavy head to shake the clinging snow and ice "
"from your large, limpid brown eyes.  The weight is off, as if you had "
"something… extra on either side of your mouth, and though you are surrounded"
" by snow and bitter pelting winds, you feel confident and toasty-warm "
"beneath your shaggy coat."
msgstr ""
"Sueñas con mover tu pesada cabeza para sacudir la nieve y el hielo de tus "
"grandes y límpidos ojos marrones. No tienes peso, como si tuvieras algo... "
"de más a ambos lados de la boca, y aunque estás rodeado de nieve y de "
"vientos amargos, te sientes confiado y calentito bajo tu peludo abrigo."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MASTODON"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Your dream is a stream of shaggy loam-brown fur trailing into an ocean of "
"punishing, icy white.  Together, you are all strong.  When you look around, "
"you see elephantine faces looking back from all angles and you know they "
"mirror your own.  You just… know."
msgstr ""
"Tu sueño es una corriente de pelaje desgreñado de color marrón marengo que "
"se adentra en un océano de blanco gélido. Juntos, todos sois fuertes. Cuando"
" miras a tu alrededor, ves rostros elefantiásicos que te miran desde todos "
"los ángulos y sabes que son un reflejo del tuyo. Simplemente... lo sabes."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MASTODON"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of your usual patient languor being interrupted by a flash of "
"white teeth against a carmine-soaked muzzle.  In an instant a thunderous "
"fury overtakes you and you trumpet your rage… right before you bring that "
"trumpeting snout, bring down those heavy spears of ivory on either side of "
"it, down upon your attacker.  They lie, bones shattered, bleeding out their "
"red into the icy white and causing it to steam  Just like that, your calm is"
" restored."
msgstr ""
"Sueñas que tu paciente languidez habitual se ve interrumpida por un destello"
" de dientes blancos contra un hocico empapado de carmín. En un instante, una"
" furia atronadora se apodera de ti y haces sonar tu rabia... justo antes de "
"que ese hocico trompeado, haga caer esas pesadas lanzas de marfil a ambos "
"lados, sobre tu atacante. Yacen, con los huesos destrozados, desangrando su "
"rojo en el blanco gélido y haciendo que éste eche vapor. Así, tu calma se "
"restablece."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MASTODON"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of slowly, patiently, plodding through the world to go from goal "
"to goal, unrushed and unworried, for you are far too large and tough to kill"
" for anyone or anything to bother trying to attack.  And if they do… it'll "
"be the last mistake of their life.  Waking up gives you a brief jolt of fear"
" and dysphoria, for your body feels so weak and fragile and incorrect "
"compared to the powerful thing you know you are."
msgstr ""
"Sueñas con avanzar lenta y pacientemente por el mundo para ir de objetivo en"
" objetivo, sin prisas ni preocupaciones, porque eres demasiado grande y duro"
" para matar como para que nadie ni nada se moleste en intentar atacarte. Y "
"si lo hacen... será el último error de su vida. El despertar te produce una "
"breve sacudida de miedo y disforia, ya que tu cuerpo se siente tan débil y "
"frágil e incorrecto comparado con lo poderoso que sabes que eres."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MASTODON"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Your thoughts within your dream may be slow, and it may take you some time "
"to reach a conclusion, but what's the rush?  What's the hurry?  You are a "
"huge and ancient thing with a pedigree that stretches back to a time before "
"sapient life first had the gall to raise a sharpened stick and call itself "
"superior.  You are huge and powerful and all that work against you shall "
"fall.  You… you have all the time in the world, now."
msgstr ""
"Puede que tus pensamientos dentro de tu sueño sean lentos, y que te lleve "
"algún tiempo llegar a una conclusión, pero ¿cuál es la prisa? ¿Cuál es la "
"prisa? Eres una cosa enorme y antigua con un pedigrí que se remonta a una "
"época anterior a que la vida sapiente tuviera el descaro de levantar un palo"
" afilado y llamarse superior. Eres enorme y poderoso y todo lo que trabaje "
"contra ti caerá. Tú... tienes todo el tiempo del mundo, ahora."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MASTODON"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Life is lonely without a family of Tusked Ones beside you, thundering as one"
" through this desolate world in search of the hidden places.  Perhaps… "
"perhaps you should start your family."
msgstr ""
"La vida es solitaria sin una familia de Colmillos a tu lado, tronando como "
"uno solo a través de este mundo desolado en busca de los lugares ocultos. "
"Tal vez... tal vez deberías formar tu familia."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "PrepNet Tag"
msgstr "Etiqueta PrepNet"

#. ~ Description of mutation "PrepNet Tag"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"NPC trait that makes monsters see it as a Prepnet.  It is a bug if you have "
"it."
msgstr ""
"Rasgo del PNJ que hace que los monstruos lo vean como un Prepnet. Es un "
"error si lo tienes."

#. ~ Mutation class name
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "YUGGOTH"
msgstr "YUGGOTH"

#. ~ "mutagen_message" of mutation class "YUGGOTH"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Strange memories of another world overwhelm you…  they fade, but not before "
"you change your genetic structure to suit them."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Memorial message of mutation class "YUGGOTH" for male
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgctxt "memorial_male"
msgid "Prepared the way into the galaxy."
msgstr "Preparó el camino al interior de la galaxia."

#. ~ Memorial message of mutation class "YUGGOTH" for female
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgctxt "memorial_female"
msgid "Prepared the way into the galaxy."
msgstr "Preparó el camino al interior de la galaxia."

#. ~ Mutation class name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Mastodon"
msgstr "Mastodonte"

#. ~ "mutagen_message" of mutation class "Mastodon"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You feel a desire to trumpet and toot."
msgstr "Sientes el deseo de barritar."

#. ~ Memorial message of mutation class "Mastodon" for male
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgctxt "memorial_male"
msgid "Went extinct."
msgstr "Se extinguieron."

#. ~ Memorial message of mutation class "Mastodon" for female
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgctxt "memorial_female"
msgid "Went extinct."
msgstr "Se extinguieron."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Killophant"
msgstr "Kilofante"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Killophant"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your species was created as the ultimate shock troop.  Inherit the earth, "
"pedigree your ancestors, crush the foe."
msgstr ""
"Tu especie fue creada como la última tropa de choque. Heredar la tierra, "
"hacer pedigrí de tus ancestros, aplastar al enemigo."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Mi-go acclimatization"
msgstr "aclimatización Mi-go"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mi-go acclimatization"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Fleshy fronds grown from your scalp function like organic heat sinks.  They "
"allow you to live comfortably within the mi-go atmosphere."
msgstr ""
"Frondas carnosas que crecen de tu cuero cabelludo que funcionan como "
"disipadores de calor orgánicos. Permiten vivir cómodamente dentro de la "
"atmósfera de mi-go."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Facial Tentacles"
msgstr "Tentáculos Faciales"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Mouth Tendrils"
msgstr "Zarcillos Bucales"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Warm Natured"
msgstr "Naturaleza Cálida"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Warm Natured"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body becomes much more efficient at distributing heat from itself."
msgstr ""
"Tu cuerpo se vuelve mucho más eficiente al distribuir el calor por sí mismo."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Neural Improvement"
msgstr "Mejora Neural"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Neural Improvement"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You see the world a little differently today.  Intelligence + 1"
msgstr "Hoy ves el mundo de forma diferente. Inteligencia + 1"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Expanded Consciousness"
msgstr "Conciencia Expandida"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Expanded Consciousness"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You are beginning to see a way off this planet.  Intelligence + 2"
msgstr "Empiezas a ver una forma de salir de este planeta. Inteligencia + 2"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Extremely Smart"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"As humans uplifted our pets in the final years this process is lifting you "
"to a new level of intelligence.  Intelligence + 4"
msgstr ""
"Al igual que los humanos ascendieron a nuestras mascotas en los últimos "
"años, este proceso te ha ascendido a un nuevo nivel de inteligencia. "
"Inteligencia + 4"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Alien Intelligence"
msgstr "Inteligencia Alienígena"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Alien Intelligence"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You can see the connections from A to B to C to D.  You look at fellow "
"survivors like you are imagining taking them apart.  Intelligence + 5"
msgstr ""
"Puedes ver las conexiones de A a B a C a D. Miras a los compañeros "
"supervivientes como si estuvieras imaginando cómo desmontarlos. Inteligencia"
" + 5"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Enhanced Reactions"
msgstr "Reacciones Mejoradas"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Enhanced Reactions"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Today is the day to start juggling.  Dexterity + 1"
msgstr "Hoy es el día de empezar a hacer malabares. Destreza + 1"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Quickening"
msgstr "Aceleración"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Quickening"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You are starting to move like they do.  Dexterity + 2"
msgstr "Empiezas a moverte como ellos. Destreza + 2"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Otherworldly Grace"
msgstr "Gracia de Otro Mundo"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Otherworldly Grace"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You no longer move like a human, others find it disconcerting.  Dexterity + "
"4"
msgstr ""
"Ya no te mueves como un humano, los demás lo encuentran desconcertante. "
"Destreza + 4"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "New Muscles"
msgstr "Músculos Nuevos"

#. ~ Description of mutation "New Muscles"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You see some new muscles that you aren't sure you've seen on humans before."
"  Strength + 1"
msgstr ""
"Ves algunos músculos nuevos que no estás seguro de haber visto antes en los "
"humanos. Fuerza + 1"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Muscle Fiber"
msgstr "Fibra Muscular"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Muscle Fiber"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Fibrous tissue seems to be spreading through your body.  Strength + 2"
msgstr ""
"El tejido fibroso parece estar extendiéndose por tu cuerpo. Fuerza + 2"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Mi-go Ears"
msgstr "Orejas Mi-go"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mi-go Ears"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your ears have split into a series of tuberous projections.  They waggle "
"towards far away sounds."
msgstr ""
"Sus orejas se han dividido en una serie de proyecciones tuberosas. Se agitan"
" hacia los sonidos lejanos."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Detachment"
msgstr "Distanciamiento"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Detachment"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"When were you ever like these creatures, helpless before the changes "
"ravaging this world."
msgstr ""
"¿Cuándo fuiste como estas criaturas, indefensas ante los cambios que asolan "
"este mundo?"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Eldritch"
msgstr "Sobrenatural"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Eldritch"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a sinister aspect to your demeanor, no longer part of this world.  "
"You feel no sorrow at the deaths of humans and your brain now processes "
"combat skills more efficiently as you mentally dissect your opponents."
msgstr ""
"Tienes un aspecto siniestro en tu comportamiento, que ya no forma parte de "
"este mundo. No sientes pena por la muerte de los humanos y tu cerebro "
"procesa ahora las habilidades de combate con mayor eficacia al diseccionar "
"mentalmente a tus oponentes."

#. ~ Description of mutation "YUGGOTH"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "This death throes of this world are the birthing pangs of yours."
msgstr "Los estertores de este mundo son los dolores de parto del tuyo."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Fetid scent"
msgstr "Olor fétido"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Fetid scent"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your sweat now smells otherworldly, and not in a good way.  The mi-go still "
"hate you but at least they aren't offended by your smell."
msgstr ""
"Tu sudor ahora huele a otro mundo, y no en el buen sentido. Los mi-go siguen"
" odiándote, pero al menos no se ofenden por tu olor."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Eerie"
msgstr "Espeluznante"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Eerie"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You are off-putting to others.  Your mannerisms have changed as if human "
"interaction is becoming foreign."
msgstr ""
"Te sientes molesto con los demás. Tus maneras han cambiado como si la "
"interacción humana se hubiera convertido en algo extraño."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Mi-go Wings"
msgstr "Alas Mi-go"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mi-go Wings"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a pair of large, veiny wings.  They don't appear to be made for "
"this atmosphere but they grant a powerful buffeting attack."
msgstr ""
"Tienes un par de alas grandes y venosas. No parecen estar hechas para esta "
"atmósfera, pero otorgan un poderoso ataque de golpeo."

#. ~ Message when player with mutation "Mi-go Wings" attacks
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
#, c-format
msgid "You buffet %s with your wings"
msgstr "Abofeteas a %s con tus alas"

#. ~ Message when NPC with mutation "Mi-go Wings" attacks
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s buffets %2$s with their wings"
msgstr "%1$s abofetea a %2$s con sus alas"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Mi-go breathe"
msgstr "respiración Mi-go"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mi-go breathe"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You can now breathe the gasses the mi-go thrive in."
msgstr "Ahora puedes respirar los gases que los mi-go se crecen."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Uplifted"
msgstr "Ascendido"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Uplifted"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You come from uplifted animal stock.  This decreases morale penalties for "
"being wet."
msgstr ""
"Provienes de una estirpe de animales ascendidos. Esto disminuye las "
"penalizaciones de moral por estar mojado."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Hauler"
msgstr "Cargador"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Hauler"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You are capable of carrying far more than someone with similar strength "
"could.  Your maximum weight carried is increased by 60%."
msgstr ""
"Eres capaz de cargar mucho más de lo que podría alguien con una fuerza "
"similar. Tu peso máximo transportado se incrementa en un 60%."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Patched Fur"
msgstr "Piel Parcheada"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Patched Fur"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your skin has patches of light fur.  This has no impact on your life except "
"marking you as not fully human."
msgstr ""
"Tu piel tiene manchas de pelo claro. Esto no tiene ningún impacto en tu "
"vida, excepto que te marca como no completamente humano."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Crushing Feet"
msgstr "Pies aplastantes"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Crushing Feet"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your feet have grown massive and ready to support huge weight.  This allows "
"kicking attacks to do much more damage, provides natural armor, and removes "
"the need to wear shoes; however, you cannot wear normal size shoes.  Reduces"
" wet effects."
msgstr ""
"Tus pies han crecido de forma masiva y están preparados para soportar un "
"gran peso. Esto permite que los ataques con patadas hagan mucho más daño, "
"proporciona una armadura natural y elimina la necesidad de usar zapatos; sin"
" embargo, no puedes usar zapatos de tamaño normal. Reduce los efectos por "
"estar mojado."

#. ~ Message when player with mutation "Crushing Feet" attacks
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
#, c-format
msgid "You kick %s with your massive feet"
msgstr "Pateas a  %s con tus gigantes pies"

#. ~ Message when NPC with mutation "Crushing Feet" attacks
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s kicks %2$s with their massive feet"
msgstr "%1$s patea al %2$s con sus gigantes pies"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Face Bumps"
msgstr "Bultos de Cara"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Face Bumps"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a pair of bumps on your face above your mouth and beside your nose."
msgstr ""
"Tienes un par de bultos en la cara por encima de tu boca y al lado de tu "
"nariz."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Tusks"
msgstr "Colmillos"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Tusks"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a pair of small tusks on your face.  They allow you to make a weak "
"piercing goring attack."
msgstr ""
"Tienes un par de pequeños colmillos en la cara. Te permiten realizar un "
"débil ataque de cornada perforante."

#. ~ Message when player with mutation "Tusks" attacks
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
#, c-format
msgid "You gore %s with your tusks"
msgstr "Corneas a %s con tus colmillos"

#. ~ Message when NPC with mutation "Tusks" attacks
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s gores %2$s with their tusks"
msgstr "%1$s cornea %2$s con sus colmillos"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Pointed Tusks"
msgstr "Colmillos Puntiagudos"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Pointed Tusks"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a pair of long, pointed tusks, like someone weaponized an elephant."
"  They allow you to make a strong piercing headbutt attack, but prevent "
"wearing mouthgear that is not made of fabric."
msgstr ""
"Tienes un par de colmillos largos y puntiagudos, como si alguien hubiera "
"armado a un elefante. Te permiten realizar un fuerte ataque de cabeza "
"perforante, pero impiden llevar un aparato bucal que no sea de tejido."

#. ~ Message when player with mutation "Pointed Tusks" attacks
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
#, c-format
msgid "You stab %s with your pointed tusks"
msgstr "Apuñalas a%s con tus colmillos puntiagudos"

#. ~ Message when NPC with mutation "Pointed Tusks" attacks
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s stabs %2$s with their pointed tusks"
msgstr "%1$s apuñala a %2$s con sus colmillos puntiagudos"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Elephant Trunk"
msgstr "Trompa de Elefante"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Elephant Trunk"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your face resembles that of an elephant, with a significant trunk.  It looks"
" fierce but prevents wearing mouthgear.  Prehensile and able to perform some"
" fine detail work."
msgstr ""
"Tu cara se parece a la de un elefante, con una trompa importante. Tienes un "
"aspecto feroz, pero no te permite llevar aparatos bucales. Es prensil y "
"capaz de realizar algunos trabajos de detalle."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Three Fingered"
msgstr "Tres Dedos"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Three Fingered"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your hands have fused into three-fingered paws.  Fine manipulation is a "
"challenge: permanent hand encumbrance of 10, difficulty with delicate "
"craftwork, and your gloves don't fit.  But they handle water better."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Trumpeting Voice"
msgstr "Voz de Trompeta"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Trumpeting Voice"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a trumpeting, elephantine voice.  Threatening NPCs will be easier, "
"but lying will be very hard."
msgstr ""
"Tienes una voz de elefante. Amenazar a los PNJs será más fácil, pero mentir "
"será muy difícil."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/obsolete.json
msgid "Brutal Strength"
msgstr "Fuerza Brutal"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Brutal Strength"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Genetic tampering made your body incredibly strong.  Strength + 7."
msgstr ""
"La manipulación genética hizo que tu cuerpo fuera increíblemente fuerte. "
"Fuerza + 7."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Cryoadaptation"
msgstr "Crioadaptación"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Cryoadaptation"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"An experimental cryosleep procedure has permanently altered your body, "
"allowing you to better tolerate cold temperatures."
msgstr ""
"Un procedimiento experimental de crio-sueño ha alterado permanentemente tu "
"cuerpo, permitiéndote tolerar mejor las temperaturas frías."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/obsolete.json
msgid "Alpine Conditioning"
msgstr "Acondicionamiento Alpino"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Alpine Conditioning"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/obsolete.json
msgid ""
"Time spent in high altitudes and low temperatures have adapted you to them, "
"and you're slightly better at resisting the cold."
msgstr ""
"El tiempo pasado en altas altitudes y bajas temperaturas te han adaptado a "
"ellas, y eres ligeramente mejor para resistir el frío."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Brutal Strength"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/obsolete.json
msgid "Genetic defects have made your body incredibly strong.  Strength + 7."
msgstr ""
"Defectos Genéticos han hecho que tu cuerpo tenga una fuerza increiblemente "
"fuerte.  Fuerza + 7."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/obsolete.json
msgid "Leathered Feet"
msgstr "Pies de Cuero"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Leathered Feet"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/obsolete.json
msgid ""
"The bottoms of your feet are tough like an animals.  You receive no movement"
" penalty for not wearing shoes."
msgstr ""
"Las plantas de tus pies son duras como las de los animales. No recibes "
"ninguna penalización de movimiento por no llevar zapatos."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/obsolete.json
msgid "Skinfolds"
msgstr "Pliegues de Piel"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Skinfolds"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/obsolete.json
msgid ""
"Your skin is tough.  Cutting damage is slightly reduced for you.  Slightly "
"decreases wet penalties."
msgstr ""
"Tu piel es resistente. El daño cortante es reducido levemente. También "
"reduce las penalidades por estar mojado."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/obsolete.json
msgid "Weak Joints"
msgstr "Articulaciones Débiles"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Weak Joints"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/obsolete.json
msgid ""
"A common flaw in your genemod, brought on by increased muscle mass and bone "
"density.  Moving over rough terrain will slow you down more than normal."
msgstr ""
"Un defecto común en tu genemod, provocado por el aumento de la masa muscular"
" y la densidad ósea. Moverte por terrenos accidentados  te ralentizará más "
"de lo normal."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/obsolete.json
msgid "Herbivorous Ancestry"
msgstr "Ancestros Herbívoros"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Strong Scent"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/obsolete.json
msgid ""
"Your scent is particularly strong.  It's vaguely offensive to humans, and "
"animals that track your scent will do so more easily."
msgstr ""
"Tu olor es particularmente fuerte. Es vagamente ofensivo para los humanos, y"
" los animales que rastreen tu olor lo harán más fácilmente."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/obsolete.json
msgid "Giant Step"
msgstr "Paso Gigante"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/obsolete.json
msgid "Slow and Steady"
msgstr "Lento y Firme"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Slow and Steady"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/obsolete.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can't move as fast as most, resulting in a 10% speed penalty on flat "
"ground."
msgstr ""
"No puedes moverte tan rápido como la mayoría, lo que supone una penalización"
" de velocidad del 10% en terreno llano."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/obsolete.json
msgid "Short Fur Coat"
msgstr "Abrigo de Pelo Corto"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Short Fur Coat"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/obsolete.json
msgid ""
"Short fur has grown to cover your entire body, providing slight protection "
"from cold."
msgstr ""
"Pelaje corto ha crecido hasta cubrir todo tu cuerpo, proporcionando una "
"ligera protección contra el frío."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Furry"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/obsolete.json
msgid ""
"Thick brown fur has grown to cover your entire body, providing a slight "
"protection against attacks, and some protection from cold."
msgstr ""
"Grueso pelaje marrón ha crecido hasta cubrir todo tu cuerpo, "
"proporcionándote una ligera protección contra los ataques, y cierta "
"protección contra el frío."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Shaggy Fur"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/obsolete.json
msgid ""
"Your fur has grown out and thickened, providing noticeable protection from "
"attacks as well as considerable insulation."
msgstr ""
"Tu pelaje ha crecido y se ha endurecido, lo que te brinda una evidente "
"protección contra los ataques, así como también un aislamiento térmico "
"considerable."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/obsolete.json
msgid "Immovable"
msgstr "Inamovible"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/obsolete.json
msgid "Unstoppable"
msgstr "Imparable"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/obsolete.json
msgid "Meatshield"
msgstr "Escudo de Carne"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/obsolete.json
msgid "Elephantine"
msgstr "Elefantino"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/obsolete.json
msgid "Freakishly Gigantic"
msgstr "Peculiarmente Gigante"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/obsolete.json
msgid "Gigantic"
msgstr "Gigante"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/obsolete.json
msgid "Terrible Odor"
msgstr "Olor Terrible"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Terrible Odor"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/obsolete.json
msgid ""
"You smell exactly like a shaggy elephant would, assuming it sweated, which "
"you do.  Monsters that track scent will find you very easily, and humans "
"will react poorly."
msgstr ""
"Hueles exactamente como lo haría un elefante peludo, suponiendo que sudara, "
"que es lo que haces. Los monstruos que rastrean el olor te encontrarán muy "
"fácilmente, y los humanos reaccionarán mal."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/obsolete.json
msgid "Constant Eater"
msgstr "Comedor Constante"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/obsolete.json
msgid "Large Diet"
msgstr "Dieta Grande"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Large Diet"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/obsolete.json
msgid ""
"You require more food than others but your ability to go the distance in "
"both combat and athleticism is expanded."
msgstr ""
"Necesitas más comida que los demás, pero tu capacidad de llegar más lejos "
"tanto en el combate como en el atletismo se amplía."

#. ~ Description of mutation "High Thirst"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/obsolete.json
msgid ""
"Your body needs more water than usual to flush the denser waste products."
msgstr ""
"Su cuerpo necesita más agua de lo habitual para eliminar los productos de "
"desecho más densos."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/obsolete.json
msgid "Giant Thirst"
msgstr "Sed Gigante"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Ponderous"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/obsolete.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Your weight must be delicately placed lest the ground give way.  You move "
"10% slower."
msgstr ""
"Tu peso debe ser colocado con delicadeza para que el suelo no ceda. Te "
"mueves un 10% más lento."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/obsolete.json
msgid "Very Deliberate"
msgstr "Muy Deliberado"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Very Deliberate"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/obsolete.json
#, no-c-format
msgid "Your muscles are quite slow to move.  You move 25% slower."
msgstr ""
"Tus músculos son bastante lentos en sus movimientos. Te mueves un 25% más "
"lento."

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#. ~ PrepNet Phyle Gardener.
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/classes.json data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/npc.json
msgid "Gardener"
msgstr "Jardinero"

#. ~ Job description of "Gardener" NPC class
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/classes.json
msgid "When the end came, we were ready.  Now I grow food for my phyle."
msgstr ""
"Cuando llegó el final, estábamos listos. Ahora cultivo comida para mi clan."

#. ~ Unique name of a female NPC
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/classes.json
msgid "Millyficent Whately"
msgstr "Millyficent Whately"

#. ~ Name suffix of a female NPC
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/classes.json
msgid "Xenobiologist, madwoman"
msgstr "Xenobióloga, mujer loca"

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/classes.json
msgid "mi-go enthusiast"
msgstr "entusiasta mi-go"

#. ~ Job description of "mi-go enthusiast" NPC class
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/classes.json
msgid "I've been studying the mi-go for years…"
msgstr "He estado estudiando los mi-go durante años..."

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/classes.json
msgid "Whately Cousin"
msgstr "Primo Whately"

#. ~ Job description of "Whately Cousin" NPC class
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/classes.json
msgid ""
"Our family has been through hard times before.  We know how to survive."
msgstr ""
"Nuestra familia ya ha pasado por momentos difíciles. Sabemos cómo "
"sobrevivir."

#. ~ Unique name of a male NPC
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/classes.json
msgid "Cyrus Whately"
msgstr "Cyrus Whately"

#. ~ Name suffix of a male NPC
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/classes.json
msgid "Patriarch, doomseer"
msgstr "Patriarca, profeta de la condenación"

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/classes.json
msgid "Aspiring Frankenstein"
msgstr "Frankenstein Aspirante"

#. ~ Job description of "Aspiring Frankenstein" NPC class
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/classes.json
msgid "Friend to outsiders…"
msgstr "Amigo de los forasteros..."

#. ~ Unique name of a female NPC
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/classes.json
msgid "Wilhemina Whately"
msgstr "Wilhemina Whately"

#. ~ Name suffix of a female NPC
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/classes.json
msgid "Shopkeeper"
msgstr "Comerciante"

#. ~ Unique name of a male NPC
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/classes.json
msgid "Nicodemus Whately"
msgstr "Nicodemus Whately"

#. ~ Name suffix of a male NPC
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/classes.json
msgid "Whately, Hatchetman"
msgstr "Whately, sicario"

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/classes.json
msgid "thawed hacker"
msgstr "hacker descongelado"

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/classes.json
msgid "thawed doctor"
msgstr "doctor descongelado"

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/classes.json
msgid "thawed scientist"
msgstr "científico descongelado"

#. ~ Unique name of a female NPC
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/classes.json
msgid "Sadie"
msgstr "Sadie"

#. ~ Name suffix of a female NPC
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/classes.json
msgid "forgotten experiment"
msgstr "experimento olvidado"

#. ~ Job description of "forgotten experiment" NPC class
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/classes.json
msgid "What a magical world to explore…"
msgstr "Qué mundo tan mágico para explorar..."

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyropod_classes.json
msgid "Thawed Hacker"
msgstr "Hacker Descongelado"

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyropod_classes.json
msgid "Thawed Doctor"
msgstr "Doctor Descongelado"

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyropod_classes.json
msgid "Thawed Scientist"
msgstr "Científico Descongelado"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyropod_classes.json
msgid "Anymore bad news?"
msgstr "¿Alguna otra mala noticia?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyropod_classes.json
msgid "What year is it?  How long have I been asleep?"
msgstr "¿En qué año estamos? ¿Cuánto tiempo estuve durmiendo?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyropod_classes.json
msgid "I thawed you out of that pod.  Listen, I could use your help…"
msgstr "Te descongelé de esa cápsula. Escucha, podría usar tu ayuda..."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyropod_classes.json
msgid "If you won't help me, I am going to hurt you."
msgstr "Si no me ayudas, te haré daño."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyropod_classes.json
msgid "Sorry, no need to get angry.  I'll get out of your way."
msgstr "Lo siento, no hay necesidad de enfadarse. Me quitaré de en medio."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyropod_classes.json
msgid "So what happens now?"
msgstr "¿Qué pasa ahora?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyropod_classes.json
msgid "Why didn't you leave me frozen until things were better?"
msgstr "¿Por qué no me dejaste congelado hasta que las cosas fueran mejor?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyropod_classes.json
msgid "If I didn't thaw you out now, you'd have died in that pod."
msgstr "si no te descongelaba ahora, habrías muerto en esa vaina."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyropod_classes.json
msgid "I'm being nice for now.  You'd better hope that it lasts."
msgstr "Estoy siendo amable por ahora. Será mejor que esperes que dure."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyropod_classes.json
msgid "I'm sorry, what can I do to help you?"
msgstr "Lo siento, ¿qué puedo hacer para ayudarte?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyropod_classes.json
msgid "How dare you threaten me!"
msgstr "¡Cómo te atreves a amenazarme!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyropod_classes.json
msgid "Go freeze yourself.  Bye."
msgstr "Ve a congelarte. Adiós."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid "What brings you here today?"
msgstr "¿Qué te trae hoy por aquí?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "How are you?"
msgstr "¿Cómo estas?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "Welcome!"
msgstr "¡Bienvenido!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid "Are you ready to leave this marble?"
msgstr "¿Estás listo para dejar este mármol?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid "You look like one of my niece's lab assistants."
msgstr "Te pareces a uno de los asistentes de laboratorio de mi sobrina."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid "Can I do anything for you?  Are you as crazy as your niece?"
msgstr "¿Puedo hacer algo por ti? ¿Estás tan loco como tu sobrina?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid "I'm going on my way now."
msgstr "Voy a seguir mi camino ahora."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid ""
"Are you here because you are morally flexible and willing to take "
"questionable directions from obviously insane people."
msgstr ""
"¿Está usted aquí porque es moralmente flexible y está dispuesto a aceptar "
"indicaciones cuestionables de personas evidentemente dementes?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid "Your niece is looking for you."
msgstr "Tu sobrina te está buscando."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid "Quite the setup you have here."
msgstr "Menudo montaje tienes aquí."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid "This is a Whately family property.  And you are an intruder."
msgstr "Esta es una propiedad de la familia Whately. Y tú eres un intruso."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid "I've met your niece."
msgstr "He conocido a tu sobrina."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid "I didn't mean to intrude."
msgstr "No quería molestar."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid "I think there's been a mistake."
msgstr "Creo que ha habido un error."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid ""
"She's always been so precocious!  I knew that she was going places and we'd "
"see great things from her."
msgstr ""
"¡Siempre ha sido muy precoz!. Sabía que iba a llegar lejos y que veríamos "
"grandes cosas de ella."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid "She needed a lab assistant, do you?"
msgstr "Necesitaba un asistente de laboratorio, ¿y tú?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid "This whole family is deranged."
msgstr "Toda esta familia está trastornada."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid ""
"The Whately family has been part of the fabric of New England since before "
"the Revolutionary War.  And I have been growing our interests for the last "
"few decades."
msgstr ""
"La familia Whately ha formado parte del tejido de Nueva Inglaterra desde "
"antes de la Guerra de la Independencia. Y he estado cultivando nuestros "
"intereses durante las últimas décadas."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid ""
"Muttering 'They whispered of a prison.  Ragnarok engine humming.  Wrapped "
"they in darkness dreaming'.  He shakes himself, 'Anyway it looks like "
"something woke up, for at least a little bit.'"
msgstr ""
"Murmullo 'Susurraban de una prisión. El motor de Ragnarok zumbando. "
"Envueltos ellos en la oscuridad soñando'. Se sacude, 'De todos modos parece "
"que algo despertó, por lo menos un poco'."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid ""
"This is a time of great danger and great opportunity and it must not be "
"squandered."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una época de grandes peligros y grandes oportunidades y no debe ser "
"malgastada."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid "This is not reassuring."
msgstr "Esto no es tranquilizador."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid "In the absence of life"
msgstr "En ausencia de vida"

#. ~ Description of mission "In the absence of life"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid "Find self healing polymers."
msgstr "Encuentra polímeros autocurativos."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "In the absence of life"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid "I need 4 self healing polymers from wherever you can find them."
msgstr "Necesito 4 polímero autocurativos de donde puedas encontrarlos."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "In the absence of life"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid ""
"My experiments are at a critical point.  Could you find about… 4 self "
"healing polymers for me?"
msgstr ""
"Mis experimentos están en un punto crítico. ¿Podrías encontrar unos... 4 "
"polímeros autocurativos para mí?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "In the absence of life"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mi-go biology"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid "Then why are you even here?  Just let me know if you reconsider."
msgstr "Entonces, ¿por qué estás aquí? Hazme saber si lo reconsideras."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "In the absence of life"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid "Hospitals, DIY geneticists."
msgstr "Hospitales, genetistas DIY(Hazlo tu mismo)"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "In the absence of life"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mi-go biology"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid "Why aren't you done yet?"
msgstr "¿Por qué no has terminado todavía?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "In the absence of life"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid "My niece shared her research, show me if it works."
msgstr "Mi sobrina compartió su investigación, mostrame si funciona."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "In the absence of life"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid "Put a stopper in death?  No you never will."
msgstr "¿Poner un freno a la muerte? No, nunca lo harás."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid "Making Connections"
msgstr "Fabricando Conexiones"

#. ~ Description of mission "Making Connections"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid "I need a neurosynaptic interface matrix."
msgstr "Necesito una matriz de interfaz neurosináptica."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Making Connections"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid "I need one neurosynaptic interface matrix."
msgstr "Necesito una matriz de interfaz neurosináptica."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Making Connections"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid ""
"I want to test something and I need a viable version to reverse engineer.  "
"Bring me one neurosynaptic interface matrix."
msgstr ""
"Quiero probar algo y necesito una versión viable para hacer ingeniería "
"inversa. Tráeme una matriz de interfaz neurosináptica."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Making Connections"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid "Without this all that's possible is 'Ye liveliest awfulness'."
msgstr "Sin esto todo lo que es posible es 'Ye liveliest awfulness'."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Making Connections"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid "You'd give up a new world just to bring back Foodplace!"
msgstr "¡Renunciaría a  un mundo nuevo sólo para traer de vuelta Lugarcomida!"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Making Connections"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid "You're going to have to hunt this down."
msgstr "Vas a tener que buscar esto."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Making Connections"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid "Have you found my matrix?"
msgstr "¿Has encontrado mi matriz?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Making Connections"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid "Have this."
msgstr "Toma esto."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Making Connections"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid ""
"How could you possibly lie to me about an object you have not put in my "
"hands."
msgstr ""
"Cómo es posible que me mientas sobre un objeto que no has puesto en mis "
"manos."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Making Connections"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid ""
"Do you have any head cybernetics?  I could possibly salvage one out of your "
"skull."
msgstr ""
"¿Tienes alguna cabeza cibernética? Posiblemente podría recuperar una de tu "
"cráneo."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid "Alpha Mutagen"
msgstr "Mutágeno Alfa"

#. ~ Description of mission "Alpha Mutagen"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid "Bring me 3 alpha mutagen."
msgstr "Traeme 3 mutágenos alfa."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Alpha Mutagen"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid "I need three alpha mutagen."
msgstr "Necesito 3 mutágenos alfa."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Alpha Mutagen"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid ""
"I know that one of the corporations were creating a so called Alpha mutagen."
"  I need three doses to prepare the body."
msgstr ""
"Sé que una de las corporaciones estaba creando un llamado mutágeno Alfa. "
"Necesito tres dosis para preparar el cuerpo."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Alpha Mutagen"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid "Better living through chemistry."
msgstr "Vivir mejor gracias a la química."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Alpha Mutagen"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid "Would you take it yourself?"
msgstr "¿Lo tomarías tú mismo?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Alpha Mutagen"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid ""
"If you can't make it yourself go hit up a lab.  Be prepared for anything in "
"there."
msgstr ""
"Si no puedes hacerlo tú mismo, ve a un laboratorio. Prepárate para cualquier"
" cosa allí."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Alpha Mutagen"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid "Did you get taller since the last time I saw you?"
msgstr "¿Estás más alto de la última vez que te vi?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Alpha Mutagen"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Broken Cyborg"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mutagen"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid "I've got something more potent for you this time."
msgstr "Esta vez tengo algo más potente para ti."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Alpha Mutagen"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Broken Cyborg"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mutagen"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid "Lies and the lying liars who tell them."
msgstr "Mentiras y los mentirosos que las cuentan."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Alpha Mutagen"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mutagen"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid "You are keeping me from my experiments.  Would you like to become one?"
msgstr "Me alejas de mis experimentos. ¿Te gustaría convertirte en uno?"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid "Broken Cyborg"
msgstr "Cíborg Rota"

#. ~ Description of mission "Broken Cyborg"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid "We need a strong base for our experiment."
msgstr "Necesitamos una base fuerte para nuestro experimento."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Broken Cyborg"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid ""
"I need an unconscious broken cyborg.  They are already brain dead so it "
"won't be murder."
msgstr ""
"Necesito un cyborg roto inconsciente. Ya tienen muerte cerebral, así que no "
"será un asesinato."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Broken Cyborg"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid ""
"If you go to labs you should find some broken cyborg experiments.  Bring an "
"inactive one to me."
msgstr ""
"Si vas a los laboratorios deberías encontrar algunos experimentos "
"cibernéticos rotos. Tráeme uno inactivo."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Broken Cyborg"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid "Are you ready for a little necromancy?"
msgstr "¿Estás preparado para un poco de nigromancia?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Broken Cyborg"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid "I'm telling you they're already brain dead."
msgstr "Te digo que ya tienen el cerebro muerto."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Broken Cyborg"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid "Look for surgical centers inside the labs."
msgstr "Busca centros quirúrgicos dentro de los laboratorios."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Broken Cyborg"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid "So where are my fresh parts?"
msgstr "Entonces, ¿dónde están mis piezas frescas?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Broken Cyborg"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid "What kinds of body modifications do you have?"
msgstr "¿Qué tipo de modificaciones corporales tienes?"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid "A-Mi-go, You-go find me some brains"
msgstr "A-Mi-go, You-go a encontrarme algunos cerebros"

#. ~ Description of mission "A-Mi-go, You-go find me some brains"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid "Find 6 living brains in jars."
msgstr "Encuentra 6 cerebros vivos en frascos."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "A-Mi-go, You-go find me some brains"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid ""
"I need some brains, but brains that are still living.  We've got our own "
"brain blasters, but I won't risk them in experiments."
msgstr ""
"Necesito algunos cerebros, pero cerebros que aún estén vivos. Tenemos "
"nuestros propios blasters cerebrales, pero no los arriesgaré en "
"experimentos."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "A-Mi-go, You-go find me some brains"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid ""
"If this works I may be able to give some of these poor souls bodies again.  "
"Six should do."
msgstr ""
"Si esto funciona podré dar a algunas de estas pobres almas cuerpos de nuevo."
" Seis deberían ser suficientes."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "A-Mi-go, You-go find me some brains"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid "I knew I could count on your generosity."
msgstr "Sabía que podía contar con tu generosidad."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "A-Mi-go, You-go find me some brains"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid "I would have given you the title of Whately family Igor."
msgstr "Te habría dado el título de Igor de la familia Whately."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "A-Mi-go, You-go find me some brains"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Humming Hearts"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Brain blasters, that's what I call them.  Some kind of automated weapon "
"system the mi-go use."
msgstr ""
"Blasters cerebrales, así es como los llamo. Una especie de sistema de armas "
"automatizadas que usan los mi-go."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "A-Mi-go, You-go find me some brains"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Humming Hearts"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid "They speak sometimes.  I wonder if they still think."
msgstr "A veces hablan. Me pregunto si todavía piensan."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "A-Mi-go, You-go find me some brains"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
msgid ""
"Go somewhere, far away, and then connect the power system.  Come back and "
"tell me how things went."
msgstr ""
"Ve a algún lugar, muy lejos, y luego conecta el sistema de energía. Vuelve y"
" cuéntame cómo han ido las cosas."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "A-Mi-go, You-go find me some brains"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Humming Hearts"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid "I can't be Dr Frankenstein unless you get me these."
msgstr "No puedo ser el Dr. Frankenstein a menos que me consigas esto."

#. ~ NPC faction name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/factions.json
msgid "PrepNet Phyle"
msgstr "Phyle RedPrep"

#. ~ Description of NPC faction "PrepNet Phyle"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/factions.json
msgid ""
"A group of bionic preppers who had expected the collapse of the economy and "
"global chaos, instead they were slightly more ready than others for the "
"Cataclysm."
msgstr ""
"Un grupo de preparadores biónicos que habían esperado el colapso de la "
"economía y el caos global, en su lugar estaban ligeramente más preparados "
"que otros para el Cataclismo."

#. ~ NPC faction name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/factions.json
msgid "Whately Family"
msgstr "Familia Whately"

#. ~ Description of NPC faction "Whately Family"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/factions.json
msgid ""
"The Whately's are an old New England family of eccentrics.  Eccentrics being"
" the kind words used about them."
msgstr ""
"Los Whately son una antigua familia de excéntricos de Nueva Inglaterra. Los "
"excéntricos son las palabras amables que se usan para referirse a ellos."

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#. ~ Make a Frankenstein BG story
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/frankenstein_classes.json
msgid "Abomination"
msgstr "Abominación"

#. ~ Job description of "Abomination" NPC class
#. ~ Make a Frankenstein BG story
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/frankenstein_classes.json
msgid ""
"The mi-go took me and vivisected me.  Now you've given me a body again."
msgstr ""
"El mi-go me cogió y me viviseccionó. Ahora me has dado un cuerpo otra vez."

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ An abomination you have revived.
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/frankenstein_classes.json
msgid "Cyborg Abomination"
msgstr "Abominación Cyborg"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid "What did you bring me?"
msgstr "¿Qué me has traído?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid "Do you smell something?"
msgstr "¿Hueles algo?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid "New test subjects!  I'm so glad you showed up!"
msgstr ""
"¡Nuevos sujetos de prueba! ¡Estoy muy contento de que hayas aparecido!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid "Can I do anything for you?  Do I want to?"
msgstr "¿Puedo hacer algo por ti? ¿Quiero hacerlo?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Millyficent Whately.  I'm so glad you finally arrived.  It's been a while "
"since I last received new lab partners."
msgstr ""
"Millyficent Whately. Me alegro de que por fin hayas llegado. Ha pasado un "
"tiempo desde la última vez que recibí nuevos compañeros de laboratorio."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid "I'm so hungry, can you help me?"
msgstr "Tengo mucha hambre, ¿puedes ayudarme?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
msgid "You are aware of the Cataclysm?"
msgstr "¿Estás al tanto del Cataclismo?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid "I am your new lab partner."
msgstr "Soy tu nuevo compañero de laboratorio."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Welcome to my lab!  Here we explore the boundaries of the possible beyond "
"the reach of small minds."
msgstr ""
"¡Bienvenido a mi laboratorio! Aquí exploramos los límites de lo posible más "
"allá del alcance de las mentes pequeñas."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid "Can you give me something to eat then?"
msgstr "¿Puedes darme algo de comer entonces?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"No, no, no!  No food without successfully completed experiments.  We mustn't"
" break the contract!"
msgstr ""
"¡No, no, no! No hay comida sin experimentos completados con éxito. ¡No "
"debemos romper el contrato!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid "What do I have to do?"
msgstr "¿Qué tengo que hacer?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid "I don't think you are well."
msgstr "No creo que estés bien."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Well after I did my graduate thesis on theoretical xenobiology the "
"government hired me to join the most interesting program.  Yes there were "
"deaths but we learned so much."
msgstr ""
"Bueno, después de hacer mi tesis de grado sobre xenobiología teórica, el "
"gobierno me contrató para unirme al programa más interesante. Sí, hubo "
"muertes, pero aprendimos mucho."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"What I know is that I pay well for test subjects and I deliver results and "
"at this rate we will not be releasing on time!"
msgstr ""
"¡Lo que sé es que pago bien por los sujetos de prueba y entrego resultados y"
" a este paso no vamos a terminar a tiempo!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Ever since they moved me to my own lab my research has progressed so much "
"faster."
msgstr ""
"Desde que me trasladaron a mi propio laboratorio, mi investigación ha "
"progresado mucho más rápido."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid "Mi-go biology"
msgstr "Biología de Mi-go"

#. ~ Description of mission "Mi-go biology"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid "Find fetid goop."
msgstr "Encuentra pringue fétida."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mi-go biology"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid "I need 14 fetid goops from mi-go locations."
msgstr "Necesito 14 pringues fétidas de mis localizaciones mi-go."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mi-go biology"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"My experiments are at a critical point.  Could you find about… 14 fetid "
"goops for me?"
msgstr ""
"Mis experimentos están en un punto crítico. ¿Podrías encontrar sobre... 14 "
"pringues fétidos para mí?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mi-go biology"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Find a mi-go base, find a way inside, smash things until you find what I "
"need."
msgstr ""
"Encuentra una base de mi-go, encuentra una manera de entrar, rompe cosas "
"hasta que encuentres lo que necesito."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mi-go biology"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid "Taste this."
msgstr "Prueba esto."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mi-go biology"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid "You are holding back the evolution of the human race."
msgstr "Estás frenando la evolución de la raza humana."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid "Mi-go Resin"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mission "Mi-go Resin"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid "Find 50 chunks of mi-go resin."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mi-go Resin"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid "I need 50 chunks of mi-go resin."
msgstr "Necesito 50 trozos de resina mi-go."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mi-go Resin"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"I need to understand more about their environment and how they create it.  "
"This research wasn't even possible previously.  Bring me fifty chunks of mi-"
"go resin."
msgstr ""
"Necesito comprender mejor sobre su ambiente y cómo lo crean. Esta "
"investigación no era posible antes. Tráeme cincuenta trozos de resina de mi-"
"go."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mi-go Resin"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"My notes suggest that their building materials are alive.  I need you to "
"help me confirm that."
msgstr ""
"Mis notas sugieren que sus materiales de construcción están vivos. Necesito "
"que me ayudes a confirmarlo."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mi-go Resin"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid "You can't just walk away from this.  We're changing the world!"
msgstr "No puedes abandonar esto. ¡Estamos cambiando el mundo!"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mi-go Resin"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Find their buildings, jackhammer them.  What did you do before the world "
"changed for the better, cold call salesman?"
msgstr ""
"Encuentra sus edificios, martillealos. ¿Qué hacías antes de que el mundo "
"cambiara para mejor, vendedor por teléfono?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mi-go Resin"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid "Have you found my resin?"
msgstr "¿Has encontrado mi resina?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mi-go Resin"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid "Drink this."
msgstr "Bebe esto."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mi-go Resin"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Did you act on Broadway?  Because I bet that skill isn't useful anymore."
msgstr ""
"¿Actuastes en Broadway? Porque apuesto a que esa habilidad ya no te es útil."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mi-go Resin"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid "I wonder if I could trade you to them for what I need?"
msgstr "¿Me pregunto si podría intercambiarte con ellos por lo que necesito?A"

#. ~ Description of mission "Mutagen"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid "Bring me 3 mutagen."
msgstr "Traeme 3 mutágenos."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mutagen"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid "I need three mutagen."
msgstr "Necesito 3 mutágenos."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mutagen"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"I need some mutagen and I don't want to spend the time making it myself.  "
"Bring me three doses, if you would be so kind."
msgstr ""
"Necesito un poco de mutágeno y no quiero perder el tiempo haciéndolo yo "
"mismo. Tráeme tres dosis, si eres tan amable."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mutagen"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Mutagen makes the world go round, it's definitely more valuable than love."
msgstr ""
"El mutágeno hace girar el mundo, es definitivamente más valioso que el amor."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mutagen"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid "Are you scared of where I'm taking you?"
msgstr "¿Tienes miedo de dónde te estoy llevando?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mutagen"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"If you can't make it yourself go hit up a government lab.  Be prepared for "
"anything in there."
msgstr ""
"Si no puedes hacerlo tú mismo, ve a un laboratorio del gobierno. Prepárate "
"para cualquier cosa allí."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mutagen"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid "Mutagen?  Why are you in front of me if not?"
msgstr "¿Mutágeno? ¿Por qué estás delante de mí si no?"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid "Humming Hearts"
msgstr "Corazones Palpitantes"

#. ~ Description of mission "Humming Hearts"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid "Find 2 humming hearts."
msgstr "Encuentra 2 corazones palpitantes."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Humming Hearts"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid "Parts, parts, parts.  Bring me some hearts."
msgstr "Partes, partes, partes. Tráeme algunos corazones."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Humming Hearts"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"The Whately's are known in these parts for gathering body parts.  Ha!  "
"That's just rumors and hearsay.  But I do need two humming hearts."
msgstr ""
"Los Whately son conocidos en estos sitios por recoger partes del cuerpo. "
"¡Ja! Eso son sólo rumores y habladurías. Pero necesito dos corazones "
"palpitantes."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Humming Hearts"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"I have some relatives you should meet, if you don't mind hard work for the "
"advancement of science."
msgstr ""
"Tengo algunos parientes que deberías conocer, si no te importa trabajar duro"
" por el avance de la ciencia."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Humming Hearts"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid "Even I understand this is dangerous."
msgstr "Incluso yo entiendo que esto es peligroso."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Humming Hearts"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid "Let's see what improvements we can divine from these beauties."
msgstr "Veamos qué mejoras podemos adivinar de estas bellezas."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid "Find my great uncle Cyrus Whately"
msgstr "Encuentra a mi tío abuelo Cyrus Whately"

#. ~ Description of mission "Find my great uncle Cyrus Whately"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Cyrus and his family were poorly liked even for Whately's before the end of "
"the world.  They went so far off grid that they may not even know anything "
"has changed.  I need to know he's alive and where his research has taken "
"him."
msgstr ""
"Cyrus y su familia eran mal vistos incluso por los Whately antes del fin del"
" mundo. Se alejaron tanto de la red que puede que ni siquiera sepan que algo"
" ha cambiado. Necesito saber que está vivo y a dónde le ha llevado su "
"investigación."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find my great uncle Cyrus Whately"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"My great uncle Cyrus had an unconventional relationship with both his "
"neighbors and the mi-go before the Cataclysm.  I'd like to know where he has"
" gotten with his research since I haven't heard from him in years."
msgstr ""
"Mi tío abuelo Cyrus tenía una relación poco convencional tanto con sus "
"vecinos como con los mi-go antes del Cataclismo. Me gustaría saber a dónde "
"ha llegado con sus investigaciones ya que hace años que no sé nada de él."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find my great uncle Cyrus Whately"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid "Can you go find my uncle and let him know where I am?"
msgstr "¿Puedes ir a buscar a mi tío y decirle dónde estoy?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find my great uncle Cyrus Whately"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Of course you said yes, you want to know what he's found just as much as I "
"do!"
msgstr ""
"Por supuesto que has dicho que sí, ¡quieres saber lo que ha encontrado tanto"
" como yo!"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find my great uncle Cyrus Whately"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Oh well.  I was hoping to teach you some new things, so you could start your"
" own experiments."
msgstr ""
"Oh, bueno. Esperaba enseñarte algunas cosas nuevas, para que pudieras "
"empezar tus propios experimentos."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find my great uncle Cyrus Whately"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"I've given you directions to that branch of the family's bunker.  Yes I said"
" bunker did you think he'd be in a tower?"
msgstr ""
"Te he dado indicaciones para llegar al búnker de esa rama de la familia. Sí,"
" he dicho búnker, ¿crees que estaría en una torre?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find my great uncle Cyrus Whately"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Thanks, now that he knows I'm here he's sent some of my cousins.  Now that I"
" have more disposable help, take a copy of my early research."
msgstr ""
"Gracias, ahora que sabeñ que estoy aquí dp ha enviado a algunos de mis "
"primos. Ahora que tengo más ayuda disponible, toma una copia de mi "
"investigación temprana."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find my great uncle Cyrus Whately"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
msgid "I hope he didn't meet Leandrus' fate…"
msgstr "Espero que no haya encontrador el destino de Leandrus..."

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ Abomination.  Change the chat if this loads.
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/npc.json
msgid "Cousin"
msgstr "Primo"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "How's the weather?"
msgstr "¿Cómo está el tiempo?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "Howdy!  You seem new, what brings you here?"
msgstr "¡Hola! Pareces nuevo, ¿qué te trae por aquí?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "How do I join the phyle?"
msgstr "¿Cómo me uno al clan?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "I'm a gardener for PrepNet Phyle.  Who are you?"
msgstr "Soy jardinero del clan PrepNet. ¿Quién es usted?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "I am a beggar who really needs something to eat."
msgstr "Soy un mendigo que realmente necesita algo de comer."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid "I am just a fellow survivor."
msgstr "Sólo soy un compañero superviviente"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "I'm bringing order back to the land."
msgstr "Estoy trayendo orden a la tierra."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"This is a PrepNet Phyle orchard.  We were a community of survivalists "
"gathering resources to prepare for climate change, but it left us better "
"prepared for what actually happened than most."
msgstr ""
"Esto es un huerto de arboles del clan PrepNet. Éramos una comunidad de "
"supervivencialistas reuniendo recursos para prepararnos para el cambio "
"climático, pero nos dejó mejor preparados para lo que realmente pasó que la "
"mayoría."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid "What can I buy here?"
msgstr "¿Qué puedo comprar aquí?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "Only the insane will prosper, I guess."
msgstr "Sólo los locos prosperarán, supongo."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"This food has to go back to our core communities.  But maybe we can trade "
"some food for services"
msgstr ""
"Esta comida tiene que volver a nuestras comunidades centrales. Pero tal vez "
"podamos cambiar algunos alimentos por servicios"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid "I can pay."
msgstr "Puedo pagar."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid "Well I'm heading out then"
msgstr "Bueno, entonces me voy."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"You have to earn the right to trade with us.  Plus we created our own "
"currency before the Cataclysm"
msgstr ""
"Tienes que ganarte el derecho a comerciar con nosotros. Además, creamos "
"nuestra propia moneda antes del cataclismo"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid "It was worth a try."
msgstr "Valía la pena intentarlo."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "What kind of currency?"
msgstr "¿Qué tipo de moneda?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"This is just an outpost, you'd have to find our main camp and currently we "
"don't want you to."
msgstr ""
"Esto es sólo un puesto de avanzada, tendrías que encontrar nuestro "
"campamento principal y actualmente no queremos que lo hagas."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "I didn't want to join your club anyway."
msgstr "No quería unirme a tu club de todos modos."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Here?  Fruits and berries.  Maybe the occasional piece of farm equipment, "
"but you need crypto coins"
msgstr ""
"¿Aquí? Frutas y bayas. Tal vez alguna pieza ocasional de equipo de granja, "
"pero necesitas criptomonedas."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "Ok."
msgstr "Ok."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "Crypto coins?  Are you insane, there isn't any global internet now."
msgstr "¿criptomonedas? ¿Estás loco? Ya no hay internet en todo el mundo."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"I got introduced to the movement through Mutual Aid Society.  From there it "
"became an all consuming part of my life to prepare for a post consumption "
"world.  It seems to have worked better for us than for many others."
msgstr ""
"Me introduje en el movimiento a través de la Sociedad de Ayuda Mutua. A "
"partir de ahí se convirtió en una parte muy absorbente de mi vida el "
"prepararme para un mundo postconsumo. Parece haber funcionado mejor para "
"nosotros que para muchos otros."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"It can get lonely out here between caravans.  But there's plenty of work and"
" my Cyber Mastiffs.  If a horde comes through we hunker down in a nearby "
"shelter if it's too large for us."
msgstr ""
"Puede ser solitario aquí entre las caravanas. Pero hay mucho trabajo y mis "
"Cyber Mastines. Si una horda pasa, nos refugiamos en un refugio cercano si "
"es demasiado grande para nosotros."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid "I'm glad you stay busy."
msgstr "Me alegro de que te mantengas ocupado."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"We use so-called crypto coins for money here.  They were a pre-Cataclysm "
"attempt to abstract money even further and create electronic cash.  Now it's"
" a joke because we use physical coins.  Barter only gets you so far.  And "
"one day we'll have the Net back up."
msgstr ""
"Aquí usamos las llamadas criptomonedas para el dinero. Fueron un intento "
"antes del Cataclismo de abstraer aún más el dinero y crear dinero "
"electrónico. Ahora es una broma porque usamos monedas físicas. El trueque "
"sólo te lleva hasta cierto punto. Y un día tendremos la red de nuevo."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "Big Game Hunting"
msgstr "Gran Juego de Caza"

#. ~ Description of mission "Big Game Hunting"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "Find 50 fur pelts."
msgstr "Encuentra 50 pelajes."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Big Game Hunting"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "I need 50 fur pelts."
msgstr "Necesito 50 pelajes de animales."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Big Game Hunting"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"I've got to maintain the orchard but at nights I work on prepping winter "
"clothes.  Could you find about… 50 fur pelts for me?"
msgstr ""
"Tengo que mantener el huerto de arboles pero por las noches trabajo en la "
"preparación de la ropa de invierno. ¿Podrías encontrar unas... 50 pelajes de"
" animales para mí?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Big Game Hunting"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"There's a lot of places to look.  The entire outdoors is full of wild "
"animals."
msgstr ""
"Hay muchos lugares para buscar. Todo el exterior está lleno de animales "
"salvajes."

#. ~ Description of mission "Bread"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "Find 50 flour."
msgstr "Encuentra 50 de harina."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bread"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "I need 50 flour."
msgstr "Necesito 50 de harina."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bread"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "Flour would let me break the monotony of fruit and meats."
msgstr ""
"La harina me permitiría romper la monotonía de las frutas y las carnes."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bread"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Thanks for accepting this task.  Otherwise I might kill a stranger for a "
"sandwich.  Just kidding."
msgstr ""
"Gracias por aceptar esta tarea. De lo contrario podría matar a un extraño "
"por un sándwich. Es una broma."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bread"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Flour is not that hard to find.  I'd look for them in residential areas and "
"professional kitchens or bakeries."
msgstr ""
"La harina no es tan difícil de encontrar. Yo las buscaría en zonas "
"residenciales y cocinas profesionales o panaderías."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bread"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "Have you found the flour?"
msgstr "¿Has encontrado la harina?"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "Gallon Jugs"
msgstr "Jarras de Galón (3.7 l)"

#. ~ Description of mission "Gallon Jugs"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "Find 5 gallon jugs."
msgstr "Encuentra 5 jarras de galón."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gallon Jugs"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "I need storage for various liquid products when the fruits come in."
msgstr ""
"Necesito almacenar varios productos líquidos cuando llegan las frutas."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gallon Jugs"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Every season we produce so much fruit.  Some of it will be turned into juice"
" and some into alcohol.  I need easy containers to load it on the caravan."
msgstr ""
"Cada temporada producimos tanta fruta. Parte de ella se convertirá en zumo y"
" otra en alcohol. Necesito contenedores sencillos para cargarlos en la "
"caravana."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gallon Jugs"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "Thank you for accepting.  I'm almost out after the last caravan."
msgstr ""
"Gracias por aceptar. Estoy casi terminado después de la última caravana."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gallon Jugs"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "I guess I'll have to make stomach waterskins."
msgstr "Supongo que tendré que utilizar odres."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gallon Jugs"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Gallon jugs are not that rare to find.  They are commonly found in kitchens."
msgstr ""
"Los envases de galón no son tan raros de encontrar. Se encuentran comúnmente"
" en las cocinas."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gallon Jugs"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "Do you have those jugs now?"
msgstr "¿Tienes esos envases ahora?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gallon Jugs"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "I am grateful for the help you've done.  I have one more task to do."
msgstr ""
"Estoy agradecido por la ayuda que nos has prestado. Tengo una tarea más que "
"hacer."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "Burnt Out CBMs"
msgstr "MBCs quemados"

#. ~ Description of mission "Burnt Out CBMs"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "Find 5 burnt out CBMs."
msgstr "Encuentra 5 MBCs quemados."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Burnt Out CBMs"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "We have the ability to manufacture CBMs but lack resources."
msgstr "Tenemos la capacidad de fabricar MBCs pero carecemos de recursos."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Burnt Out CBMs"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "If you can bring me burnt out CBMs we can recycle them into new ones."
msgstr "Si puedes traerme MBCs quemados podemos reciclarlos en otros nuevos."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Burnt Out CBMs"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Thank you for accepting.  You're really making yourself useful to the phyle."
msgstr ""
"Gracias por aceptar. Realmente te estás haciendo útil para la el clan."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Burnt Out CBMs"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"These materials are often in dangerous areas.  I understand your decision."
msgstr ""
"Estos materiales se encuentran a menudo en zonas peligrosas. Entiendo tu "
"decisión."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Burnt Out CBMs"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Zombie scientists, technicians, shocker zombies.  These are not undertaken "
"lightly."
msgstr ""
"Zombis científicos, técnicos o  lanzarayos. No deben ser tomados a la "
"ligera."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Burnt Out CBMs"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "Do you have those CBMs now?"
msgstr "¿Tienes esos MBCs ahora?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Burnt Out CBMs"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"I am grateful for the help you've done.  I think we might be able to "
"introduce you to others soon."
msgstr ""
"Estoy agradecido por la ayuda que ha prestado. Creo que pronto podremos "
"presentarte a otros."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "sadie_injection"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
msgid "Sadie's injection"
msgstr "inyección de Sadie"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Sadie's injection"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
msgid "A wave of cold runs through your body and you feel dizzy"
msgstr "Una ola de frío recorre tu cuerpo y te sientes mareado"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Sadie's injection"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
msgid "The effects of Sadie's injection appear to be wearing off now"
msgstr ""
"Los efectos de la inyección de Sadie parecen estar desapareciendo ahora"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
msgid "Are we meeting again or did we already do that part?"
msgstr "¿Nos volvemos a encontrar o ya hemos hecho esa parte?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
msgid "You remind me of my friend Billy."
msgstr "Me recuerdas a mi amigo Billy."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
msgid "What an amazing world to be alive in, more or less."
msgstr "Qué mundo tan increíble para estar vivo, más o menos."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
msgid ""
"My head always beats when I see you.  Or is that my heart?  I should check "
"that."
msgstr ""
"Mi cabeza siempre late cuando te veo. ¿O es mi corazón? Debería comprobarlo."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
msgid "It's always so nice to be seen."
msgstr "Siempre es muy agradable ser visto."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
msgid ""
"Hello Billy.  Back again to try and kill me?  It won't work, you should just"
" give up."
msgstr ""
"Hola Billy. ¿De vuelta otra vez para intentar matarme? No funcionará, "
"deberías rendirte."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
msgid "What, who is Billy?"
msgstr "Que. ¿Quién es Billy?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
msgid "Die foul creature!"
msgstr "¡Muere asquerosa criatura!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
msgid "What did you just inject me with?"
msgstr "¿Qué me acabas de inyectar?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
msgid "Would you like to come with me Sadie?"
msgstr "¿Te gustaría venir conmigo Sadie?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
msgid "Can you inject me with whatever that was again?"
msgstr "¿Puedes inyectarme lo que sea que haya sido eso otra vez?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
msgid ""
"Oh.  I see now.  You have different sexual traits than Billy, likely due to "
"a mutation or cybernetic enhancement, useful in mating rituals, the act of "
"reproduction, and establishing social hierarchies.  Very good, I accept that"
" you are either not Billy or have changed enough that we can establish a new"
" relationship beyond violence, for example based around the gathering of "
"food, mating, or shared hobbies such as badminton or photography.  How do "
"you wish to proceed with our relationship not-Billy?"
msgstr ""
"Oh. Ahora lo veo. Tienes rasgos sexuales diferentes a los de Billy, "
"probablemente debido a una mutación o a una mejora cibernética, útiles en "
"los rituales de apareamiento, en el acto de reproducción y en el "
"establecimiento de jerarquías sociales. Muy bien, acepto que no eres Billy o"
" que has cambiado lo suficiente como para que podamos establecer una nueva "
"relación más allá de la violencia, por ejemplo, basada en la recolección de "
"alimentos, el apareamiento o las aficiones compartidas, como el bádminton o "
"la fotografía. ¿Cómo deseas proceder con nuestra relación no-Billy?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
msgid ""
"I'd like to understand more about you first.  Are you human, more or less?"
msgstr "Primero me gustaría saber más sobre ti. ¿Eres humano, más o menos?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
msgid "I am your new friend and I'm here to help you."
msgstr "Soy tu nuevo amigo y estoy aquí para ayudarte."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
msgid ""
"Yes, much of what you see is human I think.  I don't have the proper "
"equipment to be entirely sure and I have some strange memories.  My beacon "
"has already told you that I am Sadie.  Beyond that I don't know much to tell"
" you.  I know a great deal about medicine.  I have some strange responses to"
" physical stimuli that I don't completely understand.  I think I must be a "
"medical experiment of some kind.  My chest hurts in a really yummy way."
msgstr ""
"Sí, mucho de lo que ves es humano, creo. No tengo el equipo adecuado para "
"estar completamente seguro y tengo algunos recuerdos extraños. Mi baliza ya "
"te ha dicho que soy Sadie. Más allá de eso no sé mucho que decirte. Sé mucho"
" sobre medicina. Tengo algunas respuestas extrañas a los estímulos físicos "
"que no entiendo del todo. Creo que debo ser un experimento médico de algún "
"tipo. Me duele el pecho de una manera realmente deliciosa."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
msgid "Can I help you?"
msgstr "¿Te puedo ayudar?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
msgid "I should go."
msgstr "Debo irme."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
msgid ""
"I have so many memories, but they feel like they belong to other people?  "
"And animals too I think?  It makes me dizzy and I have to sit down."
msgstr ""
"Tengo tantos recuerdos, pero siento que pertenecen a otras personas? ¿Y a "
"los animales también, creo? Me marea y tengo que sentarme."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
msgid "I don't know her."
msgstr "No la conozco."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Yoshimi.json
msgid "Yes.  Let's talk about something else."
msgstr "Sí. Hablemos de otra cosa."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
msgid ""
"Things stay pretty much the same here.  Sometimes I feel bad, and that feels"
" good, and sometimes I feel good, and that feels good too.  Overall things "
"are better than you might expect, but this may be a common experience, in "
"which case things are exactly as you might expect.  Does that make sense?"
msgstr ""
"Las cosas siguen más o menos igual aquí. A veces me siento mal, y eso se "
"siente bien, y a veces me siento bien, y eso también se siente bien. En "
"general, las cosas son mejores de lo que cabría esperar, pero puede que se "
"trate de una experiencia común, en cuyo caso las cosas son exactamente como "
"cabría esperar. ¿Tiene sentido?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
msgid "Perfect sense."
msgstr "Tiene mucho sentido."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
msgid ""
"I hope you like it, it's one of my favorite things in the world, actually a "
"lot of them all blended together.  It should feel really good.  Or really "
"bad, I guess I don't know much about your body chemistry.  You're still "
"alive, that's a really good sign!"
msgstr ""
"Espero que te guste, es una de mis cosas favoritas en el mundo, en realidad "
"un montón de ellas mezcladas. Debería sentirse muy bien. O muy mal, supongo "
"que no sé mucho sobre la química de tu cuerpo. Todavía estás vivo, ¡eso es "
"una muy buena señal!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
msgid ""
"Wonderful.  Please don't inject me with anything else unless I ask for it in"
" the future."
msgstr ""
"Maravilloso. Por favor, no me inyectes nada más a menos que lo pida en el "
"futuro."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
msgid ""
"I'm so glad you liked it.  It really means a lot to me that we have similar "
"body chemistry.  That's so important for all kinds of biological and "
"emotional compatibility for example organ transplants and the reproductive "
"act.  This shows how I feel about you, I think."
msgstr ""
"Me alegro mucho de que te haya gustado. Significa mucho para mí que tengamos"
" una química corporal similar. Eso es tan importante para todo tipo de "
"compatibilidad biológica y emocional, por ejemplo los trasplantes de órganos"
" y el acto reproductivo. Esto demuestra lo que siento por ti, creo."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
msgid "I'm glad we get along so well Sadie."
msgstr "Me alegro de que nos llevemos tan bien Sadie."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
msgid ""
"Let's go explore.  There's still so much these eyes haven't seen.  Wait, are"
" these new eyes?  Where did I put my old eyes?  Are they pretty?"
msgstr ""
"Vamos a explorar. Todavía hay mucho que estos ojos no hayan visto. Espera, "
"¿son ojos nuevos? ¿Dónde puse mis viejos ojos? ¿Son bonitos?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
msgid ""
"I can't wait to see how wonderful the world must be.  I've heard the "
"shrieking and moaning and cries for help and I just know it's going to be "
"perfect if everyone out there is as sweet and loving as you and Billy."
msgstr ""
"No puedo esperar a ver lo maravilloso que debe ser el mundo. He oído los "
"chillidos, los gemidos y los gritos de auxilio y sé que va a ser perfecto si"
" todo el mundo es tan dulce y cariñoso como tú y Billy."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
msgid "Yes, everyone left is exactly like Billy and me, or worse."
msgstr "Sí, todos los que quedan son exactamente como Billy y yo, o peor."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
msgid "They're even better.  Let's go."
msgstr "Son mejores, incluso. Vamos."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
msgid "Heart for Sadie"
msgstr "Corazón Por Sadie"

#. ~ Description of mission "Heart for Sadie"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
msgid "Find a special organ"
msgstr "Encuentra un órgano especial"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Heart for Sadie"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
msgid "I want your organ."
msgstr "Quiero tu órgano."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Heart for Sadie"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
msgid ""
"I've been feeling really yummy since the last time Billy came to work on me,"
" and I think it's because my heart is gone.  Like literally gone.  I "
"checked.  Billy did a really good job taking it out, but I want to leave "
"this storage unit with you and if I'm going to do that I need a working "
"heart.  My first idea was to take yours, but you probably need it even more."
"  You know who has a nice big juicy heart?  Billy does.  And I bet I know "
"where Billy is."
msgstr ""
"Me he sentido muy bien desde la última vez que Billy vino a trabajar en mí, "
"y creo que es porque mi corazón se ha ido. Como literalmente desaparecido. "
"Lo he comprobado. Billy hizo un buen trabajo sacándolo, pero quiero dejar "
"este almacén contigo y si voy a hacer eso necesito un corazón que funcione. "
"Mi primera idea fue tomar el tuyo, pero probablemente lo necesites aún más. "
"¿Sabes quién tiene un bonito y jugoso corazón? Billy. Y apuesto a que sé "
"dónde está Billy."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Heart for Sadie"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
msgid "Aw, I heart that you're going to help me get that big organ."
msgstr "Ohhh, Me encanta que me ayudes a conseguir ese gran órgano."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Heart for Sadie"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
msgid ""
"This makes me sad.  Which makes me happy.  So thanks?  Let me know if you "
"change your mind.  I probably shouldn't go without a heart for too too long "
"but I'm kind of enjoying it.  It's like always being on the edge of "
"something horrible, but in a nice way."
msgstr ""
"Esto me entristece. Lo que me hace feliz. ¿Así que gracias? Hazme saber si "
"cambias de opinión. Probablemente no debería estar sin corazón por mucho "
"tiempo, pero lo estoy disfrutando. Es como estar siempre al borde de algo "
"horrible, pero de una manera agradable."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Heart for Sadie"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
msgid ""
"Please be careful cutting that heart out.  If you ruin it I don't know about"
" another good one nearby.  Maybe practice on some friends and neighbors "
"first, you really want to be sure and get it right.  If you break Billy's "
"heart I can use a heart from another of whatever Billy is, but I can't use "
"regular hearts, and I don't know where to find more Billy types."
msgstr ""
"Por favor, ten cuidado al cortar ese corazón. Si lo estropeas no sé si hay "
"otro bueno cerca. Tal vez practica con algunos amigos y vecinos primero, "
"realmente tienes que estar seguro y hacerlo bien. Si rompes el corazón de "
"Billy puedo usar un corazón de otro Billy cualquiera pero no puedo usar "
"corazones normales, y no sé dónde encontrar más tipos Billy."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Heart for Sadie"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
msgid "Do you have my heart?"
msgstr "¿Tienes mi corazón?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Heart for Sadie"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
msgid ""
"Ooh, Billy had a really good heart.  Can you turn away please?  I just need "
"to do some quick open chest surgery here.  Just a quick cut here *ooh* and I"
" need to break this and this *SNAP* *oh!* and just sew some little things "
"together here quickly.  Not as much blood as you'd think.  I should probably"
" look into that later, there should be more blood in there.  Ah, good "
"enough, I can do a better job closing up later.  Kind of tingly, feeling "
"everything moving again in there.  See, heart surgery isn't hard if you have"
" the right attitude.  Well now, you need a good reward for everything you've"
" done for me.  Here, let me inject you with this."
msgstr ""
"Ooh, Billy tenía un buen corazón. ¿Puedes darte la vuelta, por favor? Sólo "
"necesito hacer una rápida cirugía de pecho abierto aquí. Sólo un corte "
"rápido aquí *ooh* y necesito romper esto y esto *SNAP* *oh!* y sólo coser "
"algunas cositas aquí rápidamente. No hay tanta sangre como crees. "
"Probablemente debería mirar eso más tarde, debería haber más sangre ahí. Ah,"
" lo suficientemente bueno, puedo hacer un mejor trabajo de cierre más tarde."
" Siento un poco de hormigueo al sentir que todo se mueve de nuevo ahí "
"dentro. Ves, la cirugía de corazón no es difícil si tienes la actitud "
"correcta. Bueno, ahora necesitas una buena recompensa por todo lo que has "
"hecho por mí. Aquí, déjame inyectarte con esto."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Heart for Sadie"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
msgid ""
"I don't know why, but I feel better.  Also worse.  Maybe I'm good without "
"it."
msgstr ""
"No sé por qué, pero me siento mejor. También peor. Tal vez estoy bien sin "
"ello."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Heart for Sadie"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/sadie.json
msgid ""
"Oh no, my heart.  Thank you for trying though, your failure gives me "
"pleasure.  What else are you bad at?"
msgstr ""
"Oh no, mi corazón. Sin embargo, gracias por intentarlo, tu fracaso me da "
"placer. ¿En qué más eres malo?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/threshold_recruit_dialogue.json
#, no-c-format
msgid "[MASTODON 75%] Come, join the herd before you're left behind."
msgstr "[MASTODONTE 75%] Ven, únete a la manada antes de que te quedes atrás."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/threshold_recruit_dialogue.json
#, no-c-format
msgid "[MI-GO 50%] Let's see just how much we can improve ourselves."
msgstr "[MI-GO 50%] Vamos a ver cuánto podemos mejorar."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid "Outsider."
msgstr "Forastero."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid "Hospitality rites are civilization."
msgstr "Los ritos de hospitalidad son la civilización."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid "Guest."
msgstr "Invitado."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid "How's the madness outside?"
msgstr "¿Cómo esta la locura de afuera?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid "We don't get outsiders around here all that much."
msgstr "No recibimos muchos forasteros por aquí."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid "How do I join the family?"
msgstr "¿Cómo me uno a la familia?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid "I'm a member of the Whately Family.  Who are you?"
msgstr "Soy un miembro de la familia Whately. ¿Quién eres?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid "I am lost and really need something to eat."
msgstr "Estoy perdido y realmente necesito algo de comer."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid "I've done some tasks for your relatives."
msgstr "He hecho algunas tareas para tus parientes."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Welcome to Whately lands.  Behave yourself or we'll harvest you for parts."
msgstr ""
"Bienvenido a las tierras de Whately. Compórtate o te cosecharemos por "
"partes."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid "Family bonds above all, huh?"
msgstr "Lazos familiares por encima de todo, ¿eh?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid "We aren't in the habit of breaking bread with outsiders."
msgstr "No tenemos la costumbre de partir el pan con los forasteros."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid "How do I join your family?"
msgstr "¿Cómo me uno a tu familia?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid "Then let's see what you've got to trade."
msgstr "Entonces veamos qué tienes para comerciar."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid "Only blood allowed, and the family Elders can make you of the blood."
msgstr ""
"Sólo se permite la sangre, y los Ancianos de la familia pueden hacerte de la"
" sangre."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid "Well that sounds creepy."
msgstr " Bueno, eso suena espeluznante."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"I was born part of the family.  We've never been accepted here but our "
"wealth and talents have kept us alive through the centuries."
msgstr ""
"Nací como parte de la familia. Nunca hemos sido aceptados aquí, pero nuestra"
" riqueza y nuestros talentos nos han mantenido vivos a lo largo de los "
"siglos."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Family keeps me busy and our experiments and projects take up the rest of my"
" time."
msgstr ""
"La familia me mantiene ocupado y nuestros experimentos y proyectos ocupan el"
" resto de mi tiempo."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGBR_Sadie.json
msgid ""
"This feels like a good place to relax.  Want to play doctor with real "
"scalpels?"
msgstr ""
"Este parece un buen lugar para relajarse. ¿Quieres que juguemos al médico "
"con bisturís reales?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGBR_Sadie.json
msgid "This might not be a very private place."
msgstr "Este puede que no sea un lugar muy privado."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGBR_Sadie.json
msgid "This place is so boring.  We should take people and kill some drugs."
msgstr ""
"Este lugar es tan aburrido. Deberíamos tomar personas y matar algunas "
"drogas."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGBR_Sadie.json
msgid ""
"Water water everywhere.  Let's go skinny dipping.  I bet you'll attract some"
" leeches.  I need them for something I want to do to you.  It'll be so "
"weird."
msgstr ""
"Agua, agua por todas partes. Vamos a bañarnos desnudos. Apuesto a que "
"atraerás algunas sanguijuelas. Las necesito para algo que quiero hacerte. "
"Será muy raro."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGBR_Sadie.json
msgid ""
"I like it down here.  This reminds me of that time I was down in a place "
"like this and someone creeped up behind me and hit me in the back of the "
"head with a shovel.  *shiver*  It still gives me goosebumps."
msgstr ""
"Me gusta estar aquí abajo. Esto me recuerda aquella vez que estaba abajo en "
"un lugar como este y alguien se acercó sigilosamente por detrás de mí y me "
"golpeó en la nuca con una pala. *Escalofrío* Todavía me pone la piel de "
"gallina."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGBR_Sadie.json
msgid ""
"I love nature.  It smells so good out here, like living things growing and "
"multiplying and dying and returning from the dead with horrifying new powers"
" and trying to slowly rip us apart and eat us.  It brings back really happy "
"memories for me."
msgstr ""
"Me encanta la naturaleza. Huele tan bien aquí fuera, como las cosas vivas "
"que crecen y se multiplican y mueren y vuelven de entre los muertos con "
"nuevos y horribles poderes y tratan de destrozarnos lentamente y comernos. "
"Me trae muy buenos recuerdos."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGBR_Sadie.json
msgid ""
"I love swampy places like this.  The smell of the pussywillows, the sound of"
" the crickets, the giant mutant mosquitoes hungry for our blood.  It's like "
"we're in a sexy vampire romance novel."
msgstr ""
"Me encantan los lugares pantanosos como éste. El olor de los pussywillows, "
"el sonido de los grillos, los gigantescos mosquitos mutantes hambrientos de "
"nuestra sangre. Es como si estuviéramos en una sexy novela romántica de "
"vampiros."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGBR_Sadie.json
msgid ""
"What a beautiful facility.  I bet they have all kinds of lovely toys to play"
" with.  We should kill everyone here and do some creative self-"
"experimentation."
msgstr ""
"Qué instalaciones tan bonitas. Apuesto a que tienen todo tipo de juguetes "
"encantadores para jugar. Deberíamos matar a todo el mundo aquí y hacer un "
"poco de auto-experimentación creativa."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGBR_Sadie.json
msgid ""
"Ooh, it's like a murder mystery here.  Are we the murderers, the murdered, "
"or the mystery?"
msgstr ""
"Ooh, esto es como un asesinato misterioso. ¿Somos los asesinos, los "
"asesinados o el misterio?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_afterlife.json
msgid ""
"What level of hell is this?  I spent weeks in a sulfurous hell being "
"tortured."
msgstr ""
"¿Qué nivel de infierno es este? Pasé semanas en un infierno sulfuroso siendo"
" torturado."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_afterlife.json
msgid "What was that like?"
msgstr "¿Cómo fue eso?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_afterlife.json
msgid ""
"Then they started cutting me open and taking out my organs but adding new "
"ones."
msgstr ""
"Entonces empezaron a abrirme y a sacarme los órganos, pero añadiendo otros "
"nuevos."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_afterlife.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_bonesinger.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_experiment.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/radiation_1.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/radiation_2.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/selftest.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_3.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_4.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_5.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/vatgrown_1.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/whately.json
msgid "How did it end?"
msgstr "¿Cómo terminó?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_afterlife.json
msgid ""
"Now that I finally am able to move and have some freedom, I plan on finding "
"some of these demons and punching through them until I find the devil "
"himself."
msgstr ""
"Ahora que por fin puedo moverme y tener algo de libertad, planeo encontrar "
"algunos de estos demonios y perforarlos hasta encontrar al propio diablo."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_bonesinger.json
msgid ""
"I heard the song before the aliens captured me.  I did what I could to help "
"the other Bonesingers."
msgstr ""
"Escuché la canción antes de que los alienígenas me capturaran. Hice lo que "
"pude para ayudar a los otros Cantores del Hueso."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_bonesinger.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_migo_1.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_migo_2.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_migo_3.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_experiment.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/radiation_1.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/radiation_2.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/selftest.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_1.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_2.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_3.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_4.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_5.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/vatgrown_1.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/whately.json
msgid "Where are you from?"
msgstr "¿De dónde eres?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_bonesinger.json
msgid ""
"One day I was being chased by some aliens and suddenly I was ambushed by "
"another one that shot me with some kind of pain ray."
msgstr ""
"Un día me perseguían unos alienígenas y de repente me emboscó otro que me "
"disparó con una especie de rayo de dolor."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_bonesinger.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_experiment.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/radiation_1.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/radiation_2.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/selftest.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_3.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_4.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/uplifted_animal_5.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/vatgrown_1.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/whately.json
msgid "Tell me more?"
msgstr "Cuentame más"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_bonesinger.json
msgid ""
"Eventually they took the bones from my body.  It's strange though, I still "
"hear the song calling to me, even in this new body."
msgstr ""
"Al final me quitaron los huesos del cuerpo. Sin embargo, es extraño, todavía"
" escucho la canción que me llama, incluso en este nuevo cuerpo."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_dreamer.json
msgid ""
"I just spent what felt like weeks in a dream that I was acting as a "
"targeting computer for some kind of alien turret."
msgstr ""
"Acabo de pasar lo que parecieron semanas en un sueño en el que actuaba como "
"un ordenador de puntería para una especie de torreta alienígena."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_dreamer.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_schizo_2.json
msgid "Where are you from then?"
msgstr "¿De dónde eres entonces?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_dreamer.json
msgid ""
"Now I'm in some kind of Mary Shelley nightmare?  I mean at least I have "
"mobility."
msgstr ""
"¿Ahora estoy en una especie de pesadilla de Mary Shelley? Quiero decir que "
"al menos tengo movilidad."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_dreamer.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_schizo_2.json
msgid "What does that have to do with anything?"
msgstr "¿Qué tiene eso que ver con nada?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_dreamer.json
msgid ""
"I'm going to keep going with this dream, hopefully soon I'll get to one "
"where I can fly."
msgstr ""
"Voy a seguir con este sueño, espero que pronto llegue a uno en el que pueda "
"volar."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_migo_1.json
msgid ""
"Antes do Cataclisma eu era o cientista que encabeçava um laboratório militar"
" no meu país.  Foram dias difíceis…"
msgstr ""
"Antes do Cataclisma eu era o cientista que encabeçava um laboratório militar"
" no meu país. Foram dias difíceis…"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_migo_1.json
msgid ""
"Nós estávamos pesquisando um remédio que curasse um virus altamente letal na"
" época, mas os resultados dos testes mostravam que o remédio era mais letal "
"do que o próprio virus.  Então, ao invés de recolherem os remédios das "
"prateleiras, eles nos forçaram a vendê-lo como sendo a cura para o vírus."
msgstr ""
"Nós estávamos pesquisando um remédio que curasse um virus altamente letal na"
" época, mas os resultados dos testes mostravam que o remédio era mais letal "
"do que o próprio virus. Então, ao invés de recolherem os remédios das "
"prateleiras, eles nos forçaram a vendê-lo como sendo a cura para o vírus."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_migo_1.json
msgid "Ummm?"
msgstr "¿eh?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_migo_1.json
msgid ""
"Bem… aqueles sem cérebro seguiram cegamente o líder.  Quanto àqueles com "
"algum cérebro… bom, acho que você está conversando com um deles agora"
msgstr ""
"Bem… aqueles sem cérebro seguiram cegamente o líder. Quanto àqueles com "
"algum cérebro… bom, acho que você está conversando com um deles agora"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_migo_2.json
msgid ""
"Things have been getting weird for the last couple of years.  Then we "
"started hearing rumors of strange lights in the sky at night."
msgstr ""
"Las cosas se han vuelto extrañas desde hace un par de años. Entonces "
"empezamos a oír rumores de luces extrañas en el cielo por la noche."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_migo_2.json
msgid ""
"One night I heard my neighbor calling for me to come help him.  I went "
"outside wondering what he could possibly need my help with in the middle of "
"the night."
msgstr ""
"Una noche oí que mi vecino me llamaba para que fuera a ayudarle. Salí a la "
"calle preguntándome para qué podría necesitar mi ayuda en mitad de la noche."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_migo_2.json
msgid ""
"Some kind of hideos alien was standing over my neighbors disemboweled "
"corpse.  It looked at me and said 'You're a great neighbor' then everything "
"faded to black.  I feel like everything in my body fits differently now."
msgstr ""
"Una especie de alienígena horrible estaba de pie sobre el cadáver destripado"
" de mi vecino. Me miró y dijo: \"Eres un gran vecino\" y luego todo se "
"desvaneció en negro. Siento que todo en mi cuerpo encaja de manera diferente"
" ahora."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_migo_3.json
msgid ""
"I worked in a top secret lab.  Things kept getting crazier and crazier "
"outside and the scientists inside started making desperate experiments.  "
"They worked on something called interdimensional portals."
msgstr ""
"Trabajé en un laboratorio de alto secreto. Las cosas se volvían cada vez más"
" locas fuera y los científicos de dentro empezaron a hacer experimentos "
"desesperados. Trabajaban en algo llamado portales interdimensionales."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_migo_3.json
msgid ""
"The eggheads kept sayig we needed to find a way out of here before "
"everything went sideways.  So we needed to open more portals even if we "
"hadn't had time to take all the precautions."
msgstr ""
"Los cerebritos decían que teníamos que encontrar una forma de salir de aquí "
"antes de que todo se torciera. Así que necesitábamos abrir más portales "
"aunque no hubiéramos tenido tiempo de tomar todas las precauciones."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_migo_3.json
msgid ""
"One day they opened a portal trying to find an earthlike planet and suddenly"
" portals were opening all over the lab and these fast and dangerous aliens "
"overwhelmed the lab.  They killed most of the staff and took the rest "
"prisoner."
msgstr ""
"Un día abrieron un portal tratando de encontrar un planeta parecido a la "
"Tierra y, de repente, los portales se abrieron por todo el laboratorio y "
"estos rápidos y peligrosos extraterrestres lo desbordaron. Mataron a la "
"mayoría del personal y tomaron al resto como prisioneros."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_schizo_1.json
msgid ""
"Monsters!  Monsters everywhere.  Everyone is suspect, how do I know you "
"aren't a monster?"
msgstr ""
"¡Monstruos! Monstruos por todas partes. Todos son sospechosos, ¿cómo sé que "
"no eres un monstruo?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_schizo_1.json
msgid "Are you ok?"
msgstr "¿Estás bien?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_schizo_1.json
msgid ""
"You can't trust anyone these days.  Everyone is either a cannibal or a "
"monster or a government spook."
msgstr ""
"Hoy en día no se puede confiar en nadie. Todo el mundo es un caníbal o un "
"monstruo o un espía del gobierno."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_schizo_1.json
msgid "Why would you trust me then?"
msgstr "¿Por qué confiarías en mí entonces?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_schizo_1.json
msgid "Because, what if I'm the monster?"
msgstr "Porque, ¿y si yo soy el monstruo?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_schizo_2.json
msgid "If you think this Universe is bad, you should see some of the others."
msgstr ""
"Si crees que este Universo es malo, deberías ver algunos de los otros."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_schizo_2.json
msgid ""
"Believing something existed and then finding out it didn't was like reaching"
" the top of the stairs and thinking there was one more step."
msgstr ""
"Creer que algo existía y luego descubrir que no era así era como llegar al "
"final de la escalera y pensar que había un escalón más."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_schizo_2.json
msgid ""
"I think a lot of psychopaths are just geniuses who drove so fast that they "
"lost control."
msgstr ""
"Creo que muchos psicópatas son simplemente genios que condujeron tan rápido "
"que perdieron el control."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Survivor Story"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Survivor"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Whately Story"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Cyberninja Story"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Sadie Story"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BG_traits_afs.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyborg_npcs/backgrounds/bg_traits_cyborg.json
msgid "This NPC could tell you about how they survived the Cataclysm"
msgstr "Este PNJ podría contarte cómo logró sobrevivir al Cataclismo..."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BG_traits_afs.json
msgid "Whately Story"
msgstr "Historia Whately"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BG_traits_afs.json
msgid "Cyberninja Story"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BG_traits_afs.json
msgid "Sadie Story"
msgstr "Historia Sadie"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_experiment.json
msgid ""
"I underwent experimental treatments paid for by the cartels to become a more"
" fearsome enforcer."
msgstr ""
"Me sometí a tratamientos experimentales pagados por los cárteles para "
"convertirme en un ejecutor más temible."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_experiment.json
msgid ""
"Half of the guys I underwent gene therapy with died, but hey if I had to "
"guess 90 percent of everyone is dead now?"
msgstr ""
"La mitad de los chicos con los que me sometí a la terapia genética murieron,"
" pero eh, si tuviera que adivinar el 90% de todos están muertos ahora..."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_experiment.json
msgid "Only the insane will prosper."
msgstr "Sólo los locos prosperarán."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/cyberninja.json
msgid ""
"As a corporate wetworks specialist I'm used to crazy situations.  But this "
"is like nothing I've ever experienced."
msgstr ""
"Como especialista en redes corporativas estoy acostumbrado a situaciones "
"locas. Pero esto no se parece a nada de lo que he vivido."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/cyberninja.json
msgid "What are you going to do now?"
msgstr "¿Qué vas a hacer ahora?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/cyberninja.json
msgid ""
"I'm gonna find somewhere that people are making a stand.  And if I can agree"
" with their plans I'll make my stand with them."
msgstr ""
"Voy a encontrar un lugar en el que la gente esté haciendo una oposición. Y "
"si puedo estar de acuerdo con sus planes, me posicionaré con ellos."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/cyberninja.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/ganger_1.json
msgid "Where is that?"
msgstr "¿Dónde está eso?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/cyberninja.json
msgid ""
"Right now you are looking like the best leader I've met so far in this "
"Cataclysm."
msgstr ""
"En este momento me pareces el mejor líder que he conocido hasta ahora en "
"este Cataclismo."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/ganger_1.json
msgid "I was born at the bottom of the habitat.  No silver spoon in my mouth."
msgstr ""
"Nací en el fondo del hábitat. No tengo una cuchara de plata en la boca."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/ganger_1.json
msgid "That must have been rough."
msgstr "Debe haber sido duro."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/ganger_1.json
msgid "I saw my best friend die in front of me by the time I was eight."
msgstr "Vi morir a mi mejor amigo delante de mí a los ocho años."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/ganger_1.json
msgid "I guess it prepared me for everyone dying yesterday."
msgstr "Supongo que me preparó para que todos murieran ayer."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/ganger_2.json
msgid ""
"I've spent my life in the hive.  When things started turning strange I snuck"
" out of the city."
msgstr ""
"He pasado mi vida en la colmena. Cuando las cosas empezaron a volverse "
"extrañas me escapé de la ciudad."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/ganger_2.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/ganger_3.json
msgid "You seem like you are out of your element."
msgstr "Parece que estás fuera de tu elemento."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/ganger_2.json
msgid ""
"I've never seen so many trees outside of a video.  And there is so much "
"wildlife."
msgstr ""
"Nunca he visto tantos árboles fuera de un vídeo. Y hay tanta vida silvestre."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/ganger_2.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/ganger_3.json
msgid "What will you do?"
msgstr "¿Qué harás?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/ganger_2.json
msgid "I'm going to live my best life in a dead world."
msgstr "Voy a vivir mi mejor vida en un mundo muerto."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/ganger_3.json
msgid "There's so much sky out here.  It's horrible."
msgstr "Hay tanto cielo aquí fuera. Es horrible."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/ganger_3.json
msgid "It might be worse than the dead rising."
msgstr "Podría ser peor que la resurrección de los muertos."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/ganger_3.json
msgid ""
"I'm going to kill my way back into the city so I can get out from under this"
" sky."
msgstr ""
"Voy a matar mi camino de vuelta a la ciudad para poder salir de este cielo."

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/npc_classes_mutant.json
#: data/mods/No_Hope/NPC/npc_classes_mutant.json
msgid "Lizard Mutant"
msgstr "Mutante Lagarto"

#. ~ Job description of "Lizard Mutant" NPC class
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/npc_classes_mutant.json
#: data/mods/No_Hope/NPC/npc_classes_mutant.json
msgid ""
"I'm looking for lizard mutagen… this world is no place for humans anymore, "
"and I don't plan to keep being one."
msgstr ""
"Estoy buscando un mutágeno de lagarto... este mundo ya no es lugar para los "
"humanos, y no pienso seguir siéndolo."

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/npc_classes_mutant.json
#: data/mods/No_Hope/NPC/npc_classes_mutant.json
msgid "Rabbit Mutant"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Job description of "Rabbit Mutant" NPC class
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/npc_classes_mutant.json
#: data/mods/No_Hope/NPC/npc_classes_mutant.json
msgid ""
"I'm looking for rabbit mutagen… this world is no place for humans anymore, "
"and I don't plan to keep being one."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/npc_classes_mutant.json
#: data/mods/No_Hope/NPC/npc_classes_mutant.json
msgid "Shell Cultist"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Job description of "Shell Cultist" NPC class
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/npc_classes_mutant.json
#: data/mods/No_Hope/NPC/npc_classes_mutant.json
msgid ""
"A religious cult of post human snail people that live in a volcanic cave "
"under the ice."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/npc_classes_mutant.json
#: data/mods/No_Hope/NPC/npc_classes_mutant.json
msgid "Frog Mutant"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Job description of "Frog Mutant" NPC class
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/npc_classes_mutant.json
#: data/mods/No_Hope/NPC/npc_classes_mutant.json
msgid ""
"I'm looking for frog mutagen… this world is no place for humans anymore, and"
" I don't plan to keep being one."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/npc_classes_mutant.json
#: data/mods/No_Hope/NPC/npc_classes_mutant.json
msgid "Medical Mutant"
