#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Cryosleep Survivor"
msgstr "Superviviente del Criosueño"

#. ~ Description of profession "Cryosleep Survivor" for male
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"A sudden power failure woke you from the cryosleep sarcophagus in which you "
"had entombed yourself lifetimes ago.  It seems the emergency reanimation "
"procedure has damaged your memory, and now, bearing almost no knowledge of "
"your past life, you must find a way to survive in a ruined and alien world."
msgstr ""
"Un repentino fallo de energía te despertó del sarcófago de criosueño en el "
"que te habías enterrado hace tiempo. Parece que el procedimiento de "
"reanimación de emergencia ha dañado tu memoria, y ahora, sin tener casi "
"ningún conocimiento de tu vida pasada, debes encontrar una manera de "
"sobrevivir en un mundo arruinado y alienígena."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
