"confiar en tus dos guardaespaldas robóticos para sobrevivir."

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Corporate Infiltrator"
msgstr "Espía Corporativo"

#. ~ Description of profession "Corporate Infiltrator" for male
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Before all this, you were an 'independent contractor', a spy and mercenary "
"at the service of megacorporations.  Using highly experimental holographic "
"technology, you once took on impossible jobs one after the other."
msgstr ""
"Antes de todo esto, eras un \"contratista independiente\", un espía y "
"mercenario al servicio de las megacorporaciones. Usando tecnología "
"holográfica altamente experimental, en el pasado tomastes trabajos "
"imposibles."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Corporate Infiltrator"
msgstr "Espía Corporativo"

#. ~ Description of profession "Corporate Infiltrator" for female
