msgstr "refrigerador de agua"

#. ~ Description of furniture "water cooler"
#: data/mods/Backrooms/furniture_terrain.json
msgid ""
"A plastic jug of water mounted on a dispenser.  Normally dispenses hot water"
" in addition to cold, but not with the power out.  You could probably "
"salvage the unwieldy jug on top with little effort, but any water still in "
"it would spill."
msgstr ""

