"Adds a plethora of content: professions, guns/mods/weapons, WIP mobs, "
"mutations, MA styles, and some QOL innawoods changes.  Use the readme to see"
" more details!"
msgstr ""
"Añade una plétora de contenidos: profesiones, armas/mods, WIP mobs, "
"mutaciones, estilos MA, y algunos cambios de QOL innawoods. ¡Utiliza el "
"léeme para ver más detalles!"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/constructions/crt_terrain.json
msgid "stick wall"
msgstr "muro de palos"

#. ~ Description of terrain "stick wall"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/constructions/crt_terrain.json
msgid ""
"A cheap mish mash of planks and sticks with a log pillar that keeps it "
"together.  It is capable of supporting an upper level or roof.  Dirt and "
"stones make the wall secure.  Somewhat flammable."
msgstr ""
"Una mezcla barata de tablones y palos con un pilar de madera que lo mantiene"
" unido. Es capaz de soportar un nivel superior o un techo. La suciedad y las"
" piedras hacen que el muro sea seguro. Algo inflamable."

#. ~ Bashing failed sound of terrain "stick wall"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/constructions/crt_terrain.json
msgid "krick!"
msgstr "¡Krick!"

#. ~ Legacy artifact data is set for all stats +2
#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/crt_gear/advanced_gear.json
msgid "C.R.I.T S-I G.E.A.R"
msgid_plural "C.R.I.T S-I G.E.A.Rs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Legacy artifact data is set for all stats +2
#. ~ Description of "C.R.I.T S-I G.E.A.R"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/crt_gear/advanced_gear.json
msgid ""
"C.R.I.T standard issue General Engineering Assistance Rig.  Plugged into "
"your spinal cord, this device improves your overall physique and provides "
"basic information on your surroundings."
msgstr ""
"C.R.I.T. Equipo de General Engineering Assistance Rig (G.E.A.R). Conectado a"
" su médula espinal, este dispositivo mejora su físico general y proporciona "
"información básica sobre su entorno."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/crt_gear/advanced_gear.json
msgid "C.R.I.T Engineering Suit"
msgid_plural "C.R.I.T Engineering Suits"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "C.R.I.T Engineering Suit"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/crt_gear/advanced_gear.json
msgid ""
"An airtight, flexible suit of woven composite fibers complete with segmented"
" plates of armor.  A complex system digitizes items in an individual pocket "
"universe for storage while built in joint-torsion ratchets generate the "
"necessary energy required to power the interface."
msgstr ""
"Un traje hermético y flexible de fibras compuestas tejidas con placas "
"segmentadas de armadura. Un complejo sistema digitaliza los artículos en un "
"universo de bolsillo individual para su almacenamiento, mientras que los "
"trinquetes de torsión conjunta incorporados generan la energía necesaria "
"para alimentar la interfaz."

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of an ammunition type
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_ammo.json
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_ammotypes.json
msgid "lead pellets"
msgid_plural "lead pellets"
msgstr[0] "perdigones de plomo"
msgstr[1] "perdigones de plomo"
msgstr[2] "perdigones de plomo"

#. ~ Description of "lead pellets"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_ammo.json
msgid ""
"A round tin of small light grain .177 lead pellets.  These are common, "
"tipped field pellets that can deal some light damage but are generally used "
"for plinking."
msgstr ""
"Perdigones redondos de plomo de .177 granos. Son comunes, con punta de campo"
" que pueden ocasionar un daño pequeño pero generalmente son utilizados para "
"practicar en blancos por diversión."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_ammo.json
msgid "domed HP pellets"
msgid_plural "domed HP pellets"
msgstr[0] "perdigones abovedados HP"
msgstr[1] "perdigones abovedados HP"
msgstr[2] "perdigones abovedados HP"

#. ~ Description of "domed HP pellets"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_ammo.json
msgid ""
"A stable, heavier grain lead pellet with the purpose of expanding upon "
"hitting a target for maximized damage, the dome shape allows it to pack "
"quite a punch for something so small"
msgstr ""
"Una bolita de plomo estable, de grano más pesado, con el propósito de "
"expandirse al golpear un objetivo para maximizar el daño, la forma de la "
"cúpula le permite dar un buen golpe para algo tan pequeño"

#. ~ Based off of the Gamo Redfire pellet, the plastic tip pushes back into
#. the lead pleet to cause a greater deformation and ballooning effect; makes
#. birds explode!
#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_ammo.json
msgid "tipped HP pellets"
msgid_plural "tipped HP pellets"
msgstr[0] "perdigones con punta HP"
msgstr[1] "perdigones con punta HP"
msgstr[2] "perdigones con punta HP"

#. ~ Based off of the Gamo Redfire pellet, the plastic tip pushes back into
#. the lead pleet to cause a greater deformation and ballooning effect; makes
#. birds explode!
#. ~ Description of "tipped HP pellets"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_ammo.json
msgid ""
"A medium grain lead pellet tipped with a pointed bit of hard plastic with "
"the purpose of maximum expansion upon hitting a target."
msgstr ""
"Perdigón de plomo de grano medio con un trozo puntiagudo de plástico duro "
"con el propósito de que se expanda al máximo al golpear un objetivo."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_ammo.json
msgid "alloy pellets"
msgid_plural "alloy pellets"
msgstr[0] "perdigones de aleación"
msgstr[1] "perdigones de aleación"
msgstr[2] "perdigones de aleación"

#. ~ Description of "alloy pellets"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_ammo.json
msgid ""
"A gimmicky alloy pellet with the purpose of reaching a higher velocity than "
"a normal lead pellet for breaking the sound barrier resulting in an "
"extremely loud crack, not so useful for stealth."
msgstr ""
"Una bolita de aleación truculenta con el propósito de alcanzar una mayor "
"velocidad que una bolita de plomo normal para romper la barrera del sonido "
"dando como resultado una ruido extremadamento alto, no muy útil para el "
"sigilo."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_ammo.json
msgid "pulse round"
msgid_plural "pulse rounds"
msgstr[0] "munición de pulso"
msgstr[1] "municiones de pulso"
msgstr[2] "municiones de pulso"

#. ~ Description of "pulse round"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_ammo.json
msgid ""
"A helical magazine of hollow-point alloy bullets propelled by pockets of "
"primer.  Not the most lethal thing out there, but it still packs a punch "
"without the worry of having a stray shot seriously damaging the environment."
msgstr ""
"Un cargador helicoidal de balas de aleación de punta hueca impulsado por "
"bolsillos de pistones. No es la cosa más letal que existe, pero aún así da "
"un golpe sin la preocupación de que un tiro perdido dañe seriamente el medio"
" ambiente."

#. ~ Name of an ammunition type
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_ammotypes.json
msgid "pulse ammo"
msgstr "munición de pulso"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_armor.json
msgid "C.R.I.T face mask"
msgid_plural "C.R.I.T face masks"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "C.R.I.T face mask"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_armor.json
msgid ""
"A standard issue face mask, lined with Kevlar for extra protection.  A few "
"filters provide decent environmental safety, but it was not intended for "
"extended use.  It has a basic integrated HUD."
msgstr ""
"Es una máscara facial estándar con interior de Kevlar para mayor protección."
" Tiene unos filtros que brindan una protección decente al ambiente, pero no "
"está pensada para un uso intensivo. Tiene integrado un HUD básico."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_armor.json
msgid "pair of C.R.I.T boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of C.R.I.T boots"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "pair of C.R.I.T boots"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_armor.json
msgid ""
"A pair of standard-issue boots.  Next-gen gels keep feet comfortable and "
"hygienic during long-term missions while absorbing shock and heat from "
"outside-sources.  Superalloy mesh and rubber offer quite a bit of chemical "
"protection as well.  Decently heavy though"
msgstr ""
"Un par de botas estándar. Los geles de última generación mantienen los pies "
"cómodos e higiénicos durante las misiones de larga duración, mientras "
"absorben los golpes y el calor de las fuentes externas. La malla y el caucho"
" de superaleación también ofrecen una buena protección química. Bastante "
"pesadas"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_armor.json
msgid "pair of C.R.I.T LA boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of C.R.I.T LA boots"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "pair of C.R.I.T LA boots"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_armor.json
msgid ""
"A pair of skeletonized boots.  Based off of C.R.I.T boots, the light-armor "
"variant was created for missions in warmer climates.  The LA boots keep most"
" of the old features of the standard issue boots but trade in protection for"
" easier movement."
msgstr ""
"Un par de botas esqueleticas. Basadas en las botas C.R.I.T., la variante de "
"la armadura ligera fue creada para misiones en climas más cálidos. Las botas"
" LA mantienen la mayoría de las características antiguas de las botas "
"estándar, pero intercambian la protección por una mayor facilidad de "
"movimiento."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_armor.json
msgid "pair of C.R.I.T fingertip-less gloves"
msgid_plural "pairs of C.R.I.T fingertip-less gloves"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "pair of C.R.I.T fingertip-less gloves"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_armor.json
msgid ""
"A pair of standard-issue gloves.  Made with superalloy mesh for those with "
"gene-modding and/or mutations while still allowing greater manipulation of "
"items and moderate protection."
msgstr ""
"Un par de guantes estándar. Hechos con malla de superaleación para los que "
"tienen modificaciones y/o mutaciones genéticas, permitiendo al mismo tiempo "
"una mayor manipulación de objectos y una protección moderada."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_armor.json
msgid "pair of C.R.I.T fingertip-less liners"
msgid_plural "pairs of C.R.I.T fingertip-less liners"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "pair of C.R.I.T fingertip-less liners"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_armor.json
msgid ""
"A pair of standard-issue glove liners.  Made with neoprene and rubber mesh "
"for warmth and fingertip-less for those with gene-modding and/or mutations "
"while still allowing greater manipulation of items and moderate protection."
msgstr ""
"Un par de forros de guantes estándar. Fabricados con neopreno y malla de "
"goma para dar calor y sin la punta de los dedos para aquellos con mutaciones"
" y/o modificaciones genéticas, permitiendo al mismo tiempo una mayor "
"manipulación de objetos y una protección moderada."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_armor.json
msgid "C.R.I.T backpack"
msgid_plural "C.R.I.T backpacks"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "C.R.I.T backpack"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_armor.json
msgid ""
"A standard-issue pack.  Based on the MOLLE backpack's design, this smaller "
"pack strikes a fine balance between storage space and encumbrance and allows"
" a larger weapon to be holstered, drawing and holstering is still rather "
"awkward even with the magnetized clips, but practice helps."
msgstr ""
"Un paquete estándar. Basada en el diseño de la mochila MOLLE, esta mochila "
"más pequeña consigue un equilibrio fino entre el espacio de almacenamiento y"
" la comodidad, y permite enfundar un arma más grande, dibujar y enfundar "
"sigue siendo bastante incómodo incluso con los clips magnetizados, pero la "
"práctica ayuda."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_armor.json
msgid "C.R.I.T chest rig"
msgid_plural "C.R.I.T chest rigs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "C.R.I.T chest rig"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_armor.json
msgid ""
"A slightly modified chest rig, has mesh and MOLLE loops for gear and slots "
"with light-armor padding."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_armor.json
msgid "pair of C.R.I.T leg guards"
msgid_plural "pairs of C.R.I.T leg guards"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "pair of C.R.I.T leg guards"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_armor.json
msgid ""
"Leg armor for those who fight.  Simple design and durable material allows "
"for easy movement and the padding keeps the legs safe and warm in colder "
"conditions."
msgstr ""
"Armadura de piernas para los que luchan. El diseño simple y el material "
"duradero permite un movimiento fácil y el acolchado mantiene las piernas "
"seguras y calientes en condiciones más frías."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_armor.json
msgid "pair of C.R.I.T arm guards"
msgid_plural "pairs of C.R.I.T arm guards"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "pair of C.R.I.T arm guards"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_armor.json
msgid ""
"A pair of arm guards made from superalloy molded upon neoprene, and then "
"insulated with rubber.  They are sturdy and will block attacks, but they are"
" ridiculously heavy."
msgstr ""
"Un par de guardabrazos hechos de superaleación moldeada sobre neopreno, y "
"luego aislados con goma. Son robustos y bloquean los ataques, pero son "
"ridículamente pesados."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_armor.json
msgid "C.R.I.T infantry duster"
msgid_plural "C.R.I.T infantry dusters"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "C.R.I.T infantry duster"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_armor.json
msgid ""
"A thick full-length duster coat with rubber insulation.  More than mildly "
"encumbering, but rather protective against any anti-infantry electrical "
"discharges from the robots.  Has several pockets for storage."
msgstr ""
"Una gruesa capa de polvo de longitud completa con aislamiento de goma. Más "
"que un ligero estorbo, es una protección contra cualquier descarga eléctrica"
" anti-infantería de los robots. Tiene varios bolsillos de almacenamiento."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_armor.json
msgid "C.R.I.T Armored Anomaly Suit"
msgid_plural "C.R.I.T Armored Anomaly Suits"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "C.R.I.T Armored Anomaly Suit"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_armor.json
msgid ""
"A relatively simple suit of armor.  A suit of woven composite fibers "
"combined with a cleansuit core and strategically placed segmented Kevlar "
"plates keep the suit light-weight and the one wearing it alive while "
"offering superb resistance to the elements and ambient radiation."
msgstr ""
"Un traje blindado relativamente simple. Un traje de fibras compuestas "
"tejidas combinadas con un núcleo de traje limpio y placas de Kevlar "
"segmentadas estratégicamente colocadas que mantienen el traje ligero y al "
"que lo lleva vivo, a la vez que ofrece una excelente resistencia la "
"intemperie y a la radiación ambiental."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_armor.json
msgid "C.R.I.T drop leg pouch"
msgid_plural "C.R.I.T drop leg pouches"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "C.R.I.T drop leg pouch"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_armor.json
msgid ""
"A set of pouches that can be worn on the thighs using buckled straps.  This "
"variety is more compact and is favored by the C.R.I.T for its ease of use."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de bolsas que se pueden llevar en los muslos usando correas "
"abrochadas. Esta variedad es más compacta y es favorecida por el C.R.I.T. "
"por su facilidad de uso."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_armor.json
msgid "C.R.I.T Enforcer armor assembly"
msgid_plural "C.R.I.T Enforcer armor assemblies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "C.R.I.T Enforcer armor assembly"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_armor.json
msgid ""
"A series of plates, guards and buckles which assemble into a suit of sturdy "
"body-armor which usually goes over other armor.  Overlapping steel plates on"
" top of Kevlar plates cover vast expanses as the armor juts off in places so"
" it can deflect attacks.  Built with the idea that comfort is less important"
" than safety, this heavy suit is difficult to move about in but highly "
"protective.  Various adjustable connectors such as straps and clips hold it "
"together."
msgstr ""
"Una serie de placas, protectores y hebillas que se ensamblan en un traje "
"robusto de armadura que normalmente va sobre otra armadura. Las placas de "
"acero superpuestas sobre las placas de Kevlar cubren grandes extensiones, ya"
" que la armadura sobresale en algunos lugares para poder desviar los "
"ataques. Construido con la idea de que la comodidad es menos importante que "
"la seguridad, este pesado traje es difícil de mover pero es altamente "
"protector. Varios conectores ajustables como correas y clips lo mantienen "
"unido."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_armor.json
msgid "pair of C.R.I.T Enforcer docks"
msgid_plural "pairs of C.R.I.T Enforcer docks"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "pair of C.R.I.T Enforcer docks"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_armor.json
msgid ""
"C.R.I.T Enforcer docks.  Metal plates vaguely molded into the shape of "
"oversized feet which clamp down onto your own footwear keep your feet out of"
" harms way.  It looks terrible and feels clunky unlike most of C.R.I.T's "
"designs, but they do seem to be worth using if you were to be in the middle "
"of a war zone."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_armor.json
msgid "C.R.I.T Soldier Suit"
msgid_plural "C.R.I.T Soldier Suits"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "C.R.I.T Soldier Suit"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_armor.json
msgid ""
"A suit of modern body-armor.  Strategically placed superalloy plates keep "
"the suit's weight minimal while Kevlar plates other areas and a lining of "
"soft neoprene pads areas for extra comfort.  Most importantly, this can be "
"worn comfortably under other armor."
msgstr ""
"Un traje de armadura moderna. Placas de superaleación estratégicamente "
"colocadas mantienen el peso del traje mínimo, mientras que el Kevlar cubre "
"otras áreas y un forro de áreas de almohadillas de neopreno suave para mayor"
" comodidad. Lo más importante es que se puede llevar cómodamente debajo de "
"otra armadura."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_armor.json
msgid "C.R.I.T Lone Wolf Series Armor"
msgid_plural "C.R.I.T Lone Wolf Series Armors"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "C.R.I.T Lone Wolf Series Armor"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_armor.json
msgid ""
"A matte black suit of outdated and bulky looking plate armor fitted onto a "
"soft Kevlar body-suit.  Retrofitted with new armor improvements, this heavy "
"armor will definitely protect you from practically anything.  Just make sure"
" you can actually walk with it on though."
msgstr ""
"Un traje negro mate de armadura de placas anticuadas y voluminosas ajustado "
"a un traje corporal de Kevlar suave. Retroadaptada con nuevas mejoras en la "
"armadura, esta pesada armadura definitivamente te protegerá de prácticamente"
" cualquier cosa. Sólo asegúrate de que puedes caminar con ella puesta."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_clothes.json
msgid "C.R.I.T blouse"
msgid_plural "C.R.I.T blouses"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "C.R.I.T blouse"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A standard-issue military jacket.  Durable, lightweight, and has ample "
"storage.  Super-flex neoprene keeps one warm in moderately cold weather "
"while a sleek design keeps it from being too flashy.  A zipper at the back "
"and front allows for quick donning and doffing."
msgstr ""
"Una chaqueta militar estándar. Duradera, ligera, y tiene un amplio "
"almacenamiento. El neopreno superflexible mantiene el calor en un clima "
"moderadamente frío, mientras que un diseño elegante evita que sea demasiado "
"llamativo. Una cremallera en la parte trasera y delantera permite ponerse y "
"quitarse la chaqueta rápidamente."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_clothes.json
msgid "C.R.I.T trousers"
msgid_plural "C.R.I.T trousers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "C.R.I.T trousers"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A  pair of standard-issue cargo pants.  Durable, lightweight and has ample "
"storage.  Super-flex neoprene keeps one warm in moderately cold weather."
msgstr ""
"Un par de pantalones de carga estándar. Duraderos, ligeros y con amplio "
"espacio de almacenamiento. El neopreno superflexible mantiene el calor en "
"climas moderadamente fríos."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_clothes.json
msgid "C.R.I.T pants"
msgid_plural "C.R.I.T pants"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "C.R.I.T pants"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A pair of dress pants.  A minimalist sleek design makes the pants "
"lightweight and it offers ok pockets.  Super-flex neoprene keeps one warm in"
" moderately cold weather."
msgstr ""
"Un par de pantalones de vestir. Un diseño minimalista y elegante hace que "
"los pantalones sean ligeros y ofrecen bolsillos adecuados. El neopreno "
"superflexible mantiene el calor en un clima moderadamente frío."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_clothes.json
msgid "C.R.I.T helmet liner"
msgid_plural "C.R.I.T helmet liners"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "C.R.I.T helmet liner"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_clothes.json
msgid "A standard-issue helmet liner.  Keeps the noggin warm."
msgstr "Un forro de casco estándar. Mantiene la cabeza caliente."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_clothes.json
msgid "pair of C.R.I.T shoes"
msgid_plural "pairs of C.R.I.T dress shoes"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "pair of C.R.I.T shoes"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_clothes.json
msgid "A sleek pair of dress shoes.  Fancy but easy on the eyes."
msgstr ""
"Un elegante par de zapatos de vestir. Elegante pero fácil para los ojos."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_clothes.json
msgid "pair of C.R.I.T rec gloves"
msgid_plural "pairs of C.R.I.T rec gloves"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "pair of C.R.I.T rec gloves"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A pair of standard-issue rec gloves.  Skin-hugging and sleek, these gloves "
"are made with cotton with a neoprene lining for grip-pads and warmth."
msgstr ""
"Un par de guantes de reconocimiento estándar del C.R.I.T. Con un diseño "
"elegante y que abraza la piel, estos guantes están hechos de algodón con un "
"forro de neopreno para para mejorar el agarre y abrigo. "

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_clothes.json
msgid "C.R.I.T web belt"
msgid_plural "C.R.I.T web belts"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "C.R.I.T web belt"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A standard-issue belt.  Keeps your trousers up and your tools on your hip."
msgstr ""
"Un cinturón estándar. Mantiene los pantalones puestos y tus herramientas en "
"la cadera."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_clothes.json
msgid "C.R.I.T rec duster"
msgid_plural "C.R.I.T rec dusters"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "C.R.I.T rec duster"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A waterproofed full-length duster coat.  Made with neoprene, comfort and "
"functionality meet together to form a fancy but sleek contemporary design.  "
"It has several pockets for storage."
msgstr ""
"Un abrigo impermeabilizado de larga duración. Hecho de neopreno, la "
"comodidad y la funcionalidad se unen para formar un diseño contemporáneo "
"elegante. Tiene varios bolsillos de almacenamiento."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_clothes.json
msgid "C.R.I.T rec hat"
msgid_plural "C.R.I.T rec hats"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "C.R.I.T rec hat"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_clothes.json
msgid ""
"Functionality meets fashion in this waterproofed C.R.I.T standard issue rec "
"cover.  Thick enough to provide warmth in colder weather, this hat shares "
"the same sleek design of most of C.R.I.T's gear."
msgstr ""
"La funcionalidad se une a la moda en este impermeable del C.R.I.T. "
"Suficientemente gruesa para proporcionar abrigo en tiempo frío, esta gorra "
"comparte el mismo diseño elegante de la mayoría de los equipos de C.R.I.T."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_generic.json
msgid "withered plant bundle"
msgid_plural "withered plant bundles"
msgstr[0] "fardo de plantas marchitas"
msgstr[1] "fardos de plantas marchitas"
msgstr[2] "fardos de plantas marchitas"

#. ~ Description of "withered plant bundle"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_generic.json
msgid "A bundle of plant matter"
msgstr "Es un manojo de materia vegetal."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_gun.json
msgid "C.R.I.T .5 LP"
msgid_plural "C.R.I.T .5 LPs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of gun "C.R.I.T .5 LP"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_gun.json
msgid ""
"Experimental low power sidearm under development in C.R.I.T R&D, the .5 LP "
"is a relatively weak but accurate laser pistol.  The double-barrel design "
"compensates for the lack of raw power and yet the gun manages to be "
"relatively easy to aim and lightweight due to the superalloy construction."
msgstr ""
"El arma experimental de baja potencia que se está desarrollando en I+D del "
"C.R.I.T., la .5 LP es una pistola láser relativamente débil pero precisa. El"
" diseño de doble cañón compensa la falta de potencia bruta y, sin embargo, "
"el arma consigue ser relativamente fácil de apuntar y ligera debido a la "
"construcción de superaleación."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_gun.json
msgid "C.R.I.T Chain Laser"
msgid_plural "C.R.I.T Chain Lasers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of gun "C.R.I.T Chain Laser"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_gun.json
msgid ""
"A tried and true favorite from the bowels of R&D hell.  Based off of a "
"researcher's video on three taped-together .5 LPs on a hand held power "
"drill, this gun is a relatively light weapon for the amount of UPS it eats "
"and destruction it can cause."
msgstr ""
"Un favorito de R&D del infierno de la investigación y el desarrollo. Basado "
"en el video de un investigador en tres 0.5 LPs en un taladro de mano, esta "
"arma es relativamente ligera por la cantidad de UPS que come y la "
"destrucción que puede causar."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_gun.json
msgid "C.R.I.T Laser Carbine"
msgid_plural "C.R.I.T Laser Carbines"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of gun "C.R.I.T Laser Carbine"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_gun.json
msgid ""
"A short-barrel lightweight laser gun developed by C.R.I.T R&D.  Mainly "
"developed to test out a new breakthrough in laser weapons."
msgstr ""
"Un cañón láser ligero de cañón corto desarrollado por C.R.I.T R&D. "
"Principalmente desarrollado para probar un nuevo avance en armas láser."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_gun.json
msgid "C.R.I.T Energy Rifle"
msgid_plural "C.R.I.T Energy Rifles"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of gun "C.R.I.T Energy Rifle"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_gun.json
msgid ""
"A heavy energy gun developed by C.R.I.T R&D.  Mainly developed to test out a"
" new breakthrough in hybrid weaponry."
msgstr ""
"Un arma de energía pesada desarrollada por C.R.I.T R&D. Principalmente "
"desarrollada para probar un nuevo avance en armamento híbrido."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_gun.json
msgid "C.R.I.T CQB Standard Issue"
msgid_plural "C.R.I.T CQB Standard Issues"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of gun "C.R.I.T CQB Standard Issue"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_gun.json
msgid ""
"A simple combination gun.  This military-grade semi-auto carbine couples the"
" mid-range versatility of the 9mm with the power of the 12 gauge shotgun.  "
"To further compliment the CQB aspect, the stock is built to amplify the "
"user's force and the rugged construction with tonfa-like grip can handle "
"bashing in enemy heads."
msgstr ""
"Un arma combinada sencilla. Esta carabina semiautomática de grado militar "
"combina la versatilidad de rango medio de la 9 mm con la potencia de la "
"escopeta de calibre 12. Para complementar aún más el aspecto CQB, la culata "
"está construida para amplificar la fuerza del usuario y la robusta "
"construcción con empuñadura tipo tonfa puede soportar los golpes en las "
"cabezas del enemigo."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_gun.json
msgid "C.R.I.T Fire Glove"
msgid_plural "C.R.I.T Fire Gloves"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "C.R.I.T Fire Glove"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_gun.json
msgid "Experimental CQB weapon system under development in C.R.I.T R&D."
msgstr "Sistema experimental de armas CQB en desarrollo en C.R.I.T R&D."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_gun.json
msgid "pellet gun"
msgid_plural "pellet guns"
msgstr[0] "pistola de perdigón"
msgstr[1] "pistolas de perdigones"
msgstr[2] "pistolas de perdigones"

#. ~ Description of gun "pellet gun"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_gun.json
msgid ""
"A surprisingly powerful airgun that can reliably hunt small game.  The small"
" lead or alloy pellets that can be chambered provide it decent power in "
"every shot.  It's fairly accurate and can be somewhat as damaging as a .22 "
"short, but the break action charging system requires some arm strength to "
"load a pellet."
msgstr ""
"Un arma de aire sorprendentemente poderosa que puede cazar de forma fiable "
"la caza menor. Los pequeños perdigones de plomo o de aleación que pueden ser"
" introducidos en la cámara le proporcionan una potencia decente en cada "
"disparo. Es bastante precisa y puede ser tan dañina como una .22 corta, pero"
" el sistema de carga de acción de ruptura requiere cierta fuerza en el brazo"
" para cargar un perdigón."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_gun.json
msgid "Plasma Cutter"
msgid_plural "Plasma Cutters"
msgstr[0] "Cortador de Plasma"
msgstr[1] "Cortadores de Plasma"
msgstr[2] "Cortadores de Plasma"

#. ~ Description of gun "Plasma Cutter"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_gun.json
msgid ""
"Experimental cutting tool under development in C.R.I.T R&D.  It fires an "
"extremely hot wave of plasma that slices into materials."
msgstr ""
"Herramienta de corte experimental en desarrollo en C.R.I.T R&D. Dispara una "
"ola de plasma extremadamente caliente que corta los materiales."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_gun.json
msgid "Rivet Driver"
msgid_plural "Rivet Drivers"
msgstr[0] "Conductor de Rivet"
msgstr[1] "Conductores de Rivet"
msgstr[2] "Conductores de Rivet"

#. ~ Description of gun "Rivet Driver"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_gun.json
msgid ""
"Experimental double purpose tool under development in C.R.I.T R&D.  It takes"
" a regular nail and then elongates it within a fraction of a second before "
"firing it out, upon reaching a target, the fragile stake explodes into "
"shards inside the target."
msgstr ""
"Herramienta experimental de doble propósito que está bajo desarrollo en "
"C.R.I.T R&D. Toma un clavo normal y lo alarga en una fracción de segundo "
"antes de dispararlo, al alcanzar un objetivo, la frágil estaca explota en "
"fragmentos dentro del objetivo."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_gun.json
msgid "Line Gun"
msgid_plural "Line Guns"
msgstr[0] "Arma de línea"
msgstr[1] "Armas de línea"
msgstr[2] "Armas de línea"

#. ~ Description of gun "Line Gun"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_gun.json
msgid ""
"Experimental high power cutting tool under development in C.R.I.T R&D.  It "
"fires plasma in a wide line for slicing into dense materials."
msgstr ""
"Herramienta de corte experimental de alta potencia en desarrollo en C.R.I.T "
"R&D. Dispara plasma en una amplia línea para cortar en materiales densos."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_gun.json
msgid "Pulse Rifle"
msgid_plural "Pulse Rifles"
msgstr[0] "Rifle de pulso"
msgstr[1] "Rifles de pulso"
msgstr[2] "Rifles de pulso"

#. ~ Description of gun "Pulse Rifle"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_gun.json
msgid ""
"Experimental tri-barrel sub-sonic rifle under development in C.R.I.T R&D.  "
"Great for enclosed spaces and mobs of enemies.  Shoots alloy rounds which "
"instantly mushroom out upon impact."
msgstr ""
"Rifle experimental subsónico de tres cañones en desarrollo en el C.R.I.T "
"R&D. Genial para espacios cerrados y multitudes de enemigos. Dispara balas "
"de aleación que instantáneamente se disparan al impactar."

#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_gun.json
msgid "Ripper"
msgid_plural "Rippers"
msgstr[0] "Destripador"
msgstr[1] "Destripadores"
msgstr[2] "Destripadores"

#. ~ Description of gun "Ripper"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_gun.json
msgid ""
"Experimental EM saw under development in C.R.I.T R&D.  Great for distance "
"cutting of material."
msgstr ""
"El EM experimental se está desarrollando en el I+D del C.R.I.T. Genial para "
"el corte a distancia de material."

#. ~ Firing mode of gun "Ripper"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_gun.json
msgid "em field saw"
msgstr "sierra de campo electromagnético"

#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_gunmods.json
msgid "Underslung flare launcher"
msgid_plural "Underslung flare launchers"
msgstr[0] "Lanzador de bengalas suspendida"
msgstr[1] "Lanzadores de bengalas suspendidas"
msgstr[2] "Lanzadores de bengalas suspendidas"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "Underslung flare launcher"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_gunmods.json
msgid ""
"A small barrel which launches signal flares.  However, due to its awkward "
"position, it has lower accuracy compared to an actual flaregun."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño barril que lanza bengalas de señal. Sin embargo, debido a su "
"posición incómoda, tiene una menor precisión en comparación con una pistola "
"de bengalas real."

#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_gunmods.json
msgid "CQB SI shotgun"
msgid_plural "CQB SI shotguns"
msgstr[0] "escopeta CQB SI"
msgstr[1] "escopetas CQB SI"
msgstr[2] "escopetas CQB SI"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "CQB SI shotgun"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_gunmods.json
msgid ""
"The integrated underbarrel shotgun of this gun which holds a single shot.  "
"It's irremovable."
msgstr ""
"La escopeta de cañón integrado de esta arma que tiene un solo disparo. Es "
"inamovible."

#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_gunmods.json
msgid "diffracting lens"
msgid_plural "diffracting lenses"
msgstr[0] "lente difractante"
msgstr[1] "lentes difractantes"
msgstr[2] "lentes difractantes"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "diffracting lens"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_gunmods.json
msgid ""
"A set of optics made to fit on laser weapons, which will diffract the laser "
"beam into several lower powered beams.  This slightly increases point-blank "
"damage and makes it difficult to not hit, but reduces range"
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de ópticas hechas para encajar en armas láser, que difractará el"
" rayo láser en varios rayos de menor potencia. Esto aumenta ligeramente el "
"daño a quemarropa y dificulta que no se golpee, pero reduce el alcance"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_gunmods.json
msgid "tactical flashlight"
msgid_plural "tactical flashlights"
msgstr[0] "linterna táctica"
msgstr[1] "linternas tácticas"
msgstr[2] "linternas tácticas"

#. ~ Description of "tactical flashlight"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_gunmods.json
msgid ""
"A compact flashlight which is mounted to the side of your weapon, not "
"powerful, but good enough for tight hallways."
msgstr ""
"Una linterna compacta que se monta a un lado de su arma, no es poderosa, "
"pero es lo suficientemente buena para pasillos estrechos."

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "tactical flashlight"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_gunmods.json
msgid "You turn the tactical flashlight on."
msgstr "Enciendes la linterna táctica."

#. ~ "need_charges_msg" action message of item "tactical flashlight"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_gunmods.json
msgid "The tactical flashlight's batteries are dead."
msgstr "La batería de la linterna táctica está descargada."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_gunmods.json
msgid "tactical flashlight (on)"
msgid_plural "tactical flashlights (on)"
msgstr[0] "linterna táctica (on)"
msgstr[1] "linternas tácticas (on)"
msgstr[2] "linternas tácticas (on)"

#. ~ Description of "tactical flashlight (on)"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_gunmods.json
msgid ""
"A compact flashlight which is attached to the side of your weapon, not "
"powerful, but good enough for tight hallways."
msgstr ""
"Una linterna compacta que se sujeta al costado de su arma, no es poderosa, "
"pero es lo suficientemente buena para pasillos estrechos."

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "tactical flashlight (on)"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_gunmods.json
msgid "You turn the tactical flashlight off."
msgstr "Apagas la linterna táctica."

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_item_enchants.json
msgid "Blade Rush"
msgstr "Flujo Cuchilla"

#. ~ Description of spell "Blade Rush"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_item_enchants.json
msgid "Heals some light damage to the character."
msgstr "Cura un poco de daño al personaje."

#. ~ Message of spell "Blade Rush"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_item_enchants.json
msgid "You feel a rush of vitality from your target into your body."
msgstr "Sientes un torrente de vitalidad desde tu objetivo hacia tu cuerpo."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_makeshift_survival.json
msgid "plant fiber tunic"
msgid_plural "plant fiber tunics"
msgstr[0] "túnica de fibra vegetal"
msgstr[1] "túnicas de fibra vegetal"
msgstr[2] "túnicas de fibra vegetal"

#. ~ Description of "plant fiber tunic"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_makeshift_survival.json
msgid ""
"A loose garment cobbled together from a collection of plant bundles and "
"wound together by makeshift cordage"
msgstr ""
"Una prenda suelta, confeccionada a partir de un conjunto de plantas "
"enrolladas con un cordaje improvisado."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_makeshift_survival.json
msgid "plant fiber bracelet"
msgid_plural "plant fiber bracelets"
msgstr[0] "pulsera de fibras vegetales"
msgstr[1] "pulseras de fibras vegetales"
msgstr[2] "pulseras de fibras vegetales"

#. ~ Description of "plant fiber bracelet"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_makeshift_survival.json
msgid ""
"A bracelet wound together by makeshift cordage.  Has some cool looking "
"pebbles."
msgstr ""
"Un brazalete unido por un cordaje improvisado. Tiene unas piedrecitas muy "
"bonitas."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_toolarmor.json
msgid "C.R.I.T gas mask (off)"
msgid_plural "C.R.I.T gas masks (off)"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "C.R.I.T gas mask (off)"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_toolarmor.json
msgid ""
"This is a heavily modified Spec Ops modified gas mask, fitted with top-of-"
"the-line electronics and lined with Kevlar for extra protection in order to "
"keep one's head where it should be.  Various filters and other high tech "
"wizardry allow for enhanced oxygen intake and safety even under bombardment."
"  It has an integrated HUD and the option to turn it on for more features."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una máscara de gas altamente modificada para Fuerzas de Operaciones "
"Especiales, equipada con la más alta tecnología y forrada con Kevlar con una"
" protección extra para mantener la cabeza donde debe estar. Varios filtros y"
" otras hechicerías de alta tecnología permiten una mayor entrada de oxígeno "
"y seguridad incluso bajo bombardeo. Tiene un HUD integrado y la opción de "
"encenderlo para obtener más características."

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "C.R.I.T gas mask (off)"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_toolarmor.json
msgid "C.R.I.T HUD booting up…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ "need_charges_msg" action message of item "C.R.I.T gas mask (off)"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_toolarmor.json
msgid "Power levels too low for safe boot up"
msgstr "Los niveles de potencia son demasiado bajos para un arranque seguro"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_toolarmor.json
msgid "C.R.I.T gas mask (on)"
msgid_plural "C.R.I.T gas masks (on)"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "C.R.I.T gas mask (on)"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_toolarmor.json
msgid ""
"This a heavily modified gas mask.  It is currently on and draining power for"
" the HUD, low-level night vision and other protective elements."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una máscara de gas altamente modificada. Actualmente está encendida "
"y drenando energía para el HUD, la visión nocturna de bajo nivel y otros "
"elementos de protección."

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "C.R.I.T gas mask (on)"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_toolarmor.json
msgid "C.R.I.T HUD deactivating."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Artifact data is charge_type solar
#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_toolarmor.json
msgid "C.R.I.T EM vest (off)"
msgid_plural "C.R.I.T EM vests (off)"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Artifact data is charge_type solar
#. ~ Description of "C.R.I.T EM vest (off)"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_toolarmor.json
msgid ""
"The Enhanced Movement vest is embedded with high-tech filaments and reactive"
" servos which protects its wearer and assists in movement at the cost high  "
"power usage.  It is commonly worn by C.R.I.T Spec Ops for its ease of use "
"and maneuverability.  Turn it on for suit mode, extra protection and "
"movement."
msgstr ""
"El chaleco de Movimiento Mejorado está integrado con filamentos de alta "
"tecnología y servos reactivos que protegen a su usuario y asisten al "
"movimiento a cambio de un alto costo de energía. Es comunmente usado por las"
" Fuerzas de Operaciones Especiales C.R.I.T. por su facilidad de uso y "
"maniobrabilidad. Enciéndelo para habilitar el modo traje, protección extra y"
" movimientos mejorados."

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "C.R.I.T EM vest (off)"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_toolarmor.json
msgid "C.R.I.T EM booting up…"
msgstr "C.R.I.T EM arrancando..."

#. ~ "need_charges_msg" action message of item "C.R.I.T EM vest (off)"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_toolarmor.json
msgid "Power levels too low for safe bootup…"
msgstr ""
"Los niveles de potencia son demasiado bajos para un arranque seguro..."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_toolarmor.json
msgid "C.R.I.T EM vest (on)"
msgid_plural "C.R.I.T EM vests (on)"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "C.R.I.T EM vest (on)"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/items/crt_toolarmor.json
msgid ""
"The Spec Ops Enhanced Movement vest is embedded with high-tech filaments, "
"reactive servos and a generator which pumps a crystallized liquid that "
"protects its wearer from most heavy combat situations at the cost of extreme"
" power usage.  It is commonly worn by C.R.I.T Spec Ops.  This vest is "
"currently in suit form and draining your UPS power at high rates."
msgstr ""
"El chaleco de Movimiento Mejorado de Fuerzas Especiales esta incrustado con "
"filamentos de alta tecnología, servos reactivos y un generador que bombea "
"una líquido cristalino que protege al usuario de las situaciones de combate "
"pesado a costa de un uso extremo de energía. Es comunmente usado por las "
"Fuerzas Especiales C.R.I.T.. Este chaleco está en forma de traje y drenando "
"la energia de su UPS a altas velocidades."

