#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/monsters/crt_monster.json
msgid "Slasher Bio-Recombinant"
msgid_plural "Slasher Bio-Recombinants"
msgstr[0] "Bio-Recombinante Degollador"
msgstr[1] "Bio-Recombinantes Degolladores"
msgstr[2] "Bio-Recombinantes Degolladores"

#. ~ Description of monster "Slasher Bio-Recombinant"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/monsters/crt_monster.json
msgid ""
"A horrifically twisted human body.  Two massive, bladed appendages have "
"burst through its shoulders where they are poised above its head as it "
"stalks about with terrifying purpose."
msgstr ""
"Un cuerpo humano horriblemente retorcido. Dos enormes apéndices con "
"cuchillas han irrumpido en sus hombros, donde se colocan por encima de su "
"cabeza mientras acecha con un propósito aterrador."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/monsters/crt_monster.json
msgid "Weak Slasher Bio-Recombinant"
msgid_plural "Weak Slasher Bio-Recombinants"
msgstr[0] "Bio-Recombinante Degollador Débil"
msgstr[1] "Bio-Recombinantes Degolladores Débiles"
msgstr[2] "Bio-Recombinantes Degolladores Débiles"

#. ~ Description of monster "Weak Slasher Bio-Recombinant"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/monsters/crt_monster.json
msgid ""
"A horrifically mutilated human body.  Two scrawny blades have freshly "
"bursted through its hand to deal with prey and the haunting visage of a "
"jawless maw and a gaping wound in its forehead sends chills down your spine."
"  The awkward steps it takes slows it down greatly."
msgstr ""
"Un cuerpo humano horriblemente mutilado. Dos hojas escuálidas han estallado "
"recientemente a través de su mano para hacer frente a la presa y el "
"inquietante rostro de una mandíbula sin mandíbula y una herida abierta en su"
" frente envía escalofríos por su columna vertebral. Los incómodos pasos que "
"da lo ralentizan enormemente."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/monsters/crt_monster.json
msgid "Waster Bio-Recombinant"
msgid_plural "Waster Bio-Recombinants"
msgstr[0] "Bio-Recombinante Vago"
msgstr[1] "Bio-Recombinantes Vagos"
msgstr[2] "Bio-Recombinantes Vagos"

#. ~ Description of monster "Waster Bio-Recombinant"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/monsters/crt_monster.json
msgid ""
"Clad in heavy assault gear, an eerie light green glows beneath its helmet "
"from sunken eye sockets and a gaping mouth.  Strange blade like points have "
"burst out of it's forearms making it a formidable force to be reckoned with."
msgstr ""
"Vestido con un pesado equipo de asalto, un espeluznante verde claro brilla "
"bajo su casco por las cuencas de los ojos hundidos y la boca abierta. "
"Extrañas puntas como cuchillas han estallado de sus brazos que lo convierten"
" en una fuerza formidable a tener en cuenta."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/monsters/crt_monster.json
msgid "Leaper Bio-Recombinant"
msgid_plural "Leaper Bio-Recombinants"
msgstr[0] "Bio-Recombinante Saltador"
msgstr[1] "Bio-Recombinantes Saltador"
msgstr[2] "Bio-Recombinantes Saltador"

#. ~ Description of monster "Leaper Bio-Recombinant"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/monsters/crt_monster.json
msgid ""
"This once-human body is barely recognizable, scrambling about on its abdomen"
" as it leaps forward with immense arm strength.  With elongated fangs that "
"can easily mutilate your flesh, the grotesque face roars incessantly.  The "
"lower body has fused together into one giant tail with a barbed spike."
msgstr ""
"Este cuerpo, antaño humano, es apenas reconocible, y se revuelve sobre su "
"abdomen mientras salta hacia delante con la inmensa fuerza de sus brazos. "
"Con unos colmillos alargados que pueden mutilar fácilmente tu carne, el "
"grotesco rostro ruge sin cesar. La parte inferior del cuerpo se ha fusionado"
" en una cola gigante con una espiga de púas."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/monsters/crt_monster.json
msgid "Twitcher Bio-Recombinant"
msgid_plural "Twitcher Bio-Recombinants"
msgstr[0] "Bio-Recombinante Agitador"
msgstr[1] "Bio-Recombinantes Agitador"
msgstr[2] "Bio-Recombinantes Agitador"

#. ~ Description of monster "Twitcher Bio-Recombinant"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/monsters/crt_monster.json
msgid ""
"With narrow blades coming out of its hands, this corpse spasmically dashes "
"to-and-fro with surprising speed.  It carries itself quite steadily when "
"idle, further observation shows that the person before this husk was a "
"C.R.I.T S-I G.E.A.R operator."
msgstr ""
"Con hojas estrechas saliendo de sus manos, este cadáver corre "
"espasmódicamente de un lado a otro con una velocidad sorprendente. Se mueve "
"con bastante regularidad cuando está parado, la observación adicional "
"muestra que la persona antes de esta cáscara era un operador de C.R.I.T S-I "
"G.E.A.R."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/monsters/crt_monster.json
msgid "Pack Bio-Recombinant"
msgid_plural "Pack Bio-Recombinants"
msgstr[0] "Bio-Recombinante Manada"
msgstr[1] "Bio-Recombinantes Manada"
msgstr[2] "Bio-Recombinantes Manada"

#. ~ Description of monster "Pack Bio-Recombinant"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/monsters/crt_monster.json
msgid ""
"A shrieking mutated child zombie.  The face is is mainly blank with eyes "
"swollen shut and a torn-open mouth with flaps of flesh hanging to the side."
"  A pair of seemingly purposeless appendages sprout from its shoulders "
"before ending in its arms.  Its small hands end in sharp claws."
msgstr ""
"Un niño zombi mutante chillón. La cara está principalmente en blanco, con "
"los ojos hinchados y la boca abierta con colgajos de carne colgando a un "
"lado. Un par de apéndices aparentemente sin propósito brotan de sus hombros "
"antes de terminar en sus brazos. Sus pequeñas manos terminan en garras "
"afiladas."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/monsters/crt_monster.json
msgid "Puker Bio-Recombinant"
msgid_plural "Puker Bio-Recombinants"
msgstr[0] "Bio-Recombinante Vomitador"
msgstr[1] "Bio-Recombinantes Vomitador"
msgstr[2] "Bio-Recombinantes Vomitador"

#. ~ Description of monster "Puker Bio-Recombinant"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/monsters/crt_monster.json
msgid ""
"A rather mutilated corpse covered in gaping sores.  Hanging arms with hands "
"that have long corroded away reveal jagged edges that could easily pierce "
"into your flesh.  A sticky, frothing yellow sludge flows from its exposed "
"internal organs to its unhinged jaw where it drips, hissing as it eats "
"through material."
msgstr ""
"Un cadáver bastante mutilado cubierto de llagas abiertas. Los brazos "
"colgantes con manos que se han corroído durante mucho tiempo revelan bordes "
"dentados que podrían perforar fácilmente la carne. Un pegajoso y espumoso "
"cieno amarillo fluye desde sus órganos internos expuestos hasta su mandíbula"
" desquiciada donde gotea, silbando mientras come a través del material."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/monsters/crt_monster.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
msgid "shimmering spider"
msgid_plural "shimmering spiders"
msgstr[0] "araña brillante"
msgstr[1] "arañas brillantes"
msgstr[2] "arañas brillantes"

#. ~ Description of monster "shimmering spider"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/monsters/crt_monster.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/monster.json
msgid ""
"A dog-sized spider, the air around it has a faint shimmer of light, possibly"
" reflected from tiny strands of webbing."
msgstr ""
"Una araña del tamaño de un perro, el aire que la rodea tiene un tenue brillo"
" de luz, posiblemente reflejado por pequeñas hebras de telaraña."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/monsters/monster.json
msgid "Animate Arm"
msgid_plural "Animate Arms"
msgstr[0] "Brazo Animado"
msgstr[1] "Brazos Animados"
msgstr[2] "Brazos Animados"

#. ~ Description of monster "Animate Arm"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/monsters/monster.json
msgid ""
"A dismembered arm that slowly crawls forward.  Occasionally, tentacles "
"sprout out from the wound and lash about wildly."
msgstr ""
"Un brazo desmembrado que se arrastra lentamente hacia adelante. "
"Ocasionalmente, los tentáculos brotan de la herida y golpean salvajemente."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/monsters/monster.json
msgid "Dullahan"
msgid_plural "Dullahans"
msgstr[0] "Dullahan"
msgstr[1] "Dullahans"
msgstr[2] "Dullahans"

#. ~ Description of monster "Dullahan"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/monsters/monster.json
msgid ""
"A headless humanoid that slowly sways.  Ornate and functional armor adorn "
"this dreadful corpse which carries itself with an unerringly terrible "
"steadiness.  A long tentacle has sprouted out of its right arm which "
"occasionally flails about wildly."
msgstr ""
"Un humanoide sin cabeza que se balancea lentamente. Una armadura ornamentada"
" y funcional adornan este espantoso cadáver que se sostiene con una "
"estabilidad infaliblemente terrible. Un largo tentáculo ha brotado de su "
"brazo derecho que ocasionalmente se agita salvajemente."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/crt_mutatinoc.json
msgid "Shadow Meld"
msgstr "Unión de las Sombras"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Shadow Meld"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/crt_mutatinoc.json
msgid ""
"The light around you bends strangely, making it harder for enemies to notice"
" you."
msgstr ""
"La luz que te rodea se curva de forma extraña, haciendo más difícil que los "
"enemigos se fijen en ti."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/crt_mutatinoc.json
msgid "Moon-lit Grace"
msgstr "Gracia de Luz de Luna"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Moon-lit Grace"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/crt_mutatinoc.json
msgid ""
"Aside from your appearances, your movements are incredibly graceful and "
"allow you to seemingly glide through every task."
msgstr ""
"Aparte de su apariencia, sus movimientos son increíblemente elegantes y le "
"permiten deslizarse aparentemente a través de cada tarea."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/crt_mutatinoc.json
msgid "Red Iris"
msgstr "Iris Rojo"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Red Iris"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/crt_mutatinoc.json
msgid ""
"You eyes are a pleasant shade of hypnotic scarlet.  People feel mildly "
"persuaded by you."
msgstr ""
"Tus ojos son de un agradable tono de escarlata hipnótico. La gente se siente"
" ligeramente persuadida por usted."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/crt_vamp_mutations.json
msgid "Night Walker"
msgstr "Caminador de la Noche"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Night Walker"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/crt_vamp_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Emerge from the grave of the old world, and become the night once again."
msgstr ""
"Emerges de la tumba del viejo mundo, y te conviertes en la noche una vez "
"más."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/crt_wendigo_mutations.json
msgid "Forest Guardian"
msgstr "Guardian del Bosque"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Forest Guardian"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/crt_wendigo_mutations.json
msgid ""
"The forests have longed for your help, and this last cry shook the world."
msgstr ""
"Los bosques han anhelado tu ayuda, y este último llanto sacudió el mundo."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/crt_wendigo_mutations.json
msgid "Nature's Boon"
msgstr "La Bendición de la Naturaleza"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Nature's Boon"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/crt_wendigo_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your very presence is masked by nature itself.  You are slightly harder to "
"detect."
msgstr ""
"Tu propia presencia está enmascarada por la propia naturaleza. Eres un poco "
"más difícil de detectar."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/crt_wendigo_mutations.json
msgid "Slashers"
msgstr "Acuchilladores"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Slashers"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/crt_wendigo_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your torso has an extra set of appendages that have burst out of your back, "
"they are tipped with massive bone blades at the end, and look like they can "
"do some serious damage with the thick acid that they secrete."
msgstr ""
"El torso tiene un conjunto extra de apéndices que han estallado de la "
"espalda, están inclinados con cuchillas de hueso gigante en el extremo, y "
"parece que pueden hacer algún daño serio con el ácido espeso que secretan."

#. ~ Message when player with mutation "Slashers" attacks
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/crt_wendigo_mutations.json
#, c-format
msgid "You tear into %s with your blades"
msgstr "Desgarras %s con tus cuchillas"

#. ~ Message when NPC with mutation "Slashers" attacks
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/crt_wendigo_mutations.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s tears into %2$s with their blades"
msgstr "%1$s  desgarra %2$s con sus espadas"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/crt_wendigo_mutations.json
msgid "Spurs"
msgstr "Espuelas"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Spurs"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/crt_wendigo_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Spurs of bone have erupted all across your arms.  A thick, biological "
"secretion oozes out of them promising extra harm to enemies."
msgstr ""
"Han surgido espolones de hueso por todos tus brazos. De ellos rezuma una "
"espesa secreción biológica que promete un daño extra a los enemigos."

#. ~ Message when player with mutation "Spurs" attacks
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/crt_wendigo_mutations.json
#, c-format
msgid "You ravage %s with your arms"
msgstr "Devastas a%s con tus brazos"

#. ~ Message when NPC with mutation "Spurs" attacks
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/crt_wendigo_mutations.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s ravages %2$s with their arm spurs"
msgstr "%1$s devasta a %2$s con sus espolones de brazos"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/crt_wendigo_mutations.json
msgid "Persistent Body"
msgstr "Cuerpo Persistente"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Persistent Body"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/crt_wendigo_mutations.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"As you move, the world seems to breath life and energy into your limbs.  You"
" simply tire much less readily than others.  Your maximum stamina is 50% "
"higher than usual."
msgstr ""
"Mientras te mueves, el mundo parece insuflar vida y energía a tus "
"extremidades. Simplemente, te cansas menos que los demás. Tu vigor máximo es"
" un 50% mayor a lo normal."

#. ~ Mutation class name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/vamp_mut_cat.json
msgid "Vampire"
msgstr "Vampiro"

#. ~ "mutagen_message" of mutation class "Vampire"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/vamp_mut_cat.json
msgid ""
"Nearby shadows seem to bend towards you for a moment and then reality warps "
"back into place."
msgstr ""
"Las sombras cercanas parecen inclinarse hacia ti por un momento y luego la "
"realidad vuelve a su lugar."

#. ~ Memorial message of mutation class "Vampire" for male
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/vamp_mut_cat.json
msgctxt "memorial_male"
msgid "Dispersed into the shadows."
msgstr "Dispersado en las sombras."

#. ~ Memorial message of mutation class "Vampire" for female
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/vamp_mut_cat.json
msgctxt "memorial_female"
msgid "Dispersed into the shadows."
msgstr "Dispersado en las sombras."

