#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SYLVAN"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/wendigo_mut_cat.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about the mountain forests."
msgstr "Tienes un extraño sueño sobre los bosques de la montaña."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SYLVAN"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/wendigo_mut_cat.json
msgid "Your dreams give you a peculiar feeling of sinking into the treelines."
msgstr ""
"Tus sueños te dan una peculiar sensación de hundirse en las lineas de "
"arboles."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SYLVAN"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/wendigo_mut_cat.json
msgid "You have a vivid dream of strolling through the woods."
msgstr "Tienes el vívido sueño de pasear por el bosque."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SYLVAN"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/wendigo_mut_cat.json
msgid "You have a dream of chasing something as a raw hunger sears your mind."
msgstr "Sueñas con perseguir algo cuando un hambre cruda te quema la mente."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SYLVAN"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/wendigo_mut_cat.json
msgid "Recollections of stalking a human shakes you awake."
msgstr "Los recuerdos de acechar a un humano te despiertan."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SYLVAN"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/wendigo_mut_cat.json
msgid "You dream of tearing into more and more enemies."
msgstr "Sueñas con destrozar más y más enemigos."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SYLVAN"
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/wendigo_mut_cat.json
msgid "You have a lucid dream where nature carefully welcomes your body."
msgstr ""
"Tienes un sueño lúcido donde la naturaleza acoge cuidadosamente tu cuerpo."

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_classes.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "C.R.I.T ROTC Member"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "C.R.I.T ROTC Member" for male
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_classes.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were training ahead of time to become a C.R.I.T officer in the upcoming "
"war.  Your call to arms arrived dead on arrival and already plastered in the"
" all-too vibrant gore of your squadmates.  In the midst of panic, you bugged"
" out lest you join the remnants of your friends.  Now it's up to your wits "
"and short years of training to keep you alive in this Cataclysm."
msgstr ""
"Te entrenastes con anticipación para ser un oficial del C.R.I.T. en la "
"próxima guerra. Tu llamada a las armas llegó muerta a tu llegada y ya "
"pavimentada en la intensa sangre de tus compañeros. En medio del pánico, te "
"fuiste para no unirte a los restos de tus amigos. Ahora depende de tu "
"ingenio y tus cortos años de entrenamiento para mantenerte vivo en este "
"Cataclismo."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_classes.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "C.R.I.T ROTC Member"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "C.R.I.T ROTC Member" for female
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_classes.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were training ahead of time to become a C.R.I.T officer in the upcoming "
"war.  Your call to arms arrived dead on arrival and already plastered in the"
" all-too vibrant gore of your squadmates.  In the midst of panic, you bugged"
" out lest you join the remnants of your friends.  Now it's up to your wits "
"and short years of training to keep you alive in this Cataclysm."
msgstr ""
"Te entrenastes con anticipación para ser un oficial del C.R.I.T. en la "
"próxima guerra. Tu llamada a las armas llegó muerta a tu llegada y ya "
"pavimentada en la intensa sangre de tus compañeros. En medio del pánico, te "
"fuiste para no unirte a los restos de tus amigos. Ahora depende de tu "
"ingenio y tus cortos años de entrenamiento para mantenerte vivo en este "
"Cataclismo."

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_classes.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "C.R.I.T Janitor"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "C.R.I.T Janitor" for male
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_classes.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"*Sigh* Your life has been a wreck.  Hopping place to place you finally found"
" a job at C.R.I.T… as a janitor of sorts.  The pay was good and you got some"
" sneak-peeks on some pretty cool stuff.  After all non-essential personnel "
"were purged you found yourself stuck with nothing but the uniform they gave "
"you and your job's sign-bonus equipment."
msgstr ""
"*Ufff* Tu vida ha sido una desgracia. Dando bandazos de un lugar a otro "
"hasta que finalmente encontraste un trabajo en el C.R.I.T... como una "
"especie de bedel. La paga era buena y conseguiste ver a escondidas algunas "
"cosas muy interesantes. Después de que todo el personal no esencial fuera "
"purgado, te encontraste atascado con nada más que el uniforme que te dieron "
"y el equipo de trabajo bonificado."

