#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_classes.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "C.R.I.T NCO"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "C.R.I.T NCO" for male
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_classes.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were a senior NCO, relaying orders to your squad was an everyday task.  "
"When the cataclysm struck, your expertise helped save everyone time and time"
" again until it all fell apart."
msgstr ""
"Eras un NCO superior, transmitir órdenes a tu escuadrón era una tarea "
"diaria. Cuando el cataclismo golpeó, tu experiencia ayudó a salvar a todos "
"una y otra vez hasta que todo se vino abajo."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_classes.json
