#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_classes.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "C.R.I.T Grunt"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "C.R.I.T Grunt" for male
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_classes.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were part of the infantry; first to hit the ground running, clear a FOB "
"and then come back to relax with your squad.  Those days ended when the "
"cataclysm reared its ugly head.  Your lines were torn through like wet paper"
" when the otherworldly abominations arrived.  Now fleeing for your life, "
"will you have what it takes to survive or is this hellish landscape your "
"resting place?"
msgstr ""
"Fuiste parte de la infantería; el primero en llegar al terreno, despejar un "
"campo de batalla y después volver a relajarte con tu escuadrón. Esos días "
"terminaron cuando el cataclismo asomó su fea cabeza. Tus líneas fueron "
"destrozadas como papel mojado cuando llegaron las abominaciones de otro "
"mundo. Ahora, huyendo por tu vida, ¿tendrás lo que hace falta para "
"sobrevivir o este paisaje infernal será tu lugar de descanso?"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_classes.json
