#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_classes.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "C.R.I.T Employee"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "C.R.I.T Employee" for male
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_classes.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Like many others, you had requested to join the C.R.I.T organization's "
"admin-offices to escape from bitter memories and past traumas after "
"valiantly protecting your comrades for years.  After you completed the "
"readjustment program, your skills may have rusted considerably since your "
"last deployment to battle, but the drilled muscle memories have not worn "
"away.  As your comrades' screams once again ring in your ears and repressed "
"memories of abhorrent nature resurface, can you find it within yourself to "
"overcome the looming terror which paralyzes you?"
msgstr ""
"Como muchos otros, usted había solicitado unirse a las oficinas "
"administrativas de la organización C.R.I.T. para escapar de los amargos "
"recuerdos y traumas del pasado, después de proteger valientemente a tus "
"camaradas durante años. Después de completar el programa de reajuste, tus "
"habilidades pueden haberse oxidado considerablemente desde su último "
"despliegue en batalla, pero la memoria múscular entrenada no se ha "
"desgastado. Mientras los gritos de tus camaradas suenan una vez más en tus "
"oídos y resurgen los recuerdos reprimidos de la detestable naturaleza , "
"¿puedes encontrar dentro de ti mismo la forma de superar el terror que te "
"paraliza?"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_classes.json
