#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_classes.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "C.R.I.T Engineer"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "C.R.I.T Engineer" for male
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_classes.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were scheduled to fix the several of the lab facilities in New England "
"and show other researchers the new weapons you were working on.  When the "
"Cataclysm broke out, it made it so testing was easier to do, but then again "
"nothing seems to making that much sense.  Time to bug-out!"
msgstr ""
"Estabas programado para arreglar las instalaciones de varios laboratorios en"
" Nueva Inglaterra y mostrar a otros investigadores las nuevas armas en las "
"que estaba trabajando. Cuando el cataclismo estalló, lo hizo para que las "
"pruebas fueran más fáciles de hacer, pero de nuevo nada parece tener tanto "
"sentido. ¡Hora de irse!"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_classes.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "C.R.I.T Engineer"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "C.R.I.T Engineer" for female
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_classes.json
