"whistle."
msgstr ""
"Ya es bastante difícil conseguir que los niños corran sin tener que "
"preocuparse por hacerlo en una zona de guerra. Los extraterrestres ni "
"siquiera se alinean cuando tocas el silbato."

#. ~ Description of profession "Major General" for male
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You worked your way up through the ranks, from a no-name private, to a big "
"shot Major General.  Now however, it is years since you last fired a weapon "
"in anger, and you've somehow ended up deep behind enemy lines."
msgstr ""
"Te abriste camino a través de los rangos, desde un soldado raso sin nombre, "
"hasta un importante General de División. Sin embargo, hace años que no "
"disparas un arma con rabia y, de alguna manera, has acabado en lo más "
"profundo de las líneas enemigas."

#. ~ Description of profession "Major General" for female
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You worked your way up through the ranks, from a no-name private, to a big "
"shot Major General.  Now however, it is years since you last fired a weapon "
"in anger, and you've somehow ended up deep behind enemy lines."
msgstr ""
"Te abriste camino a través de los rangos, desde una soldada rasa sin nombre,"
" hasta una importante General de División. Sin embargo, hace años que no "
"disparas un arma con rabia y, de alguna manera, has acabado en lo más "
"profundo de las líneas enemigas."

#. ~ Description of profession "Military Recruit" for male
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Joining the military has been your dream for years.  You finally got in, "
"just in time for your training to get interrupted by some sort of national "
"emergency.  After a hot deployment, as far as you can tell you're one of the"
" last active personnel in this hellhole."
msgstr ""
"Entrar en el ejército ha sido tu sueño durante años. Finalmente entraste, "
"justo a tiempo para que tu entrenamiento se viera interrumpido por algún "
"tipo de emergencia nacional. Tras un caluroso despliegue, por lo que puedes "
"ver eres uno de los últimos efectivos en activo en este infierno."

#. ~ Description of profession "Military Recruit" for female
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Joining the military has been your dream for years.  You finally got in, "
"just in time for your training to get interrupted by some sort of national "
"emergency.  After a hot deployment, as far as you can tell you're one of the"
" last active personnel in this hellhole."
msgstr ""
"Entrar en el ejército ha sido tu sueño durante años. Finalmente entraste, "
"justo a tiempo para que tu entrenamiento se viera interrumpido por algún "
"tipo de emergencia nacional. Tras un caluroso despliegue, por lo que puedes "
"ver eres una de los últimos efectivos en activo en este infierno."

#. ~ Description of profession "Combat Mechanic" for male
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You failed out of high school, and joined the army.  You were soon hand "
"picked for extra training in the mechanics trade, keeping the armor running."
"  It's been years since you last touched a rifle, and now the sky is "
"falling…"
msgstr ""
"No superaste el bachillerato y te alistaste en el ejército. Pronto te "
"eligieron para un entrenamiento extra en el oficio de mecánica, para "
"mantener las armaduras en funcionamiento. Hacía años que no tocabas un "
"fusil, y ahora el cielo se está cayendo..."

#. ~ Description of profession "Combat Mechanic" for female
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You failed out of high school, and joined the army.  You were soon hand "
"picked for extra training in the mechanics trade, keeping the armor running."
"  It's been years since you last touched a rifle, and now the sky is "
"falling…"
msgstr ""
"No superaste el bachillerato y te alistaste en el ejército. Pronto te "
"eligieron para un entrenamiento extra en el oficio de mecánica, para "
"mantener las armaduras en funcionamiento. Hacía años que no tocabas un "
"fusil, y ahora el cielo se está cayendo..."

#. ~ Description of profession "Riot Control Officer" for male
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were keeping the peace at a local climate change protest when the bombs "
"started dropping and aliens started appearing in the streets.  It was only "
"by luck that you manage to survive the crowd in one piece, and the worst is "
"yet to come."
msgstr ""
"Estabas manteniendo la paz en una protesta local contra el cambio climático "
"cuando empezaron a caer las bombas y a aparecer alienígenas en las calles. "
"Sólo por suerte lograste sobrevivir a la multitud en una pieza, y lo peor "
"está por llegar."

#. ~ Description of profession "Riot Control Officer" for female
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were keeping the peace at a local climate change protest when the bombs "
"started dropping and aliens started appearing in the streets.  It was only "
"by luck that you manage to survive the crowd in one piece, and the worst is "
"yet to come."
msgstr ""
"Estabas manteniendo la paz en una protesta local contra el cambio climático "
"cuando empezaron a caer las bombas y a aparecer alienígenas en las calles. "
"Sólo por suerte lograste sobrevivir a la multitud en una pieza, y lo peor "
"está por llegar."

#. ~ Description of profession "Trucker" for male
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You once ruled the road in your big rig.  When the bombs hit, you hopped in "
"and drove it to safety.  Now it's just you and your truck against the world."
msgstr ""
"Una vez gobernaste la carretera en tu gran camión. Cuando las bombas "
"cayeron, te subiste y condujiste hasta un lugar seguro. Ahora sólo estas tú "
"y tu camión contra el mundo."

#. ~ Description of profession "Trucker" for female
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You once ruled the road in your big rig.  When the bombs hit, you hopped in "
"and drove it to safety.  Now it's just you and your truck against the world."
msgstr ""
"Una vez gobernaste la carretera en tu gran camión. Cuando las bombas "
"cayeron, te subiste y condujiste hasta un lugar seguro. Ahora sólo estas tú "
"y tu camión contra el mundo."

#. ~ Description of profession "Competitive Fencer" for male
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Years of training prepared you for the competitive fencing circuit, but your"
" latest tournament was cut short when aliens invaded the piste.  The referee"
" was blown away, so you're not sure if the rules are still in play."
msgstr ""
"Años de entrenamiento te prepararon para el circuito competitivo de esgrima,"
" pero tu último torneo se vio interrumpido cuando unos alienígenas "
"invadieron la pista. El árbitro salió volando, así que no estás seguro de "
"que las reglas sigan vigentes."

#. ~ Description of profession "Competitive Fencer" for female
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Years of training prepared you for the competitive fencing circuit, but your"
" latest tournament was cut short when aliens invaded the piste.  The referee"
" was blown away, so you're not sure if the rules are still in play."
msgstr ""
"Años de entrenamiento te prepararon para el circuito competitivo de esgrima,"
" pero tu último torneo se vio interrumpido cuando unos alienígenas "
"invadieron la pista. El árbitro salió volando, así que no estás seguro de "
"que las reglas sigan vigentes."

#. ~ Description of profession "Career Politician" for male
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've spent your life appealing to the people, persuading many and "
"promising much throughout your time in office.  Now that your voting base is"
" dead or worse and hostile forces are in America's heartland, winning hearts"
" and minds just got that much harder."
msgstr ""
"Has pasado la vida apelando a la gente, persuadiendo a muchos y prometiendo "
"mucho durante tu mandato. Ahora que tu base de votantes está muerta o peor y"
" que las fuerzas hostiles están en el corazón de Estados Unidos, ganar "
"corazones y mentes se ha vuelto mucho más difícil."

#. ~ Description of profession "Career Politician" for female
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've spent your life appealing to the people, persuading many and "
"promising much throughout your time in office.  Now that your voting base is"
" dead or worse and hostile forces are in America's heartland, winning hearts"
" and minds just got that much harder."
msgstr ""
"Has pasado la vida apelando a la gente, persuadiendo a muchos y prometiendo "
"mucho durante tu mandato. Ahora que tu base de votantes está muerta o peor y"
" que las fuerzas hostiles están en el corazón de Estados Unidos, ganar "
"corazones y mentes se ha vuelto mucho más difícil."

#. ~ Description of profession "Hazmat Unit" for male
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were deployed to autopsy one of the aliens after it was put down.  When "
"their friends showed up in force, you knew this was out of your job "
"description."
msgstr ""
"Fuiste desplegado para hacer la autopsia a uno de los alienígenas después de"
" que fuera sacrificado. Cuando sus amigos aparecieron con mucha fuerza, "
"supiste que esto estaba fuera del ámbito de tu trabajo."

#. ~ Description of profession "Hazmat Unit" for female
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were deployed to autopsy one of the aliens after it was put down.  When "
"their friends showed up in force, you knew this was out of your job "
"description."
msgstr ""
"Fuiste desplegada para hacer la autopsia a uno de los alienígenas después de"
" que fuera sacrificado. Cuando sus amigos aparecieron con mucha fuerza, "
"supiste que esto estaba fuera del ámbito de tu trabajo."

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Military Flamethrower Operator"
msgstr "Operador Lanzallamas Militar"

#. ~ Description of profession "Military Flamethrower Operator" for male
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"In response to the outbreak, you were dispatched to contain alien invasive "
"species through judicious use of fire.  After getting separated from your "
"squad, your priorities have shifted to basic survival."
msgstr ""
"En respuesta al brote, te enviaron a contener las especies invasoras "
"alienígenas mediante el uso prudente del fuego. Tras separarte de tu "
"escuadrón, tus prioridades han cambiado a la supervivencia básica."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Military Flamethrower Operator"
msgstr "Operadora Lanzallamas Militar"

#. ~ Description of profession "Military Flamethrower Operator" for female
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"In response to the outbreak, you were dispatched to contain alien invasive "
"species through judicious use of fire.  After getting separated from your "
"squad, your priorities have shifted to basic survival."
msgstr ""
"En respuesta al brote, te enviaron a contener las especies invasoras "
"alienígenas mediante el uso prudente del fuego. Tras separarte de tu "
"escuadrón, tus prioridades han cambiado a la supervivencia básica."

#. ~ Description of profession "Non Commissioned Officer" for male
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You're a veteran of several peace keeping missions.  You lead your squad as "
"a sort of parental figure, offering helpful advice on how not to die.  Now "
"they've been blasted to pieces by the alien and you're on your own."
msgstr ""
"Eres un veterano de varias misiones de mantenimiento de paz. Diriges tu "
"escuadrón como una especie de figura paterna, ofreciendo consejos útiles "
"sobre cómo no morir. Ahora los alienígenas los han hecho pedazos y estás "
"solo."

#. ~ Description of profession "Non Commissioned Officer" for female
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You're a veteran of several peace keeping missions.  You lead your squad as "
"a sort of parental figure, offering helpful advice on how not to die.  Now "
"they've been blasted to pieces by the alien and you're on your own."
msgstr ""
"Eres una veterana de varias misiones de mantenimiento de paz. Diriges tu "
"escuadrón como una especie de figura materna, ofreciendo consejos útiles "
"sobre cómo no morir. Ahora los alienígenas los han hecho pedazos y estás "
"sola."

#. ~ Description of profession "Special Operator" for male
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were the best of the best, the military's finest.  That's why you're "
"still alive, even after all your comrades fell to the aliens.  As far as you"
" can tell, you're one of the last active operators in this hellhole."
msgstr ""
"Eras lo mejor de lo mejor, lo más selecto del ejército. Por eso sigues vivo,"
" incluso después de que todos tus compañeros cayeran ante los alienígenas. "
"Por lo que puedes decir, eres uno de los últimos operadores activos en este "
"agujero infernal."

#. ~ Description of profession "Special Operator" for female
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were the best of the best, the military's finest.  That's why you're "
"still alive, even after all your comrades fell to the aliens.  As far as you"
" can tell, you're one of the last active operators in this hellhole."
msgstr ""
"Eras la mejor de lo mejor, lo más selecto del ejército. Por eso sigues viva,"
" incluso después de que todos tus compañeros cayeran ante los alienígenas. "
"Por lo que puedes decir, eres uno de los últimos operadores activos en este "
"agujero infernal."

#. ~ Description of scenario "Evacuee" for male
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You have survived the initial wave of panic and managed to escape to "
"(relative) safety in one of the many government evac shelters."
msgstr ""
"Has sobrevivido a la ola de pánico inicial y has conseguido escapar a la "
"(relativa) seguridad en uno de los muchos refugios de evacuación del "
"gobierno."

#. ~ Description of scenario "Evacuee" for female
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You have survived the initial wave of panic and managed to escape to "
"(relative) safety in one of the many government evac shelters."
msgstr ""
"Has sobrevivido a la ola de pánico inicial y has conseguido escapar a la "
"(relativa) seguridad en uno de los muchos refugios de evacuación del "
"gobierno."

#. ~ Description of scenario "Missed" for male
#. ~ Description of scenario "Large Building" for male
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Whether due to stubbornness, ignorance, or just plain bad luck, you missed "
"the evacuation and managed to avoid being turned into one of those things "
"outside.  You are now left in a city full of the hateful revenants of your "
"neighbors."
msgstr ""
"Sea por tu tozudez, ignorancia, o simplemente mala suerte, te perdiste la "
"evacuación y lograste evitar ser convertido en una de esas cosas de afuera. "
"Ahora estás atrapado en una ciudad llena de los antipáticos retornados de "
"tus vecinos."

#. ~ Description of scenario "Missed" for female
#. ~ Description of scenario "Large Building" for female
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Whether due to stubbornness, ignorance, or just plain bad luck, you missed "
"the evacuation and managed to avoid being turned into one of those things "
"outside.  You are now left in a city full of the hateful revenants of your "
"neighbors."
msgstr ""
"Sea por tu tozudez, ignorancia, o simplemente mala suerte, te perdiste la "
"evacuación y lograste evitar ser convertida en una de esas cosas de afuera. "
"Ahora estás atrapada en una ciudad llena de los antipáticos retornados de "
"tus vecinos."

#. ~ Description of scenario "Surrounded" for male
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've attracted the attention of a pack of mutants in some way, now they're"
" all around and you'll likely have to fight through them if you want to "
"escape."
msgstr ""
"Has atraído la atención de una manada de mutantes de alguna manera, ahora "
"están por todas partes y es probable que tengas que luchar a través de ellos"
" si quieres escapar."

#. ~ Description of scenario "Surrounded" for female
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've attracted the attention of a pack of mutants in some way, now they're"
" all around and you'll likely have to fight through them if you want to "
"escape."
msgstr ""
"Has atraído la atención de una manada de mutantes de alguna manera, ahora "
"están por todas partes y es probable que tengas que luchar a través de ellos"
" si quieres escapar."

#. ~ Description of scenario "Safe Place" for male
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've found some distant safe place that seems to have gone unnoticed by "
"the invasion force.  Looks like you're on your own…"
msgstr ""
"Has encontrado un lugar seguro y distante que parece no haber pasado "
"desapercibido por las fuerzas invasoras. Parece que estás solo.."

#. ~ Description of scenario "Safe Place" for female
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've found some distant safe place that seems to have gone unnoticed by "
"the invasion force.  Looks like you're on your own…"
msgstr ""
"Has encontrado un lugar seguro y distante que parece no haber pasado "
"desapercibido por las fuerzas invasoras. Parece que estás sola.."

#. ~ Description of scenario "Infected" for male
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"In the chaos and panic of the invasion, you got a horrible wound!  You "
"didn't get proper medical care, and now it has started turning green."
msgstr ""
"Durante el caos y el pánico de la evacuación, ¡te hiciste una herida grave!."
" No recibiste cuidado médico adecuado y ahora se ha empezado a poner verde."

#. ~ Description of scenario "Infected" for female
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"In the chaos and panic of the invasion, you got a horrible wound!  You "
"didn't get proper medical care, and now it has started turning green."
msgstr ""
"Durante el caos y el pánico de la evacuación, ¡te hiciste una herida grave!."
" No recibiste cuidado médico adecuado y ahora se ha empezado a poner verde."

#. ~ Description of scenario "Wilderness" for male
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You find yourself amongst trees.  The screaming and the explosions are "
"fainter this far from civilization, but you'd better know what you're doing "
"out here."
msgstr ""
"Te encuentras entre arboles. Los gritos y las explosiones son débiles tan "
"lejos de la civilización, pero será mejor que sepas lo que estás haciendo "
"aquí."

#. ~ Description of scenario "Wilderness" for female
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You find yourself amongst trees.  The screaming and the explosions are "
"fainter this far from civilization, but you'd better know what you're doing "
"out here."
msgstr ""
"Te encuentras entre arboles. Los gritos y las explosiones son débiles tan "
"lejos de la civilización, pero será mejor que sepas lo que estás haciendo "
"aquí."

#. ~ Description of scenario "Helicopter Crash" for male
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"While being evacuated from a hot zone, the pilot lost control of the "
"helicopter and crashed in the middle of nowhere.  Hopefully some of the "
"soldiers that were with you also survived the accident."
msgstr ""
"Estabas siendo evacuado de una zona caliente cuando el piloto perdió el "
"control del helicóptero y se estrelló en medio de la nada. Esperemos que "
"algunos de los soldados que estaban contigo también hayan sobrevivido al "
"accidente."

#. ~ Description of scenario "Helicopter Crash" for female
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"While being evacuated from a hot zone, the pilot lost control of the "
"helicopter and crashed in the middle of nowhere.  Hopefully some of the "
"soldiers that were with you also survived the accident."
msgstr ""
"Estabas siendo evacuada de una zona caliente cuando el piloto perdió el "
"control del helicóptero y se estrelló en medio de la nada. Esperemos que "
"algunos de los soldados que estaban contigo también hayan sobrevivido al "
"accidente."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/furniture_terrain/indoor_furniture.json
msgid "Edison generator"
msgstr "Generador de Edison"

#. ~ Description of terrain "Edison generator"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/furniture_terrain/indoor_furniture.json
msgid ""
"This imposing apparatus harnesses 'atmospheric charges', or at least that's "
"what the news said when these things came out.  Pioneered by Elton Moosek "
"and his Bluebox team, these were immediately snapped up by the government "
"due to their potential to generate near limitless power.  It's not doing "
"much good here though.  Perhaps it could be salvaged for other purposes."
msgstr ""
"Este imponente aparato aprovecha las \"cargas atmosféricas\", o al menos eso"
" es lo que decían las noticias cuando salieron estas cosas. Elton Moosek y "
"su equipo de CajaAzul fueron los pioneros y el gobierno se apoderó de ellos "
"inmediatamente debido a su potencial para generar energía casi ilimitada. "
"Sin embargo, no sirve de mucho aquí. Tal vez podría ser rescatado para otros"
" fines."

#. ~ Description of furniture "dresser"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/furniture_terrain/indoor_furniture.json
msgid "Dress yourself!"
msgstr "¡Vístete!"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/furniture_terrain/outdoor-furniture.json
msgid "poppy bush"
msgstr "arbusto de amapola"

#. ~ Description of furniture "poppy bush"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/furniture_terrain/outdoor-furniture.json
msgid ""
"An invasive species brought to Earth by the invaders and found it quite to "
"its liking.  It spiny, writhing fronds make it look more like a jungle bush "
"than a conventional poppy except for its red petals, but is named after such"
" due to its similar medicinal properties.  It exudes a potent, sleep "
"inducing aroma."
msgstr ""
"Una especie invasora traída a la Tierra por los invasores y que le encontró "
"bastante a su gusto. Sus frondas espinosas y retorcidas la hacen parecer más"
" un arbusto de la selva que una amapola convencional, salvo por sus pétalos "
"rojos, pero recibe ese nombre por sus propiedades medicinales similares. "
"Desprende un potente aroma que induce al sueño."

#. ~ Description of "large quiver"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/armor.json
msgid ""
"A large leather quiver trimmed with metal, worn on the back, that can hold "
"60 arrows.  Historically used by horse archers, rather than foot archers, "
"but sometimes horses are a little hard to come by in this day and age.  "
"Activate to store arrows."
msgstr ""
"Un gran carcaj de cuero con adornos de metal, que se lleva en la espalda y "
"puede contener 60 flechas. Históricamente usada por arqueros de caballo, más"
" que por arqueros de a pie, pero a veces los caballos son un poco difíciles "
"de conseguir en estos tiempos. Actívalo para almacenar flechas."

#. ~ Description of "bra"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/armor.json
msgid ""
"A simple bra.  For protecting those bits you don't want creatures to look "
"at."
msgstr ""
"Un simple sostén. Para proteger esas partes que no quieres que las criaturas"
" miren."

#. ~ Description of "children's book"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/books.json
msgid ""
"A little book for little readers.  The colorful cartoon characters and sweet"
" stories contained herein belong to a different time, before the sky grew "
"dark and the aliens arrived."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño libro para pequeños lectores. Los coloridos personajes de dibujos"
" animados y las dulces historias que contiene pertenecen a otra época, antes"
" de que el cielo se oscureciera y llegaran los extraterrestres."

#. ~ Description of "TIME magazine"
#. ~ Description of "US Weekly"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/books.json
msgid ""
"Current events concerning a bunch of people who're all dead now - or working"
" for them."
msgstr ""
"Eventos actuales acerca de un montón de gente que ahora estan muertos o "
"trabajando para ellos."

#. ~ Description of "Zombie Survival Guide"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/books.json
msgid ""
"While this seems like it would be at least partially useful in this "
"situation, the sheer amount of speculative fiction present makes it "
"practically useless.  What the hell is a mi-go?  Aren't triffids from some "
"ancient movie?"
msgstr ""
"Aunque parece que sería al menos parcialmente útil en esta situación, la "
"gran cantidad de ficción especulativa presente la hace prácticamente inútil."
" ¿Qué demonios es un mi-go? ¿No son los trífidos de alguna película antigua?"

#. ~ Description of "cooked brains"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"Now you can emulate a zombie!  Preparing brain for eating is challenging, "
"and this doesn't seem to be the best way to do it."
msgstr ""
"¡Ahora puedes emular a un zombi! Preparar cerebro para comer es un desafío, "
"y esta no parece ser la mejor manera de hacerlo."

#. ~ tainted meat is meat that has been heavily genetically poisoned or is
#. completely alien in nature
#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid "chunk of alien meat"
msgid_plural "chunks of alien meat"
msgstr[0] "trozo de carne alienígena"
msgstr[1] "trozos de carne alienígena"
msgstr[2] "trozos de carne alienígena"

#. ~ tainted meat is meat that has been heavily genetically poisoned or is
#. completely alien in nature
#. ~ Description of "chunk of alien meat"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"This dense, stringy substance smells strongly like burnt oil, or some sort "
"of industrial chemical.  For all intents and purposes, it seems like the "
"'meat' of the creature, but its bizarre texture and faintly red-purple tint "
"is unlike anything you've ever experienced before.  You could eat it, but no"
" doubt it would not only taste heinous but also make you sick, being made of"
" material your body was never supposed to ingest."
msgstr ""
"Esta sustancia densa y fibrosa huele fuertemente a aceite quemado o a algún "
"tipo de producto químico industrial. A todos los efectos, parece la "
"\"carne\" de la criatura, pero su extraña textura y su tenue tinte rojo-"
"púrpura no se parecen a nada que hayas experimentado antes. Podrías comerlo,"
" pero sin duda no sólo tendría un sabor atroz, sino que también te haría "
"enfermar, al estar hecho de un material que tu cuerpo no debería ingerir."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid "dehydrated alien meat"
msgid_plural "dehydrated alien meats"
msgstr[0] "carne alienigena deshidratada"
msgstr[1] "carnes alienigenas deshidratadas"
msgstr[2] "carnes alienigenas deshidratadas"

#. ~ Description of "dehydrated alien meat"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"Pieces of alien meat that have been dried to prevent them from rotting away."
"  It will still poison you if you eat this."
msgstr ""
"Piezas de carne alienígena que han sido secadas para evitar que se pudran. "
"Comer esto te envenenará igualmente."

#. ~ Description of "alien bone"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"A piece of a hard material with many crests and protrusions, made of a hard "
"material that occasionally leaves a bit of moisture on your hand when you "
"touch it.  It seems basically like a bone, though not one you'd see in any "
"anatomy textbook.  You could eat it, but no doubt it would not only taste "
"heinous but also make you sick, being made of material your body was never "
"supposed to injest.  It might at least be able to be used for something, if "
"not as well as the earthly variant due to its fiddly size and shape."
msgstr ""
"Una pieza de un material duro con muchas crestas y protuberancias, hecho de "
"un material duro que ocasionalmente deja un poco de humedad en la mano "
"cuando se toca. Parece básicamente un hueso, aunque no se ve en ningún libro"
" de anatomía. Podrías comértelo, pero sin duda no sólo tendría un sabor "
"fuerte sino que también te enfermaría, ya que está hecho de un material que "
"se supone que tu cuerpo nunca debe haber ingerido. Al menos podría ser "
"utilizado para algo, aunque no tan bien como la variante terrestre debido a "
"su tamaño y forma."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid "alien fat"
msgid_plural "alien fats"
msgstr[0] "grasa alienígena"
msgstr[1] "grasas alienígenas"
msgstr[2] "grasas alienígenas"

#. ~ Description of "alien fat"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"A chunk of dense fat that is tough and rubbery.  It smells simply heinous, "
"like open sewer and pungent chemicals, and is doubtless full of strange "
"material that your body was never supposed to injest.  It might at least be "
"able to be used for something, if not quite as well as its earthly variant "
"due to its relative impurities."
msgstr ""
"Un trozo de grasa densa, dura y gomosa. Huele sencillamente atroz, como a "
"alcantarilla abierta y a productos químicos punzantes, y sin duda está lleno"
" de materiales extraños que tu cuerpo nunca debería ingerir. Al menos podría"
" servir para algo, aunque no tan bien como su variante terrestre debido a "
"sus relativas impurezas."

#. ~ Description of "alien tallow"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"A smooth grayish block of cleaned and rendered alien fat.  Processing it "
"seems to have at least removed some of the smell.  It won't spoil for a very"
" long time, and can be used as an ingredient in many projects.  It is no "
"safer than its source material to consume."
msgstr ""
"Un bloque grisáceo y liso de grasa alienígena procesada y limpia. El "
"procesamiento parece haber eliminado al menos parte del olor. No se pudrirá "
"durante mucho tiempo, y puede ser usada como ingrediente en muchos "
"proyectos. No es más seguro de consumir que su material de origen."

#. ~ mutant meat is meat that comes from a creature that is spliced with
#. earthly genes or originally came from earth before being modded
#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid "chunk of unusual meat"
msgid_plural "chunks of unusual meat"
msgstr[0] "trozo de carne inusual"
msgstr[1] "trozos de carne inusual"
msgstr[2] "trozos de carne inusual"

#. ~ mutant meat is meat that comes from a creature that is spliced with
#. earthly genes or originally came from earth before being modded
#. ~ Description of "chunk of unusual meat"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"Meat from the aliens is typically quite foul, full of toxins and substances "
"not meant to be digested by humans.  However, this piece almost looks edible"
" - if not for a few sections that still have strange hues and disgusting, "
"spongy texture.  Still, with a bit of preparation, it might even be somewhat"
" palatable."
msgstr ""
"La carne de los alienígenas suele ser bastante asquerosa, llena de toxinas y"
" sustancias que no deben ser digeridas por los humanos. Sin embargo, este "
"trozo casi parece comestible, si no fuera por algunas secciones que todavía "
"tienen matices extraños y una textura repugnante y esponjosa. Aun así, con "
"un poco de preparación, podría ser algo digerible."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid "scrap of unusual meat"
msgid_plural "scraps of unusual meat"
msgstr[0] "resto de carne inusual"
msgstr[1] "restos de carne inusual"
msgstr[2] "restos de carne inusual"

#. ~ Description of "scrap of unusual meat"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"A tiny scrap of meat from an unusual creature.  It smells a bit odd and has "
"a variety of discolorations that indicate that it is still going to be rough"
" on your digestive system.  Still, seems digestible at least, if you cook it"
" and remove the worst parts."
msgstr ""
"Un diminuto resto de carne de una criatura inusual. Huele un poco raro y "
"tiene una variedad de decoloraciones que indican que todavía va a ser duro "
"para tu sistema digestivo. Aún así, parece digerible al menos, si lo cocinas"
" y quitas las peores partes."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid "unusual humanoid meat"
msgid_plural "unusual humanoid meats"
msgstr[0] "carne humanoide inusual"
msgstr[1] "carnes humanoides inusuales"
msgstr[2] "carnes humanoides inusuales"

#. ~ Description of "unusual humanoid meat"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"Freshly butchered from the body of an alien creature that was unsettlingly "
"humanoid in appearance.  It smells faintly of chemicals and is colored odd "
"hues that indicate that it is still going to be rough on your digestive "
"system.  You'd have to be crazy or starving to eat this."
msgstr ""
"Recién sacado del cuerpo de una criatura alienígena de aspecto "
"inquietantemente humanoide. Huele débilmente a productos químicos y tiene un"
" colorido de tonos extraños que indican que todavía va a ser duro para tu "
"sistema digestivo. Tendrías que estar loco o hambriento para comer esto."

#. ~ Description of "cooked cretin"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"Cooked meat from an alien humanoid.  Now that the worst bits have been "
"processed, it's probably digestible, if not very appetizing."
msgstr ""
"Carne cocinada de un humanoide alienígena. Ahora que los peores trozos han "
"sido procesados, es probablemente digerible, si no muy apetitosa."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid "cooked unusual meat"
msgid_plural "cooked unusual meats"
msgstr[0] "carne inusual cocinada"
msgstr[1] "carnes inusuales cocinadas"
msgstr[2] "carnes inusuales cocinadas"

#. ~ Description of "cooked unusual meat"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"This is a cooked chunk of meat from an unusual critter.  It has strange "
"colors, smells a bit funny, and has a mushy texture but it tastes… mostly "
"normal.  Hopefully you cut away the worst bits well enough."
msgstr ""
"Este es un trozo de carne cocinada de una criatura inusual. Tiene colores "
"extraños, huele un poco raro, y tiene una textura blanda pero sabe... "
"mayormente normal. Con suerte, cortaste los peores trozos lo suficientemente"
" bien."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid "cooked scrap of unusual meat"
msgid_plural "cooked scraps of unusual meat"
msgstr[0] "resto cocinado de carne inusual"
msgstr[1] "restos cocinados de carne inusual"
msgstr[2] "restos cocinados de carne inusual"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid "unusual tallow"
msgid_plural "unusual tallows"
msgstr[0] "sebo inusual"
msgstr[1] "sebos inusuales"
msgstr[2] "sebos inusuales"

#. ~ Description of "unusual tallow"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"A smooth white block of cleaned and rendered fat sourced from an unusual "
"creature.  It will remain edible for a very long time, and can be used as an"
" ingredient in many foods and projects."
msgstr ""
"Un bloque blanco y liso de grasa procesada y limpiada procedente de una "
"criatura inusual. Permanecerá comestible durante mucho tiempo, y puede ser "
"usada como ingrediente en muchas comidas y proyectos."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid "unusual lard"
msgid_plural "unusual lards"
msgstr[0] "manteca inusual"
msgstr[1] "mantecas inusuales"
msgstr[2] "mantecas inusuales"

#. ~ Description of "unusual lard"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"A smooth white block of dry-rendered fat sourced from an alien.  It will "
"remain edible for a very long time, and can be used as an ingredient in many"
" foods and projects."
msgstr ""
"Un bloque blanco y liso de grasa procesada y seca procedente de una "
"alienígena. Permanecerá comestible por mucho tiempo, y puede ser usada como "
"ingrediente en muchas comidas y proyectos."

#. ~ Description of "chunk of mutant humanoid fat"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid "Freshly butchered fat from an alien humanoid."
msgstr "Grasa recién cortada de un humanoide alienígena."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid "unusual humanoid tallow"
msgid_plural "unusual humanoid tallows"
msgstr[0] "sebo humanoide inusual"
msgstr[1] "sebos humanoides inusuales"
msgstr[2] "sebos humanoides inusuales"

#. ~ Description of "unusual humanoid tallow"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"A smooth white block of cleaned and rendered fat sourced from an alien "
"humanoid.  It won't rot for a very long time, and can be used as an "
"ingredient in many foods and projects."
msgstr ""
"Un bloque blanco y liso de grasa procesada y limpia procedente de un "
"humanoide alienígena. No se pudrirá por mucho tiempo, y puede ser usada como"
" ingrediente en muchas comidas y proyectos."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid "unusual humanoid lard"
msgid_plural "unusual humanoid lards"
msgstr[0] "manteca humanoide inusual"
msgstr[1] "mantecas humanoides inusuales"
msgstr[2] "mantecas humanoides inusuales"

#. ~ Description of "unusual humanoid lard"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"A smooth white block of dry-rendered fat sourced from an alien humanoid.  It"
" won't rot for a very long time, and can be used as an ingredient in many "
"foods and projects."
msgstr ""
"Un bloque blanco de grasa procesada seca procedente de un humanoide "
"alienígena. No se pudrirá por mucho tiempo, y puede ser usada como "
"ingrediente en muchas comidas y proyectos."

#. ~ Description of "raw human skin"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"A carefully folded raw skin harvested from a humanoid.  You can cure it for "
"storage and tanning, or eat it if you're desperate enough."
msgstr ""
"Una piel cruda cuidadosamente doblada y cosechada de un humanoide. Puedes "
"curarla para almacenarla y curtirla, o comerla si estás lo suficientemente "
"desesperado."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid "raw humanoid pelt"
msgid_plural "raw humanoid pelts"
msgstr[0] "pelaje humanoide crudo"
msgstr[1] "pelajes humanoides crudos"
msgstr[2] "pelajes humanoides crudos"

#. ~ Description of "raw humanoid pelt"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"A carefully folded raw skin harvested from a fur-bearing creature that was "
"disturbingly humanoid.  It still has the fur attached.  You can cure it for "
"storage and tanning, or eat it if you're desperate enough."
msgstr ""
"Una piel cruda cuidadosamente doblada cosechada de una criatura con una piel"
" que era perturbadoramente humanoide. Todavía tiene el pelo adherido. Puedes"
" curarla para almacenarla y curtirla, o comerla si estás lo suficientemente "
"desesperado."

#. ~ Description of "smartphone"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/electronic.json
msgid ""
"A popular, fancy smartphone.  Capable of making photos due to integrated "
"camera and illuminating an area as per its flashlight app, assuming it has "
"enough charge.  The smartphone also has a clock app that includes an alarm."
"  Runs on a small, proprietary power cell that needs a specialized charger."
"  That is to say, is quite difficult to recharge post-Cataclysm."
msgstr ""
"Un smartphone popular y elegante. Es capaz de hacer fotos gracias a su "
"cámara integrada y de iluminar una zona gracias a su aplicación de linterna,"
" siempre que tenga suficiente carga. El smartphone también tiene una "
"aplicación de reloj que incluye una alarma. Funciona con una pequeña pila de"
" energía propia que necesita un cargador especializado. Es decir, es "
"bastante difícil de recargar después del cataclismo."

#. ~ Description of "toilet brush"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/generics.json
msgid ""
"The aliens that have invaded Earth cannot be intimidated or humiliated - at "
"least not meaningfully - so this stiff brush is only useful for scouring "
"toilet bowls."
msgstr ""
"Los alienígenas que han invadido la Tierra no pueden ser intimidados o "
"humillados - al menos no de manera significativa - por lo que este cepillo "
"rígido sólo es útil para fregar las tazas de baño."

#. ~ Description of "basketball"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/generics.json
msgid "A high-quality indoor basketball.  You could throw it at your enemies."
msgstr ""
"Una pelota de baloncesto de interior de alta calidad. Podrías lanzarla a tus"
" enemigos."

#. ~ Description of "newspaper page"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/newspaper.json
msgid ""
"A single sheet of newspaper broadsheet.  Most of the information on there is"
" terribly trivial, or out of date, but one thing catches your eye briefly - "
"some things from before the Cataclysm, and some even after."
msgstr ""
"Una sola hoja de periódico de gran formato. La mayor parte de la información"
" es terriblemente trivial, o anticuada, pero una cosa llama la atención "
"brevemente - algunas cosas de antes del Cataclismo, y otras incluso después."

#. ~ Description of gun "longbow"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/ranged.json
msgid ""
"A six-foot wooden bow that takes a fair amount of strength to draw.  It can "
"be used effectively by those of somewhat above-average strength.  Used "
"mainly in medieval England in wartime, but pierces hide just as well as "
"chainmail."
msgstr ""
"Un arco de madera de dos metros que requiere bastante fuerza para tensarse. "
"Puede ser utilizado con eficacia por personas con una fuerza superior a la "
"media. Se utilizaba principalmente en la Inglaterra medieval en tiempos de "
"guerra, pero atraviesa la piel tan bien como la malla."

#. ~ Description of gun "flintlock rifle"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/ranged.json
msgid ""
"This ancient firearm lacks the fire-rate of modern weapons, but packs as "
"much punch as the best of 'em and rewards the skilled shooter with easily-"
"crafted ammunition."
msgstr ""
"Esta antigua arma de fuego carece de la cadencia de fuego de las armas "
"modernas, pero tiene tanta fuerza como las mejores y recompensa al tirador "
"hábil con munición fácil de fabricar."

#. ~ Description of "electric carver (off)"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/tools.json
msgid ""
"An electric meat carver powered by batteries.  Two serrated blades that "
"vibrate together to slice just about anything from turkey to ham… even your "
"enemies!"
msgstr ""
"Un cortador de carne eléctrico que funciona con baterias. Dos cuchillas "
"dentadas que vibran juntas para cortar casi todo, desde el pavo hasta el "
"jamón... ¡incluso a tus enemigos!"

#. ~ Description of "noise emitter (off)"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/tools.json
msgid ""
"This device was constructed by 'enhancing' a speaker ripped off from some "
"electronic device with some amplifier circuits.  It has now no other use "
"beside emitting loud crackling static noise, that could distract an enemy."
msgstr ""
"Este dispositivo fue construido \"mejorando\" un altavoz arrancado de algún "
"dispositivo electrónico con algunos circuitos de amplificación. Ahora no "
"tiene ningún otro uso aparte de emitir un fuerte ruido estático crepitante, "
"que podría distraer a un enemigo."

#. ~ Description of "noise emitter (on)"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/tools.json
msgid ""
"This device has been turned on and is emitting horrible crackles, pops and "
"other static sounds.  Quick, get away from it before it draws enemies to "
"you!"
msgstr ""
"Este dispositivo se ha encendido y está emitiendo horribles crujidos, "
"estallidos y otros sonidos estáticos. ¡Rápido, aléjate de él antes de que "
"atraiga enemigos hacia ti!"

#. ~ Description of "electronic handcuffs"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/tools.json
msgid ""
"A pair of electronic handcuffs, used by automated New Order units to detain captives.  Their continuous siren clearly identifies the wearer as a person of internet and alerts nearby 'safety teams' to their presence.  Wait for their arrival, don't try to escape or to remove the cuffs - they will administer an electric shock.\n"
"However, since capture is out of the question, you're probably in for a painful time, unless you get creative…"
msgstr ""
"Un par de esposas electrónicas, utilizadas por las unidades automatizadas del Nuevo Orden para detener cautivos. Su sirena continua identifica claramente al portador como persona de interés y alerta de su presencia a los \"equipos de seguridad\" cercanos. Espera su llegada, no intentes escapar ni quitarte las esposas - te administrarán una descarga eléctrica.\n"
"Sin embargo, como la captura está segura, probablemente te espera un tiempo doloroso, a menos que seas creativo..."

#. ~ Description of "hedge trimmer (off)"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/tools.json
msgid ""
"A cordless, double-sided, gasoline-powered hedge trimmer.  A long line of "
"sharp-edged teeth extends from the engine; turning the trimmer on will make "
"them rapidly vibrate.  The poor man's chainsaw as far as your enemies are "
"concerned."
msgstr ""
"Un cortasetos sin cable, de doble cara y con motor de gasolina. Del motor "
"sale una larga hilera de dientes afilados que, al encender el cortasetos, "
"vibran rápidamente. La motosierra del pobre en lo que respecta a sus "
"enemigos."

#. ~ Description of "hedge trimmer (on)"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/tools.json
msgid ""
"A cordless, double-sided, gasoline-powered hedge trimmer.  It is currently "
"on, ready to do some alien topiary; use this item to turn it off."
msgstr ""
"Un cortasetos inalámbrico, de doble cara y con motor de gasolina. En este "
"momento está encendida, lista para hacer algún seto extraterrestre; usar "
"para apagar."

#. ~ Description of "circular saw (off)"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/tools.json
msgid ""
"A lightweight handheld cordless circular saw.  Spins a circular blade fast "
"enough to cut wood, aliens, or in an emergency, pizza.  The blade, while "
"effective in combat, is hard to hit with due to its small size."
msgstr ""
"Una ligera sierra circular inalámbrica de mano. Hace girar una cuchilla "
"circular lo suficientemente rápido como para cortar madera, aliens o, en "
"caso de emergencia, pizza. La hoja, aunque es eficaz en combate, es difícil "
"de golpear debido a su pequeño tamaño."

#. ~ Description of "reinforced solar panel"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/vehicle.json
msgid ""
"A solar panel that has been covered with a pane of reinforced glass to "
"protect the delicate solar cells from aliens or errant baseballs.  The glass"
" causes this panel to produce slightly less power than a normal panel.  "
"Useful for a vehicle."
msgstr ""
"Un panel solar que ha sido cubierto con un panel de vidrio reforzado para "
"proteger las delicadas células solares de los extraterrestres o de las bolas"
" de béisbol errantes. El vidrio hace que este panel produzca un poco menos "
"de energía que un panel normal. Es útil para un vehículo."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/vehicle.json
msgid "upgraded reinforced solar panel"
msgid_plural "upgraded reinforced solar panels"
msgstr[0] "panel solar reforzado mejorado"
msgstr[1] "paneles solares reforzados mejorados"
msgstr[2] "paneles solares reforzados mejorados"

#. ~ Description of "upgraded reinforced solar panel"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/vehicle.json
msgid ""
"An upgraded solar panel that has been covered with a pane of reinforced "
"glass to protect the delicate solar cells from aliens or errant baseballs.  "
"The glass causes this panel to produce slightly less power than a normal "
"upgraded panel.  Useful for a vehicle."
msgstr ""
"Un panel solar mejorado que ha sido cubierto con un panel de vidrio "
"reforzado para proteger las delicadas células solares de los extraterrestres"
" o de las bolas de béisbol errantes. El vidrio hace que este panel produzca "
"un poco menos de energía que un panel mejorado normal. Es útil para un "
"vehículo."

#. ~ Description of "lobotomizer"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/weapons.json
msgid ""
"This is a hand-forged collapsible tool that has two axe heads and sharp "
"shovel-like tip on one end.  It can be used as a shovel, or you could chop "
"an enemy up with it instead."
msgstr ""
"Se trata de una herramienta plegable forjada a mano que tiene dos cabezas de"
" hacha y una punta afilada en forma de pala en un extremo. Se puede utilizar"
" como pala o, en su lugar, se puede cortar a un enemigo con ella."

#. ~ Description of "spike on a stick"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/weapons.json
msgid ""
"A flimsy pole made of wood with a basic metal spike tied to it.  It's barely"
" sharp, and crudely constructed, but it will keep an enemy out of arm's "
"reach until you can find something better."
msgstr ""
"Un palo endeble hecho de madera con un pincho metálico básico atado a él. "
"Apenas está afilada y está construida de forma tosca, pero mantendrá a un "
"enemigo fuera del alcance hasta que puedas encontrar algo mejor."

#. ~ Name of starting location "sloc_dks_shelter"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/locations/evac_center.json
msgid "Shelter"
msgstr "Refugio"

#. ~ Description for recipe group
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/locations/evac_center.json
msgid "Field Camp"
msgstr "Campamento"

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_flier"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/fliers.json
msgid "This is an advertisement for a quality-of-life medicine."
msgstr "Esto es un anuncio de una medicina de calidad de vida."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_flier"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/fliers.json
msgid ""
"This is an advertisement for a community initiative by the local police."
msgstr "Este es un anuncio de una iniciativa comunitaria de la policía local."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_flier"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/fliers.json
msgid ""
"This is a hand-drawn flier that has been photocopied for wide distribution."
"  It reads, in what looks like sharpie-bolded letters, \"THEY DON'T WANT YOU"
" TO KNOW.  They KNEW this would happen.  They were watching everything.  "
"They struck a deal even before they landed.\"  There used to be tear-away "
"phone numbers at the bottom, but they're all gone now."
msgstr ""
"Este es un folleto dibujado a mano que ha sido fotocopiado para su amplia "
"distribución. Dice, en lo que parecen letras en negrita, \"ELLOS NO QUIEREN "
"QUE LO SEPAS. Ellos SABIAN que esto pasaría. Lo estaban vigilando todo. "
"Hicieron un trato incluso antes de aterrizar\". En la parte inferior había "
"números de teléfono desprendibles, pero ya no están."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_flier"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/fliers.json
msgid ""
"This is a government-issued, air-dropped alert.  \"EVACUATE IMMEDIATELY.  "
"Proceed to your closest FEMA operated community shelter to await police and "
"military escort to safety.\""
msgstr ""
"Esta es una alerta emitida por el gobierno y lanzada desde el aire. "
"\"EVACÚEN INMEDIATAMENTE. Diríjanse a su refugio comunitario más cercano "
"operado por FEMA para esperar la escolta policial y militar a un lugar "
"seguro\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_flier"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/fliers.json
msgid ""
"This is a government-issued, air-dropped alert.  \"EVACUATE IMMEDIATELY.  "
"Police and military forces have been dispatched to your area and will help "
"escort you to safety.\""
msgstr ""
"Esta es una alerta emitida por el gobierno, lanzada desde el aire. \"EVACÚEN"
" INMEDIATAMENTE. La policía y las fuerzas militares han sido enviadas a su "
"área y les escoltarán a la seguridad.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_flier"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/fliers.json
msgid ""
"This is a government-issued, air-dropped alert.  \"EVACUATION ALERT.  Please"
" make your way to the nearest FEMA evacuation shelter.    Seek protection "
"from police and military forces if traveling in groups.\""
msgstr ""
"Esta es una alerta emitida por el gobierno, lanzada desde el aire. \"ALERTA "
"DE EVACUACIÓN. Por favor, diríjanse al refugio de evacuación de la FEMA más "
"cercano. Busquen la protección de la policía y las fuerzas militares si "
"viajan en grupo\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_flier"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/fliers.json
msgid ""
"This is a government-issued, air-dropped alert.  \"EVACUATION ALERT.  Please"
" make your way to the nearest FEMA evacuation shelter.  Travel in groups and"
" avoid crowds.  Avoid hostile forces at all costs.\""
msgstr ""
"Esta es una alerta emitida por el gobierno, lanzada desde el aire. \"ALERTA "
"DE EVACUACIÓN. Por favor, diríjanse al refugio de evacuación de FEMA más "
"cercano. Viajen en grupos y eviten las multitudes. Evite las fuerzas "
"hostiles a toda costa\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_flier"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/fliers.json
msgid ""
"This is a glossy, high quality flier.  \"What they don't want you to know!  "
"Reading this may save your life.\"  Inside is a series of warnings "
"recommending people avoid infrastructure, state roads, and to exercise "
"discretion when making contact with any police or military forces, as they "
"might be rogue.  Pictured is a group of police officers holding a couple at "
"gunpoint."
msgstr ""
"Este es un folleto brillante y de alta calidad. \"¡Lo que no quieren que "
"sepas! Leer esto puede salvar tu vida\". En el interior hay una serie de "
"advertencias que recomiendan a la gente que evite las infraestructuras y las"
" carreteras estatales, y que actúe con discreción al entrar en contacto con "
"cualquier fuerza policial o militar, ya que podrían tratarse de "
"delincuentes. En la foto aparece un grupo de policías que retiene a una "
"pareja a punta de pistola."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_flier"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/fliers.json
msgid ""
"This is a glossy advertisement from FEMA asking that people donate their "
"canned goods in return for tax write-offs.  From the date on the flier, it "
"doesn't look like the initiative ever had time to get off the ground."
msgstr ""
"Este es un brillante anuncio de la FEMA en el que se pide que la gente done "
"sus productos enlatados a cambio de desgravaciones fiscales. Por la fecha "
"del folleto, no parece que la iniciativa haya tenido tiempo de despegar."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_flier"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/fliers.json
msgid ""
"This is an advertisement for a local electronics store, dated a few weeks "
"before the evacuation order.  \"Sale on smartphones and refurbished laptops "
"at DigiMart, three days only!\""
msgstr ""
"Este es un anuncio de una tienda local de electrónica, fechado unas semanas "
"antes de la orden de evacuación. \"Rebajas en smartphones y portátiles "
"reacondicionados en DigiMart, ¡solo tres días!\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_flier"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/fliers.json
msgid ""
"This is an advertisement for a local gun shop.  It shows a picture of a "
"target bullseye with most of the shots having landed somewhere near the "
"center.  The caption reads:  \"Protect yourself!  Come in and practice "
"today!\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_flier"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/fliers.json
msgid ""
"This is a flier for pet food, with a cute animal performing a silly trick."
msgstr ""
"Este es un folleto de comida para mascotas, con un simpático animal haciendo"
" un truco tonto."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_flier"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/fliers.json
msgid ""
"This is an advertisement for a portable generator, the kind that was "
"becoming popular in the face of increasing natural disasters before the "
"invasion."
msgstr ""
"Este es un anuncio de un generador portátil, del tipo que se estaba "
"popularizando ante el aumento de las catástrofes naturales antes de la "
"invasión."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_flier"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/fliers.json
msgid ""
"This is a public notice from a local police department encouraging citizens "
"to pack their supplies before their designated evacuation date to ensure "
"faster transit."
msgstr ""
"Este es un aviso público de un departamento de policía local en el que se "
"anima a los ciudadanos a preparar sus provisiones antes de la fecha de "
"evacuación designada para garantizar un tránsito más rápido."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_flier"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/fliers.json
msgid ""
"This is a public alert from the Centers for Disease Control.  Its message, "
"repeated in several languages, reads: PUBLIC HEALTH ALERT: Due to recent "
"events, the CDC is issuing a warning to avoid public areas and spaces.  The "
"CDC would like to remind the public to cover your nose and mouth when "
"sneezing, wash your hands frequently, and receive an up-to-date flu shot if "
"possible.  Boiling water is recommended until further notice."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una alerta pública de los Centros de Control de Enfermedades. Su "
"mensaje, repetido en varios idiomas, dice: ALERTA DE SALUD PÚBLICA: Debido a"
" los recientes acontecimientos, el CDC está emitiendo una advertencia para "
"evitar áreas y espacios públicos. El CDC quieren recordar al público que se "
"cubra la nariz y la boca al estornudar, que se lave las manos con frecuencia"
" y que se ponga al día con la vacuna de la gripe si es posible. Se "
"recomienda hervir el agua hasta nuevo aviso."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_flier"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/fliers.json
msgid ""
"This is a public alert from the Federal Emergency Management Agency.  Its "
"message, repeated in several languages, reads: STAY IN YOUR HOMES!  All "
"residents of the New England Disaster Area are advised to shelter in place "
"wherever possible.  The United States Armed Forces are working to secure the"
" area.  If there is a nearby evacuation shelter you can get to safely, you "
"are recommended to do so.  Otherwise, stay in your homes until authorized "
"personnel evacuate you to a secured facility.  Thank you for your "
"compliance."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una alerta pública de la Agencia Federal de Gestión de Emergencias. "
"Su mensaje, repetido en varios idiomas, dice: ¡PERMANEZCAN EN SUS CASAS! Se "
"aconseja a todos los residentes de la zona de catástrofe de Nueva Inglaterra"
" que se refugien en su lugar siempre que sea posible. Las Fuerzas Armadas de"
" los Estados Unidos están trabajando para asegurar la zona. Si hay un "
"refugio de evacuación cercano al que puedan llegar con seguridad, se les "
"recomienda que lo hagan. De lo contrario, permanezcan en sus casas hasta que"
" el personal autorizado les evacue a un lugar seguro. Gracias por su "
"aceptación."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_flier"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/fliers.json
msgid ""
"This is a public alert from the Federal Emergency Management Agency.  Its "
"message, repeated in several languages, consists of a list of towns serving "
"as major evacuation points from the hot zones.  Someone has scribbled off "
"most of the town names, and scrawled \"OVERRUN\" next to each one."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una alerta pública de la Agencia Federal de Gestión de Emergencias. "
"Su mensaje, repetido en varios idiomas, consiste en una lista de ciudades "
"que sirven como puntos principales de evacuación de las zonas calientes. "
"Alguien ha tachado la mayoría de los nombres de las ciudades y ha "
"garabateado \" SOBRECARGADO \" al lado de cada una de ellas."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_flier"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/fliers.json
msgid ""
"This is a public warning from an unnamed source.  Its rambling message, "
"poorly-photocopied onto both sides of the page, reads: Don't believe the "
"lies!  The Army cannot stop them.  They prefer us alive but have no quams "
"about killing anyone who RESISTS.  Secure supplies and escape while there is"
" still time."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una advertencia pública de una fuente no identificada. Su mensaje "
"incoherente, mal fotocopiado en ambos lados de la página, dice: ¡No creas "
"las mentiras! El ejército no puede detenerlos. Nos prefieren vivos, pero no "
"tienen reparos en matar a cualquiera que se resista. Asegura provisiones y "
"escapa mientras haya tiempo."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_flier"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/fliers.json
msgid ""
"This is a public warning from the Federal Government.  Its brief message, "
"repeated in several languages, reads:  The President of the United States "
"has declared unilateral martial law to be in effect in response to the "
"ongoing national crisis.  Continue to shelter in place until evacuated to an"
" appropriate emergency management camp by authorized military personnel.  A "
"24-hour curfew has been established.  This curfew will remain in effect "
"until further notice.  Stay indoors to avoid friendly fire."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una advertencia pública del Gobierno Federal. Su breve mensaje, "
"repetido en varios idiomas, dice: El Presidente de los Estados Unidos ha "
"declarado la ley marcial unilateral en respuesta a la crisis nacional en "
"curso. Continúen refugiándose en su lugar hasta que sean evacuados a un "
"campamento de gestión de emergencias apropiado por personal militar "
"autorizado. Se ha establecido un toque de queda de 24 horas. Este toque de "
"queda permanecerá en vigor hasta nuevo aviso. Permanezcan en el interior "
"para evitar el fuego amigo."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_flier"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/fliers.json
msgid ""
"This is an advertisement for Galaxybux coffee.  The smiling, feminine alien "
"mascot seems a little inappropriate now."
msgstr ""
"Este es un anuncio de café Galaxybux. La sonriente y femenina mascota "
"alienígena parece un poco inapropiada ahora."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_flier"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/fliers.json
msgid ""
"This is a public alert from the Federal Emergency Management Agency.  Its "
"message, repeated in several languages, consists of a list of towns serving "
"as major evacuation points from the hot zones."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una alerta pública de la Agencia Federal para el Manejo de "
"Emergencias (FEMA). Su mensaje, repetido en varios idiomas, consiste en una "
"lista de pueblos que funcionan como puntos de evacuación las zonas "
"complicadas."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_flier"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/fliers.json
msgid ""
"This is a propaganda poster from only a few weeks before the evacuation "
"orders.  A parent dressed in military fatigues hugs their partner goodbye as"
" their smiling children look on.  \"Enlist today.  Take your freedom in your"
" own hands.\""
msgstr ""
"Este es un cartel de propaganda de sólo unas semanas antes de las órdenes de"
" evacuación. Un padre vestido con traje militar se despide de su pareja ante"
" la mirada sonriente de sus hijos. \"Alístate hoy. Toma tu libertad en tus "
"manos\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_flier"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/fliers.json
msgid ""
"This is a propaganda poster from only a few weeks before the evacuation "
"orders.  A handsome looking person dressed in military fatigues exercises "
"along with several other people.  \"Enlist today.\""
msgstr ""
"Este es un cartel de propaganda de sólo unas semanas antes de las órdenes de"
" evacuación. Una persona de aspecto apuesto, vestida con traje militar, se "
"ejercita junto a otras personas. \"Alístate hoy\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_flier"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/fliers.json
msgid ""
"This is a propaganda poster from only a few weeks before the evacuation "
"orders.  Someone in military fatigues is helping someone who has fallen "
"stand up.  \"Enlist today and become a community leader.\""
msgstr ""
"Este es un cartel de propaganda de sólo unas semanas antes de las órdenes de"
" evacuación. Una persona con uniforme militar ayuda a levantarse a alguien "
"que se ha caído. \"Alístese hoy y conviértase en un líder de la comunidad\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_flier"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/fliers.json
msgid ""
"This is an advertisement that looks like it came right out of Silicon "
"Valley.  'Space age aesthetic' is written in cursive script underneath a "
"picture of some sleek but practically useless home gadget."
msgstr ""
"Este es un anuncio que parece salido de Silicon Valley. \"Estética de la era"
" espacial\" está escrito en letra cursiva debajo de una imagen de un aparato"
" doméstico elegante pero prácticamente inútil."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_flier"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/fliers.json
msgid ""
"FEELING BLUE?  Try \"Greens\" for Magazines!  Your local Supermarket!  "
"Nothing cheers you up like a good magazine… unless it's JUNK FOOD!  Or why "
"not buy an MP3 PLAYER or a GAME CONSOLE?  Chase those blues away at GREENS "
"Supermarket"
msgstr ""
"¿TE SIENTES AZUL? ¡Prueba con \"Verdes\" para revistas! ¡Tu supermercado "
"local! Nada te anima más que una buena revista... ¡A menos que sea COMIDA "
"BASURA! ¿O por qué no compras un REPRODUCTOR MP3 o una CONSOLA DE JUEGOS? "
"Persigue a esos azules en el Supermercado de los VERDES"

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_flier"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/fliers.json
msgid ""
"\"The Nintendy Flip!  Play your games anywhere!\" Following is an "
"illustration of several people playing their games in unlikely places, using"
" the titular gaming device."
msgstr ""
"\"¡El Nintendy Flip! Juega a tus juegos en cualquier lugar\". A continuación"
" se muestra una ilustración de varias personas jugando a sus juegos en "
"lugares inverosímiles, utilizando el dispositivo anteriormente mencionado."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_flier"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/fliers.json
msgid ""
"JOIN THE CONCERNED CONSUMERS OF FOODPEOPLE!  Join the fight to…\n"
" - Stop the neutralization of cultural icons.\n"
" - Endow Foodperson with vitals befitting heroics superb.\n"
" - Protect RU-238 and other FRUIT flavors from the threat of prohibition.\n"
" - Inspire future consumers of the superhero genre."
msgstr ""
"¡ÚNETE A LOS CONSUMIDORES PREOCUPADOS DE GENTECOMIDA! Únete a la lucha para⋯\n"
"- Detener la neutralización de los iconos culturales.\n"
"- Dotar a Personacomida de unas cualidades vitales dignas de los héroes más importantes.\n"
"- Proteger el RU-238 y otros sabores FRUTA de la amenaza de la prohibición.\n"
"- Inspirar a los futuros consumidores en el género de los superhéroes."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_flier"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/fliers.json
msgid ""
"Printed on this glossy piece of paper is a picture of someone firing a "
"rocket launcher at a massive robot.  The word \"RESIST\" is printed just "
"below it."
msgstr ""
"En este papel brillante hay una imagen de alguien disparando un lanzacohetes"
" a un enorme robot. La palabra \"RESISTIR\" está impresa justo debajo."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_general_graffiti_snippets"
#. ~ This graffiti is generally assumed to come from before the Cataclysm
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/graffiti.json
msgid "This is a cartoon rendition of an alien."
msgstr "Esta es una interpretación de dibujos animados de un alienígena."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_general_graffiti_snippets"
#. ~ This graffiti is generally assumed to come from before the Cataclysm
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/graffiti.json
msgid "This is a crudely spray-painted tag adorned with skulls."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una etiqueta crudamente pintada con spray y adornada con cráneos."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_general_graffiti_snippets"
#. ~ This graffiti is generally assumed to come from before the Cataclysm
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/graffiti.json
msgid "This is a spray-painted drawing of an angel with wings made of vines."
msgstr ""
"Este es un dibujo pintado con spray de un ángel con alas de enredaderas."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_general_graffiti_snippets"
#. ~ This graffiti is generally assumed to come from before the Cataclysm
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/graffiti.json
msgid "This is a simple spray-painted graphic of a forest made of bones."
msgstr ""
"Este es un simple gráfico pintado con spray de un bosque hecho de huesos."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_general_graffiti_snippets"
#. ~ This graffiti is generally assumed to come from before the Cataclysm
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/graffiti.json
msgid "This is a drawing of an alien with a bullet hole in its head."
msgstr ""
"Este es un dibujo de un alienígena con un agujero de bala en la cabeza.Este "
"es un dibujo de un alienígena con un agujero de bala en la cabeza."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_general_graffiti_snippets"
#. ~ This graffiti is generally assumed to come from before the Cataclysm
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/graffiti.json
msgid "eyes to the skies"
msgstr "ojos a los cielos"

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_general_graffiti_snippets"
#. ~ This graffiti is generally assumed to come from before the Cataclysm
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/graffiti.json
msgid ""
"This is a spray-painting of an anatomically unlikely woman wearing very "
"little."
msgstr ""
"Esto es una imagen en spray de una mujer anatómicamente incorrecta que viste"
" muy poco."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_shelter_graffiti_snippets"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/graffiti.json
msgid "THAT'S NO RESCUE BUS"
msgstr "ESE NO ES UN BUS DE RESCATE"

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_shelter_graffiti_snippets"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/graffiti.json
msgid "LAST STOP"
msgstr "ÚLTIMA PARADA"

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_shelter_graffiti_snippets"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/graffiti.json
msgid ""
"This is a far-too-detailed drawing the inside of an alien craft, in all its "
"biomechanical horror."
msgstr ""
"Este es un dibujo demasiado detallado del interior de una fabricación "
"alienígena, en todo su horror biomecánico."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_shelter_graffiti_snippets"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/graffiti.json
msgid ""
"This is a quick rendition in permanent marker of an alien craft with war "
"machines spilling out of it.  Underneath, it reads \"What did we do to "
"deserve this?\""
msgstr ""
"Se trata de una rápida representación con rotulador permanente de una "
"fabricación alienígena de la que salen máquinas de guerra. Debajo se lee "
"\"¿Qué hemos hecho para merecer esto?\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_shelter_graffiti_snippets"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/graffiti.json
msgid "NEW GODS"
msgstr "NUEVOS DIOSES"

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_shelter_graffiti_snippets"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/graffiti.json
msgid ""
"<given_name> I couldn't wait any longer, went to cabin.  Meet me there.  "
"Love <given_name>."
msgstr ""
"<given_name> yo no podía esperar más, fui a la cabaña. Encuéntrame allí. Con"
" amor <given_name>."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_shelter_graffiti_snippets"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/graffiti.json
msgid "\"keep moving their looking for us\" is written here in a hasty scrawl."
msgstr ""
"\"Sigue moviéndote nos estan buscando\" está escrito aquí en un garabato "
"apresurado."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_shelter_graffiti_snippets"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/graffiti.json
msgid "EARTH WASN'T THE FIRST"
msgstr "LA TIERRA NO ES LA PRIMERA"

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_shelter_graffiti_snippets"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/graffiti.json
msgid "seven hour war"
msgstr "guerra de las siete horas"

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_shelter_graffiti_snippets"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/graffiti.json
msgid "FUCK COPS"
msgstr "QUE SE JODAN LOS POLICIAS"

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_shelter_graffiti_snippets"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/graffiti.json
msgid "gray dawn"
msgstr "amanecer gris"

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_shelter_graffiti_snippets"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/graffiti.json
msgid "they can't read english communicate below:"
msgstr "no saben leer el inglés comuniquense a continuación:"

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_many_years_old_news"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/newspaper.json
msgid ""
"DISASTER IN THE SARITANIA MINES!  A copper mine west of Saritania, a small "
"town in Vermont, collapsed Wednesday, killing an estimated thirty miners in "
"the disaster.  Local officials could not be reached for comment, despite the"
" mine being Saritania's primary industry."
msgstr ""
"DESASTRE EN LAS MINAS DE SARITANIA Una mina de cobre al oeste de Saritania, "
"una pequeña ciudad de Vermont, se derrumbó el miércoles, matando a unos "
"treinta mineros en el desastre. No fue posible contactar con las autoridades"
" locales para que hicieran comentarios, a pesar de que la mina es la "
"principal industria de Saritania."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_many_years_old_news"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/newspaper.json
msgid ""
"EDITORIAL: MORE HOMES NEED GUNS.  While visiting a friend recently, our "
"conversation turned to gun control, and I was shocked to learn that my close"
" friend didn't own a firearm.  In this day and age, not having a weapon in "
"your home shows an appalling lack of personal safety, and I told him so.  "
"Weapons that can kill are our only hope against other people armed "
"similarly.  I see a utopia of honest citizens keeping each other honest by "
"being armed."
msgstr ""
"EDITORIAL: MÁS HOGARES NECESITAN ARMAS. Mientras visitaba a un amigo "
"recientemente, nuestra conversación giró en torno al control de las armas, y"
" me sorprendió saber que mi íntimo amigo no poseía un arma de fuego. En los "
"tiempos que corren, no tener un arma en casa demuestra una terrible falta de"
" seguridad personal, y así se lo dije. Las armas que pueden matar son "
"nuestra única esperanza contra otras personas armadas de forma similar. Veo "
"una utopía de ciudadanos honestos que se mantienen honestos entre sí estando"
" armados."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_many_years_old_news"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/newspaper.json
msgid ""
"ATOMIC DEREGULATION?  President Toffer announced to a mixed crowd today that"
" he had sponsored a bill to deregulate public use of radioactive compounds, "
"allowing more widespread use of low-grade radioactive compounds in home "
"appliances.  \"Plutonium is the greenest energy we have,\" he told an "
"assembled press.  \"It's time we got over our fear and moved into the "
"light.\"  The future of the environment is expected to be a hot campaign "
"issue this year as election season rolls up."
msgstr ""
"¿DESREGULACIÓN ATÓMICA? El presidente Toffer ha anunciado hoy ante una "
"multitud heterogénea que ha patrocinado un proyecto de ley para desregular "
"el uso público de los compuestos radiactivos, permitiendo un uso más "
"generalizado de los compuestos radiactivos de bajo grado en los aparatos "
"domésticos. \"El plutonio es la energía más verde que tenemos\", dijo a la "
"prensa reunida. \"Es hora de que superemos el miedo y salgamos a la luz\". "
"Se espera que el futuro del medio ambiente sea un tema candente en la "
"campaña electoral de este año."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_many_years_old_news"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/newspaper.json
msgid ""
"NUCLEAR BLUES.  Just this morning, President Toffer expressed disappointment"
" in the final draft in the controversial \"21st Century Nuclear Innovation "
"Act\" that was just passed through the House today, \"establishing new FDA "
"procedures for the regulation of radiation\" among other things.  \"Mark my "
"words,\"  Toffer said during a press conference.  \"Today is the day that "
"America turned to darkness.\""
msgstr ""
"NUCLEAR BLUES. Esta misma mañana, el presidente Toffer ha expresado su "
"decepción por el borrador final de la controvertida \"Ley de Innovación "
"Nuclear del Siglo XXI\" que acaba de ser aprobada hoy en la Cámara de "
"Representantes, y que \"establece nuevos procedimientos de la FDA para la "
"regulación de la radiación\", entre otras cosas. \"Recuerden mis palabras\","
" dijo Toffer durante una conferencia de prensa. \"Hoy es el día en que "
"Estados Unidos se volvió a la oscuridad\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_years_old_news"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/newspaper.json
msgid ""
"STUDENT MISSING: A high school student vanished yesterday evening in the "
"forest near Wayland.  The 17-year-old international student from China (who "
"adopted the anglicized nickname \"Brett\" due to his classmates' difficulty "
"pronouncing his given name) was last seen with his friends in the camp.  "
"\"Brett said that he was gonna get some firewood but he never came back,\" "
"said his classmate, Jianxiang Wang.  The search is underway."
msgstr ""
"ESTUDIANTE DESAPARECIDO: Un estudiante de secundaria desapareció ayer por la"
" tarde en el bosque cerca de Wayland. El estudiante internacional de 17 años"
" de China (que adoptó el apodo anglicista \"Brett\" debido a la dificultad "
"de sus compañeros para pronunciar su nombre de pila) fue visto por última "
"vez con sus amigos en el campamento. \"Brett dijo que iba a buscar leña pero"
" nunca regresó\", dijo su compañero de clase, Jianxiang Wang. La búsqueda "
"está en marcha."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_years_old_news"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/newspaper.json
msgid ""
"STILL SEARCHING: The search for Brett, the high school student who went "
"missing three days ago, is still ongoing.  \"He could have played in the "
"soccer game against Weston High School yesterday,\" Brett's sorrowful "
"teammate said, \"[..] we've never stopped praying.\"  Despite the best "
"efforts of the County Search & Rescue, Brett had still not been located at "
"the time of this report."
msgstr ""
"TODAVIA EN BÚSQUEDA: La búsqueda de Brett, el estudiante de secundaria que "
"desapareció hace tres días, sigue en curso. \"Podría haber jugado en el "
"partido de fútbol contra Weston High School ayer\", dijo un afligido "
"compañero de equipo de Brett, \"[...] nunca hemos dejado de rezar\". A pesar"
" de los esfuerzos del departamento de búsqueda y rescate del condado, Brett "
"aún no ha sido localizado en el momento de este reporte."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_years_old_news"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/newspaper.json
msgid ""
"POPULAR 'ALIEN AUTOPSY' DEBUNKED.  A widely circulated video, making the "
"rounds everywhere from FriendFace to television news, has been debunked as a"
" fake.  This extremely realistic and graphic alien autopsy shows an insect-"
"like creature being dismantled by Japanese researchers, who comment on its "
"anatomy in Japanese throughout the video.  Yesterday, on the popular social "
"media website Eddit, a 'making of' video was posted, clearly exposing the "
"work as the final film project of a small group of students at UCLA."
msgstr ""
"LA POPULAR \"AUTOPSIA ALIENÍGENA\" DESMENTIDA. Se ha desmontado un vídeo muy"
" difundido, que circula por todas partes, desde FriendFace hasta las "
"noticias de televisión, y que es falso. Esta autopsia alienígena, "
"extremadamente realista y gráfica, muestra a una criatura parecida a un "
"insecto siendo desmontada por investigadores japoneses, que comentan su "
"anatomía en japonés a lo largo del vídeo. Ayer, en el popular sitio web de "
"redes sociales Eddit, se publicó un vídeo del \"Como se hizo\", que expone "
"claramente que la obra es el proyecto cinematográfico final de un pequeño "
"grupo de estudiantes de la UCLA."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_years_old_news"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/newspaper.json
msgid ""
"BIG BREAK.  At the pressure of tech moguls like Elton Moosek, a new "
"bipartisan bill has set aside a big boost for long underfunded NASA.  \"It's"
" time we started looking at opportunities beyond our own atmosphere,\" says "
"a spokesperson for Edison Automotives.  This space fad is no doubt tied to a"
" new collaborative in the tech industry, secretively nicknamed \"Project "
"Bluebox.\""
msgstr ""
"GRAN APERTURA. Ante la presión de magnates de la tecnología como Elton "
"Moosek, un nuevo proyecto de ley bipartidista ha reservado un gran impulso "
"para la NASA, que lleva mucho tiempo sin recibir fondos. \"Es hora de que "
"empecemos a buscar oportunidades más allá de nuestra propia atmósfera\", "
"dice un portavoz de Edison Automotives. Esta moda espacial está sin duda "
"ligada a una nueva colaboración en la industria tecnológica, apodada en "
"secreto \"Proyecto CajaAzul\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_one_year_old_news"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/newspaper.json
msgid ""
"READY FOR THE WORST.  In response to growing public concern about a "
"potential attack from China and increased prevalence of natural disasters, "
"President Loft announced a major funding initiative for the construction of "
"FEMA-supported community shelters near major population sites.  \"These "
"shelters will provide a much-needed near safety points in an emergency,\" "
"said a spokesperson for FEMA.  \"In short, they are public survivalist "
"bunkers, fitted with food, water, and clothing for any number of natural "
"disasters in the foreseeable future.  We've very excited about this "
"initiative.\""
msgstr ""
"PREPARADOS PARA LO PEOR En respuesta a la creciente preocupación pública por"
" un posible ataque de China y el aumento de la prevalencia de las "
"catástrofes naturales, el presidente Loft anunció una importante iniciativa "
"de financiación para la construcción de refugios comunitarios con el apoyo "
"de la FEMA cerca de los principales núcleos de población. \"Estos refugios "
"proporcionarán un punto de seguridad cercano muy necesario en caso de "
"emergencia\", dijo un portavoz de la FEMA. \"En resumen, son búnkeres "
"públicos de supervivencialistas, equipados con alimentos, agua y ropa para "
"cualquier número de desastres naturales en el futuro previsible. Estamos muy"
" ilusionados con esta iniciativa\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_one_year_old_news"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/newspaper.json
msgid ""
"TURNING UP THE HEAT: New statistics suggest the average temperature in New "
"England has climbed several degrees in the last two years.  \"No doubt crops"
" are going to start suffering unless something is done,\" said an expert."
msgstr ""
"SUBIENDO EL CALOR: Nuevas estadísticas sugieren que la temperatura media en "
"Nueva Inglaterra ha subido varios grados en los últimos dos años. \"Sin "
"duda, los cultivos van a empezar a sufrir si no se hace algo\", dijo un "
"experto."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_one_year_old_news"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/newspaper.json
msgid ""
"EDITORIAL: THIS IS WHERE 'ME TOO' ENDS UP.  It's been a while now since 'Me "
"Too' swept the message boards of our nation, but its repercussions are felt "
"every day.  Disconnected from our identities and our heritage by the "
"overwhelming urge to suppress the white male and hide his every achievement,"
" American citizens are turning to violence to find a place of belonging.  "
"Mark my words: within a year, there will be a reckoning, and it won't be "
"caused by the trade war, it will be from the broken heart of America."
msgstr ""
"EDITORIAL: AQUÍ ES DONDE TERMINA EL 'ME TOO'. Ya ha pasado un tiempo desde "
"que el \"Me Too\" arrasó en los tablones de anuncios de nuestra nación, pero"
" sus repercusiones se sienten cada día. Desconectados de nuestras "
"identidades y de nuestra herencia por el abrumador impulso de suprimir al "
"hombre blanco y ocultar todos sus logros, los ciudadanos estadounidenses "
"están recurriendo a la violencia para encontrar un lugar de pertenencia. "
"Recuerden mis palabras: dentro de un año, habrá un ajuste de cuentas, y no "
"será causado por la guerra comercial, sino por el corazón roto de Estados "
"Unidos."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_one_year_old_news"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/newspaper.json
msgid ""
"EDITORIAL: THE RISE OF THE RIGHT HAS BROUGHT US HERE.  As the wounded white "
"male ego becomes more and more of a self-stereotype, we see the cost of "
"allowing right-wing sentiment echoed all around us.  A stricter stance on "
"gun control, workplace discrimination, and domestic terrorist groups must be"
" taken if our most marginalized populations are to survive the next year.  "
"Everyone is affected by these sorts of issues."
msgstr ""
"EDITORIAL: EL ASCENSO DE LA DERECHA NOS HA TRAÍDO HASTA AQUÍ. A medida que "
"el ego del hombre blanco herido se convierte cada vez más en un "
"autoestereotipo, vemos el coste de permitir que el sentimiento de la derecha"
" se haga eco a nuestro alrededor. Hay que adoptar una postura más estricta "
"en cuanto al control de armas, la discriminación en el lugar de trabajo y "
"los grupos terroristas domésticos si queremos que nuestras poblaciones más "
"marginadas sobrevivan el próximo año. Todo el mundo se ve afectado por este "
"tipo de cuestiones."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_one_year_old_news"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/newspaper.json
msgid ""
"NEW LAB OPENS: The Messier Research Facility has been officially opened by "
"NASA right here in New England.  According to Deputy Administer Sophie "
"Perla, \"This state of the art facility will catapult us back onto the world"
" stage.  With the opening of the Messier research complex, New England has a"
" starry future ahead of it.\""
msgstr ""
"INAUGURACIÓN DEL NUEVO LABORATORIO: La NASA ha inaugurado oficialmente el "
"Centro de Investigación Messier aquí mismo, en Nueva Inglaterra. Según la "
"administradora adjunta Sophie Perla, \"esta instalación de vanguardia nos "
"catapultará de nuevo a la escena mundial. Con la apertura del complejo de "
"investigación Messier, Nueva Inglaterra tiene un futuro estelar por "
"delante\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_one_year_old_news"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/newspaper.json
msgid ""
"'SPACE AGE AESTHETIC'.  After much buzz in the tech world about \"Project "
"Bluebox\", a new line of what is being termed as 'space-age aesthetic' "
"products have been demoed to a select group of potential investors, "
"particularly NASA administrators.  \"The public can look forward to new "
"cutting edge devices hitting the shelves within a year.  Prepare to have "
"your horizons broadened.\" a spokesperson said mysteriously this Monday, "
"standing in front of a display case with heavily tinted glass."
msgstr ""
"ESTÉTICA DE LA ERA ESPACIAL. Después de mucho ruido en el mundo de la "
"tecnología sobre el \"Proyecto CajaAzul\", una nueva línea de lo que se "
"denomina \"estética de la era espacial\" ha sido demostrada a un grupo "
"selecto de potenciales inversores, en particular administradores de la NASA."
" \"El público puede esperar que los nuevos dispositivos de vanguardia "
"lleguen a las estanterías dentro de un año. Prepárense para ampliar sus "
"horizontes\", dijo misteriosamente un portavoz este lunes, de pie frente a "
"una vitrina con cristales muy tintados."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_one_year_old_news"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/newspaper.json
msgid ""
"SAFETY IN YOUR OWN BACKYARD.  Growing tensions amid an unstable geopolitical"
" situation and trouble at home has led President Loft to support funding "
"increases for domestic security, as well as new \"green\" initiates now "
"being championed by many private sector industries.  New military "
"installations are to be built across the nation, bundled alongside similarly"
" ambitious budget increases for FEMA and scientific research in response to "
"climate change.  Civil rights organizations are purportedly mixed on the "
"decision, calling it \"two steps forward, one step back.\""
msgstr ""
"SEGURIDAD EN SU PROPIO PATIO. Las crecientes tensiones en medio de una "
"situación geopolítica inestable y los problemas en casa han llevado al "
"presidente Loft a apoyar el aumento de la financiación de la seguridad "
"nacional, así como las nuevas iniciativas \"verdes\" que ahora defienden "
"muchas industrias del sector privado. Se van a construir nuevas "
"instalaciones militares en todo el país, junto con aumentos presupuestarios "
"igualmente ambiciosos para la FEMA y la investigación científica en "
"respuesta al cambio climático. Las organizaciones de derechos civiles están "
"supuestamente mezcladas con la decisión, calificándola de \"dos pasos "
"adelante, un paso atrás\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_months_old_news"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/newspaper.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"SUPPORT THE COUNTRIES THAT SUPPORT YOURS: Washington has announced the "
"deployment of additional soldiers to key locations in East Asia following "
"Chinese joint military exercises with North Korea.  \"We pledge our support "
"to our allies, no matter where they are,\" the president said today in a "
"press statement.  Our survey results show that the public is more than 56% "
"in favor of a war with China, up 2% from where it was last month."
msgstr ""
"APOYE A LOS PAÍSES QUE APOYAN A LOS SUYOS: Washington ha anunciado el "
"despliegue de más soldados en lugares clave de Asia Oriental tras las "
"maniobras militares conjuntas de China con Corea del Norte. \"Nos "
"comprometemos a apoyar a nuestros aliados, estén donde estén\", dijo hoy el "
"presidente en una declaración de prensa. Los resultados de nuestra encuesta "
"muestran que el público está más del 56% a favor de una guerra con China, un"
" 2% más que el mes pasado."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_months_old_news"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/newspaper.json
msgid ""
"EVACS UNDER STRESS.  Following a recent string of devastating weather-"
"related natural disasters, FEMA sponsored community shelters are under "
"significant stress to stay in stock as the public flocks to their safety.  "
"\"We're going to have to start finding new, cost efficient ways to fill "
"those lockers with filling food and warm clothes,\" said FEMA spokesperson "
"Quinn Wright.  \"There's no way that we can keep this up with what we have "
"right now.\""
msgstr ""
"LOS REFUGIOS BAJO PRESIÓN. Tras la reciente serie de devastadoras "
"catástrofes naturales relacionadas con el clima, los refugios comunitarios "
"patrocinados por la FEMA están sometidos a una gran presión para mantener "
"sus existencias mientras el público acude en masa a su seguridad. \"Vamos a "
"tener que empezar a encontrar formas nuevas y rentables de llenar esos "
"armarios con comida y ropa de abrigo\", dijo el portavoz de FEMA, Quinn "
"Wright. \"No hay manera de que podamos mantener esto con lo que tenemos "
"ahora mismo\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_months_old_news"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/newspaper.json
msgid ""
"DO THEY WALK AMONG US?  A tenfold spike in sightings of unexplained "
"phenomena, particularly fantastic beasts and monsters, presents an "
"interesting case for sociologists.  \"This could be related to the recent "
"popularity of science-fiction and ghost hunting shows,\" said Dr. Sammantha "
"Williamson in an interview.  \"During times of stress, it's not unusual for "
"people to start telling stories about the paranormal.  It happened in the "
"Cold War with the growing UFO phenomena and the stories about CIA telepathy "
"experiments, for example.  People need things to take their mind off the "
"world.\""
msgstr ""
"¿ANDAN ENTRE NOSOTROS? El hecho de que se haya multiplicado por diez el "
"número de avistamientos de fenómenos inexplicables, sobre todo de bestias y "
"monstruos fantásticos, supone un caso interesante para los sociólogos. "
"\"Esto podría estar relacionado con la reciente popularidad de los programas"
" de ciencia-ficción y de caza fantasmas\", afirma la doctora Sammantha "
"Williamson en una entrevista. \"En épocas de estrés, no es raro que la gente"
" empiece a contar historias sobre lo paranormal. Sucedió en la Guerra Fría "
"con el creciente fenómeno de los ovnis y las historias sobre los "
"experimentos de telepatía de la CIA, por ejemplo. La gente necesita cosas "
"para distraerse del mundo\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_months_old_news"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/newspaper.json
msgid ""
"EDITORIAL: HOME CANNING NEEDS TO MAKE A COMEBACK.  With food security in "
"question after another severe drought and nationwide wildfires this year, I "
"think it's clear we all need to get out Grandma's old books, and learn how "
"to can again.  Grocery stores could be a bit empty this winter, and now is "
"the time to make pickles and preserves while the pickling's good.  In this "
"issue, three of our editors share their uplifting stories of rediscovering "
"the joys of home canning."
msgstr ""
"EDITORIAL: LAS CONSERVAS CASERAS TIENEN QUE VOLVER. Con la seguridad "
"alimentaria en entredicho tras otra grave sequía y los incendios forestales "
"de este año en todo el país, creo que está claro que todos tenemos que sacar"
" los viejos libros de la abuela y aprender de nuevo a hacer conservas. Las "
"tiendas de comestibles podrían estar un poco vacías este invierno, y ahora "
"es el momento de hacer encurtidos y conservas mientras el producto sea "
"bueno. En este número, tres de nuestros editores comparten sus inspiradoras "
"historias de redescubrimiento de las alegrías de las conservas caseras."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_months_old_news"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/newspaper.json
msgid ""
"SUNNY FUTURES.  Edison Automotives released a new line of solar-powered "
"vehicles today, as part of their 'space age aesthetic' initiative.  \"This "
"is big news for everybody, no less those concerned with global warming as it"
" stands.  We could see massive cutbacks in atmospheric carbon dioxide,\" "
"said a spokesperson during the meeting."
msgstr ""
"FUTUROS SOLARES. Edison Automotives ha presentado hoy una nueva línea de "
"vehículos que funcionan con energía solar, como parte de su iniciativa de "
"\"estética de la era espacial\". \"Es una gran noticia para todos, y no "
"menos para los que se preocupan por el calentamiento global tal y como está "
"planteado. Podríamos ver recortes gigante de dióxido de carbono "
"atmosférico\", dijo un portavoz durante la reunión."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_months_old_news"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/newspaper.json
msgid ""
"ASTRONOMERS READY TO WORK.  \"We're really excited to be working alongside "
"Edison and other people just as enthusiastic as we are about the future of "
"space travel,\" said a renowned astronomer at Messier Research Facility "
"after news of Edison inquiries into manned missions into the galaxy was "
"leaked to the Associated Press last week.  \"Intergalactic real estate, "
"asteroid mining, you name it.\""
msgstr ""
"ASTRÓNOMOS LISTOS PARA TRABAJAR. \"Estamos realmente entusiasmados de "
"trabajar junto a Edison y otras personas tan entusiastas como nosotros sobre"
" el futuro de los viajes espaciales\", dijo un renombrado astrónomo del "
"Centro de Investigación Messier después de que la semana pasada se filtrara "
"a Associated Press la noticia de las investigaciones de Edison sobre "
"misiones tripuladas a la galaxia. \"Inmuebles intergalácticos, minería de "
"asteroides, lo que sea\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_months_old_news"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/newspaper.json
msgid ""
"UNREST CONTINUES IN SOUTH AMERICA, AFRICA.  Although reports are "
"inconsistent, it has been confirmed that widespread social unrest in "
"poverty-stricken, disaster-torn regions of Africa and South America, as well"
" as some parts of Indonesia and Asia have continued and only grown in "
"severity.  \"It's obvious this is a social media effect,\" said political "
"science professor Dr. Ely Savage.  \"Economists have been saying for some "
"time that the current situation of developed nations forcing underdeveloped "
"nations into semi-slavery couldn't last, and now we're seeing the "
"repercussions.\""
msgstr ""
"CONTINÚAN LOS DISTURBIOS EN AMÉRICA DEL SUR Y ÁFRICA. Aunque los informes "
"son inconsistentes, se ha confirmado que el malestar social generalizado en "
"las regiones de África y América del Sur, asoladas por la pobreza y los "
"desastres, así como en algunas partes de Indonesia y Asia, ha continuado y "
"sólo ha aumentado en gravedad. \"Es obvio que se trata de un efecto de las "
"redes sociales\", dijo el profesor de ciencias políticas Ely Savage. \"Los "
"economistas llevan tiempo diciendo que la situación actual de las naciones "
"desarrolladas que obligan a las subdesarrolladas a la semiesclavitud no "
"podía durar, y ahora estamos viendo las repercusiones\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_months_old_news"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/newspaper.json
msgid ""
"FOODPLACE PANTS FEUD.  An ongoing legal battle between popular fast food "
"megalith Foodplace and the non-profit Concerned Consumers of Foodpeople has "
"ended with the determination that the Foodperson costume will remain a "
"gender-neutral, non-revealing unitard.  \"Superheroes are meant to have "
"exaggerated anatomy and revealing costumes,\" a spokesperson from CCF said "
"in a press release.  \"This is a sad day not just for fans of Foodplace, but"
" for consumers of the fast-food superhero genre overall.\""
msgstr ""
"DISPUTA POR LOS PANTALONES DE LUGARCOMIDA. Una batalla legal entre el "
"popular grupo de comida rápida Lugarcomida y la organización sin ánimo de "
"lucro Consumidores Preocupados de GenteComida ha terminado con la "
"determinación de que el disfraz de Personacomida siga siendo un traje de "
"género neutro y no revelador. \"Los superhéroes están destinados a tener una"
" anatomía exagerada y trajes reveladores\", dijo un portavoz de CPG en un "
"comunicado de prensa. \"Este es un día triste no sólo para los fans de "
"Lugarcomida, sino para los consumidores del género de superhéroes de comida "
"rápida en general\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_months_old_news"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/newspaper.json
msgid ""
"EDITORIAL: FORGET DRUGS OR FRIENDFACE, VIDEO GAMES BEHIND MORAL FAILURES.  I"
" can't believe how many idiots are wasting their time blaming social media "
"or drugs on the decline of our great nation when the answer is obvious: this"
" is the result of letting our kids fall to the moral iniquity of video "
"games.  Just last week I saw my kid playing one of those stupid bleep-bloop "
"games, all letters and numbers and symbols.  When I asked him what he was "
"doing it was absolutely appalling.  Violence.  Cannibalism.  Humans as "
"cattle.  Mermaid abuse.  Our government is in the pocket of these video game"
" developers, and we're all paying the price."
msgstr ""
"EDITORIAL: OLVÍDATE DE LAS DROGAS O DE LA CARA DE AMIGO, LOS VIDEOJUEGOS "
"ESTÁN DETRÁS DE LOS FRACASOS MORALES. No puedo creer la cantidad de idiotas "
"que pierden el tiempo culpando a las redes sociales o a las drogas del "
"declive de nuestra gran nación cuando la respuesta es obvia: es el resultado"
" de dejar que nuestros hijos caigan en la maldad moral de los videojuegos. "
"Justo la semana pasada vi a mi hijo jugando a uno de esos estúpidos juegos "
"de pitidos, todo letras y números y símbolos. Cuando le pregunté qué estaba "
"haciendo fue absolutamente espantoso. Violencia. Canibalismo. Humanos como "
"ganado. Abuso de sirenas. Nuestro gobierno está en el bolsillo de estos "
"desarrolladores de videojuegos, y todos estamos pagando el precio."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_weeks_old_news"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/newspaper.json
msgid ""
"CHINESE AGGRESSION:  China took the offensive last week on the country’s "
"disputed border with India, seizing a local village along an important "
"highway.  While there was no violence, the UN is scrambling to ease "
"tensions, calling the move \"Hostile for hostility's sake.\"  China claims "
"that British land treaties support their actions, saying that they were "
"merely taking back what was rightfully theirs.  This has done nothing to "
"assuage national fears of open military conflict as the trade war begins to "
"cut deep."
msgstr ""
"AGRESIÓN CHINA: China tomó la ofensiva la semana pasada en la disputada "
"frontera del país con la India, apoderándose de una aldea local a lo largo "
"de una importante autopista. Aunque no hubo violencia, la ONU se esfuerza "
"por aliviar las tensiones, calificando el movimiento de \"hostilidad "
"premeditada\". China afirma que los tratados territoriales británicos "
"respaldan sus acciones, diciendo que simplemente estaban recuperando lo que "
"era suyo por derecho. Esto no ha hecho nada para apaciguar los temores "
"nacionales de un conflicto militar abierto, ya que la guerra comercial "
"empieza a ser intensa."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_weeks_old_news"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/newspaper.json
msgid ""
"WILD WEATHER.  Meteorologists are reported to be \"concerned\" by recent "
"weather patterns, new survey says.  Our own weatherman, Farhan Kishor, has "
"this to say: \"Stock up on batteries and food and prepare to stay indoors "
"for a while due to flooding and strong winds.  Stay tuned to your local "
"weather station for updates.  We're in store for a big one, folks.\""
msgstr ""
"TIEMPO SALVAJE. Los meteorólogos se muestran \"preocupados\" por los "
"recientes patrones meteorológicos, según una nueva encuesta. Nuestro propio "
"meteorólogo, Farhan Kishor, ha dicho lo siguiente: \"Abastézcanse de pilas y"
" alimentos y prepárense para permanecer en casa durante un tiempo debido a "
"las inundaciones y los fuertes vientos. Permanezcan atento a su estación "
"meteorológica local para conocer las novedades. Nos espera una gran "
"tormenta, gente\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_weeks_old_news"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/newspaper.json
msgid ""
"GIVING BACK: PUTTING THE \"COMMUNITY\" IN COMMUNITY SHELTERS.  A FEMA "
"spokesperson is unveiling a new community-lead effort today: tax deductions "
"in return for donations of canned goods.  \"This will be a great way for "
"local communities to get excited about what we're doing here and invest in "
"their own safety.\""
msgstr ""
"DEVOLVIENDO: PONIENDO LA \"COMUNIDAD\" EN LOS REFUGIOS COMUNITARIOS. Un "
"portavoz de FEMA presenta hoy un nuevo esfuerzo liderado por la comunidad: "
"deducciones fiscales a cambio de donaciones de productos enlatados. \"Esta "
"será una gran forma de que las comunidades locales se entusiasmen con lo que"
" estamos haciendo aquí e inviertan en su propia seguridad\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_weeks_old_news"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/newspaper.json
msgid ""
"METEOR SHOWERS TONIGHT, NATIONWIDE.  Keep your eyes peeled for the sudden "
"appearance of a surprise meteor shower tonight, visible around midnight in "
"the night sky.  Local stargazers are saying that this is a surprise, but a "
"welcome one.  \"It's not often that you get to see this sort of thing with "
"your own eyes quite so clearly,\" says astrologist Paul O'Ryan."
msgstr ""
"LLUVIA DE METEORITOS ESTA NOCHE, EN TODO EL PAÍS. Estén atento a la súbita "
"aparición de una lluvia de meteoros por sorpresa esta noche, visible "
"alrededor de la medianoche en el cielo nocturno. Los observadores de "
"estrellas locales dicen que se trata de una sorpresa, pero bienvenida. \"No "
"es frecuente ver este tipo de cosas con tus propios ojos con tanta "
"claridad\", dice el astrólogo Paul O'Ryan."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_weeks_old_news"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/newspaper.json
msgid ""
"\"TAKE YOUR FREEDOM IN YOUR OWN HANDS.\"  In a surprise press conference "
"today, the president and senior military figures revealed shocking "
"information on an impending foreign attack.  \"It's time to take freedom "
"into your own hands,\" President Loft said when addressing the crowd, urging"
" them to enlist in the armed forces immediately.  \"We don't know when or "
"where they will strike, but they mean to do as much harm as possible to our "
"sovereignty as a nation, to citizens of the United States, and to the world "
"as a whole.\"  Washington has refused to comment further."
msgstr ""
"\"TOMA TU LIBERTAD EN TUS MANOS\". En una conferencia de prensa sorpresa "
"celebrada hoy, el presidente y los altos mandos militares revelaron "
"información impactante sobre un inminente ataque extranjero. \"Es hora de "
"tomar la libertad en sus propias manos\", dijo el presidente Loft al "
"dirigirse a la multitud, instándoles a alistarse en las fuerzas armadas "
"inmediatamente. \"No sabemos cuándo ni dónde atacarán, pero pretenden hacer "
"el mayor daño posible a nuestra soberanía como nación, a los ciudadanos de "
"Estados Unidos y al mundo entero\". Washington se ha negado a hacer más "
"comentarios."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_weeks_old_news"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/newspaper.json
msgid ""
"WORLD READIES FOR WAR?  In a message directly from the United Nations, "
"several leaders warn that citizens of major metropolitan areas should "
"immediately begin packing for impending evacuation orders in light of a "
"\"novel threat to world peace\".  The President of the United States is "
"urging enlistment of all able bodied volunteers, and no doubt a draft is to "
"follow as the world mobilizes.  The enemy, though?  Nobody knows."
msgstr ""
"¿EL MUNDO SE PREPARA PARA LA GUERRA? En un mensaje procedente directamente "
"de las Naciones Unidas, varios líderes advierten que los ciudadanos de las "
"principales áreas metropolitanas deben comenzar a hacer las maletas ante las"
" inminentes órdenes de evacuación a la luz de una \"nueva amenaza para la "
"paz mundial\". El Presidente de los Estados Unidos insta a alistarse a todos"
" los voluntarios en condiciones de hacerlo, y no cabe duda de que el mundo "
"se movilizará con un reclutamiento. ¿Pero el enemigo? Nadie lo sabe."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_weeks_old_news"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/newspaper.json
msgid ""
"TENSIONS SKYROCKET.  The streets are packed today as people rush to the "
"supermarkets in order to buy supplies for impending conflict as warned by "
"the President a week ago.  A local woman, Jesse Clarke, has this to say:  "
"\"Nobody knows what's going on or what's going to happen, but we know it's "
"going to be bad.\""
msgstr ""
"LAS TENSIÓN SE DISPARA. Las calles están abarrotadas hoy mientras la gente "
"se apresura a los supermercados para comprar provisiones ante el inminente "
"conflicto, tal y como advirtió el Presidente hace una semana. Una mujer "
"local, Jesse Clarke, dijo lo siguiente: \"Nadie sabe qué está pasando o qué "
"va a pasar, pero sabemos que va a ser malo\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_weeks_old_news"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/newspaper.json
msgid ""
"LOCAL EVACUATION ORDERS.  FEMA has announced small-scale evacuations of "
"select centers where hostile activity is supposedly supposed to be most "
"intense.  \"This is a preventive measure,\" Spokesperson Linda Garrison told"
" our correspondent.  \"We expect to have people home in a few days, but it's"
" best we play it safe until then.\""
msgstr ""
"ÓRDENES DE EVACUACIÓN LOCALES. La FEMA ha anunciado la evacuación a pequeña "
"escala de determinados centros en los que se supone que la actividad hostil "
"sea más intensa. \"Se trata de una medida preventiva\", dijo la portavoz "
"Linda Garrison a nuestro corresponsal. \"Esperamos tener a la gente en casa "
"en unos días, pero es mejor ir a lo seguro hasta entonces\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_weeks_old_news"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/newspaper.json
msgid ""
"EDITORIAL:  CHINESE PSY-OP.  Just a week ago we were gearing up for war "
"against our enemy to the East, now we're holding hands and singing kumbaya?"
"  I don't think so.  President Loft has always been limp-wristed, but now "
"he's either taking money for him or they're beaming psionic waves into his "
"head.  I know that sounds crazy, but what could make a man turn on his own "
"country like this?  I don't buy the supposed \"aliens\" line he's selling us"
" for a second.  Vote to impeach NOW!"
msgstr ""
"EDITORIAL: LA OPERACIÓN PSICOLÓGICA CHINA. Hace apenas una semana nos "
"preparábamos para la guerra contra nuestro enemigo del Este, ¿y ahora nos "
"damos la mano y cantamos kumbaya? No lo creo. El presidente Loft siempre ha "
"sido un cobarde, pero ahora está aceptando dinero para él o le están "
"enviando ondas psiónicas a la cabeza. Sé que parece una locura, pero ¿qué "
"puede hacer que un hombre se vuelva así contra su propio país? No me creo ni"
" por un segundo la supuesta línea de \"extraterrestres\" que nos está "
"vendiendo. ¡Voten por el impeachment AHORA!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_newest_news"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/newspaper.json
msgid ""
"EVACUATION ALERT: FEMA officials said today \"Do not try to defend your "
"property.  Please retreat to your nearest evacuation center and await "
"extraction to a safe facility.  Military officials require all civilians to "
"be removed from hot sites for potential hostile strikes.\""
msgstr ""
"ALERTA DE EVACUACIÓN: Los funcionarios de la FEMA dijeron hoy \"No intenten "
"defender su propiedad. Por favor, retírense a su centro de evacuación más "
"cercano y espere la extracción a una instalación segura. Los oficiales "
"militares requieren que todos los civiles sean retirados de los sitios "
"críticos por posibles ataques de hostiles.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_newest_news"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/newspaper.json
msgid ""
"BLOOD IN THE STREETS.  [Pictured: A grainy image of a terrifying war machine"
" prowling a body-strewn street, taken from between curtains.]  The police "
"didn't stand a chance, neither did the National Guard, and neither will you."
"  Stay hidden.  Stay alert.  This will be our last issue."
msgstr ""
"SANGRE EN LAS CALLES. [Imagen: Una imagen granulada de una aterradora "
"máquina de guerra merodeando por una calle sembrada de cadáveres, tomada "
"entre cortinas]. La policía no tuvo ninguna oportunidad, tampoco la Guardia "
"Nacional, y tú tampoco la tendrás. Permanezcan ocultos. Manténgase alerta. "
"Este será nuestro último número."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_newest_news"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/newspaper.json
msgid ""
"A BRIDGE TOO FAR.  In a statement Monday, the Department of Defense detailed"
" its plans to deploy strategic minefields on key bridge crossings, in order "
"to slow down invading ground forces.  \"Military personnel will be on-site "
"to assist any refugees fleeing the hot zones.  We urge citizens to comply "
"with all military directives and proceed directly to evacuation centers for "
"relocation.\""
msgstr ""
"UN PUENTE DEMASIADO LEJOS. En un comunicado el lunes, el Departamento de "
"Defensa detalló sus planes para desplegar campos de minas estratégicos en "
"los cruces de puentes clave, con el fin de frenar a las fuerzas terrestres "
"invasoras. \"El personal militar estará en el lugar para ayudar a los "
"refugiados que huyan de las zonas calientes. Instamos a los ciudadanos a "
"cumplir con todas las directivas militares y proceder directamente a los "
"centros de evacuación para su reubicación.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_newest_news"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/newspaper.json
msgid ""
"GLOBAL BOMBING:  Coordinated bombing strikes have decimated major cities "
"across the globes, as well as numerous key infrastructure such as power "
"plants and highways.  A statement from the Pentagon has been issued, stating"
" that civilians are to shelter indoors, preferably in a basement or other "
"interior location.  Allegations that enemy troops have been spotted on the "
"ground have not been confirmed or denied at this time, but military "
"officials warn that they should NOT be engaged if present."
msgstr ""
"BOMBARDEO GLOBAL: Los bombardeos coordinados han diezmado las principales "
"ciudades de todo el mundo, así como numerosas infraestructuras clave, como "
"centrales eléctricas y carreteras. Se ha emitido un comunicado del Pentágono"
" en el que se indica que los civiles deben refugiarse en lugares cerrados, "
"preferiblemente en un sótano u otro lugar interior. Por el momento no se ha "
"confirmado ni desmentido que se hayan visto tropas enemigas sobre el "
"terreno, pero los oficiales militares advierten que NO deben confrontarse "
"con ellas."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_newest_news"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/newspaper.json
msgid ""
"THE WRATH OF AN ANGRY GOD.  [Pictured, the Empire State Building and "
"surrounding skyscrapers are obliterated by multiple concentrated rays of "
"energy that erupt from the sky.  A massive, dark shape is just visible "
"through the clouds.]  Prepare supplies immediately.  If you must travel, do "
"not go in large groups or draw attention to yourself in any way.  All major "
"roadways are to be considered closed at this time, either blocked or "
"destroyed.  Stand strong."
msgstr ""
"LA IRA DE UN DIOS FURIOSO. En la imagen, el Empire State Building y los "
"rascacielos circundantes son destruidos por múltiples rayos de energía "
"concentrados que surgen del cielo. Una forma masiva y oscura es apenas "
"visible a través de las nubes]. Preparen suministros inmediatamente. Si "
"deben viajar, no vayan en grupos grandes ni llamen la atención de ninguna "
"manera. Todas las carreteras principales deben considerarse cerradas en este"
" momento, bloqueadas o destruidas. Manténganse fuertes."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_newest_news"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/newspaper.json
msgid ""
"PUBLIC SERVICE ANNOUNCEMENT: \"Aid Delayed\".  Fighting by the military in "
"and around the New England Exclusion Zone is expected to delay civilian "
"extraction.  Civilians will be forced to supply themselves over the next "
"weeks.  Sources indicate this problem is widespread in other major "
"population centers, but aggravated locally by the very high number of "
"bombing targets and enemy ground forces over the last two days."
msgstr ""
"ANUNCIO DE SERVICIO PÚBLICO: \"Ayuda Retrasada\". Se espera que los combates"
" de los militares en la Zona de Exclusión de Nueva Inglaterra y sus "
"alrededores retrasen la extracción de la población civil. Los civiles se "
"verán obligados a autoabastecerse durante las próximas semanas. Las fuentes "
"indican que este problema es generalizado en otros centros de población "
"importantes, pero que se ha agravado localmente por el gran número de "
"objetivos de bombardeo y de fuerzas terrestres enemigas de los últimos dos "
"días."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_newest_news"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/newspaper.json
msgid ""
"PUBLIC SERVICE ANNOUNCEMENT: \"New England Cut Off\".  New England, like "
"many other major urban areas, has been designated a \"military exclusion "
"zone\".  No further evacuation attempts will be funded; all survivors in the"
" area are to be considered under occupation of hostile non-state actors.  "
"Citizens still in the area are encouraged to shelter in place and advised "
"not approach active military personnel in the area, as doing so will "
"directly interfere with ongoing operations.  Cellular and land-based "
"communication grids have been blocked by large numbers of people attempting "
"to contact loved ones.  It is recommended that civilians avoid use of these "
"tools for all but the most urgent messages."
msgstr ""
"ANUNCIO DE SERVICIO PÚBLICO: \"Nueva Inglaterra aislada\". Nueva Inglaterra,"
" al igual que muchas otras zonas urbanas importantes, ha sido designadas "
"\"zona de exclusión militar\". No se realizarán más intentos de evacuación; "
"todos los supervivientes en la zona se considerarán bajo la ocupación de "
"actores no estatales hostiles. Se anima a los ciudadanos que aún se "
"encuentran en la zona a que se refugien en su sitio y se les aconseja que no"
" se acerquen al personal militar activo en la zona, ya que al hacerlo "
"interferirán directamente con las operaciones en curso. Las redes de "
"comunicación móviles y terrestres han sido bloqueadas por un gran número de "
"personas que intentan contactar con sus seres queridos. Se recomienda a los "
"civiles que eviten el uso de estas herramientas, salvo para los mensajes más"
" urgentes."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_newest_news"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/newspaper.json
msgid ""
"ALIEN INVADERS.  Amidst the violence of this invasion, we can no longer "
"disregard reports of so-called unidentified flying objects and hostile "
"robots on the ground.  Government sources could not be reached to confirm or"
" deny these reports, but our own reporters confirm it with photographic "
"evidence shown below."
msgstr ""
"INVASORES ALIENÍGENAS. En medio de la violencia de esta invasión, ya no "
"podemos ignorar los informes sobre los llamados objetos voladores no "
"identificados y los robots hostiles en tierra. No se ha podido contactar con"
" fuentes gubernamentales para confirmar o desmentir estos informes, pero "
"nuestros propios reporteros lo confirman con las pruebas fotográficas que se"
" muestran a continuación."

#. ~ Snippet in category "radio_archive"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/radio.json
msgid ""
"kssht.  Dark Horse, this is Blue Jay, what's your status, over.  kssht.  "
"Blue Jay, this is Black Horse, still holding, but not for long.  kssht.  "
"Dark Horse, you've got to hold position for 3 hours.  We're almost black on "
"ammo, but resupply is on the way, over.  kssht.  Not possible Blue Jay, too "
"many tangos.  30 minutes max, and if you don't order us to retreat we're "
"gone, over.  kssht."
msgstr ""
"shhhh. Caballo Oscuro, aquí Pájaro Azul, ¿cuál es su situación?, cambio. "
"shhhh. Pájaro Azul, aquí Caballo Oscuro, todavía aguantando, pero no por "
"mucho tiempo. shhhh. Caballo Oscuro, tiene que mantener la posición durante "
"3 horas. Estamos casi sin municiones, pero el reabastecimiento está en "
"camino, cambio. shhhh. No es posible Pájaro Azul, demasiados tangos. 30 "
"minutos máximo, y si no nos ordenas retirarnos caeremos, cambio. shhhh."

#. ~ Snippet in category "radio_archive"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/radio.json
msgid ""
"This is …kssht… we're holding the line so that …kssht… it's been a pleasure "
"to serve, but there's too many of them …kssht… God bless America…"
msgstr ""
"Aquí ...shhhh.. mantenemos las linea para que ...shhhh... ha sido un honor "
"servir, pero hay demasiados ...shhhh... Dios bendiga América..."

#. ~ Snippet in category "radio_archive"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/radio.json
msgid ""
"Attention.  Attention.  Do not fight.  Do not resist.  Become one with the "
"family.  Surrender.  Receive care.  Be loved.  Live.  Do not throw your life"
" away.  Do not fight.  Do not resist.  Attention.  Attention."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "radio_archive"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/radio.json
msgid ""
"This is an emergency broadcast from the National Emergency Alert System.  "
"This is not a test.  Unknown military forces have been spotted nationwide.  "
"They are confirmed by law enforcement officials to be hostile.  Please "
"proceed to your local community shelter.  If you are not in an evacuation "
"zone, officials highly recommend you pack gear for evacuation.  Make sure to"
" include clean clothes, a blanket, and enough food and water to last a few "
"days.  More information will be released as it becomes available."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una emisión de emergencia del Sistema Nacional de Alerta de "
"Emergencia. Esto no es una prueba. Fuerzas militares desconocidas han sido "
"avistadas a lo largo del país. Las fuerzas del orden han confirmado que son "
"hostiles. Por favor, diríjanse a su refugio local. Si no se encuentra en una"
" zona de evacuación, las autoridades recomiendan encarecidamente que prepare"
" el equipo para la evacuación. Asegúrese de incluir ropa limpia, una manta y"
" suficiente comida y agua para varios días. Se publicará más información a "
"medida que esté disponible."

#. ~ Snippet in category "radio_archive"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/radio.json
msgid ""
"This is an emergency broadcast from the National Emergency Alert System.  "
"This is not a test.  Seek immediate shelter.  Multiple missile launches have"
" been confirmed to be target designated military targets, including in urban"
" areas.  Seek immediate shelter.  If a community shelter is not available, "
"alternative shelter locations are basements, beneath stairwells, or central "
"rooms with no windows.  Ensure that you have sufficient protection from "
"falling debris.  Ensure that you have food and water for at least one week."
"  Repeat.  Seek immediate shelter."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una emisión de emergencia del Sistema Nacional de Alerta de "
"Emergencia. Esto no es una prueba. Busquen refugio inmediatamente. Se ha "
"confirmado que múltiples lanzamientos de misiles apuntan a objetivos "
"militares designados, incluso en zonas urbanas. Busque un refugio inmediato."
" Si no dispone de un refugio comunitario, los lugares alternativos para "
"refugiarse son los sótanos, debajo de las escaleras o las habitaciones "
"centrales sin ventanas. Asegúrese de tener suficiente protección contra la "
"caída de escombros. Asegúrese de que tiene comida y agua para al menos una "
"semana. Repita. Busquen refugio inmediatatamente."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"watch those wrist rockets\""
msgstr "\"mira esos cohetes de muñeca\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"this spider thing came after me  it got me good  i shot it but i dont know"
" if ill make it\""
msgstr ""
"\"Esta cosa araña me persiguió y me dio un buen golpe le disparé, pero no sé"
" si lo lograré\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"When I think of the aliens I get mad, because I was supposed to be the "
"next big leader.  WHERES MY CHANCE!??\""
msgstr ""
"\"Cuando pienso en los extraterrestres me vuelvo loco, porque se suponía que"
" yo iba a ser el próximo gran líder. ¿DÓNDE ESTÁ MI OPORTUNIDAD?\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"They stopped me at the edge of town, said they wanted to make a deal…\""
msgstr ""
"\"Me pararon en las afueras del pueblo, dijeron que querían hacer un "
"trato...\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"robots cant smell.  youll thank me later\""
msgstr "\"Los robots no huelen. Me lo agradecerás después\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"Hey.  Everyone reading this.  Life isn't so bad with them.  People just "
"need to read up on their capitals if you catch my drift.\""
msgstr ""
"A los que me lean. Yo me encuentro bien. Uniéndonos a ellos la vida no es "
"Dura. A veces uno tiene que leer sus mayúsculos principios."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"goddamn piece of shit gun doesnt fucking work\""
msgstr "\"jodida cacho arma de mierda que no dispara\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"I got my tinfoil hat on.  Good thing too, cause this alien was starrin at "
"me kinda funny, trying to freeze my mind in place.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Tengo puesto mi sombrero de papel de aluminio. Está bien la cosa porque "
"este alien se me quedaba mirando de forma divertida, tratando de congelar mi"
" mente.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"they sold us all down the river real fast huh?  they're on the radio near "
"washington.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Nos engañaron a todos hasta el cogote, ¿eh? Están en la radio cerca de "
"Washington\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"Some of 'em are big.  Real big.  Don't stick around, I saw my mate get "
"turned into ash.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Algunos son grandes. Realmente grandes. No te quedes, vi a mi compañero "
"convertirse en cenizas\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"who the hell busted up all the steering wheels and seats?\""
msgstr "\"¿Quién diablos rompió todos los volantes y asientos?\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"did they break all the fucking lawnmowers?!\""
msgstr "\"¡¿Rompieron todos los malditos cortacésped?!\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"Some of the bridges, they're right next to each other, right?  If you see "
"something up ahead one of those, just careen through to the other side.  My "
"van was long enough to bridge right across!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Algunos puentes, están uno al lado del otro, ¿no? Si ves algo en uno, salí"
" rápidamente para el otro lado. ¡Mi camioneta era lo suficientemente larga "
"para poder cruzar!\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"thought i was lucky when i found some soldiers.  they just made me hand "
"over all my shit AND my boots.  walked back home the mud.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Pensé que había tenido suerte cuando encontré a unos soldados. me hicieron"
" entregar toda mis cosas Y mis botas. volví a casa caminando por el barro\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"who fucking popped all the tires you assholes\""
msgstr "\"¿Quién diablos ha reventado todos los neumáticos, cabrones?\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"ambushed a couple and they weren't too tough.  just watch out for the "
"reinforcements.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Emboscaron a un par y no fueron tan duros. Sólo hay que tener cuidado con "
"los refuerzos\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"earth wasn't the first\""
msgstr "\"la tierra no fue la primera\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"bullet holes and plasma burns all over the car.  piece of shit hardly "
"runs\""
msgstr ""
"\"Agujeros de bala y quemaduras de plasma por todo el coche. Este cacho de "
"mierda apenas funciona\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"one day this will all be over.\""
msgstr "\"un día todo esto se acabará\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"Got a picture of someone wasting one of those walkers.  You should see it "
"soon: remember me by it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Tengo una foto de alguien destrozando uno de esos caminantes. Deberías "
"verla pronto: recuérdame por ella\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"why would you set up fucking mines they don't do anything to them just "
"blew off my FUCKING LEG when i was trying to take a stroll\""
msgstr ""
"\"Por qué se instalan las minas de mierda que no les hacen nada, me acabo de"
" volar mi JODIDA PIERNA cuando estaba tratando de dar un paseo\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"The evacs are a death trap.  They took everyone else away on a bus but "
"stayed and heard the explosions just a few minutes later.  Now it's just "
"me.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Las evacuaciones son una trampa mortal. Se llevaron a todos los demás en "
"un autobús, pero yo me quedé y escuché las explosiones unos minutos después."
" Ahora sólo estoy yo\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"plugged some alient techn ignto me idkont know if i feel so gowod\""
msgstr "\"me enchufe techn gn a ali n gna, y no me sint my b n\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"i've heard they know how to bring you back if you die\""
msgstr "\"He oído que saben cómo traerte de vuelta si mueres\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"you motherfucker\""
msgstr "\"tu hijo de puta\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"seen them around a lot of military installations.  they could've just blew"
" them up but no.  they're waiting\""
msgstr ""
"\"Los he visto alrededor de muchas instalaciones militares. Podrían haberlas"
" volado pero no. Están esperando\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"hahahahahaha die you flammable bastards\""
msgstr "\"jajajajaja morid, bastardos inflamables\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"If you're reading this: they're not gonna stop until everyone's dead.  "
"Join us by Boston, we've set up a camp in the woods\""
msgstr ""
"\"Si estás leyendo esto: no van a parar hasta que todos estémos muertos. "
"Únete a nosotros en Boston, hemos montado un campamento en el bosque\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"I thought bigmouth carp were bad.  The things they brought with them?  "
"Talk about invasive species.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Creía que las carpas de boca grande eran malas. ¿Las cosas que trajeron "
"con ellas? Hablando de especies invasoras\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"please let this all be a dream.  i had to bury her last night.  i don't "
"even know what to do anymore.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Por favor, que todo esto sea un sueño. Tuve que enterrarla anoche. Ya no "
"sé qué hacer\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"TALL ONES RUN RUN RUN RUN RUN\""
msgstr "\"ALTOS CORRÉD CORRÉD\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"Are they still human with all those machines stapled on?\""
msgstr "\"¿Siguen siendo humanos con todas esas máquinas clavadas?\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"got close to one of their ships and i feel crawly inside\""
msgstr "\"Me acerqué a una de sus naves y me sentí mal por dentro\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"Remember history class with the invaders and their diseases?  yeah… my gut"
" doesn't feel right… like it's moving…\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Recuerdas la clase de historia con los invasores y sus enfermedades? "
"Sí... mi tripa no se siente bien... como si se moviera...\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"They build modern bullets fuckin crazy.  Set some on fire and they all "
"goes like a lil grenade.  Need kindling first.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Las balas modernas que fabrican son una locura. Préndelas fuego y van a "
"explotar como granadas. Necesitan ser encendidas primero.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"The bricks of this bathroom look like a face.  Haha… it's all I can focus "
"on.  At least let me shit before you bash down the door.  Please…\""
msgstr ""
"\"Los ladrillos de este baño parecen una cara. Jaja... es todo lo que puedo "
"enfocar. Al menos déjame cagar antes de derribar la puerta. Por favor...\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"What the hell were they mining for in these shafts?\""
msgstr "\"¿Qué demonios estaban excavando en estos pozos?\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"fucking idiots with their medieval getups like that's gonna help against "
"PLASMA RIFLES\""
msgstr ""
"\"Malditos idiotas con sus atuendos medievales como si eso fuera a ayudar "
"contra los RIFLES DE PLASMA\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"wish the rain kept up after they arrived.  made my funnel collection feel "
"more useful\""
msgstr ""
"\"Ojalá siguiera lloviendo después de su llegada. Hace que mi colección de "
"embudos se sienta más útil\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"Libraries are useless after the apocalypse.  Can't read away the aliens.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Las bibliotecas son inútiles después del apocalipsis. No se puede leer de "
"lejos a los extraterrestres\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"I swear to God I've seen these aliens before!  In a game, or something!  I"
" swear…\""
msgstr ""
"\"¡Juro por Dios que he visto a estos alienígenas antes! En un juego, o algo"
" así. Lo juro...\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"Think it's worth it to crack a bank now that all the guards were killed or"
" sent off?\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Crees que vale la pena asaltar un banco ahora que todos los guardias "
"fueron asesinados o despachados?\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"They're setting up in these big structures all over.  Looks like some shit"
" out of a sci-fi movie… goes without saying huh\""
msgstr ""
"\"Se están instalando en estas grandes estructuras por todas partes. Parece "
"una mierda sacada de una película de ciencia ficción... no hace falta "
"decirlo eh\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"i've seen what they've done to people who surrendered.  I don't know if "
"I'll be able to sleep right again…\""
msgstr ""
"\"He visto lo que han hecho a la gente que se ha rendido. No sé si podré "
"volver a dormir bien...\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"sometimes I wonder what would happen if I surrendered to one.  shitting in"
" a bucket sucks, man\""
msgstr ""
"\"A veces me pregunto qué pasaría si me entregara a uno. Cagar en cubos es "
"una putada, tío\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"how long were they watching us?\""
msgstr "\"¿Cuánto tiempo estuvieron observándonos?\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"couldn't even dent one with the .45. all the noise just made me a bigger "
"target.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Ni siquiera pude abollar uno con la 45. Todo el ruido sólo me hizo un "
"blanco más grande\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"Come to the bar if you see this, let's re-enact an alien movie, friends.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Venid al bar si veis esto, vamos a recrear una película de "
"extraterrestres, amigos\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"here I was hoping for zombies hahahaha, feel like I was born into the "
"wrong apocalypse\""
msgstr ""
"\"y yo que estaba esperando a los zombis jajaja, siento que nací en el "
"apocalipsis equivocado\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"It blacked out the sun for a while and rained hellfire.  Biblical.  What "
"the HELL are we supposed to do?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Apagó el sol durante un rato y llovió fuego del infierno. Bíblico. ¿Qué "
"demonios se supone que debemos hacer?\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"…damn those hybrid cars are efficient.  Wish I was smart enough to finagle"
" that engine controller out of it… heard Scrapper Joe put one in his "
"deathmobile and now doesn't need gas at all… then again, Joe is full of "
"shit…\""
msgstr ""
"\"...esos malditos coches híbridos son eficientes. Desearía ser lo "
"suficientemente inteligente como para sacar el controlador del motor... "
"escuché que Joe el Desguazador puso uno en su automóvil de la muerte y ahora"
" no necesita gasolina en absoluto... pero claro, Joe es un mentiroso...\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"Crawled in through the vents.  Whole office building is a wreck.  Why the "
"hell they bomb it?  Just to kill people?  Deny resources and shelter?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Reptando por los conductos de ventilación. Todo el edificio de oficinas es"
" una ruina. ¿Por qué demonios lo bombardearon? ¿Sólo para matar gente? "
"¿Negar recursos y refugio?\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"god help you if you get caught by one of those nasty blade things that "
"have been carving up wood.  my arm…\""
msgstr ""
"\"Que Dios te ayude si te atrapa una de esas asquerosas cuchillas que han "
"estado tallando la madera. mi brazo...\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"OPFOR, occupiers, invaders, aliens, new gods, drones, bots.  Did I miss "
"any?\""
msgstr ""
"\"OPFOR, ocupantes, invasores, alienígenas, nuevos dioses, drones, robots. "
"¿Me he perdido algo?\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"remember lambda\""
msgstr "\"recuerda lambda\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"do NOT surrender.  if you're so lucky as to find any that won't rip you up"
" or shoot you on sight at this point, they do NOT have anything good in mind"
" for us\""
msgstr ""
"\"NO te rindas, si tienes la suerte de encontrar alguno que no te destroce o"
" te dispare en el acto. En el tiempo actual, NO tienen nada bueno en mente "
"para nosotros\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"the finest army in the world.  problem is, they're the finest army off-"
"world.\""
msgstr ""
"\"El mejor ejército del mundo. El problema es que son el mejor ejército de "
"mundo exterior\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"watch your six.  some of them can cloak.\""
msgstr "\"Vigila tus seis. Algunos pueden camuflarse\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"ALL HAIL THE NEW GODS\""
msgstr "\"TODOS ALABAD A LOS NUEVOS DIOSES\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"Aliens crawling all over the place.  Have reinforcement points all over.  "
"Could take them out.  Might buy us some time in some places.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Alienígenas reptando por todo el lugar. Tienen puntos de refuerzo por "
"todas partes. Podría eliminarlos. Podríamos ganar algo de tiempo en algunos "
"sitios\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"wondering if firefighter gear would be a better idea.  they use a lot of "
"plasma, which is like, heat, right?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Me pregunto si el equipo de bomberos sería una mejor idea. Ellos usan "
"mucho plasma, que es como, calor, ¿verdad?\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"they're definitely watching us.  stay alert\""
msgstr "\"Definitivamente nos están observando. Manténganse alerta\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"if you hear humming: run\""
msgstr "\"si escuchas un zumbido: corre\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"get on the roofs.  they might see you but they can't climb.\""
msgstr "\"Subid a los tejados. Puede que te vean pero no pueden subir\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"i'm running out of ink but listen you need to\""
msgstr "\"Me estoy quedando sin tinta, pero escucha, necesitas\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"mmm mmm delsihous alien drink\""
msgstr "\"mmm mmm bebida alienígena delisiousa\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"they've got robots for everything.  haven't seen a single gray.  some "
"aliens, huh?\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"at least they aren't quiet\""
msgstr "\"al menos no son silenciosos\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"ELTON MOOSEK DID THIS\""
msgstr "\"ELTON MOOSEK HIZO ESTO\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"did you know?  alien wildlife is friendly to other aliens.  whoda thunk.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Sabías que la fauna alienígena es amiga de otros alienígenas? Quien lo "
"pensaría.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"I'd like to thank my high-school culinary arts class for teaching me how "
"to make RDX.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Me gustaría agradecer a mi clase de artes culinarias del instituto por "
"enseñarme a hacer RDX\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"in my dreams i saw hordes of the walking dead and a guy named kevin "
"standing above it all, speaking in tongues.  glad it wasn't real\""
msgstr ""
"\"En mis sueños vi hordas de muertos vivientes y un tipo llamado Kevin de "
"pie por encima de todo, hablando en distintas lenguas. Me alegro de que no "
"fuera real\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"sometimes… I dream about cheese\""
msgstr "\"a veces... sueño con queso\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"mushy fucking pickles\""
msgstr "\"putos pepinillos blandos\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"war of the god damn worlds\""
msgstr "\"guerra de los malditos mundos\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"made a movie out of some footage of the war.  a week days cut down into "
"seven hours.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Hice una película con algunas secuencias de la guerra. Una semana de días "
"recortada en siete horas\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"Got split from my squad.  If you're reading this, meet me at the nearby "
"bunker.  Remember the password.  If not: I've got a bullet with your fucking"
" name on it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Me separé de mi escuadrón. Si estás leyendo esto, reúnete conmigo en el "
"búnker cercano. Recuerda la contraseña. Si no: Tengo una bala con tu puto "
"nombre\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"if anyones reading this, please tell my mom i was right about robots being"
" superior\""
msgstr ""
"\"Si alguien lee esto, por favor, dígale a mi madre que tenía razón sobre la"
" superioridad de los robots\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"heard a kid whispering to me from inside a garage.  i fucking bolted\""
msgstr ""
"\"Oí a un chico susurrarme desde el interior de un garaje. Salí corriendo\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"This is all just a dream, right??!  I'M GOING TO WAKE UP, HE'S GOING TO BE"
" OK\""
msgstr ""
"\"Todo esto es sólo un sueño, ¿verdad? VOY A DESPERTAR, EL VA A ESTAR "
"BIEN\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"I figured it out.\""
msgstr "\"Lo he descubierto\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"can never have enough kevlar.  basically just live in a kevlar turtle "
"shell.\""
msgstr ""
"\"nunca puede ser suficiente poseer un kevlar. básicamente es como vivir en "
"un caparazón de tortuga de kevlar.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"Glad you found this finally.  I've been watching you for a while.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Me alegro de que hayas encontrado esto finalmente. Te he estado observando"
" durante un tiempo\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"chin up brian\""
msgstr "\" barbilla arriba brian \""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"all it had to do was look at me WHAT THE FUCK DID IT DO TO ME\""
msgstr "\"todo lo que tenía que hacer era mirarme QUÉ MIERDA ME HIZO\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"i think i've been here before\""
msgstr "\"creo que he estado aquí antes\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"Tried wearing one their suits of armor and they shot at me anyway.  It's "
"like they're, like, a hivemind, man.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Intenté llevar una de sus armaduras y me dispararon de todos modos. Es "
"como si fuesen una especie de mente colectiva, tío\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"knock knock?  check the back window.\""
msgstr "\"¿Toc toc? Revisa la ventana trasera\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"for anyone reading:  no, SETI had nothing-to-fuck do with this\""
msgstr ""
"\"para quien lea: no, el SETI no tiene jodidamente nada que ver con esto\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"they put something in the water\""
msgstr "\"ponen algo en el agua\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"the 50cal is strong with this one\""
msgstr "\"el calibre 50 es fuerte con este\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"WBLF 970 went off-air three days ago.  There's nothing left on the radio "
"but static.  Might as well throw this thing away…\""
msgstr ""
"\"WBLF 970 no emite desde hace tres días. No queda nadie en la radio salvo "
"estática. Bien podría tirar esta cosa...\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"remember to bleach those bandages\""
msgstr "\"recuerda purificar con lejia esas vendas\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"parry this casuals\""
msgstr "\"esquiva esto accidentalmente\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"I've seen what they do with the bodies.  Their medical prowess is "
"staggering…\""
msgstr ""
"\"He visto lo que hacen con los cuerpos. Su destreza médica es "
"asombrosa...\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"You're next.\""
msgstr "\"Tú eres el siguiente\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"anyone else want to go down in a blaze of glory?  join me at the park.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Alguien más quiere caer en un resplandor de gloria? Únase a mí en el "
"parque\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"Lots of new easy ways to burn calories now.  Fighting the aliens, managing"
" the fields, outrunning the new 'wildlife', and more.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Ahora hay muchas formas nuevas y fáciles de quemar calorías. Luchar contra"
" los alienígenas, ocuparse de los campos, dejar atrás a la nueva 'fauna', y "
"mucho más\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"it wasn't even a person anymore im sorry god\""
msgstr "\"Ya no era una persona, lo siento, Dios\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"This has to be China's fault.  Seriously, why is nobody suspecting the "
"people we're having a cold war with!  This is an invasion!  These aren't "
"robots, it's just power armor!  WAKE UP, SHEEPLE!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Esto tiene que ser culpa de China. En serio, ¡por qué nadie sospecha de la"
" gente con la que tenemos una guerra fría! ¡Esto es una invasión! ¡Estos no "
"son robots, es sólo una armadura de energía! ¡DESPIERTEN, BORREGOS!\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"Two words: Truman Show.\""
msgstr "\"Cuatro palabras: El show de Truman\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"For sale: baby shoes, unused\""
msgstr "\"Se vende: zapatos de bebé, sin usar\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"Heard recently of some radio op who lives in a skyscraper, announcing "
"where the bots are going.  I think I saw the explosion a mile away after "
"they caught wind.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Hace poco oí hablar de un operador de radio que vive en un rascacielos, "
"anunciando hacia dónde los robots estaban yendo. Creo que vi la explosión a "
"una milla de distancia después de que el viento la empujara\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"preppers picked this place clean… no food…\""
msgstr "\"Los rreparadores han dejado este lugar limpio... sin comida...\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"The fewer 'resistance members' in New England, the stronger we'll become "
"out here in the wilds.  Let them die.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Cuantos menos 'miembros de la resistencia' haya en Nueva Inglaterra, más "
"fuertes seremos aquí en la selva. Déjenlos morir\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"Take this little token as a sign that I was here too, and I took something"
" really good.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Toma esta pequeña ficha como señal de que yo también estuve aquí y me "
"llevé algo muy bueno\"."

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_dks_emissary, mon_dks_emissary_war,
#. mon_dks_emissary_flame
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/speech/neworder_speech.json
msgid "booming footsteps."
msgstr "pasos atronadores."

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_dks_emissary, mon_dks_emissary_war
