#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TYRANT"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of a strange jungle with giant ferns."
msgstr "Sueñas con una extraña jungla con helechos gigantes."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TYRANT"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
msgid "Dreams of being the king are all you can remember."
msgstr "Los sueños de ser el rey son todo lo que puedes recordar."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TYRANT"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You brush through tree sized ferns as you hunt for your prey.  The rain "
"falls slick upon your skin."
msgstr ""
"Te mueves entre helechos del tamaño de un árbol mientras cazas a tu presa. "
"La lluvia cae resbalando sobre tu piel."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TYRANT"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
msgid "Thunderous footsteps shake the earth, are they yours?"
msgstr "Unos pasos estruendosos sacuden la tierra, ¿son los tuyos?"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TYRANT"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
msgid "Your teeth, how do you have so many teeth?  Am I growing extra teeth?"
msgstr ""
"Tus dientes, ¿cómo es que tienes tantos dientes? ¿Me están creciendo dientes"
" de más?"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TYRANT"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
msgid "The hairless apes around you smell like food.  Are they?"
msgstr "Los monos sin pelo que te rodean huelen a comida. ¿Lo son?"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TYRANT"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
msgid "So close, you can taste the rebirth of a glorious past."
msgstr ""
"Tan cerca que se puede saborear el renacimiento de un pasado glorioso."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TYRANT"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
msgid "King, nay not a king.  A god among beasts."
msgstr "Rey, no un rey. Un dios entre bestias."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "STEGO"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
msgid "The warm sun upon your skin.  A heavier air, golden dreams."
msgstr "El cálido sol sobre tu piel. Un aire más pesado, sueños dorados."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "STEGO"
#. ~ Dream of mutation category "HORNS"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of eating the largest fern you've ever seen."
msgstr "Sueñas con comer el helecho más grande que hayas visto."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "STEGO"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Large, you are becoming larger every day.  Armored skin, to protect you from"
" the world.  These are the gifts you are receiving."
msgstr ""
"Grande, cada día eres más grande. Piel blindada, para protegerte del mundo. "
"Estos son los regalos que estás recibiendo."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "STEGO"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of before the Cataclysm, but you are different somehow.  The other"
" humans all seem so soft to you."
msgstr ""
"Sueñas con antes del Cataclismo, pero de alguna manera eres diferente. Todos"
" los demás humanos te parecen tan blandos."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "STEGO"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Slower, trudging through the universe, you cease to notice those that try to"
" stop you as you walk through them."
msgstr ""
"Más lento, caminando por el universo, dejas de notar a los que intentan "
"detenerte mientras los atraviesas."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "STEGO"
#. ~ Dream of mutation category "HORNS"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
msgid "Why is this world so cold compared to the one in your dreams?"
msgstr "¿Por qué este mundo es tan frío comparado con el de tus sueños?"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "STEGO"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Is this how superman feels?  Bulletproof?  But superman is much faster than "
"you."
msgstr ""
"¿Es así como se siente Superman? ¿A prueba de balas? Pero Superman es mucho "
"más rápido que tú."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "STEGO"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
msgid "Nothing less than an asteroid can kill you."
msgstr "Nada menor a un asteroide puede matarte."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "HORNS"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
msgid "The warm sun upon your skin after escaping from a hard shell."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "HORNS"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Large, you are becoming larger every day.  Majestic horns, to protect you "
"from the world and show your power.  These are the gifts you are receiving."
msgstr ""
"Grande, cada día eres más grande. Majestuosos cuernos, para protegerte del "
"mundo y enseñar tu poder. Estos son los regalos que estas recibiendo."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "HORNS"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of before the Cataclysm, but you are different somehow.  The other"
" humans all seem so flat and weak to you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "HORNS"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Wandering peacefully through the woods with your family, easily knocking "
"down anything in your path, fearing nothing."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "HORNS"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Giant teeth come down on you, finding horns.  The screaming and blood is not"
" yours."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "HORNS"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
msgid ""
"While you are not the most feared, your majestic horns and powerful herd "
"command respect."
msgstr ""

