#. ~ Description of "railgun rifle ammo"
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/ammo/rifle.json
msgid ""
"Projectile used for a railgun.  It's made of a ferromagnetic metal, probably"
" cobalt."
msgstr ""
"Proyectil usado para un arma de riel. Está hecho de un metal ferromagnético,"
" probablemente cobalto."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/ammo/rifle_huge.json
msgid "huge rifle ammo, ball"
msgid_plural "huge rifle ammo, ball"
msgstr[0] "munición de rifle enorme, bola"
msgstr[1] "munición de rifle enorme, bola"
msgstr[2] "munición de rifle enorme, bola"

#. ~ Description of "huge rifle ammo, ball"
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/ammo/rifle_huge.json
msgid ""
"Huge rifle ammunition like this bridges the gap between light cannons and "
"big game rifles.  It's suitable for taking on light vehicles and other "
"materiel, or hunting extremely large game.  'Ball' is an old term for full "
"metal jacketed bullets which offer reduced fouling, better reliability, and "
"slightly improved penetration compared to plain lead."
msgstr ""
"La munición de los rifles enormes como este cierra la brecha entre los "
"cañones ligeros y los rifles de caza mayor. Adecuada para dañar vehículos "
"ligeros y otro material, o para cazar presas extremadamente grandes. "
"\"Bola\" es un antiguo término para las balas con camisa de metal que "
"ofrecen menos incrustaciones, mayor fiabilidad y una penetración ligeramente"
" mejorada en comparación con el plomo."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/ammo/rifle_huge.json
msgid "huge rifle ammo, AP"
msgid_plural "huge rifle ammo, AP"
msgstr[0] "munición de rifle enorme, AP"
msgstr[1] "munición de rifle enorme, AP"
msgstr[2] "munición de rifle enorme, AP"

#. ~ Description of "huge rifle ammo, AP"
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/ammo/rifle_huge.json
msgid ""
"Huge rifle ammunition like this bridges the gap between light cannons and "
"big game rifles.  It's suitable for taking on light vehicles and other "
"materiel, or hunting extremely large game.  These armor piercing munitions "
"feature tungsten steel penetrators for use against light-skinned vehicles."
msgstr ""
"La munición de los rifles enormes como este cierra la brecha entre los "
"cañones ligeros y los rifles de caza mayor. Adecuada para dañar vehículos "
"ligeros y otro material, o para cazar presas extremadamente grandes. Estas "
"municiones perforadoras de blindaje tienen penetradores de acero de "
"tungsteno ser usados contra vehículos ligeros."

