#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture.json
msgid "Translocator Gate"
msgstr "La puerta del translocalizador"

#. ~ Description of furniture "Translocator Gate"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture.json
msgid ""
"A gate for translocation.  Cast the translocation spell or use a "
"translocator to choose this gate as a destination."
msgstr ""
"Una puerta para la translocalización. Lanza el hechizo de translocación o "
"usa un translocalizador para elegir esta puerta como destino."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture.json
msgid "Magic Circle"
msgstr "Círculo Mágico"

#. ~ Description of furniture "Magic Circle"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture.json
msgid ""
"This is a rough magic circle, carved into the ground and decorated with "
"blood, candles, and other small knick-knacks."
msgstr ""
"Este es un círculo mágico tosco, tallado en la tierra y decorado con sangre,"
" velas y otras pequeñas chucherías."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture.json
msgid "large glowing boulder"
msgstr "una gran roca brillante"

#. ~ Description of furniture "large glowing boulder"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture.json
msgid "Something about this doesn't look right."
msgstr "Algo de esto no se ve bien."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture.json
msgid "enchanter's workbench"
msgstr "mesa de trabajo del hechicero"

#. ~ Description of furniture "enchanter's workbench"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture.json
msgid ""
"An ornate oak cabinet topped by a durable resin countertop resistant to most"
" alchemical spills and burns.  It has wired in electrical and gas fittings, "
"and has been decorated with several protection runes - mostly ornamental."
msgstr ""
"Un gabinete de roble adornado con una encimera de resina resistente a la "
"mayoría de los derrames y quemaduras alquímicas. Está cableado con "
"accesorios eléctricos y de gas, y ha sido decorado con varias runas de "
"protección, en su mayoría ornamentales."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture.json
msgid "standing alembic"
msgstr ""
"Un gabinete de roble adornado, coronado por una resistente encimera de "
"resina "

#. ~ Description of furniture "standing alembic"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture.json
msgid ""
"A large glass and copper alembic for distilling alchemical concoctions.  It "
"consists of a copper pot with rising spires of twisted glass draining into "
"various removable bottles."
msgstr ""
"Un gran alambique de vidrio y cobre para destilar brebajes alquímicos. "
"Consiste en un pote de cobre con espirales ascendentes de vidrio retorcido "
"que drena en varias botellas extraíbles."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture.json
msgid "orrery"
msgstr "Planetario mecánico"

#. ~ Description of furniture "orrery"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture.json
msgid ""
"This is a beautiful, non-scale model of the solar system.  A complex series "
"of gears allows the relative motions of the planets to be studied at the "
"turn of a crank.  This more modern version also has bluetooth and could have"
" been controlled with an app, if there was any power anymore."
msgstr ""
"Este es un hermoso modelo no a escala del sistema solar. Una compleja serie "
"de engranajes permite estudiar los movimientos relativos de los planetas al "
"girar una manivela. Esta versión más moderna también tiene bluetooth y "
"podría haber sido controlado con una aplicación, si hubiera habido más "
"potencia."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture.json
msgid "huge mana crystal"
msgstr "un enorme cristal de maná"

#. ~ Description of furniture "huge mana crystal"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture.json
msgid ""
"This is a mana crystal that juts from the ground as if it had sprouted up "
"like a weed.  It pulses with a delicate yellow energy, occasionally bursting"
" with flashes of pent-up light."
msgstr ""
"Este es un cristal de maná que sobresale del suelo como si hubiera brotado "
"como una hierba. Pulsa con una delicada energía amarilla, ocasionalmente "
"estallando con destellos de luz acumulada."

#. ~ Bashing sound of furniture "huge mana crystal"
#. ~ Bashing sound of furniture "everfrost crystal"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture.json
msgid "glass shattering!"
msgstr "¡pisadas de cristales!"

#. ~ Bashing failed sound of furniture "huge mana crystal"
#. ~ Bashing failed sound of furniture "everfrost crystal"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture.json
msgid "mana crackling!"
msgstr "¡maná crepitante!"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture.json
msgid "stone altar"
msgstr "altar de piedra"

#. ~ Description of furniture "stone altar"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture.json
msgid ""
"This is a big stone altar.  Most commonly used in morally questionable "
"rituals."
msgstr ""
"Este es un gran altar de piedra. Más comúnmente utilizado en rituales "
"moralmente cuestionables."

#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Overmap terrain name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/worldgen/overmap_terrain.json
msgid "attunement altar"
msgstr "altar de sintonización"

#. ~ Description of furniture "attunement altar"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture.json
msgid ""
"An ancient stone plinth covered in symbols that appear to be combinations "
"and variations of the eight magic classes.  Eight depressions are on the top"
" with the original symbols of the classes, each look as though they can hold"
" an item."
msgstr ""
"Un antiguo zócalo de piedra cubierto de símbolos que parecen ser "
"combinaciones y variaciones de las ocho clases mágicas. En la parte superior"
" hay ocho depresiones con los símbolos originales de las clases, cada una de"
" las cuales parece poder contener un objeto."

#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture.json data/mods/Magiclysm/items/tools.json
msgid "demon forge"
msgid_plural "demon forges"
msgstr[0] "forja de demonio"
msgstr[1] "forjas de demonio"
msgstr[2] "forjas de demonio"

#. ~ Description of furniture "demon forge"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture.json
msgid ""
"This is a forge made of the chitin of a huge, red spider that has a penchant"
" for flames.  Custom made to withstand the heat from alumentum, this forge "
"can resmelt the magical metals into their workable, ingot form."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una forja hecha con la quitina de una enorme araña roja que tiene "
"predilección por las llamas. Hecha a medida para soportar el calor del "
"alumento, esta forja puede refundir los metales mágicos en su forma de "
"lingote viable."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture.json
msgid "candelabra of everlasting candles"
msgstr "candelabro de velas eternas"

#. ~ Description of furniture "candelabra of everlasting candles"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture.json
msgid ""
"A candelabra, strangely the candles never seem to burn down.  Smashing it "
"doesn't seem like it'd produce any worthwhile salvage."
msgstr ""
"Un candelabro, extrañamente las velas nunca parecen consumirse. Romperlo no "
"parece que vaya a producir ningún salvamento que valga la pena."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture.json
msgid "everfrost crystal"
msgstr "cristal siemprecongelado"

#. ~ Description of furniture "everfrost crystal"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture.json
msgid ""
"This massive mana crystal juts from the ground as if it had sprouted up like"
" a weed.  It pulses with an angry white light, occasionally flickering "
"brighter."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture.json
msgid "flat boulder"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of furniture "flat boulder"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/furniture.json
msgid ""
"Smooth, flat boulder.  You can use it both as a table and an anvil.  It "
"responds to your force, and you can easily move it."
