#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Would-be Wizard"
msgstr "Aspirante a mago"

#. ~ Description of profession "Would-be Wizard" for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You found a pamphlet with bright colors claiming you can be a Wizard, oddly "
"serene with the world falling down around you."
msgstr ""
"Encontraste un folleto con colores brillantes que decía que puedes ser un "
"mago, extrañamente sereno con el mundo cayendo a tu alrededor."

