#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Corrosive Rocker"
msgstr "Rockero Corrosivo"

#. ~ Description of profession "Corrosive Rocker" for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Your metal career soared to new heights when you swapped special effects for"
" acrid gore and spiked whips.  It seems the Cataclysm is now your final "
"tour."
msgstr ""
"Tu carrera en el mundo del metal alcanzó nuevas cotas cuando cambiaste los "
"efectos especiales por el gore acre y los látigos con pinchos. Parece que el"
" Cataclismo es ahora tu última gira."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
