#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/terrain.json
msgid "burnt tree"
msgstr "árbol quemado"

#. ~ Description of terrain "burnt tree"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/terrain.json
msgid ""
"This tree looks like it has been burnt badly, but it is somehow still "
"standing."
msgstr ""
"Este árbol parece que se ha quemado mucho, pero de alguna manera sigue en "
"pie."

#. ~ Description of terrain "burnt tree"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/terrain.json
msgid ""
"This is a large cocoon-like object that looks to be the vague shape of some "
"creature.  You don't want to know how long it stayed alive while being "
"sucked dry by these spiders."
msgstr ""
"Este es un gran objeto parecido a un capullo que parece tener la forma vaga "
"de alguna criatura. No quieres saber cuánto tiempo se mantuvo vivo mientras "
"estas arañas lo dejaban seco."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/terrain.json
msgid "webbing wall"
msgstr "muro de tela de araña"

#. ~ Description of terrain "webbing wall"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/terrain.json
msgid ""
"This wall seems to be made up of a combination of webbing, wood splinters, "
"detritus, and some kind of dark-colored resin."
msgstr ""
"Este muro parece estar hecho de una combinación de telas de araña, astillas "
"de madera, detritus y algún tipo de resina de color oscuro."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/terrain.json
msgid "barren dirt"
msgstr "tierra yerma"

#. ~ Description of terrain "barren dirt"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/terrain.json
msgid ""
"It's dirt.  The ground here is infertile.  Could also be dug out for "
"construction projects."
msgstr ""
"Tierra. El suelo aquí es infértil. Tierra. También se puede excavar para "
"proyectos de construcción."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/terrain.json
msgid "glassteel vault wall"
msgstr "muro de la bóveda de cristal de acero"

#. ~ Description of terrain "glassteel vault wall"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/terrain.json
msgid ""
"A barrier made of glassteel, it's nothing complicated, and looks extremely "
"fragile.  It is most definitely not fragile and it's probably alarmed in the"
" event that someone does break through it."
msgstr ""
"Una barrera hecha de cristal de acero, no es nada complicada y parece "
"extremadamente frágil. Definitivamente, no es frágil y probablemente se de "
"una alarma en caso de que alguien la atraviese."

#. ~ Bashing sound of terrain "glassteel vault wall"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/terrain.json
msgid "a cross between steel bending and glass shattering!"
msgstr "¡un cruce entre el acero que se dobla y el cristal que se rompe!."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/terrain.json
msgid "concrete floor, everburning chandelier"
msgstr "suelo de hormigón, lámpara de araña siempreencendida"

#. ~ Description of terrain "concrete floor, everburning chandelier"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/terrain.json
msgid ""
"A bare and cold concrete floor with an elaborate chandelier above it filled "
"with everburning candles."
msgstr ""
"Un suelo de hormigón desnudo y frío con una elaborada lámpara de araña "
"encima llena de velas siempreencendidas."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/terrain.json
msgid "magically reinforced concrete wall"
msgstr "muro de hormigón armado mágicamente"

#. ~ Description of terrain "magically reinforced concrete wall"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/terrain.json
msgid ""
"An extremely resilient wall, filled with concrete and rebar and esoteric "
"ingredients.  Best suited for supporting multi-level buildings, only serious"
" explosives and high-speed impacts would be capable of damaging this wall."
msgstr ""
"Un muro extremadamente resistente, lleno de hormigón, barras corrugadas e "
"ingredientes esotéricos. Más adecuado para soportar edificios de varios "
"niveles, sólo explosivos potentes e impactos de alta velocidad serían "
"capaces de dañar este muro."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/terrain.json
msgid "magically reinforced concrete floor"
msgstr "suelo de hormigón armado mágicamente"

#. ~ Description of terrain "magically reinforced concrete floor"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/terrain.json
msgid ""
"Extremely resilient floor made from carefully placed rebar and poured "
"alchemical concrete, capable of providing protection from the elements.  As "
"for the matching roof, it still requires supporting walls, otherwise it may "
"very well cave in."
msgstr ""
"Suelo extremadamente resistente hecho de barras corrugadas cuidadosamente "
"colocadas y hormigón alquímico vertido, capaz de proporcionar protección "
"contra la intemperie. En cuanto al techo, aún requiere muros de apoyo, de lo"
" contrario podría derrumbarse."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/terrain.json
msgid "vault vent"
msgstr "ventilación de la bóveda"

#. ~ Description of terrain "vault vent"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/terrain.json
msgid ""
"This concrete flooring has a vent pouring fresh, clean air into the vault."
msgstr ""
"Este suelo de hormigón tiene un respiradero que vierte aire fresco y limpio "
"en la bóveda."

#. ~ Name of tool quality "MAGIC_MUTAGEN"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/tool_qualities.json
msgid "magic mutagen mixer"
msgstr "mezclador mágico de mutágeno"

#. ~ Name of tool quality "MAGIC_CAULDRON"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/tool_qualities.json
msgid "alchemical cauldron"
msgstr "caldero alquímica"

#. ~ Name of a trap
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traps.json
msgid "summon hounds"
msgstr "Invocar perros"

#. ~ Vitamin name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/vitamin.json
msgid "Black Dragon Mutagen"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Vitamin name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/vitamin.json
msgid "Concentrated Mana Mutagen"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
msgid "Smite"
msgstr "Golpeo"

#. ~ Description of spell "Smite"
#. ~ Animist spell
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Smite"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
msgid ""
"Evil has become pervasive throughout the world.  Let your power be the light"
" that shines in the darkness!"
msgstr ""
"El mal se ha vuelto omnipresente en todo el mundo. ¡Deja que tu poder sea la"
" luz que brilla en la oscuridad!"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
msgid "Life Conversion"
msgstr "Conversión de Vida"

#. ~ Description of spell "Life Conversion"
#. ~ Animist spell
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Life Conversion"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
msgid ""
"You channel your life force itself into your spiritual energy.  You spend hp"
" to regain mana."
msgstr ""
"Canalizas tu fuerza vital en tu energía espiritual. Gastas pv para recuperar"
" maná."

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
msgid "Mind over Pain"
msgstr "Mente sobre Dolor"

#. ~ Description of spell "Mind over Pain"
#. ~ Animist spell
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Mind Over Pain"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
msgid ""
"With an intense ritual that resembles crossfit, you manage to put some of "
"your pain at bay."
msgstr ""
"Con un intenso ritual que se asemeja al crossfit, te las arreglas para "
"eliminar algo de tu dolor."

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
msgid "Summon Zombie"
msgstr "Invocar Zombi"

#. ~ Description of spell "Summon Zombie"
#. ~ Animist spell
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Summon Zombie"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
msgid ""
"An ethereal-looking zombie rises from the depths of the earth to fight for "
"you.  You may be able to summon more with a higher level in this spell."
msgstr ""
"Un zombi de aspecto etéreo se levanta de las profundidades de la tierra para"
" luchar por ti. Podrás invocar más con un nivel más alto en este hechizo."

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
msgid "Summon Tough Zombie"
msgstr "Invocar Zombi Duro"

#. ~ Description of spell "Summon Tough Zombie"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
msgid ""
"An ethereal-looking tough zombie rises from the depths of the earth to fight"
" for you.  You may be able to summon more with a higher level in this spell."
msgstr ""
"Un zombi de aspecto etéreo se levanta de las profundidades de la tierra para"
" luchar por ti. Podrás invocar más con un nivel más alto de hechizo."

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
msgid "Summon Skeleton"
msgstr "Invocar Esqueleto"

#. ~ Description of spell "Summon Skeleton"
#. ~ Animist spell
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Summon Skeleton"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
msgid ""
"A ghostly skeleton rises from the depths of the earth to fight for you.  You"
" may be able to summon more with a higher level in this spell."
msgstr ""
"Un esqueleto fantasmagórico se levanta de las profundidades de la tierra "
"para luchar por ti. Podrás invocar más con un nivel más alto en este "
"hechizo."

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
msgid "Summon Decayed Pouncer"
msgstr "Invocar Asaltante Pútrido"

#. ~ Description of spell "Summon Decayed Pouncer"
#. ~ Animist spell
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Summon Decayed Pouncer"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
msgid ""
"A decrepit looking large cat rises from the depths of the earth to fight for"
" you.  You may be able to summon more with a higher level in this spell."
msgstr ""
"Un gato grande decrépito se levanta de las profundidades de la tierra para "
"luchar por ti. Podrás invocar más con un nivel más alto en este hechizo."

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
msgid "Summon Spearcat Hunter"
msgstr "Invocar Cazador Gatolanza"

#. ~ Description of spell "Summon Spearcat Hunter"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
msgid ""
"A primal looking large cat rises from the depths of the earth to fight for "
"you.  You may be able to summon more with a higher level in this spell."
msgstr ""
"Un gran gato de aspecto primitivo surge de las profundidades de la tierra "
"para luchar por ti. Podrás invocar más con un nivel más alto de hechizo."

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
msgid "Necrotic Gaze"
msgstr "Mirada Necrótica"

#. ~ Description of spell "Necrotic Gaze"
#. ~ Animist spell
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Necrotic Gaze"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
msgid ""
"You use the power of your own blood to imbue necrotic energy into your gaze,"
" damaging the target you look at."
msgstr ""
"Utilizás la energía de tu propia sangre para imbuir energía necrótica a tu "
"mirada, dañando al enemigo que estés mirando."

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
msgid "Animist Rune"
msgstr "Runa Animista"

#. ~ Description of spell "Animist Rune"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
msgid ""
"This ritual creates a small pebble attuned to Animists.  You can use the "
"rune as a catalyst for recipes."
msgstr ""
"Este ritual crea un pequeño guijarro en sintonía con los animistas. Puedes "
"usar la runa como catalizador para las recetas."

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
msgid "Soulrend"
msgstr "Finalizador de Alma"

#. ~ Description of spell "Soulrend"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
msgid ""
"Violently tears the spirit from the body, and bounds the resulting shade to "
"your will."
msgstr ""
"Arranca violentamente el espíritu de un cuerpo, y ata la sombra resultante a"
" tu voluntad."

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
msgid "Disruption Bolt"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of spell "Disruption Bolt"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Disruption Bolt"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
msgid ""
"Release a resonant bolt of spiritual energy at a nearby target.  It will "
"disrupt the natural link between matter and animus, causing heavy but never "
"lethal damage."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
msgid "Wrathful Spirits"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of spell "Wrathful Spirits"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
msgid ""
"Grant brief corporality to orphaned spirits and allow them to fight under "
"your command."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
msgid "Spirit Walk"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of spell "Spirit Walk"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
msgid ""
"Momentarily plunge into the underworld, and swap positions with any spirit "
"you command."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
msgid "Lesser Banishment"
msgstr "Destierro Menor"

#. ~ Description of spell "Lesser Banishment"
#. ~ Animist spell
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Lesser Banishment"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
msgid ""
"Banish a monster to the lesser-known nether dimension.  If a monster is more"
" powerful than you can handle, the spell drains your life force to make up "
"the difference."
msgstr ""
"Destierra un monstruo hacia una dimensión menos conocida. Si un monstruo es "
"más poderoso de lo que puedes manejar, el hechizo drena tu fuerza vital para"
" compensar la diferencia."

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
msgid "Ignus Fatuus"
msgstr "Ignifugo Fatuo"

#. ~ Description of spell "Ignus Fatuus"
#. ~ Animist spell
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Ignus Fatuus"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
msgid ""
"Summons ghostly foxfire worked from living marsh vapor, to lead your enemies"
" astray.  With more experience, this spell can conjure multiple ghost "
"lights."
msgstr ""
"Invoca un fantasmal fuego fatuo del vapor de pantano, para extraviar a tus "
"enemigos. Con más experiencia, este hechizo puede conjurar múltiples luces "
"fantasmales."

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
msgid "Bleed"
msgstr "Sangrado"

#. ~ Description of spell "Bleed"
#. ~ Animist spell
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Bleed"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
msgid ""
"With a shout and a gesture, the target starts bleeding from old wounds."
msgstr ""
"Con un grito y un gesto, el objetivo empieza a sangrar por viejas heridas."

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
msgid "Decaying Boneclub"
msgstr "Garrote de Hueso Pútrido"

#. ~ Description of spell "Decaying Boneclub"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
msgid ""
"This spell links your live blood to the dead blood & bones, creating a club "
"hungry for the flesh of the living."
msgstr ""
"Este hechizo une tu sangre viva con la sangre y los huesos muertos, creando "
"un garrote hambriento de carne de seres vivos."

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
msgid "Improved Decaying Boneclub"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of spell "Improved Decaying Boneclub"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
msgid ""
"This spell links your live blood to the dead blood & bones, creating a club "
"hungry for the flesh of the living.  Now you know this spell like the back "
"of your hand, and start to design your own version."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
msgid "Rupture"
msgstr "Ruptura"

#. ~ Description of spell "Rupture"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
msgid ""
"You pour mana into an unwilling and unprepared vessel, causing cellular "
"break-down, internal hemorrhaging, ley lines becoming muddled, and "
"electronics overcharging.  Immensely gruesome, crude, and was once illegal "
"world-wide, not that it matters now."
msgstr ""
"Viertes maná en un recipiente que no quiere y no está preparado, lo que "
"provoca una ruptura celular, una hemorragia interna, el enturbiamiento de "
"las líneas ley y la sobrecarga de los aparatos electrónicos. Extremadamente "
"horripilante, cruda, y una vez fue ilegal en todo el mundo, no es que "
"importe ahora."

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
msgid "Devour"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of spell "Devour"
#. ~ Animist spell
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Devour"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
msgid ""
"Kill a summoned creature, consuming its life energy to regain some health."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
msgid "Devour Damage"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of spell "Devour Damage"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
msgid "Deal deadly damage to ally.  You can see it only in debug mode."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
msgid "Devour Healing"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of spell "Devour Healing"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/animist.json
msgid "Heal the player.  You can see it only in debug mode."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monster_special_attacks/monster_special_attacks.json
msgid "Cure Light Wounds"
msgstr "Curar Heridas Leves"

#. ~ Description of spell "Cure Light Wounds"
#. ~ Description of spell "Jury Rig"
#. ~ Biomancer spell
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Cure Light Wounds"
#. ~ Description of spell "Blood healing"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Biotek.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monster_special_attacks/monster_special_attacks.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/vampire_spells.json
msgid "Heals a little bit of damage on the target."
msgstr "Cura un poco de daño en el objetivo."

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
msgid "Pain Split"
msgstr "Dolor Dividido"

#. ~ Description of spell "Pain Split"
#. ~ Biomancer spell
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Pain Split"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
msgid "Evens out damage among your limbs."
msgstr "Empareja el daño entre tus extremidades."

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
msgid "Vicious Tentacle"
msgstr "Tentaculo Atroz"

#. ~ Description of spell "Vicious Tentacle"
#. ~ Biomancer spell
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Vicious Tentacle"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
msgid ""
"This spell extrudes a long nasty whiplike tentacle of sharp bones and oozing"
" acid from your body, it has a long reach attack and vicious damage."
msgstr ""
"Este hechizo extrae de tu cuerpo un largo y desagradable tentáculo en forma "
"de latigo de huesos afilados y ácido rezumante, tiene un ataque de largo "
"alcance y un daño atroz."

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
msgid "Evolved Vicious Tentacle"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of spell "Evolved Vicious Tentacle"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
msgid ""
"This spell extrudes a long nasty whiplike tentacle of sharp bones and oozing"
" acid from your body, it has a long reach attack and vicious damage.  Now "
"you know this spell like the back of your hand, and start to design your own"
" version."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Spell name
#. ~ Name of effect type id "bio_boost"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "Grotesque Enhancement"
msgstr "Mejora Grotesco"

#. ~ Description of spell "Grotesque Enhancement"
#. ~ Biomancer spell
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Grotesque Enhancement"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
msgid ""
"A spell that warps your body in alien ways to increase your physical "
"abilities and strength."
msgstr ""
"Un hechizo que modifica tu cuerpo en formas alienígenas para incrementar tu "
"fuerza y habilidades físicas."

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
msgid "Acidic Spray"
msgstr "Rocio Ácido"

#. ~ Description of spell "Acidic Spray"
#. ~ Biomancer spell
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Acidic Spray"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
msgid ""
"When cast, the mage opens his mouth and sprays acid in a wide cone to "
"dissolve his foes into goo.  Just imagine what he'll do with the goo."
msgstr ""
"Cuando es lanzado, el mago abre su boca y rocía ácido en un cono ancho para "
"disolver a sus enemigos a una sustancia viscosa. Imagina lo que hará con la "
"sustancia viscosa."

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
msgid "Flesh Pouch"
msgstr "Bolsa De Carne"

#. ~ Description of spell "Flesh Pouch"
#. ~ Biomancer spell
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Flesh Pouch"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
msgid ""
"This spell grows a large pouch out of your skin on your back, allowing you "
"to store your gear in it."
msgstr ""
"Este hechizo hace crecer una gran bolsa detu piel en la espalda, "
"permitiéndote almacenar tu equipo en ella."

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
msgid "Conjure Bonespear"
msgstr "Conjurar Lanza de Huesos"

#. ~ Description of spell "Conjure Bonespear"
#. ~ Biomancer spell
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Conjure Bonespear"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
msgid ""
"This spell creates a long shaft of bone with a wicked point and blades along"
" its length."
msgstr ""
"Este hechizo crea un largo eje de hueso con una punta malvada y cuchillas a "
"lo largo de su longitud."

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
msgid "Evolved Conjure Bonespear"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of spell "Evolved Conjure Bonespear"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
msgid ""
"This spell creates a long shaft of bone with a wicked point and blades along"
" its length.  Now you know this spell like the back of your hand, and start "
"to design your own version."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
msgid "Biomancer Rune"
msgstr "Runa Biomante"

#. ~ Description of spell "Biomancer Rune"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
msgid ""
"This ritual creates a small pebble attuned to Biomancers.  You can use the "
"rune as a catalyst for recipes."
msgstr ""
"Este ritual crea un pequeño guijarro en sintonía con los biománticos. Puedes"
" usar la runa como catalizador para las recetas."

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
msgid "Paralytic Dart"
msgstr "Dardo Paralizante"

#. ~ Description of spell "Paralytic Dart"
#. ~ Biomancer spell
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Paralytic Dart"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
msgid ""
"Spits a warped needle of sinew and bone, carrying with it a sting that slows"
" your victim."
msgstr ""
"Escupe una aguja deformada de tendón y hueso, llevando consigo un aguijón "
"que ralentiza a su víctima."

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
msgid "Visceral Projection"
msgstr "Proyección Visceral"

#. ~ Description of spell "Visceral Projection"
#. ~ Biomancer spell
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Visceral Projection"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
msgid ""
"Projects a spray of acrid blood and gore all around you, growing to ensnare "
"your prey in a field of twitching poisonous tendrils."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
msgid "Visceral Paralysis"
msgstr "Parálisis Viral"

#. ~ Description of spell "Visceral Paralysis"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
msgid "Paralytic side effect of Projection."
msgstr "Efecto secundario paralizante de la Proyección."

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
msgid "Visceral Backlash"
msgstr "Retroceso Visceral"

#. ~ Description of spell "Visceral Backlash"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
msgid "Hits the user with side effects too."
msgstr "También tiene efectos secundarios para el usuario."

#. ~ Spell name
#. ~ Name of effect type id "bio_weave"
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/vampire_spells.json
msgid "Coagulant Weave"
msgstr "Tejido coagulante"

#. ~ Description of spell "Coagulant Weave"
#. ~ Biomancer spell
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Coagulant Weave"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
msgid ""
"Turns your biological mastery inwards, medically enhancing your flesh.  "
"Rather than strength of healing, it staves off blood loss and purges wounds "
"before they can turn septic, at the cost of increased hunger and thirst."
msgstr ""
"Vuelve tu dominio biológico hacia adentro, mejorando médicamente tu carne. "
"En lugar de la fuerza de curación, evita la pérdida de sangre y purga las "
"heridas antes de que se vuelvan sépticas, a costa del aumento del hambre y "
"la sed."

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
msgid "Caustic Feedback"
msgstr "Retroalimentación Cáustica"

#. ~ Description of spell "Caustic Feedback"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
msgid "This is a sub-spell of the Caustic Aura spell."
msgstr "Esto es un subhechizo del hechizo Aura Cáustica."

#. ~ Sound description of spell "Caustic Feedback"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
msgid "acidic sizzle!"
msgstr "¡chispas acidas!"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
msgid "Caustic Aura"
msgstr "Aura Cáustica"

#. ~ Description of spell "Caustic Aura"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
msgid ""
"This spell suspends acid in a layer around you, corroding melee attackers "
"when struck and enhancing your melee damage."
msgstr ""
"Este hechizo suspende el ácido en una capa a tu alrededor, corroyendo a los "
"atacantes c. a c. cuando te golpean y aumentando tu daño c. a c."

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
msgid "Improved Caustic Aura"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of spell "Improved Caustic Aura"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/biomancer.json
msgid ""
"This spell suspends acid in a layer around you, corroding melee attackers "
"when struck and enhancing your melee damage.  Now you know this spell like "
"the back of your hand, and start to design your own version."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/black_dragon.json
msgid "Acid Claw"
msgstr "Garra Ácida"

#. ~ Description of spell "Acid Claw"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/black_dragon.json
msgid ""
"Your claws glow with yellow acid energy, and as you swipe your claw a wave "
"of acid sweeps forth from it."
msgstr ""
"Tus garras brillan con energía ácida amarilla, y al deslizar tu garra una "
"ola de ácido sale de ella."

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/black_dragon.json
msgid "Acid Bite"
msgstr "Mordisco Ácido"

#. ~ Description of spell "Acid Bite"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/black_dragon.json
msgid "Your maw drips with acid as you make a bite attack."
msgstr "Tus fauces gotean ácido mientras haces un ataque de mordisco."

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/black_dragon.json
msgid "Dragon's Bite"
msgstr "Mordisco de Dragón"

#. ~ Description of spell "Dragon's Bite"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/black_dragon.json
msgid "The bite damage in Acid Bite."
msgstr "El daño por mordedura de Mordisco Ácida."

#. ~ Spell name
#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/black_dragon.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "Black Dragon Shell"
msgid_plural "Black Dragon Shells"
msgstr[0] "Caparazón de Dragón Negro"
msgstr[1] "Caparazones de Dragón Negro"
msgstr[2] "Caparazones de Dragón Negro"

#. ~ Description of spell "Black Dragon Shell"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/black_dragon.json
msgid ""
"You channel your inner draconic magic to protect yourself from damage and "
"reflect some back as acid damage."
msgstr ""
"Canalizas tu magia dracónica interior para protegerte del daño y reflejar "
"una parte como daño de ácido."

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/black_dragon.json
msgid "Black Dragon Shell Retaliation"
msgstr "Represalia de Dragón Negro"

#. ~ Description of spell "Black Dragon Shell Retaliation"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/black_dragon.json
msgid "Acid burst that punishes attackers."
msgstr "Ráfagas de ácido que castiga a los atacantes."

#. ~ Spell name
#. ~ Name of effect type id "dragon_terror_debuff"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/black_dragon.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_effects.json
msgid "Dragon Terror"
msgstr "Terror de Dragón"

#. ~ Description of spell "Dragon Terror"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/black_dragon.json
msgid ""
"With an ear piercing roar, you channel the inner power of dragons and strike"
" fear into those who stand before you, slowing their escape from your "
"terror."
msgstr ""
"Con un rugido desgarrador, canalizas el poder interior de los dragones e "
"infundes miedo a los que se encuentran ante ti, frenando su huida de tu "
"terror."

#. ~ Spell name
#. ~ Name of effect type id "dragon_boost"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/black_dragon.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutation_effects.json
msgid "Dragon Boost"
msgstr "Impulso de Dragón"

#. ~ Description of spell "Dragon Boost"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/black_dragon.json
msgid ""
"You let out a mighty roar as you infuse yourself with the power of Dragons."
msgstr ""
"Dejas escapar un poderoso rugido mientras te infundes con el poder de los "
"Dragones."

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/black_dragon.json
msgid "Health Recovery"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of spell "Health Recovery"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/black_dragon.json
msgid "Minor health recovery spell associated with Dragon Boost."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/black_dragon.json
msgid "Stamina Recovery"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of spell "Stamina Recovery"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/black_dragon.json
msgid "Minor stamina recovery spell associated with Dragon Boost."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/black_dragon.json
msgid "Dragon Acid Spit"
msgstr "Saliva Ácida de Dragón"

#. ~ Description of spell "Dragon Acid Spit"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/black_dragon.json
msgid ""
"You conjure up acidic spittle that you can shoot long distances as you close"
" in on your terrified prey."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Spell name
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/black_dragon.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Black Dragon Breath"
msgstr "Aliento de Dragón Negro"

#. ~ Description of spell "Black Dragon Breath"
#. ~ Description of spell "Black Dragons' Breath"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/black_dragon.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/dragonbreath.json
msgid "Spews a line of acid from your mouth."
msgstr "Echa una línea de ácido por la boca."

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/manatouched.json
msgid "Crystallize Mana"
msgstr "Cristalizar Maná"

#. ~ Description of spell "Crystallize Mana"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
msgid "Crystallizes mana into solid form."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
msgid "Crystallize Mana (1)"
msgstr "Cristalizar Maná (1)"

#. ~ Description of spell "Crystallize Mana (1)"
#. ~ Description of spell "Crystallize Mana (5)"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
msgid ""
"Mana Crystal Spawner.  If you can see this you probably debugged it in."
msgstr ""
"Generador de Cristales de Maná. Si puedes ver esto probablemente lo hayas "
"depurado."

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
msgid "Crystallize Mana (5)"
msgstr "Cristalizar Maná (5)"

#. ~ Spell name
#. ~ Name of effect type id "mana_fatigue"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/classless.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
