"after, the massive pressure wave will crush everything inside, inflicting "
"barotrarumatic injuries on everyone effected.  It will also try to pull "
"unprepared creatures inside the zone before attack."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/stormshaper.json
msgid "Vacuum Decompression Pull"
