#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Vulcanist.json
msgid "Lava Bomb Shrapnel"
msgstr "Bomba de Lava Metralla"

#. ~ Description of spell "Lava Bomb Shrapnel"
#. ~ Description of spell "Lava Bomb Heat"
#. ~ Description of spell "Lava Bomb Terrain"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Vulcanist.json
msgid "This is a sub spell for the Lava Bomb spell."
msgstr "Este es un subhechizo para el hechizo de Bomba de Lava."

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Vulcanist.json
msgid "Lava Bomb Heat"
msgstr "Calor de la Bomba de Lava"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Vulcanist.json
msgid "Lava Bomb Terrain"
msgstr "Terreno de Bomba de Lava"

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Vulcanist.json
msgid "Lava Bomb"
msgstr "Bomba Lava"

#. ~ Description of spell "Lava Bomb"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Vulcanist.json
msgid ""
"You tear up the ground beneath you to fire a lava bomb: a globe of lava "
"surrounded by hot, solid rock.  It shatters upon impact, spraying shards of "
"rock and lava everywhere."
msgstr ""
"Desgarras el suelo debajo de ti para disparar una bomba de lava: un globo de"
" lava rodeado de roca caliente y sólida. Se rompe en el impacto, rociando "
"fragmentos de roca y lava por todas partes."

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Vulcanist.json
msgid "Pyroclastic Flow"
msgstr "Flujo Piroclástico"

#. ~ Description of spell "Pyroclastic Flow"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Vulcanist.json
msgid ""
"Pulls up the heat of the Earth, along with considerable smoke mixed with "
"ashes."
msgstr ""
"Extrae el calor de la Tierra junto con un humo considerable mezclado con "
"ceniza."

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Vulcanist.json
msgid "Pyroclastic Flow Smoke"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of spell "Pyroclastic Flow Smoke"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Vulcanist.json
msgid ""
"Creates smoke in the area.  Subspell; you aren't allowed to see it except in"
" debug mode."
msgstr ""
"Crea humo en el área. Subhechizo; no se te permite ver esto excepto en modo "
"depuración."

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Wither_Mage.json
msgid "Assassin Teleport"
msgstr "Teletransporte Asesino"

#. ~ Description of spell "Assassin Teleport"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Wither_Mage.json
msgid "This is a sub-spell for Assassin Strike.  It teleports you."
msgstr "Este es un subhechizo de Golpe de Asesino. Te teletransporta."

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Wither_Mage.json
msgid "Assassin Toxic Smoke"
msgstr "Humo Tóxico Asesino"

#. ~ Description of spell "Assassin Toxic Smoke"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Wither_Mage.json
msgid ""
"This is a sub-spell for Assassin Strike.  It generates toxic smoke in an "
"area."
msgstr ""
"Este es un subhechizo de Golpe Asesino. Genera humo tóxico en un área."

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Wither_Mage.json
msgid "Assassin Strike"
msgstr "Golpe Asesino"

#. ~ Description of spell "Assassin Strike"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Wither_Mage.json
msgid "You strike a poisonous blow and disappear in a puff of toxic smoke."
msgstr "Das un golpe venenoso y desapareces en una bocanada de humo tóxico."

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Wither_Mage.json
msgid "Life Drain"
msgstr "Drenaje de Vida"

#. ~ Description of spell "Life Drain"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Wither_Mage.json
msgid ""
"This spell takes some of a target's life; part of it comes to you in a less-"
"potent form."
msgstr ""
"Este hechizo extrae parte de la vida del objetivo; una pequeña parte de ella"
" te llega."

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Wither_Mage.json
msgid "Life Drain Stamina"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of spell "Life Drain Stamina"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/attunements/Wither_Mage.json
msgid ""
"Gives you a bit of stamina.  Subspell; you aren't allowed to see it except "
"in debug mode."
msgstr ""
"Te da un poco de vigor. Subhechizo; no se te permite ver esto excepto en "
"modo depuración."

#. ~ Name of achievement
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/achievements/mutations.json
msgid "Dragons don't have nightmares, nightmares have dragons!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of requirement of achievement "Dragons don't have nightmares,
#. nightmares have dragons!"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/achievements/mutations.json
msgid "crossed black dragon mutation threshold"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Name of achievement
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/achievements/spells.json
msgid "Would-be Wizard"
msgstr "Aspirante a maga"

#. ~ Name of achievement
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/achievements/spells.json
msgid "Wizard's Apprentice"
msgstr "Aprendiz de Mago"

#. ~ Name of achievement
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/achievements/spells.json
msgid "Journeyman Wizard"
msgstr "Oficial Mago"

#. ~ Description of achievement "Journeyman Wizard"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/achievements/spells.json
msgid ""
"You have learned enough spells that in more reasonable times you would have "
"graduated from your apprenticeship."
msgstr ""
"Has aprendido suficientes hechizos que, en tiempos más razonables, te "
"habrían permitido terminar tu aprendizaje."

#. ~ Name of achievement
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/achievements/spells.json
msgid "Archmage"
msgstr "Archimago"

#. ~ Description of achievement "Archmage"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/achievements/spells.json
msgid ""
"You have learned a large number of spells, and would be qualified for the "
"Archmage title."
msgstr ""
"Has aprendido un gran número de hechizos, y estarías cualificado para el "
"título de Archimago."

#. ~ Name of achievement
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/achievements/spells.json
msgid "Master Archmage"
msgstr "Maestro Archimago"

#. ~ Description of achievement "Master Archmage"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/achievements/spells.json
msgid ""
"You have learned so many spells, that you would have been a major source of "
"knowledge for many wizards.  Also known as a Sage, Master Archmages enjoy a "
"wide variety of perks due to their lifelong commitment to learning and "
"helping others learn."
msgstr ""
"Has aprendido tantos hechizos que habrías sido una importante fuente de "
"conocimiento para muchos magos. También conocidos como sabios, los maestros "
"archimagos disfrutan de una gran variedad de ventajas debido a su compromiso"
" de por vida con el aprendizaje y la ayuda a los demás."

#. ~ Name of achievement
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/achievements/spells.json
msgid "Senile Wizard"
msgstr "Mago Senil"

#. ~ Name of achievement
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/achievements/spells.json
msgid "Cast a Spell"
msgstr "Lanzar un Hechizo"

#. ~ Description of achievement "Cast a Spell"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/achievements/spells.json
msgid ""
"The first great milestone to becoming a full-fledged wizard is to cast a "
"spell.  Some mages simply study the spell in the spellbook until they think "
"they understand it as well as they can, but you can't beat practice over "
"theory."
msgstr ""
"El primer gran hito para convertirse en un mago de pleno derecho es lanzar "
"un hechizo. Algunos magos se limitan a estudiar el hechizo en el libro de "
"hechizos hasta que creen que lo entienden lo mejor posible, pero no hay nada"
" mejor que la práctica sobre la teoría."

#. ~ Name of achievement
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/achievements/spells.json
msgid "Spell Level 5"
msgstr "Nivel Hechizo 5"

#. ~ Name of achievement
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/achievements/spells.json
