#. perhaps have 1 egg be equivalent to 5 or more shells when making potions.
#. ~ Description of "stone shell"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
msgid ""
"The broken fragment of an owlbear egg.  With luck it might still contain "
"some of its former power, though if nothing else it's still a bit sharp."
msgstr ""
"El fragmento roto de un huevo de buhoso. Con suerte, puede que aún contenga "
"algo de su antiguo poder, aunque si nada más, sigue siendo un poco afilado."

