msgstr[2] "pociones de inicio"

#. ~ Description of "potion starter"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
msgid ""
"Strong alcohol, infused with mana and concentrated into a liquid that can "
"stabilize spells into liquid form.  You can still drink it, if you want."
msgstr ""
"Alcohol fuerte, infundido con maná y concentrado en un líquido que puede "
"estabilizar los hechizos en forma líquida. Puedes seguir bebiéndolo, si "
"quieres."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
msgid "superior potion starter"
msgid_plural "superior potion starters"
msgstr[0] "poción superior de inicio"
msgstr[1] "pociones superior de inicio"
msgstr[2] "pociones superior de inicio"

#. ~ Description of "superior potion starter"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
msgid ""
"Pure ethanol saturated with magical energy.  The sheer power concentrated "
"within causes the surface of the potion to ripple continuously."
msgstr ""
"Etanol puro saturado de energía mágica. El poder puro concentrado en su "
"interior hace que la superficie de la poción se ondule continuamente."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
msgid "large adrenal gland"
msgid_plural "large adrenal glands"
msgstr[0] "glándula suprarrenal grande"
msgstr[1] "glándulas suprarrenales grandes"
msgstr[2] "glándulas suprarrenales grandes"

#. ~ Description of "large adrenal gland"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
msgid ""
"An organ located above the kidneys responsible for secretion of adrenaline, "
"cortisol, and aldosterone.  This one is huge, whether by nature or mutation."
msgstr ""
"Órgano situado encima de los riñones responsable de la secreción de "
"adrenalina, cortisol y aldosterona. Este es enorme, ya sea por naturaleza o "
"por mutación."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
msgid "glow dust"
msgid_plural "glow dusts"
msgstr[0] "polvo brillante"
msgstr[1] "polvos brillantes"
msgstr[2] "polvos brillantes"

#. ~ Description of "glow dust"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
msgid ""
"The powdered remains of a will-o-wisps's physical form.  It seems to still "
"possess an otherworldly glow."
msgstr ""
"Los restos pulverizados de la forma física de un fuego fatuo. Parece que "
"todavía posee un brillo de otro mundo."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
msgid "magical reading light"
msgid_plural "magical reading lights"
msgstr[0] "luz mágica de lectura"
msgstr[1] "luces mágicas de lectura"
msgstr[2] "luces mágicas de lectura"

#. ~ Description of "magical reading light"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
msgid ""
"Powered by the magic of glow powder and lesser mana potions, this extremely "
"expensive little light will provide just enough light to read by for at "
"least a decade.  Use it to close the cover and hide the light."
msgstr ""
"Impulsada por la magia del polvo brillante y las pociones de maná menores, "
"esta pequeña luz extremadamente cara proporcionará la luz suficiente para "
"leer durante al menos una década. Úsala para cerrar la tapa y ocultar la "
"luz."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
msgid "magical reading light (covered)"
msgid_plural "magical reading lights (covered)"
msgstr[0] "luz mágica de lectura (cubierta)"
msgstr[1] "luces mágicas de lectura (cubiertas)"
msgstr[2] "luces mágicas de lectura (cubiertas)"

#. ~ Description of "magical reading light (covered)"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
msgid ""
"Powered by the magic of glow powder and lesser mana potions, this extremely "
"expensive little light will provide just enough light to read by for at "
"least a decade.  The cover is closed.  Use it to open the cover and show the"
" light."
msgstr ""
"Impulsada por la magia del polvo brillante y las pociones de maná menores, "
"esta pequeña luz extremadamente cara proporcionará la luz suficiente para "
"leer durante al menos una década. La tapa está cerrada. Úsala para abrir la "
"tapa y mostrar la luz."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
msgid "bulette plate"
msgid_plural "bulette plates"
msgstr[0] "placa de bulette"
msgstr[1] "placas de bulette"
msgstr[2] "placas de bulette"

#. ~ Description of "bulette plate"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
msgid ""
"The great plates from behind a bulette's head have always been prized for "
"use in shield and armor making."
msgstr ""
"Las grandes placas de detrás de la cabeza de un bulette siempre han sido muy"
" apreciadas para su uso en la fabricación de escudos y armaduras."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
msgid "bulette pearl"
msgid_plural "bulette pearls"
msgstr[0] "perla de bulette"
msgstr[1] "perlas de bulette"
msgstr[2] "perlas de bulette"

#. ~ Description of "bulette pearl"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
msgid ""
"As a bulette burrows through the earth its gills collect minute amounts of "
"precious metals and gems which slowly aggregate into lustrous gemstones "
"prized for their beauty and power."
msgstr ""
"A medida que un bulette madruga a través de la tierra, sus branquias recogen"
" diminutas cantidades de metales preciosos y gemas que lentamente se agregan"
" en lustrosas piedras preciosas apreciadas por su belleza y poder."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
msgid "dragon essence"
msgid_plural "dragon essences"
msgstr[0] "esencia de dragón"
msgstr[1] "esencias de dragón"
msgstr[2] "esencias de dragón"

#. ~ Description of "dragon essence"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
msgid ""
"This is the magical essence from a dragon, distilled into a concentrated "
"form."
msgstr ""
"Esta es la esencia mágica de un dragón, destilada en una forma concentrada."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
msgid "stirge proboscis"
msgid_plural "stirge proboscises"
msgstr[0] "proboscide de murciequito"
msgstr[1] "proboscides de murciequito"
msgstr[2] "proboscides de murciequito"

#. ~ Description of "stirge proboscis"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
msgid ""
"A long sucking apparatus harvested from stirge corpse.  Makes a poor melee "
"weapon."
msgstr ""
"Un largo aparato de succión cosechado de un cadáver de murciequito. Es una "
"pobre arma de c. a c."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
msgid "chunk of demon chitin"
msgid_plural "chunks of demon chitin"
msgstr[0] "trozo de quitina de demonio"
msgstr[1] "trozos de quitina de demonio"
msgstr[2] "trozos de quitina de demonio"

#. ~ Description of "chunk of demon chitin"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
msgid ""
"A piece of demon spider exoskeleton.  It is light and very durable, and "
"probably has some magical properties."
msgstr ""
"Una pieza de exoesqueleto de araña demoníaca. Es ligero y muy duradero, y "
"probablemente tiene algunas propiedades mágicas."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
msgid "bundle of demon chitin chunks"
msgid_plural "bundles of demon chitin chunks"
msgstr[0] "paquete de trozos de quitina de demonio"
msgstr[1] "paquetes de trozos de quitina de demonio"
msgstr[2] "paquetes de trozos de quitina de demonio"

#. ~ Description of "bundle of demon chitin chunks"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
msgid ""
"Pieces of demon spider exoskeleton, bundled tightly together for storage.  "
"Disassemble to unpack."
msgstr ""
"Piezas de exoesqueleto de araña demonio, atadas fuertemente para su "
"almacenamiento. Desmontar para desempaquetar."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
msgid "demon chitin plate"
msgid_plural "demon chitin plates"
msgstr[0] "placa de quitina demoníaca"
msgstr[1] "placas de quitina demoníaca"
msgstr[2] "placas de quitina demoníaca"

#. ~ Description of "demon chitin plate"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
msgid ""
"A large piece of demon spider exoskeleton, painstakingly cut from the corpse"
" of an adult demon spider.  A plate of this size can be used to create armor"
" plating."
msgstr ""
"Una gran pieza de exoesqueleto de araña demonio, cuidadosamente cortado del "
"cadáver de una araña demonio adulta. Una placa de este tamaño puede ser "
"usada para crear un blindaje."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
msgid "demon spider fang"
msgid_plural "demon spider fangs"
msgstr[0] "colmillo de araña del demonio"
msgstr[1] "colmillos de araña del demonio"
msgstr[2] "colmillos de araña del demonio"

#. ~ Description of "demon spider fang"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
msgid ""
"A fang from a demon spider.  It seems to still drip with poison; you might "
"be able to use this in some alchemical recipe?"
msgstr ""
"Un colmillo de una araña demoníaca. Parece que todavía gotea con veneno; "
"¿podrías usar esto en alguna receta alquímica?"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of an ammunition type
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/ammo_types.json
msgid "alumentum"
msgid_plural "alumentum"
msgstr[0] "alumento"
msgstr[1] "alumento"
msgstr[2] "alumento"

#. ~ Description of "alumentum"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
msgid ""
"Alumentum is magically processed coal or charcoal.  It burns as hot as "
"magnesium, and for a significantly longer period of time.  One of the very "
"few magical materials that is still produced in any quantity today due to "
"its usefulness."
msgstr ""
"Alumento es un carbón procesado mágicamente. Arde a tanta temperatura como "
"el magnesio, y durante un período de tiempo significativamente más largo. "
"Uno de los pocos materiales mágicos que se sigue produciendo en cualquier "
"cantidad hoy en día debido a su utilidad."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
msgid "mana dust"
msgid_plural "mana dusts"
msgstr[0] "polvo de maná"
msgstr[1] "polvo de maná"
msgstr[2] "polvo de maná"

#. ~ Description of "mana dust"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
msgid ""
"Crystalized mana in powdered form.  It faintly pulses with arcane energy."
msgstr "Maná cristalizado en polvo. Pulsa débilmente con energía arcana."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
msgid "mana pearl"
msgid_plural "mana pearls"
msgstr[0] "perla de maná"
msgstr[1] "perlas de maná"
msgstr[2] "perlas de maná"

#. ~ Description of "mana pearl"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
msgid ""
"A gemstone created by alchemy.  You can feel it attract surrounding mana."
msgstr ""
"Una gema creada por la alquimia. Puedes sentir que atrae al maná "
"circundante."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
msgid "enchanted wood"
msgid_plural "enchanted wood"
msgstr[0] "madera encantada"
msgstr[1] "maderas encantadas"
msgstr[2] "maderas encantadas"

#. ~ Description of "enchanted wood"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
msgid "Wood that has been infused with mana."
msgstr "Madera que ha sido infundida con maná."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
msgid "mana bomb"
msgid_plural "mana bombs"
msgstr[0] "bomba maná"
msgstr[1] "bombas maná"
msgstr[2] "bombas maná"

#. ~ Description of "mana bomb"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
msgid ""
"Mana bombs are powerful explosive devices developed by a little-known "
"alchemist group for use against enemy spellcasters.  These bombs are fueled "
"by pure arcane energy and can kill instantly.  The exact workings are "
"unclear, but they appear to use some kind of massive mana burn."
msgstr ""
"Las bombas maná son poderosos dispositivos explosivos desarrollados por un "
"grupo de alquimistas poco conocidos para el uso contra lanzadores de "
"hechizos enemigos. Estas bombas son alimentadas por energía arcana pura y "
"pueden matar instantáneamente. No está claro exactamente cómo funcionan "
"exactamente, pero parecen utilizar alguna clase de enorme quemadura de maná."

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "mana bomb"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
msgid "Mix liquid"
msgstr "Mezclar líquido"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "mana bomb"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
msgid "You mix the contents of the bottle, and it starts to sizzle."
msgstr "Mezclas el contenido de la botella y empieza a chisporrotear."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
msgid "mana bomb (lit)"
msgid_plural "mana bombs (lit)"
msgstr[0] "bomba maná (enc.)"
msgstr[1] "bombas maná (enc.)"
msgstr[2] "bombas maná (enc.)"

#. ~ Description of "mana bomb (lit)"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
msgid ""
"The liquid in the bottle is sizzling.  Throwing it away from you, preferably"
" at an enemy, would be a very good idea."
msgstr ""
"El líquido de la botella está chisporroteando. Tirarla lejos, "
"preferiblemente hacia un enemigo, sería una muy buena idea."

#. ~ "no_deactivate_msg" action message of item "mana bomb (lit)"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
msgid ""
"The reaction has already started - all you can do is get it away from you!"
msgstr ""
"La reacción ya ha comenzado - ¡lo único que puedes hacer es alejarla de ti!"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a trap
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
msgid "alchemical mine"
msgid_plural "alchemical mines"
msgstr[0] "mina alquímica"
msgstr[1] "minas alquímicas"
msgstr[2] "minas alquímicas"

#. ~ Description of "alchemical mine"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
msgid ""
"A pair of stabilized alchemist bombs with concentrated mana linking them.  "
"Any movement in the mana linkage zone provokes an extremely powerful "
"explosion in a small area."
msgstr ""
"Un par de bombas alquímicas estabilizadas con maná concentrado "
"conectándolas. Cualquier movimiento en la unión de maná provocará una "
"explosión extremadamente poderosa en una pequeña área."

#. ~ "done_message" action message of item "alchemical mine"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
msgid "You set the alchemic mine."
msgstr "Colocas la mina alquímica."

