msgstr[0] "Ichaival"
msgstr[1] "Ichaivals"
msgstr[2] "Ichaivals"

#. ~ Description of gun "Ichaival"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/archery.json
msgid ""
"Ichaival, the bow of Odin.  Rumored to fire 10 arrows with every pull of the"
" string.  It has gold and silver ornaments on it, as well as an ornate "
"Raven."
msgstr ""
"Ichaival, el arco de Odín. Se rumorea que dispara 10 flechas con cada tirón "
"de la cuerda. Tiene adornos de oro y plata, así como un cuervo ornamentado."

#. ~ Description of "orichalcum arrow"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/archery.json
msgid ""
"An arrow composed of a sliver of orichalcum.  The arrow has a mysterious "
"glow.  Has a very high chance of staying intact when fired, however can only"
" be fired from Ichaival."
msgstr ""
"Flecha compuesta de una astilla de oricalco. La flecha tiene un brillo "
"misterioso. Tiene muchas posibilidades de permanecer intacta cuando se "
"dispara, sin embargo sólo puede ser disparada con el Ichaival."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/armor.json
msgid "pair of demon chitin arm guards"
msgid_plural "pairs of demon chitin arm guards"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "pair of demon chitin arm guards"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/armor.json
msgid ""
"A pair of arm guards crafted from the carefully cleaned and pruned red "
"exoskeletons of demon spiders.  Fire-resistant and very durable."
msgstr ""
"Un par de guardabrazos hechos a partir de exoesqueletos de arañas demonio "
"cuidadosamente limpiados y podados. Resistentes al fuego y muy duraderos."

