msgstr[2] "armaduras de quitina demonio"

#. ~ Description of "demon chitin armor"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/armor.json
msgid ""
"Leg and body armor crafted from the carefully cleaned and pruned red "
"exoskeletons of demon spiders.  Fire-resistant and very durable."
