msgstr[0] "par de botas de quitina demonio"
msgstr[1] "pares de botas de quitina demonio"
msgstr[2] "pares de botas de quitina demonio"

#. ~ Description of "pair of demon chitin boots"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/armor.json
msgid ""
"Boots crafted from carefully cleaned and pruned red exoskeletons of demon "
"spiders.  Fire-resistant and very durable."
msgstr ""
"Botas fabricadas con exoesqueletos de arañas demonio rojas cuidadosamente "
