msgstr[2] "muñecos vudú zombi"

#. ~ Description of "zombie voodoo doll"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
msgid ""
"A remarkably accurate effigy of an undead human, including pieces of bone "
"and organs.  Necromantic magic delays immediate rot, but it won't last "
"forever.  Piercing it with the attached needle could compel it to serve you."
msgstr ""
"Una efigie notablemente precisa de un humano no muerto, incluyendo trozos de"
" hueso y órganos. La magia nigromántica retrasa la putrefacción inmediata, "
"pero no durará para siempre. Perforarlo con la aguja adjunta podría "
"obligarlo a servirte."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/cast_spell_items.json
