msgstr[1] "runas Kelvinistas"
msgstr[2] "runas Kelvinistas"

#. ~ Description of "Kelvinist rune"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/class_runes.json
msgid ""
"This magical pebble has an insignia of ice and flames on it.  It is "
"necessary for Kelvinists to channel magic into their crafts."
msgstr ""
"Este guijarro mágico tiene una insignia de hielo y llamas. Es necesario que "
"los kelvinistas canalicen la magia en sus artesanías."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/class_runes.json
msgid "Stormshaper rune"
msgid_plural "Stormshaper runes"
msgstr[0] "runa del Moldeador de Tormentas"
msgstr[1] "runas del Moldeador de Tormentas"
msgstr[2] "runas del Moldeador de Tormentas"

#. ~ Description of "Stormshaper rune"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/class_runes.json
msgid ""
"This magical pebble has an insignia of lightning and storm clouds on it.  It"
" is necessary for Stormshapers to channel magic into their crafts."
msgstr ""
"Este guijarro mágico tiene una insignia de relámpagos y nubes de tormenta. "
"Es necesario que los Moldeadores de la Tormenta canalicen la magia en sus "
"artesanías."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/class_runes.json
msgid "Druid rune"
msgid_plural "Druid runes"
msgstr[0] "runa de Druida"
msgstr[1] "runas de Druida"
msgstr[2] "runas de Druida"

#. ~ Description of "Druid rune"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/class_runes.json
msgid ""
"This magical pebble has an insignia of nature and trees on it.  It is "
"necessary for Druids to channel magic into their crafts."
msgstr ""
"Este guijarro mágico tiene una insignia de la naturaleza y de los árboles. "
"Es necesario que los druidas canalicen la magia en sus artesanías."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/class_runes.json
msgid "Animist rune"
msgid_plural "Animist runes"
msgstr[0] "runa Animista"
msgstr[1] "runas Animistas"
msgstr[2] "runas Animistas"

#. ~ Description of "Animist rune"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/class_runes.json
msgid ""
"This magical pebble has an insignia of summoners on it.  It is necessary for"
" Animists to channel magic into their crafts."
msgstr ""
"Este guijarro mágico tiene una insignia de invocadores en él. Es necesario "
"que los animistas canalicen la magia en sus artesanías."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/class_runes.json
msgid "alchemist rune"
msgid_plural "alchemist runes"
msgstr[0] "runa alquimista"
msgstr[1] "runas alquimistas"
msgstr[2] "runas alquimistas"

#. ~ Description of "alchemist rune"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/class_runes.json
msgid ""
"This magical pebble has an insignia of alchemy and potions on it.  While "
"versatile in use, the lack of attunement to any school prevents creation of "
"more advanced recipes."
msgstr ""
"Este guijarro mágico tiene una insignia de la alquimia y pociones en él. "
"Aunque es versátil en su uso, la falta de sintonía con cualquier escuela "
"impide la creación de recetas más avanzadas."

#. ~ Alchemically speaking, I see this egg as having the elements of Growth,
#. Stone, and Egg.  Growth would make things grow faster, the simplest example
#. being a magical liquid fertilizer.  Stone would be a defensive element,
#. used in creating something like a potion of stoneskin.  Egg would be
#. interesting though.  What if instead of being imbibed there were potions
#. that instead functioned similarly to the sourdough items, or the blob
#. vehicle parts, in that they take a gestation period and then you could
#. activate them and have a new item pop out.  Creatures sure but especially
#. biomancers could have temporarily-lived tools, weapons, and armor.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/comestibles.json
msgid "owlbear egg"
msgid_plural "owlbear eggs"
msgstr[0] "huevo de búhoso"
msgstr[1] "huevos de búhoso"
msgstr[2] "huevos de búhoso"

#. ~ Alchemically speaking, I see this egg as having the elements of Growth,
#. Stone, and Egg.  Growth would make things grow faster, the simplest example
#. being a magical liquid fertilizer.  Stone would be a defensive element,
#. used in creating something like a potion of stoneskin.  Egg would be
#. interesting though.  What if instead of being imbibed there were potions
#. that instead functioned similarly to the sourdough items, or the blob
#. vehicle parts, in that they take a gestation period and then you could
#. activate them and have a new item pop out.  Creatures sure but especially
#. biomancers could have temporarily-lived tools, weapons, and armor.
#. ~ Description of "owlbear egg"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/comestibles.json
msgid ""
"This egg laid by an owlbear seems almost indistinguishable from a large rock"
" until you touch it and can feel the warm glow of potential life energy from"
" within.  It's hard to believe that an owlbear could grow so quickly from "
"something so small.  Perhaps you could carefully crack it open to get at the"
" liquid golden goodness inside."
msgstr ""
"Este huevo puesto por un búhoso parece casi indistinguible de una gran roca "
"hasta que lo tocas y puedes sentir el cálido resplandor de la energía vital "
"potencial interna. Es difícil de creer que un búhoso pueda crecer tan rápido"
" de algo tan pequeño. Tal vez podrías abrirlo con cuidado para llegar a la "
"bondad dorada líquida de su interior."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/comestibles.json
msgid "owlbear egg yolk"
msgid_plural "owlbear egg yolks"
msgstr[0] "yema de huevo de buhoso"
msgstr[1] "yemas de huevo de buhoso"
msgstr[2] "yemas de huevo de buhoso"

#. ~ Description of "owlbear egg yolk"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/comestibles.json
msgid "The liquid innards of an owlbear egg.  Good eating."
msgstr "Las entrañas líquidas de un huevo búhoso. Buena comida."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/comestibles.json
msgid "hairball"
msgid_plural "hairballs"
msgstr[0] "bola de pelo"
msgstr[1] "bolas de pelo"
msgstr[2] "bolas de pelo"

#. ~ Description of "hairball"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/comestibles.json
msgid ""
"A big, ugly ball of animal spit and licked-off hairs.  Don't swallow it."
msgstr ""
"Una gran y fea bola de escupitajos de animales y pelos lamidos. No te la "
"tragues."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/comestibles.json
msgid "dragon meat"
msgid_plural "dragon meat"
msgstr[0] "carne de dragón"
msgstr[1] "carnes de dragón"
msgstr[2] "carnes de dragón"

#. ~ Description of "dragon meat"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/comestibles.json
msgid ""
"The meat from a slain dragon.  It does not seem to respond to cooking the "
"same way as other meat, making it obvious that it still retains some magical"
" properties."
msgstr ""
"La carne de un dragón asesinado. No parece responder a la cocción de la "
"misma manera que otras carnes, obviamente aún conserva algunas propiedades "
"mágicas."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/comestibles.json
msgid "scream mushroom"
msgid_plural "scream mushrooms"
msgstr[0] "hongo de aullador"
msgstr[1] "hongos de aullador"
msgstr[2] "hongos de aullador"

#. ~ Description of "scream mushroom"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/comestibles.json
msgid ""
"The mushrooms harvested from a dead shrieker.  Could be used in potions."
msgstr ""
"Los hongos cosechados de un aullador muerto. Podrían usarse en pociones."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/comestibles.json
msgid "purified meat"
msgid_plural "purified meats"
msgstr[0] "carne purificada"
msgstr[1] "carnes purificadas"
msgstr[2] "carnes purificadas"

#. ~ Description of "purified meat"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/comestibles.json
msgid ""
"Indistinguishable from pre-Cataclysm lab grown beef.  It should be excellent"
" but somehow it's just edible."
msgstr ""
"Indistinguible de la carne de vacuno cultivada en el laboratorio antes del "
"Cataclismo. Debería ser excelente, pero de alguna manera es sólo comestible."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/comestibles.json
msgid "impure meat"
msgid_plural "impure meats"
msgstr[0] "carne impura"
msgstr[1] "carnes impuras"
msgstr[2] "carnes impuras"

#. ~ Description of "impure meat"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/comestibles.json
msgid ""
"Not as tainted as previously and tastes like the real thing.  You do not "
"want to cook this for your friends, though if you do they won't know the "
"difference for a while."
msgstr ""
"No está tan contaminadas como antes y sabe como la verdadera. No quieres "
"cocinar esto para tus amigos, aunque si lo haces no notarán la diferencia "
"por un tiempo."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/constructs.json
msgid "golem core"
msgid_plural "golem cores"
msgstr[0] "núcleo de gólems"
msgstr[1] "núcleos de gólems"
msgstr[2] "núcleos de gólems"

#. ~ Description of "golem core"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/constructs.json
msgid ""
"The \"heart\" of a golem.  Makes a soft humming noise when you hold it close"
" to your ear."
msgstr ""
"El \"corazón\" de un golem. Emite un suave zumbido cuando lo acercas al "
"oído."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/constructs.json
msgid "broken clay golem"
msgid_plural "broken clay golems"
msgstr[0] "golem de arcilla roto"
msgstr[1] "golems de arcilla rotos"
msgstr[2] "golems de arcilla rotos"

#. ~ Description of "broken clay golem"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/constructs.json
msgid ""
"A broken clay golem, looking like a piece of post-modern art.  Could be "
"smashed for clay."
msgstr ""
"Un golem de arcilla roto, que parece una pieza de arte post-moderno. Podría "
"ser aplastado por la arcilla."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/constructs.json
msgid "broken plastic golem"
msgid_plural "broken plastic golems"
msgstr[0] "golem de plástico roto"
msgstr[1] "golems de plástico rotos"
msgstr[2] "golems de plástico rotos"

#. ~ Description of "broken plastic golem"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/constructs.json
msgid ""
"A broken plastic golem, like a giant action figure chewed up by an equally "
"giant puppy.  You could smash it up into recycled plastic bits."
msgstr ""
"Un golem de plástico roto, como una figura de acción gigante masticada por "
"un cachorro igualmente gigante. Podrías romperlo en trocitos de plástico "
"para reciclarlo."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/constructs.json
msgid "broken stone golem"
msgid_plural "broken stone golems"
msgstr[0] "gólem de piedra rota"
msgstr[1] "gólems de piedra rotas"
msgstr[2] "gólems de piedra rotas"

#. ~ Description of "broken stone golem"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/constructs.json
msgid ""
"A broken stone golem, not that much different from a big boulder.  Could be "
"smashed for stone."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/constructs.json
msgid "broken iron golem"
msgid_plural "broken iron golems"
msgstr[0] "gólem de hierro roto"
msgstr[1] "gólems de hierro rotos"
msgstr[2] "gólems de hierro rotos"

#. ~ Description of "broken iron golem"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/constructs.json
msgid ""
"A broken iron golem, with all iron you would possibly ever need.  Could be "
"smashed for iron."
msgstr ""
"Un golem de hierro roto, con todo el hierro que puedas necesitar. Podría "
"romperse por el hierro."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/constructs.json
msgid "broken forge born"
msgid_plural "broken forge borns"
msgstr[0] "forja nacida rota"
msgstr[1] "forjas nacidas rotas"
msgstr[2] "forjas nacidas rotas"

#. ~ Description of "broken forge born"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/constructs.json
msgid ""
"A broken forge born, with all orichalcum you would possibly ever need.  "
"Could be smashed for orichalcum."
msgstr ""
"Una forja nacida rota, con todo el oricalco que puedas necesitar. Podría "
"romperse por el oricalco."

#. ~ Description of "broken stone golem"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/constructs.json
msgid ""
"A broken earthshaper's golem, almost the same as it's natural stone "
"counterpart.  Could be smashed for stone."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/containers.json
msgid "lesser dimensional bag"
msgid_plural "lesser dimensional bags"
msgstr[0] "bolsa dimensional menor"
msgstr[1] "bolsas dimensionales menores"
msgstr[2] "bolsas dimensionales menores"

#. ~ Description of "lesser dimensional bag"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/containers.json
msgid ""
"This is a bag that can contain more than it should.  The bag magically "
"reduces the weight of its contents and expands less than the amount of stuff"
" you put into it.  It takes a few words and hand-waving to take an item out."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una bolsa que puede contener más de lo que debería. La bolsa reduce "
"mágicamente el peso de su contenido y se expande menos que la cantidad de "
"cosas que pones en ella. Se necesitan unas pocas palabras y agitar la mano "
"para sacar un artículo."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/containers.json
msgid "dimensional bag"
msgid_plural "dimensional bags"
msgstr[0] "bolsa dimensional"
msgstr[1] "bolsas dimensionales"
msgstr[2] "bolsas dimensionales"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/containers.json
msgid "greater dimensional bag"
msgid_plural "greater dimensional bags"
msgstr[0] "bolsa dimensional grande"
msgstr[1] "bolsas dimensionales grandes"
msgstr[2] "bolsas dimensionales grandes"

#. ~ Description of "greater dimensional bag"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/containers.json
msgid ""
"This dimensional bag has reached the limits of human innovation with a "
"combination of manufacturing and magical secrets."
msgstr ""
"Esta bolsa dimensional ha alcanzado los límites de la innovación humana con "
"una combinación de fabricación y secretos mágicos."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/containers.json
msgid "supergravity preservation box"
msgid_plural "supergravity preservation boxes"
msgstr[0] "caja de preservación de supergravedad"
msgstr[1] "cajas de preservación de supergravedad"
msgstr[2] "cajas de preservación de supergravedad"

#. ~ Description of "supergravity preservation box"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/containers.json
msgid ""
"A box that uses gravity magic to preserve food.  It makes the box much "
"heavier, but anything in it lasts far longer and you can store more."
msgstr ""
"Una caja que usa la magia de la gravedad para preservar la comida. Hace que "
"la caja sea mucho más pesada, pero todo lo que hay en ella dura mucho más "
"tiempo y se puede almacenar más."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/currency.json
msgid "denarius"
msgid_plural "denarii"
msgstr[0] "denario"
msgstr[1] "denarios"
msgstr[2] "denarios"

#. ~ Description of "denarius"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/currency.json
msgid ""
"Each of these mithril coins has a profile of Valzain, and strangely each of "
"these coins is defaced in some way."
msgstr ""
"Cada una de estas monedas de mithril tienen un perfil de Valzain, y "
"extrañamente cada una de estas monedas está desfigurada de alguna manera."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted.json
msgid "belt of strength +2"
msgid_plural "belts of strength +2"
msgstr[0] "cinturón de fuerza +2"
msgstr[1] "cinturones de fuerza +2"
msgstr[2] "cinturones de fuerza +2"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted.json
msgid "belt of haste"
msgid_plural "belts of haste"
msgstr[0] "cinturón de velocidad"
msgstr[1] "cinturones de velocidad"
msgstr[2] "cinturones de velocidad"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted.json
msgid "minor staff of the magi"
msgid_plural "minor staves of the magi"
msgstr[0] "bastón de los magi mínimo"
msgstr[1] "bastones de los magi mínimos"
msgstr[2] "bastones de los magi mínimos"

#. ~ Description of "minor staff of the magi"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted.json
msgid ""
"A simple carved staff, made of wood.  It faintly glows with magic when you "
"cast spells.  Wielding it slightly increases your mana regeneration"
msgstr ""
"Un simple bastón tallado, hecho de madera. Brilla débilmente con magia "
"cuando haces hechizos. Blandirla aumenta ligeramente tu regeneración de maná"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted.json
msgid "lesser staff of the magi"
msgid_plural "lesser staves of the magi"
msgstr[0] "bastón de los magi menor"
msgstr[1] "bastones de los magi menores"
msgstr[2] "bastones de los magi menores"

#. ~ Description of "lesser staff of the magi"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted.json
msgid ""
"A beautifully carved staff, made of enchanted wood.  It faintly glows with "
"magic when you cast spells, but it is not a sturdy melee weapon.  Wielding "
"it increases your mana regeneration."
msgstr ""
"Un bastón bellamente tallado, hecho de madera encantada. Brilla tenuemente "
"con magia cuando haces hechizos, pero no es un arma de combate robusta c. a "
"c. Blandirla aumenta tu regeneración de maná."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted.json
msgid "greater staff of the magi"
msgid_plural "greater staves of the magi"
msgstr[0] "bastón mayor de los magi"
msgstr[1] "bastones mayores de los magi"
msgstr[2] "bastones mayores de los magi"

#. ~ Description of "greater staff of the magi"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted.json
msgid ""
"A beautifully carved staff, made of enchanted wood and mithril.  It faintly "
"glows with magic when you cast spells, but it is not a sturdy melee weapon."
"  Wielding it greatly increases your mana regeneration."
msgstr ""
"Un bastón bellamente tallado, hecho de madera encantada y mitril. Brilla "
"tenuemente con magia cuando se lanzan hechizos, pero no es un arma de "
"combate robusta c. a c. Blandirla aumenta enormemente tu regeneración de "
"maná."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted.json
msgid "sinister minor staff of bleeding"
msgid_plural "sinister minor staves of bleeding"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "sinister minor staff of bleeding"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted.json
msgid ""
"A sinister looking staff, made of wood and with a red orb of crystallized "
"mana at the handle.  The orb and its rune faintly glow with magic when you "
"cast spells.  Wielding it slightly increases your mana regeneration and "
"allows you to cast the bleed spell."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "wizard hat"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted.json
msgid ""
"A blue pointed hat with stars stitched into it.  Wearing it increases your "
"maximum mana."
msgstr ""
"Un sombrero azul puntiagudo con estrellas pegadas a él. Llevarlo puesto "
"aumenta tu maná máximo."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted.json
msgid "fireball hammer"
msgid_plural "fireball hammers"
msgstr[0] "martillo de bola de fuego"
msgstr[1] "martillos de bola de fuego"
msgstr[2] "martillos de bola de fuego"

#. ~ Description of "fireball hammer"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted.json
msgid "Use with caution!  Flammable!  Explosive!"
msgstr "¡Utilícelo con precaución! ¡Inflamable! ¡Explosivo!"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted.json
msgid "Cloak of Morthylla the Lamia"
msgid_plural "Cloaks of Morthylla the Lamia"
msgstr[0] "Capa de Morthylia la Lamia"
msgstr[1] "Capas de Morthylia la Lamia"
msgstr[2] "Capas de Morthylia la Lamia"

#. ~ Description of "Cloak of Morthylla the Lamia"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted.json
msgid ""
"This cloak seems to absorb light except for the pinpricks of stars that move"
" across its surface."
msgstr ""
"Este capa parece absorber la luz excepto por los puntitos de las estrellas "
"que se mueven a través de su superficie."

#. ~ the bag itself gives +3 to throwing instead of knifes because of stupid
#. code oogie woogie, that make effects (and enchantments, it seems) being
#. apply in the very first move after the giving. ie if you give +3 to
#. throwing for a knife, spawn it, and then throw it, it wont be applied
#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted.json
msgid "Bag of Infinite Throwing Knives"
msgid_plural "Bags of Infinite Throwing Knives"
msgstr[0] "Bolsa de Cuchillos Arrojadizos Infinitos"
msgstr[1] "Bolsa de Cuchillos Arrojadizos Infinitos"
msgstr[2] "Bolsa de Cuchillos Arrojadizos Infinitos"

#. ~ the bag itself gives +3 to throwing instead of knifes because of stupid
#. code oogie woogie, that make effects (and enchantments, it seems) being
#. apply in the very first move after the giving. ie if you give +3 to
#. throwing for a knife, spawn it, and then throw it, it wont be applied
#. ~ Description of "Bag of Infinite Throwing Knives"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted.json
msgid ""
"This bag conjures a magical throwing knife on activation.  Only refills when"
" worn.  It also boosts your throwing abilities."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted.json
msgid "pair of wolfshead cufflinks"
msgid_plural "pairs of wolfshead cufflinks"
msgstr[0] "par de gemelos de cabezalobo"
msgstr[1] "pares de gemelos de cabezalobo"
msgstr[2] "pares de gemelos de cabezalobo"

#. ~ Description of "pair of wolfshead cufflinks"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted.json
msgid ""
"A pair of silver cufflinks with a wolf's head engraved into them.  Each "
"cufflink has a bright ruby eye and pearl teeth.  They appear to be growling."
"  There is an inscription, 'When the moon shines.  I become alive.'"
msgstr ""
"Un par de gemelos de plata con una cabeza de lobo grabada en ellos. Cada "
"gemelo tiene un ojo de rubí brillante y dientes de perla. Parecen estar "
"gruñendo. Hay una inscripción, \"Cuando la luna brille\". Volveré a la "
"vida\"."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_belts.json
msgid "magic leather belt"
msgid_plural "magic leather belts"
msgstr[0] "cinturón mágico de cuero"
msgstr[1] "cinturones mágicos de cuero"
msgstr[2] "cinturones mágicos de cuero"

#. ~ Description of "magic leather belt"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_belts.json
msgid "A leather belt.  Useful for making your pair of pants fit."
msgstr "Un cinturón de cuero. Útil para ajustar los pantalones."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_belts.json
msgid "Belt of Haste"
msgid_plural "Belts of Haste"
msgstr[0] "Cinturón de Velocidad"
msgstr[1] "Cinturones de Velocidad"
msgstr[2] "Cinturones de Velocidad"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_belts.json
msgid "Megingjörð"
msgid_plural "Megingjörð"
msgstr[0] "Megingjörð"
msgstr[1] "Megingjörð"
msgstr[2] "Megingjörð"

#. ~ Description of "Megingjörð"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_belts.json
msgid ""
"The mythical belt of Thor, god of thunder.  Or at least so it appears.  It "
"doubles the wearer's base strength."
msgstr ""
"El mítico cinturón de Thor, dios del trueno. O al menos eso parece. Duplica "
"la fuerza básica del portador."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_belts.json
msgid "lesser dimensional toolbelt"
msgid_plural "lesser dimensional toolbelts"
msgstr[0] "cinturon de herramientas dimensional menor"
msgstr[1] "cinturones de herramientas dimensionales menores"
msgstr[2] "cinturones de herramientas dimensionales menores"

#. ~ Description of "lesser dimensional toolbelt"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_belts.json
msgid ""
"A sturdy workman's belt that fits around your waist, covered in easy to "
"access pouches.  Like all dimensional spaces, they hold more than they "
"should with a fair weight reduction."
msgstr ""
"Un cinturón robusto de obrero que se ajusta alrededor de tu cintura, "
"cubierta en bolsas de fácil acceso. Como todos los espacios dimensionales, "
"sostienen mucho más de lo que deberían con una reducción de peso "
"considerable."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_belts.json
msgid "greater dimensional toolbelt"
msgid_plural "greater dimensional toolbelts"
msgstr[0] "cinturon dimensional mayor"
msgstr[1] "cinturones dimensionales mayor"
msgstr[2] "cinturones dimensionales mayor"

#. ~ Description of "greater dimensional toolbelt"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_belts.json
msgid ""
"A heavy-duty workman's belt that fits around your waist, covered in easy to "
"access pouches.  Like all dimensional spaces, they hold far more than they "
"should with a substantial weight reduction."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_belts.json
msgid "Belt of Weaponry"
msgid_plural "Belts of Weaponry"
msgstr[0] "Cinturón de Armamento"
msgstr[1] "Cinturones de Armamento"
msgstr[2] "Cinturones de Armamento"

#. ~ Description of "Belt of Weaponry"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_belts.json
msgid ""
"A wide girdle that fits around your waist, you can sheath or holster any "
"weapon into it in the blink of an eye, and it seemingly stores them "
"somewhere else."
msgstr ""
"Una faja ancha que se ajusta alrededor de tu cintura, puedes enfundar o "
"enfundar cualquier armUna faja ancha que se ajusta alrededor de tu cintura, "
"puedes enfundar o enfundar cualquier arma en ella en un abrir y cerrar de "
"ojos, y aparentemente las almacena en otro lugar.a en ella en un abrir y "
"cerrar de ojos, y aparentemente las almacena en otro lugar."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_belts.json
msgid "technomancer's toolbelt"
msgid_plural "technomancer's toolbelts"
msgstr[0] "cinturón de herramientas tecnomante"
msgstr[1] "cinturones de herramientas tecnomante"
msgstr[2] "cinturones de herramientas tecnomante"

#. ~ Description of "technomancer's toolbelt"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_belts.json
msgid ""
"A custom-built leather utility belt that instantly creates any tool that you"
" reach for.  Activate to sheathe/draw a weapon."
msgstr ""
"Un cinturón de cuero hecho a medida que crea instantáneamente cualquier "
"herramienta que necesites. Activar para enfundar/sacar un arma."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_belts.json
msgid "Belt of The Iron Whip"
msgid_plural "Belts of the Iron Whip"
msgstr[0] "Cinturón del Látigo de Hierro"
msgstr[1] "Cinturones del Látigo de Hierro"
msgstr[2] "Cinturones del Látigo de Hierro"

#. ~ Description of "Belt of The Iron Whip"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_belts.json
msgid ""
"A braided but flexible belt seemingly made of metal.  You can activate it to"
" transform it into a whip and flay your enemies."
msgstr ""
"Un cinturón trenzado pero flexible, aparentemente hecho de metal. Puedes "
"activarlo para transformarlo en un látigo y desollar a tus enemigos."

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "Belt of The Iron Whip"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_belts.json
msgid ""
"You grab the belt and it uncoils to become a flexible metal whip in your "
"hand!"
msgstr ""
"¡Agarras el cinturón y se desenrolla para convertirse en un flexible látigo "
"de metal en tu mano!"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_belts.json
msgid "The Iron Whip"
msgid_plural "Iron Whips"
msgstr[0] "Látigo de Hierro"
msgstr[1] "Látigos de Hierro"
msgstr[2] "Látigos de Hierro"

#. ~ Description of "The Iron Whip"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_belts.json
msgid ""
"A long braided flexible steel bullwhip that narrows into a sharp blade at "
"the end.  Easily capable of slicing and dicing anything that comes at you.  "
"It transforms back into a belt."
msgstr ""
"Un largo torbellino de acero flexible trenzado que se estrecha en una hoja "
"afilada en el extremo. Fácilmente capaz de rebanar y cortar en cubos "
"cualquier cosa que venga hacia ti. Se transforma de nuevo en un cinturón."

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "The Iron Whip"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_belts.json
msgid ""
"You loop the whip in your hand and it coils back into a belt form in an "
"instant."
msgstr ""
"Enroscas el látigo en tu mano y se vuelve a enrollar en forma de cinturón en"
" un instante."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_boots.json
msgid "seven league boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of seven league boots"
msgstr[0] "botas de siete leguas"
msgstr[1] "pares de botas de siete leguas"
msgstr[2] "pares de botas de siete leguas"

#. ~ Description of "seven league boots"
#. ~ Description of "boots of haste"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_boots.json
msgid ""
"Rugged yet extremely comfortable and well fitting boots of worn leather and "
"steel, they look like they've seen a lot of use and will likely see a lot "
"more.  They make your movement a lot less work."
msgstr ""
"Botas robustas pero extremadamente cómodas y bien ajustadas de cuero y acero"
" desgastado, parece que han visto mucho uso y probablemente verán mucho más."
" Hacen que tu movimiento cueste mucho menos."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_boots.json
msgid "boots of haste"
msgid_plural "pairs of boots of haste"
msgstr[0] "botas de velocidad"
msgstr[1] "pares de botas de velocidad"
msgstr[2] "pares de botas de velocidad"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_boots.json
msgid "escape boots"
msgid_plural "escape boots"
msgstr[0] "botas de escape"
msgstr[1] "botas de escape"
msgstr[2] "botas de escape"

#. ~ Description of "escape boots"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_boots.json
msgid ""
"Rugged yet extremely comfortable and well fitting boots of worn leather and "
"steel, these boots can be activated once a day to escape from nasty "
"situations, teleporting you a good distance in a random direction."
msgstr ""
"Botas robustas pero extremadamente cómodas y bien ajustadas de cuero y acero"
" gastado, estas botas pueden activarse una vez al día para escapar de "
"situaciones desagradables, teletransportándote a una buena distancia en una "
"dirección aleatoria."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_boots.json
msgid "freerunner's boots"
msgid_plural "freerunner's boots"
msgstr[0] "botas del corredor libre"
msgstr[1] "pares de botas del corredor libre"
msgstr[2] "pares de botas del corredor libre"

#. ~ Description of "freerunner's boots"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_boots.json
msgid ""
"Rugged yet extremely comfortable and well fitting boots of worn leather and "
"steel, seeming a bit more flexible and breathable than typical for their "
"materials.  The enchantment they bear helps guide their wearer in their "
"motions, to make movement around and over obstacles much more fluid and "
"efficient."
msgstr ""
"Botas robustas, extremadamente cómodas y bien ajustadas de cuero y acero, "
"que parecen un poco más flexibles y transpirables que las típicas para sus "
"materiales. El encantamiento que llevan ayuda a guiar a su portador en sus "
"movimientos, para hacer que el movimiento alrededor y sobre los obstáculos "
"sea mucho más fluido y eficiente."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_boots.json
msgid "boots of grounding"
msgid_plural "pairs of boots of grounding"
msgstr[0] "botas de enraizamiento"
msgstr[1] "pares de botas de enraizamiento"
msgstr[2] "pares de botas de enraizamiento"

#. ~ Description of "boots of grounding"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_boots.json
msgid ""
"Rugged yet extremely comfortable and well fitting boots of leather with "
"small engraved runes seemingly filled with rubber.  When worn, you are "
"immune to damage from electricity."
msgstr ""
"Botas de cuero resistentes pero extremadamente cómodas y bien ajustadas con "
"pequeñas runas grabadas que parecen estar llenas de goma. Cuando se llevan, "
"provocan inmunidad a los daños por electricidad."

#. ~ Description of "platinum bracelet"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_bracelet.json
msgid ""
"A bracelet, completely covered with a large amount of runes from both sides."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
