msgid_plural "steel bracers"
msgstr[0] "brazalete de acero"
msgstr[1] "brazaletes de acero"
msgstr[2] "brazaletes de acero"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_bracers.json
msgid "bracer of lesser defense"
msgid_plural "bracers of lesser defense"
msgstr[0] "brazalete de defensa menor"
msgstr[1] "brazaletes de defensa menor"
msgstr[2] "brazaletes de defensa menor"

#. ~ Description of "bracer of lesser defense"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_bracers.json
msgid ""
"A light but extremely sturdy steel bracer with an ornate shield engraved on "
"the top, silver accentuates the intricate design.  It protects your body "
"with a light aura to reduce damage you take."
msgstr ""
"Un brazalete de acero ligero pero extremadamente robusto con un escudo "
"ornamentado grabado en la parte superior, la plata acentúa el intrincado "
"diseño. Protege tu cuerpo con un aura ligera para reducir el daño que "
"recibes."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_bracers.json
msgid "bracer of greater defense"
msgid_plural "bracers of greater defense"
msgstr[0] "brazalete mayor de defensa"
msgstr[1] "brazaletes mayores de defensa"
msgstr[2] "brazaletes mayores de defensa"

#. ~ Description of "bracer of greater defense"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_bracers.json
msgid ""
"A light but extremely sturdy steel bracer with an ornate shield engraved on "
"the top, gold accentuates the intricate design.  It protects your body with "
"a strong aura to reduce damage you take."
msgstr ""
"Un brazalete de acero ligero pero extremadamente robusto con un escudo "
"ornamentado grabado en la parte superior, el oro acentúa el intrincado "
"diseño. Protege tu cuerpo con un aura fuerte para reducir el daño que "
"recibes."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_bracers.json
msgid "lesser bracer of lightning"
msgid_plural "lesser bracers of lightning"
msgstr[0] "brazalete menor de relámpago"
msgstr[1] "brazaletes menores de relámpago"
msgstr[2] "brazaletes menores de relámpago"

#. ~ Description of "lesser bracer of lightning"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_bracers.json
msgid ""
"A light but extremely sturdy steel bracer with an ornate bundle of lightning"
" bolts engraved on the top, silver accentuates the intricate design.  It "
"protects your body with a light aura to reduce electrical damage you take, "
"as well as being able to release a Jolt spell 3 times a day."
msgstr ""
"Un ligero pero extremadamente robusto brazalete de acero con un ornamentado "
"haz de rayos grabado en la parte superior, la plata acentúa el intrincado "
"diseño. Protege tu cuerpo con un aura ligera para reducir el daño eléctrico "
"que recibes, además de poder liberar un hechizo de sacudida 3 veces al día."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_bracers.json
msgid "greater bracer of lightning"
msgid_plural "greater bracers of lightning"
msgstr[0] "brazalete mayor de relámpago"
msgstr[1] "brazaletes  mayores de relámpagos"
msgstr[2] "brazaletes  mayores de relámpagos"

#. ~ Description of "greater bracer of lightning"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_bracers.json
msgid ""
"A light but extremely sturdy steel bracer with an ornate bundle of lightning"
" bolts engraved on the top, gold accentuates the intricate design.  It "
"protects your body with a strong aura to reduce electrical damage you take, "
"as well as being able to release a Lightning Bolt spell 3 times a day."
msgstr ""
"Un ligero pero extremadamente robusto brazalete de acero con un ornamentado "
"haz de rayos grabado en la parte superior, el oro acentúa el intrincado "
"diseño. Protege tu cuerpo con un aura fuerte para reducir el daño eléctrico "
"que recibes, además de ser capaz de liberar un hechizo de Rayo 3 veces al "
"día."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_cloaks.json
msgid "Wildshape Cloak: Fish"
msgid_plural "Wildshape Cloaks: Fish"
msgstr[0] "Capa Formasalvaje: Pescado"
msgstr[1] "Capas Formasalvaje: Pescado"
msgstr[2] "Capas Formasalvaje: Pescado"

#. ~ Description of "Wildshape Cloak: Fish"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A magical cloak that shimmers like fresh water under a warm sun.  It can be "
"worn to morph your body to a form that is excellent for swimming, but ill-"
"suited for combat."
msgstr ""
"Una capa mágica que brilla como agua fresca bajo un sol cálido. Se puede "
"llevar para transformar tu cuerpo en una forma excelente para la natación, "
"pero inadecuada para el combate."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_cloaks.json
msgid "Wildshape Cloak: Bear"
msgid_plural "Wildshape Cloak: Bears"
msgstr[0] "Capa Formasalvaje: Oso"
msgstr[1] "Capas Formasalvaje: Oso"
msgstr[2] "Capas Formasalvaje: Oso"

#. ~ Description of "Wildshape Cloak: Bear"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A magical cloak that smells of the forest.  It can be worn to morph your "
"body to a form that is strong and resilient in melee combat.  However, you "
"feel as if you would lose a part of yourself."
msgstr ""
"Una capa mágica que huele a bosque. Puede ser llevada para transformar tu "
"cuerpo en una forma fuerte y resistente en el combate c. a c. Sin embargo, "
"sientes como si fueras a perder una parte de ti mismo."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_cloaks.json
msgid "Wildshape Cloak: Deer"
msgid_plural "Wildshape Cloak: Deers"
msgstr[0] "Capa Formasalvaje: Ciervo"
msgstr[1] "Capas Formasalvaje: Ciervo"
msgstr[2] "Capas Formasalvaje: Ciervo"

#. ~ Description of "Wildshape Cloak: Deer"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A magical cloak that feels soft to the touch.  It can be worn to morph your "
"body to a form well-suited to escaping difficult situations.  However, it is"
" not suited for combat."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_clothes.json
msgid "enchanted parabolan wool blouse"
msgid_plural "enchanted parabolan wool blouse"
msgstr[0] "blusa de lana parabolan encantada"
msgstr[1] "blusas de lana parabolan encantada"
msgstr[2] "blusas de lana parabolan encantada"

#. ~ Description of "enchanted parabolan wool blouse"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A loose iridescent blouse in a style most often associated with pirates and "
"renfaires.  It shimmers as you look at it.  Made of parabolan wool, it "
"sometimes dimly shows reflections of things here and not.  This particular "
"one has piratical flairs and glitters with enchantment."
msgstr ""
"Una blusa suelta e iridiscente en un estilo que se asocia a menudo con los "
"piratas y los rufianes. Brilla al mirarla. Hecha de lana parabolan, a veces "
"muestra tenuemente reflejos de cosas de aquí y de allá. Esta en particular "
"tiene aires de pirata y brilla con encanto."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_clothes.json
msgid "enchanted parabolan wool breeches"
msgid_plural "enchanted parabolan wool breeches"
msgstr[0] "pantalón bombacho de lana parabolan encantada"
msgstr[1] "pantalones bombachos de lana parabolan encantada"
msgstr[2] "pantalones bombachos de lana parabolan encantada"

#. ~ Description of "enchanted parabolan wool breeches"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A well-made pair of old-fashioned pants, made of iridescent material.  "
"Comfortable, but lacks pockets.  It shimmers as you look at it.  Made of "
"parabolan wool, it sometimes dimly shows reflections of things here and not."
"  This particular one has piratical flairs and gliters with enchantment."
msgstr ""
"Un par de pantalones antiguos bien hechos, de material iridiscente. Cómodos,"
" pero sin bolsillos. Brillan al mirarlos. Hecho de lana parabolan, a veces "
"muestra tenuemente reflejos de cosas de aquí y de allá. Este en particular "
"tiene aires de pirata y brilla con encanto."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_clothes.json
msgid "parabolan wool blouse"
msgid_plural "parabolan wool blouses"
msgstr[0] "blusa de lana parabolan"
msgstr[1] "blusas de lana parabolan"
msgstr[2] "blusas de lana parabolan"

#. ~ Description of "parabolan wool blouse"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A loose iridescent blouse in a style most often associated with pirates and "
"renfaires.  It shimmers as you look at it.  Made of parabolan wool, it "
"sometimes dimly shows reflections of things here and not."
msgstr ""
"Una blusa suelta iridiscente en un estilo que se asocia más a menudo con los"
" piratas y los rufianes. Brilla al mirarla. Hecho de lana de parabolan, a "
"veces muestra tenuemente los reflejos de las cosas aquí y de allá."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_clothes.json
msgid "parabolan wool breeches"
msgid_plural "parabolan wool breeches"
msgstr[0] "pantalón bombacho de lana parabolan"
msgstr[1] "pantalones bombachos de lana parabolan"
msgstr[2] "pantalones bombachos de lana parabolan"

#. ~ Description of "parabolan wool breeches"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A well-made pair of old-fashioned pants, made of iridescent material.  "
"Comfortable, but lacks pockets.  It shimmers as you look at it.  Made of "
"parabolan wool, it sometimes dimly shows reflections of things here and not."
msgstr ""
"Un par de pantalones antiguos bien hechos, de material iridiscente. Cómodoñ,"
" pero sin bolsillos. Brillan al mirarlos. Hechos de lana parabolan, a veces "
"muestran tenuemente reflejos de cosas de aquí y de allá."

#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_gunmods.json
msgid "'Silent Winds' suppressor"
msgid_plural "'Silent Winds' suppressors"
msgstr[0] "supresor 'Vientos Silenciosos'"
msgstr[1] "Los supresores 'Vientos Silenciosos'"
msgstr[2] "Los supresores 'Vientos Silenciosos'"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "'Silent Winds' suppressor"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_gunmods.json
msgid ""
"Rather than using purely wipe media, an additional localized silence spell "
"in this tube quiets gunshots going through to hearing-safe levels."
msgstr ""
"En lugar de utilizar medios de borrado puros, un hechizo de silencio "
"localizado adicional en este tubo calma los disparos que pasan a niveles "
"seguros para la audición."

#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_gunmods.json
msgid "mana laser sight (rail)"
msgid_plural "mana laser sights (rail)"
msgstr[0] "mira láser de maná (riel)"
msgstr[1] "miras láser de maná (riel)"
msgstr[2] "miras láser de maná (riel)"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "mana laser sight (rail)"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_gunmods.json
msgid ""
"A small visible-light laser using light shown through a mana crystal that "
"mounts on a firearm's accessory rail to enhance ease and speed of target "
"acquisition.  Aside from increased weight, there are no drawbacks.  You can "
"rotate the attachment rail to fit under the barrel."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño láser de luz visible que utiliza la luz que se muestra a través "
"de un cristal de maná que se monta en el riel accesorio de un arma de fuego "
"para mejorar la facilidad y la velocidad de adquisición del objetivo. Aparte"
" del aumento de peso, no hay inconvenientes. Puedes rotar el riel de "
"accesorios para que quepa debajo del cañón."

#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_gunmods.json
msgid "mana laser sight (underbarrel)"
msgid_plural "mana laser sights (underbarrel)"
msgstr[0] "mira láser de maná (bajo el cañón)"
msgstr[1] "miras láser de maná (bajo el cañón)"
msgstr[2] "miras láser de maná (bajo el cañón)"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "mana laser sight (underbarrel)"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_gunmods.json
msgid ""
"A small visible-light laser using light shown through a mana crystal that "
"mounts on a firearm's accessory rail to enhance ease and speed of target "
"acquisition.  Aside from increased weight, there are no drawbacks.  You can "
"rotate the attachment rail to fit on the rail."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño láser de luz visible que utiliza la luz que se muestra a través "
"de un cristal de maná que se monta en el riel accesorio de un arma de fuego "
"para mejorar la facilidad y la velocidad de adquisición del objetivo. Aparte"
" del aumento de peso, no hay inconvenientes. Puede rotar el riel de "
"accesorios para que encaje en el riel."

#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_gunmods.json
msgid "mana dot sight"
msgid_plural "mana dot sights"
msgstr[0] "mira de punto de maná"
msgstr[1] "miras de punto de maná"
msgstr[2] "miras de punto de maná"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "mana dot sight"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_gunmods.json
msgid ""
"Adds a blue dot optic made from crystallized mana to the top of your gun, "
"replacing the iron sights.  Increases accuracy and weight."
msgstr ""
"Añade un punto óptico azul hecho de maná cristalizado a la parte superior de"
" su arma, reemplazando las miras de hierro. Aumenta la precisión y el peso."

