msgstr[2] "máscaras de visión perfecta"

#. ~ Description of "mask of perfect vision"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_masks.json
msgid ""
"A decidedly steampunk-looking half mask that covers the eye area of the "
"face, it has large lenses that correct and greatly enhance the vision of the"
" wearer."
msgstr ""
"Una media máscara de aspecto decididamente steampunk que cubre la zona de "
"los ojos de la cara, tiene grandes lentes que corrigen y mejoran enormemente"
" la visión del portador."

