#. ~ Effectively a durable knife spear +1 with IMPALE tech.  based off Wicked
#. Bonespear.  Lorewise, it would make sense for novice Biomancers to be
#. developing their skills in spears so they can adequately use the Bonespear
#. once they're proficient enough to summon one.  Should be weaker than other
#. school weapons DPSwise due to reach.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_melee.json
msgid "Biomancer spear"
msgid_plural "Biomancer spears"
msgstr[0] "lanza biomántica"
msgstr[1] "lanzas Biománticas"
msgstr[2] "lanzas Biománticas"

#. ~ Effectively a durable knife spear +1 with IMPALE tech.  based off Wicked
#. Bonespear.  Lorewise, it would make sense for novice Biomancers to be
#. developing their skills in spears so they can adequately use the Bonespear
#. once they're proficient enough to summon one.  Should be weaker than other
#. school weapons DPSwise due to reach.
#. ~ Description of "Biomancer spear"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_melee.json
msgid ""
"A grotesque bone spearhead on a stout wooden pole.  There is a Biomancer "
"rune embedded at the base of the head."
msgstr ""
"Una grotesca punta de hueso en un palo de madera robusto. Hay una runa "
"Biomántica incrustada en la base de la cabeza."

#. ~ Effectively a durable knife spear +2 and a barb launcher that shoots
#. sharpened bone, will have less dps because it has reach and is capable of
#. morphing into a gun
#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_melee.json
msgid "Biomancer shifting spear"
msgid_plural "Biomancer shifting spears"
msgstr[0] "lanza cambiante de Biomante"
msgstr[1] "lanzas cambiantes de Biomante"
msgstr[2] "lanzas cambiantes de Biomante"

#. ~ Effectively a durable knife spear +2 and a barb launcher that shoots
#. sharpened bone, will have less dps because it has reach and is capable of
#. morphing into a gun
#. ~ Description of "Biomancer shifting spear"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_melee.json
msgid ""
"A grotesque bone spearhead on a hardened flesh pole.  There is a Biomancer "
"rune embedded in the middle.  You feel this spear squirming in your hand as "
"if alive."
msgstr ""
"Una grotesca punta de lanza de hueso en un asta de carne endurecida. Hay una"
" runa Biomántica incrustada en el centro. Sientes que esta lanza se retuerce"
" en tu mano como si estuviera viva."

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "Biomancer shifting spear"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_melee.json
msgid "You feel the spear rapidly contracting and squirming for ranged combat"
msgstr ""
"Sientes que la lanza se contrae rápidamente y se retuerce para el combate a "
"distancia"

#. ~ Combat stats based off crowbar +1, techniques off Halligan bar(closest
#. non-magical substitute), weight based on 16oz clawhammer head, small wrench
#. and crowbar with a small benefit from being magic
#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_melee.json
msgid "Technomancer toolbar"
msgid_plural "Technomancer toolbars"
msgstr[0] "barra de herramientas del Tecnomante"
msgstr[1] "barras de herramientas del Tecnomante"
msgstr[2] "barras de herramientas del Tecnomante"

#. ~ Combat stats based off crowbar +1, techniques off Halligan bar(closest
#. non-magical substitute), weight based on 16oz clawhammer head, small wrench
#. and crowbar with a small benefit from being magic
#. ~ Description of "Technomancer toolbar"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_melee.json
msgid ""
"This staff incorporates a sturdy crescent wrench on top of a prybar and a "
"hammer on the other in a convenient package.  There is a Technomancer rune "
"embedded in the hammerhead."
msgstr ""
"Este bastón incorpora una robusta llave inglesa en la parte superior de una "
"palanca y un martillo en la otra en un paquete práctico. Hay una runa de "
"tecnomante incrustada en el cabezal del martillo."

#. ~ Pretty much the same as the other, but now with a cool touchscreen that
#. casts mirror image and does some minor things
#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_melee.json
msgid "Technomancer mana-toolbar"
msgid_plural "Technomancer mana-toolbars"
msgstr[0] "barra de herramientas-mana del Tecnomante"
msgstr[1] "barras de herramientas-mana del Tecnomante"
msgstr[2] "barras de herramientas-mana del Tecnomante"

#. ~ Pretty much the same as the other, but now with a cool touchscreen that
#. casts mirror image and does some minor things
#. ~ Description of "Technomancer mana-toolbar"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_melee.json
msgid ""
"This staff incorporates a sturdy crescent wrench on top of a prybar and a "
"hammer on the other in a convenient package.  There are electronic "
"components in the staff connected to a touchscreen embedded in the staff, "
"you only had time to cram one spell in the prototype software.  There is a "
"Technomancer rune embedded in the hammerhead."
msgstr ""
"Este bastón incorpora una robusta llave inglesa en la parte superior y un "
"martillo en la otra, en un cómodo paquete. Hay componentes electrónicos en "
"el bastón conectados a una pantalla táctil incrustada en el bastón, sólo "
"tuvistes tiempo de meter un hechizo en el software del prototipo. Hay una "
"runa Technomancer incrustada en la cabeza del martillo."

#. ~ The classical vision of the wizard gets a classic weapon.  DPS Stats are
#. between the regular and ironshod versions.  Stats are slightly worse than
#. the QS+1 due to the glass weight slowing attack speed.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_melee.json
msgid "Magus staff"
msgid_plural "Magus staves"
msgstr[0] "vara de Magus"
msgstr[1] "varas de Magus"
msgstr[2] "varas de Magus"

#. ~ The classical vision of the wizard gets a classic weapon.  DPS Stats are
#. between the regular and ironshod versions.  Stats are slightly worse than
#. the QS+1 due to the glass weight slowing attack speed.
#. ~ Description of "Magus staff"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_melee.json
msgid ""
"A quarterstaff with runes carved into it and two glass jars, heat-tempered "
"and infused with mana for durability, to act as mana receptacles.  There are"
" two Magi runes embedded at the tips."
msgstr ""
"Una vara larga con runas talladas en él y dos tarros de vidrio, templados "
"con calor e impregnados de maná para su durabilidad, para actuar como "
"receptáculos de maná. Hay dos runas Magi incrustadas en las puntas."

#. ~ It will be based on the Q +2 weapon but slightly worse, slightly better
#. than the magus staff, but its greatest strength will be its regen mana
#. capabilities, better than magi staff minor but worse than the lesser one.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_melee.json
msgid "Magus battle staff"
msgid_plural "Magus battle staves"
msgstr[0] "vara de combate Magus"
msgstr[1] "varas de combate Magus"
msgstr[2] "varas de combate Magus"

#. ~ It will be based on the Q +2 weapon but slightly worse, slightly better
#. than the magus staff, but its greatest strength will be its regen mana
#. capabilities, better than magi staff minor but worse than the lesser one.
#. ~ Description of "Magus battle staff"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_melee.json
msgid ""
"A quarterstaff with runes carved into it and two mana pearls at the tip, "
"enchanted with mana for durability.  It fills you with an invigorating "
"sensation.  There are two Magi runes carved into the wood."
msgstr ""
"Una vara larga con runas talladas y dos perlas de maná en la punta, "
"encantada con maná para mayor durabilidad. Te llena de una sensación "
"vigorizante. Hay dos runas Magi talladas en la madera."

#. ~ Flame-bladed sword covers half of Kelvinist's heat-cold theme.  Combat
#. stats equivalent to cutlass +1 with BRUTAL technique.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_melee.json
msgid "Kelvinist flamberge"
msgid_plural "Kelvinist flamberges"
msgstr[0] "espada flamígera Kelvinista"
msgstr[1] "espadas flamígeras Kelvinistas"
msgstr[2] "espadas flamígeras Kelvinistas"

#. ~ Flame-bladed sword covers half of Kelvinist's heat-cold theme.  Combat
#. stats equivalent to cutlass +1 with BRUTAL technique.
#. ~ Description of "Kelvinist flamberge"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_melee.json
msgid ""
"A sword with an undulating blade, reminiscent of a flame.  There is a "
"Kelvinist rune embedded in the pommel."
msgstr ""
"Una espada con una hoja ondulada, que recuerda a una llama. Hay una runa "
"kelvinista incrustada en el pomo."

#. ~ Stats based on scimitar +2, a weapon that will cast freezing touch when
#. it hits, has wide strike
#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_melee.json
msgid "Kelvinist Frostbind"
msgid_plural "Kelvinist Frostbinds"
msgstr[0] "Unión Helada Kelvinista"
msgstr[1] "Uniones Heladas Kelvinista"
msgstr[2] "Uniones Heladas Kelvinista"

#. ~ Stats based on scimitar +2, a weapon that will cast freezing touch when
#. it hits, has wide strike
#. ~ Description of "Kelvinist Frostbind"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_melee.json
msgid ""
"This curved sword, reminiscent of a scimitar, has a handle with an embedded "
"crystal from which a cold wind emanates.  There are Kelvinist runes embedded"
" in the blade."
msgstr ""
"Esta espada curva, que recuerda a una cimitarra, tiene un mango con un "
"cristal incrustado del que emana un viento frío. Hay runas kelvinistas "
"incrustadas en la hoja."

#. ~ Equivalent to copper axe +1.  Metals chosen for being two most conductive
#. metals + balancing reasons
#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_melee.json
msgid "Stormshaper axe"
msgid_plural "Stormshaper axes"
msgstr[0] "hacha del Moldeador de Tormentas"
msgstr[1] "hachas del Moldeador de Tormentas"
msgstr[2] "hachas del Moldeador de Tormentas"

#. ~ Equivalent to copper axe +1.  Metals chosen for being two most conductive
#. metals + balancing reasons
#. ~ Description of "Stormshaper axe"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_melee.json
msgid ""
"A forged copper axe with silver trimmings and a wooden handle.  There is a "
"Stormshaper rune embedded in the eye."
msgstr ""
"Un hacha de cobre forjado con adornos de plata y un mango de madera. Hay una"
" runa de Moldeador de Tormentas incrustada en el ojo."

#. ~ There isn't an equivalent, so the damage has been multiplied by 1.2 to
#. cutting and bashing
#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_melee.json
msgid "Stormshaper hammer-axe"
msgid_plural "Stormshaper hammer-axes"
msgstr[0] "hachamartillo del Moldeador de Tormentas"
msgstr[1] "hachamartillos del Moldeador de Tormentas"
msgstr[2] "hachamartillos del Moldeador de Tormentas"

#. ~ There isn't an equivalent, so the damage has been multiplied by 1.2 to
#. cutting and bashing
#. ~ Description of "Stormshaper hammer-axe"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_melee.json
msgid ""
"A forged copper hammer-axe with silver trimmings and a wooden handle.  There"
" is a Stormshaper rune embedded in the eye and a Nordic rune reminiscent of "
"Thor, the thunder god, in the hammer side."
msgstr ""
"Hachamartillo de cobre forjado con adornos de plata y mango de madera. Hay "
"una runa de Moldeador de Tormentas incrustada en el ojo y una runa nórdica "
"que recuerda a Thor, el dios del trueno, en el lateral del martillo."

#. ~ Tool qualities equivalent to steak knife, combat equiv.  to copper knife
#. + 1 w/ RAPID and BLOCK1, size/weight off combat knife +1
#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_melee.json
msgid "Animist athame"
msgid_plural "Animist athames"
msgstr[0] "athame animista"
msgstr[1] "athames animista"
msgstr[2] "athames animista"

#. ~ Tool qualities equivalent to steak knife, combat equiv.  to copper knife
#. + 1 w/ RAPID and BLOCK1, size/weight off combat knife +1
#. ~ Description of "Animist athame"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_melee.json
msgid ""
"A steel ritual knife used by Animists to draw blood for summoning.  Their "
"school rune is embedded in the crossguard."
msgstr ""
"Un cuchillo ritual de acero usado por los animistas para extraer sangre en "
"invocaciones. La runa animista está incrustada en su guarda cruz."

#. ~ Tool qualities equivalent to combat knife with some saw capability, to
#. represent sharpness, combat equiv.  to combat knife + 2 w/ RAPID and BLOCK1
#. with no to hit, size/weight off combat knife +1
#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_melee.json
msgid "Animist life-athame"
msgid_plural "Animist life-athames"
msgstr[0] "athame de vida animista"
msgstr[1] "athames de vida animista"
msgstr[2] "athames de vida animista"

#. ~ Tool qualities equivalent to combat knife with some saw capability, to
#. represent sharpness, combat equiv.  to combat knife + 2 w/ RAPID and BLOCK1
#. with no to hit, size/weight off combat knife +1
#. ~ Description of "Animist life-athame"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_melee.json
msgid ""
"A steel ritual knife used by Animists to draw blood for summoning.  The "
"knife has seen so much bloodshed that the rune at the crossguard seemingly "
"is constantly drenched in blood and gives you preternatural resistance to "
"pain."
msgstr ""
"Cuchillo ritual de acero utilizado por los animistas para extraer la sangre "
"usada en las invocaciones. El cuchillo ha visto tanta sangre derramada que "
"la runa de la cruceta parece estar constantemente empapada de sangre y te da"
" una resistencia preternatural al dolor."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_melee.json
msgid "springstaff(baton)"
msgid_plural "springstaves(baton)"
msgstr[0] "vara de resorte(porra)"
msgstr[1] "varas de resorte(porra)"
msgstr[2] "varas de resorte(porra)"

#. ~ Description of "springstaff(baton)"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_melee.json
msgid ""
"This versatile weapon uses Technomancy-enhanced springs to keep the staff "
"tips retracted while in baton configuration.  Activate to extend."
msgstr ""
"Esta versátil arma usa resortes mejorados por la tecnomancia para mantener "
"las puntas de los bastones retraídas en la configuración de bastón. Activar "
"para extender."

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "springstaff(baton)"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_melee.json
msgid "Extend to staff"
msgstr "Extender a los empleados"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "springstaff(baton)"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_melee.json
msgid "You snap open your springstaff into staff mode."
msgstr "Abre a presión tu vara de resorte en modo de bastón."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_melee.json
msgid "springstaff(staff)"
msgid_plural "springstaves(staff)"
msgstr[0] "vara de resorte(bastón)"
msgstr[1] "varas de resorte(bastón)"
msgstr[2] "varas de resorte(bastón)"

#. ~ Description of "springstaff(staff)"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_melee.json
msgid ""
"This versatile weapon uses Technomancy-enhanced springs to keep the staff "
"tips from retracting while in staff configuration.  Activate to extend."
msgstr ""
"Esta versátil arma usa resortes mejorados por la tecnomanía para evitar que "
"las puntas del bastón se retraigan mientras está en la configuración del "
"bastón. Activar para extender."

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "springstaff(staff)"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_melee.json
msgid "Retract to baton"
msgstr "Retraer el bastón"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "springstaff(staff)"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_melee.json
msgid "You collapse your springstaff into baton mode."
msgstr "Colapsas tu resorte en el modo porra."

#. ~ Pretty similar to the war scythe, but with less weight, more cutting
#. damage and capable of casting a strong offensive spell.
#. ~ Description of "grim reaper's scythe"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_melee.json
msgid ""
"This is a long and crooked tool used to reap souls, with a skull engraved in"
" its blade.  Magically treated to reduce weight and enhance sharpness, this "
"enchanted weapon is even capable of delivering a strong rupture attack.  Let"
" the harvest begin."
msgstr ""
"Se trata de una herramienta larga y torcida utilizada para segar almas, con "
"una calavera grabada en su hoja. Tratada mágicamente para reducir el peso y "
"mejorar el filo, esta arma encantada es incluso capaz de realizar un fuerte "
"ataque de ruptura. Que comience la cosecha."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_misc.json
msgid "heat cube"
msgid_plural "heat cubes"
msgstr[0] "cubo de calor"
msgstr[1] "cubos de calor"
msgstr[2] "cubos de calor"

#. ~ Description of "heat cube"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_misc.json
msgid ""
"A smooth steel cube the size of your fist.  Several buttons on the sides "
"activate the powers of the cube."
msgstr ""
"Un cubo de acero liso del tamaño de tu puño. Varios botones en los lados "
"activan los poderes del cubo."

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "heat cube"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_misc.json
msgid "Activate torch mode"
msgstr "Activar el modo antorcha"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "heat cube"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_misc.json
msgid ""
"You push the torch button and the cube emits a large flame from the top, one"
" that does radiate heat, but won't burn anything."
msgstr ""
"Presionas el botón de la antorcha y el cubo emite una gran llama desde la "
"parte superior, que irradia calor, pero no quema nada."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_misc.json
msgid "heat cube (torch on)"
msgid_plural "heat cubes (torch on)"
msgstr[0] "cubo de calor (antorcha encendida)"
msgstr[1] "cubos de calor (antorcha encendida)"
msgstr[2] "cubos de calor (antorcha encendida)"

#. ~ Description of "heat cube (torch on)"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_misc.json
msgid ""
"The heat cube in the torch configuration, where it emits warmth and a bright"
" flame that does not burn."
msgstr ""
"El cubo de calor en la configuración de la antorcha, donde emite calor y una"
" llama brillante que no se quema."

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "heat cube (torch on)"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_misc.json
msgid "The torch flame is extinguished."
msgstr "La llama de la antorcha se ha apagado."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_misc.json
msgid "skeleton key of opening"
msgid_plural "skeleton keys of opening"
msgstr[0] "llave esquelética de apertura"
msgstr[1] "llaves esqueléticas de apertura"
msgstr[2] "llaves esqueléticas de apertura"

#. ~ Description of "skeleton key of opening"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_misc.json
msgid ""
"A small gold skeleton key.  You can activate it to unlock locked things."
msgstr ""
"Una pequeña llave esqueleto de oro. Puedes activarla para abrir cosas "
"cerradas."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_misc.json
msgid "everburning torch"
msgid_plural "everburning torches"
msgstr[0] "antorcha siempreencendida"
msgstr[1] "antorchas siempreencendidas"
msgstr[2] "antorchas siempreencendidas"

#. ~ Description of "everburning torch"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_misc.json
msgid ""
"This is a high quality engraved wooden torch.  On command, the tip bursts "
"into flame and produces a fair amount of light.  It will burn forever."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una antorcha de madera grabada de alta calidad. Cuando se le ordena,"
" la punta estalla en llamas y produce una buena cantidad de luz. Se quemará "
"para siempre."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_misc.json
msgid "endless flask"
msgid_plural "endless flasks"
msgstr[0] "frasco interminable"
msgstr[1] "frascos interminables"
msgstr[2] "frascos interminables"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "endless flask"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_misc.json
msgid "You open the flask and discover it full of sweet, sweet, whiskey!"
msgstr "¡Abres el frasco y lo descubres lleno de dulce, dulce, whisky!"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_misc.json
msgid "endless teapot"
msgid_plural "endless teapots"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "endless teapot"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_misc.json
msgid ""
"You check the teapot and discover it full of sweet tea!  Sadly, it's cold."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_misc.json
msgid "enchanted tailor's kit"
msgid_plural "enchanted tailor's kits"
msgstr[0] "kit de sastrería encantado"
msgstr[1] "kits de sastrería encantados"
msgstr[2] "kits de sastrería encantados"

#. ~ Description of "enchanted tailor's kit"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_misc.json
msgid ""
"This is a high quality, engraved steel kit with a variety of needles, some "
"plastic spools for thread, some small scissors, even a small heating element"
" for melting and joining plastic.  Use a tailor's kit to customize your "
"clothing and armor.  This uses your tailoring skill.  It also contains one "
"of those magic spiders that constantly, if slowly, makes new thread."
msgstr ""
"Este es un kit de acero grabado de alta calidad con una variedad de agujas, "
"algunos carretes de plástico para el hilo, algunas pequeñas tijeras, incluso"
" un pequeño elemento calefactor para fundir y unir el plástico. Utiliza un "
"kit de sastre para personalizar tu ropa y tu armadura. Esto utiliza tu "
"habilidad de sastre. También contiene una de esas arañas mágicas que "
"constantemente, aunque lentamente, hace nuevo hilo."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_misc.json
msgid "spider box"
msgid_plural "spider boxes"
msgstr[0] "caja de araña"
msgstr[1] "cajas de araña"
msgstr[2] "cajas de araña"

#. ~ Description of "spider box"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_misc.json
msgid ""
"This is a small glass box that contains a spider that diligently works day "
"and night to produce silk thread that it stores in a reservoir you can open "
"and retrieve it from."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una pequeña caja de vidrio que contiene una araña que trabaja "
"diligentemente día y noche para producir hilo de seda que almacena en un "
"depósito que se puede abrir y del que se puede recuperar."

#. ~ Magazine name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/enchanted_misc.json
msgid "91/30 Boreal clip"
msgid_plural "91/30 Boreal clips"
msgstr[0] "91/30 Boreal clip"
msgstr[1] "91/30 Boreal clips"
msgstr[2] "91/30 Boreal clips"

#. ~ Description of magazine "91/30 Boreal clip"
