msgstr[1] "Gungnirs"
msgstr[2] "Gungnirs"

#. ~ Description of "Gungnir"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/melee.json
msgid ""
"Gungnir, the spear of Odin.  It is rumored to be the perfect spear, "
"perfectly hitting any target regardless of the wielder's strength or skill."
"  It feels like Odin's protecting you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/melee.json
msgid "Gram"
msgid_plural "Grams"
msgstr[0] "Gram"
msgstr[1] "Grams"
msgstr[2] "Grams"

#. ~ Description of "Gram"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/melee.json
msgid ""
"Gram, the sword of Sigurd.  It is rumored to be the sword that slayed the "
"legendary dragon, Fafnir.  Once said to have cleaved Regin's anvil in half, "
"the edge is impeccable."
msgstr ""
"Gram, la espada de Sigurd. Se rumorea que es la espada que mató al "
"legendario dragón Fafnir. Una vez se dijo que había partido el yunque de "
"Regin por la mitad, el filo es impecable."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/melee.json
msgid "Laevateinn"
msgid_plural "Laevateinns"
msgstr[0] "Laevateinn"
msgstr[1] "Laevateinns"
msgstr[2] "Laevateinns"

#. ~ Description of "Laevateinn"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/melee.json
msgid ""
"Laevateinn, the staff of Loki.  Said to have been plucked from the gates of "
"Hel by Loki.  Imbued with a mysterious magic, the magic of the trickster god"
" himself."
msgstr ""
"Laevateinn, el bastón de Loki. Se dice que fue arrancado de las puertas de "
"Hel por Loki. Imbuido de una magia misteriosa, la magia del mismísimo dios "
"embaucador."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/melee.json
msgid "orichalcum combat knife"
msgid_plural "orichalcum combat knives"
msgstr[0] "cuchillo de combate de oricalco"
msgstr[1] "cuchillos de combate de oricalco"
msgstr[2] "cuchillos de combate de oricalco"

#. ~ Description of "orichalcum combat knife"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/melee.json
msgid ""
"A variant of the combat knife that is made of orichalcum instead of steel.  "
"Sharper and easier to maintain than steel while just as dense, this knife "
"also has a thinner blade, which shaves off some weight."
msgstr ""
"Una variante del cuchillo de combate que está hecha de oricalco en lugar de "
"acero. Más afilado y fácil de mantener que el acero, aunque igual de denso, "
"este cuchillo también tiene una hoja más delgada, lo que ahorra algo de "
"peso."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/melee.json
msgid "orichalcum longsword"
msgid_plural "orichalcum longswords"
msgstr[0] "espada larga de oricalco"
msgstr[1] "espadas largas de oricalco"
msgstr[2] "espadas largas de oricalco"

#. ~ Description of "orichalcum longsword"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/melee.json
msgid ""
"A variant of the longsword that is made of orichalcum instead of steel.  "
"Sharper and easier to maintain than steel while just as dense, this "
"longsword also has a thinner blade, which shaves off some weight."
msgstr ""
"Una variante de la espada larga hecha de oricalco en lugar de acero. Más "
"afilada y fácil de mantener que el acero, aunque igual de densa, esta espada"
" larga también tiene una hoja más fina, lo que ahorra algo de peso."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/melee.json
msgid "orichalcum fire axe"
msgid_plural "orichalcum fire axes"
msgstr[0] "hacha de fuego oricalco"
msgstr[1] "hachas de fuego oricalco"
msgstr[2] "hachas de fuego oricalco"

#. ~ Description of "orichalcum fire axe"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/melee.json
msgid ""
"A fire axe made with orichalcum instead of steel.  This makes it possible to"
" chop through harder materials, and in the very well-funded fire stations is"
" preferred."
msgstr ""
"Un hacha de fuego hecha con oricalco en lugar de acero. Esto permite cortar "
"materiales más duros, y en los parques de bomberos muy bien dotados se "
"prefiere."

#. ~ Description of "Wolfsbane"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/melee.json
msgid ""
"Wolfsbane pikes are generally antiques brought over from Europe.  Forged "
"during the days when the Black Forest went from France to Transylvania, "
"these spears targeted the Loup Garou that were weak against fire."
msgstr ""
"Las picas de wolfsbane son generalmente antigüedades traídas de Europa. "
"Forjadas durante los días en que la Selva Negra iba de Francia a "
"Transilvania, estas lanzas apuntaban a los Loup Garou que eran débiles "
"contra el fuego."

#. ~ Description of "longsword"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/melee.json
msgid ""
"This is a classic medieval sword, the size being in-between the lighter "
"arming sword and later two-handed swords.  Thanks to the mysterious silvery "
"metal it was forged from, it is stronger than tempered steel while weighing "
"substantially less."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una espada medieval clásica, con un tamaño intermedio entre la "
"espada de armas más ligera y las posteriores espadas de dos manos. Gracias "
"al misterioso metal plateado con el que se forjó, es más fuerte que el acero"
" templado y pesa bastante menos."

