msgstr[2] "copias de Protección Contra las Bestias Mágicas"

#. ~ Description of "Protection from Magical Beasts"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/recipe_books.json
msgid ""
"A leatherbound book with a picture of a shield holding back dragonfire on "
