#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/attunements.json
msgid "Artificer"
msgstr "Artifice"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Artificer"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/attunements.json
msgid ""
"With the mechanically-minded Technomancer and the sheer power of lightning "
"from a Stormshaper, the Artificer has a unique confluence of skills and "
"spells to be perfect for invention.  While modern inventions and machines "
"have won out in a modern society, after a Cataclysm one has a chance to go "
"back to roots of things.  To make weird gadgets that are just as likely to "
"explode as explode the thing you're pointing at."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/attunements.json
msgid "Alchemist"
msgstr "Alquimista"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Alchemist"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/attunements.json
msgid ""
"The alchemist comes from the technomancer's skills with unliving matter "
"combined with the animist's grasp on the ambient ley lines.  It requires "
"magical talent and lots of time, but is invaluable for creating powerful "
"magical effects in a storable, accessible form."
msgstr ""
"El alquimista procede de las habilidades del tecnomante con la materia "
"inerte, combinadas con el dominio animista de las líneas ley ambientales. "
"Requiere talento mágico y mucho tiempo, pero es inestimable para crear "
"poderosos efectos mágicos almacenables y accesibles."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/attunements.json
msgid "Biotek"
msgstr "Biotécnico"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Biotek"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/attunements.json
msgid ""
"The Biotek is quite simply the marriage of technology and flesh.  It was not"
" even discovered as an attunement until recent times due to the great "
"advancements in technology in the last 50 years.  The Biotek is unique as it"
" is the only known attunement that warps the Aethereum in such a way as to "
"allow cybernetics to coincide with magical abilities, to an extent."
msgstr ""
"El Biotécnico es simplemente la unión de la tecnología y la carne. No se "
"descubrió como una sintonía hasta hace poco, debido a los grandes avances "
"tecnológicos de los últimos 50 años. El Biotécnico es único, ya que es la "
"única sintonización conocida que deforma el Aethereum de tal manera que "
"permite que la cibernética coincida con las habilidades mágicas, hasta "
"cierto punto."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/attunements.json
msgid "Blood Mage"
msgstr "Maga de Sangre"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Blood Mage"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/attunements.json
msgid ""
"Animists are known for their blood magic, and being a Biomancer you are able"
" to take it another step further by strengthening your blood.  The dark arts"
" have opened to you, and while dangerous, are incredible to behold."
msgstr ""
"Los animistas son conocidos por su magia de sangre, y al ser un Biomántico "
"eres capaz de llevarla un paso más allá fortaleciendo tu sangre. Las artes "
"oscuras se han abierto para ti, y aunque son peligrosas, son increíbles de "
"presenciar."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/attunements.json
msgid "Boreal Mage"
msgstr "Mago Boreal"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Boreal Mage"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/attunements.json
msgid ""
"Named for the auroras that grace the poles of the earth, the Boreal mage "
"specializes in auras that protect ethereally.  Boreal mages definitely know "
"their way around cold spells, but their real strength is protection."
msgstr ""
"Llamado así por las auroras que adornan los polos de la tierra, el mago "
"Boreal se especializa en auras que protegen de forma etéreamente. Los magos "
"Boreales conocen bien los hechizos de frío, pero su verdadero punto fuerte "
"es la protección."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/attunements.json
msgid "Cleansing Flame"
msgstr "Llama Purificadora"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Cleansing Flame"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/attunements.json
msgid ""
"The Cleansing Flame is the fire that burns away the chaff, in preparation "
"for the regrowth of new life."
msgstr ""
"La Llama Purificadora es el fuego que quema la paja, en preparación para el "
"rebrote de la nueva vida."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/attunements.json
msgid "Crusader"
msgstr "Cruzado"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Crusader"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/attunements.json
msgid ""
"The Crusader attunement is a clashing dichotomy of Man and Nature.  "
"Utilizing man's propensity for tools and nature's resilience, the Crusader "
"is a juggernaut in armed combat."
msgstr ""
"La sintonía del Cruzado es una dicotomía de choque entre el Hombre y la "
"Naturaleza. Utilizando la propensión del hombre a las herramientas y la "
"adaptación de la naturaleza, el Cruzado es un monstruo en el combate armado."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/attunements.json
msgid "Earth Elemental"
msgstr "Elemental de Tierra"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Earth Elemental"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/attunements.json
msgid ""
"Stone is superior to flesh.  You have allowed this axiom into your life, and"
" work to correct your own weakness with biomancy.  The strength of the Earth"
" rushed up to meet you with open arms."
msgstr ""
"La piedra es superior a la carne. Has permitido que este axioma entre en tu "
"vida, y trabajas para corregir tu propia debilidad con la biomancia. La "
"fuerza de la Tierra se apresuró a recibirte con los brazos abiertos."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/attunements.json
msgid "Fire Elemental"
msgstr "Elemental de Fuego"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Fire Elemental"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/attunements.json
msgid ""
"You have used your expertise in Biomancy to change your body more toward "
"your affinity for fire as a Kelvinist.  Fire doesn't bother you as much "
"anymore, and your blood is flammable when it touches the air, resulting in a"
" gout of flame when something hurts you.  You are also starting to study "
"more spells that focus on using your own body's affinity for fire."
msgstr ""
"Has utilizado tu experiencia en Biomancia para cambiar tu cuerpo más hacia "
"tu afinidad por el fuego como Kelvinista. El fuego ya no te molesta tanto, y"
" tu sangre es inflamable cuando entra en contacto con el aire, lo que da "
"lugar a una ráfaga de llamas cuando algo te hiere. También empiezas a "
"estudiar más hechizos que se centran en utilizar la afinidad de tu propio "
"cuerpo por el fuego."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/attunements.json
msgid "Force Mage"
msgstr "Mago  de Fuerza"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Force Mage"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/attunements.json
msgid ""
"Force = Mass x Acceleration.  This is the typical thing that people think of"
" nowadays when the word is used, but Force Mages have a different meaning, "
"coming from traditional roots: untyped magical damage appears to be a "
"ghostly \"force.\"  This might be the effect of the attunement, but the "
"cause is even more intriguing: they appear to turn Newton's Third Law on its"
" head.  Magical scholars of the 21st century have theorized that this isn't "
"really the case; instead of the opposite reaction happening on this plane of"
" existence, a Force Mage uses the Aetherium's alternate Laws to rebound the "
"force back upon itself, effectively doubling the force in the same direction"
" instead.  However this ability comes with limitations, as the Force Mage "
"can only do this for melee damage."
msgstr ""
"Fuerza = Masa x Aceleración. Esto es lo típico en lo que piensa la gente hoy"
" en día cuando se usa la palabra, pero los Magos de la Fuerza tienen un "
"significado diferente, que proviene de raíces tradicionales: el daño mágico "
"no tipificado parece ser una \"fuerza\" fantasmal. Esto podría ser el efecto"
" de la sintonía, pero la causa es aún más intrigante: parecen darle la "
"vuelta a la Tercera Ley de Newton. Los estudiosos de la magia del siglo XXI "
"han teorizado que esto no es realmente así; en lugar de que la reacción "
"opuesta se produzca en este plano de existencia, un Mago de la Fuerza "
"utiliza las Leyes alternativas del Aetherium para hacer rebotar la fuerza "
"sobre sí mismo, duplicando efectivamente la fuerza en la misma dirección. "
"Sin embargo, esta habilidad tiene sus limitaciones, ya que el Mago de la "
"Fuerza sólo puede hacer esto para el daño c. a c."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/attunements.json
msgid "Gaia's Chosen"
msgstr "Elegido de Gaia"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Gaia's Chosen"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/attunements.json
msgid ""
"The Champion of the Earth, Gaia's Chosen is blessed on all things nature, "
"animate and inanimate."
msgstr ""
"El Campeón de la Tierra, el Elegido de Gaia está bendecido por todas las "
"cosas de la naturaleza, animadas e inanimadas."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/attunements.json
msgid "Glacier Mage"
msgstr "Mago Glacial"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Glacier Mage"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/attunements.json
msgid ""
"The power of a Glacier Mage is backed by a thousand tons of ice and snow, "
"with a brutal might in their spells.  While they are skilled with cold "
"spells, their greatest strength is in offense."
msgstr ""
"El poder de un Mago Glaciar está respaldado por mil toneladas de hielo y "
"nieve, con una fuerza brutal en sus hechizos. Aunque son hábiles con los "
"hechizos de frío, su mayor fuerza está en la ofensiva."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/attunements.json
msgid "Golemancer"
msgstr "Golemántico"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Golemancer"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/attunements.json
msgid ""
"The Golemancer is the ancient myth of the clay golem, made reality from "
"constant use of Animist summons and Earthshaper self-strengthening spells.  "
"Takes some traits from the golems they create, such as immunity to slowing "
"effects."
msgstr ""
"El Golemántico es el antiguo mito del gólem de arcilla, hecho realidad por "
"el uso constante de invocaciones animistas y hechizos de autofortalecimiento"
" del Terraformante. Toma algunos rasgos de los gólems que crea, como la "
"inmunidad a los efectos de ralentización."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/attunements.json
msgid "Gravity Mage"
msgstr "Mago de Gravedad"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Gravity Mage"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/attunements.json
msgid ""
"The fundamental Laws of the universe are thought of as the end-all-be-all in"
" magical circles, and the Gravity Mage is a result of mages mucking around "
"with those laws.  Unfortunately, this attunement does not give supreme "
"control over gravity as a fundamental force, though the affinity is "
"prominent and comes with some non-negligible benefits."
msgstr ""
"En los círculos mágicos se considera que las Leyes fundamentales del "
"universo son el fin de todo, y el Mago de la Gravedad es el resultado de los"
" magos que juegan con esas leyes. Desgraciadamente, esta sintonía no da un "
"control supremo sobre la gravedad como fuerza fundamental, aunque la "
"afinidad es prominente y viene con algunos beneficios no despreciables."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/attunements.json
msgid "Overclocker"
msgstr "Overclocker"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Overclocker"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/attunements.json
msgid ""
"The Technomancer specializes in augmenting humans without actually modifying"
" them; and the Overclocker takes the heat aptitude of a Kelvinist and puts "
"that to work.  You are able to think significantly faster, and are able to "
"align your ley lines for spellcasting faster as a result."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/attunements.json
msgid "Ice Elemental"
msgstr "Elemental de Hielo"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Ice Elemental"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/attunements.json
msgid ""
"Through your power in Biomancy, you have changed your body towards your "
"Kelvinist affinity for ice.  Extreme cold has less effect on you, and your "
"superchilled skin causes frostbite when touching others.  You're also "
"starting to research more magic that focuses on your body's inherent ice "
"affinity."
msgstr ""
"Gracias a tu poder en Biomancia, has cambiado tu cuerpo hacia tu afinidad "
"kelvinista por el hielo. El frío extremo te afecta menos, y tu piel "
"supercongelada provoca congelaciones al tocar a otros. También estás "
"empezando a investigar más magia que se centra en la afinidad de hielo "
"inherente a tu cuerpo."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/attunements.json
msgid "Illusionist"
msgstr "Ilusionista"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Illusionist"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/attunements.json
msgid ""
"Through the fine manipulation of light, an Illusionist might craft "
"deceptively convincing and dangerous illusions.  An Illusionist excels at "
"avoiding direct confrontation, instead relying on decoys and traps to slip "
"by undetected."
msgstr ""
"A través de la manipulación de la luz, el ilusionista puede fabricar "
"ilusiones convincentes y peligrosas. Un ilusionista es excelente para evitar"
" la confrontación directa y, en su lugar, confía en los señuelos y las "
"trampas para pasar desapercibido."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/attunements.json
msgid "Magnetism Mage"
msgstr "Mago Magnético"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/attunements.json
msgid "Permafrost Mage"
msgstr "Mago Permafrost"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/attunements.json
msgid "Radiation Mage"
msgstr "Mago de Radiación"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Radiation Mage"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/attunements.json
msgid ""
"The Radiation mage was discovered as an attunement in the 20th century, "
"closely guarded as a military secret in close relation to the Manhattan "
"Project.  It was declassified in 1989 as a part of the attunement awareness "
"movement, but it is still poorly understood even by the very few researchers"
" that wrote books on attunements."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/attunements.json
msgid "Shaman"
msgstr "Chamán"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Shaman"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/attunements.json
msgid ""
"Deeply attuned to the spiritual fabric that shapes and nurtures the natural "
"world, shamans call upon the primeval spirits of nature for aid and advice."
"  Be careful however, for ancient spirits are fickle and unknowable things."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/attunements.json
msgid "Shapeshifter"
msgstr "Cambiaformas"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Shapeshifter"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/attunements.json
msgid ""
"The shapeshifter is the Biomancer refined - able to use a flicker of mana to"
" change shape at the drop of a hat to make yourself more inviting or shape "
"others into desired shapes."
msgstr ""
"El cambiaformas es el Biomántico refinado, capaz de utilizar un destello de "
"maná para cambiar de forma a la primera de cambio para hacerse más atractivo"
" o moldear a otros en formas deseadas."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/attunements.json
msgid "Soulfire"
msgstr "Alma de Fuego"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Soulfire"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/attunements.json
msgid ""
"The Soulfire is a phenomena of the caster's spirit binding to a fragment of "
"a spirit of flame.  This makes it possible for the Soulfire to use its "
"namesake as an element - much like fire, it does burn, but it burns away at "
"the soul instead of the flesh."
msgstr ""
"El Alma de Fuego es un fenómeno del espíritu del lanzador que se une a un "
"fragmento de un espíritu de llama. Esto hace posible que el Alma de Fuego "
"utilice su homónimo como elemento - como el fuego, quema, pero quema el alma"
" en lugar de la carne."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/attunements.json
msgid "Storm Elemental"
msgstr "Elemental de Tormenta"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Storm Elemental"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/attunements.json
msgid ""
"You've used your knowledge of Biomancy to change your body into a form "
"befitting a Stormshaper.  You can better withstand the power of electricity,"
" and sparks leap from your skin when something hits you.  You're beginning "
"to study spells that utilize your body's affinity for the electric."
msgstr ""
"Has utilizado tus conocimientos de Biomancia para transformar tu cuerpo en "
"una forma propia de un Moldeador de Tormentas. Puedes soportar mejor el "
"poder de la electricidad y las chispas saltan de tu piel cuando algo te "
"golpea. Estás empezando a estudiar hechizos que utilizan la afinidad de tu "
"cuerpo con la electricidad."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/attunements.json
msgid "Stormcaller"
msgstr "Invocador de Tormentas"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Stormcaller"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/attunements.json
msgid ""
"A stormcaller is a stormshaper with an additional affinity toward the "
"weather in a localized area.  Historians agree that the druid requirement "
"has something to do with the Druid's affinity for nature, just like their "
"ability to summon animals.  You will know a stormcaller is in the room if "
"your ears pop and your hair stands straight on end.  Stormcallers are not "
"known for their subtlety."
msgstr ""
"Un invocador de tormentas es un moldeador de tormentas con una afinidad "
"adicional hacia el clima en un área localizada. Los historiadores coinciden "
"en que el requisito de druida tiene algo que ver con la afinidad del druida "
"por la naturaleza, al igual que su capacidad de invocar animales. Sabrás que"
" hay un invocador de tormentas en la habitación si se te erizan las orejas y"
" se te ponen los pelos de punta. Los invocadores de tormentas no son "
"conocidos por su sutileza."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/attunements.json
msgid "Sun Mage"
msgstr "Mago de Sol"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Sun Mage"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/attunements.json
msgid ""
"The Sun Mage has been studying the Laws governing heat, and has attained a "
"special relationship with that life-giving yellow orb in the sky.  Glimpses "
"of the Sun meet its foes, and its own burning light pierces the darkness."
msgstr ""
"El Mago del Sol ha ido estudiando las leyes que rigen el calor, y ha "
"alcanzado una relación especial con ese orbe amarillo que da vida en el "
"cielo. Los destellos del Sol se encuentran con tus enemigos, y su propia luz"
" ardiente atraviesa la oscuridad."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/attunements.json
msgid "Tundra Mage"
msgstr "Mago de la Tundra"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Tundra Mage"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/attunements.json
msgid ""
"The barren cold of the world's far reaches flows through the Tundra Mage.  "
"They find power in the all-pervasive frost of the North and in the creatures"
" that defy its deathly chill."
msgstr ""
"El frío estéril de los confines del mundo fluye a través del Mago de la "
"Tundra. Encuentran su poder en la helada omnipresente del Norte y en las "
"criaturas que desafían su frío mortal."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/attunements.json
msgid "Void Mage"
msgstr "Mago de Vacio"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Void Mage"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/attunements.json
msgid ""
"Where there is nothing, there is still power, and the Void Mages embody that"
" power.  The ability to wield emptiness itself is at their fingertips, and "
"no living creature can withstand the call of the void."
msgstr ""
"Donde no hay nada, sigue habiendo poder, y los Magos del Vacío encarnan ese "
"poder. La capacidad de manejar el vacío mismo está en la punta de sus dedos,"
" y ninguna criatura viviente puede resistir la llamada del vacío."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/attunements.json
msgid "Vulcanist"
msgstr "Vulcanista"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Vulcanist"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/attunements.json
msgid ""
"One of the most destructive forces on earth, a Volcano Mage takes some "
"aspect of its namesake.  Their spells tend to be a little slow, but their "
"resilience in proximity to a volcano is legendary."
msgstr ""
"Una de las fuerzas más destructivas de la tierra, un Mago Volcán toma algún "
"aspecto de su homónimo. Sus hechizos suelen ser un poco lentos, pero su "
"resistencia en las proximidades de un volcán es legendaria."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/attunements.json
msgid "Wither Mage"
msgstr "Mago Marchitador"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Wither Mage"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/attunements.json
msgid ""
"While biomancers focus on both life and death; Wither Mages set their sights"
" on the transitional period between these two stages.  They wield entropy "
"and decay hand and hand, using it to enhance their combat prowess to "
"surgical precision.  This confluence of abilities are what lead to assassin "
"mages gaining this attunement."
msgstr ""
"Mientras que los biománticos se centran en la vida y en la muerte, los Magos"
" Marchitadores se centran en el periodo de transición entre estas dos "
"etapas. Manejan la entropía y la decadencia mano a mano, y la utilizan para "
"mejorar su destreza en el combate con una precisión quirúrgica. Esta "
"confluencia de habilidades es lo que lleva a los magos asesinos a obtener "
"esta sintonía."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/classes.json
msgid "Magus"
msgstr "Magus"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Magus"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/classes.json
msgid ""
"A tradition as old as magic, the Magus focuses on binding and shaping the "
"energy of the universe to their will."
msgstr ""
"Una tradición tan antigua como la magia, el Magus se centra en unir y dar "
"forma a la energía del universo a su voluntad."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/classes.json
msgid "Animist"
msgstr "Animista"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Animist"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/classes.json
msgid ""
"The animist tradition is a relatively new school of magical thought, formed "
"through combination of many older ways that focus on harmony and connection "
"to the natural world.  This does not mean that animists are passive: the "
"natural world is a savage place."
msgstr ""
"La tradición animista es una escuela relativamente nueva de pensamiento "
"mágico, formada a través de la combinación de muchas formas antiguas que se "
"centran en la armonía y la conexión con el mundo natural. Esto no significa "
"que los animistas sean pasivos: el mundo natural es un lugar salvaje."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/classes.json
msgid "Kelvinist"
msgstr "Kelvinista"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Kelvinist"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/classes.json
msgid ""
"Disciples of the great Archwizard Lord Kelvin.  Kelvinists focus their magic"
" on manipulation and control of the temperature of their environment, "
"leading to spectacularly powerful explosions or bone-chilling cold.  Your "
"powers grant you some immunity from fire, that raises with your skills."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/classes.json
msgid "Stormshaper"
msgstr "Moldeador de Tormentas"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Stormshaper"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/classes.json
msgid ""
"Stormshapers follow ancient arcane disciplines of meditation and harmony "
"with the winds and tides that shape the planet.  Through their deep "
"connection to these forces, they can request powerful changes.  Your powers "
"grant you some immunity from electricity, that raises with your skills."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/classes.json
msgid "Technomancer"
msgstr "Tecnomante"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Technomancer"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/classes.json
msgid ""
"Technomancers are the new breed of modern magician, blending their arcane "
"might with their advanced knowledge of the fundamental nature of the "
"universe.  They use technology to enhance their magic and vice versa."
msgstr ""
"Los tecnomantes son la nueva raza de magos modernos, que combinan su poder "
"arcano con su avanzado conocimiento de la naturaleza fundamental del "
"universo. Utilizan la tecnología para mejorar su magia y viceversa."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/classes.json
msgid "Earthshaper"
msgstr "Terraformante"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Earthshaper"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/classes.json
msgid ""
"Earthshapers have allowed their minds to sink deep within the stones and "
"metals of the planet, and become one with its secrets.  To a master "
"Earthshaper, spells can be as permanent as the stones they are created from,"
" and time is measured in geological eras."
msgstr ""
"Los Terraformantes han permitido que sus mentes se hundan en lo profundo de "
"las piedras y metales del planeta, y se conviertan en uno con sus secretos. "
"Para un maestro Terraformante, los hechizos pueden ser tan permanentes como "
"las piedras de las que se crean, y el tiempo se mide en eras geológicas."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/classes.json
msgid "Biomancer"
msgstr "Biomántico"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Biomancer"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/classes.json
msgid ""
"The Biomancer focuses on manipulating and even absorbing flesh; their own, "
"and that of other living or dead things.  Most other wizards find their "
"powers gross and disturbing, but no one can question the potency of their "
"abilities, and certainly not their adaptability to any situation."
msgstr ""
"El Biomántico se centra en manipular e incluso absorber la carne; la suya "
"propia y la de otras cosas vivas o muertas. La mayoría de los otros magos "
"encuentran sus poderes burdos y perturbadores, pero nadie puede cuestionar "
"la potencia de sus habilidades, y ciertamente no su adaptabilidad a "
"cualquier situación."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/classes.json
msgid "Druid"
msgstr "Druida"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Druid"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/classes.json
msgid ""
"Druids follow a wild tradition of allegiance and rebirth within the world of"
" nature, especially the cycle of death and rebirth that is the plant world."
"  A powerful Druid is as much a part of that world as the human one."
msgstr ""
"Los Druidas siguen una tradición salvaje de lealtad y renacimiento dentro "
"del mundo de la naturaleza, especialmente el ciclo de muerte y renacimiento "
"que es el mundo vegetal. Un poderoso Druida es tan parte de este mundo como "
"el humano."

#. ~ Mutation class name
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/manatouched.json
msgid "Manatouched"
msgstr "Tocado por Maná"

#. ~ "mutagen_message" of mutation class "Manatouched"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/manatouched.json
msgid "Your ley lines surge with mana and power."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Memorial message of mutation class "Manatouched" for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/manatouched.json
msgctxt "memorial_male"
msgid "Ascended to the metaphysical."
msgstr "Ascendió a lo metafísico."

#. ~ Memorial message of mutation class "Manatouched" for female
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/manatouched.json
msgctxt "memorial_female"
msgid "Ascended to the metaphysical."
msgstr "Ascendió a lo metafísico."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Manatouched"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/manatouched.json
msgid "Magic is in you.  Magic is you."
msgstr "La magia está en ti. La magia eres tú."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/manatouched.json
msgid "Mana Solidification"
msgstr "Solidificación de Maná"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mana Solidification"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/manatouched.json
msgid ""
"Your internal ley lines have become much easier for you to control, "
"resulting in you being able to naturally create crystallized mana."
msgstr ""
"Tus líneas de ley internas se han vuelto mucho más fáciles de controlar, lo "
"que te permite crear maná cristalizado de forma natural."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Seeker Bolts"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/manatouched.json
msgid ""
"Your hands glow with mana energy.  You can fire seeker bolts from your "
"fingertips."
msgstr ""
"Tus manos brillan con energía de maná. Puedes disparar saetas buscadores "
"desde la punta de tus dedos."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/manatouched.json
msgid "Subtle Spell"
msgstr "Hechizo Sutil"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Subtle Spell"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/manatouched.json
msgid ""
"You no longer need to move your arms to cast spells, due to your ley lines "
"becoming untethered from your arms.  Arm encumbrance no longer applies to "
"spell failure chance."
msgstr ""
"Ya no necesitas mover los brazos para lanzar hechizos, ya que tus líneas ley"
" se han desvinculado de tus brazos. La incomodidad de tus brazos ya no se "
"aplica a la probabilidad de fallo de los hechizos."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/manatouched.json
msgid "Silent Spell"
msgstr "Hechizo Silencioso"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Silent Spell"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/manatouched.json
msgid ""
"You no longer need to use your voice to enforce your will upon the world.  "
"Mouth encumbrance no longer applies to spell failure chance."
msgstr ""
"Ya no necesitas usar tu voz para imponer tu voluntad al mundo. La "
"incomodidad de la boca ya no se aplica a la probabilidad de fallo del "
"hechizo."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/traits/manatouched.json
msgid "Weak"
msgstr "Débil"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Weak"
