msgid "My Sweet Cataclysm"
msgstr "Mi Dulce Cataclismo"

#. ~ Description of MOD "My Sweet Cataclysm"
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/modinfo.json
msgid ""
"In the wake of the Cataclysm, sweets and snacks are coming to life.  You "
"could be one of them and walk through the Cataclysm as a human shaped piece "
"of sugar with your pet necco wafer, or you could just hunt them for some "
"sweet treats."
msgstr ""
"Tras el cataclismo, los dulces y los bocadillos están cobrando vida. Podrías"
" ser uno de ellos y caminar a través del Cataclismo como un cacho de azúcar "
"con forma humana con tu mascota necco wafer, o podrías simplemente cazarlos "
"por algunos dulces."

