#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
msgid ""
"A small humanoid made of marshmallow.  Its chocolate-coated cracker armor "
"shines dully as it bumbles around on its stubby marshmallow legs.  How cute!"
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño humanoide hecho de malvavisco. Su armadura de galleta recubierta "
"de chocolate brilla con dulzura mientras va dando tumbos sobre sus "
"rechonchas piernas de malvavisco. ¡Qué bonito!"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
msgid "marshmallow knight"
msgid_plural "marshmallow knights"
msgstr[0] "caballero de malvavisco"
msgstr[1] "caballeros de malvavisco"
msgstr[2] "caballeros de malvavisco"

#. ~ Description of monster "marshmallow knight"
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
msgid ""
"A marshmallow humanoid clad in knightly armor made of chocolate-coated "
"crackers.  It bumbles around as if looking around for something.  It's oddly"
" adorable in a majestic sort of way."
msgstr ""
"Un humanoide de malvavisco vestido con una armadura de caballero hecha de "
"galletas recubiertas de chocolate. Va dando tumbos como si buscara algo. Es "
"extrañamente adorable de una manera majestuosa."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
msgid "marshmallow champion"
msgid_plural "marshmallow champions"
msgstr[0] "campeón malvavisco"
msgstr[1] "campeones malvaviscos"
msgstr[2] "campeones malvaviscos"

#. ~ Description of monster "marshmallow champion"
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
msgid ""
"Standing tall in its shining armor of chocolate-coated crackers, this "
"marshmallow proudly strides towards an unknown goal."
msgstr ""
"Con su brillante armadura de galletas recubiertas de chocolate, este "
"malvavisco avanza con orgullo hacia una meta desconocida."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
msgid "marshmallow war lord"
msgid_plural "marshmallow war lords"
msgstr[0] "señor de la guerra malvavisco"
msgstr[1] "señores de la guerra malvaviscos"
msgstr[2] "señores de la guerra malvaviscos"

#. ~ Description of monster "marshmallow war lord"
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
msgid ""
"A gigantic humanoid armored with thick plates of chocolate-coated crackers."
"  Its frozen smile is barely visible from under its heavy helmet as it scans"
" its surroundings."
msgstr ""
"Un gigantesco humanoide blindado con gruesas placas de galletas recubiertas "
"de chocolate. Su sonrisa helada apenas es visible bajo su pesado casco "
"mientras escudriña su entorno."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
msgid "gummy cub"
msgid_plural "gummy cubs"
msgstr[0] "cachorro de gominola"
msgstr[1] "cachorros de gominola"
msgstr[2] "cachorros de gominola"

#. ~ Description of monster "gummy cub"
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
msgid "An achingly adorable bear cub made of sugary gummy goodness."
msgstr "Un adorable osezno hecho de gominolas azucaradas."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
msgid "gummy bear"
msgid_plural "gummy bears"
msgstr[0] "oso de gominola"
msgstr[1] "osos de gominola"
msgstr[2] "osos de gominola"

#. ~ Description of monster "gummy bear"
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
msgid ""
"A large bear made of flavored sugary gelatin.  Its smooth, round shape and "
"fruity smell make it somehow less scary than its fleshy counterpart."
msgstr ""
"Un gran oso hecho de gelatina azucarada aromatizada. Su forma suave y "
"redonda y su olor afrutado lo hacen menos temible que su homólogo carnoso."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
msgid "gummy gator"
msgid_plural "gummy gators"
msgstr[0] "gomicaimán"
msgstr[1] "gomicaimanes"
msgstr[2] "gomicaimanes"

#. ~ Description of monster "gummy gator"
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
msgid ""
"Slowly moving through the chocolate like a gummy log along the surface.  You"
" notice it's eye's following your movement as you approach."
msgstr ""
"Se mueve lentamente por el chocolate como un tronco de goma a lo largo de la"
" superficie. Notas que sus ojos siguen tu movimiento a medida que te "
"acercas."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
msgid "cracker kid"
msgid_plural "cracker kids"
msgstr[0] "niño galleta"
msgstr[1] "niños galleta"
msgstr[2] "niños galleta"

#. ~ Description of monster "cracker kid"
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_monsters.json
