msgstr[1] "cadáveres de profundos"
msgstr[2] "cadáveres de profundos"

#. ~ Description of "deep one corpse"
#: data/mods/Mythos/items/corpses/mythos.json
msgid "The dead body of a deep one."
msgstr "El cadaver muerto de un profundo."

#. ~ Description of "deep one corpse"
#: data/mods/Mythos/items/corpses/mythos.json
msgid "A dead body of a male deep one."
msgstr "Un cadáver muerto de un profundo masculino."

#. ~ Description of "deep one corpse"
#: data/mods/Mythos/items/corpses/mythos.json
msgid "A dead body of a female deep one."
msgstr "Un cadáver muerto de un profundo femenino."

#. ~ Description of "deep one corpse"
#: data/mods/Mythos/items/corpses/mythos.json
msgid "The dead body of a deep one, coated in congealed blood."
msgstr "El cadáver muerto de un profundo, recubierto de sangre coagulada."

#. ~ Description of "deep one corpse"
#: data/mods/Mythos/items/corpses/mythos.json
msgid "A dead body of a deep one with a gaping stab wound in its back."
msgstr "Un cadáver de un profundo con una enorme puñalada en la espalda."

#. ~ Description of "deep one corpse"
#. ~ Snippet of item "deep one corpse"
#: data/mods/Mythos/items/corpses/mythos.json
msgid ""
"The dead body of a deep one.  Its forehead bears a large bullet entrance "
"wound.  An even larger exit wound is present on the back of its head."
msgstr ""
"El cadáver de un profundo. Su frente presenta un gran orificio de entrada de"
" bala. Un orificio de salida aún mayor está presente en la parte posterior "
"de su cabeza."

#. ~ Description of "deep one corpse"
#: data/mods/Mythos/items/corpses/mythos.json
msgid ""
"The upper half of a dead deep one body, as if torn apart with enormous "
"force.  Some organs are hanging out."
msgstr ""
"La mitad superior de un cadáver muerto profundo, como si se hubiera "
"desgarrado con una fuerza enorme. Algunos órganos están colgando."

#. ~ Snippet of item "deep one corpse"
#: data/mods/Mythos/items/corpses/mythos.json
msgid ""
"The corpse of a deep one shot several times in the back with a low-caliber "
"weapon."
msgstr ""
"El cadáver de un profundo disparado varias veces en la espalda con un arma "
"de bajo calibre."

#. ~ Snippet of item "deep one corpse"
#: data/mods/Mythos/items/corpses/mythos.json
msgid ""
"A deep one corpse gored by arms fire chest to thighs, leaving the face "
"eerily and fishily pristine."
msgstr ""
"Un cadáver de profundo atravesado y disparado por los brazos, desde el pecho"
" hasta los muslos, dejando el rostro sospechosamente impoluto."

#. ~ Snippet of item "deep one corpse"
#: data/mods/Mythos/items/corpses/mythos.json
msgid ""
"The corpse of a deep one.  It appears to have been shot in the forehead at a"
" very close range leaving you a good view of its brain matter."
msgstr ""
"El cadáver de un profundo. Parece haber recibido un disparo en la frente a "
"muy corta distancia dejándote una buena vista de su materia cerebral."

#. ~ Snippet of item "deep one corpse"
#: data/mods/Mythos/items/corpses/mythos.json
msgid ""
"The corpse of a deep one, its legs and arms covered in blood.  It appears to"
" have been shot in the thigh."
msgstr ""
"El cadáver de un profundo, con las piernas y los brazos cubiertos de sangre."
" Parece haber recibido un disparo en el muslo."

#. ~ Snippet of item "deep one corpse"
#: data/mods/Mythos/items/corpses/mythos.json
msgid ""
"The corpse of a deep one who appears to have been shot to death.  Its right "
"arm is only barely still attached to his shoulder."
msgstr ""
"El cadáver de un profundo que parece haber muerto de un disparo. Su brazo "
"derecho está apenas unido a su hombro."

#. ~ Snippet of item "deep one corpse"
#: data/mods/Mythos/items/corpses/mythos.json
msgid ""
"The corpse of a deep one unblemished but for the bloody hole atop its head, "
"its bald scalp intermixed now with brain, viscera and shotgun pellets."
msgstr ""
"El cadáver de un profundo no está limpio más que por el agujero sangriento "
"en la parte superior de la cabeza, su cuero cabelludo calvo mezclado ahora "
"con cerebro, vísceras y balas de escopeta."

#. ~ Description of monster "deep one"
#: data/mods/Mythos/monsters/mythos.json
msgid ""
"A large, greenish-gray amphibious humanoid with webbed hands and feet.  It's"
" wide, flabby head is distinctly fish like with wide staring eyes and its "
"gangling limbs end in wickedly sharp claws.  It moves with an odd hopping "
"gait, occasionally dropping down to walk on four limbs."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Mythos/monsters/mythos.json
msgid "rat-thing"
msgid_plural "rat-things"
msgstr[0] "cosa rata"
msgstr[1] "cosas rata"
msgstr[2] "cosas rata"

#. ~ Description of monster "rat-thing"
#: data/mods/Mythos/monsters/mythos.json
msgid ""
"A small brown rodent with long whiskers and beady eyes.  Its face is "
"strangely human-like, as are its tiny hands."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño roedor marrón con largos bigotes y ojos saltones. Su cara es "
"extrañamente humana, al igual que sus pequeñas manos."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Mythos/monsters/mythos.json
msgid "shantak"
msgid_plural "shantak"
msgstr[0] "shantak"
msgstr[1] "shantaks"
msgstr[2] "shantaks"

#. ~ Description of monster "shantak"
#: data/mods/Mythos/monsters/mythos.json
msgid ""
"An enormous, scaly avian monster larger than an elephant.  It has slimy, "
"reptilian skin, a pair of membranous, bat-like wings and a horse-like head "
"at the end of a long neck."
msgstr ""
"Un enorme monstruo aviar escamoso más grande que un elefante. Tiene una piel"
" viscosa de reptil, un par de alas membranosas parecidas a las de un "
"murciélago y una cabeza parecida a la de un caballo al final de un largo "
"cuello."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Mythos/monsters/mythos.json
msgid "dark young"
msgid_plural "dark young"
msgstr[0] "joven oscuro"
msgstr[1] "joven oscuro"
msgstr[2] "joven oscuro"

#. ~ Description of monster "dark young"
#: data/mods/Mythos/monsters/mythos.json
msgid ""
"A horrifying, pitch-black monstrosity, seemingly made of ropy tentacles.  It"
" stands as tall as a tree on stumpy, hoofed legs, and its flanks covered in "
"puckered maws, dripping green goo."
msgstr ""
"Una horrible monstruosidad negra como el carbón, aparentemente hecha de "
"tentáculos. Es tan alto como un árbol sobre unas patas rechonchas y con "
"pezuñas, y sus flancos están cubiertos de fauces fruncidas que gotean una "
"sustancia viscosa verde."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Mythos/monsters/mythos.json
msgid "ghoul"
msgid_plural "ghouls"
msgstr[0] "ghoul"
msgstr[1] "ghouls"
msgstr[2] "ghouls"

#. ~ Description of monster "ghoul"
#: data/mods/Mythos/monsters/mythos.json
msgid ""
"This humanoid creature has a semi-canine head, hooved feet, and claws.  Its "
"rubbery skin is pale and covered with grave-mold."
msgstr ""
"Esta criatura humanoide tiene una cabeza semicanina, pies con pezuñas y "
"garras. Su piel gomosa es pálida y está cubierta de moho de tumba."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Mythos/monsters/mythos.json
msgid "ghast"
msgid_plural "ghasts"
msgstr[0] "ghast"
msgstr[1] "ghasts"
msgstr[2] "ghasts"

#. ~ Description of monster "ghast"
#: data/mods/Mythos/monsters/mythos.json
msgid ""
"This vaguely humanoid creature is almost as big as a pony.  It has long "
"hooved legs on which it hops, clawed hands, and a hideous noseless head with"
" oversized teeth."
msgstr ""
"Esta criatura vagamente humanoide es casi tan grande como un poni. Tiene "
"largas patas con pezuñas sobre las que brinca, manos con garras y una "
"horrible cabeza sin nariz con dientes de gran tamaño."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Mythos/monsters/mythos.json
msgid "elder thing"
msgid_plural "elder things"
msgstr[0] "cosa antigua"
msgstr[1] "cosas antiguas"
msgstr[2] "cosas antiguas"

#. ~ Description of monster "elder thing"
#: data/mods/Mythos/monsters/mythos.json
msgid ""
"A strange alien creature with a star-shaped head and numerous writhing "
"appendages arranged radially around its barrel-shaped body."
msgstr ""
"Una extraña criatura alienígena con una cabeza en forma de estrella y "
"numerosos apéndices retorcidos dispuestos radialmente alrededor de su cuerpo"
" en forma de barril."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Mythos/monsters/mythos.json
msgid "nightgaunt"
msgid_plural "nightgaunts"
msgstr[0] "demacrado nocturno"
msgstr[1] "demacrados nocturnos"
msgstr[2] "demacrados nocturnos"

#. ~ Description of monster "nightgaunt"
#: data/mods/Mythos/monsters/mythos.json
msgid ""
"This lanky ebon humanoid has batlike wings and a long prehensile tail, yet "
"its most unsettling feature is its lack of a face."
msgstr ""
"Este larguirucho humanoide de ébano tiene alas parecidas a las de un "
"murciélago y una larga cola prensil, pero su característica más inquietante "
"es la falta de rostro."

#. ~ Death message of monster "nightgaunt"
#: data/mods/Mythos/monsters/mythos.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s melts into wisps of darkness."
msgstr "%s se funde en jirones de oscuridad."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Mythos/monsters/mythos.json
msgid "servitor of the outer gods"
msgid_plural "servitors of the outer gods"
msgstr[0] "servidor de los dioses exteriores"
msgstr[1] "servidores de los dioses exteriores"
msgstr[2] "servidores de los dioses exteriores"

#. ~ Description of monster "servitor of the outer gods"
#: data/mods/Mythos/monsters/mythos.json
msgid ""
"A constantly-flickering mass of eyes, mouths, and tentacles hanging in the "
"air, emitting a piping noise from flutes of bone."
msgstr ""
"Una masa de ojos, bocas y tentáculos que parpadean constantemente y que "
"cuelgan en el aire, emitiendo un ruido de flautas de hueso."

#. ~ Death message of monster "servitor of the outer gods"
#: data/mods/Mythos/monsters/mythos.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s folds into itself and disappears."
msgstr "%s se pliega en si mismo y desaparece."

#. ~ Description of monster "flying polyp"
#: data/mods/Mythos/monsters/mythos.json
msgid ""
"A half polypous, utterly alien creature.  It's only partly material and has "
"the ability to fly, despite the absence of wings.  It produces strange "
"whistling noises which send cold shivers of primal terror down your spine."
msgstr ""
"Una criatura medio polipo, totalmente alienígena. Es sólo parcialmente "
"material y tiene la capacidad de volar, a pesar de la ausencia de alas. "
"Produce extraños silbidos que envían escalofríos de terror primitivo por su "
"columna vertebral."

#. ~ Description of monster "hunting horror"
#: data/mods/Mythos/monsters/mythos.json
msgid ""
"This is some sort of great viperine creature, possessed of a curiously "
"distorted head and massive clawed appendages.  It partially supports itself "
"with the aid of black rubbery wings of monstrous dimensions.  Its form "
"writhes and changes before your eyes, filling you with unnameable horror."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una especie de gran criatura viperina, poseedora de una cabeza "
"curiosamente distorsionada y enormes apéndices con garras. Se sostiene "
"parcialmente con la ayuda de unas gomosas alas negras de dimensiones "
"monstruosas. Su forma se retuerce y cambia ante tus ojos, llenándote de un "
"horror innombrable."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/No_Fungi/comestibles.json
msgid "berry-shaped anomaly"
msgid_plural "berry-shaped anomalies"
msgstr[0] "anomalía con forma de baya"
msgstr[1] "anomalías con forma de baya"
msgstr[2] "anomalías con forma de baya"

#. ~ Description of "berry-shaped anomaly"
#: data/mods/No_Fungi/comestibles.json
msgid ""
"If we left this as it should be, one could just walk into the Bloom "
"uncontested and partake of the Fruit.  We can't have that, can we?"
msgstr ""
"Si dejamos esto como debería ser, uno podría entrar en el Bloom sin "
"oposición y participar de la Fruta. No podemos tener eso, ¿verdad?"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/No_Fungi/comestibles.json
msgid "seed-shaped anomaly"
msgid_plural "seed-shaped anomalies"
msgstr[0] "anomalía con forma de semilla"
msgstr[1] "anomalías con forma de semilla"
msgstr[2] "anomalías con forma de semilla"

#. ~ Description of "seed-shaped anomaly"
#: data/mods/No_Fungi/comestibles.json
msgid ""
"If we left this as it should be, one could just walk into the Garden "
"uncontested and partake of the Seed.  We can't have that, can we?"
msgstr ""
"Si dejamos esto como debe ser, uno podría entrar en el Jardín sin oposición "
"y participar de la Semilla. No podemos tener eso, ¿verdad?"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/No_Fungi/comestibles.json
msgid "gelatin-shaped anomaly"
msgid_plural "gelatin-shaped anomalies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "gelatin-shaped anomaly"
#: data/mods/No_Fungi/comestibles.json
msgid ""
"If we left this as it should be, one could just walk into the Spire "
"uncontested and partake of the Sap.  Wait, how did you even GET this anyway?"
msgstr ""
"Si dejamos esto como debería ser, uno podría entrar en la Espira sin ser "
"cuestionado y participar de la Savia. Espera, ¿cómo conseguiste esto de "
"todos modos?"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/No_Fungi/comestibles.json
msgid "fruit-shaped anomaly"
msgid_plural "fruit-shaped anomalies"
msgstr[0] "anomalía con forma de fruta"
msgstr[1] "anomalías con forma de fruta"
msgstr[2] "anomalías con forma de fruta"

#. ~ Description of "fruit-shaped anomaly"
#: data/mods/No_Fungi/comestibles.json
msgid ""
"We do not exist at the moment.  Clever little human, no doubt debugging to "
"see this?  We will not permit you to join us while we are modded out."
msgstr ""
"No existimos en este momento. Pequeño humano inteligente, sin duda  ¿ estas "
"depurando para poder ver esto?. No permitiremos que te nos unas mientras "
"estamos modificando ahi fuera."

#. ~ Description of furniture "fungal mass"
#: data/mods/No_Fungi/furniture.json
msgid ""
"Thick ropes of Mycal matter have covered the ground here completely.  It's "
"soft to the touch, but you sink into it, making moving across it difficult."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of furniture "fungal clump"
#: data/mods/No_Fungi/furniture.json
msgid ""
"Alien mold and stems mingle tightly here, creating a sort of fungal bush."
msgstr ""
"El moho extraterrestre y los tallos se mezclan fuertemente aquí, creando una"
" especie de arbusto de hongos."

#. ~ MOD name
#: data/mods/No_Fungi/modinfo.json
msgid "No Fungal Monsters"
msgstr "Sin Monstruos Fúngicos"

#. ~ Description of MOD "No Fungal Monsters"
#: data/mods/No_Fungi/modinfo.json
msgid "Removes fungal monsters and regions from the game."
msgstr "Saca del juego las regiones y los monstruos fúngicos."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "flaming_eye_warming_up"
#: data/mods/No_Hope/effects.json
msgid "Flaming Eye Warming Up"
msgstr "Calentamiento de Ojo Llameante"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Flaming Eye Warming Up"
#: data/mods/No_Hope/effects.json
msgid "You got a bad feeling about this flaming eye's intentions."
msgstr ""
"Tienes un muy mal presentimiento sobre las intenciones de este ojo "
"llameante."

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/No_Hope/enchantments.json
msgid "Destruction Ray"
msgstr "Rayo Destructor"

#. ~ Description of spell "Destruction Ray"
#: data/mods/No_Hope/enchantments.json
msgid "Pre-nerf flaming eye's destruction ray."
msgstr "Pre-Debilitado del rayo destructor del ojo llameante."

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/No_Hope/enchantments.json
msgid "Flaming Eye Damage"
msgstr "Daño de Ojo Llameante"

#. ~ Description of spell "Flaming Eye Damage"
#: data/mods/No_Hope/enchantments.json
msgid "Damage with the destruction ray."
msgstr "Daño con el rayo destructor."

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/No_Hope/enchantments.json
msgid "Flaming Eye Notify"
msgstr "Notificación de Ojo Llameante"

#. ~ Description of spell "Flaming Eye Notify"
#: data/mods/No_Hope/enchantments.json
msgid "Flaming Eye warms up before activating its destruction ray."
msgstr "El Ojo Llameante se calienta antes de activar su rayo destructor."

#. ~ Description of "inactive chicken walker"
#: data/mods/No_Hope/items.json
msgid ""
"This is an inactive chicken walker.  Using this item involves placing it on "
"the ground, loading the unit with the factory-loaded 5.56 rounds and 40mm "
"cartridge grenades in your inventory (if you wish to divide your ammunition,"
" set aside whatever ammunition you do NOT want to give the robot) and "
"turning it on.  If reprogrammed and rewired successfully the chicken walker "
"will then identify you as a friendly, roam around or follow you, and attack "
"all enemies with a built-in firearm and grenade launcher."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una gallina caminante inactiva. El uso de este artículo implica "
"colocarlo en el suelo, cargar la unidad con balas de 5.56 de fabrica y de "
"cartuchos de granadas de 40 mm de su inventario (si desea dividir su "
"munición, deje a un lado cualquier munición que NO quiera darle al robot) y "
"encenderlo. Si se reprograma y se recablea con éxito, la gallina caminante "
"te identificará como un amigo, deambulará o te seguirá y atacará a todos los"
" enemigos con un arma de fuego y un lanzagranadas incorporados."

#. ~ "friendly_msg" action message of item "inactive chicken walker"
#: data/mods/No_Hope/items.json
msgid ""
"The chicken walker rises to its feet, sways away from you and begins "
"surveying the area."
msgstr ""
"La gallina caminante se pone de pie, se aleja de ti y comienza a "
"inspeccionar la zona."

#. ~ "hostile_msg" action message of item "inactive chicken walker"
#: data/mods/No_Hope/items.json
msgid "The chicken walker whirrs and aims directly at you.  Take cover!"
msgstr "El mecha-gallina zumba y te apunta directamente a ti. ¡Cubrete!"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/No_Hope/items.json
msgid "chicken walker chassis"
msgid_plural "chicken walker chassis"
msgstr[0] "chasis de gallina caminante"
msgstr[1] "chasis de gallinas caminantes"
msgstr[2] "chasis de gallinas caminantes"

#. ~ Description of "chicken walker chassis"
#: data/mods/No_Hope/items.json
msgid ""
"What's left when you remove all moving parts and electronics.  It's the "
"skeleton and armor of the chicken walker."
msgstr ""
"Lo que queda cuando se quitan todas las partes móviles y electrónicas. Esto "
"es el esqueleto y la armadura de la gallina caminante."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/No_Hope/items.json
msgid "Beagle chassis"
msgid_plural "Beagle chassis"
msgstr[0] "chasis de Beagle"
msgstr[1] "chasis de Beagles"
msgstr[2] "chasis de Beagles"

#. ~ Description of "Beagle chassis"
#: data/mods/No_Hope/items.json
msgid ""
"What's left when you remove all moving parts and electronics.  It's the "
"skeleton and armor of the Beagle tank."
msgstr ""
"Lo que queda cuando se quitan todas las partes móviles y electrónicas. Esto "
"el esqueleto y la armadura del tanque Beagle."

#. ~ MOD name
#: data/mods/No_Hope/modinfo.json
msgid "No Hope"
msgstr "Sin Esperanza"

#. ~ Description of MOD "No Hope"
#: data/mods/No_Hope/modinfo.json
msgid ""
"- Significantly reduced amount of places with guaranteed loot spawns.\n"
"- Loot spawn in buildings is drastically reduced, especially for food, tools, guns etc.\n"
"- Most buildings are destroyed, vandalized, or looted.\n"
"- Most cars are destroyed or at least damaged.  Intact cars are nearly impossible to find.\n"
"- Fuel is much harder to find, almost all cars have no fuel in tanks.\n"
"- Marauders, looters, and bandits everywhere.\n"
"\n"
"See extended description in README.md.\n"
"\n"
"To get the mod author's intended playing experience, consider:\n"
"- Enabling wandering hordes.\n"
"- Setting item spawn scaling factor to 0.5 or lower.\n"
"- Setting spawn rate scaling factor to 1.5 or higher."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
msgid "laser turret"
msgid_plural "laser turrets"
msgstr[0] "torreta láser"
msgstr[1] "torretas láser"
msgstr[2] "torretas láser"

#. ~ Description of monster "laser turret"
#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
msgid ""
"The TX-5LR Cerberus is an upgrade to its predecessors.  It features a state "
"of the art revolving laser cannon system with three barrels that charge from"
" high-capacity batteries embedded in its hull."
msgstr ""
"La TX-5LR Cerberus es una actualización de su predecesores. Posee un sistema"
" de cañón láser rotativo de última generación, con tres cañones que se "
"cargan con baterías de alta capacidad que están embebidas por todo su casco."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
msgid "turret"
msgid_plural "turrets"
msgstr[0] "torreta"
msgstr[1] "torretas"
msgstr[2] "torretas"

#. ~ Description of monster "turret"
#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
msgid ""
"The General Atomics TX-1 Guardian, a small, pill-shaped automated gun turret"
" using state of the art ATR systems to dynamically reorient itself to new "
"friends and enemies alike.  There is no mechanism to reload the weapon when "
"its magazine is empty and the fire control system is only designed for semi "
"automatic fire."
msgstr ""
"La General Atomics TX-1 Guardian es una pequeña torreta automatizada con "
"forma de pastilla. Utiliza sistemas ATR de última generación para "
"reorientarse dinámicamente hacia sus nuevos amigos y enemigos por igual. No "
"tiene mecanismo para recargar el arma cuando se vacía el cargador y el "
"sistema de control de disparo está diseñado solo para disparo "
"semiautomático."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
msgid "antimateriel turret"
msgid_plural "antimateriel turrets"
msgstr[0] "torreta antimaterial"
msgstr[1] "torretas antimaterial"
msgstr[2] "torretas antimaterial"

#. ~ Description of monster "antimateriel turret"
#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
msgid ""
"Leadworks LLC's T-107A1 Interdictor, an automated .50BMG antimateriel rifle."
"  Credited with forestalling countless car-bombing attempts, it has always "
"been kept under extremely tight control, so as to itself maintain extremely "
"tight control of its area.  And then the Cataclysm struck."
msgstr ""
"La T-107A1 Interdictor de Leadwork SRL, un rifle antimaterial .50BMG "
"automatizado. Se le atribuye haber impedido numerosos intentos de atentados "
"con coches bomba. Siempre se ha mantenido bajo extremademente estrictos "
"controles, así como él mismo mantiene un control estricto de esta área. Y "
"entonces, el Cataclismo ocurrió."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
msgid "milspec turret"
msgid_plural "milspec turrets"
msgstr[0] "torreta milspec"
msgstr[1] "torretas milspec"
msgstr[2] "torretas milspec"

#. ~ Description of monster "milspec turret"
#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
msgid ""
"Leadworks LLC's T-4A1 Sentry.  It features improved firmware over General "
"Atomics' TX-1 9x19mm model and an automated 5.56mm carbine."
msgstr ""
"T-4A1 Sentry de Leadworks SRL. Posee un firmware mejorado del modelo TX-1 "
"9x19mm de General Atomic, y una carabina 5.56mm automatizada."

#. ~ Description of monster "M240 autonomous CROWS II"
#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
msgid ""
"A remote weapon system derived from the M153 CROWS II and enhanced with "
"autonomous operation software.  Thousands of these were deployed by the US "
"military before the Cataclysm and they were valued for their use in engaging"
" infantry without exposing the operator.  This one is fitted with a M240."
msgstr ""
"Un sistema de armas a distancia derivado del M153 CROWS II y mejorado con un"
" software de funcionamiento autónomo. Miles de ellas fueron desplegadas por "
"el ejército de EE.UU. antes del Cataclismo y fueron valoradas por su uso en "
"la participación de la infantería sin exponer al operador. Este está "
"equipado con un M240."

#. ~ Description of monster "tripod"
#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
msgid ""
"The Honda Regnal, a tall robot walking on three spidery legs.  For weapons, "
"it has a trio of spiked retractable cables and a flamethrower mounted on its"
" head."
msgstr ""
"El Honda Regnal, un robot alto que camina sobre tres patas similares a las "
"de una araña. Como armas, lleva un trío de cables retraíbles con púas, y un "
"lanzallamas montado en su cabeza."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
msgid "Beagle Mini-Tank UGV"
msgid_plural "Beagle Mini-Tank UGVs"
msgstr[0] "UGV Mini-Tanque Beagle"
msgstr[1] "UGV Mini-Tanques Beagle"
msgstr[2] "UGV Mini-Tanques Beagle"

#. ~ Description of monster "Beagle Mini-Tank UGV"
#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
msgid ""
"The Northrop Beagle is a refrigerator-sized urban warfare UGV.  Sporting an "
"anti-tank missile launcher, 40mm grenade launcher, and numerous anti-"
"infantry weapons, it's designed for high-risk urban fighting."
msgstr ""
"El Northrop Beagle es un UGV de guerra urbana del tamaño de un refrigerador."
" Con un lanzador de misiles anti-tanque, un lanzagranadas de 40mm y "
"numerosas armas anti-infantiles, está diseñado para la lucha urbana de alto "
"riesgo."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
msgid "chicken walker"
msgid_plural "chicken walkers"
msgstr[0] "mecha-gallina"
msgstr[1] "mecha-gallinas"
msgstr[2] "mecha-gallinas"

#. ~ Description of monster "chicken walker"
#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
msgid ""
"The Northrop ATSV, a massive, heavily-armed and armored robot walking on a "
"pair of reverse-jointed legs.  Armed with a 40mm anti-vehicle grenade "
"launcher, 5.56 anti-personnel gun, and the ability to electrify itself "
"against attackers, it is an effective automated sentry, though production "
"was limited due to a legal dispute."
msgstr ""
"El ATSV de Northrop, un enorme robot fuertemente armado y blindado que "
"camina sobre un par de piernas articuladas al revés. Armado con un "
"lanzagranadas antivehículo de 40 mm, un cañón antipersonal de 5.56 y la "
"capacidad de electrificarse contra los atacantes, es un efectivo centinela "
"automatizado, aunque su producción fue limitada debido a una disputa legal."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
msgid "security bot"
msgid_plural "security bots"
msgstr[0] "robot de seguridad"
msgstr[1] "robots de seguridad"
msgstr[2] "robots de seguridad"

#. ~ Description of monster "security bot"
#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
msgid ""
"The Northrop Watchman X-1 is a production series of heavily armored combat "
"robots.  Initially designed for military patrol and escort service, it rolls"
" on a set of hydraulic treads and is armed with a M16A4."
msgstr ""
"El Northrop Watchman X-1 es una producción en serie de robots de combate "
"poderosamente blindados. Diseñado inicialmente para el servicio de patrulla "
"y escolta militar, rueda sobre un conjunto de orugas hidráulicas y está "
"armado con un M16A4."

#. ~ Description of monster "moose"
#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
msgid ""
"The Eastern moose, the largest living species of deer.  The bulls are quite "
"ill-tempered, especially in the rutting season."
msgstr ""
"El Alce del Este, el más grande de la familia de los ciervos. Los machos "
"tienen bastante mal genio, especialmente en la temporada de celo."

#. ~ Description of monster "flaming eye"
#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
msgid ""
"An enormous disembodied eyeball the size of a person, flying through the air"
" through some unknown agency.  Wreathed in unnatural flickering blue flame, "
"it possesses a blazing yellow iris with a slitted pupil like that of a cat "
"and trails a set of flailing black tendrils as it slowly drifts about; its "
"unearthly presence filling you with dread at the prospect of falling under "
"its baleful gaze."
msgstr ""
"Un enorme globo ocular incorpóreo del tamaño de una persona, volando por el "
"aire a través de alguna agencia desconocida. Envuelto en una llama azul "
"parpadeante y antinatural, posee un iris amarillo ardiente con una pupila "
"rajada como la de un gato y sigue un conjunto de zarcillos negros ondulantes"
" mientras se desplaza lentamente; su presencia sobrenatural te llena de "
"temor ante la perspectiva de caer bajo su mirada maligna."

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "flaming eye"
#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
msgid "A piercing beam of light bursts forth!"
msgstr "¡Un rayo de luz perforante sale disparado hacia adelante!"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
msgid "staring eye"
msgid_plural "staring eyes"
msgstr[0] "ojo penetrante"
msgstr[1] "ojos penetrantes"
msgstr[2] "ojos penetrantes"

#. ~ Description of monster "staring eye"
#: data/mods/No_Hope/monsters.json
msgid ""
"An enormous disembodied eyeball the size of a person, flying through the air"
" through some unknown agency.  Its unearthly presence filling you with dread"
" at the prospect of falling under its baleful gaze."
msgstr ""
"Un enorme globo ocular incorpóreo del tamaño de una persona, que vuela por "
"el aire a través de algún mecanismo desconocido. Su presencia sobrenatural "
"te llena de temor ante la perspectiva de caer bajo su funesta mirada."

#. ~ Description of terrain "wall"
#: data/mods/No_Hope/terrain.json
msgid ""
"The stereotypical wall with wooden support structure filled with insulation "
"and drywalled.  Paint job is the all too common and neutral off-white or "
"cream color, it could use more vibrant paint."
msgstr ""
"El típico muro con estructura de soporte de madera rellena de aislamiento y "
"con muros en seco. El trabajo de pintura es el demasiado común y neutro "
"color blanco roto o crema, podría usar una pintura más vibrante."

