msgstr "Tu tez está apagada y gastada."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Bloodthirst, Reddened Eyes, Wan"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your skin is pale and have turned dark red.  You feel a constant hunger, "
"like the food you eat is no longer nourishing you."
msgstr ""
"Tu piel está pálida y se ha vuelto de color rojo oscuro. Sientes un hambre "
"constante, como si los alimentos que comes ya no te nutrieran."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Bloodthirst, Reddened Eyes, Wan"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Your skin is pale and your eyes are thoroughly bloodshot."
msgstr ""
"Tu piel es pálida y sus ojos están completamente inyectados en sangre."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Bloodthirst, Reddened Eyes, Wan"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"You feel the blood rushing from the wound and then a pressure that reminds "
"you of backwash."
msgstr ""
"Sientes la sangre saliendo de la herida y luego una presión que te recuerda "
"al reflujo."

