"A faux wall positioned and joined seamlessly with the wall, this wall looks "
"pretty normal."
msgstr ""
"Una pared falsa colocada y unida a la perfección con la pared, esta pared "
"parece bastante normal."

#. ~ Description of terrain "open secret door"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-doors.json
msgid ""
"This apparently normal segment of wall has opened to reveal a secret "
"passage."
msgstr ""
"Este segmento de pared aparentemente normal se ha abierto para revelar un "
"pasaje secreto."

