msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of monster "flying shark"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/nightmares_and_chimeras.json
msgid ""
"It would be funny watching a shark swim through the air, between trees and "
"other objects like kelp under the water.  If it didn't mean the shark was "
"here, now and capable of flying after you.  Clearly something is off, here."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/nightmares_and_chimeras.json
msgid "endless snake"
msgid_plural "endless snakes"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of monster "endless snake"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/nightmares_and_chimeras.json
msgid ""
"The tail of this snake doesn't seem to end.  Clearly there are places that "
"are not part of the tail of this snake, but when you watch it move you only "
"see the front of the body move forward while the rear stays in it's place "
"eternally elongating.  But that can't be true so your eyes snap to somewhere"
" else and that seems to be an appropriately length snake, isn't it?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/nightmares_and_chimeras.json
msgid "swarm of teeth"
msgid_plural "swarms of teeth"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of monster "swarm of teeth"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/nightmares_and_chimeras.json
