"A carbine variant of the C7A1, recently introduced by the Canadian armed "
"forces.  Though accurate, small, and lightweight, it is infamous for its "
"unreliability when not properly maintained.  It is chambered in 5.56x45mm "
"and accepts STANAG magazines."
