"que sea utilizable."

#. ~ Description of monster "shifting mass"
#: data/mods/innawood/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"A small, shifting mass floating in midair.  It is not even real enough to "
"have a stable shape.  You can see through it, not as if it were transparent,"
" but as if it isn't quite fully there."
msgstr ""
"Una masa pequeña y cambiante que flota en medio del aire. Ni siquiera es lo "
"suficientemente real como para tener una forma estable. Se puede ver a "
"través de ella, no como si fuera transparente, sino como si no estuviera del"
" todo aquí."

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "shifting mass"
#: data/mods/innawood/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"For a moment the shifting mass passes into you as if it were an illusion and"
" a slight wave of fatigue washes over you."
msgstr ""
"Por un momento, la masa cambiante pasa dentro de ti como si fuera una "
"ilusión y una ligera ola de fatiga te invade."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/innawood/monsters/nether.json
msgid "Impossible shape"
msgid_plural "Impossible shapes"
msgstr[0] "Forma imposible"
msgstr[1] "Formas imposibles"
msgstr[2] "Formas imposibles"

#. ~ Description of monster "Impossible shape"
#: data/mods/innawood/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"A twisted shape floating in midair; its angles don't quite seem to add up - "
"it hurts to look at. You can see through it, not as if it were transparent "
"but as if it isn't quite fully there."
msgstr ""
"Una forma retorcida que flota en el aire; sus ángulos no parecen cuadrar del"
" todo; duele mirarla. Se puede ver a través de ella, no como si fuera "
"transparente, sino como si no estuviera del todo aquí."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/innawood/monsters/nether.json
msgid "Absence"
msgid_plural "Absences"
msgstr[0] "Ausencia"
msgstr[1] "Ausencias"
msgstr[2] "Ausencias"

