#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/bionic_professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Industrial Cyborg"
msgstr "Cíborg Industrial"

#. ~ Description of profession "Industrial Cyborg" for male
#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/bionic_professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"For better or for worse, bionic augmentation has turned you into a walking "
"power tool.  Upgraded with a standard industrial-grade manual labor surgery "
"and training package, you are augmented with bionic muscles and an "
"integrated toolset, both powered by standard batteries."
msgstr ""
"Para mejor o para peor, las alteraciones biónicas te han convertido en una "
"herramienta eléctrica con patas. Mejorado con cirugía de grado industrial y "
"un paquete de entrenamiento, se te ha instalado musculatura biónica y una "
"caja de herramientas, alimentadas con baterías normales."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/package_bionic_professions/bionic_professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Industrial Cyborg"
msgstr "Cíborg Industrial"

#. ~ Description of profession "Industrial Cyborg" for female
